values
  ('648086443864045095', 'Step Brothers', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Adam McKay, Oliver Wood, Courtenay Miles', 'Will Ferrell, Adam McKay', 'Will Ferrell, John C. Reilly, Richard Jenkins, Mary Steenburgen, Adam Scott, Kathryn Hahn, Andrea Savage, Rob Riggle', 'R', 'Brennan Huff and Dale Doback might be grown men. But that doesn''t stop them from living at home and turning into jealous, competitive stepbrothers when their single parents marry. Brennan''s constant competition with Dale strains his mom''s marriage to Dale''s dad, leaving everyone to wonder whether they''ll ever see eye to eye.', 'Brennan Huff and Dale Doback might be grown men. But that doesn''t stop them from living at home and turning into jealous, competitive stepbrothers when their single parents marry. Brennan''s constant competition with Dale strains his mom''s marriage to Dale''s dad, leaving everyone to wonder whether they''ll ever see eye to eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvggBbEraUTAVR6ffP3AaBUWSHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12133'),
  ('205186757552099471', 'Step by Step', 1946, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Frank Redman, Phil Rosen, James E. Casey', 'Stuart Palmer', 'Lawrence Tierney, Anne Jeffreys, Lowell Gilmore, Myrna Dell, Harry Harvey, Addison Richards, Ray Walker, Jason Robards Sr.', 'NR', 'Marine veteran Johnny Christopher meets and is immediately drawn to beautiful Evelyn Smith one day on the beach. Evelyn''s new job as secretary to a U.S. senator in California soon brings unexpected intrigue and trouble for her and Johnny. The machinations of a sinister group of Nazi spies lead to mysteries and mistaken identities, and the two soon find themselves framed for murder!', 'Marine veteran Johnny Christopher meets and is immediately drawn to beautiful Evelyn Smith one day on the beach. Evelyn''s new job as secretary to a U.S. senator in California soon brings unexpected intrigue and trouble for her and Johnny. The machinations of a sinister group of Nazi spies lead to mysteries and mistaken identities, and the two soon find themselves framed for murder!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ou5XNadKw9z12SEAESHtzGcCgkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74911'),
  ('120055444117803388', 'Step Into Liquid', 2003, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Dana Brown', 'Dana Brown', 'Robert August, Rochelle Ballard, Shawn Barron, Layne Beachley, Bob Beaton, Jesse Brad Billauer, Bruce Brown, Taj Burrow', 'PG-13', 'No special effects. No stuntmen. No stereotypes. No other feeling comes close. Surfers and secret spots from around the world are profiled in this documentary.', 'No special effects. No stuntmen. No stereotypes. No other feeling comes close. Surfers and secret spots from around the world are profiled in this documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gF352z3G8wnk5GDKzn7RcIDstwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15292'),
  ('547100091368342221', 'Step Mother is Nineteen', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', null, null, 'Seung Ha, Lee Do-jin', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjHQOmstLZKF0urCZRwn2xunmsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1105602'),
  ('111429094260619981', 'Step Sisters', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Charles Stone III', 'Chuck Hayward', 'Eden Sher, Alessandra Torresani, Megalyn Echikunwoke, Gage Golightly, Matt McGorry, Naturi Naughton, Lyndon Smith, Shay Davila', 'PG-13', 'Jamilah has her whole life figured out. She''s the president of her black sorority, captain of their champion step dance crew, is student liaison to the college dean, and her next move is on to Harvard Law School. She''s got it all, right? But when the hard-partying white girls from Sigma Beta Beta embarrass the school, Jamilah is ordered to come to the rescue. Her mission is to not only teach the rhythmically-challenged girls how to step dance, but to win the Steptacular, the most competitive of dance competitions. With the SBBs reputations and charter on the line, and Jamilah''s dream of attending Harvard in jeopardy, these outcast screw-ups and their unlikely teacher stumble through one hilarious misstep after another. Cultures clash, romance blossoms, and sisterhood prevails as everyone steps out of their comfort zones.', 'Jamilah has her whole life figured out. She''s the president of her black sorority, captain of their champion step dance crew, is student liaison to the college dean, and her next move is on to Harvard Law School. She''s got it all, right? But when the hard-partying white girls from Sigma Beta Beta embarrass the school, Jamilah is ordered to come to the rescue. Her mission is to not only teach the rhythmically-challenged girls how to step dance, but to win the Steptacular, the most competitive of dance competitions. With the SBBs reputations and charter on the line, and Jamilah''s dream of attending Harvard in jeopardy, these outcast screw-ups and their unlikely teacher stumble through one hilarious misstep after another. Cultures clash, romance blossoms, and sisterhood prevails as everyone steps out of their comfort zones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QrO9BuS93Ii2BKre0IyvkpHW8E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431072'),
  ('971655386763478837', 'Step Up', 2006, 'Music, Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Anne Fletcher, Michael Seresin', 'Duane Adler, Melissa Rosenberg', 'Channing Tatum, Jenna Dewan, Damaine Radcliff, Rachel Griffiths, Deirdre Lovejoy, Alyson Stoner, Drew Sidora, Josh Henderson', 'PG-13', 'Delinquent Tyler Gage receives the opportunity of a lifetime after vandalizing a performing arts school, gaining him the chance to earn a scholarship and dance with up-and-coming dancer Nora.', 'Delinquent Tyler Gage receives the opportunity of a lifetime after vandalizing a performing arts school, gaining him the chance to earn a scholarship and dance with up-and-coming dancer Nora.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmw52kXk2kN8AQil7tgOD41gt4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9762'),
  ('237090779874552369', 'Step Up 2: The Streets', 2008, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Jon M. Chu, Max Malkin, Alison C. Rosa', 'Toni Ann Johnson, Karen Barna, Duane Adler', 'Briana Evigan, Robert Hoffman, Will Kemp, Cassie Ventura, Adam Sevani, Black Thomas, Harry Shum Jr., Channing Tatum', 'PG-13', 'When rebellious street dancer Andie West lands at the elite Maryland School of the Arts, she finds herself fighting to fit in while also trying to hold onto her old life. When she joins forces with the school''s hottest dancer, Chase Collins, to form a crew of fellow outcasts to compete in Baltimore''s underground dance battle The Streets.', 'When rebellious street dancer Andie West lands at the elite Maryland School of the Arts, she finds herself fighting to fit in while also trying to hold onto her old life. When she joins forces with the school''s hottest dancer, Chase Collins, to form a crew of fellow outcasts to compete in Baltimore''s underground dance battle The Streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYdlRTvA5fneB88NchV3sirzCE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8328'),
  ('928945937688846785', 'Step Up 3D', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jon M. Chu, Ken Seng', 'Amy Andelson, Emily Meyer', 'Sharni Vinson, Rick Malambri, Adam Sevani, Alyson Stoner, Joe Slaughter, Kendra Andrews, Stephen ''tWitch'' Boss, Daniel ''Cloud'' Campos', 'PG-13', 'A tight-knit group of New York City street dancers, including Luke and Natalie, team up with NYU freshman Moose, and find themselves pitted against the world''s best hip-hop dancers in a high-stakes showdown that will change their lives forever.', 'A tight-knit group of New York City street dancers, including Luke and Natalie, team up with NYU freshman Moose, and find themselves pitted against the world''s best hip-hop dancers in a high-stakes showdown that will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPcqa5TZ7S63RNmCuY45ZizFBen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41233'),
  ('23124341066555342', 'Step Up All In', 2014, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Richard Cowan, Rachael Fortier, Trish Sie', 'John Swetnam', 'Briana Evigan, Ryan Guzman, Chaton Anderson, Stephen ''tWitch'' Boss, Misha Gabriel, Izabella Miko, Alyson Stoner, Adam Sevani', 'PG-13', 'All-stars from previous installments convene in glittering Las Vegas, battling for a victory that could define their dreams and their careers.', 'All-stars from previous installments convene in glittering Las Vegas, battling for a victory that could define their dreams and their careers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgAjyJyEvj5S9CeztXs39iEUJKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243683'),
  ('165468190675252183', 'Step Up Revolution', 2012, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Scott Speer, Karsten ''Crash'' Gopinath, Maria Mantia', 'Jenny Mayer', 'Kathryn McCormick, Ryan Guzman, Misha Gabriel, Stephen ''tWitch'' Boss, Cleopatra Coleman, Peter Gallagher, Tommy Dewey, Emiliano Díez', 'PG-13', 'Emily arrives in Miami with aspirations to become a professional dancer. She sparks with Sean, the leader of a dance crew whose neighborhood is threatened by Emily''s father''s development plans.', 'Emily arrives in Miami with aspirations to become a professional dancer. She sparks with Sean, the leader of a dance crew whose neighborhood is threatened by Emily''s father''s development plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMpwxmk3r7Aq36GcqMbCuP9DJYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85446'),
  ('268551918406209892', 'Step Up: Year of the Dance', 2019, 'Music, Drama', 'Ron Yuan, L.T. Chang', 'Li Wei', 'Meng Meiqi, Sung Joo, Owodog Chuang, Dany Lee, Jingxing Huang, Zack Roberts, Sen Yang, Shiyong Peng', null, 'Two young people from different social classes put aside their differences and come together to form a dance group and win a championship in China.', 'Two young people from different social classes put aside their differences and come together to form a dance group and win a championship in China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yS5lcaUfFsl7gUT5mSEylECzoqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593680'),
  ('73443634770631042', 'Stepdad and Mother-Daughter', 2021, 'Romance', 'Lee Han-II', null, 'Min Do-yoon, Ye Seul, Yoon Yool, Yeon Joo, Shin Yeon-ho, Jo Wan-jin', null, 'Seo-ra, an elegant woman from Louisiana, U.S., marries businessman Kyeong-han who does anything to make money. Kyeong-hwan was in a relationship with Mi-yeon, who was a bar madam, but after his marriage to Seo-ra, he tells Mi-yeon that he will now live as an elegant businessman. For Kyeong-hwan, however, there was a problem of sexual desire and madness when he saw clothes with no underwear in sight. One day, Seo-ra''s biological daughter Yoo-na, appeared at Kyeong-hwan''s newlywed house in a short skirt.', 'Seo-ra, an elegant woman from Louisiana, U.S., marries businessman Kyeong-han who does anything to make money. Kyeong-hwan was in a relationship with Mi-yeon, who was a bar madam, but after his marriage to Seo-ra, he tells Mi-yeon that he will now live as an elegant businessman. For Kyeong-hwan, however, there was a problem of sexual desire and madness when he saw clothes with no underwear in sight. One day, Seo-ra''s biological daughter Yoo-na, appeared at Kyeong-hwan''s newlywed house in a short skirt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49UMGEIEACXOU5PvwUswyVDmgJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892222'),
  ('60852704597414994', 'Stepdaddy', 2026, 'Drama', 'Christopher Novabos', null, 'Astrid Lee, Christy Imperial, Jamilla Obispo, Marlon Marcia', null, 'Emotions and intrigue run high in this titillating taboo family affair. Chloe and Nica are sisters who both find themselves in their own passionate love affairs with their stepdad Carl.', 'Emotions and intrigue run high in this titillating taboo family affair. Chloe and Nica are sisters who both find themselves in their own passionate love affairs with their stepdad Carl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZxNblisKuDzSUW5g18FERjyJs9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1658216'),
  ('245219339912314724', 'Stepfather 2', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jeff Burr, Jacek Laskus, Robert Loeser', 'John Auerbach', 'Terry O''Quinn, Meg Foster, Caroline Williams, Jonathan Brandis, Henry Brown, Mitchell Laurance, Miriam Byrd-Nethery, Leon Martell', 'R', '"Stepfather" Jerry Blake escapes an insane asylum and winds up in another town, this time impersonating a marriage counselor. With a future wife and new stepson who love him, Blake eliminates anyone who stands in his way to building the perfect family.', '"Stepfather" Jerry Blake escapes an insane asylum and winds up in another town, this time impersonating a marriage counselor. With a future wife and new stepson who love him, Blake eliminates anyone who stands in his way to building the perfect family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/STSt97FOcXjaUEHtVBPRZCA7eK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30666'),
  ('322989907329279816', 'Stepfather 3', 1992, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Guy Magar, Alan Caso, Tom Blank', 'Guy Magar, Marc B. Ray', 'Robert Wightman, Priscilla Barnes, Season Hubley, David Tom, John Ingle, Dennis Paladino, Stephen Mendel, Jay Acovone', 'R', 'After escaping a Puget Sound institution, "Stepfather" Gene Clifford alters his appearance with plastic surgery and takes on another new identity: Keith Grant. Moving to Deer View, California, Keith falls for a divorced school principal, arousing the suspicions of her wheelchair-bound, computer-savvy son.', 'After escaping a Puget Sound institution, "Stepfather" Gene Clifford alters his appearance with plastic surgery and takes on another new identity: Keith Grant. Moving to Deer View, California, Keith falls for a divorced school principal, arousing the suspicions of her wheelchair-bound, computer-savvy son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/an492xjfS59bRBVTnmFfGy71cNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61964'),
  ('316587293215607379', 'Stéphane', 2023, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Lucas Pastor, Xavier Cordonnier, Timothée Hochet', 'Timothée Hochet, Lucas Pastor', 'Lucas Pastor, Bastien Garcia, Eva Grégorieff, Elena Bultot, Louis Rossignol, François Duroy', null, 'On the set of his amateur short film, Tim unwittingly meets a certain Stéphane, a gruff, loud-mouthed man with stories that smack of a competition mythomaniac. Tim is convinced that he has a golden documentary subject.', 'On the set of his amateur short film, Tim unwittingly meets a certain Stéphane, a gruff, loud-mouthed man with stories that smack of a competition mythomaniac. Tim is convinced that he has a golden documentary subject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gceKQxMakhiTer6wjZTALx231PU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:901405'),
  ('963457581748814680', 'Stephanie', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Akiva Goldsman, Antonio Riestra', 'Ben Collins, Luke Piotrowski', 'Shree Crooks, Frank Grillo, Anna Torv, Jonah Beres, Lasaundra Gibson, Samantha Smith, Amanda Christine, Swati Kapila', 'R', 'After a mysterious global crisis, a young girl is left alone to hide from a malevolent power that stalks her home. Her parents eventually return and the struggle begins to save their daughter.', 'After a mysterious global crisis, a young girl is left alone to hide from a malevolent power that stalks her home. Her parents eventually return and the struggle begins to save their daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saH984W3ZGjRX0NMCEsuKh8VUP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333357'),
  ('92570344629545944', 'Stephanie Daley', 2007, 'Drama', 'Hilary Brougher, David Rush Morrison', 'Hilary Brougher', 'Tilda Swinton, Amber Tamblyn, Timothy Hutton, Denis O''Hare, Jim Gaffigan, Deirdre O''Connell, Halley Feiffer, Neal Huff', 'R', 'Stephanie collapses in a pool of blood while on a school skiing trip. A doctor discovers that the blood is the after-effects of giving birth. Soon afterward, the body of a newborn baby is found in a toilet, its mouth blocked with toilet paper. Despite Stephanie''s insistence that her child was stillborn and that she had no idea that she was pregnant, she is arrested for the murder of the child.', 'Stephanie collapses in a pool of blood while on a school skiing trip. A doctor discovers that the blood is the after-effects of giving birth. Soon afterward, the body of a newborn baby is found in a toilet, its mouth blocked with toilet paper. Despite Stephanie''s insistence that her child was stillborn and that she had no idea that she was pregnant, she is arrested for the murder of the child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSDxceWMWT30XlnXzy70FCS7vR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20308'),
  ('1124966135919282015', 'Stephen', 2025, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Mithun', 'Gomathi Shankar, Mithun', 'Gomathi Shankar, Smruthi Venkat, Michael Thangadurai, Vijayashree, Kuberan, Shrisha, Harija', 'R', 'A psychiatrist evaluating a self-confessed serial killer unravels a twisted web of trauma, deceit, and psychological manipulation—only to question if the killer is truly guilty or just another victim in a larger, darker game.', 'A psychiatrist evaluating a self-confessed serial killer unravels a twisted web of trauma, deceit, and psychological manipulation—only to question if the killer is truly guilty or just another victim in a larger, darker game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUURUJzeSTc47T2VeNw7nZwZ8VJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1561955'),
  ('503669057589072388', 'Stephen Curry: Underrated', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Peter Nicks, Sean Havey', null, 'Stephen Curry, Reggie Miller, Kevin Durant, Ayesha Curry, Draymond Green, Dell Curry', 'PG-13', 'The remarkable coming-of-age story of Stephen Curry—one of the most influential, dynamic, and unexpected players in basketball history—and his rise from an undersized college player to a four-time NBA champion.', 'The remarkable coming-of-age story of Stephen Curry—one of the most influential, dynamic, and unexpected players in basketball history—and his rise from an undersized college player to a four-time NBA champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFpnGiDrY9Brz4FQLKBKX1uCbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860278'),
  ('524233179015475720', 'Stephen King: A Necessary Evil', 2020, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Jérémy Fauchoux, Julien Dupuy', 'Julien Dupuy', 'Micky Sébastian, Stephen King', null, 'The American writer Stephen King has been one of the world''s best-selling authors for decades. How can the overwhelming success of his numerous works be explained? Perhaps by the boundless inventiveness of his literature? And what else is behind the longevity of his astonishing career?', 'The American writer Stephen King has been one of the world''s best-selling authors for decades. How can the overwhelming success of his numerous works be explained? Perhaps by the boundless inventiveness of his literature? And what else is behind the longevity of his astonishing career?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZON0e8mRoDCt7Og5DiqlWkvtkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:754322'),
  ('928746726986253700', 'Stephen King''s Golden Tales', 1993, 'Horror', 'Theodore Gershuny, Jodie Foster, Frank De Palma', 'Bob Balaban, Franco Amurri, Art Monterastelli', 'Marcia Cross, Bruce Davison, Paul Dooley, John Fiedler, Eileen Heckart, Richard B. Shull, Jeff Conaway, Patrick Kilpatrick', null, 'A collection of horror stories taking the viewer into the dark world of Stephen King, featuring vampires, strange objects and sinister humor. The five 20-minutes tales were all taken from the Tales from the Darkside TV series and strung together as a video feature.', 'A collection of horror stories taking the viewer into the dark world of Stephen King, featuring vampires, strange objects and sinister humor. The five 20-minutes tales were all taken from the Tales from the Darkside TV series and strung together as a video feature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8BLG1SHV24w2hSBcRxdoHFM9n4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460730'),
  ('766285665593450829', 'Stephen the Great: Vaslui 1475', 1975, 'Action, Drama, History, War', 'Mircea Drăgan', 'Mircea Drăgan, Constantin Mitru', 'Gheorghe Cozorici, Gheorghe Dinică, Violeta Andrei, Toma Dimitriu, Sandina Stan, Geo Barton, Anna Széles, Iurie Darie', null, 'In 1475 when Stephen the Great, ruler of Moldavia is facing an invading Ottoman army of 120 000 men, the fate of Christian Europe largely depends on the battle''s outcome.', 'In 1475 when Stephen the Great, ruler of Moldavia is facing an invading Ottoman army of 120 000 men, the fate of Christian Europe largely depends on the battle''s outcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tycNHAwvd485WDpzIay4iqrubCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153483'),
  ('813990435752706974', 'Stephen, the King', 1984, 'Drama, History, Music', 'Gábor Koltay, Tamás Andor, Mihály Sárdi', 'Levente Szörényi, Gábor Koltay, János Bródy', 'László Pelsőczy, Miklós Varga, Gyula Vikidál, Katalin Berek, Bernadette Sára, Máté Victor, Juhász Jácint, Lajos Balázsovits', null, 'István, a király ("Stephen, the King") is a Hungarian rock opera written by Levente Szörényi (music) and János Bródy (lyrics), based on the life of Saint Stephen of Hungary. The storyline was based on the play Ezredforduló (Turn of the Millennium) by Miklós Boldizsár, who co-wrote the libretto. The opera was first staged in 1983 on an open-air stage in Budapest. This first performance was also made into a 1984 film, directed by Gábor Koltay, and its music released on an album. The musical became a smash hit and is still very popular in Hungary and among Hungarian minorities in neighboring countries.', 'István, a király ("Stephen, the King") is a Hungarian rock opera written by Levente Szörényi (music) and János Bródy (lyrics), based on the life of Saint Stephen of Hungary. The storyline was based on the play Ezredforduló (Turn of the Millennium) by Miklós Boldizsár, who co-wrote the libretto. The opera was first staged in 1983 on an open-air stage in Budapest. This first performance was also made into a 1984 film, directed by Gábor Koltay, and its music released on an album. The musical became a smash hit and is still very popular in Hungary and among Hungarian minorities in neighboring countries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/te2cpF0VyYgT4rmL3KGP4hfG1TF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168601'),
  ('1135881299436291929', 'Stepmom', 1998, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Chris Columbus, Donald McAlpine', 'Gigi Levangie, Steven Rogers, Jessie Nelson', 'Julia Roberts, Susan Sarandon, Ed Harris, Jena Malone, Liam Aiken, Lynn Whitfield, Darrell Larson, Mary Louise Wilson', 'PG-13', 'Jackie is a divorced mother of two. Isabel is the career minded girlfriend of Jackie’s ex-husband Luke, forced into the role of unwelcome stepmother to their children. But when Jackie discovers she is ill, both women realise they must put aside their differences to find a common ground and celebrate life to the fullest, while they have the chance.', 'Jackie is a divorced mother of two. Isabel is the career minded girlfriend of Jackie’s ex-husband Luke, forced into the role of unwelcome stepmother to their children. But when Jackie discovers she is ill, both women realise they must put aside their differences to find a common ground and celebrate life to the fullest, while they have the chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMPv2Yz6QDzv6YhSbaqM48Medl1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9441'),
  ('735907246385891703', 'Stepmom 2019', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Dong-hyun', null, 'Sin Seong-hoon, Jin Si-ah, Jo Wan-jin, Yoo Sul-young', null, 'Young-chul moves to his wife''s mansion. One day, Young-chul''s stepmom comes to find the hidden videotape in the mansion. Yeong-cheol finds out that these tapes are just sex videos! Using this, she implements a secret plan to spend a hot night with her stepmother, who has been dreaming since childhood.', 'Young-chul moves to his wife''s mansion. One day, Young-chul''s stepmom comes to find the hidden videotape in the mansion. Yeong-cheol finds out that these tapes are just sex videos! Using this, she implements a secret plan to spend a hot night with her stepmother, who has been dreaming since childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BZCR1Twix5rQtf2VvdnmEif3Nl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656956'),
  ('893687520035414307', 'Stepmom''s Desire', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Dong-Joon', null, 'Lee Soo, Tae Hee, James, Jung In', null, 'Sang-jin, who was envious of her neighbor after getting a beautiful wife, Ask your wife''s friend Gian to take over the son''s extracurricular teacher, Sang-jin, who left work early, accidentally sees Gian''s shower. A man who wants to have sex with his son''s tutor, And a son who wants to have a good time with a young stepmom, Ji-an and Jin-hee, who want money, are disappointed with her husband, and Bin-jin gives her body to a young son.', 'Sang-jin, who was envious of her neighbor after getting a beautiful wife, Ask your wife''s friend Gian to take over the son''s extracurricular teacher, Sang-jin, who left work early, accidentally sees Gian''s shower. A man who wants to have sex with his son''s tutor, And a son who wants to have a good time with a young stepmom, Ji-an and Jin-hee, who want money, are disappointed with her husband, and Bin-jin gives her body to a young son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYC6UyML4CU4zYiZVbDMrwnGyWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715287'),
  ('146769225649960410', 'Stepmonster', 1993, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jeremy Stanford, Wally Pfister', 'Mark Thomas McGee, Craig J. Nevius', 'Alan Thicke, Molly Cheek, Billy Corben, Robin Riker, Alice Hirson, George Gaynes, Ami Dolenz, Corey Feldman', null, 'Todd Dougherty has an imagination driven by comic books. So when he accuses his soon-to-be stepmother of being a monster, no one believes him. When neighbors start turning up dead, it becomes a race against time for Todd to stop this hideous, carnivorous creature from marrying his dad and ruining his life.', 'Todd Dougherty has an imagination driven by comic books. So when he accuses his soon-to-be stepmother of being a monster, no one believes him. When neighbors start turning up dead, it becomes a race against time for Todd to stop this hideous, carnivorous creature from marrying his dad and ruining his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbkEuXZjKXFuoXWRhrzGDoLOUU9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131847'),
  ('587554864461047083', 'Steppenwolf', 1974, 'Drama', 'Fred Haines, Ernst Bertschi, Tomislav Pinter', 'Fred Haines', 'Max von Sydow, Dominique Sanda, Pierre Clémenti, Carla Romanelli, Roy Bosier, Alfred Baillou, Niels-Peter Rudolph, Helmut Förnbacher', null, 'In the bourgeois circles of Europe after the Great War, can anything save the modern man? Harry Haller, a solitary intellectual, has all his life feared his dual nature of being human and being a beast. He''s decided to die on his 50th birthday, which is soon. He''s rescued from his solipsism by the mysterious Hermine, who takes him dancing, introduces him to jazz and to the beautiful and whimsical Maria, and guides him into the hallucinations of the Magic Theater, which seem to take him into Hell. Can humour, sin, and derision lead to salvation?', 'In the bourgeois circles of Europe after the Great War, can anything save the modern man? Harry Haller, a solitary intellectual, has all his life feared his dual nature of being human and being a beast. He''s decided to die on his 50th birthday, which is soon. He''s rescued from his solipsism by the mysterious Hermine, who takes him dancing, introduces him to jazz and to the beautiful and whimsical Maria, and guides him into the hallucinations of the Magic Theater, which seem to take him into Hell. Can humour, sin, and derision lead to salvation?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aoy0l6O1x6lSjH8L06s6ZSRhY7a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74948'),
  ('47461212993775605', 'Steppenwolf', 2024, 'Thriller', 'Adilkhan Yerzhanov, Yerkinbek Ptyraliyev', 'Adilkhan Yerzhanov', 'Berik Aitzhanov, Anna Starchenko, Azamat Nigmanov, Kuantay Abdimadi, Yerken Gubashev, Timur Kim, Yerbolat Alkozha, Nurbek Mukushev', null, 'Tamara is searching for her missing son in a small town consumed by riots and violence. In a desperate attempt to get him back, she decides to offer a reward to an amoral former investigator whose methods prove to be sadistic. Determined, Tamara decides to complete the mission with the nihilistic detective, no matter what the cost.', 'Tamara is searching for her missing son in a small town consumed by riots and violence. In a desperate attempt to get him back, she decides to offer a reward to an amoral former investigator whose methods prove to be sadistic. Determined, Tamara decides to complete the mission with the nihilistic detective, no matter what the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbtZpT3VfyUmSlga3wWHDtBJ7kW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1023122'),
  ('717334797606834332', 'Stepping Out', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Lewis Gilbert, Alan Hume', 'Richard Harris', 'Liza Minnelli, Shelley Winters, Robyn Stevan, Jane Krakowski, Bill Irwin, Ellen Greene, Sheila McCarthy, Andrea Martin', 'PG', 'A has-been Broadway performer gives tap lessons to a group of misfits who, through their dance classes, bond and realize what they can achieve.', 'A has-been Broadway performer gives tap lessons to a group of misfits who, through their dance classes, bond and realize what they can achieve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxiqMSnRj6a58kb2AhdN6354rsc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41795'),
  ('1123957145853502035', 'Steps', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Zbigniew Rybczyński', null, 'Daniel Chapman, Chase Coleman, Reed Coleman, H. Roger Daisley, Drew Dix', null, 'A tourist group is shown the latest in Soviet virtual reality technology through the Potemkin.', 'A tourist group is shown the latest in Soviet virtual reality technology through the Potemkin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKj6FZo9p14qWti7fJ366VPuPvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289657'),
  ('921248885131728221', 'Stepsister from Planet Weird', 2000, 'Family, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Steve Boyum, David Eggby', 'Francess LantZ, Chris Matheson', 'Courtnee Draper, Tamara Hope, Lance Guest, Khrystyne Haje, Vanessa Lee Chester, Myles Jeffrey, Lauren Maltby, Aash Aaron', 'G', 'Megan''s world is turned upside down when she hears her calm life with her little brother and single mum is about to change. She hears she''s soon to have a stepfather and a stepsister. Megan thinks they''re a bit weird and is determined to stop the wedding. She discovers they''re actually even stranger than she thought - they''re from another planet.', 'Megan''s world is turned upside down when she hears her calm life with her little brother and single mum is about to change. She hears she''s soon to have a stepfather and a stepsister. Megan thinks they''re a bit weird and is determined to stop the wedding. She discovers they''re actually even stranger than she thought - they''re from another planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ui3XjIVDZn740k7hPOh5gJmFsME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70773'),
  ('565732429666047471', 'Steptoe & Son', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cliff Owen, John Wilcox, Ariel Levy', 'Ray Galton, Alan Simpson', 'Wilfrid Brambell, Harry H. Corbett, Carolyn Seymour, Arthur Howard, Victor Maddern, Fred Griffiths, Joan Heath, Fred McNaughton', null, 'Albert Steptoe and his son Harold are rag-and-bone men, complete with horse and cart to tour the neighbourhood. They also live together at the junk yard. Harold, who likes the bright lights in the West End of London, meets a stripper, marries her and takes her home. Albert is furious and tries every trick he knows to drive the new bride from his household.', 'Albert Steptoe and his son Harold are rag-and-bone men, complete with horse and cart to tour the neighbourhood. They also live together at the junk yard. Harold, who likes the bright lights in the West End of London, meets a stripper, marries her and takes her home. Albert is furious and tries every trick he knows to drive the new bride from his household.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihP86Oyt5qDNssKjtaeVrNXFhKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31787'),
  ('962486529742063742', 'Steptoe & Son Ride Again', 1973, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Peter Sykes, Ernest Steward, Graham Ford', 'Ray Galton, Alan Simpson', 'Wilfrid Brambell, Harry H. Corbett, Diana Dors, Milo O''Shea, Neil McCarthy, Bill Maynard, George Tovey, Sam Kydd', null, 'Albert Steptoe and his son Harold are rag-and-bone men, complete with horse and cart to tour the neighbourhood. They also live amicably together at the junk yard. Always on the lookout for ways to improve his lot, Harold invests his father''s life savings in a greyhound who is almost blind and can''t see the hare. When the dog loses a race and Harold has to pay off the debt, he comes up with another bright idea. Collect his father''s life insurance. To do this his father must pretend to be dead.', 'Albert Steptoe and his son Harold are rag-and-bone men, complete with horse and cart to tour the neighbourhood. They also live amicably together at the junk yard. Always on the lookout for ways to improve his lot, Harold invests his father''s life savings in a greyhound who is almost blind and can''t see the hare. When the dog loses a race and Harold has to pay off the debt, he comes up with another bright idea. Collect his father''s life insurance. To do this his father must pretend to be dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWOESkScPGK5W31E5N5dLBi6jOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52797'),
  ('917255729860744576', 'Stereo', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Maximilian Erlenwein, The Chau Ngo', 'Maximilian Erlenwein', 'Jürgen Vogel, Moritz Bleibtreu, Petra Schmidt-Schaller, Georg Friedrich, Rainer Bock, Adrian Can, Paul Faßnacht, Fabian Hinrichs', null, 'Erik has is own motorbike workshop in a sleepy little town. He may have the telling word ‘scoundrel’ tattooed onto his lower arm but he nonetheless creates an impression of a well-behaved average Joe. His relationship with his girlfriend Julia is going well and her daughter Linda is very fond of her new Dad. But then all of a sudden the mysterious Henry appears and begins following him about like a sinister shadow. The more Erik tries to shake off his diabolical guest the more Henry intrudes into his life. But then when a violent gangster named Keitel enters the fray and threatens not only Erik but Julia and Linda, Erik’s seemingly ideal world begins to run off the rails.', 'Erik has is own motorbike workshop in a sleepy little town. He may have the telling word ‘scoundrel’ tattooed onto his lower arm but he nonetheless creates an impression of a well-behaved average Joe. His relationship with his girlfriend Julia is going well and her daughter Linda is very fond of her new Dad. But then all of a sudden the mysterious Henry appears and begins following him about like a sinister shadow. The more Erik tries to shake off his diabolical guest the more Henry intrudes into his life. But then when a violent gangster named Keitel enters the fray and threatens not only Erik but Julia and Linda, Erik’s seemingly ideal world begins to run off the rails.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTm2JEsdKNgUFPjm5UBo1541fTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256311'),
  ('1150786953324239483', 'Stereo (Tile 3B of a CAEE Educational Mosaic)', 1969, 'Science Fiction', 'David Cronenberg, David Cronenberg', 'David Cronenberg', 'Ronald Mlodzik, Jack Messinger, Iain Ewing, Clara Mayer, Paul Mulholland, Arlene Mlodzik, Glenn McCauley', 'NR', 'A group of Canadian university students agree to partake in a grisly psychological experiment, which renders them incapable of speech but able to communicate telepathically.', 'A group of Canadian university students agree to partake in a grisly psychological experiment, which renders them incapable of speech but able to communicate telepathically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0iWpWPBqZLHNCfhSEjvJH6UT3h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33691'),
  ('20582264061797719', 'Steve', 2025, 'Drama', 'Tim Mielants, Robrecht Heyvaert, Nigel Pollock', 'Max Porter', 'Cillian Murphy, Tracey Ullman, Jay Lycurgo, Little Simz, Douggie McMeekin, Youssef Kerkour, Roger Allam, Emily Watson', 'R', 'Over one intense day, the devoted head teacher of a last-chance reform school strives to keep his students in line while facing pressures of his own.', 'Over one intense day, the devoted head teacher of a last-chance reform school strives to keep his students in line while facing pressures of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmLoMyofbseLfxiGgk1Iz5H97c3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242404'),
  ('71190229475233509', 'Steve Jobs', 2015, 'Drama, History', 'Danny Boyle, Alwin H. Küchler, Luke Freeborn', 'Aaron Sorkin', 'Michael Fassbender, Kate Winslet, Seth Rogen, Jeff Daniels, Michael Stuhlbarg, Katherine Waterston, Perla Haney-Jardine, Ripley Sobo', 'R', 'Set backstage at three iconic product launches and ending in 1998 with the unveiling of the iMac, Steve Jobs takes us behind the scenes of the digital revolution to paint an intimate portrait of the brilliant man at its epicenter.', 'Set backstage at three iconic product launches and ending in 1998 with the unveiling of the iMac, Steve Jobs takes us behind the scenes of the digital revolution to paint an intimate portrait of the brilliant man at its epicenter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljiRO29Y9khEERRqMluptUYunJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321697'),
  ('1064742926684531082', 'Steve Jobs: Billion Dollar Hippy', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Laura Craig Gray, Tristan Quinn', null, 'Steve Jobs, Steve Wozniak, John Sculley, Andy Hertzfeld, Daniel Kottke, Evan Davis, Bob Cringely', null, 'Broadly considered a brand that inspires fervour and defines cool consumerism, Apple has become one of the biggest corporations in the world, fuelled by game-changing products that tap into modern desires. Its leader, Steve Jobs, was a long-haired college dropout with infinite ambition, and an inspirational perfectionist with a bully''s temper. A man of contradictions, he fused a Californian counterculture attitude and a mastery of the art of hype with explosive advances in computer technology. Insiders including Apple co-founder Steve Wozniak, the chairman who ousted Jobs from the company he founded, and Jobs'' chief of software, tell extraordinary stories of the rise, fall and rise again of Apple with Steve Jobs at its helm. With Stephen Fry, world wide web inventor Sir Tim Berners-Lee and branding guru Rita Clifton, Evan Davis decodes the formula that took Apple from suburban garage to global supremacy.', 'Broadly considered a brand that inspires fervour and defines cool consumerism, Apple has become one of the biggest corporations in the world, fuelled by game-changing products that tap into modern desires. Its leader, Steve Jobs, was a long-haired college dropout with infinite ambition, and an inspirational perfectionist with a bully''s temper. A man of contradictions, he fused a Californian counterculture attitude and a mastery of the art of hype with explosive advances in computer technology. Insiders including Apple co-founder Steve Wozniak, the chairman who ousted Jobs from the company he founded, and Jobs'' chief of software, tell extraordinary stories of the rise, fall and rise again of Apple with Steve Jobs at its helm. With Stephen Fry, world wide web inventor Sir Tim Berners-Lee and branding guru Rita Clifton, Evan Davis decodes the formula that took Apple from suburban garage to global supremacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maYBumRfAbeH2bCSaRuN8cLEgcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80688'),
  ('302708095710869373', 'Steve Jobs: The Lost Interview', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Paul Sen', 'Bob Cringely', 'Steve Jobs, Bob Cringely', null, 'In a television interview filmed in 1995, Steve Jobs talks frankly about his early life, competition with Microsoft and his vision for the future, while he was running NeXT, the company he founded after leaving Apple.', 'In a television interview filmed in 1995, Steve Jobs talks frankly about his early life, competition with Microsoft and his vision for the future, while he was running NeXT, the company he founded after leaving Apple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xISU0kU9uN9csV1PlcLYyduCKfA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89638'),
  ('438646336035227211', 'Steve Jobs: The Man in the Machine', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Alex Gibney, Sam Painter, Yutaka Yamazaki', 'Alex Gibney', 'Bob Belleville, Chrisann Brennan, Nolan Bushnell, Jason Chen, Nick Denton, Jesus Diaz, Peter Elkind, Alex Gibney', 'R', 'When Steve Jobs died the world wept. But what accounted for the grief of millions of people who didn’t know him? This evocative film navigates Jobs'' path from a small house in the suburbs, to zen temples in Japan, to the CEO''s office of the world''s richest company, exploring how Jobs’ life and work shaped our relationship with the computer. The Man in the Machine is a provocative and sometimes startling re-evaluation of the legacy of an icon.', 'When Steve Jobs died the world wept. But what accounted for the grief of millions of people who didn’t know him? This evocative film navigates Jobs'' path from a small house in the suburbs, to zen temples in Japan, to the CEO''s office of the world''s richest company, exploring how Jobs’ life and work shaped our relationship with the computer. The Man in the Machine is a provocative and sometimes startling re-evaluation of the legacy of an icon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8zA8Vdh5AQRULuDDp2xx08DNNx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324308'),
  ('330859631419416900', 'Steve Martin and Martin Short: An Evening You Will Forget for the Rest of Your Life', 2018, 'Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Marcus Raboy', 'Steve Martin, Martin Short', 'Steve Martin, Martin Short, Jesse Lunsford', null, 'Comedians and writers Steve Martin and Martin Short perform a live comedy set with music by The Steep Canyon Rangers and jazz pianist, Jeff Babko, at the Peace Center in Greenville, South Carolina.', 'Comedians and writers Steve Martin and Martin Short perform a live comedy set with music by The Steep Canyon Rangers and jazz pianist, Jeff Babko, at the Peace Center in Greenville, South Carolina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3STPYldeX274Uw20UikS55irMXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525814'),
  ('1027967712168577777', 'Steve McQueen: The Man & Le Mans', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Gabriel Clarke, John McKenna, Matt Smith', 'Gabriel Clarke', 'Steve McQueen, Chad McQueen, Neile Adams, Alan Trustman, James Garner, Hal Hamilton, John Frankenheimer, Derek Bell', null, 'Steve McQueen: The Man & Le Mans interweaves stunning newly discovered footage and voice recordings with original interviews. It is the true story of how a cinema legend would risk almost everything in pursuit of his dream.', 'Steve McQueen: The Man & Le Mans interweaves stunning newly discovered footage and voice recordings with original interviews. It is the true story of how a cinema legend would risk almost everything in pursuit of his dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQGYyBBGWXgSv9PhgKbUoHS7azS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339934'),
  ('460966806256755385', 'Stevie', 2003, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Steve James', null, 'Steve James, Stephen Fielding, Tonya Gregory, Bernice Hagler, Verna Hagler, Brenda Hickam, Doug Hickam, Judy James', 'R', 'In 1995 Director Steve James (Hoop Dreams) returned to rural Southern Illinois to reconnect with Stevie Fielding, a troubled young boy he had been an ''Advocate Big Brother'' to ten years earlier.', 'In 1995 Director Steve James (Hoop Dreams) returned to rural Southern Illinois to reconnect with Stevie Fielding, a troubled young boy he had been an ''Advocate Big Brother'' to ten years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67TAylTWoysC2ffqVO18do0rwEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51927'),
  ('1149482005475720228', 'Stewardess School', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Fred J. Koenekamp, Ken Blancato, Bill Scott', 'Ken Blancato', 'Brett Cullen, Mary Cadorette, Don Most, Sandahl Bergman, Judy Landers, Wendie Jo Sperber, Julia Montgomery, Dennis Burkley', 'R', 'A group of varied misfits (including a former prostitute/stripper and a bumbler who can''t see more than 6 inches in front of his face) enter a school to become flight attendants. Somehow, the group makes it through to the final test: a cross-country flight.', 'A group of varied misfits (including a former prostitute/stripper and a bumbler who can''t see more than 6 inches in front of his face) enter a school to become flight attendants. Somehow, the group makes it through to the final test: a cross-country flight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gv3RXJ0epHMahYd5HBJhApDQHXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51743'),
  ('945527171098238981', 'Stewie Griffin: The Untold Story', 2005, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Pete Michels', 'Gary Janetti, Chris Sheridan, Steve Callaghan', 'Seth MacFarlane, Alex Borstein, Seth Green, Mila Kunis, Patrick Warburton, Lori Alan, Drew Barrymore, Mike Henry', 'NR', 'The maniacal baby of the Griffin family, Stewie, meets his future self. In doing this he discovers that his future image is not what he has anticipated because of a near death experience.', 'The maniacal baby of the Griffin family, Stewie, meets his future self. In doing this he discovers that his future image is not what he has anticipated because of a near death experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgbMydwYuHlGcaASQMA963qpSH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65215'),
  ('639908332498968367', 'Stick', 1985, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Burt Reynolds, Nick McLean', 'Elmore Leonard, Joseph Stinson', 'Burt Reynolds, Candice Bergen, George Segal, Charles Durning, José Pérez, Richard Lawson, Castulo Guerra, Dar Robinson', 'R', 'After getting out of jail, car thief Ernest "Stick" Stickley witnesses the murder of his friend Rainy during a drug deal. To avoid getting killed by the same people, who work for mobster Chucky, Stick gets a job as a chauffeur for millionaire Barry Braham and lies low. As he gets used to his new routine, Stick woos Barry''s financial consultant, Kyle McClaren, but must fight back when Chucky''s men come after him.', 'After getting out of jail, car thief Ernest "Stick" Stickley witnesses the murder of his friend Rainy during a drug deal. To avoid getting killed by the same people, who work for mobster Chucky, Stick gets a job as a chauffeur for millionaire Barry Braham and lies low. As he gets used to his new routine, Stick woos Barry''s financial consultant, Kyle McClaren, but must fight back when Chucky''s men come after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHZ50vtexlvgXRjAKXxLRT8H6tr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32387'),
  ('590651866359334720', 'Stick It', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jessica Bendinger, Daryn Okada, Lars P. Winther', 'Jessica Bendinger', 'Jeff Bridges, Missy Peregrym, Vanessa Lengies, Jon Gries, Gia Carides, Julie Warner, Maddy Curley, Kellan Lutz', 'PG-13', 'Haley is a naturally gifted athlete but, with her social behavior, the teen seems intent on squandering her abilities. After a final brush with the law, a judge sentences her to an elite gymnastics academy run by a legendary, hard-nosed coach. Once there, Haley''s rebellious attitude wins her both friends and enemies.', 'Haley is a naturally gifted athlete but, with her social behavior, the teen seems intent on squandering her abilities. After a final brush with the law, a judge sentences her to an elite gymnastics academy run by a legendary, hard-nosed coach. Once there, Haley''s rebellious attitude wins her both friends and enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMcylxIC7nBpBd8Uf6Apr4MJ1pf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10115'),
  ('1043401200074094845', 'Stick Man', 2015, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Jeroen Jaspaert, Daniel Snaddon, Karen Lindsay-Stewart', 'Max Lang, Jeroen Jaspaert', 'Martin Freeman, Hugh Bonneville, Jennifer Saunders, Russell Tovey, Sally Hawkins, Rob Brydon, Anouska White, Eve Bentley', null, 'Stick Man lives in the family tree with his Stick Lady Love and their stick children three, and he''s heading on an epic adventure across the seasons. Will he get back to his family in time for Christmas?', 'Stick Man lives in the family tree with his Stick Lady Love and their stick children three, and he''s heading on an epic adventure across the seasons. Will he get back to his family in time for Christmas?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hChFSATMxo9cDpDGl5iit5dx7yy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374251'),
  ('1133327699984923396', 'Stickman', 2017, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Sheldon Wilson, Gregor Hagey', 'Sheldon Wilson', 'Hayley Law, Sara Alicia Garcia, Zoé De Grand Maison, Erik Knudsen, Alanna Bale, Anthony Lemke, Delia Lisette Chambers, Sarah Fisher', null, 'The thing that waits under your bed, hides in the closet, stalks your dreams… is waiting for you. At least Emma Wright knew that at the age of 7 when she was wrongly accused of murdering her sister. Emma knew it was the Stickman. After years of isolation she finally has her demons under control and is released.', 'The thing that waits under your bed, hides in the closet, stalks your dreams… is waiting for you. At least Emma Wright knew that at the age of 7 when she was wrongly accused of murdering her sister. Emma knew it was the Stickman. After years of isolation she finally has her demons under control and is released.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brlxFn8t5ez5KAGDjQuC1bGp1Fk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480403'),
  ('1096713234968418950', 'Sticks & Stones', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Neil Tolkin, Paul Childs, Avraham Karpick', 'Neil Tolkin', 'Justin Isfeld, Max Goldblatt, Chauncey Leopardi, Jordan Brower, Gary Busey, Kirstie Alley, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Matt McCoy', 'PG-13', 'For three junior high friends, growing up takes a dangerous turn when the vicious local bully targets them. With no one to turn to but each other, they muster the courage to take a shot at settling the score.', 'For three junior high friends, growing up takes a dangerous turn when the vicious local bully targets them. With no one to turn to but each other, they muster the courage to take a shot at settling the score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whP82OMYdw9i4PjleJ4VvWWg6vu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292044'),
  ('1025986678461767629', 'Stiff Upper Lips', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Gary Sinyor, Simon Archer, Natasha Tahta', 'Gary Sinyor, Paul Simpkin', 'Georgina Cates, Peter Ustinov, Prunella Scales, Samuel West, Sean Pertwee, David Artus, Kevin Furlong, Nicholas Selby', 'R', 'Stiff Upper Lips is a broad parody of British period films, especially the lavish Merchant-Ivory productions of the ''eighties and early ''nineties. Although it specifically targets A Room with a View, Chariots of Fire, Maurice, A Passage to India, and many other films, in a more general way Stiff Upper Lips satirises popular perceptions of certain Edwardian traits: propriety, sexual repression, xenophobia, and class snobbery.', 'Stiff Upper Lips is a broad parody of British period films, especially the lavish Merchant-Ivory productions of the ''eighties and early ''nineties. Although it specifically targets A Room with a View, Chariots of Fire, Maurice, A Passage to India, and many other films, in a more general way Stiff Upper Lips satirises popular perceptions of certain Edwardian traits: propriety, sexual repression, xenophobia, and class snobbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BKL5t6z6kudeDmuwYiIF5dzAV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89861'),
  ('267260347926162810', 'Stigma', 1977, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Lawrence Gordon Clark', 'Clive Exton', 'Peter Bowles, Kate Binchy, Maxine Gordon, Jon Laurimore, Christopher Blake, John Judd', null, 'A young couple move into a remote country house in the middle of a stone circle. They employ workmen who disturb an ancient menhir, unleashing a supernatural force.', 'A young couple move into a remote country house in the middle of a stone circle. They employ workmen who disturb an ancient menhir, unleashing a supernatural force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztCjyRwwKiJsZ5IOu4YgYBGyU29.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144399'),
  ('97703209361680064', 'Stigma', 1980, 'Horror', 'José Ramón Larraz, Giuseppe Bernardini', 'José Ramón Larraz', 'Christian Borromeo, Alexandra Bastedo, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Helga Liné, Berta Cabré, Antonio Molino Rojo, Irene Gutiérrez Caba, Massimo Serato', null, 'The death of Sebastian''s father engenders in him pathological fears and hallucinations. His death wishes seem to cause horrible accidents, which he is unable to control. When his older brother dies, he feels that he has caused it. He undergoes hypnosis, but his apparent supernatural powers continue. As his own life nears its end, he becomes even more violent and sadistic.', 'The death of Sebastian''s father engenders in him pathological fears and hallucinations. His death wishes seem to cause horrible accidents, which he is unable to control. When his older brother dies, he feels that he has caused it. He undergoes hypnosis, but his apparent supernatural powers continue. As his own life nears its end, he becomes even more violent and sadistic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlbtISrFOblD9Ms3N0s5isp7StG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29881'),
  ('325949530137627839', 'Stigmata', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rupert Wainwright, Jeffrey L. Kimball, Miguel Lima', 'Tom Lazarus, Rick Ramage', 'Patricia Arquette, Gabriel Byrne, Jonathan Pryce, Nia Long, Thomas Kopache, Rade Šerbedžija, Enrico Colantoni, Dick Latessa', 'R', 'A young woman with no strong religious beliefs, Frankie Paige begins having strange and violent experiences, showing signs of the wounds that Jesus received when crucified. When the Vatican gets word of Frankie''s situation, a high-ranking cardinal requests that the Rev. Andrew Kiernan investigate her case. Soon Kiernan realizes that very sinister forces are at work, and tries to rescue Frankie from the entity that is plaguing her.', 'A young woman with no strong religious beliefs, Frankie Paige begins having strange and violent experiences, showing signs of the wounds that Jesus received when crucified. When the Vatican gets word of Frankie''s situation, a high-ranking cardinal requests that the Rev. Andrew Kiernan investigate her case. Soon Kiernan realizes that very sinister forces are at work, and tries to rescue Frankie from the entity that is plaguing her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKS1Vuqj7OQpOumfs6ArC0TICTN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10307'),
  ('903435600682373495', 'Stigmatized Properties', 2020, 'Horror, Drama', 'Hideo Nakata, Yasushi Hanamura', 'Brazily Anne Yamada', 'Kazuya Kamenashi, Nao, Koji Seto, Houka Kinoshita, Noriko Eguchi, MEGUMI, Mao, Junji Takada', null, 'Yamano Yamame, an entertainer who can''t sell, is unreasonably told by his seniors that he should live in the accident property because he will put it on TV, and he moves to the property where the murder occurred due to his appearance on TV and the low rent. At first glance, the room was a normal room, but a mysterious white object was reflected in the image of the room, and the sound was disturbed. The program in which Yamame appeared became lively, and Yamame moved around the accident property in search of new material. Yamame, who encounters various mysterious phenomena in the room where he lives, makes a big break as an "entertainer who lives in the accident property".', 'Yamano Yamame, an entertainer who can''t sell, is unreasonably told by his seniors that he should live in the accident property because he will put it on TV, and he moves to the property where the murder occurred due to his appearance on TV and the low rent. At first glance, the room was a normal room, but a mysterious white object was reflected in the image of the room, and the sound was disturbed. The program in which Yamame appeared became lively, and Yamame moved around the accident property in search of new material. Yamame, who encounters various mysterious phenomena in the room where he lives, makes a big break as an "entertainer who lives in the accident property".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66iMLeBkpwPD0fT9iULeEEQT8Ku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:742043'),
  ('114822812005485108', 'Stigmatized Properties: Possession', 2025, 'Horror', 'Hideo Nakata, Ryuichi Saeki, Takahiro Imai', 'Daisuke Hosaka', 'Shota Watanabe, Mei Hata, Kotaro Yoshida, Kenichi Takitoh, Tarō Suwa, Jiro, Maho Yamada, Bokuzo Masana', null, 'Aspiring celebrity Yahiro Kuwata moves to Tokyo and becomes a "Cursed Property Resident Talent," living in haunted locations for TV and social media. As he hops between eerie apartments, an old inn, and a séance-filled share house, he uncovers the dark mysteries hidden within. But his extreme sensitivity to spirits makes him an easy target for relentless supernatural attacks. In one particular cursed property, he stumbles upon an unimaginable horror and a shocking truth that will change everything.', 'Aspiring celebrity Yahiro Kuwata moves to Tokyo and becomes a "Cursed Property Resident Talent," living in haunted locations for TV and social media. As he hops between eerie apartments, an old inn, and a séance-filled share house, he uncovers the dark mysteries hidden within. But his extreme sensitivity to spirits makes him an easy target for relentless supernatural attacks. In one particular cursed property, he stumbles upon an unimaginable horror and a shocking truth that will change everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIuqCUB982uBAKbzWrBiFhcm5H8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1450684'),
  ('1019834530132584390', 'Stiletto', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Nick Vallelonga, TK Shom, Lynnette M. Myers', 'Paul Sloan', 'Stana Katic, Tom Berenger, Paul Sloan, Michael Biehn, William Forsythe, Diane Venora, Amanda Brooks, Dominique Swain', 'R', 'The seemingly random killings of an assassin puzzle her former lover, a wealthy Greek crime boss whose organization is jeopardized by his love for her, and the detective following her rising body count', 'The seemingly random killings of an assassin puzzle her former lover, a wealthy Greek crime boss whose organization is jeopardized by his love for her, and the detective following her rising body count', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IGs3VTIpUdZqjJtM2QVs3Q4D8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15542'),
  ('829287114943003462', 'Still', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Wison Jiraungkoonsakul, Nikorn Sripongwarakul, Sittipong Kongtong', 'Patana Chirawong, Tanwarin Sukkhapisit, Manussa Vorasingha', 'Siriwimol Charoenpura, Akara Amarttayakul, Supakson Ruengsomboon, Kachapa Toncharoen, Sattawat Sethakorn, Atthaporn Teemakorn, Pimolrat Pisolyabutr, Wiradit Srimalai', null, 'A haunted house, a nightclub fire, a body found in a water tank, and a prison death make up four horror stories pulled from Thailand''s newspaper headlines.', 'A haunted house, a nightclub fire, a body found in a water tank, and a prison death make up four horror stories pulled from Thailand''s newspaper headlines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dliHBherBuDSmazI8iKPpmjo1Hd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61674'),
  ('522315568550402149', 'Still Alice', 2014, 'Drama', 'Richard Glatzer, Wash Westmoreland, Denis Lenoir', 'Richard Glatzer, Wash Westmoreland', 'Julianne Moore, Kate Bosworth, Shane McRae, Hunter Parrish, Alec Baldwin, Seth Gilliam, Kristen Stewart, Stephen Kunken', 'PG-13', 'Alice Howland, happily married with three grown children, is a renowned linguistics professor who starts to forget words. When she receives a devastating diagnosis, Alice and her family find their bonds tested.', 'Alice Howland, happily married with three grown children, is a renowned linguistics professor who starts to forget words. When she receives a devastating diagnosis, Alice and her family find their bonds tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJiGGbuLW8IkEnh5073maEmIr7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284293'),
  ('1131697186460254061', 'Still Breathing', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'James F. Robinson, John Thomas', 'James F. Robinson', 'Brendan Fraser, Joanna Going, Ann Magnuson, Celeste Holm, Lou Rawls, Steven Lambert, Toby Huss, Michael McKean', 'PG-13', 'Two lost souls: she a con-artist in L.A.; he a puppeteer in San Antonio have the same dream linking each with the other. He travels to L.A. to find this woman he has become obsessed with. She resists, afraid of his kooky ideas until she travels with him to San Antonio and meets his wise grandmother. Story of two disparate people linked by "fate" gets increasingly interesting as it rolls along.', 'Two lost souls: she a con-artist in L.A.; he a puppeteer in San Antonio have the same dream linking each with the other. He travels to L.A. to find this woman he has become obsessed with. She resists, afraid of his kooky ideas until she travels with him to San Antonio and meets his wise grandmother. Story of two disparate people linked by "fate" gets increasingly interesting as it rolls along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1IKvPLuwIxNUUXJ1q24fUR2nOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39467'),
  ('286118577920724847', 'Still Crazy', 1998, 'Comedy, Music', 'Brian Gibson, Ashley Rowe, Sallie Hard', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais', 'Stephen Rea, Billy Connolly, Jimmy Nail, Timothy Spall, Bill Nighy, Juliet Aubrey, Helena Bergström, Bruce Robinson', 'R', 'In the 1970s, Strange Fruit were it. They lived the rock lifestyle to the max, groupies, drugs, internal tension and an ex front man dead from an overdose. Even their demise was glamorous; when lightning struck the stage during an outdoor festival. Twenty years on, these former rock gods they have now sunk deep into obscurity when the idea of a reunion tour is lodged in the head of Tony, former keyboard player of the Fruits. Tony sets out to find his former bandmates with the help of former manager Karen to see if they can recapture the magic and give themselves a second chance.', 'In the 1970s, Strange Fruit were it. They lived the rock lifestyle to the max, groupies, drugs, internal tension and an ex front man dead from an overdose. Even their demise was glamorous; when lightning struck the stage during an outdoor festival. Twenty years on, these former rock gods they have now sunk deep into obscurity when the idea of a reunion tour is lodged in the head of Tony, former keyboard player of the Fruits. Tony sets out to find his former bandmates with the help of former manager Karen to see if they can recapture the magic and give themselves a second chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1k991eZm7iF8JUNiVdUZU44x5c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1618'),
  ('949873772101231813', 'Still Dust on the Brain', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Poul Bang, Aage Wiltrup', 'Arvid Müller, Aage Stentoft, Øyvind Vennerød', 'Dirch Passer, Ove Sprogøe, Helle Virkner, Søren Elung Jensen, Hanne Borchsenius, Bodil Udsen, Karl Stegger, Solveig Sundborg', null, 'Det Støver Stadig (It''s Still Dusting) is the second film in the popular "Dust series" (Støv På Hjernen, Støv For Alle Pengene). Once again, Arvid Müller and Aage Stentoft wrote the festive script, which introduced new customs and traditions to the Danish housing market. The small community in the "sleepy town" is easily recognizable, but major changes have taken place since last time, because the residents of Solvænget have—with municipal support—bought the property they live in, and (something completely new at the time) the wives have had to take jobs to make ends meet! Mrs. Rigmor Hansen is absolutely brilliant as the manager of a Quick laundry. Her "truths" about the new everyday life in Denmark are crystal clear—and eternally young. The property''s first general meeting with the guys in the stairwell – and the presentation of the first annual accounts – are golden scenes from the golden age of Danish family films.', 'Det Støver Stadig (It''s Still Dusting) is the second film in the popular "Dust series" (Støv På Hjernen, Støv For Alle Pengene). Once again, Arvid Müller and Aage Stentoft wrote the festive script, which introduced new customs and traditions to the Danish housing market. The small community in the "sleepy town" is easily recognizable, but major changes have taken place since last time, because the residents of Solvænget have—with municipal support—bought the property they live in, and (something completely new at the time) the wives have had to take jobs to make ends meet! Mrs. Rigmor Hansen is absolutely brilliant as the manager of a Quick laundry. Her "truths" about the new everyday life in Denmark are crystal clear—and eternally young. The property''s first general meeting with the guys in the stairwell – and the presentation of the first annual accounts – are golden scenes from the golden age of Danish family films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUmDc5pdzwitlYrcrGqo7SjTjqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73174'),
  ('536417803137932671', 'Still Fabulous', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Michela Andreozzi, Maurizio Calvesi, Livio Bordone', 'Michela Andreozzi, Daniela Delle Foglie', 'Diana Del Bufalo, Valentina Nappi, Alessandro Tiberi, Raoul Bova, Angela Finocchiaro, Ludovica Di Donato, Jenny De Nucci, Massimiliano Vado', null, 'Stuck in a dead-end career and on a string of terrible dates, the life of 30-something Maddalena is a total mess until one day, she meets an unlikely imaginary friend who comes to her in the form of real-life porn star Valentina Nappi. Her mission? To teach Maddalena everything she needs to know about life, sex, and love.', 'Stuck in a dead-end career and on a string of terrible dates, the life of 30-something Maddalena is a total mess until one day, she meets an unlikely imaginary friend who comes to her in the form of real-life porn star Valentina Nappi. Her mission? To teach Maddalena everything she needs to know about life, sex, and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sd6FXSEyvhIKkw8xmFuMV0xnMoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115749'),
  ('383735373827568712', 'Still Here', 2020, 'Drama', 'Vlad Feier, Ana Paula Rivera, Adrienne Stern', 'Vlad Feier, Peter Gutter', 'Johnny Whitworth, Zazie Beetz, Maurice McRae, Afton Williamson, Larry Pine, Jeremy Holm, Danny Johnson, Jared Kemp', null, 'Christian Baker, a young New York journalist from The Chronicle, gets assigned to a social story about the disappearance of Monique Watson, a 12 years old African-American girl from Brooklyn. Trying to get the assignment behind, he quickly and poorly researches the story and goes with the first lead. This brings down a series of pains. Christian with guilt decides to finally do his work properly finding himself in a race against time to help the family find the girl', 'Christian Baker, a young New York journalist from The Chronicle, gets assigned to a social story about the disappearance of Monique Watson, a 12 years old African-American girl from Brooklyn. Trying to get the assignment behind, he quickly and poorly researches the story and goes with the first lead. This brings down a series of pains. Christian with guilt decides to finally do his work properly finding himself in a race against time to help the family find the girl', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8v8rK0Us4WapWpcuyULdN8wJA5Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528402'),
  ('218730843279837410', 'Still Hope', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Richie Johns, Julius Damenz, Lance Johann', 'Randy McWilson, Mitch Hudson', 'Luna Rivera, John D. Michaels, Alex Veadov, Michelle Haro, Andrea Mitchell', 'PG-13', '. Hope, a teenager from a tight-knit community, finds herself in danger when the person she believes to be a new friend proves unsafe. Taken from all she knows, Hope is forced into sex trafficking and stripped of her identity. After finding freedom from her captors, Hope discovers that survival is only the first step. Inspired by true stories, Hope''s journey is a powerful illustration of the courage it takes to walk the complex path of recovery.', '. Hope, a teenager from a tight-knit community, finds herself in danger when the person she believes to be a new friend proves unsafe. Taken from all she knows, Hope is forced into sex trafficking and stripped of her identity. After finding freedom from her captors, Hope discovers that survival is only the first step. Inspired by true stories, Hope''s journey is a powerful illustration of the courage it takes to walk the complex path of recovery.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F0%2Fgracenote%2F00ec52fc85ac432d89ba103bd2a0927e.jpg', 'plex:movie:still-hope'),
  ('526801181366246601', 'Still Life', 1978, 'Drama', 'Sohrab Shahid Saless, Manuchehr Hadji-Abadian, Houshang Baharlou', 'Sohrab Shahid Saless', 'Zadour Bonyadi, Zahra Yazdani, Hibibollah Safarian, Majid Baghaie, Hedayatollah Navid, Mohammad-Reza Samimi, Noorollah Googlani, Hossein-Ali Bidogli', null, 'A railway crossing guard and his wife live in a routine of total isolation and uneventfulness.', 'A railway crossing guard and his wife live in a routine of total isolation and uneventfulness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEXQDugjJzEUYyrf4RMYz2mxbxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213592'),
  ('369039840809099049', 'Still Life', 2005, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jon Knautz, John Ashmore, Matthew Gorman', 'Charles Johnston', 'Trevor Matthews, Matthew Brulotte, Lee Demarbre', null, 'A pill-popping, over-caffeinated driver accidentally hits something. Panic-stricken, he searches for help in a strange and desolate town that offers very little in the form of human kindness.', 'A pill-popping, over-caffeinated driver accidentally hits something. Panic-stricken, he searches for help in a strange and desolate town that offers very little in the form of human kindness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLHPjE3sakqShH81ciB8Jh0txAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190638'),
  ('736894452838702270', 'Still Life', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jia Zhangke, Nelson Yu Lik-wai, Yu Yan', 'Jiamin Sun, Na Guan, Jia Zhangke', 'Han Sanming, Zhao Tao, Wang Hongwei, Zhubin Li, Haiyu Xiang, Lin Zhou, Lizhen Ma, Zhou Lan', null, 'A town in Fengjie county is gradually being demolished and flooded to make way for the Three Gorges Dam. A man and woman visit the town to locate their estranged spouses, and become witness to the societal changes.', 'A town in Fengjie county is gradually being demolished and flooded to make way for the Three Gorges Dam. A man and woman visit the town to locate their estranged spouses, and become witness to the societal changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJYBqUk9zZ3lotYo4711HqWh8QE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2346'),
  ('992643331802018329', 'Still Life', 2013, 'Drama', 'Uberto Pasolini, Stefano Falivene', 'Uberto Pasolini', 'Eddie Marsan, Joanne Froggatt, Karen Drury, Andrew Buchan, Neil D''Souza, Tim Potter, Michael Elkin, Paul Anderson', 'PG-13', 'A council case worker looks for the relatives of those found dead and alone.', 'A council case worker looks for the relatives of those found dead and alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WxGIgw13bKHXFbMhJqBc8Sk2TY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216156'),
  ('397142269688998203', 'Still Life of Memories', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hitoshi Yazaki, Isao Ishii', 'Masa Asanishi, Akihiko Ito', 'Masanobu Ando, Natsuko Kobayashi, Rima Matsuda, Vivienne Sato, Kiyomi Itō, Misa Wada, Sally Mizuno, Inuhiko Yomota', null, 'A rising photographer is asked by a mysterious woman to take pictures of her body, engaging both his talent and personal life.', 'A rising photographer is asked by a mysterious woman to take pictures of her body, engaging both his talent and personal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqL9PwGn58tiV6zv4AAS3FyP9de.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535618'),
  ('795902966758350602', 'Still Life with Ghosts', 2025, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Enrique Buleo, Gina Ferrer', 'Enrique Buleo', 'Consuelo Trujillo, Fernando Sansegundo, Enric Benavent, Gloria Martínez, Eduardo Antuña, Patty Bonet, Cristina García, Pilar Matas', null, 'In a small town haunted by the struggles of life and death, ghosts and humans alike embark on a desperate journey to end their torment, resorting to extreme measures to achieve their goals.', 'In a small town haunted by the struggles of life and death, ghosts and humans alike embark on a desperate journey to end their torment, resorting to extreme measures to achieve their goals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozv8zvv4uHABf45v4vVUkJ13NDq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1352706'),
  ('990374120372673995', 'Still Mine', 2012, 'Drama', 'Michael McGowan, Brendan Steacy', 'Michael McGowan', 'James Cromwell, Geneviève Bujold, Campbell Scott, Julie Stewart, Rick Roberts, George R. Robertson, Barbara Gordon, Chuck Shamata', 'PG-13', 'Craig, a fiercely determined New Brunswick farmer, sets out to build a more suitable house for his ailing wife, Irene, despite their children''s concerns. As he starts building, he is blindsided by the bureaucratic codes and officials. As Irene becomes increasingly ill, Craig fights back. Based on a true story.', 'Craig, a fiercely determined New Brunswick farmer, sets out to build a more suitable house for his ailing wife, Irene, despite their children''s concerns. As he starts building, he is blindsided by the bureaucratic codes and officials. As Irene becomes increasingly ill, Craig fights back. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbSCfkLnGrxMqOkny5SrLiqfCav.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128215'),
  ('659914806787652501', 'Still Not Quite Human', 1992, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Eric Luke, Ron Orieux', 'Kevin Osborn, Seth McEvoy, Eric Luke', 'Jay Underwood, Alan Thicke, Adam Philipson, Betsy Palmer, Rosa Nevin, Robert Metcalfe, Sheelah Megill, Ken Pogue', 'PG', 'In the final film of the series, Chip and his "father" attend a robotics convention. Here, Dr. Carson is kidnapped and replaced by an android. Can Chip and his newfound friends save Dr. Carson from a dangerous competitor?', 'In the final film of the series, Chip and his "father" attend a robotics convention. Here, Dr. Carson is kidnapped and replaced by an android. Can Chip and his newfound friends save Dr. Carson from a dangerous competitor?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lADreDHwDnzgBlUeWHXifnjfYIu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70172'),
  ('493683242396101109', 'Still of the Night', 1982, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Robert Benton, Néstor Almendros', 'Robert Benton', 'Roy Scheider, Meryl Streep, Jessica Tandy, Joe Grifasi, Sara Botsford, Josef Sommer, Irving Metzman, Larry Joshua', 'PG', 'When one of his patients is found murdered, psychiatrist Dr. Sam Rice is visited by the investigating officer but refuses to give up any information. He''s then visited by the patient''s mistress, Brooke Reynolds, whom he quickly falls for despite her being a likely murder suspect. As the police pressure on him intensifies, Rice decides to attempt solving the case on his own and soon discovers that someone is trying to kill him as well.', 'When one of his patients is found murdered, psychiatrist Dr. Sam Rice is visited by the investigating officer but refuses to give up any information. He''s then visited by the patient''s mistress, Brooke Reynolds, whom he quickly falls for despite her being a likely murder suspect. As the police pressure on him intensifies, Rice decides to attempt solving the case on his own and soon discovers that someone is trying to kill him as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRTOsV47tfFIWF5QUx5KJtDPQwV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32048'),
  ('430856709388849902', 'Still Out of My League', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Emanuele Pasquet, Claudio Norza', 'Michela Straniero, Roberto Proia', 'Ludovica Francesconi, Giancarlo Commare, Jozef Gjura, Gaja Masciale, Jenny De Nucci, Giuseppe Futia, Riccardo Niceforo, Loredana Bertè', null, 'After breaking up with her dreamboat, Marta finds love with an artist. But life throws a few twists into the mix for the ailing woman and her friends.', 'After breaking up with her dreamboat, Marta finds love with an artist. But life throws a few twists into the mix for the ailing woman and her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soVwWSesTguGQSNsEpdSr46z98M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790523'),
  ('662259714318102161', 'Still Smokin', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Harvey Harrison, Tommy Chong, Jos Budie', 'Cheech Marin, Tommy Chong', 'Cheech Marin, Tommy Chong, Hans Man in ''t Veld, Carol van Herwijnen, Shireen Strooker, Susan Hahn, Arjan Ederveen, Kees Prins', 'R', 'Cheech & Chong are invited to a celebrity party in Amsterdam. When they get there, however, it turns out that the guy who invited them has taken off with all the money. They are actually expecting Burt Reynolds and Dolly Parton, so our heroes get to be Mr. Burt and Mr. Dolly.', 'Cheech & Chong are invited to a celebrity party in Amsterdam. When they get there, however, it turns out that the guy who invited them has taken off with all the money. They are actually expecting Burt Reynolds and Dolly Parton, so our heroes get to be Mr. Burt and Mr. Dolly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4Fup0uvurH2aBUYwRCsad8x7bV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12695'),
  ('513369984776796553', 'Still the Water', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Naomi Kawase, Yutaka Yamazaki, Yuki Kondo', 'Naomi Kawase', 'Nijiro Murakami, Junko Abe, Miyuki Matsuda, Tetta Sugimoto, Makiko Watanabe, Jun Murakami, Hideo Sakaki, Fujio Tokita', null, 'On the Japanese island of Amami, despite lacking parental guidance, Kaito and his girlfriend Kyoko try to find their place in the world. While Kaito suffers from the absence of his father, who moved to Tokyo after his birth, Kyoko must come to grips with her mother’s terminal illness.', 'On the Japanese island of Amami, despite lacking parental guidance, Kaito and his girlfriend Kyoko try to find their place in the world. While Kaito suffers from the absence of his father, who moved to Tokyo after his birth, Kyoko must come to grips with her mother’s terminal illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGylYtfMvKM7DwEI3CsdLTFJPTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265193'),
  ('374613163899073640', 'Still Time', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Alessandro Aronadio, Roberto Forza, Myriam Lugarà', 'Alessandro Aronadio, Renato Sannio', 'Edoardo Leo, Barbara Ronchi, Mario Sgueglia, Francesca Cavallin, Raz Degan, Massimo Wertmüller, Stella Trotta, Andrea Purgatori', 'PG-13', 'Dante accidentally kisses Alice and they get engaged. After a surprise party for his 40th birthday, he wakes up a year later, not remembering what happened. Not only does he discover that Alice is pregnant... He feels time is passing too quickly and he starts forgetting some of the most important moments of his life.', 'Dante accidentally kisses Alice and they get engaged. After a surprise party for his 40th birthday, he wakes up a year later, not remembering what happened. Not only does he discover that Alice is pregnant... He feels time is passing too quickly and he starts forgetting some of the most important moments of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/527kMgGu38T8Sc1wwfJxyoUHgrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881462'),
  ('387173111274514342', 'Still Waiting...', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Jeff Balis, Dan Coplan, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Rob McKittrick', 'John Michael Higgins, Rob Benedict, Steve Howey, Rob Kerkovich, Andy Milonakis, Alanna Ubach, Phillip Vaden, Chris Williams', 'R', 'After Shenaniganz loses all its hottest waitresses to new competitor Ta-Ta''s Wing Shack -- where the scantily clad wait staff earns bigger tips -- the Shenaniganz staff aims to give Ta-Ta''s its just desserts.', 'After Shenaniganz loses all its hottest waitresses to new competitor Ta-Ta''s Wing Shack -- where the scantily clad wait staff earns bigger tips -- the Shenaniganz staff aims to give Ta-Ta''s its just desserts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plzhxWNw2JleCNCuPsx773DCXy5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15105'),
  ('388193107409627871', 'STILL: A Michael J. Fox Movie', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Davis Guggenheim, C. Kim Miles, Clair Popkin', null, 'Michael J. Fox, Tracy Pollan, Sam Fox, Aquinnah Fox, Schuyler Fox, Annabelle Fox, Susan Bressman, Ryan Orser', 'R', 'A short kid from a Canadian army base becomes the international pop culture darling of the 1980s—only to find the course of his life altered by a stunning diagnosis. What happens when an incurable optimist confronts an incurable disease?', 'A short kid from a Canadian army base becomes the international pop culture darling of the 1980s—only to find the course of his life altered by a stunning diagnosis. What happens when an incurable optimist confronts an incurable disease?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDO4gYZxvdsIrHKzsSAbc3N7Wfg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058699'),
  ('790503690204154911', 'Still/Born', 2018, 'Horror', 'Brandon Christensen', 'Brandon Christensen', 'Christie Burke, Jesse Moss, Rebecca Olson, Jenn Griffin, Sheila McCarthy, Michael Ironside, Brittany Allen', null, 'Still/Born follows Mary, a new mother who lost one of her twins in childbirth. As she struggles with the loss of one of her children, she starts to suspect something sinister is after her surviving child – a supernatural entity that has chosen her child and will stop at nothing to take it from her.', 'Still/Born follows Mary, a new mother who lost one of her twins in childbirth. As she struggles with the loss of one of her children, she starts to suspect something sinister is after her surviving child – a supernatural entity that has chosen her child and will stop at nothing to take it from her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZ1BbnMArbnSISel8dK9mpRwWIB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429742'),
  ('296810223756968106', 'Stille Nacht I: Dramolet', 1988, 'Mystery, Animation, Horror', 'Timothy Quay, Stephen Quay', null, null, null, 'A magnet moves on a floor. A moth beats against a window. A doll child watches the magnet; threads of metal filings gather around the magnet.', 'A magnet moves on a floor. A moth beats against a window. A doll child watches the magnet; threads of metal filings gather around the magnet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9YfZdF4lA3QA5LbVwOZfN2tyT5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110760'),
  ('660860044154594784', 'Stille Nacht II: Are We Still Married?', 1992, 'Animation, Mystery, Horror, Music', 'Timothy Quay, Stephen Quay', null, null, null, 'Stop-motion animated short film with a white ball, a rabbit, and a girl, and a voice singing "Are We Still Married".', 'Stop-motion animated short film with a white ball, a rabbit, and a girl, and a voice singing "Are We Still Married".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKrBHoTVLctGE6Z5sDJDpsnwZ2o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59363'),
  ('844349560206402781', 'Stille Nacht III: Tales from Vienna Woods', 1993, 'Animation, Horror, Mystery', 'Stephen Quay, Timothy Quay', null, null, null, 'Near an extraordinary chair with many legs, a hand is visible gripping an edge. The hand is weathered, the fingers cracked and scarred. The end of a rifle appears and a shot fires. The bullet is visible whirling through space; it caroms and then goes through a pine cone. A long spoon emerges from a drawer in the chair and stretches toward the hand. The bullet is on the spoon. Later, the hand holds the bullet between two fingers; another shot is fired.', 'Near an extraordinary chair with many legs, a hand is visible gripping an edge. The hand is weathered, the fingers cracked and scarred. The end of a rifle appears and a shot fires. The bullet is visible whirling through space; it caroms and then goes through a pine cone. A long spoon emerges from a drawer in the chair and stretches toward the hand. The bullet is on the spoon. Later, the hand holds the bullet between two fingers; another shot is fired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KRHdwzumppLhSdc5r7DkYSiQXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110768'),
  ('421274103325546707', 'Stille Nacht IV: Can''t Go Wrong Without You', 1993, 'Animation, Horror, Mystery, Music', 'Timothy Quay, Stephen Quay', null, null, null, 'Short animated film featuring the song "Can''t Go Wrong Without You" by His Name Is Alive.', 'Short animated film featuring the song "Can''t Go Wrong Without You" by His Name Is Alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/furozn9qtWgCrXHcywYGXHgeTuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110772'),
  ('401507312041509683', 'Stiller & Meara: Nothing Is Lost', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Ben Stiller, Matt Lake, Jessica Lee Gagné', null, 'Jerry Stiller, Anne Meara, Ben Stiller, Amy Stiller, Ella Stiller, Quinn Dempsey Stiller, Christine Taylor, Christopher Walken', 'R', 'Ben Stiller tells the story of his parents—comedy icons Jerry Stiller and Anne Meara—exploring their impact on popular culture and at home, where the lines between creativity, family, life, and art often blurred.', 'Ben Stiller tells the story of his parents—comedy icons Jerry Stiller and Anne Meara—exploring their impact on popular culture and at home, where the lines between creativity, family, life, and art often blurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJuzuanxfc7D7Kqz4qYQqsDhRY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1517758'),
  ('302032684922615632', 'Stillwater', 2021, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Masanobu Takayanagi, Thierry Zemmour, Loïc Chavanon', 'Marcus Hinchey, Tom McCarthy, Noé Debré', 'Matt Damon, Camille Cottin, Abigail Breslin, Lilou Siauvaud, Deanna Dunagan, Moussa Maaskri, Anne Le Ny, Idir Azougli', 'R', 'Bill Baker, an American oil-rig roughneck from Oklahoma, travels to Marseille to visit his estranged daughter, Allison, who is in prison for a murder she claims she did not commit. Confronted with language barriers, cultural differences, and a complicated legal system, Bill builds a new life for himself in France as he makes it his personal mission to exonerate his daughter.', 'Bill Baker, an American oil-rig roughneck from Oklahoma, travels to Marseille to visit his estranged daughter, Allison, who is in prison for a murder she claims she did not commit. Confronted with language barriers, cultural differences, and a complicated legal system, Bill builds a new life for himself in France as he makes it his personal mission to exonerate his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lrPR7ah1KElPKnCsxmIRE1OlIh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616651'),
  ('1007741113291834094', 'Stimulantia', 1967, 'Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman, Rune Ericson, Gunnar Fischer', 'Lars Görling, Tage Danielsson, Hans Alfredson', 'Ingrid Bergman, Gunnar Björnstrand, Harriet Andersson, Lars Ekborg, Glenna Forster-Jones, Inga Landgré, Ingmar Bergman, Käbi Laretei', null, 'Eight vignettes on a variety of topics, including a baby growing up, Charlie Chaplin, Birgit Nilsson, the racing track at Le Mans, erotic cleanliness, French literature, and a black woman in a cupboard in the neighborhood of Farsta near Stockholm.', 'Eight vignettes on a variety of topics, including a baby growing up, Charlie Chaplin, Birgit Nilsson, the racing track at Le Mans, erotic cleanliness, French literature, and a black woman in a cupboard in the neighborhood of Farsta near Stockholm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59Jk4rH4Imdpy25VHo9mFLwANwO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268240'),
  ('1071566377948486222', 'Sting', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brad Shield, Kiah Roache-Turner', 'Kiah Roache-Turner', 'Alyla Browne, Ryan Corr, Penelope Mitchell, Kate Walsh, Robyn Nevin, Noni Hazlehurst, Danny Kim, Silvia Colloca', 'R', 'After raising an unnervingly talented spider in secret, 12-year-old Charlotte must face the truth about her pet and fight for her family''s survival.', 'After raising an unnervingly talented spider in secret, 12-year-old Charlotte must face the truth about her pet and fight for her family''s survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97XZtLd461e5e0WBIBJREK1lzqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1087388'),
  ('700563682484221842', 'Sting of Death', 1966, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'William Grefé, Julio C. Chávez, Julio Roldan', 'William Kerwin', 'Joe Morrison, Valerie Hawkins, John Vella, Jack Nagle, Sandy Lee Kane, Deanna Lund, Lois Etelman, Blanche Devereaux', null, 'A group of biology students head to the Florida Everglades for a holiday, but instead of fun in the sun, they run into trouble with a mutated, bloodthirsty, and quite deadly jellyfish-man-monster.', 'A group of biology students head to the Florida Everglades for a holiday, but instead of fun in the sun, they run into trouble with a mutated, bloodthirsty, and quite deadly jellyfish-man-monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LgaRexyf7wlwI9iE9O8Y6R19FV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85233'),
  ('1012439558629237039', 'Stingaree', 1934, 'Comedy, Adventure, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, James Van Trees', 'Becky Gardiner', 'Irene Dunne, Richard Dix, Mary Boland, Conway Tearle, Andy Devine, Una O''Connor, Henry Stephenson, George Barraud', 'NR', 'A young lady named Hilda who works as a servant for the wealthy Clarksons, sheep farmers, and dreams of being a great singer. An upcoming visit by Sir Julian, a famous composer arriving from London, drives jealous Mrs. Clarkson (an interfering biddy who fancies she can sing - but can''t) to send away Hilda, so he doesn''t hear Hilda has a good voice. Meanwhile, an infamous outlaw named Stingaree has just arrived in town and kidnaps Sir Julian, then poses as him at the Clarksons, where he meets Hilda a few hours before she is to leave.', 'A young lady named Hilda who works as a servant for the wealthy Clarksons, sheep farmers, and dreams of being a great singer. An upcoming visit by Sir Julian, a famous composer arriving from London, drives jealous Mrs. Clarkson (an interfering biddy who fancies she can sing - but can''t) to send away Hilda, so he doesn''t hear Hilda has a good voice. Meanwhile, an infamous outlaw named Stingaree has just arrived in town and kidnaps Sir Julian, then poses as him at the Clarksons, where he meets Hilda a few hours before she is to leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6EtpgxaoFQKF4JuoFotQk9KuGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184936'),
  ('3123479334160648', 'Stingray', 1978, 'Action', 'Richard Taylor, Frank Miller', 'Richard Taylor', 'Christopher Mitchum, Les Lannom, Cliff Emmich, William Watson, John Carl Buechler, Bert Hinchman, Sherry Jackson, Sondra Theodore', 'PG', 'Lonigan and his partner Tony, two drug dealers, shoot two cops who attempt to set them up, and run away with a million bucks and the drugs, which they stash in a red Corvette Stingray in a used car lot. When they attempt to recover their stash with their leader, Abigail, they find out that two happy-go-lucky dudes, Elmo and Al, have bought the car. They quickly pursue the two along with the police who think that the car''s new owners are the criminals.', 'Lonigan and his partner Tony, two drug dealers, shoot two cops who attempt to set them up, and run away with a million bucks and the drugs, which they stash in a red Corvette Stingray in a used car lot. When they attempt to recover their stash with their leader, Abigail, they find out that two happy-go-lucky dudes, Elmo and Al, have bought the car. They quickly pursue the two along with the police who think that the car''s new owners are the criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Uq8Dx9TqLkAAG4naLWMJluH7KL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94071'),
  ('818392994994532721', 'Stinsen brinner... filmen alltså', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Claes Eriksson, Anders Eriksson, Dan Myhrman', 'Claes Eriksson, Anders Eriksson', 'Anders Eriksson, Kerstin Granlund, Claes Eriksson, Peter Rangmar, Jan Rippe, Per Fritzell, Knut Agnred, Folke Lindh', null, 'The stationmaster is trying to prevent his station from being closed. The train isn''t coming and he has to explain to the waiting trainpassengers why it''s late, while other people is trying to get the station for their use; for example the italians, who want to make a pizzeria out of it.', 'The stationmaster is trying to prevent his station from being closed. The train isn''t coming and he has to explain to the waiting trainpassengers why it''s late, while other people is trying to get the station for their use; for example the italians, who want to make a pizzeria out of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5GWtcMfmIwPc6LR8BzRf5mq4yA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53688'),
  ('525001271187499534', 'Stir', 1980, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Stephen Wallace, Geoff Burton', 'Bob Jewson', 'Bryan Brown, Max Phipps, Dennis Miller, Gary Waddell, Phil Motherwell, Michael Gow, Edward Robshaw, Tex Morton', null, 'Filmed in the Clare Valley, Gladstone and the Flinders Ranges in South Australia, this prison movie was inspired by the true life prison riot at Bathurst Jail in 1974 and its subsequent Royal Commission into New South Wales Prisons.', 'Filmed in the Clare Valley, Gladstone and the Flinders Ranges in South Australia, this prison movie was inspired by the true life prison riot at Bathurst Jail in 1974 and its subsequent Royal Commission into New South Wales Prisons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k15yYqhdIxZFv01duvkh97KHdmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171513'),
  ('636229333279905084', 'Stir Crazy', 1980, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Sidney Poitier, Daniel McCauley, Don Wilkerson', 'Bruce Jay Friedman', 'Gene Wilder, Richard Pryor, Georg Stanford Brown, JoBeth Williams, Miguel Ángel Suárez, Craig T. Nelson, Barry Corbin, Charles Weldon', 'R', 'New Yorkers Skip Donahue and Harry Monroe have no jobs and no prospects, so they decide to flee the city and find work elsewhere, landing jobs wearing woodpecker costumes to promote the opening of a bank. When their feathery costumes are stolen and used in a bank robbery, they no longer have to worry about employment — they''re sent to prison.', 'New Yorkers Skip Donahue and Harry Monroe have no jobs and no prospects, so they decide to flee the city and find work elsewhere, landing jobs wearing woodpecker costumes to promote the opening of a bank. When their feathery costumes are stolen and used in a bank robbery, they no longer have to worry about employment — they''re sent to prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehCdQewg9SxjhnimJrKwNKbr80C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21629'),
  ('1010246638361438509', 'Stir of Echoes', 1999, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'David Koepp, Fred Murphy, Bob Schick', 'Andrew Kevin Walker', 'Kevin Bacon, Kathryn Erbe, Illeana Douglas, Zachary David Cope, Kevin Dunn, Conor O''Farrell, Liza Weil, Lusia Strus', 'R', 'After being hypnotized by his sister-in-law, Tom Witzky begins seeing haunting visions of a girl''s ghost and a mystery begins to unfold around her.', 'After being hypnotized by his sister-in-law, Tom Witzky begins seeing haunting visions of a girl''s ghost and a mystery begins to unfold around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CyJ5aYF27cITX1WSUTENeP4wBE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11601'),
  ('85054732342589222', 'Stir of Echoes: The Homecoming', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ernie Barbarash', 'Ernie Barbarash', 'Rob Lowe, Marnie McPhail, Ben Lewis, Tatiana Maslany, Shawn Roberts, Vik Sahay, Cristine Prosperi', 'R', 'A soldier returns home from the Iraq war only to be haunted by visions of the dead.', 'A soldier returns home from the Iraq war only to be haunted by visions of the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHfi643JkyJe647vtLE8SSZICI9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34734'),
  ('1083513898352295228', 'Stitch Head', 2025, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Steve Hudson, Toby Genkel, Lucy Rands', 'Steve Hudson', 'Asa Butterfield, Joel Fry, Alison Steadman, Rob Brydon, Seth Usdenov, Fern Brady, Tia Bannon, Jamali Maddix', 'PG', 'Stitch Head was the first creature brought to ''almost life'' by mad professor Erasmus. In the years since, he’s become nursemaid to the master’s ever-growing menagerie of neglected creatures, tasked with teaching them to suppress their ''inner monster'' and hide out in the castle — away from prying eyes and itchy pitchfork fingers, of the village mob in the valley below. But when grubby circus impresario Fulbert Freakfinder arrives offering Stitch Head a starring role in his freak show, our hero is tempted by the promise of love and acceptance.', 'Stitch Head was the first creature brought to ''almost life'' by mad professor Erasmus. In the years since, he’s become nursemaid to the master’s ever-growing menagerie of neglected creatures, tasked with teaching them to suppress their ''inner monster'' and hide out in the castle — away from prying eyes and itchy pitchfork fingers, of the village mob in the valley below. But when grubby circus impresario Fulbert Freakfinder arrives offering Stitch Head a starring role in his freak show, our hero is tempted by the promise of love and acceptance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0ZOIaQ8oLEGmQVrYcmvIOUuSqs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214130'),
  ('1060913671004818156', 'Stitch! The Movie', 2003, 'Comedy, Family, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Julie Morgavi, Bobs Gannaway, Tony Craig', 'Bobs Gannaway, Jess Winfield', 'Daveigh Chase, Chris Sanders, Tia Carrere, David Ogden Stiers, Kevin McDonald, Liliana Mumy, Jeff Bennett, Ving Rhames', 'G', 'The continuing adventures of Lilo, a little Hawaiian girl, and Stitch, the galaxy''s most-wanted extraterrestrial. Stitch, Pleakley, and Dr. Jumba are all part of the household now, but what Lilo and Stitch don''t know is that Dr. Jumba brought his other alien "experiments" to Hawaiʻi as well.', 'The continuing adventures of Lilo, a little Hawaiian girl, and Stitch, the galaxy''s most-wanted extraterrestrial. Stitch, Pleakley, and Dr. Jumba are all part of the household now, but what Lilo and Stitch don''t know is that Dr. Jumba brought his other alien "experiments" to Hawaiʻi as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flwMGZcOO80lqsnZ6lIwsKja5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15567'),
  ('159103267217402696', 'Stitches', 2012, 'Horror', 'Conor McMahon, Patrick Jordan', 'Conor McMahon, David O''Brien', 'Ross Noble, Tommy Knight, Gemma-Leah Devereux, John McDonnell, Shane Murray-Corcoran, Thommas Kane Byrne, Eoghan McQuinn, Roisin Barron', 'R', 'The clumsy and unfunny clown Richard "Stitches" Grindle entertains at the 10th birthday party of little Tom, but the boy and his friends play a prank with Stitches, tying his shoelaces. Stitches slips, falls and dies. Six years later, Tom gives a birthday party for his friends at home, but Stitches revives to haunt the teenagers and revenge his death.', 'The clumsy and unfunny clown Richard "Stitches" Grindle entertains at the 10th birthday party of little Tom, but the boy and his friends play a prank with Stitches, tying his shoelaces. Stitches slips, falls and dies. Six years later, Tom gives a birthday party for his friends at home, but Stitches revives to haunt the teenagers and revenge his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxZ6rfvzKWwt2nu7ElrwYkNHu5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115210'),
  ('185948293111698723', 'Stockholm', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alejandro de Pablo, Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Borja Soler', 'Isabel Peña, Rodrigo Sorogoyen', 'Javier Pereira, Aura Garrido, Jesús Caba, Susana Abaitua, Miriam Marco, Lorena Mateo', null, 'The story of the encounter between a boy and a girl. He confesses that he fell in love with her at first sight, but she does not believe him. However, as they walk through the night in Madrid, they share their desires, secrets, and maybe a few little lies. But soon the film brings us back to the harsh reality of power struggles, psychological games and conflicts between the sexes. Stockholm thus offers an incredible reading of the relations between young people today.', 'The story of the encounter between a boy and a girl. He confesses that he fell in love with her at first sight, but she does not believe him. However, as they walk through the night in Madrid, they share their desires, secrets, and maybe a few little lies. But soon the film brings us back to the harsh reality of power struggles, psychological games and conflicts between the sexes. Stockholm thus offers an incredible reading of the relations between young people today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72Kl7ve97Uwrgjnpia30VzfwtFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185738'),
  ('747754897610970746', 'Stockholm', 2019, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Robert Budreau, Brendan Steacy', 'Robert Budreau', 'Ethan Hawke, Noomi Rapace, Mark Strong, Christopher Heyerdahl, Bea Santos, Mark Rendall, Ian Matthews, John Ralston', 'R', 'Based on the extraordinary true story of the European city’s 1973 bank heist and hostage crisis that was documented in the 1974 New Yorker article “The Bank Drama” by Daniel Lang. The events grasped the world’s attention when the hostages bonded with their captors and turned against the authorities, giving rise to the psychological phenomenon known as “Stockholm Syndrome.”', 'Based on the extraordinary true story of the European city’s 1973 bank heist and hostage crisis that was documented in the 1974 New Yorker article “The Bank Drama” by Daniel Lang. The events grasped the world’s attention when the hostages bonded with their captors and turned against the authorities, giving rise to the psychological phenomenon known as “Stockholm Syndrome.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ko3AS33BLNEBcp1CO4FvdRltTxr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437626'),
  ('963730010372581045', 'Stockholm Bloodbath', 2024, 'Action, History, Drama, Adventure, War', 'Mikael Håfström, Pär M. Ekberg, Júlia Bársony', 'Erlend Loe, Nora Landsrød', 'Sophie Cookson, Claes Bang, Alba August, Mikkel Boe Følsgaard, Jakob Oftebro, Ulrich Thomsen, Emily Beecham, Thomas Chaanhing', null, 'In 1520, the notorious and power-hungry Danish King Christian II is determined to seize the Swedish crown from Sten Sture, no matter what it takes. Meanwhile, sisters Freja and Anne make a solemn promise to seek revenge on the men who brutally murdered their family. Everything comes to a head in the heart of Stockholm, where the sisters are drawn into a ruthless political struggle between Sweden and Denmark that culminates in a mass execution, presided over by the mad King "Christian the Tyrant," known as the Stockholm Bloodbath.', 'In 1520, the notorious and power-hungry Danish King Christian II is determined to seize the Swedish crown from Sten Sture, no matter what it takes. Meanwhile, sisters Freja and Anne make a solemn promise to seek revenge on the men who brutally murdered their family. Everything comes to a head in the heart of Stockholm, where the sisters are drawn into a ruthless political struggle between Sweden and Denmark that culminates in a mass execution, presided over by the mad King "Christian the Tyrant," known as the Stockholm Bloodbath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzXOB8nxO70SfSbOhrYcY94x6MI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1051486'),
  ('527202180693194847', 'Stockholm Marathon', 1994, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Peter Keglevic, Wolfgang Dickmann', 'Beate Langmaack, Rainer Berg', 'Gösta Ekman, Kjell Bergqvist, Rolf Lassgård, Niklas Hjulström, Corinna Harfouch, Mats Huddén, Jonas Falk, Anna Godenius', null, 'A gardener decides to exact revenge on the men he believes to be responsible for the death of his mentally disturbed wife.', 'A gardener decides to exact revenge on the men he believes to be responsible for the death of his mentally disturbed wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIia6whM2IsyI7pnXKBTaixZOpJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33121'),
  ('823299503781911637', 'Stockholm, entrée de l''exposition', 1897, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre Promio', null, null, null, 'A view of the entrance to the Stockholmsutställlningen, the World Exhibition in Stockholm.', 'A view of the entrance to the Stockholmsutställlningen, the World Exhibition in Stockholm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWBrk60N03EFsAzS8iPeWehVkq2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231044'),
  ('770509077637343044', 'Stockholm, Pennsylvania', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Arnaud Potier, Nikole Beckwith, Jacques Terblanche', 'Nikole Beckwith', 'Saoirse Ronan, Cynthia Nixon, Jason Isaacs, David Warshofsky, Avery Phillips, Hana Hayes, Rosalind Chao, Tom Wright', null, 'A young woman is returned home to her biological parents after living with her abductor for 17 years.', 'A young woman is returned home to her biological parents after living with her abductor for 17 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoapXic9H8w3PdXIJICuoZMVWoV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308361'),
  ('429914573437980575', 'Stockholmsnatt', 1987, 'Crime, Drama', 'Johan Schell, Staffan Hildebrand', 'Staffan Hildebrand', 'Paolo Roberto, Ian Roberto, Ellen Roberto, Vincenzo Roberto, Quincy Jones III, Camilla Lundén, Liam Norberg, Jonas Rasmusson', null, 'The film is loosely based on a true story about Paolo Roberto, later a professional boxer and TV presenter. Because of his Italian roots, Paolo is dealing with an identity crisis. With an admiration of Kung Fu films and with his teenage aggressions, Paolo practices violence on innocent citizens in Stockholm.', 'The film is loosely based on a true story about Paolo Roberto, later a professional boxer and TV presenter. Because of his Italian roots, Paolo is dealing with an identity crisis. With an admiration of Kung Fu films and with his teenage aggressions, Paolo practices violence on innocent citizens in Stockholm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijp1Ojqxj0KiEG9Q4Y1sde2Eguk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76034'),
  ('432684061853826973', 'Stoic', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Uwe Boll, Mathias Neumann, Bryan C. Knight', 'Uwe Boll', 'Edward Furlong, Shaun Sipos, Sam Levinson, Steffen Mennekes', null, 'A heated game of poker causes three men incarcerated for nonviolent offenses to brutalize their cellmate before taking drastic measures in order to cover up their crime.', 'A heated game of poker causes three men incarcerated for nonviolent offenses to brutalize their cellmate before taking drastic measures in order to cover up their crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPkNJ75cR36rnClt8Ev1wqOuUDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24757'),
  ('1050604398745297432', 'Stoker', 2013, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Park Chan-wook, Chung Chung-hoon, Kim Thompson', 'Wentworth Miller', 'Mia Wasikowska, Nicole Kidman, Matthew Goode, Dermot Mulroney, Jacki Weaver, Lucas Till, Alden Ehrenreich, Phyllis Somerville', 'R', 'After India’s father dies suddenly, her uncle Charlie, whom she never knew existed, comes to live with her and her emotionally unstable mother. Soon after his arrival, she begins to suspect that this mysterious, charming man has ulterior motives. But instead of feeling outrage or horror, the friendless girl becomes increasingly infatuated with him.', 'After India’s father dies suddenly, her uncle Charlie, whom she never knew existed, comes to live with her and her emotionally unstable mother. Soon after his arrival, she begins to suspect that this mysterious, charming man has ulterior motives. But instead of feeling outrage or horror, the friendless girl becomes increasingly infatuated with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aK0PTgwDiLm2YCNpOrhD8JR3mqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86825'),
  ('160136109572527045', 'Stolen', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Anders Anderson, Andy Steinman', 'Glenn Taranto', 'Jon Hamm, Josh Lucas, Rhona Mitra, James Van Der Beek, Jessica Chastain, Joanna Cassidy, Jimmy Bennett, Morena Baccarin', 'R', 'A detective becomes obsessed with solving a child''s 50-year-old murder, uncovering striking similarities between the case and his son''s disappearance.', 'A detective becomes obsessed with solving a child''s 50-year-old murder, uncovering striking similarities between the case and his son''s disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJzSflTDiGc4E641ex5ADyfdCQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38850'),
  ('632958823526232514', 'Stolen', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Simon West, James Whitaker, Janell Sammelman', 'David Guggenheim', 'Nicolas Cage, Sami Gayle, Josh Lucas, Malin Åkerman, Danny Huston, Shanna Forrestall, Kevin Foster, Mark Valley', 'R', 'Master thief Will Montgomery is just released from the State penitentiary after serving a 10 year sentence, is contacted by Vincent, his ex comrade in crime, who is holding Will’s teenage daughter ransom in a hijacked taxi cab. Vincent will only surrender her when Will reveals the whereabouts of the 20 million dollars he contrived to conceal from their last robbery.', 'Master thief Will Montgomery is just released from the State penitentiary after serving a 10 year sentence, is contacted by Vincent, his ex comrade in crime, who is holding Will’s teenage daughter ransom in a hijacked taxi cab. Vincent will only surrender her when Will reveals the whereabouts of the 20 million dollars he contrived to conceal from their last robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rTcpPiet2Lt2uZXBFIH5U7ylBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127493'),
  ('264028394800905073', 'Stolen', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Karan Tejpal, Isshaan Ghosh, Amarendra Singh', 'Gaurav Dhingra, Karan Tejpal, Swapnil Salkar "Agadbumb"', 'Abhishek Banerjee, Shubham Vardhan, Mia Maelzer, Harish Khanna, Sahidur Rahaman, Baby Tanya, Shrishti, Lovekush Kundu', null, 'The five-month-old baby of impoverished tribal woman Jhumpa Mahato is stolen. Two brothers, Gautam and Raman, who witness the kidnapping, try to help her and become embroiled in the complexities of the investigation.', 'The five-month-old baby of impoverished tribal woman Jhumpa Mahato is stolen. Two brothers, Gautam and Raman, who witness the kidnapping, try to help her and become embroiled in the complexities of the investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xR5Endhjm4soY6fPgXY0jrpDZvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156202'),
  ('799451237180767478', 'Stolen', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Elle-Márjá Eira, Ken Are Bongo, Håkan Linder', 'Peter Birro', 'Elin Kristina Oskal, Martin Wallström, Magnus Kuhmunen, Pávva Pittja, Lars-Ánte Wasara, Dakota Trancher Williams, Ida Persson Labba, Matias Tunold', null, 'A young woman struggles to defend her Sámi heritage in a world where xenophobia is on the rise, climate change is threatening reindeer herding, and young people choose suicide in the face of collective desperation.', 'A young woman struggles to defend her Sámi heritage in a world where xenophobia is on the rise, climate change is threatening reindeer herding, and young people choose suicide in the face of collective desperation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovUBfip0EgyqHZYhVx4K0ZjFkgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019317'),
  ('496711808979512222', 'Stolen by Their Father', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Simone Stock, Sasha Moric, Joe Caporale', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Sarah Drew, Carina Battrick, Tara Yelland, Caroline Palmer, Valentina Battrick, Cameron Nicoll, Patrice Goodman, Jinny Wong', 'PG-13', 'The story of a mother whose two young daughters are kidnapped by her abusive ex-husband—and her all-consuming fight to get them back.', 'The story of a mother whose two young daughters are kidnapped by her abusive ex-husband—and her all-consuming fight to get them back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m31GJGP8yf0aASFrzrrQe28vvKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942713'),
  ('501100597533812120', 'Stolen Days', 2019, 'Drama', 'Guido Lombardi, Daria D''Antonio', 'Guido Lombardi, Marco Gianfreda, Luca de Benedittis', 'Augusto Zazzaro, Riccardo Scamarcio, Massimo Popolizio, Carlo Cerciello, Giorgio Careccia, Vanessa Scalera, Rosa Diletta Rossi, Leandra Concetta Fili', null, 'Salvo was five when his father Vincenzo was arrested, practically before his eyes. Seven years later Salvo lives with his uncles and his cousin a controlled and peaceful existence in the Turin area, but his father returns and claims his son for four days. Vincenzo has to carry an important load to Bari and brings Salvo (nomen est omen) with him as insurance: a child is better than a gun, he says, because his presence in the event of a possible police detention can have a distracting effect . This however is not the only reason why Vincenzo wants Salvo with him, and the "Salv-atore" child will prove to be a potential vehicle of redemption for that messed up father, but not entirely devoid of feelings and attentions.', 'Salvo was five when his father Vincenzo was arrested, practically before his eyes. Seven years later Salvo lives with his uncles and his cousin a controlled and peaceful existence in the Turin area, but his father returns and claims his son for four days. Vincenzo has to carry an important load to Bari and brings Salvo (nomen est omen) with him as insurance: a child is better than a gun, he says, because his presence in the event of a possible police detention can have a distracting effect . This however is not the only reason why Vincenzo wants Salvo with him, and the "Salv-atore" child will prove to be a potential vehicle of redemption for that messed up father, but not entirely devoid of feelings and attentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5d2419yYqmKKO5dXqVUD0Zp95H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625501'),
  ('457201279543540103', 'Stolen Desire', 1958, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shōhei Imamura, Kuratarō Takamura, Kirio Urayama', 'Hisashi Yamanouchi', 'Hiroyuki Nagato, Yōko Minamida, Osamu Takizawa, Shinichi Yanagisawa, Kō Nishimura, Michie Kita, Shoichi Ozawa, Hayao Takamura', null, 'A rambunctious and ribald tale of a troupe of travelling actors who alternate highlights of kabuki theatre with strip shows.', 'A rambunctious and ribald tale of a troupe of travelling actors who alternate highlights of kabuki theatre with strip shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jjtaMgtuwiYEBObStDtli1sayc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46149'),
  ('1133875686605765729', 'Stolen Dreams', 2009, 'Drama', 'Sandra Werneck, Fernando Zagallo, Walter Carvalho', 'Paulo Halm, Michelle Franz, Sandra Werneck', 'Nanda Costa, Amanda Diniz, Kika Farias, Marieta Severo, Daniel Dantas, Nelson Xavier, Ângelo Antônio, MV Bill', null, 'Jessica, Sabrina and Daiane have dreams, just like all young people of any social class or place in the world. They live in a low-income neighborhood in the periphery of Rio de Janeiro and find in prostitution a way to survive and satisfy their consumer desires. However, even faced with the trials of absolute uncertainty and lack of hope, Jessica, Sabrina and Daiane insist on loving, having fun and planning their future.', 'Jessica, Sabrina and Daiane have dreams, just like all young people of any social class or place in the world. They live in a low-income neighborhood in the periphery of Rio de Janeiro and find in prostitution a way to survive and satisfy their consumer desires. However, even faced with the trials of absolute uncertainty and lack of hope, Jessica, Sabrina and Daiane insist on loving, having fun and planning their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mdVp2j5AdtB0qW6Wt4MXRoNFt6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45170'),
  ('388145166106140791', 'Stolen Face', 1952, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Terence Fisher, Walter J. Harvey', 'Richard H. Landau, Martin Berkeley', 'Paul Henreid, Lizabeth Scott, André Morell, Mary Mackenzie, John Wood, Susan Stephen, Arnold Ridley, Diana Beaumont', 'NR', 'A plastic surgeon changes the face of a female convict to match that of the beautiful woman who broke his heart and left him. He marries the convict but trouble starts when his true love returns.', 'A plastic surgeon changes the face of a female convict to match that of the beautiful woman who broke his heart and left him. He marries the convict but trouble starts when his true love returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKZQUswbsLJPD7zfWLBfg6bqSa6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38964'),
  ('818871368914812793', 'Stolen Girl', 2025, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'James Kent, Teo Delgado', 'Kas Graham, Rebecca Pollock', 'Kate Beckinsale, Scott Eastwood, Jordan Duvigneau, Matt Craven, Nowar Yusuf, Arvin Kananian, Robert Farrior, Alejandra Howard', 'R', 'In 1993, Maureen’s six-year-old daughter Amina is snuck out of the country by her ex-husband, Karim. After years of unsuccessful attempts to find her, Maureen intersects with a professional retriever of internationally abducted children who promises to help her find Amina in exchange for her collaboration.', 'In 1993, Maureen’s six-year-old daughter Amina is snuck out of the country by her ex-husband, Karim. After years of unsuccessful attempts to find her, Maureen intersects with a professional retriever of internationally abducted children who promises to help her find Amina in exchange for her collaboration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZlNXEHZsBp7unqw009MeBbMv87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280450'),
  ('217248374104215069', 'Stolen Hours', 1963, 'Drama', 'Daniel Petrie, Harry Waxman', 'Jessamyn West', 'Susan Hayward, Michael Craig, Diane Baker, Edward Judd, Paul Rogers, Robert Bacon, Paul Stassino, Jerry Desmonde', null, 'A woman diagnosed with a brain tumor falls in love with her doctor.', 'A woman diagnosed with a brain tumor falls in love with her doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgAmhHZRMdBV5iZWIoUHHxbUsTx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242622'),
  ('572662104039506210', 'Stolen Identity', 2018, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Hideo Nakata, Yuta Tsukinaga', 'Tetsuya Oishi', 'Keiko Kitagawa, Kei Tanaka, Yudai Chiba, Ryo Narita, Jun Kaname, Bakarhythm, Maryjun Takahashi, Taizo Harada', null, 'After a man accidentally leaves his smartphone in a taxi, he and his girlfriend are plagued by stalkers and cybercrimes.', 'After a man accidentally leaves his smartphone in a taxi, he and his girlfriend are plagued by stalkers and cybercrimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFTyUmeddTMd5E25KyjErk8Mu3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537755'),
  ('1029730014927011746', 'Stolen Kisses', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'François Truffaut, Denys Clerval, Richard Overstreet', 'François Truffaut, Claude de Givray, Bernard Revon', 'Jean-Pierre Léaud, Claude Jade, Delphine Seyrig, Michael Lonsdale, Daniel Ceccaldi, Claire Duhamel, Harry-Max, André Falcon', 'R', 'The third in a series of films featuring François Truffaut''s alter-ego, Antoine Doinel, the story resumes with Antoine being discharged from military service. His sweetheart Christine''s father lands Antoine a job as a security guard, which he promptly loses. Stumbling into a position assisting a private detective, Antoine falls for his employers'' seductive wife, Fabienne, and finds that he must choose between the older woman and Christine.', 'The third in a series of films featuring François Truffaut''s alter-ego, Antoine Doinel, the story resumes with Antoine being discharged from military service. His sweetheart Christine''s father lands Antoine a job as a security guard, which he promptly loses. Stumbling into a position assisting a private detective, Antoine falls for his employers'' seductive wife, Fabienne, and finds that he must choose between the older woman and Christine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qHh1Vp2TOOX5IaTVt4wyT8OTnR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255'),
  ('731517708330030545', 'Stolen Life', 2005, 'Drama', 'Li Shaohong, Zeng Nianping', null, 'Zhou Xun, Wu Jun, Cai Ming, Su Xiaoming, Yan Ni', null, 'When Yan''ni starts college she believes she is embarking on a new life away from her family, and she is, but not the new beginning she anticipates. Once at school, she immediately meets Muyu and falls in love with him. What she does not know is that from the moment he met her Muyu began an intricate deception that will lead to the loss of her child and the future she believes in.', 'When Yan''ni starts college she believes she is embarking on a new life away from her family, and she is, but not the new beginning she anticipates. Once at school, she immediately meets Muyu and falls in love with him. What she does not know is that from the moment he met her Muyu began an intricate deception that will lead to the loss of her child and the future she believes in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lba5IIvJSJYZWSN8nrM7YQ1JYAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69811'),
  ('803916833283316849', 'Stolen Spring', 1993, 'Drama', 'Peter Schrøder, Dirk Brüel, Tom Hedegaard', 'Peter Bay', 'Frits Helmuth, Tomas Villum Jensen, Jesper Langberg, Adam Simonsen, Hugo Øster Bendtsen, René Benjamin Hansen, Lars Lohmann, Ken Vedsegaard', null, 'At their 25th high-school anniversary some bourgeois citizens remember their time in school as a happy one. In reality it was quite the contrary. The school was a madhouse in which the teachers, especially Blomme, tormented the students. As a result one of them became a murderer.', 'At their 25th high-school anniversary some bourgeois citizens remember their time in school as a happy one. In reality it was quite the contrary. The school was a madhouse in which the teachers, especially Blomme, tormented the students. As a result one of them became a murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fx9ScTlwfUsJXvGhIcGO50CzdbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42613'),
  ('1045984704369956807', 'Stolen Summer', 2002, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Pete Jones, Peter Biagi', 'Pete Jones', 'Adiel Stein, Mike Weinberg, Aidan Quinn, Bonnie Hunt, Kevin Pollak, Eddie Kaye Thomas, Lisa Dodson, Brian Dennehy', null, 'Pete, an eight-year-old Catholic boy growing up in the suburbs of Chicago in the mid-1970s, attends Catholic school, where as classes let out for the summer, he''s admonished by a nun to follow the path of the Lord, and not that of the Devil. Perhaps taking this message a bit too seriously, Pete decides it''s his goal for the summer to help someone get into heaven - by trying to convert a Jew to Catholicism.', 'Pete, an eight-year-old Catholic boy growing up in the suburbs of Chicago in the mid-1970s, attends Catholic school, where as classes let out for the summer, he''s admonished by a nun to follow the path of the Lord, and not that of the Devil. Perhaps taking this message a bit too seriously, Pete decides it''s his goal for the summer to help someone get into heaven - by trying to convert a Jew to Catholicism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/marKnaLfvEnQ1DK3U2SLKYRGVdh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39541'),
  ('16485930257630673', 'Stolen Women, Captured Hearts', 1997, 'Western, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jerry London', 'Richard Fielder', 'Janine Turner, Jean Louisa Kelly, Michael Greyeyes, Patrick Bergin, William Shockley, Rodney A. Grant, Saginaw Grant, William Lightning', null, 'Kansas, 1868. A wagon train is attacked by a band of Lakota Sioux led by the young and athletic warrior Tokalah. The attractive, red haired Anna Brewster-Morgan and her friend Sarah White are on this wagon train too. When Tokalah noticed a terrified Anna with a Bible, he thinks this is an omen. Despite killing the other passengers of the wagon train, only Anna and Sarah may continue their voyage. The next day Anna and Sarah are kidnapped by Tokalah. At first terrified of her captors, the unhappily married Anna eventually falls in love with the noble, honorable Tokalah. After a year''s captivity, Sarah is returned to her own people. Anna now must choose between her new life with Tokalah and her previous existence as the wife of farmer Daniel Morgan.', 'Kansas, 1868. A wagon train is attacked by a band of Lakota Sioux led by the young and athletic warrior Tokalah. The attractive, red haired Anna Brewster-Morgan and her friend Sarah White are on this wagon train too. When Tokalah noticed a terrified Anna with a Bible, he thinks this is an omen. Despite killing the other passengers of the wagon train, only Anna and Sarah may continue their voyage. The next day Anna and Sarah are kidnapped by Tokalah. At first terrified of her captors, the unhappily married Anna eventually falls in love with the noble, honorable Tokalah. After a year''s captivity, Sarah is returned to her own people. Anna now must choose between her new life with Tokalah and her previous existence as the wife of farmer Daniel Morgan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBn3ijt3xL0Tk2AbduQVuNjzfcd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68167'),
  ('1147507759118056432', 'Stolen: Heist of the Century', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Mark Lewis', null, 'Agim De Bruycker, Patrick Peys, Annie Lauwers, Peter Kerkhof', 'PG-13', 'Antwerp, 2003. A gang of thieves rob the impenetrable Diamond Center. Who was behind one of the world''s biggest heists - and how did they pull it off?', 'Antwerp, 2003. A gang of thieves rob the impenetrable Diamond Center. Who was behind one of the world''s biggest heists - and how did they pull it off?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqZOJkBd3DR6ioacm136lP7BGvi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1513598'),
  ('432465852965469559', 'Stolz der Nation', 2009, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Eli Roth', null, 'Daniel Brühl, Bo Svenson', null, 'Director Quentin Tarantino tasked Eli Roth to craft a mini-movie called Stolz der Nation (Nation''s Pride) that will be included in the theatrical cut of Inglourious Basterds. To help promote Inglourious Basterds via the film-within-a-film, Roth has slapped together a trailer for Nation''s Pride blending black and white photography with modern multi-layered camera effects.', 'Director Quentin Tarantino tasked Eli Roth to craft a mini-movie called Stolz der Nation (Nation''s Pride) that will be included in the theatrical cut of Inglourious Basterds. To help promote Inglourious Basterds via the film-within-a-film, Roth has slapped together a trailer for Nation''s Pride blending black and white photography with modern multi-layered camera effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPatk3OM3bZk69jvTEB9JoC10b1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28447'),
  ('46332198791840513', 'Stomp the Yard', 2007, 'Drama, Music', 'Sylvain White, Scott Kevan', 'Gregory Ramon Anderson', 'Columbus Short, Meagan Good, Ne-Yo, Darrin Henson, Jermaine Williams, Chris Brown, Laz Alonso, Brian J. White', 'PG-13', 'After the death of his younger brother, a troubled 19-year-old street dancer from Los Angeles is able to bypass juvenile hall by enrolling in the historically black, Truth University in Atlanta, Georgia. But his efforts to get an education and woo the girl he likes are sidelined when he is courted by the top two campus fraternities, both of which want and need his fierce street-style dance moves to win the highly coveted national step show competition.', 'After the death of his younger brother, a troubled 19-year-old street dancer from Los Angeles is able to bypass juvenile hall by enrolling in the historically black, Truth University in Atlanta, Georgia. But his efforts to get an education and woo the girl he likes are sidelined when he is courted by the top two campus fraternities, both of which want and need his fierce street-style dance moves to win the highly coveted national step show competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dald9tUbRmGQ91CUJnzaBAjjvUf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1931'),
  ('187344099741938943', 'Stomp the Yard 2: Homecoming', 2010, 'Drama, Music', 'Rob Hardy', 'Meena Payne, Albert Leon', 'Kiely Williams, Tika Sumpter, Stephen ''tWitch'' Boss, Collins Pennie, Columbus Short, Keith David, David Banner, Pooch Hall', 'PG-13', 'Chance Harris looks to find a balance between his school, work, relationships and opportunity to perform at the nationally televised step competition during homecoming weekend at Truth University.', 'Chance Harris looks to find a balance between his school, work, relationships and opportunity to perform at the nationally televised step competition during homecoming weekend at Truth University.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttwEygvi7j1TNhDTvfBROEHtHEY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33473'),
  ('1034202855013839162', 'Stonados', 2013, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Jason Bourque, Brenton Spencer', 'Rafael Jordan', 'Paul Johansson, Sebastian Spence, Miranda Frigon, Jess McLeod, Dylan Schmid, William B. Davis, Grace Vukovic, Ben Witmer', null, 'A storm chaser tries to save Boston from destruction when a freak tornado bombards the city with huge boulders.', 'A storm chaser tries to save Boston from destruction when a freak tornado bombards the city with huge boulders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QAsTKtZIJWyHeJcXh34jeAZIsM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222890'),
  ('215666590397376294', 'Stone', 1974, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Sandy Harbutt, Graham Lind, Dewey Hungerford', 'Sandy Harbutt, Michael Robinson', 'Ken Shorter, Sandy Harbutt, Deryck Barnes, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Roger Ward, Vincent Gil, Dewey Hungerford, James Bowles', null, 'After one of its members witnesses a political assassination, an outlaw motorbike gang becomes the target of a string of murders, prompting a cop to join their ranks to determine who is responsible.', 'After one of its members witnesses a political assassination, an outlaw motorbike gang becomes the target of a string of murders, prompting a cop to join their ranks to determine who is responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnXEtNLbwMeYCnZChXw48V8jdzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14937'),
  ('975981853075427826', 'Stone', 1992, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Aleksandr Burov, Vladimir Persov', 'Yuriy Arabov', 'Pyotr Aleksandrov, Leonid Mozgovoy, Vadim Semyonov', null, 'A young night watchman at the Anton Chekhov museum in Yalta encounters a mysterious, weary intruder who appears to be the playwright himself, returned from the dead. Over the course of a single night, the two share a series of quiet, existential interactions within the preserved rooms of the estate.', 'A young night watchman at the Anton Chekhov museum in Yalta encounters a mysterious, weary intruder who appears to be the playwright himself, returned from the dead. Over the course of a single night, the two share a series of quiet, existential interactions within the preserved rooms of the estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viOFOGhmx0UvPSx4wxeejaAQxBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127296'),
  ('288973379825276247', 'Stone', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Action, Mystery', 'John Curran, Maryse Alberti', 'Angus MacLachlan', 'Robert De Niro, Edward Norton, Milla Jovovich, Frances Conroy, Enver Gjokaj, Pepper Binkley, Sandra Love Aldridge, Greg Trzaskoma', 'R', 'Parole officer Jack Mabry has only a few weeks left before retirement and wishes to finish out the cases he''s been assigned. One such case is that of Gerald ''Stone'' Creeson, a convicted arsonist who is up for parole. Jack is initially reluctant to indulge Stone in the coarse banter he wishes to pursue and feels little sympathy for the prisoner''s pleads for an early release. Seeing little hope in convincing Jack himself, Stone arranges for his wife to seduce the officer, but motives and intentions steadily blur amidst the passions and buried secrets of the corrupted players in this deadly game of deception.', 'Parole officer Jack Mabry has only a few weeks left before retirement and wishes to finish out the cases he''s been assigned. One such case is that of Gerald ''Stone'' Creeson, a convicted arsonist who is up for parole. Jack is initially reluctant to indulge Stone in the coarse banter he wishes to pursue and feels little sympathy for the prisoner''s pleads for an early release. Seeing little hope in convincing Jack himself, Stone arranges for his wife to seduce the officer, but motives and intentions steadily blur amidst the passions and buried secrets of the corrupted players in this deadly game of deception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcdN6DntOAOtKNQKcRKnfFayFis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44113'),
  ('228913760736265603', 'Stone Cold', 1991, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Craig R. Baxley, Alexander Gruszynski, Benjamin Rosenberg', 'Walter Doniger', 'Brian Bosworth, Lance Henriksen, William Forsythe, Arabella Holzbog, Sam McMurray, Richard Gant, Paulo Tocha, David Tress', 'R', 'Joe Huff is a tough, loner cop with a flair for infiltrating dangerous biker gangs. The FBI blackmail Huff into an undercover operation that entails infiltrating The Brotherhood – a powerful Mississippi biker gang linked in the murder of government officials as well as dealing drugs with the mafia.', 'Joe Huff is a tough, loner cop with a flair for infiltrating dangerous biker gangs. The FBI blackmail Huff into an undercover operation that entails infiltrating The Brotherhood – a powerful Mississippi biker gang linked in the murder of government officials as well as dealing drugs with the mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nW7wZKKjzZ5zriDfIjpJcZIyZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21338'),
  ('365410764966994151', 'Stone Cold', 2005, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Robert Harmon, Patrick Arias, Stuart Williams', null, 'Tom Selleck, Kathy Baker, Kohl Sudduth, Viola Davis, Jane Adams, Shawn Roberts, Cindy Sampson, Alexis Dziena', 'R', 'Jesse Stone is a former L.A. homicide detective who left behind the big city and an ex-wife to become the police chief of the quiet New England fishing town of Paradise. Stone''s old habits die hard as he continues to indulge his two favorite things: Scotch whiskey and women. After a series of murders, the first ever in Paradise, and a high school girl is raped he''s forced to face his own demons in order to solve the crimes.', 'Jesse Stone is a former L.A. homicide detective who left behind the big city and an ex-wife to become the police chief of the quiet New England fishing town of Paradise. Stone''s old habits die hard as he continues to indulge his two favorite things: Scotch whiskey and women. After a series of murders, the first ever in Paradise, and a high school girl is raped he''s forced to face his own demons in order to solve the crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vovdfgdfXazuOZK7x8ZwFwuxtci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31046'),
  ('942568471706994434', 'Stone Cold Dead', 1979, 'Thriller, Horror', 'George Mendeluk', 'George Mendeluk', 'Richard Crenna, Paul Williams, Belinda Montgomery, Chuck Shamata, Alberta Watson, Andrée Cousineau, Monique Mercure, George Chuvalo', 'R', 'Sergeant Boyd''s police search to find a sniper who has been shooting hookers.', 'Sergeant Boyd''s police search to find a sniper who has been shooting hookers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LXtVvX3GLwE2N8JU57iKKqR78g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29942'),
  ('427845113887414444', 'Stone Cold Fox', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Sophie Tabet, Ken Seng, Melissa R. Stubbs', 'Julia Roth, Sophie Tabet', 'Kiernan Shipka, Kiefer Sutherland, Krysten Ritter, Mishel Prada, Jamie Chung, Karen Fukuhara, Gabrielle Maiden, Adam El Sharkawy', 'R', 'In this ''80s-set revenge story, the defiant Fox breaks out of an abusive commune in search of her family. But when the queenpin kidnaps her little sister and sends a crooked cop after her, Fox has no choice but to infiltrate the very place she escaped.', 'In this ''80s-set revenge story, the defiant Fox breaks out of an abusive commune in search of her family. But when the queenpin kidnaps her little sister and sends a crooked cop after her, Fox has no choice but to infiltrate the very place she escaped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaL55wDL4bEUhU8pvAO2j1U7WSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1287814'),
  ('129672951415090345', 'Stone of Destiny', 2008, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Charles Martin Smith, Glen Winter', null, 'Robert Carlyle, Peter Mullan, Billy Boyd, Charlie Cox, Kate Mara, Stephen McCole, Ciaron Kelly, Brenda Fricker', null, 'Tells of the daring heist of The Stone of Destiny in the 1950s by a charming group of idealistic Scottish undergraduates, whose action rekindled Scottish nationalistic pride.', 'Tells of the daring heist of The Stone of Destiny in the 1950s by a charming group of idealistic Scottish undergraduates, whose action rekindled Scottish nationalistic pride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZWhnQY4Efi0iYQpnagP4vyaYps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12407'),
  ('453782883052263602', 'Stone Years', 1985, 'Drama', 'Thanassis Christopoulos, Stratos Tzitzis, Antonis Michaleas', 'Pantelis Voulgaris', 'Themis Bazaka, Dimitris Katalifos, Maria Martika, Eirini Inglesi, Nikos Birbilis, Ilias Katevas, Thanos Grammenos, Penelope Pitsouli', null, 'The true story of a young couple (Babis and Eleni) fighting for love and freedom. An odyssey in and out of prisons during the dark period between the Greek civil war until the end of dictatorship in 1974.', 'The true story of a young couple (Babis and Eleni) fighting for love and freedom. An odyssey in and out of prisons during the dark period between the Greek civil war until the end of dictatorship in 1974.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfM6P4I3j7S9zCImLjhtYJlRcxr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204134'),
  ('455755605749671422', 'Stoned', 2005, 'Drama', 'Stephen Woolley, John Mathieson, Deborah Saban', 'Robert Wade, Neal Purvis', 'Leo Gregory, Paddy Considine, David Morrissey, Ben Whishaw, Tuva Novotny, Amelia Warner, Monet Mazur, Luke de Woolfson', null, 'A chronicle of the sordid life and suspicious death of Rolling Stones co-founder Brian Jones, who was found in the bottom of his swimming pool weeks after being let go from the band.', 'A chronicle of the sordid life and suspicious death of Rolling Stones co-founder Brian Jones, who was found in the bottom of his swimming pool weeks after being let go from the band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfgAKZRJz4QIflwtpY4PCeG6oon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17741'),
  ('718438911516271909', 'Stonehearst Asylum', 2014, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Brad Anderson, Thomas Yatsko, Mark Roper', 'Joe Gangemi', 'Kate Beckinsale, Jim Sturgess, David Thewlis, Brendan Gleeson, Ben Kingsley, Michael Caine, Sinéad Cusack, Jason Flemyng', 'PG-13', 'An Oxford Medical School graduate takes a position at a mental institution and soon becomes obsessed with a female mental patient, but he has no idea of a recent and horrifying staffing change.', 'An Oxford Medical School graduate takes a position at a mental institution and soon becomes obsessed with a female mental patient, but he has no idea of a recent and horrifying staffing change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZxGCCQ0NAtraevqULJ84wSSjo0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207933'),
  ('892152848671031801', 'Stonehenge Apocalypse', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Action, TV Movie', 'Paul Ziller, Anthony C. Metchie', 'Brad Abraham, Paul Ziller', 'Misha Collins, Torri Higginson, Peter Wingfield, Hill Harper, David James Lewis, Tina Milo Milivojevic, Michael Kopsa, Brent Stait', null, 'When a group of archaeologists dig up a human skeleton near Stonehenge, an ancient piece of machinery hidden beneath the bedrock is discovered. Not knowing what it could be, the workers accidentally trigger the mechanism and start a chain of events that may very well end the world as we know it', 'When a group of archaeologists dig up a human skeleton near Stonehenge, an ancient piece of machinery hidden beneath the bedrock is discovered. Not knowing what it could be, the workers accidentally trigger the mechanism and start a chain of events that may very well end the world as we know it', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHMeMg2UBu5aNUFVHYeWsKkwurT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39750'),
  ('480214319850825016', 'Stones', 2002, 'Drama', 'Ramón Salazar, David Carretero', 'Ramón Salazar', 'Najwa Nimri, Antonia San Juan, Mónica Cervera, Vicky Peña, Ángela Molina, Lola Dueñas, María Casal, Enrique Alcides', null, 'The stones of the title are the dreams and burdens carried by these five women with interlinked lives. This story of decision and transformation was nominated for the Golden Bear at the Berlin Film Festival.', 'The stones of the title are the dreams and burdens carried by these five women with interlinked lives. This story of decision and transformation was nominated for the Golden Bear at the Berlin Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwp4NfSnguyrRYudveJIvhTjaqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28204'),
  ('497597463236306302', 'Stones for the Rampart', 2014, 'War, Drama, History', 'Paweł Edelman, Robert Gliński, Miłosz Sakowski', 'Dominik Wieczorkowski-Rettinger, Wojciech Pałys', 'Tomasz Ziętek, Marcel Sabat, Kamil Szeptycki, Magdalena Koleśnik, Sandra Staniszewska, Wojciech Zieliński, Andrzej Chyra, Danuta Stenka', null, 'To be defeated and not be - a victory. This is the motto that life is guided by three young friends: Alek, Sophy and Rudy. Scouts, high school graduates high school in Warsaw drifting ambitious plans for the future broken through September 1939. Entering adulthood in a very dramatic times, which puts them a choice - to survive at any cost, or to join the fighting for a free homeland, risking everything. The boys brought up in patriotic homes, shaped by the ideals of scouting, they decide to fight. They become soldiers, and although every scrape with death, they can live a full life.', 'To be defeated and not be - a victory. This is the motto that life is guided by three young friends: Alek, Sophy and Rudy. Scouts, high school graduates high school in Warsaw drifting ambitious plans for the future broken through September 1939. Entering adulthood in a very dramatic times, which puts them a choice - to survive at any cost, or to join the fighting for a free homeland, risking everything. The boys brought up in patriotic homes, shaped by the ideals of scouting, they decide to fight. They become soldiers, and although every scrape with death, they can live a full life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQ06u4MiQx3EIN4T6S3M8CeeRSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283389'),
  ('714874757482718366', 'Stonewall', 1995, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy, History', 'Nigel Finch, Chris Seager, Van Hayden', 'Rikki Beadle Blair', 'Guillermo Díaz, Frederick Weller, Duane Boutte, Bruce MacVittie, Brendan Corbalis, Luis Guzmán, Peter Ratray, King Mustafa Obafemi', 'R', 'A group of gay friends try to live with dignity and self-respect while events build to the opening battle in the major gay rights movement.', 'A group of gay friends try to live with dignity and self-respect while events build to the opening battle in the major gay rights movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCkn7r7V9UFmtuREaKmaoI5OeeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28628'),
  ('897589065655493705', 'Stonewall', 2015, 'Drama, History', 'Roland Emmerich, Jean-François Duplat, Jeanne Leblanc', 'Jon Robin Baitz', 'Jeremy Irvine, Jonny Beauchamp, Joey King, Caleb Landry Jones, Matt Craven, David Cubitt, Vladimir Alexis, Ben Sullivan', 'R', 'Kicked out by his parents, a gay teenager leaves small-town Indiana for New York''s Greenwich Village, where growing discrimination against the gay community leads to riots on June 28, 1969.', 'Kicked out by his parents, a gay teenager leaves small-town Indiana for New York''s Greenwich Village, where growing discrimination against the gay community leads to riots on June 28, 1969.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkUKuPK0dJwP9o47npgLipp83D0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273899'),
  ('278999643174040691', 'Stoopnocracy', 1933, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Budd Hulick, F. Chase Taylor, Harold Nicholas', null, 'An animated short chronicling the adventures of Colonel Stoopnagle and Budd.', 'An animated short chronicling the adventures of Colonel Stoopnagle and Budd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vy2yPsxGzczGT0ciWNNXqTP3ehV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148069'),
  ('771102560704614038', 'Stop and Go', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Gustavo Loza', 'Juan Meyer, Gustavo Loza', 'Germán Valdés III, Luis Arrieta, Cassandra Ciangherotti, Javier Rivera, Jimena Guerra, Ilithya Manzanilla, Ana Karina Sánchez, Regina Orozco', null, 'Perico and Emilio, almost good looking teenagers, enterprising bums and lovers of the seamy side of student life, have the same problem: they have no place to take their girlfriends to give free rein to their baser passions: they can''t go to their homes or those of the girls, and only sluts go to hourly hotels. Faced with this need (and a great deal of pent up testosterone), they decide to become entrepreneurs, thanks to Perico''s father''s old VW van, that, as well as a possible solution for their lust, can also be turned into the business of a lifetime, as Professor Carranco would say: Today, whoever finds a niche in the market can become a millionaire.', 'Perico and Emilio, almost good looking teenagers, enterprising bums and lovers of the seamy side of student life, have the same problem: they have no place to take their girlfriends to give free rein to their baser passions: they can''t go to their homes or those of the girls, and only sluts go to hourly hotels. Faced with this need (and a great deal of pent up testosterone), they decide to become entrepreneurs, thanks to Perico''s father''s old VW van, that, as well as a possible solution for their lust, can also be turned into the business of a lifetime, as Professor Carranco would say: Today, whoever finds a niche in the market can become a millionaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5epJhZG1Kpw6O3BgRpBUdNFonvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38825'),
  ('335165921619434734', 'Stop at Nothing: The Lance Armstrong Story', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Alex Holmes', null, 'Lance Armstrong, Betsy Andreu, Frankie Andreu, Greg LeMond', 'PG-13', 'A portrait of the man behind the greatest fraud in sporting history. Lance Armstrong enriched himself by cheating his fans, his sport and the truth. But the former friends whose lives and careers he destroyed would finally bring him down.', 'A portrait of the man behind the greatest fraud in sporting history. Lance Armstrong enriched himself by cheating his fans, his sport and the truth. But the former friends whose lives and careers he destroyed would finally bring him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbkj11kIhZAApsfQ0hEQSqsP20Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273997'),
  ('547851316854488853', 'Stop Making Sense', 1984, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jonathan Demme, Jordan Cronenweth, Michael Looney', 'Jonathan Demme', 'David Byrne, Chris Frantz, Jerry Harrison, Tina Weymouth, Ednah Holt, Lynn Mabry, Steven Scales, Alex Weir', 'PG', 'A concert film documenting Talking Heads at the height of their popularity, on tour for their 1983 album "Speaking in Tongues." The band takes the stage one by one and is joined by a cadre of guest musicians for a career-spanning and cinematic performance that features creative choreography and visuals.', 'A concert film documenting Talking Heads at the height of their popularity, on tour for their 1983 album "Speaking in Tongues." The band takes the stage one by one and is joined by a cadre of guest musicians for a career-spanning and cinematic performance that features creative choreography and visuals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utNpurUe1MMjEaHqvpkfxgfpSnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24128'),
  ('776846735137884338', 'Stop Me Here', 2016, 'Drama', 'Alain Marcoen, Gilles Bannier', 'Gilles Bannier, Nathalie Hertzberg', 'Reda Kateb, Léa Drucker, Gilles Cohen, Erika Sainte, Julia Piaton, Stéphanie Murat', null, 'Samson Cazalet, Taxi driver in his thirties, picks up a client at the airport. The same evening, the daughter of the woman disappears and the overwhelming evidence points to Samson. How can he prove his innocence when he is the ideal suspect?', 'Samson Cazalet, Taxi driver in his thirties, picks up a client at the airport. The same evening, the daughter of the woman disappears and the overwhelming evidence points to Samson. How can he prove his innocence when he is the ideal suspect?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47CQDowRIXbXzY5wIH9DtStlRt6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375487'),
  ('989728937601620', 'Stop Playing with the Stars', 2020, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Matteo Oleotto', 'Daniele Di Biasio, Michele Pellegrini', 'Alessandro Roja, Pilar Fogliati, Carlotta Natoli, Emanuela Grimalda, Fiorenza Pieri, Adriano Pantaleo, Maurizio Fanin, Ariella Reggio', null, 'Love happens when a romantic obsessed with astrology pretends to be going steady with a rational scientist, hoping that the parents will think everything is OK.', 'Love happens when a romantic obsessed with astrology pretends to be going steady with a rational scientist, hoping that the parents will think everything is OK.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCJdlSWBGgZcGwT8uVX6cdcxdL4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670338'),
