  ('800875551379968284', 'Storage 24', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Johannes Roberts, Tim Sidell', 'Davie Fairbanks, Noel Clarke, Marc Small', 'Noel Clarke, Colin O''Donoghue, Antonia Campbell-Hughes, Ned Dennehy, Laura Haddock, Jamie Thomas King, Alex Price, Geoff Bell', 'R', 'Something nasty is lurking inside a secure storage unit. When a group of people get trapped inside, they need to find a way to get out of a building that''s designed to keep things in...', 'Something nasty is lurking inside a secure storage unit. When a group of people get trapped inside, they need to find a way to get out of a building that''s designed to keep things in...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8o059PGrYLl28RM3TzHoY955SSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114958'),
  ('806200664259733681', 'Storia di Nilde', 2019, null, 'Federico Annicchiarico, Emanuele Imbucci', 'Salvatore De Mola, Emanuele Imbucci, Marco Dell''Omo', 'Anna Foglietta, Vincenzo Amato, Linda Caridi, Pietro Ragusa, Francesco Colella, Astrid Meloni', null, 'The story of Nilde Lotti who fought with the partisan resistance during World War II and subsequently, as a member of Italy''s Communist Party, became the first female president of the lower house of parliament in 1979.', 'The story of Nilde Lotti who fought with the partisan resistance during World War II and subsequently, as a member of Italy''s Communist Party, became the first female president of the lower house of parliament in 1979.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lF2BIXWqaEAfFBeydoNvV0Qzd0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651807'),
