  ('1095182973113435018', 'Stories from the Kronen', 1995, 'Drama', 'Montxo Armendáriz, Alfredo Mayo, Ricardo Walker', 'Montxo Armendáriz', 'Juan Diego Botto, Jordi Mollà, Eduardo Noriega, Aitor Merino, Armando del Río, Diana Gálvez, Iñaki Méndez, Mercedes Sampietro', 'NR', 'Carlos is a young student, just 21. Nice or annoying as he likes, enjoys provoking and transgreding. In the night he goes out to meet his friends in the Kronen, a bar. Every situation can be taken a little farther. There are no limits, no accepted barriers. And more each time, each adventure is chained to the next, as if it were a continuous night. A long description of people: grandfather, parents, sister, girlfriend, friends. And, among that, the obscure will of living every minute as if it were the last one. But something which happens puts Carlos and his friend against a reality they have been trying to ignore.', 'Carlos is a young student, just 21. Nice or annoying as he likes, enjoys provoking and transgreding. In the night he goes out to meet his friends in the Kronen, a bar. Every situation can be taken a little farther. There are no limits, no accepted barriers. And more each time, each adventure is chained to the next, as if it were a continuous night. A long description of people: grandfather, parents, sister, girlfriend, friends. And, among that, the obscure will of living every minute as if it were the last one. But something which happens puts Carlos and his friend against a reality they have been trying to ignore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vulTVwoMoy1IE1IRJhihHYQ6H2H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98600'),
  ('336322470161183071', 'Stories Not to be Told', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Andreu Rebés, Cesc Gay, Eva Taboada', 'Cesc Gay, Tomàs Aragay', 'Anna Castillo, Chino Darín, Javier Rey, Àlex Brendemühl, Antonio de la Torre, María León, Eva Reyes, Alexandra Jiménez', null, 'Five tales of human vulnerability and the hilarious, painful, and awkward curveballs life throws us.', 'Five tales of human vulnerability and the hilarious, painful, and awkward curveballs life throws us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjkxgOovtGpt0lTgHkQ9ImWS6td.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801860'),
  ('930202166086401436', 'Stories of Love That Cannot Belong to This World', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Francesca Comencini, Valerio Azzali', 'Laura Paolucci, Francesca Comencini, Francesca Manieri', 'Lucia Mascino, Thomas Trabacchi, Valentina Bellè, Iaia Forte, Carlotta Natoli, Camilla Semino Favro, Simonetta Solder, Giulia Ricciardi', null, 'Claudia and Flavio were once passionately in love, but all of that is over. Now, in their fifties, they must venture anew into the world of love and dating once more but for Claudia confronting the end and accepting a new beginning isn’t so easy. Claudia is unwilling to let go and forget the life she’s built with Flavio, while Flavio, eager to move on, soon finds himself in a relationship with a much younger woman. Claudia soon reconnects with Nina, a student from her days as a professor.', 'Claudia and Flavio were once passionately in love, but all of that is over. Now, in their fifties, they must venture anew into the world of love and dating once more but for Claudia confronting the end and accepting a new beginning isn’t so easy. Claudia is unwilling to let go and forget the life she’s built with Flavio, while Flavio, eager to move on, soon finds himself in a relationship with a much younger woman. Claudia soon reconnects with Nina, a student from her days as a professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xr34IqVwtRJ5Fdw3oovY7X4RwhD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467412'),
  ('922476124256233285', 'Stories of Samba', 2024, 'Drama', 'Pedro Serrano, Lito Mendes da Rocha, Elis de Seta', 'Pedro Serrano, Rubens Marinelli, Guilherme Moraes Quintella', 'Paulo Miklos, Gero Camilo, Gustavo Machado, Leilah Moreno, Sidney Santiago, Paulo Tiefenthaler, Carlos Gimenez, Izak Dahora', null, 'At a bar table, old samba singer and composer Adoniran Barbosa tells a young waiter stories about a São Paulo that no longer exists. He fondly remembers the maloca where he lived with Joca and Mato Grosso, their passion for Iracema and other characters eternalized in his sambas, chronicles of a metropolis swallowed up by the voracious appetite of progress.', 'At a bar table, old samba singer and composer Adoniran Barbosa tells a young waiter stories about a São Paulo that no longer exists. He fondly remembers the maloca where he lived with Joca and Mato Grosso, their passion for Iracema and other characters eternalized in his sambas, chronicles of a metropolis swallowed up by the voracious appetite of progress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSVc6JY8DHKphcYhS3dJwMK1NPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1187762'),
  ('175044888641176833', 'Stories Our Cinema Did (Not) Tell', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Fernanda Pessoa', null, 'Jece Valadão, Fernando Torres, José Lewgoy, Nuno Leal Maia, Sandra Bréa, Maria Zilda Bethlem, Mário Lago, Rubens de Falco', null, 'Filled with raunchy laughs, this documentary compiles outrageous scenes from sex-comedies that shaped Brazil''s "pornochanchada" boom of the 1970s.', 'Filled with raunchy laughs, this documentary compiles outrageous scenes from sex-comedies that shaped Brazil''s "pornochanchada" boom of the 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNp27hnq6cYTl6r8vkem0dIBYWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445402'),
