  ('366906699974775213', 'Stories We Tell', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Sarah Polley, Iris Ng, David Forsyth', 'Sarah Polley', 'Michael Polley, Harry Gulkin, Susy Buchan, John Buchan, Mark Polley, Joanna Polley, Cathy Gulkin, Marie Murphy', 'PG-13', 'Canadian actress and filmmaker Sarah Polley investigates certain secrets related to her mother, interviewing a group of family members and friends whose reliability varies depending of their implication in the events, which are remembered in different ways; so a trail of questions remains to be answered, because memory is always changing and the discovery of truth often depends on who is telling the tale.', 'Canadian actress and filmmaker Sarah Polley investigates certain secrets related to her mother, interviewing a group of family members and friends whose reliability varies depending of their implication in the events, which are remembered in different ways; so a trail of questions remains to be answered, because memory is always changing and the discovery of truth often depends on who is telling the tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVDtDW3qP0je1Cy87GDfijG9W4c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128216'),
  ('582279922766711395', 'Stork Day', 2004, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Giulio Manfredonia, Fabio Simonelli, Roberto Forza', 'Harold Ramis, Danny Rubin', 'Antonio Albanese, Goya Toledo, Fabio De Luigi, Asunción Balaguer, Beatriz Rico, Pepón Nieto, Esther Ortega', null, 'Filippo is a star on the Italian TV. He works for a documentary series about wild animals and nature. He is sent to Tenerife (Spain) to shot an issue about the local stork. It is the 13th of August. After he did his job is time to leave, but the ferry couldn''t operate. He has to spend the night in the island. The day after is again the 13th of August, and Filippo live again the same day for different times. Something has to change to exit the paranoid and unrealistic situation.', 'Filippo is a star on the Italian TV. He works for a documentary series about wild animals and nature. He is sent to Tenerife (Spain) to shot an issue about the local stork. It is the 13th of August. After he did his job is time to leave, but the ferry couldn''t operate. He has to spend the night in the island. The day after is again the 13th of August, and Filippo live again the same day for different times. Something has to change to exit the paranoid and unrealistic situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLzoub8a2mFAMoHiXIlmms6YpRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54427'),
  ('465278320339814386', 'Stork Naked', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Milt Franklyn', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A drunken stork comes to the home of Mr. and Mrs. Daffy Duck with a bundle of joy, but Daffy wants no part of the delivery and takes extreme measures to keep the stork away.', 'A drunken stork comes to the home of Mr. and Mrs. Daffy Duck with a bundle of joy, but Daffy wants no part of the delivery and takes extreme measures to keep the stork away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwFr3cyoZfLM6N4NgchJ2SQr0wF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235165'),
  ('986095207620357847', 'Storks', 2016, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Doug Sweetland, Nicholas Stoller', 'Nicholas Stoller', 'Andy Samberg, Katie Crown, Kelsey Grammer, Jennifer Aniston, Ty Burrell, Anton Starkman, Keegan-Michael Key, Jordan Peele', 'PG', 'Storks deliver babies…or at least they used to. Now they deliver packages for a global internet retail giant. Junior, the company’s top delivery stork, is about to be promoted when he accidentally activates the Baby Making Machine, producing an adorable and wholly unauthorized baby girl...', 'Storks deliver babies…or at least they used to. Now they deliver packages for a global internet retail giant. Junior, the company’s top delivery stork, is about to be promoted when he accidentally activates the Baby Making Machine, producing an adorable and wholly unauthorized baby girl...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwGolX8JmGJhhcUjO5SJt38Uk0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332210'),
  ('1022251248437955154', 'Storm', 1999, 'Thriller', 'Harris Done, Ben Kufrin, Andrew Hofman', 'Diane Fine, Patrick Phillips, Phillip J. Roth', 'Luke Perry, Martin Sheen, Robert Knott, David Moses, Alexandra Powers, Kathleen Randazzo, Marc McClure, J.P. Hubbell', 'PG', 'A top secret government study involving the manipulation of the weather goes awry, leaving L.A. in the path of a destructive hurricane. A meteorologist sets out to save the city.', 'A top secret government study involving the manipulation of the weather goes awry, leaving L.A. in the path of a destructive hurricane. A meteorologist sets out to save the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNryXEIq7BbVmDPi9OpGFcqLRHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44661'),
  ('951819961604210057', 'Storm', 2005, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Måns Mårlind, Björn Stein, Linus Sandgren', 'Måns Mårlind', 'Eric Ericson, Eva Röse, Jonas Karlsson, Lina Englund, Peter Engman, Kalle Norrhäll, Jacqueline Ramel, Matias Varela', null, 'DD is a smug fellow, almost 30 years of age, who can manage all by himself. At least that''s what he thinks. However, a strange woman - Lova - enters his life, hunted by evil men who want to hurt her. Against his will, DD is forced into a series of horrific events.', 'DD is a smug fellow, almost 30 years of age, who can manage all by himself. At least that''s what he thinks. However, a strange woman - Lova - enters his life, hunted by evil men who want to hurt her. Against his will, DD is forced into a series of horrific events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHoTQa6CToMsnPYP2Uy6K1B6H1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46222'),
  ('284322429341356001', 'Storm', 2009, 'Drama', 'Hans-Christian Schmid, Bogumił Godfrejów', 'Hans-Christian Schmid, Bernd Lange', 'Kerry Fox, Anamaria Marinca, Stephen Dillane, Rolf Lassgård, Alexander Fehling, Tarik Filipović, Krešimir Mikić, Steven Scharf', null, 'Hannah Maynard, a prosecutor of Hague''s Tribunal for war crimes in former Yugoslavia, charges a Serbian commander for killing Bosniaks. However, her main witness might be lying, so the court sends a team to Bosnia to investigate.', 'Hannah Maynard, a prosecutor of Hague''s Tribunal for war crimes in former Yugoslavia, charges a Serbian commander for killing Bosniaks. However, her main witness might be lying, so the court sends a team to Bosnia to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGGBjA2ILqs91EDI2yvqA8kbWTJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35619'),
  ('311275744233957765', 'Storm Boy', 1977, 'Drama, Family', 'Henri Safran, Geoff Burton', 'Sonia Borg, Sidney L. Stebel', 'Greg Rowe, Peter Cummins, David Gulpilil, Judy Dick, Tony Allison, Michael Moody, Graham Dow, Frank Foster-Brown', null, 'Mike is a lonely Australian boy living in a coastal wilderness with his reclusive father. In search of friendship he encounters an Aboriginal native loner and the two form a bond in the care of orphaned pelicans.', 'Mike is a lonely Australian boy living in a coastal wilderness with his reclusive father. In search of friendship he encounters an Aboriginal native loner and the two form a bond in the care of orphaned pelicans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nXbLb1Hw92bATJfDLpu4iH9zqJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14302'),
  ('20369126388245310', 'Storm Boy', 2019, 'Drama, Adventure, Family', 'Rick Rifici, Chris Webb, Joshua Watkins', 'Justin Monjo', 'Geoffrey Rush, Jai Courtney, Erik Thomson, Morgan Davies, Finn Little, Simone Annan, Trevor Jamieson, David John Clark', 'PG', 'Storm Boy lives a lonely life with his reclusive father on a desolate coastline, but when he forms a close bond with a pelican, Mr. Percival, his life takes a new and unexpected turn.', 'Storm Boy lives a lonely life with his reclusive father on a desolate coastline, but when he forms a close bond with a pelican, Mr. Percival, his life takes a new and unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geQ8xR84vmv44NuYgjmhvHF5HNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505953'),
  ('969412128990754984', 'Storm Catcher', 1999, 'Action, Thriller', 'Anthony Hickox, David Bridges, Greg Webb', 'Bill Gucwa, Ed Masterson', 'Dolph Lundgren, Mystro Clark, Jon Pennell, Robert Miano, Yvonne Zima, Kylie Bax, Jody Jones, Robert Glen Keith', 'R', 'A renegade general plots to bomb Washington using a new top secret jet called the Storm Catcher. The only trouble is only one man is capable of flying it. So they seek to put him on the run in a conspiracy that makes him appear to have murdered several men and stolen the plane. Then try to murder his wife and take his daughter prisoner. Threatening to kill his daughter if he doesn''t help, he appears trapped. However, his best friend who is the plane''s computer specialist has a few tricks up his sleeve.', 'A renegade general plots to bomb Washington using a new top secret jet called the Storm Catcher. The only trouble is only one man is capable of flying it. So they seek to put him on the run in a conspiracy that makes him appear to have murdered several men and stolen the plane. Then try to murder his wife and take his daughter prisoner. Threatening to kill his daughter if he doesn''t help, he appears trapped. However, his best friend who is the plane''s computer specialist has a few tricks up his sleeve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nl7TMlYPSDGhWga4j6ru8RvKF7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26129'),
  ('201474392180579014', 'Storm Cell', 2008, 'Action, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Steven R. Monroe, C. Kim Miles, Matthias Mellinghaus', 'Graham Ludlow', 'Mimi Rogers, Robert Moloney, Andrew Airlie, Ryan Kennedy, Elyse Levesque, Michael Ironside, Kristy Dawn Dinsmore, Ryan Grantham', 'PG-13', 'A brother and sister are torn apart when their parents die tragically in a tornado. While he moves to Seattle to be away from the memory, she devotes her life to studying storms and weather patterns. When she discovers the threat of a powerful series of tornadoes are heading for Seattle, she must convince her brother and the entire city that she is not crazy; and they are in grave danger', 'A brother and sister are torn apart when their parents die tragically in a tornado. While he moves to Seattle to be away from the memory, she devotes her life to studying storms and weather patterns. When she discovers the threat of a powerful series of tornadoes are heading for Seattle, she must convince her brother and the entire city that she is not crazy; and they are in grave danger', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdfKZzMVyV07kyU30hQbDspsHKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16200'),
  ('253062090887514393', 'Storm Center', 1956, 'Drama', 'Burnett Guffey, Daniel Taradash, Carter DeHaven Jr.', 'Elick Moll, Daniel Taradash', 'Bette Davis, Brian Keith, Kim Hunter, Paul Kelly, Joe Mantell, Kevin Coughlin, Sally Brophy, Curtis Cooksey', null, 'Politicians go after a small-town librarian when she refuses to ban a book. She''s quickly labeled a Communist.', 'Politicians go after a small-town librarian when she refuses to ban a book. She''s quickly labeled a Communist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1roPYFlTDXucRbzwfJ7q7HsWHHf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45239'),
  ('1119901236983925580', 'Storm Chasers: Revenge of the Twister', 1998, 'Action', 'Mark Sobel, Miklós Lente, Nancy Sorge', 'Jeffrey Wynne', 'Kelly McGillis, Wolf Larson, Liz Torres, Adrian Zmed, James MacArthur, David Millbern, Martin Evans, Rick Ravanello', null, 'Jamie Marshall is a "storm chaser" who, having lost her husband in a crash after his plane was struck by lightning, recklessly throws herself into her work. Sent by her boss to Colorado to investigate the cause of a devastating tornado, she meets Will Stanton, Field Coordinator for FEMA. One night, while working closely together examining the wreckage of the recent storm, Jamie and Will experience a once-in-a-lifetime phenomenon - a ball of lightning falling from the sky connecting with the ground all around them. As Will tries to shield Jamie from the lightning, the two embrace and find themselves in a passionate kiss. The next day Jamie and Will return to the location. What they discover is a facility where waste from scientific experimentation is affecting the atmosphere causing the tornadoes. Armed with the new information and seven new tornadoes on the horizon, Jamie and Will prepare the already tornado ravaged town for another possible disaster!', 'Jamie Marshall is a "storm chaser" who, having lost her husband in a crash after his plane was struck by lightning, recklessly throws herself into her work. Sent by her boss to Colorado to investigate the cause of a devastating tornado, she meets Will Stanton, Field Coordinator for FEMA. One night, while working closely together examining the wreckage of the recent storm, Jamie and Will experience a once-in-a-lifetime phenomenon - a ball of lightning falling from the sky connecting with the ground all around them. As Will tries to shield Jamie from the lightning, the two embrace and find themselves in a passionate kiss. The next day Jamie and Will return to the location. What they discover is a facility where waste from scientific experimentation is affecting the atmosphere causing the tornadoes. Armed with the new information and seven new tornadoes on the horizon, Jamie and Will prepare the already tornado ravaged town for another possible disaster!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgFNzKouGjxwPjbLiPE7UONYnOy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80542'),
  ('593232317704826400', 'Storm Fear', 1955, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Cornel Wilde, Joseph LaShelle', 'Horton Foote', 'Cornel Wilde, Jean Wallace, Dan Duryea, Lee Grant, David Stollery, Dennis Weaver, Steven Hill', 'NR', 'A wounded bank robber takes over his brother''s home.', 'A wounded bank robber takes over his brother''s home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NyojUKHvOqkmpSjWJOQyWRdOc3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75637'),
  ('549951927494503230', 'Storm in a Teacup', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ian Dalrymple, Victor Saville, Muir Mathieson', 'James Bridie, Ian Dalrymple, Donald Bull', 'Vivien Leigh, Rex Harrison, Cecil Parker, Sara Allgood, Ursula Jeans, Gus McNaughton, Edgar K. Bruce, Robert Hale', null, 'A local politician in Scotland tries to break the reporter who wrote a negative story about him, and who is also in love with his daughter.', 'A local politician in Scotland tries to break the reporter who wrote a negative story about him, and who is also in love with his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YmBGnY5v6PZYCYjXjvv4qKDQhH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57662'),
  ('210431214504644175', 'Storm Over Asia', 1928, 'Drama, War, History', 'Vsevolod Pudovkin, Anatoli Golovnya', 'Osip Brik, I. Novokshenov', 'Valéry Inkijinoff, I. Dedintsev, Aleksandr Chistyakov, Anel Sudakevich, Boris Barnet, Karl Gurnyak, Vladimir Tsoppi, L. Belinskaïa', null, 'In 1918 a young and simple Mongol herdsman and trapper is cheated out of a valuable fox fur by a European capitalist fur trader. Ostracized from the trading post, he escapes to the hills after brawling with the trader who cheated him. In 1920 he becomes a Soviet partisan, and helps the partisans fight for the Soviets against the occupying British army. However he is captured by the British when they try to requisition cattle from the herdsmen at the same time as the commandant meets with a reincarnated Grand Lama. After the trapper is shot, the army discovers an amulet that suggests he is a direct descendant of Genghis Khan. They find him still alive, so the army restores his health and plans to use him as the head of a puppet regime. The trapper is thus thrust into prominence as he is placed in charge of the puppet government. By the end, however, the "puppet" turns against his masters in an outburst of fury.', 'In 1918 a young and simple Mongol herdsman and trapper is cheated out of a valuable fox fur by a European capitalist fur trader. Ostracized from the trading post, he escapes to the hills after brawling with the trader who cheated him. In 1920 he becomes a Soviet partisan, and helps the partisans fight for the Soviets against the occupying British army. However he is captured by the British when they try to requisition cattle from the herdsmen at the same time as the commandant meets with a reincarnated Grand Lama. After the trapper is shot, the army discovers an amulet that suggests he is a direct descendant of Genghis Khan. They find him still alive, so the army restores his health and plans to use him as the head of a puppet regime. The trapper is thus thrust into prominence as he is placed in charge of the puppet government. By the end, however, the "puppet" turns against his masters in an outburst of fury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymzADiDk85KsI683tI21A4oaWT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84273'),
  ('244134382528561315', 'Storm Rider: Legend of Hammerhead', 2026, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'Zoran Lisinac, Domagoj Mazuran', 'Zoran Lisinac, Domagoj Mazuran', 'Marco Ilsø, Billy Barratt, Gilles Geary, Sarah-Sofie Boussnina, Ivana Dudić, Goran Bogdan, Neb Chupin, Caroline Goodall', null, 'Centuries after the Great Flood, riders compete in death races on the water to secure shelter for their people behind the walls of Argos. Rebellious storm riders Neb and Ana look to uncover hidden truths by breaking through the storm.', 'Centuries after the Great Flood, riders compete in death races on the water to secure shelter for their people behind the walls of Argos. Rebellious storm riders Neb and Ana look to uncover hidden truths by breaking through the storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9JjrKhJRmL0PNpnCmMidf9JAt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874860'),
  ('816380399586959128', 'Storm Trooper', 1998, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Jim Wynorski, J.E. Bash', 'T.L. Lankford', 'Carol Alt, John Laughlin, Corey Feldman, Zach Galligan, Melissa Brasselle, Ross Hagen, Kool Moe Dee, John Terlesky', null, 'Shortly after murdering her abusive husband, a woman (Carol Alt) takes an injured stranger into her home. She soon discovers the stranger is a cyborg. He then persuades her to help him flee from a mysterious gang of armed men who soon …', 'Shortly after murdering her abusive husband, a woman (Carol Alt) takes an injured stranger into her home. She soon discovers the stranger is a cyborg. He then persuades her to help him flee from a mysterious gang of armed men who soon …', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pqg1zuX2gGT5QRLnRBWEmXDTFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149544'),
  ('128946174861401026', 'Storm Warning', 1951, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Stuart Heisler, Carl E. Guthrie, Ray Heindorf', 'Daniel Fuchs, Richard Brooks', 'Ginger Rogers, Ronald Reagan, Doris Day, Steve Cochran, Hugh Sanders, Lloyd Gough, Raymond Greenleaf, Ned Glass', null, 'A fashion model witnesses the brutal assassination of an investigative journalist by the Ku Klux Klan while traveling to a small town to visit her sister.', 'A fashion model witnesses the brutal assassination of an investigative journalist by the Ku Klux Klan while traveling to a small town to visit her sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLQFeibR5q1OKaBGdyYaCssJoWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35009'),
  ('537132552889535502', 'Storm Warning', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jamie Blanks, Karl von Moller, Colin Bell', 'Everett De Roche', 'Nadia Farès, Robert Taylor, John Brumpton, David Lyons, Mathew Wilkinson', 'R', 'A couple becomes lost in a massive storm and seek refuge at a nearby farmhouse, only to be captured by deranged killers.', 'A couple becomes lost in a massive storm and seek refuge at a nearby farmhouse, only to be captured by deranged killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a52a97dlHjYWnNTzeJJohlPOSLG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14459'),
  ('928883598715017604', 'Storm Warning', 2020, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Philippe Pavans de Ceccatty, Bruno Garcia', 'Fabienne Lesieur, Victor Pavy', 'Blandine Bellavoir, Lannick Gautry, Antoine Duléry, Stéphane Debac, Jeanne Bournaud, Valérie Mairesse, Julien Gaspar-Oliveri, Bernard Mazzinghi', null, 'As an unforgettable storm lashes the Breton town of Perros-Guirec, a ten-year-old boy goes missing.', 'As an unforgettable storm lashes the Breton town of Perros-Guirec, a ten-year-old boy goes missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cx88KraMR5ly4qqfxuxe3fpV2R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741132'),
  ('153717674864518069', 'Storm: Letter of Fire', 2017, 'Adventure, Family, History', 'Dennis Bots, Rolf Dekens', 'Karen van Holst Pellekaan', 'Davy Gomez, Yorick van Wageningen, Angela Schijf, Juna de Leeuw, Peter van den Begin, Maarten Heijmans, Egbert Jan Weeber, Tibo Vandenborre', null, 'The film is set in 1521 Antwerp, in a Europe ravaged by religious wars, and during the early years of the Reformation. It tells the story of the twelve year old, Falko Voeten – a printer’s son. When Falko’s father, Klaas Voeten, a printer of forbidden literature, is caught by the Inquisition for printing a letter written by Maarten Luther; Falko is unwittingly propelled into helping his father and into searching for the letter. Threatened by the Inquisition but aided by Marieke, a Catholic orphan girl from the underground sewers, Falko is faced with a race against time if he is to save his father from being executed for heresy.', 'The film is set in 1521 Antwerp, in a Europe ravaged by religious wars, and during the early years of the Reformation. It tells the story of the twelve year old, Falko Voeten – a printer’s son. When Falko’s father, Klaas Voeten, a printer of forbidden literature, is caught by the Inquisition for printing a letter written by Maarten Luther; Falko is unwittingly propelled into helping his father and into searching for the letter. Threatened by the Inquisition but aided by Marieke, a Catholic orphan girl from the underground sewers, Falko is faced with a race against time if he is to save his father from being executed for heresy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GHXZJdVnSA8JEmGuUe9hFgN3nH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378423'),
  ('312178714120153936', 'Stormageddon', 2015, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Nick Lyon, Paul Ruddy, Glenn Miller', 'Neil Elman', 'John Hennigan, Eve Mauro, Joseph Gatt, Robert Blanche, Ricco Ross, David Shatraw, Adrian Paul, David Preston', null, 'What happens when you ask the most powerful computer program, run by the most powerful computers, to follow, listen and predict human behavior? The program learns, becomes sentient and begins to behave like a human. When a master computer program, Echelon, takes over America''s entire online system, our country is threatened to be brought to its knees. Hacking into DARPA, Echelon gains the ability to manipulate the weather, create earthquakes, and cause a level of destruction unlike anything the country could ever imagine. But how do you stop a computer program when it has control over any and every defense you have?', 'What happens when you ask the most powerful computer program, run by the most powerful computers, to follow, listen and predict human behavior? The program learns, becomes sentient and begins to behave like a human. When a master computer program, Echelon, takes over America''s entire online system, our country is threatened to be brought to its knees. Hacking into DARPA, Echelon gains the ability to manipulate the weather, create earthquakes, and cause a level of destruction unlike anything the country could ever imagine. But how do you stop a computer program when it has control over any and every defense you have?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loZHFn4RoTeh4t1I4hS01DRYF7q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370097'),
  ('416450545560810851', 'Stormbreaker', 2006, 'Adventure, Action, Family', 'Geoffrey Sax, Chris Seager, Donnie Yen', 'Anthony Horowitz', 'Alex Pettyfer, Sarah Bolger, Ewan McGregor, Robbie Coltrane, Stephen Fry, Damian Lewis, Bill Nighy, Sophie Okonedo', 'PG', 'Alex Rider thinks he is a normal school boy, until his uncle is killed. He discovers that his uncle was actually spy on a mission, when he was killed. Alex is recruited by Alan Blunt to continue the mission. He is sent to Cornwall to investigate a new computer system, which Darrius Sayle has created. He plans to give the new computer systems to every school in the country, but Mr. Blunt has other ideas and Alex must find out what it is.', 'Alex Rider thinks he is a normal school boy, until his uncle is killed. He discovers that his uncle was actually spy on a mission, when he was killed. Alex is recruited by Alan Blunt to continue the mission. He is sent to Cornwall to investigate a new computer system, which Darrius Sayle has created. He plans to give the new computer systems to every school in the country, but Mr. Blunt has other ideas and Alex must find out what it is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uYi3be7gwoPMoIAi76vSd4Ci1i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9978'),
  ('115285559151563699', 'Storming Attacks', 1978, 'Action', 'Shao-Kuan Wen, Fan Shou Fu, Yang Chuan', 'Shao-Kuan Wen', 'Ho Tsung-Tao, Dana, Mark Cheung Lui, John Cheung Ng-Long, Han Ying-Chieh, Bolo Yeung, Luk Chu-Sek, Hon Yee-Sang', 'R', 'A band of counterfeiters wants to make Hong Kong their new territory. The disgraced leader of the Special Squad will have to team-up with a group of Hong Kong police officers in an attempt to stop the dirty business of crime lord Han Tin Lung, but Han''s problem is not only the interference of the Police force, but his Japanese ally Kimura is not happy with his ''cut'' in the counterfeit deal and will try to put Donna (a relative of Han) on his side to make Han''s business his own property. Both policemen and criminals are highly trained Martial Arts fighters and they will have the chance to prove who has the best Kung Fu techniques.', 'A band of counterfeiters wants to make Hong Kong their new territory. The disgraced leader of the Special Squad will have to team-up with a group of Hong Kong police officers in an attempt to stop the dirty business of crime lord Han Tin Lung, but Han''s problem is not only the interference of the Police force, but his Japanese ally Kimura is not happy with his ''cut'' in the counterfeit deal and will try to put Donna (a relative of Han) on his side to make Han''s business his own property. Both policemen and criminals are highly trained Martial Arts fighters and they will have the chance to prove who has the best Kung Fu techniques.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mizspggdLsnPSQKPysh34Vd1SZR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54859'),
  ('369142286526340983', 'Stormskerry Maja', 2024, 'Drama', 'Tiina Lymi, Rauno Ronkainen, Joona Mielonen', 'Tiina Lymi', 'Amanda Jansson, Linus Troedsson, Amanda Kilpeläinen Arvidsson, Jonna Järnefelt, Tobias Zilliacus, Desmond Eastwood, Tony Doyle, Carl-Kristian Rundman', null, 'Maja and Janne move to the barren and remote island of Stormskerry, where survival is a daily struggle. Growing up in a world of old values, Maja becomes aware of a new era: a woman can be an equal partner instead of a mere bystander. The couple have children, and life is good until trouble sets in: war arrives on the island, Janne is forced to flee from the English troops, and Maja and the children are imprisoned. The family also faces many financial difficulties and death. Years pass, but Maja remains strong and stays in Stormskerry despite all the hardships and difficulties.', 'Maja and Janne move to the barren and remote island of Stormskerry, where survival is a daily struggle. Growing up in a world of old values, Maja becomes aware of a new era: a woman can be an equal partner instead of a mere bystander. The couple have children, and life is good until trouble sets in: war arrives on the island, Janne is forced to flee from the English troops, and Maja and the children are imprisoned. The family also faces many financial difficulties and death. Years pass, but Maja remains strong and stays in Stormskerry despite all the hardships and difficulties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oTBiJzGz0J5LrLNSk9SLQzmPaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028769'),
  ('157493585202418722', 'Stormtroopers', 1976, 'Comedy, War', 'Salvatore Samperi', 'Renato Pozzetto, Cochi Ponzoni, Maria Pia Fusco', 'Renato Pozzetto, Lino Toffolo, Cochi Ponzoni, Teo Teocoli, Felice Andreasi, Massimo Boldi, Licinia Lentini, Umberto Smaila', null, 'A handful of recruits prepares for a war that nobody knows about the purpose or the motive. The field commander is a general who plays with a Marx puppet and lives in a luxurious palace that looks like a cabin from the outside. His orderlies are a captain who lives in Arabic dress in a curtain and a sergeant in training who does not shine for intelligence. Continuing training between various and grotesque accidents until the order arrives for the front. And then?', 'A handful of recruits prepares for a war that nobody knows about the purpose or the motive. The field commander is a general who plays with a Marx puppet and lives in a luxurious palace that looks like a cabin from the outside. His orderlies are a captain who lives in Arabic dress in a curtain and a sergeant in training who does not shine for intelligence. Continuing training between various and grotesque accidents until the order arrives for the front. And then?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBfA2dSY0krpxCRiOx2QkeT4Jid.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167854'),
  ('780555417183694089', 'Stormy', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Sarah Gibson', null, 'Stormy Daniels, Jimmy Kimmel, Rachel Maddow, Demi Delia, Seth Rogen, Michael Avenatti, Donald Trump', 'R', 'Delve into the life and times of Stormy Daniels as she shares her story and account of events that have become part of American history.', 'Delve into the life and times of Stormy Daniels as she shares her story and account of events that have become part of American history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WdElBdccL5RbJOWjUErFolaaqz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1240928'),
  ('678837456119542339', 'Stormy Monday', 1988, 'Thriller', 'Mike Figgis, Roger Deakins, John Watson', 'Mike Figgis', 'Melanie Griffith, Tommy Lee Jones, Sting, Sean Bean, Alison Steadman, Scott Hoxby, Mark Long, James Cosmo', 'R', 'When a corrupt American businessman tries to strong arm his way into businesses in Newcastle, England, he is thwarted by a club attendant and his waitress girlfriend.', 'When a corrupt American businessman tries to strong arm his way into businesses in Newcastle, England, he is thwarted by a club attendant and his waitress girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYrfUdkZmGoB1QtGbYnDR2ZL8XR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25497'),
  ('85271002730916422', 'Stormy Night', 1943, 'Music, Comedy', 'Jean Georgescu, Gérard Perrin', 'Jean Georgescu', 'Stefan Baroi, Radu Beligan, Elena Bulandra, Gheorghe Ciprian, Iancu Constantinescu, George Demetru, Florica Demion, Miluță Gheorghiu', null, 'Bucharest, 1876. Don Dumitrache instructs his trusted man, Chiriac, to watch his young wife, Veta. Dumitrache is sure that Veta having an affair, she does not know is that her lover is Chiriac own...', 'Bucharest, 1876. Don Dumitrache instructs his trusted man, Chiriac, to watch his young wife, Veta. Dumitrache is sure that Veta having an affair, she does not know is that her lover is Chiriac own...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mizQx5Ewl3PcJ2wI3LlWBHwniPq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385924'),
  ('1116746103999507032', 'Stormy Night', 2005, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Gisaburō Sugii', 'Gisaburō Sugii, Yuichi Kimura', 'Shido Nakamura, Hiroki Narimiya, Riki Takeuchi, Koichi Yamadera, Hayashiya Shōzō IX, Eiji Bandō, Tetsuya Yanagihara, Yoshiyuki Hirai', null, 'After hiding together in an abandoned barn one stormy night, wolf Gabu and goat Mei pledge to be secret friends, despite being natural enemies. They must overcome hardship and persecution in hopes of finding another forest where they can be together in peace.', 'After hiding together in an abandoned barn one stormy night, wolf Gabu and goat Mei pledge to be secret friends, despite being natural enemies. They must overcome hardship and persecution in hopes of finding another forest where they can be together in peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YWTD0MZtf0RItKMQpgvuqHuFHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19961'),
  ('5361209417628633', 'Stormy Waters', 1941, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean Grémillon, Armand Thirard, Louis Daquin', 'Jacques Prévert', 'Jean Gabin, Madeleine Renaud, Michèle Morgan, Fernand Ledoux, Nane Germon, Jean Marchat, Jean Dasté, Charles Blavette', 'NR', 'A married tugboat captain falls for a woman he rescues from a sinking ship.', 'A married tugboat captain falls for a woman he rescues from a sinking ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dM9qttcCSS8053iRD8ILd1J5E5F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64897'),
  ('441745328885147175', 'Stormy Weather', 1943, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Andrew L. Stone, Leon Shamroy', 'Frederick J. Jackson, Ted Koehler', 'Lena Horne, Bill Robinson, Cab Calloway, Katherine Dunham, Fats Waller, Fayard Nicholas, Harold Nicholas, Ada Brown', 'NR', 'The relationship between an aspiring dancer and a popular songstress provides a retrospective of the great African-American entertainers of the early 1900s.', 'The relationship between an aspiring dancer and a popular songstress provides a retrospective of the great African-American entertainers of the early 1900s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6XpJ69jXvP5WXzVsKVR4rUJhe1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43513'),
  ('678851554177430281', 'Storstrøm Bridge', 1950, 'Documentary', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer', null, null, 'A wordless ode to the Storstrom bridge.', 'A wordless ode to the Storstrom bridge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kD5IhCbQhG6Shj82H7AEdIf9IGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164998'),
  ('791233401589917392', 'Story of a Cloistered Nun', 1973, 'Drama', 'Massimo Carocci, Domenico Paolella, Armando Nannuzzi', 'Tonino Cervi, Domenico Paolella', 'Catherine Spaak, Suzy Kendall, Eleonora Giorgi, Martine Brochard, Umberto Orsini, Tino Carraro, Konrad Georg, Ann Odessa', null, 'Refusing an arranged marriage, young aristocrat Carmela is sent to a convent. Her arrival intensifies the power struggle between the debauched nun Elizabeth and the stern Mother Superior, as both are smitten by Carmela''s beauty.', 'Refusing an arranged marriage, young aristocrat Carmela is sent to a convent. Her arrival intensifies the power struggle between the debauched nun Elizabeth and the stern Mother Superior, as both are smitten by Carmela''s beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekQWxklatYHdnUOkHE9qhfShRJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106969'),
  ('293526959496290873', 'Story of a Junkie', 1985, 'Drama', 'Lech Kowalski', null, 'John Spacely', 'R', 'Filmed in documentary-style, the film follows the character of Gringo, a young man looking for fortune in New York, only to fall into heroin addiction.', 'Filmed in documentary-style, the film follows the character of Gringo, a young man looking for fortune in New York, only to fall into heroin addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11EOR9BkDbiI9LSzK5mEGgdFIrm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131134'),
  ('738505965404745350', 'Story of a Love Affair', 1950, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Francesco Maselli, Enzo Serafin', 'Silvio Giovaninetti, Piero Tellini, Daniele D''Anza', 'Massimo Girotti, Lucia Bosè, Gino Rossi, Marika Rowsky, Ferdinando Sarmi, Rubi D''Alma, Anita Farra, Carlo Gazzabini', null, 'A wealthy, possessive husband''s investigation reignites his young wife''s past love, leading them to plot against him. As obstacles fall away, their passion faces a new test.', 'A wealthy, possessive husband''s investigation reignites his young wife''s past love, leading them to plot against him. As obstacles fall away, their passion faces a new test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9afrreOCHzCPF0Zft7ptWVbk3xr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49781'),
  ('825048005632260571', 'Story of a Night', 2025, 'Drama', 'Paolo Costella, Fabrizio Lucci', 'Tania Pedroni', 'Anna Foglietta, Giuseppe Battiston, Giulietta Rebeggiani, Biagio Venditti, Massimiliano Caiazzo, Massimo Scola, Thomas Trabacchi, Yle Vianello', null, 'Piero and Elisabetta loved each other very much, despite the opposition of her parents, and had three children with whom they formed a seemingly indissoluble unit. But when the eldest, Flavio, loses his life in an accident, the family falls apart: Elisabetta and Piero glare at each other and exchange ferocious jokes, unable to overcome that tragic event and not blame each other. It is the two remaining children, Dennis and Sara, who convince them to celebrate Christmas together in Cortina d''Ampezzo, the town where their maternal grandparents own a luxurious chalet. The two children have a plan, which will however be abruptly interrupted by an unexpected event. All the family dynamics will be called into question, and will keep everyone in suspense for a long night of waiting and reflections on the past.', 'Piero and Elisabetta loved each other very much, despite the opposition of her parents, and had three children with whom they formed a seemingly indissoluble unit. But when the eldest, Flavio, loses his life in an accident, the family falls apart: Elisabetta and Piero glare at each other and exchange ferocious jokes, unable to overcome that tragic event and not blame each other. It is the two remaining children, Dennis and Sara, who convince them to celebrate Christmas together in Cortina d''Ampezzo, the town where their maternal grandparents own a luxurious chalet. The two children have a plan, which will however be abruptly interrupted by an unexpected event. All the family dynamics will be called into question, and will keep everyone in suspense for a long night of waiting and reflections on the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWVR1C3zczfxBfdMCvbizTxsGQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1224453'),
  ('324727283511352210', 'Story of a Prostitute', 1965, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Seijun Suzuki, Kazue Nagatsuka, Masami Kuzū', 'Hajime Takaiwa', 'Tamio Kawachi, Yumiko Nogawa, Isao Tamagawa, Shoichi Ozawa, Toshio Sugiyama, Daizaburo Hirata, Tomiko Ishii, Kotoe Hatsui', null, 'Volunteering as a "comfort woman" on the Manchurian front, where she is expected to service hundreds of soldiers, Harumi is commandeered by the brutal Lieutenant Narita but falls for the sensitive Mikami, Narita''s direct subordinate. Seijun Suzuki''s Story of a Prostitute is a tragic love story as well as a rule-bending take on a popular Taijiro Tamura novel, challenging military and fraternal codes of honor, as seen through Harumi''s eyes.', 'Volunteering as a "comfort woman" on the Manchurian front, where she is expected to service hundreds of soldiers, Harumi is commandeered by the brutal Lieutenant Narita but falls for the sensitive Mikami, Narita''s direct subordinate. Seijun Suzuki''s Story of a Prostitute is a tragic love story as well as a rule-bending take on a popular Taijiro Tamura novel, challenging military and fraternal codes of honor, as seen through Harumi''s eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJQUZF2Gu1w1aYu9PGFpk8XsRjn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39506'),
  ('646123091633940837', 'Story of a Real Man', 1948, 'War, Drama', 'Aleksandr Stolper, Mark Magidson, Evgeniy Zilbershtein', 'Mariya Smirnova', 'Pavel Kadochnikov, Nikolai Okhlopkov, Aleksey Dikiy, Vasili Merkuryev, Lyudmila Tselikovskaya, Lyubov Sokolova, Aleksandr Mikhajlov, Boris Babochkin', null, 'Alexey Meresyev was a fighter pilot during the war. One day he was shot down by Nazis, and because of his wounds both of his legs had to be cut off up to his knees. Because of his spirit and courage, Alexey was able to overcome his disability. He learned not only to walk on his artificial limps, but even dance and fly the plane again. Based on a real-life story.', 'Alexey Meresyev was a fighter pilot during the war. One day he was shot down by Nazis, and because of his wounds both of his legs had to be cut off up to his knees. Because of his spirit and courage, Alexey was able to overcome his disability. He learned not only to walk on his artificial limps, but even dance and fly the plane again. Based on a real-life story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pjdzV8peaf2PpGxcAAhUMV6wcb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254332'),
  ('37659688919971481', 'Story of Annette Zelman', 2022, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Philippe Le Guay, Pénélope Pourriat', 'Emmanuel Salinger', 'Ilona Bachelier, Vassili Schneider, Julie Gayet, Laurent Lucas, Guilaine Londez, Daniel Cohen, Louise Legendre, Simon Thomas', null, '1942 Paris. Annette is 20 years old, Jean is barely older, they love each other and the future is bright for them. But the deportation of the Jews of France will change their destiny. Upset at the idea of their only son marrying a Jewish woman, Jean Jausion''s parents decide to keep young Annette Zelman away from them... and denounce her to the Gestapo. The machine was launched, but it was too late. Annette was deported to Auschwitz on June 22, 1942.', '1942 Paris. Annette is 20 years old, Jean is barely older, they love each other and the future is bright for them. But the deportation of the Jews of France will change their destiny. Upset at the idea of their only son marrying a Jewish woman, Jean Jausion''s parents decide to keep young Annette Zelman away from them... and denounce her to the Gestapo. The machine was launched, but it was too late. Annette was deported to Auschwitz on June 22, 1942.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqpWVWeihMl3q9pZjVBlVlrpvv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006474'),
  ('795470100043371320', 'Story of Fear and a Knife', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Fausto Zuccoli, Mario Amendola, Paolo Taccari', 'Mario Amendola, Bruno Corbucci', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Maurizio Arena, Ninetto Davoli, Fiorenzo Fiorentini, Lando Fiorini, Anita Durante, Mario Carotenuto', null, 'A funk is believed to be a tough guy because of a magic bowler hat which gives him courage and strength.', 'A funk is believed to be a tough guy because of a magic bowler hat which gives him courage and strength.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94Lb6527814rEBsn1ONqnuT6B3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201798'),
  ('1085905626752994189', 'Story of G.I. Joe', 1945, 'Drama, War', 'William A. Wellman, Archie Stout, Louis Applebaum', 'Leopold Atlas, Guy Endore, Philip Stevenson', 'Burgess Meredith, Robert Mitchum, Freddie Steele, Wally Cassell, Jimmy Lloyd, John R. Reilly, William Murphy, Dorothy Coonan Wellman', null, 'War correspondent Ernie Pyle joins Company C, 18th Infantry as this American army unit fights its way across North Africa in World War II. He comes to know the soldiers and finds much human interest material for his readers back in the States. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2000.', 'War correspondent Ernie Pyle joins Company C, 18th Infantry as this American army unit fights its way across North Africa in World War II. He comes to know the soldiers and finds much human interest material for his readers back in the States. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOlCfMtwobk2bNgqpXaaf17OtBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46614'),
  ('1148479254856941513', 'Story of Judas', 2015, 'Drama, History', 'Rabah Ameur-Zaïmeche, Irina Lubtchansky', 'Rabah Ameur-Zaïmeche', 'Nabil Djedouani, Mohamed Aroussi, Rabah Ameur-Zaïmeche, Marie Loustalot, Eliott Khayat, Régis Laroche, Xavier Mussel, Roland Gervet', null, 'A man ascends a barren summit. It is Judas, come to collect Jesus and carry him down the mountain on his back, joking and panting as he does so. After bathing in the river and taking part in a henna ceremony, Jesus leaves for Jerusalem. Judas is concerned for his friend’s safety, since the Roman occupiers look upon the prophet as an insurgent.', 'A man ascends a barren summit. It is Judas, come to collect Jesus and carry him down the mountain on his back, joking and panting as he does so. After bathing in the river and taking part in a henna ceremony, Jesus leaves for Jerusalem. Judas is concerned for his friend’s safety, since the Roman occupiers look upon the prophet as an insurgent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKcJhnlTivobDKrsm7yVbMyVFjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324687'),
  ('415661132904632991', 'Story of Night', 1979, 'Documentary', 'Clemens Klopfenstein', 'Serena Kiefer, Clemens Klopfenstein', null, null, 'It’s a black-and-white record of European cities in the dark (2-5am), from Basle to Belfast. Quiet, and meditative, what emerges most strongly is an eerie sense of city landscapes as deserted film sets, in which the desolate architecture overwhelms any sense of reality. The only reassurance that we are not in some endless machine-Metropolis is the shadow of daytime activity: a juggernaut plunging through a darkened village, a plague of small birds in the predawn light. The whole thing is underscored by a beautiful ‘composed’ soundtrack, from quietly humming streetlights to reggae and the rumble of armoured cars in Belfast. A strange and remarkable combination of dream, documentary and science-fiction.', 'It’s a black-and-white record of European cities in the dark (2-5am), from Basle to Belfast. Quiet, and meditative, what emerges most strongly is an eerie sense of city landscapes as deserted film sets, in which the desolate architecture overwhelms any sense of reality. The only reassurance that we are not in some endless machine-Metropolis is the shadow of daytime activity: a juggernaut plunging through a darkened village, a plague of small birds in the predawn light. The whole thing is underscored by a beautiful ‘composed’ soundtrack, from quietly humming streetlights to reggae and the rumble of armoured cars in Belfast. A strange and remarkable combination of dream, documentary and science-fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2ZnW18XYB2XgrOTLLsVbNFdEFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149094'),
  ('422639748019798446', 'Story of One Crime', 1963, 'Animation', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Boris Kotov, M. Rusanova', 'Mikhail Volpin', 'Zinoviy Gerdt', null, 'The story about an everyman who one morning suddenly leaps out on the courtyard and bludgeons two conversing housewives to death with a frying pan.', 'The story about an everyman who one morning suddenly leaps out on the courtyard and bludgeons two conversing housewives to death with a frying pan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaxSdSzznJO9m4aH7MCXy6WMN2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90021'),
  ('617616330368331644', 'Story of the Bass Cello', 1956, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Jiří Trnka, Ludvík Hájek, Emanuel Franek', 'Jiří Trnka', 'Jan Pivec', null, '"Román s basou" is another short by master a stop-motion puppet-animator Jiri Trnka. The story is based on Anton Chekhovs story "Roman s Kontrabasom". Princess Bibulova decides to go fishing along the river while not far away a bass player leaves his two companions to go for a swim.', '"Román s basou" is another short by master a stop-motion puppet-animator Jiri Trnka. The story is based on Anton Chekhovs story "Roman s Kontrabasom". Princess Bibulova decides to go fishing along the river while not far away a bass player leaves his two companions to go for a swim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jn5evnNSjSmxEFrf7NJcJs3aQSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92821'),
  ('963883322627766357', 'Story of Women', 1988, 'Drama, History', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier, Alain Wermus', 'Colo Tavernier O''Hagan, Claude Chabrol', 'Isabelle Huppert, François Cluzet, Nils Tavernier, Marie Trintignant, Guillaume Foutrier, Nicolas Foutrier, Aurore Gauvin, Lolita Chammah', null, 'France, World War II. In order to somehow make ends meet, the mother of two children, Marie Latour, does underground abortions and rents a room to a familiar prostitute. She doesn''t pay any attention to her husband, who returned from the war because of his injury, and lives her own life. Abortions gradually begin to bring a good income, and boredom can be easily dispelled by starting up with a young lover.', 'France, World War II. In order to somehow make ends meet, the mother of two children, Marie Latour, does underground abortions and rents a room to a familiar prostitute. She doesn''t pay any attention to her husband, who returned from the war because of his injury, and lives her own life. Abortions gradually begin to bring a good income, and boredom can be easily dispelled by starting up with a young lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIBOAemklR8MVYP0Vn5RE0MYYWT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41975'),
  ('73827145981984360', 'Storybook', 1994, 'Family, Adventure', 'Hanania Baer, Lorenzo Doumani, Ken Blakey', 'Susan Bowen, Lorenzo Doumani', 'Sean Fitzgerald, Swoosie Kurtz, Richard Moll, William McNamara, Milton Berle, Jack Scalia, James Doohan, Ed Begley Jr.', null, 'A young boy and his dog discover a magical story book and enter the enchanted Storyland, ruled by wicked Queen Evilia. They''ll need a little help from his literary friends to get back to the real world.', 'A young boy and his dog discover a magical story book and enter the enchanted Storyland, ruled by wicked Queen Evilia. They''ll need a little help from his literary friends to get back to the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oYWtBlmQZH4FjUUMT0ZgSeYZDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291645'),
  ('738953123704481881', 'StoryJester', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Tuca Moraes, Thiago Mascarenhas, Bianca Paranhos', 'Odete Damico, Sergio Martorelli, Paulo Cursino', 'Maurício Manfrini, Cacau Protásio, Estevam Nabote, Giovani Braz, Maurício de Barros, Carlos Alberto de Nóbrega, Serjão Loroza, Bemvindo Sequeira', null, 'Paulinho Gogó narrates his stories on a park bench for different listeners, while waiting for the arrival of his beloved Nega Juju.', 'Paulinho Gogó narrates his stories on a park bench for different listeners, while waiting for the arrival of his beloved Nega Juju.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmCAciCurvDWZJY8wo3lvo9S9b2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669329'),
  ('1041695130334526835', 'Storytelling', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Todd Solondz, Frederick Elmes, Timothy Bird', 'Todd Solondz', 'Selma Blair, Leo Fitzpatrick, Robert Wisdom, Aleksa Palladino, Mark Webber, Paul Giamatti, John Goodman, Jonathan Osser', 'R', 'College and high school serve as the backdrop for two stories about dysfunction and personal turmoil.', 'College and high school serve as the backdrop for two stories about dysfunction and personal turmoil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hSpaT8x0LQy7G5TXb6vGWQrRSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16550'),
  ('981388138779296620', 'Storytime', 1979, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Terry Gilliam', null, 'Terry Gilliam', null, 'The first story-time segment is about a cheerful cockroach named Don, who scurries throughout his mansion home, walks beneath the floorboards and does unspeakable things in the darkness of the cupboard, before being splatted by somebody''s foot. The second segment is about an ordinary man named Albert Einstein ("the only Albert Einstein not to have discovered the Theory of Relativity") whose hands have a life of their own, staying out late at night, misbehaving and committing adultery with feet. The third segment – hasn''t much story to it at all, and instead concerns the inhabitants of the moving pictures on an over-sized Christmas card, who interact with each other in all sorts of bizarre ways.', 'The first story-time segment is about a cheerful cockroach named Don, who scurries throughout his mansion home, walks beneath the floorboards and does unspeakable things in the darkness of the cupboard, before being splatted by somebody''s foot. The second segment is about an ordinary man named Albert Einstein ("the only Albert Einstein not to have discovered the Theory of Relativity") whose hands have a life of their own, staying out late at night, misbehaving and committing adultery with feet. The third segment – hasn''t much story to it at all, and instead concerns the inhabitants of the moving pictures on an over-sized Christmas card, who interact with each other in all sorts of bizarre ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7jxcwi6Ld1RIR9YTIF1iCZN3jg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38845'),
  ('145825268568087249', 'Storyville', 1992, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mark Frost, Ronald Víctor García', 'Lee Reynolds, Mark Frost', 'James Spader, Joanne Whalley, Jason Robards, Charlotte Lewis, Michael Warren, Piper Laurie, Michael Parks, Chuck McCann', null, 'While investigating his own blackmailing, a young politician uncovers his family''s deep secrets.', 'While investigating his own blackmailing, a young politician uncovers his family''s deep secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aag0midhVXwTVv5ZiidAFo6H5SY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135890'),
  ('703654967580882480', 'Stournara 288', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Yiorgos Stamboulopoulos', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Dinos Iliopoulos', 'Sofia Vempo, Orestis Makris, Smaroula Giouli, Dinos Iliopoulos, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Apostolos Avdis, Beata Asimakopoulou, Dina Trianti', null, 'Through the narration of a tenant of a block of flats on 288 Stournara street, we watch the everyday stories of people living in the city, their problems, their comic situations and their love affairs.', 'Through the narration of a tenant of a block of flats on 288 Stournara street, we watch the everyday stories of people living in the city, their problems, their comic situations and their love affairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhoBH6n3MdQIF2Jud77p0cYptqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367431'),
  ('533223729511870526', 'Stowaway', 1936, 'Music, Adventure, Family', 'William A. Seiter', 'William M. Conselman, Nat Perrin, Arthur Sheekman', 'Shirley Temple, Robert Young, Alice Faye, Eugene Pallette, Helen Westley, Arthur Treacher, Allan Lane, J. Edward Bromberg', 'NR', 'Chin-Ching gets lost in Shanghai and is befriended by American playboy Tommy Randall. She falls asleep in his car which winds up on a ship headed for America. Susan Parker, also on the ship, marries Randall to give Chin-Ching a family.', 'Chin-Ching gets lost in Shanghai and is befriended by American playboy Tommy Randall. She falls asleep in his car which winds up on a ship headed for America. Susan Parker, also on the ship, marries Randall to give Chin-Ching a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cA8G6s7qAK9kI9DKvbvEWmQkbbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27597'),
  ('952466552677008918', 'Stowaway', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Katharina Dietl, Alice Weibhauser, Georgina Foley', 'Joe Penna, Ryan Morrison', 'Anna Kendrick, Toni Collette, Daniel Dae Kim, Shamier Anderson', 'R', 'A three-person crew on a mission to Mars faces an impossible choice when an unplanned passenger jeopardizes the lives of everyone on board.', 'A three-person crew on a mission to Mars faces an impossible choice when an unplanned passenger jeopardizes the lives of everyone on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFyRjhJfhNgM565U2mwEp5YUUOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559581'),
  ('574162771821078267', 'Stowaway', 2022, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller', 'Declan Whitebloom, Giles Dunning', 'Ivan Hayden', 'Ruby Rose, Patrick Schwarzenegger, Frank Grillo, Danny Bohnen, Scotty Bohnen, Luis Da Silva, Jr., Emma Maddock, Major Dodge', null, 'A tenacious party girl fights to survive after three thieves commandeer her luxury yacht. Unable to escape and trapped on the yacht at high seas, the prey becomes the hunter as she turns the tables on the intruders and takes matters into her own hands.', 'A tenacious party girl fights to survive after three thieves commandeer her luxury yacht. Unable to escape and trapped on the yacht at high seas, the prey becomes the hunter as she turns the tables on the intruders and takes matters into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZfKo5349nEssW0n2wqNf4vPtbZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999205'),
  ('1100169349765161992', 'Straight', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nicolas Flessa', 'Nicolas Flessa', 'Adrian Can, Annabelle Dorn, Beba Ebner, Frederic Heidorn, Marion Kruse, Anna Oussankina, Florian Sonnefeld, Soner Ulutas', null, 'Straight is the story of a messy love triangle between two men and a woman. Nazim (Eralp Uzun) is a hot young Turkish guy involved in petty crime. He goes out each night with his buddies, cruising for girls and dealing drugs in a seedy city square populated with hookers. None of his buddies suspect that on many of those nights he ends up in the arms of men. Since he met David (Florian Sonnefeld) on the street, his hetero façade is rapidly crumbling. His friends seem to pick up on the new vibe and wonder what’s up. David is from a bourgeois Jewish family and slumming it. He hangs out on the street pretending to look for drugs, but what he really wants is Nazim. Their first hookup is alternately hot, tender and filled with guilt. Nevertheless, their affair develops in secret against all odds. Further entangling things is David’s Polish-German girlfriend (Beba Ebner), who is revolting against her strict Catholic upbringing by going out with this punkish Jewish boyfriend.', 'Straight is the story of a messy love triangle between two men and a woman. Nazim (Eralp Uzun) is a hot young Turkish guy involved in petty crime. He goes out each night with his buddies, cruising for girls and dealing drugs in a seedy city square populated with hookers. None of his buddies suspect that on many of those nights he ends up in the arms of men. Since he met David (Florian Sonnefeld) on the street, his hetero façade is rapidly crumbling. His friends seem to pick up on the new vibe and wonder what’s up. David is from a bourgeois Jewish family and slumming it. He hangs out on the street pretending to look for drugs, but what he really wants is Nazim. Their first hookup is alternately hot, tender and filled with guilt. Nevertheless, their affair develops in secret against all odds. Further entangling things is David’s Polish-German girlfriend (Beba Ebner), who is revolting against her strict Catholic upbringing by going out with this punkish Jewish boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/palU9vDuTnUeJCI00ssAUaSiJTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67865'),
  ('496231950831102077', 'Straight', 2024, 'Romance', 'Marcelo Tobar', 'Drew Fornarola, Marcelo Tobar, Scott Elmegreen', 'Alejandro Speitzer, Franco Masini, Bárbara López', null, 'Roberto is a successful 32-year-old banker with a demanding life and a job that occupies him even on the weekends; a talented girlfriend, Elia, with whom he has been in a relationship for six years; and in his free time a little soccer, beer and Cris, a 20-year-old boy he meets on a gay dating app. Cris will make him rethink whether he has the life he wants or the one he''s expected to have.', 'Roberto is a successful 32-year-old banker with a demanding life and a job that occupies him even on the weekends; a talented girlfriend, Elia, with whom he has been in a relationship for six years; and in his free time a little soccer, beer and Cris, a 20-year-old boy he meets on a gay dating app. Cris will make him rethink whether he has the life he wants or the one he''s expected to have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34l0QGrhDv8DawQss6rDRkio4Ga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1167898'),
  ('1092063937559257744', 'Straight A''s', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'James Cox, Shawn Kim', 'David Cole', 'Ryan Phillippe, Anna Paquin, Luke Wilson, Riley Thomas Stewart, Ursula Parker, Amparo Garcia-Crow, Augustin Solis, Tess Harper', 'R', 'Pressured by his late mother''s ghost to return home to the family he abandoned, a former addict grabs a bag of pills and a sack of marijuana and hits the road to Shreveport.', 'Pressured by his late mother''s ghost to return home to the family he abandoned, a former addict grabs a bag of pills and a sack of marijuana and hits the road to Shreveport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92bkt0yTztGrNy44bOIHkxpkcDn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153795'),
  ('1053348399236180648', 'Straight Ahead Until Morning', 1994, 'Drama', 'Alain Guiraudie, Georges de Genevraye', 'Alain Guiraudie', 'Stephane Valgalier, Jean-Marie Fertey, Christian Ducasse, Felicien Dejonghe, Rael Fernin, Julien Mignot', null, 'A sleepwalker decides to paint the town red. In the search of the wild painter, a young night watchman delivers some monologue.', 'A sleepwalker decides to paint the town red. In the search of the wild painter, a young night watchman delivers some monologue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmqZzR1HZ7zoEGMHJoGekI2Mz7v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185724'),
  ('299882357081203404', 'Straight from the Barrio', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'José Iván Santiago', 'Daddy Yankee, Ángel M. Sanjurjo, Edgar Soberón Torchia', 'Daddy Yankee, Katiria Soto, César Farrait, Angélica Alcaide, Norma Colón, Eddie D, Rey Pirin, Ana Isabelle', 'R', 'A young drug dealer falls in love while facing disruption among the men in his gang, and being offered a career as a Reggaetón singer.', 'A young drug dealer falls in love while facing disruption among the men in his gang, and being offered a career as a Reggaetón singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LIlCFEQnlCWpsd1HYmvhY5JHpq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20093'),
  ('407577299293063681', 'Straight From the Heart', 2003, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'James W. Wrenn, A. Brooks Medoff, David S. Cass Sr.', 'Pamela Wallace', 'Teri Polo, Andrew McCarthy, Patricia Kalember, Greg Evigan, Christine Tucci, David Jean Thomas, J. Kenneth Campbell, Richard Gross', null, 'Jordan Donavan, a photographer in New York, is so disappointed when after five years of going steady Edward Morgan offers her not marriage but just to move in with him, that she accepts the match-making arranged via a magazine by her female friend with Tyler Ross, a horse rancher in the West, whose candidacy was actually also posted by his sister. After a bad start they soon grow closer.', 'Jordan Donavan, a photographer in New York, is so disappointed when after five years of going steady Edward Morgan offers her not marriage but just to move in with him, that she accepts the match-making arranged via a magazine by her female friend with Tyler Ross, a horse rancher in the West, whose candidacy was actually also posted by his sister. After a bad start they soon grow closer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bDM5O87EbABkYEjV6VmSDXVCYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26131'),
  ('538781453357861545', 'Straight On Till Morning', 1972, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Brian Probyn, Peter Collinson, Richard Rambaut', 'John Peacock', 'Rita Tushingham, Shane Briant, Katya Wyeth, Annie Ross, Tom Bell, Claire Kelly, Harold Berens, John Clive', 'R', 'Brenda, a timid, withdrawn woman, meets Peter, a man she believes is finally the love of her life. However, little does Brenda know that Peter is a vicious serial killer.', 'Brenda, a timid, withdrawn woman, meets Peter, a man she believes is finally the love of her life. However, little does Brenda know that Peter is a vicious serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NqyQVPVnEqGWdfdNpK66XGkqBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40210'),
  ('42825607282476906', 'Straight Shooter', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Thomas Bohn, Peter von Haller', 'Thomas Bohn', 'Dennis Hopper, Heino Ferch, Katja Flint, Hannelore Hoger, Ulrich Mühe, Jürgen Schornagel, Bernhard Bettermann, Maximilian Beckmann', null, 'After his daughter died of cancer, former French foreign legionnaire "Straight Shooter" alias Volker Bretz threatens those who financed, built, favoured and now work the nuclear power plant Atar II to kill one of them each day until the plant is shut down. His former drill sergeant, Frank Hector, who now owns several night clubs and brothels, is the only one who might be able to stop the maniac killing specialist. Frank is flown in instantly, but soon has to find out that his former comrade''s actions might be a result from an event long ago.', 'After his daughter died of cancer, former French foreign legionnaire "Straight Shooter" alias Volker Bretz threatens those who financed, built, favoured and now work the nuclear power plant Atar II to kill one of them each day until the plant is shut down. His former drill sergeant, Frank Hector, who now owns several night clubs and brothels, is the only one who might be able to stop the maniac killing specialist. Frank is flown in instantly, but soon has to find out that his former comrade''s actions might be a result from an event long ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e90DCN1cD9W6tF8yw1NNMQrNE3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10224'),
  ('1089827369982234830', 'Straight Shooters', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald runs a shooting gallery. His nephews come by and he offers them a free shot, but when the first one hits all the targets, the notoriously cheap Donald switches a cheap prize for the correct one. He then gives the other two boys gimmicked guns; the last one is empty, but the targets break anyway because one boy is hitting them from behind. Donald chases them off; they use the mystic''s booth next door to get revenge.', 'Donald runs a shooting gallery. His nephews come by and he offers them a free shot, but when the first one hits all the targets, the notoriously cheap Donald switches a cheap prize for the correct one. He then gives the other two boys gimmicked guns; the last one is empty, but the targets break anyway because one boy is hitting them from behind. Donald chases them off; they use the mystic''s booth next door to get revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flnDoMm8Wf2DLHeONiDtTv2uq4v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67447'),
  ('938769637386789418', 'Straight Story', 2006, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Vladimiros Kiriakidis, Efi Mouriki', 'Efi Mouriki, Vladimiros Kiriakidis', 'Hristos Hatzipanagiotis, Vladimiros Kiriakidis, Anthem Moss, Kanellina Menouti, Meni Konstantinidou, Katerina Daskalaki, Euripides Laskaridis, Christina Mitropoulou', null, 'This film is about an upside down world, where being homosexual is considered "normal" and heterosexual is considered "not normal".', 'This film is about an upside down world, where being homosexual is considered "normal" and heterosexual is considered "not normal".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jDMrCwArFKzQ6CFFL8saA6VTkE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48128'),
  ('90538924276631833', 'Straight Talk', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Barnet Kellman, Peter Sova', 'Craig Bolotin, Patricia Resnick', 'Dolly Parton, James Woods, Griffin Dunne, Michael Madsen, Deirdre O''Connell, John Sayles, Teri Hatcher, Spalding Gray', 'PG', 'Honest and straightforward small-town Shirlee Kenyon chucks her boyfriend and heads for Chicago. Accidentally having to host a radio problem phone-in show, it is clear she is a natural and is hired on the spot. But the station insists she call herself Doctor, and as her popularity grows a local reporter starts digging for the truth. Problem is, the more he is around her the more he fancies her.', 'Honest and straightforward small-town Shirlee Kenyon chucks her boyfriend and heads for Chicago. Accidentally having to host a radio problem phone-in show, it is clear she is a natural and is hired on the spot. But the station insists she call herself Doctor, and as her popularity grows a local reporter starts digging for the truth. Problem is, the more he is around her the more he fancies her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fc9jSEvsnqdQ59Gt6mlIgb9rtto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37264'),
  ('1051323118362303275', 'Straight Time', 1978, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ulu Grosbard, Jack Roe, Owen Roizman', 'Jeffrey Boam, Edward Bunker, Alvin Sargent', 'Dustin Hoffman, Theresa Russell, Gary Busey, Harry Dean Stanton, M. Emmet Walsh, Rita Taggart, Kathy Bates, Sandy Baron', 'R', 'After being released on parole, a burglar attempts to go straight, get a regular job, and just go by the rules. He soon finds himself back in jail at the hands of a power-hungry parole officer.', 'After being released on parole, a burglar attempts to go straight, get a regular job, and just go by the rules. He soon finds himself back in jail at the hands of a power-hungry parole officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qht8SAqj7dEeEzv9yXalFB35ycb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23397'),
  ('156620031605405781', 'Straight to Hell', 1987, 'Action, Western, Comedy, Crime', 'Alex Cox, Tom Richmond, Yousaf Bokhari', 'Alex Cox, Dick Rude', 'Dick Rude, Sy Richardson, Courtney Love, Joe Strummer, Jennifer Balgobin, Miguel Sandoval, Shane MacGowan, Spider Stacy', null, 'A gang of bank robbers with a suitcase full of money go to the desert to hide out. After burying the loot, they find their way to a surreal town full of cowboys who drink an awful lot of coffee.', 'A gang of bank robbers with a suitcase full of money go to the desert to hide out. After burying the loot, they find their way to a surreal town full of cowboys who drink an awful lot of coffee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n024xDQXXjtabakNYdRtRKCyvEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9698'),
  ('480987806038109110', 'Straight Up', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'James Sweeney, Melissa Kyle, John Baumgartner', 'James Sweeney', 'Katie Findlay, James Sweeney, Dana Drori, James Scully, Joshua Diaz, Tracie Thoms, Betsy Brandt, Randall Park', null, 'Todd is a hyper-articulate, obsessive compulsive gay twentysomething whose fear of dying alone leads him to a baffling conclusion: he might not be gay after all. When he meets Rory, a whip-smart struggling actress with her own set of insecurities, the two forge a relationship that’s all talk and no sex.', 'Todd is a hyper-articulate, obsessive compulsive gay twentysomething whose fear of dying alone leads him to a baffling conclusion: he might not be gay after all. When he meets Rory, a whip-smart struggling actress with her own set of insecurities, the two forge a relationship that’s all talk and no sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZWXx9CAam2TWpzjB1tYX7bwNuE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604031'),
  ('644906773483749225', 'Straightheads', 2007, 'Thriller', 'Dan Reed, Chris Seager', 'Dan Reed', 'Gillian Anderson, Danny Dyer, Adam Rayner, Antony Byrne, Anthony Calf, Ralph Brown, Steven Robertson, Gugu Mbatha-Raw', 'R', 'There is instant chemistry between Alice (Gillian Anderson), a businesswoman, and Adam (Danny Dyer), a younger working-class man who installs a security system in her London apartment. She takes him to a party in the country, and they end up making love. But the night turns horrific when they encounter three thugs who maim Adam and rape Alice. The incident turns them into fearful recluses until Alice spots the leader of their attackers (Anthony Calf) -- and the two victims plot a brutal revenge.', 'There is instant chemistry between Alice (Gillian Anderson), a businesswoman, and Adam (Danny Dyer), a younger working-class man who installs a security system in her London apartment. She takes him to a party in the country, and they end up making love. But the night turns horrific when they encounter three thugs who maim Adam and rape Alice. The incident turns them into fearful recluses until Alice spots the leader of their attackers (Anthony Calf) -- and the two victims plot a brutal revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5W8jG9kt2UfEq8Tn0rb3BRaOPqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13538'),
  ('277555818925973830', 'Strait-Jacket', 1964, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'William Castle, Herbert S. Greene, Arthur E. Arling', 'Robert Bloch', 'Joan Crawford, Diane Baker, Leif Erickson, Howard St. John, John Anthony Hayes, Rochelle Hudson, George Kennedy, Edith Atwater', 'NR', 'After a twenty-year stay at an asylum for a double murder, a mother returns to her estranged daughter where suspicions arise about her behavior.', 'After a twenty-year stay at an asylum for a double murder, a mother returns to her estranged daughter where suspicions arise about her behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNL4ydW0KVhennniy3QSYYv18Hp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29396'),
  ('510379432462222484', 'Stranded', 2001, 'Science Fiction', 'Ricardo Aronovich, María Lidón', 'Juan Miguel Aguilera', 'Vincent Gallo, Maria de Medeiros, Joaquim de Almeida, María Lidón, Danel Aser, Johnny Ramone, José Sancho, Paul Gibert', null, 'A team of astronauts on the first mission to Mars crashes onto the surface, losing contact with Earth. With no other recourse, and help millions of miles away, the crew is forced to make desperate choices in order to stay alive. Will they be able to survive as the minutes slip away?', 'A team of astronauts on the first mission to Mars crashes onto the surface, losing contact with Earth. With no other recourse, and help millions of miles away, the crew is forced to make desperate choices in order to stay alive. Will they be able to survive as the minutes slip away?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trYNLH02gy6j4O9KXYW8awtXJgv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2191'),
  ('395231123297223461', 'Stranded', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Guillaume Brac, Claudine Natkin', 'Guillaume Brac', 'Julien Lucas, Vincent Macaigne, Adélaïde Leroux, Nathalie Lecat, Maud Colson, Adeline Lankri, Damien Baillet, Christian ''Bouboule'' Boulanger', null, 'Luc goes off on his bicycle to forget his problems. A suit of accidents make him spend the night in a little town of Picardie. He meets Sylvain, who tries to help him, for the best and the worst.', 'Luc goes off on his bicycle to forget his problems. A suit of accidents make him spend the night in a little town of Picardie. He meets Sylvain, who tries to help him, for the best and the worst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkET7Vjc0F5cjM7mFeFMLgKLCh3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170830'),
  ('495376888783486603', 'Stranded', 2010, 'Mystery, Action, Horror, War', 'Hugues Martin, Sandra Martin, Pierre Cottereau', 'Sandra Martin, Hugues Martin', 'Thierry Frémont, Saïd Taghmaoui, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Aurélien Wiik, Cyril Raffaelli, Yann Hernandez, Fatima Herandi Raouya, Emmanuel Bonami', null, 'Algeria, 1960. A section of French paratroopers are sent in search of a missing aircraft in the Algerian desert. The wreckage of the plane is quickly located, but there are no survivors, just a suitcase stamped “Top Secret”. Stormed by enemy soldiers, the troops find refuge in a strange abandoned citadel. Despite warnings from the place’s Guardian to leave at once, they wake up the Djinns, the evil spirits of the desert .', 'Algeria, 1960. A section of French paratroopers are sent in search of a missing aircraft in the Algerian desert. The wreckage of the plane is quickly located, but there are no survivors, just a suitcase stamped “Top Secret”. Stormed by enemy soldiers, the troops find refuge in a strange abandoned citadel. Despite warnings from the place’s Guardian to leave at once, they wake up the Djinns, the evil spirits of the desert .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rI1yDo1imacSvFd8M3OJX8J7Rc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53923'),
  ('169012497211228845', 'Stranded', 2013, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Roger Christian, Michael Johnson, Mark Dobrescu', 'Roger Christian, Christian Piers Betley', 'Christian Slater, Brendan Fehr, Amy Matysio, Michael Therriault, Lyndon Bray, Ryland Alexander, Mark D. Claxton', 'NR', 'The Lunar Base Ark explores ore and unexpectedly is hit by a meteor shower and has severe damages. Colonel Gerard Brauchman sends the crewwoman Ava Cameron to repair a wing that is full of CO2. Dr. Lance Krauss warns that the gas may cause paranoia and hallucinations. Ava brings a sample of the meteor for analysis and Dr. Krauss finds that there are spores attached to the meteor. Ava accidentally cuts her finger in a sample but she hides the cut from the doctor. Soon Ava gets pregnant and delivers an alien offspring. However, neither Col. Brauchman nor Dr. Kraus believes in her words and they believe that Ava is delusional. The offspring bites the crewman Bruce Johns and the crew discovers that Bruce has been cloned by the alien. Soon they find how dangerous the clone is.', 'The Lunar Base Ark explores ore and unexpectedly is hit by a meteor shower and has severe damages. Colonel Gerard Brauchman sends the crewwoman Ava Cameron to repair a wing that is full of CO2. Dr. Lance Krauss warns that the gas may cause paranoia and hallucinations. Ava brings a sample of the meteor for analysis and Dr. Krauss finds that there are spores attached to the meteor. Ava accidentally cuts her finger in a sample but she hides the cut from the doctor. Soon Ava gets pregnant and delivers an alien offspring. However, neither Col. Brauchman nor Dr. Kraus believes in her words and they believe that Ava is delusional. The offspring bites the crewman Bruce Johns and the crew discovers that Bruce has been cloned by the alien. Soon they find how dangerous the clone is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxqwma5Ds2UYhTwi0btsE2qSbVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196830'),
  ('923805678758211807', 'Stranded', 2015, 'Comedy', 'José Corbacho, Mario Montero, Juan Cruz', 'José Corbacho, Jaime Bartolomé, Juan Cruz', 'Lola Dueñas, Carlos Areces, Núria Gago, Miki Esparbé, Rossy de Palma, Aida Folch, Toni Acosta, María Alfonsa Rosso', null, 'The last train travel of the year from Barcelona to Madrid, suddenly stops by a voltage drop in the middle of nowhere during a fierce snowstorm. Because of the peculiarity of its passengers, will begin to emerge hilarious conflicts between them.', 'The last train travel of the year from Barcelona to Madrid, suddenly stops by a voltage drop in the middle of nowhere during a fierce snowstorm. Because of the peculiarity of its passengers, will begin to emerge hilarious conflicts between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26Bywkn2IUvOgCQMab4sQKtjXIR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347669'),
  ('978995712073764099', 'Stranded', 2021, 'Drama', 'Giovanni Mattei, Victor Soares', 'Victor Soares, Amanda Caliari', 'Ingrid Ohara, Pietro Guedes, Gabriel Peixinho, Luiza Parente, Gregory Kessey, Priscila Caliari, Fernanda Schneider, Vivi Wanderley', null, 'Tensions run high while food runs low as six influencers find themselves stranded on a secluded island after plans for a weekend escape go awry.', 'Tensions run high while food runs low as six influencers find themselves stranded on a secluded island after plans for a weekend escape go awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZonuUeC9bH2D5A609w7nkplhyj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:841793'),
  ('986113075709090390', 'Stranded: I''ve Come from a Plane That Crashed on the Mountains', 2007, 'Documentary, History', 'Gonzalo Arijón, César Charlone, Pablo Zubizarreta', null, 'José Pedro Algorta Durán, Roberto Canessa, Alfredo Daniel Delgado Salaberri, Daniel Fernández Strauch, Roberto François Álvarez, Roy Álex Harley Sánchez, José Luis Inciarte Vázquez, Álvaro Mangino Schmid', null, 'The story, told by the survivors, of a group of young men, members of a Uruguayan rugby team, who managed to survive for 72 days, at an altitude of almost 4,000 meters, in the heart of the Andes Mountains, after their plane, en route to Chile, crashed there on October 13, 1972.', 'The story, told by the survivors, of a group of young men, members of a Uruguayan rugby team, who managed to survive for 72 days, at an altitude of almost 4,000 meters, in the heart of the Andes Mountains, after their plane, en route to Chile, crashed there on October 13, 1972.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Uu9M1y36vI727Ec2oDMeS3V3Ys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21508'),
  ('1112149379611189209', 'Strange Affair', 1981, 'Drama', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Étienne Becker', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Christopher Frank', 'Gérard Lanvin, Michel Piccoli, Nathalie Baye, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Madeleine Cheminat, Jean-François Balmer, Pierre Michaël, Victor Garrivier', null, 'A young Parisian advertising executive becomes so captivated by the unsettling charm of his mysterious new employer that he eventually abandons his family and friends, viewing it a privilege to let the ubiquitous employer take over his home, his life, his desire. Only his wife remains suspicious, recognizing both the pathos and the evil in the man’s soul-stealing power.', 'A young Parisian advertising executive becomes so captivated by the unsettling charm of his mysterious new employer that he eventually abandons his family and friends, viewing it a privilege to let the ubiquitous employer take over his home, his life, his desire. Only his wife remains suspicious, recognizing both the pathos and the evil in the man’s soul-stealing power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nf6OzJJQnTMD71yhvhkvldEkkab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12266'),
  ('637528246286964159', 'Strange Bargain', 1949, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Will Price, Harry J. Wild, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Lillie Hayward', 'Martha Scott, Jeffrey Lynn, Harry Morgan, Katherine Emery, Richard Gaines, Henry O''Neill, Walter Sande, Michael Chapin', 'NR', 'Bookkeeper Sam Wilson learns from his boss, Malcolm Jarvis, that he is losing his job because the company is closing down. Jarvis then makes a strange proposition, saying he intends to commit suicide but wants Sam to make it look like a murder, in order for his wife and son to inherit Jarvis''s life insurance. Sam declines, but when he goes to see Jarvis and finds his dead body, he reluctantly goes along with the scheme.', 'Bookkeeper Sam Wilson learns from his boss, Malcolm Jarvis, that he is losing his job because the company is closing down. Jarvis then makes a strange proposition, saying he intends to commit suicide but wants Sam to make it look like a murder, in order for his wife and son to inherit Jarvis''s life insurance. Sam declines, but when he goes to see Jarvis and finds his dead body, he reluctantly goes along with the scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLb5ckTN32ZA9VAcGJbox3mhJOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41551'),
  ('534721670066705840', 'Strange Bedfellows', 1965, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Leo Tover, Melvin Frank, Wendell Franklin', 'Michael Pertwee, Melvin Frank', 'Rock Hudson, Gina Lollobrigida, Gig Young, Edward Judd, Howard St. John, Dave King, Peggy Rea, Joseph Sirola', null, 'After a hasty wedding, Carter and Toni find that they disagree on everything. They separate and seven years later, on the eve before their divorce, meet again and spend the night together. Reality sets in when morning comes and they begin arguing again. Once again, divorce proceedings are on — until Carter finds out that an important promotion hinges on whether he''s married.', 'After a hasty wedding, Carter and Toni find that they disagree on everything. They separate and seven years later, on the eve before their divorce, meet again and spend the night together. Reality sets in when morning comes and they begin arguing again. Once again, divorce proceedings are on — until Carter finds out that an important promotion hinges on whether he''s married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2oxd8nGZ7k0pihcNmNxAQ0BC1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48451'),
  ('1030989786098423137', 'Strange Bedfellows', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Dean Murphy, Sean McClory, Roger Lanser', 'Dean Murphy, Stewart Faichney', 'Paul Hogan, Michael Caton, Pete Postlethwaite, Roy Billing, Alan Cassell, Andy Pappas, Paula Duncan, Kevin Dee', 'R', 'Two ''very straight'' old timers have to learn how to pass as a loving gay couple after falsely claiming same-sex status to take advantage of newly legislated tax laws.', 'Two ''very straight'' old timers have to learn how to pass as a loving gay couple after falsely claiming same-sex status to take advantage of newly legislated tax laws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zub7yJWZwGf61jLnANdV2mb1yRo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32141'),
  ('260686272370847812', 'Strange Behavior', 1981, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Mystery', 'Michael Laughlin, Louis Horvath, Murray Newey', 'Bill Condon, Michael Laughlin', 'Michael Murphy, Louise Fletcher, Dan Shor, Fiona Lewis, Arthur Dignam, Dey Young, Marc McClure, Scott Brady', 'R', 'When the teenagers in a small Illinois town start getting murdered, the police chief makes a connection to the mysterious scientific experiments being done at the local university and must stop them before his own son is dragged into the deadly scheme.', 'When the teenagers in a small Illinois town start getting murdered, the police chief makes a connection to the mysterious scientific experiments being done at the local university and must stop them before his own son is dragged into the deadly scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yom3R0L2U7gM4VX6LpXyHbwmFiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40041'),
  ('1084730581744152806', 'Strange Birds', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Elise Girard, Renato Berta', 'Elise Girard, Anne-Louise Trividic', 'Lolita Chammah, Jean Sorel, Virginie Ledoyen, Pascal Cervo, Ronald Chammah', null, 'Mavie is 27 years old and has just moved to the French capital from the provinces. She dreams of a future as a writer but is plagued by doubt and uncertainty. 76-year-old misanthrope Georges runs a bookshop in Paris – or has he merely been forced to take refuge there to escape his past? These are two peculiar creatures indeed. Georges is cynical and no longer expects much from life, while Mavie is still brimming with expectation. Yet something magical happens between them, until Georges'' dark secret suddenly catches up with him – and Mavie is caught up in something very different...', 'Mavie is 27 years old and has just moved to the French capital from the provinces. She dreams of a future as a writer but is plagued by doubt and uncertainty. 76-year-old misanthrope Georges runs a bookshop in Paris – or has he merely been forced to take refuge there to escape his past? These are two peculiar creatures indeed. Georges is cynical and no longer expects much from life, while Mavie is still brimming with expectation. Yet something magical happens between them, until Georges'' dark secret suddenly catches up with him – and Mavie is caught up in something very different...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yD9ZzvQkC8P0nis2XiPEVYgDO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440102'),
  ('1008611077855866064', 'Strange Brew', 1983, 'Comedy, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Dave Thomas, Rick Moranis, Harry V. Bring', 'Dave Thomas, Rick Moranis, Steve De Jarnatt', 'Dave Thomas, Rick Moranis, Max von Sydow, Paul Dooley, Lynne Griffin, Angus MacInnes, Roger Dunn, Tom Harvey', 'PG', 'Something is rotten at the Elsinore Brewery. Bob and Doug McKenzie (as seen on SCTV) help the orphan Pam regain the brewery founded by her recently-deceased father. But to do so, they must confront the suspicious Brewmeister Smith and two teams of vicious hockey players.', 'Something is rotten at the Elsinore Brewery. Bob and Doug McKenzie (as seen on SCTV) help the orphan Pam regain the brewery founded by her recently-deceased father. But to do so, they must confront the suspicious Brewmeister Smith and two teams of vicious hockey players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rScplcvRHX7o7XK88SFb5mddo8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12921'),
