  ('955600039598520273', 'Strange Confession', 1945, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'John Hoffman, Bernard B. Brown, Maury Gertsman', 'M. Coates Webster', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Brenda Joyce, J. Carrol Naish, Milburn Stone, Lloyd Bridges, Addison Richards, Mary Gordon, Christian Rub', null, 'A scientist who is working on a cure for influenza is victimized by his unscrupulous boss, who releases the vaccine before it''s ready, resulting in the death of the scientist''s son.', 'A scientist who is working on a cure for influenza is victimized by his unscrupulous boss, who releases the vaccine before it''s ready, resulting in the death of the scientist''s son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAm963eBAGWsDooujlD5r1rIGcc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29241'),
