  ('390823768853023878', 'Strange Days', 1995, 'Crime, Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kathryn Bigelow, Matthew F. Leonetti, Albert Cho', 'Jay Cocks, James Cameron', 'Ralph Fiennes, Angela Bassett, Juliette Lewis, Tom Sizemore, Michael Wincott, Vincent D''Onofrio, Glenn Plummer, Brigitte Bako', 'R', 'In the last days of 1999, ex-cop turned street hustler Lenny Nero receives a disc which contains the memories of the murder of a prostitute. With the help of bodyguard Mace, he starts to investigate and is pulled deeper and deeper in a whirl of murder, blackmail and intrigue.', 'In the last days of 1999, ex-cop turned street hustler Lenny Nero receives a disc which contains the memories of the murder of a prostitute. With the help of bodyguard Mace, he starts to investigate and is pulled deeper and deeper in a whirl of murder, blackmail and intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rY5BrDRcYAKE0BYmmT66YG6Uy5Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281'),
  ('1715792266055938', 'Strange Desire of Mr. Bard', 1954, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Géza von Radványi, Marcel Camus, Léonce-Henri Burel', 'René Barjavel', 'Michel Simon, Louis de Funès, Yves Deniaud, Geneviève Page, Georgette Anys, Paul Demange, Paul Frankeur, Henri Arius', null, 'A terminally ill Mr. Bard, a casino bus driver forced to quit his job, miraculously wins a fortune playing roulette. Instantly becoming a millionaire, he wants to fulfill his life''s dream: to become a father. This plan is opposed by his greedy relatives who would go any low to take this money away from him. They are being led by a small-time crook. Mr. Bard''s natural shyness and good heart lead him to the journey of self-exploration and finding his true love.', 'A terminally ill Mr. Bard, a casino bus driver forced to quit his job, miraculously wins a fortune playing roulette. Instantly becoming a millionaire, he wants to fulfill his life''s dream: to become a father. This plan is opposed by his greedy relatives who would go any low to take this money away from him. They are being led by a small-time crook. Mr. Bard''s natural shyness and good heart lead him to the journey of self-exploration and finding his true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3giYzy24nSHjMj2Ow1MYCs0dij4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95652'),
