  ('64343168127674421', 'Strange Hair Salon', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Han Dong-Ho', null, 'Lee Sin-ho, Jung Won-II, Lee Chae-dam', null, 'Mi Na opens her new beauty salon. However, Mi Na doesn''t reseive customers even though she has opend her salon for a while. Therefore, she tries to attract customers by implementing a sexy concept, which proves to be a jackpot.', 'Mi Na opens her new beauty salon. However, Mi Na doesn''t reseive customers even though she has opend her salon for a while. Therefore, she tries to attract customers by implementing a sexy concept, which proves to be a jackpot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqSZAGnEh1ntFnKFBDACh7YUOwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387820'),
