  ('55807093139971003', 'Strange Impersonation', 1946, 'Romance, Thriller, Drama', 'Anthony Mann, Robert Pittack, George Loper', 'Mindret Lord', 'Brenda Marshall, William Gargan, Hillary Brooke, George Chandler, Ruth Ford, H.B. Warner, Lyle Talbot, Mary Treen', null, 'A female research scientist conducting experiments on a new anesthetic has a very bad week. Her scheming assistant intentionally scars her face, her almost-fiancee appears to have deserted her and she finds herself being blackmailed by a women she accidentally knocked down with her car.', 'A female research scientist conducting experiments on a new anesthetic has a very bad week. Her scheming assistant intentionally scars her face, her almost-fiancee appears to have deserted her and she finds herself being blackmailed by a women she accidentally knocked down with her car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrPQaDYMzvS4CZkfuGyDreS55jk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30614'),
