  ('439227507300903637', 'Strange Place for an Encounter', 1988, 'Romance', 'François Dupeyron, Charles Van Damme', 'Dominique Faysse, François Dupeyron', 'Catherine Deneuve, Gérard Depardieu, André Wilms, Nathalie Cardone, Jean-Pierre Sentier, Alain Rimoux, Vincent Martin, Philippe Faure', null, 'France is a haughty, bourgeoise wife who is abandoned at the side of the road by her husband after a vicious quarrel. She meets Charles, a doctor. The meeting of the two strangers is the focus of the film, along with their encounters with characters at a truck stop.', 'France is a haughty, bourgeoise wife who is abandoned at the side of the road by her husband after a vicious quarrel. She meets Charles, a doctor. The meeting of the two strangers is the focus of the film, along with their encounters with characters at a truck stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVD0H0jNO7ZKc4zxQ4FePXttrtl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172950'),
  ('618393284119647138', 'Strange Planet', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Emma-Kate Croghan, John Martin, Jessica Turner', 'Emma-Kate Croghan, Stavros Kazantzidis', 'Claudia Karvan, Naomi Watts, Tom Long, Aaron Jeffery, Alice Garner, Felix Williamson, Hugo Weaving, Rebecca Frith', null, 'Alice, Judy and Sally are three Australian roommates who are unlucky in love. Over the course of a year, they endure numerous personal ups and downs. Meanwhile, Ewan, Joel and Neil are friends and coworkers with similar problems, and gradually their lives intersect with the trio of women to varying degrees. Will any of these young people finally find a satisfying relationship?', 'Alice, Judy and Sally are three Australian roommates who are unlucky in love. Over the course of a year, they endure numerous personal ups and downs. Meanwhile, Ewan, Joel and Neil are friends and coworkers with similar problems, and gradually their lives intersect with the trio of women to varying degrees. Will any of these young people finally find a satisfying relationship?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0aMbHfv46Wpl4kMOZAQY0oa1je.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49584'),
  ('1015617819867199408', 'Strange Triangle', 1946, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Ray McCarey, Harry Jackson', 'Mortimer Braus', 'Signe Hasso, Preston Foster, Anabel Shaw, Shepperd Strudwick, Roy Roberts, Emory Parnell, Nancy Evans, Frank Wilcox', 'NR', 'In this drama, a seductive woman uses her wiles upon both a traveling bank examiner and a manager to whom she is married. This woman has expensive taste and ends up spending all of her husband''s money. She then begins trying to seduce the bank examiner, who doesn''t know she is married to the manager.', 'In this drama, a seductive woman uses her wiles upon both a traveling bank examiner and a manager to whom she is married. This woman has expensive taste and ends up spending all of her husband''s money. She then begins trying to seduce the bank examiner, who doesn''t know she is married to the manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NI696cz3NywsC4xpLx1BtHSidV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25498'),
  ('467838949511899808', 'Strange Voyage', 1964, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Juan Estelrich March, José F. Aguayo', 'Pedro Beltrán', 'Carlos Larrañaga, Tota Alba, Lina Canalejas, Rafaela Aparicio, Jesús Franco, Luis Marín, María Luisa Ponte, Sara Lezana', null, 'In a small town near Madrid, Paquita and her brother Venancio, both single and with a childish personality, live under the shadow of their bossy older sister, Ignacia, a grumpy old maid.', 'In a small town near Madrid, Paquita and her brother Venancio, both single and with a childish personality, live under the shadow of their bossy older sister, Ignacia, a grumpy old maid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qR34wM5e8tDuE1u5o1G8alP5AKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162510'),
  ('644809326855412752', 'Strange Way of Life', 2023, 'Drama, Western, Romance', 'Pedro Almodóvar, Luna Frax, Manuel Calvo', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Ethan Hawke, Pedro Pascal, Jason Fernández, José Condessa, Daniel Rived, Sara Sálamo, Manu Ríos, Pedro Casablanc', 'R', 'After 25 years, a former hired gun visits his old colleague, now a small-town sheriff. Their past relationship is explored, as is how they reflect on it in the present.', 'After 25 years, a former hired gun visits his old colleague, now a small-town sheriff. Their past relationship is explored, as is how they reflect on it in the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKOSFVplHUtvjtDEE5N4x8Hs9vL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:963765'),
  ('712213191912818951', 'Strange Wilderness', 2008, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Fred Wolf, David Hennings, John Collins', 'Peter Gaulke, Fred Wolf', 'Steve Zahn, Allen Covert, Jonah Hill, Kevin Heffernan, Ashley Scott, Jeff Garlin, Robert Patrick, Blake Clark', 'R', 'With the ratings dropping for a wilderness-themed TV show, two animal fans go to the Andes in search of Bigfoot.', 'With the ratings dropping for a wilderness-themed TV show, two animal fans go to the Andes in search of Bigfoot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tamhOw4dSgn4lonjZyhEhIt9Wm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14220'),
  ('499648781048582079', 'Strange World', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Paul Aichele, Lisa M. Tse, Rebecca Vallera-Thompson', 'Qui Nguyen', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Dennis Quaid, Jaboukie Young-White, Gabrielle Union, Lucy Liu, Alan Tudyk, Jonathan Melo, Abraham Benrubi', 'PG', 'A journey deep into an uncharted and treacherous land, where fantastical creatures await the legendary Clades—a family of explorers whose differences threaten to topple their latest, and by far most crucial, mission.', 'A journey deep into an uncharted and treacherous land, where fantastical creatures await the legendary Clades—a family of explorers whose differences threaten to topple their latest, and by far most crucial, mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9x70QUXs6uEwtin1SGNKoFXoia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877269'),
  ('370912754690798076', 'Strangeland', 1998, 'Horror', 'John Pieplow, Goran Pavicevic', 'Dee Snider', 'Kevin Gage, Elizabeth Peña, Brett Harrelson, Robert Englund, Linda Cardellini, Tucker Smallwood, Ivonne Coll, Amy Smart', 'R', 'A pierced and tattooed sadist, Captain Howdy, trolls the Internet for naive teens, luring them to his home to torture and defile them. When Howdy kidnaps and tortures the daughter of police Detective Mike Gage, he is caught. Deemed insane, he is sent to an asylum but is released soon after, seemingly better. However, Gage knows it is only a matter of time before Howdy strikes again, and he''s ready to unleash his own form of retribution when the time comes.', 'A pierced and tattooed sadist, Captain Howdy, trolls the Internet for naive teens, luring them to his home to torture and defile them. When Howdy kidnaps and tortures the daughter of police Detective Mike Gage, he is caught. Deemed insane, he is sent to an asylum but is released soon after, seemingly better. However, Gage knows it is only a matter of time before Howdy strikes again, and he''s ready to unleash his own form of retribution when the time comes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhQh5rtPymR1J8daZc0FNXiSkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27791'),
  ('849957234198735361', 'Strangeness', 2022, 'Comedy, History, Drama', 'Maurizio Calvesi, Luca Federico, Roberto Andò', 'Roberto Andò, Ugo Chiti, Massimo Gaudioso', 'Toni Servillo, Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Giulia Andò, Rosario Lisma, Donatella Finocchiaro, Aurora Quattrocchi, Galatea Ranzi', null, 'During a trip to Sicily in 1920, Luigi Pirandello meets two gravediggers-turned-playwrights rehearsing a play with their amateur dramatics. Pirandello takes an interest in the odd couple, having been suffering from writer''s block while working on his eventual masterpiece, Six Characters in Search of an Author.', 'During a trip to Sicily in 1920, Luigi Pirandello meets two gravediggers-turned-playwrights rehearsing a play with their amateur dramatics. Pirandello takes an interest in the odd couple, having been suffering from writer''s block while working on his eventual masterpiece, Six Characters in Search of an Author.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtIhBUq4lnJrZyjuAkshXxW6Txi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:930921'),
  ('424018991499917243', 'Stranger at the Gate', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Joshua Seftel, Karl Schroder', null, 'Bibi Bahrami, Dr. Saber Bahrami, Zaki Bahrami, Captain Kent Kurtz, Dana McKinney, Emily McKinney, Richard ''Mac'' McKinney, Jomo Williams', null, 'A U.S. Marine plots a terrorist attack on a small-town American mosque, but his plan takes an unexpected turn when he comes face to face with the people he sets out to kill.', 'A U.S. Marine plots a terrorist attack on a small-town American mosque, but his plan takes an unexpected turn when he comes face to face with the people he sets out to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGRoSUZxLib49O9xcEvBw9PlEKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964789'),
  ('838380329828676274', 'Stranger by the Lake', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alain Guiraudie, Claire Mathon, Julie Darfeuil', 'Alain Guiraudie', 'Pierre Deladonchamps, Christophe Paou, Patrick d''Assumçao, Jérôme Chappatte, Mathieu Vervisch, Gilbert Traïna, Emmanuel Daumas, Sébastien Badachaoui', 'NR', 'Frank spends his summer days hopelessly searching for companionship at a popular cruising spot on the shores of a lake in rural France. One day, he meets Michel, an attractive yet darkly mysterious man and falls blindly in love.', 'Frank spends his summer days hopelessly searching for companionship at a popular cruising spot on the shores of a lake in rural France. One day, he meets Michel, an attractive yet darkly mysterious man and falls blindly in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ug6IbPt19J8YIW9vh87Xw9FOTaJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186992'),
  ('314350926050934899', 'Stranger Eyes', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Yeo Siew Hua, Hideho Urata', 'Yeo Siew Hua', 'Wu Chien-ho, Lee Kang-sheng, Anicca Panna, Vera Chen, Pete Teo, Xenia Tan, Maryanne Ng-Yew, Mila Troncoso', null, 'After the mysterious disappearance of their baby daughter, a young couple receives strange videos and realizes someone has been filming their daily life — even in their most intimate moments. The police set up surveillance around their home to catch the voyeur but the family starts to crumble as secrets unravel under the scrutiny of eyes watching them from all sides.', 'After the mysterious disappearance of their baby daughter, a young couple receives strange videos and realizes someone has been filming their daily life — even in their most intimate moments. The police set up surveillance around their home to catch the voyeur but the family starts to crumble as secrets unravel under the scrutiny of eyes watching them from all sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9y0JRUl4W05enkZwq9dRBKWOK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:948184'),
  ('115585113544000765', 'Stranger from Venus', 1954, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Burt Balaban, Kenneth Talbot, Barry Delmaine', 'Hans Jacoby', 'Patricia Neal, Helmut Dantine, Derek Bond, Cyril Luckham, Willoughby Gray, Marigold Russell, Arthur Young, Kenneth Edwards', 'NR', 'Stranger from Venus (a.k.a. Immediate Disaster and The Venusian) is the story of a woman who meets a stranger with no pulse who has the power of life and death at his touch. He is here from Venus to warn Earth about the atom.', 'Stranger from Venus (a.k.a. Immediate Disaster and The Venusian) is the story of a woman who meets a stranger with no pulse who has the power of life and death at his touch. He is here from Venus to warn Earth about the atom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gb4z8qoKAHLoVX6KnXQK4SdgrDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116210'),
  ('857241254614971822', 'Stranger in My Bed', 1987, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Larry Elikann, Rob Cowan, Casey Grant', null, 'Lindsay Wagner, Armand Assante, Doug Sheehan, Allyn Ann McLerie, Gabriel Damon, R.H. Thomson, Alyson Court, Campbell Lane', null, 'A woman gets amnesia after an accident, and doesn''t remember her life, including her husband. While she tries to recall, she meets a man and begins a relationship with him.', 'A woman gets amnesia after an accident, and doesn''t remember her life, including her husband. While she tries to recall, she meets a man and begins a relationship with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8snG7fRANgVT6H4KLxrUFctY0Yi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195754'),
  ('101308486891839347', 'Stranger in My Pocket', 2018, 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 'Can Deniz Atıcı, Tugçe Koçyigit, Tugba Yigitcan', 'Rolando Ravello, Paola Mammini, Filippo Bologna', 'Belçim Bilgin, Buğra Gülsoy, Çağlar Çorumlu, Leyla Lydia Tuğutlu, Serkan Altunorak, Şükrü Özyıldız, Şebnem Bozoklu', null, 'The seven old friends decide to come together for dinner. Everyone is seated at the table, chatting, eating laughing accompaniment. During the meal, it is decided to play a game. The game is pretty simple; everyone will put their phones on the desk, every incoming message and notification will be read aloud. Their relationship begins to deteriorate. The group who thinks they are very close friends for so long are in fact alien to each other.', 'The seven old friends decide to come together for dinner. Everyone is seated at the table, chatting, eating laughing accompaniment. During the meal, it is decided to play a game. The game is pretty simple; everyone will put their phones on the desk, every incoming message and notification will be read aloud. Their relationship begins to deteriorate. The group who thinks they are very close friends for so long are in fact alien to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iWCVSE8nXpSZ3EnAGuPz3Bp6WH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497179'),
  ('894447439803788623', 'Stranger in Our House', 1979, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Wes Craven, William B. Jurgensen', null, 'Linda Blair, Lee Purcell, Jeremy Slate, Jeff McCracken, Jeff East, Carol Lawrence, Macdonald Carey, Fran Drescher', 'PG-13', 'A country family of five take in charming cousin Julie, whose parents recently died in a car crash, though teenaged daughter Rachel grows suspect that she has an alternative agenda; one that possibly includes witchcraft.', 'A country family of five take in charming cousin Julie, whose parents recently died in a car crash, though teenaged daughter Rachel grows suspect that she has an alternative agenda; one that possibly includes witchcraft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgyK4IzdzgTWUuBkjpPeDYgsJqz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37938'),
  ('1126811627257853582', 'Stranger in the House', 1967, 'Crime, Drama', 'Pierre Rouve, Kenneth Higgins', 'Pierre Rouve', 'James Mason, Geraldine Chaplin, Bobby Darin, Paul Bertoya, Ian Ogilvy, Bryan Stanion, Pippa Steel, Clive Morton', 'NR', 'John Sawyer, once an eminent barrister, has slid into a life of cynicism and drunkenness since his wife left him. When his daughter''s boyfriend is accused of murder, Sawyer decides to try to pull himself together and defend him in court.', 'John Sawyer, once an eminent barrister, has slid into a life of cynicism and drunkenness since his wife left him. When his daughter''s boyfriend is accused of murder, Sawyer decides to try to pull himself together and defend him in court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCFeKNJqu5RFTEHpjlfjvI60LKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221449'),
  ('1024600572300271398', 'Stranger in the House', 1968, 'Horror', 'Alfredo Zacarías', 'Alfredo Zacarías, Miguel Zacarías', 'Evita, Joselo, Roy Jenson, Rosenda Monteros, Ofelia Montesco, René Cardona, Arturo Castro ''Bigotón'', José Loza', null, 'An American serial killer, known for his handiwork with a straight razor, manages to escape while being transported in Mexico and hides out inside a publisher''s home, where he claims many more victims.', 'An American serial killer, known for his handiwork with a straight razor, manages to escape while being transported in Mexico and hides out inside a publisher''s home, where he claims many more victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8UoKbKTRIFMxMndL5LyqpMrTTy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447229'),
  ('428070193857052461', 'Stranger in the House', 1992, 'Drama', 'Jean-Yves Le Mener, Georges Lautner', 'Jean Lartéguy, Bernard Stora, Georges Lautner', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Renée Faure, Cristiana Réali, Sébastien Tavel, François Perrot, Geneviève Page, Sandrine Kiberlain, Benoît Le Pecq', null, 'Since the suicide of his wife, Jacques Loursat has gone downhill. Estranged from his daughter, his lawyer''s pratice in ruins, he consoles himself with drink. One night he is woken by a gunshot and catches sight of a young man fleeing the house. Isabelle, his daughter, claims to know nothing about it, even when he finds the body of a young man. Isabelle hangs around with a gang of spoiled young people who have no shortage of money, and is in love with Joel, an ambitious boy involved in drug dealing. Antoine, from a more modest background, is in love with her. When the police start investigating Joel''s murder, Antoine becomes the ideal suspect.', 'Since the suicide of his wife, Jacques Loursat has gone downhill. Estranged from his daughter, his lawyer''s pratice in ruins, he consoles himself with drink. One night he is woken by a gunshot and catches sight of a young man fleeing the house. Isabelle, his daughter, claims to know nothing about it, even when he finds the body of a young man. Isabelle hangs around with a gang of spoiled young people who have no shortage of money, and is in love with Joel, an ambitious boy involved in drug dealing. Antoine, from a more modest background, is in love with her. When the police start investigating Joel''s murder, Antoine becomes the ideal suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDRoPO5Z63KG9hyuamL8ccRLM8B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81042'),
  ('1018285866939836040', 'Stranger in the Woods', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adam Newacheck, Travis Prow', 'Holly Kenney', 'Holly Kenney, Brendin Brown, Paris Nicole, Radek Antczak, Teddy Spencer, Devon Deshaun Stewart', null, 'Olivia and her friends go on a vacation. After Olivia nearly drowns with a slit wrist in her bathtub after her fiancé''s funeral, her friends suspect that she tried to kill herself, but she believes someone attacked her.', 'Olivia and her friends go on a vacation. After Olivia nearly drowns with a slit wrist in her bathtub after her fiancé''s funeral, her friends suspect that she tried to kill herself, but she believes someone attacked her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcrbiVMOkAaOyha8BqyVDQCTwh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175038'),
  ('828446400487649002', 'Stranger on Horseback', 1955, 'Western', 'Jacques Tourneur, Ray Rennahan', 'Don Martin, Herb Meadow', 'Joel McCrea, Miroslava, Kevin McCarthy, John McIntire, John Carradine, Nancy Gates, Emile Meyer, Robert Cornthwaite', 'NR', 'A circuit judge in the old west attempts to bring a suspected killer to justice. The judge runs afoul of the killer''s rich cattle baron father in the process.', 'A circuit judge in the old west attempts to bring a suspected killer to justice. The judge runs afoul of the killer''s rich cattle baron father in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3mtLA2jQIYCdxRxOC6KB9v5O2p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109376'),
