  ('839148352191104489', 'Stranger on the Run', 1967, 'TV Movie, Western', 'Don Siegel, Earl J. Bellamy', null, 'Henry Fonda, Anne Baxter, Michael Parks, Dan Duryea, Sal Mineo, Lloyd Bochner, Michael Burns, Tom Reese', 'NR', 'A drifter finds himself wrongly accused of murder by a power-crazed sheriff. The sheriff gives him a horse, some supplies, and a one-hour head start into the desert before sending his murderous posse after him.', 'A drifter finds himself wrongly accused of murder by a power-crazed sheriff. The sheriff gives him a horse, some supplies, and a one-hour head start into the desert before sending his murderous posse after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pEzu77gmRXadlsgmsXaFKcQjNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121713'),
  ('682073661901235657', 'Stranger on the Third Floor', 1940, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Nicholas Musuraca, Boris Ingster', 'Nathanael West', 'Peter Lorre, John McGuire, Margaret Tallichet, Charles Waldron, Elisha Cook Jr., Charles Halton, Ethel Griffies, Cliff Clark', null, 'Newspaper reporter Michael Ward plunges into a nightmare of guilt, fearing that his "evidence" has sentenced the wrong man to death.', 'Newspaper reporter Michael Ward plunges into a nightmare of guilt, fearing that his "evidence" has sentenced the wrong man to death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovJx3qRt83keSwZ8Cax1wyRc3Lb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29481'),
  ('85740773094723786', 'Stranger Than Fiction', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Marc Forster, Michael Lerman, Peter Thorell', 'Zach Helm', 'Will Ferrell, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Dustin Hoffman, Emma Thompson, Queen Latifah, Tony Hale, Tom Hulce, Linda Hunt', 'PG-13', 'Harold Crick is a lonely IRS agent whose mundane existence is transformed when he hears a mysterious voice narrating his life.', 'Harold Crick is a lonely IRS agent whose mundane existence is transformed when he hears a mysterious voice narrating his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCzcepubwShvZ4vbCsygQNgF2Z1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1262'),
  ('157305032918589403', 'Stranger Than Paradise', 1983, null, 'Jim Jarmusch', null, 'John Lurie, Eszter Balint, Richard Edson', null, '30-minute short subject film that would become Stranger Than Paradise. This short was released as a standalone film in 1982, and shown as "Stranger Than Paradise" at the 1983 International Film Festival Rotterdam. When it was later expanded into a three-act feature, that name was appropriated for the feature itself, and the initial segment was renamed "The New World".', '30-minute short subject film that would become Stranger Than Paradise. This short was released as a standalone film in 1982, and shown as "Stranger Than Paradise" at the 1983 International Film Festival Rotterdam. When it was later expanded into a three-act feature, that name was appropriated for the feature itself, and the initial segment was renamed "The New World".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6UvfMk1vWiX2eQgWOlAqIqlCV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410051'),
  ('950840913622858681', 'Stranger Than Paradise', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jim Jarmusch, Tom DiCillo', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'John Lurie, Eszter Balint, Richard Edson, Cecillia Stark, Danny Rosen, Rammellzee, Tom DiCillo, Richard Boes', 'R', 'New York layabout Willie forms an unexpected bond with his young Hungarian cousin Eva when she pays him a surprise visit. Later, Eva moves in with their aunt in Cleveland, and Willie takes his best friend Eddie to see her—a visit that culminates in a strange, eventful trip to Florida.', 'New York layabout Willie forms an unexpected bond with his young Hungarian cousin Eva when she pays him a surprise visit. Later, Eva moves in with their aunt in Cleveland, and Willie takes his best friend Eddie to see her—a visit that culminates in a strange, eventful trip to Florida.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYlx0msjh4E74syleTXueWIOxC9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469'),
  ('455736030785143752', 'Stranger Things', 2013, 'Drama', 'Eleanor Burke, Ron Eyal, Eleanor Burke', 'Eleanor Burke, Ron Eyal', 'Bridget Collins, Adeel Akhtar, Vivienne Burke, Victoria Jeffrey, Kim Joyce, Keith Parry, Rebecca Ward, Taran Wiseman', null, 'Oona, a recent graduate in anthropology, has returned to her dead mother’s seaside cottage in southern England to prepare it for sale. Her arrival disturbs Mani, a wary vagrant who has been squatting on the property.', 'Oona, a recent graduate in anthropology, has returned to her dead mother’s seaside cottage in southern England to prepare it for sale. Her arrival disturbs Mani, a wary vagrant who has been squatting on the property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TKdguyacjYrC1Hnbi3PjSP8r3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182026'),
  ('256908930562539783', 'Strangerland', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Peter Beeh, Kim Farrant, P.J. Dillon', 'Michael Kinirons, Fiona Seres', 'Nicole Kidman, Joseph Fiennes, Hugo Weaving, Lisa Flanagan, Megan Alston, Maddison Brown, Meyne Wyatt, Sean Keenan', 'R', 'Newly arrived to a remote desert town, Catherine and Matthew are tormented by a suspicion when their two teenage children mysteriously vanish.', 'Newly arrived to a remote desert town, Catherine and Matthew are tormented by a suspicion when their two teenage children mysteriously vanish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aqx7cDELYw5ZEZkS4EhyjnXXBV0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245846'),
  ('357745498792515395', 'Strangers', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Aanand L. Rai', 'Himanshu Sharma, Gaurav S. Sinha', 'Kay Kay Menon, Jimmy Shergill, Sonali Kulkarni, Nandana Sen, Kitu Gidwani', null, 'An overnight train journey, from London into France, business class, is comfortable and expensive. The premise where two of the film''s protagonists,''strangers'' to each other, meet, talk and decide to eliminate each other''s spouses to alleviate themselves of the hell they are trapped in.', 'An overnight train journey, from London into France, business class, is comfortable and expensive. The premise where two of the film''s protagonists,''strangers'' to each other, meet, talk and decide to eliminate each other''s spouses to alleviate themselves of the hell they are trapped in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gy5tR9A9oAXB79zV6Q2crzCB9tP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488216'),
  ('937283621317140234', 'Strangers', 2024, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Tony Dean Smith, Ivan Vatsov, Galina Kyuchukova', 'Steven Paul', 'Sienna Guillory, Jon Voight, Jamie Bamber, Emmett J. Scanlan, Alex Blake, Euan Macnaughton, Antoni Davidov, Kate Nichols', 'R', 'Seeking revenge on her abusive husband, a woman''s life takes a dark turn when she meets a mysterious hitman. Drawn into a whirlwind romance, she spirals into a dangerous vigilante spree. As the body count rises, she begins to unravel the true nature of her partner and the secrets they both conceal.', 'Seeking revenge on her abusive husband, a woman''s life takes a dark turn when she meets a mysterious hitman. Drawn into a whirlwind romance, she spirals into a dangerous vigilante spree. As the body count rises, she begins to unravel the true nature of her partner and the secrets they both conceal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6hYeC1asK2ZRU7Ygukn4tV1zlS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1326878'),
  ('210892825897669885', 'Strangers by Night', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alex Lutz, Thomas Santucci, Éponine Momenceau', 'Alex Lutz, Karin Viard', 'Alex Lutz, Karin Viard, Jérôme Pouly, Noémie de Lattre, Kenza Fortas, Nicole Calfan, Ludivine de Chastenet, Marco Luraschi', null, 'In a crowded subway train, a woman pushes a man. They argue. Their little joust "barks loudly", but does not lack charm... Later, in the corridors of the station, the two strangers make love awkwardly in the booth of a photo booth. At last, on the surface, they will say goodbye...', 'In a crowded subway train, a woman pushes a man. They argue. Their little joust "barks loudly", but does not lack charm... Later, in the corridors of the station, the two strangers make love awkwardly in the booth of a photo booth. At last, on the surface, they will say goodbye...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suZCNSLiZQ0YeAZL2CzYpfPwP5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000409'),
  ('476882787588320165', 'Strangers in the House', 1942, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Henri Decoin, Jules Kruger', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot', 'Raimu, Juliette Faber, Gabrielle Fontan, Héléna Manson, Tania Fédor, Marguerite Ducouret, Jean Tissier, Jacques Baumer', null, 'Loursat, a lawyer, lives with his daughter Nicole in a sinister and vast bourgeois residence. Abandoned for nearly twenty years by his wife, the brilliant lawyer has sunk into alcoholism and his relationship with his daughter is virtually non-existent. However, one day the corpse of a stranger is discovered in the residence of Loursat. Nicole, who frequents a gang of young people who escape boredom by stealing cars and other objects, is immediately suspected.', 'Loursat, a lawyer, lives with his daughter Nicole in a sinister and vast bourgeois residence. Abandoned for nearly twenty years by his wife, the brilliant lawyer has sunk into alcoholism and his relationship with his daughter is virtually non-existent. However, one day the corpse of a stranger is discovered in the residence of Loursat. Nicole, who frequents a gang of young people who escape boredom by stealing cars and other objects, is immediately suspected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KmXdqNnAoAKOQgXaJtb6geaU7g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65532'),
  ('61082655625166018', 'Strangers in the Night', 1944, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Anthony Mann, Reggie Lanning, Joe Dill', 'Bryant Ford, Paul Gangelin', 'William Terry, Virginia Grey, Helene Thimig, Edith Barrett, Anne O''Neal, Audley Anderson, Jimmie Lucas, Roy Butler', 'NR', 'In this Gothic tale, a returning WW2 vet goes looking for a small-town girl whom he knows only from letters. It’s the pretext for an off-beat treatment of sexual frustration morphing into a dangerous delusion, and eventually murder.', 'In this Gothic tale, a returning WW2 vet goes looking for a small-town girl whom he knows only from letters. It’s the pretext for an off-beat treatment of sexual frustration morphing into a dangerous delusion, and eventually murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1J1PqjFn3JLUokbk7mluv0jDvor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42885'),
  ('707130584469913906', 'Strangers in the Night', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Sol Lopatín, Alejandro Montiel', 'Daniel Cúparo, Alejandro Montiel, Mili Roque Pitt', 'Diego Torres, Julieta Zylberberg, Fabián Vena, Ludovico Di Santo, Laura Conforte, Alexia Moyano, Betiana Blum, Daniel Rabinovich', null, 'When Martín and Sol try to solve the enigma of a missing neighbor, they will discover that nothing is what it seems, that your hearing can trick you just like your imagination and that your heart is a double-edged weapon.', 'When Martín and Sol try to solve the enigma of a missing neighbor, they will discover that nothing is what it seems, that your hearing can trick you just like your imagination and that your heart is a double-edged weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcw87I2CpGHhrY8toHmNkb6UjHF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154083'),
  ('740217067321241631', 'Strangers in the Park', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Juan José Campanella, Miguel P. Gilaberte', 'Juan José Campanella', 'Eduardo Blanco, Luis Brandoni, Verónica Pelaccini, Agustín Aristarán, Manuela Menéndez, Matías Alarcón', null, 'A former communist militant and a "live and let live" man form an unlikely friendship on a park bench, sharing their life stories with humor and heart.', 'A former communist militant and a "live and let live" man form an unlikely friendship on a park bench, sharing their life stories with humor and heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b09A92ZuTH5RRIdIeM16kXIgl8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1631485'),
  ('400236363566059666', 'Strangers May Kiss', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'George Fitzmaurice, Douglas Shearer, William H. Daniels', null, 'Norma Shearer, Robert Montgomery, Neil Hamilton, Marjorie Rambeau, Irene Rich, Hale Hamilton, Albert Conti, Jed Prouty', 'NR', 'After years of fighting off the advances of her old flame Steve, Lisbeth settles into a steamy, casual romance with journalist Alan. Against the advice of her happily married aunt Celia -- who encourages her to demand a serious commitment -- Lisbeth continues to see Alan, even after she hears he may have a wife in France. When Alan''s work sends him abroad, a lovesick Lisbeth struggles to understand her feelings.', 'After years of fighting off the advances of her old flame Steve, Lisbeth settles into a steamy, casual romance with journalist Alan. Against the advice of her happily married aunt Celia -- who encourages her to demand a serious commitment -- Lisbeth continues to see Alan, even after she hears he may have a wife in France. When Alan''s work sends him abroad, a lovesick Lisbeth struggles to understand her feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQzbsb5ldVq97feSIncfy49vpYk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120844'),
  ('1141187711243697791', 'Strangers of the Evening', 1932, 'Mystery, Comedy, Horror', 'H. Bruce Humberstone, Arthur Edeson', null, 'Zasu Pitts, Lucien Littlefield, Eugene Pallette, Tully Marshall, Miriam Seegar, Theodore von Eltz, Warner Richmond, Mahlon Hamilton', 'NR', 'Bodies start mysteriously disappearing from the city morgue. An investigator tries to determine what is going on.', 'Bodies start mysteriously disappearing from the city morgue. An investigator tries to determine what is going on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KQm5vn66xmf79QYIUDoZ2deQgQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156450'),
  ('1072031037668188795', 'Strangers When We Meet', 1960, 'Romance, Drama', 'Richard Quine, Charles Lang', 'Evan Hunter', 'Kirk Douglas, Kim Novak, Barbara Rush, Ernie Kovacs, Walter Matthau, Virginia Bruce, John Bryant, Kent Smith', 'NR', 'A suburban architect loves his wife but is bored with his marriage and with his work, so he takes up with the neglected, married beauty who lives down the street.', 'A suburban architect loves his wife but is bored with his marriage and with his work, so he takes up with the neglected, married beauty who lives down the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fGmqmBjkvnwCE188L8IdYztKnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85926'),
  ('988828793543020415', 'Strangers When We Meet', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Zhang Guoli, Chao Ming', 'Liu Zhenyun, Ye Hao', 'Fan Wei, Zhou Dongyu, Song Jia, Mao Hai, Fan Tiantian, Yang Haoyu, Deng Fei, Lei Wang', null, 'After serving 30 years in prison, Lao Qin starts a new life with 1.5 million compensation from the government for demolition and relocation. He just wants to marry a wife and have children to live in peace, but his life is completely changed with the intrusion of the eccentric 24-year-old girl Chang Juan.', 'After serving 30 years in prison, Lao Qin starts a new life with 1.5 million compensation from the government for demolition and relocation. He just wants to marry a wife and have children to live in peace, but his life is completely changed with the intrusion of the eccentric 24-year-old girl Chang Juan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80gNAYpcICOKGrnuUbbX4EELQeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:824117'),
  ('300013920757132576', 'Strangers with Candy', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Paul Dinello, Oliver Bokelberg', 'Stephen Colbert, Paul Dinello, Amy Sedaris', 'Amy Sedaris, Stephen Colbert, Paul Dinello, Greg Hollimon, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Ian Holm, Chandra Wilson, Deborah Rush', 'R', 'A prequel to the critically acclaimed series featuring Jerri Blank, a 46 year old ex-junkie, ex-con who returns to high school in a bid to start her life over.', 'A prequel to the critically acclaimed series featuring Jerri Blank, a 46 year old ex-junkie, ex-con who returns to high school in a bid to start her life over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPx4aELIbpf6ZRdHPmBH5h5Qs95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13141'),
  ('407100397320391549', 'Strangled', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, Horror', 'Árpád Sopsits, Gábor Szabó', 'Árpád Sopsits', 'Károly Hajduk, Gábor Jászberényi, Zsolt Anger, Mónika Balsai, Piroska Móga, Eszter Csépai, Péter Bárnai, Zsolt Trill', null, 'A psychotic killer is on the prowl, who continues to slaughter young women while an innocent man is wrongly accused and sentenced for crimes he could never have committed. A determined detective arrives on the scene and soon becomes obsessed with the case while under pressure from the prosecutor to see a man hang.', 'A psychotic killer is on the prowl, who continues to slaughter young women while an innocent man is wrongly accused and sentenced for crimes he could never have committed. A determined detective arrives on the scene and soon becomes obsessed with the case while under pressure from the prosecutor to see a man hang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYj4YNq8Pfmqj8lJvhtA7ooiULr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426958'),
  ('792259691505814908', 'Strangled Eggs', 1961, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Julie Bennett', null, 'Foghorn Leghorn courts Miss Prissy when a foundling is left on her doorstep. It is Henery the Chicken Hawk.', 'Foghorn Leghorn courts Miss Prissy when a foundling is left on her doorstep. It is Henery the Chicken Hawk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiY81ZQuxrMTBrmroxEwe6hITmQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234696'),
  ('518965016491026498', 'Strangled Lives', 1996, 'Drama', 'Ricky Tognazzi, Alessio Gelsini Torresi', 'Graziano Diana, Francesco Taurisano, Simona Izzo', 'Vincent Lindon, Sabrina Ferilli, Luca Zingaretti, Ricky Memphis, Lina Sastri, Francesco Venditti, Violante Placido, Vittorio Amandola', null, 'Francesco is an entrepreneur in the building industry. His company is near to collapse if it doesn''t win a deal to build a new school complex. It needs at least 60 million liras to participate to the deal, but all the banks refuse to lend the money. A corrupt bank employee introduces him to Claudio, apparently an assistant of Sergio, Francesco''s old school friend. Sergio is an accountant available to lend Francesco the money he needs. Francesco wins the deal, but soon he discovers that Claudio is not what he says.', 'Francesco is an entrepreneur in the building industry. His company is near to collapse if it doesn''t win a deal to build a new school complex. It needs at least 60 million liras to participate to the deal, but all the banks refuse to lend the money. A corrupt bank employee introduces him to Claudio, apparently an assistant of Sergio, Francesco''s old school friend. Sergio is an accountant available to lend Francesco the money he needs. Francesco wins the deal, but soon he discovers that Claudio is not what he says.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gp1jZ8IZQoSNzYhBqvdts6kMjlT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123495'),
  ('607525633577256805', 'Strangler of the Swamp', 1946, 'Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Frank Wisbar', 'Frank Wisbar', 'Rosemary La Planche, Robert Barrat, Blake Edwards, Charles Middleton, Effie Laird, Nolan Leary, Frank Conlan, Therese Lyon', 'NR', 'A number of swamp land men have died by strangulation and the inhabitants believe that an innocent man they hanged is seeking revenge on all of the male descendants of those responsible for his death. Maria, granddaughter of the innocent ferryman, decides to operate the ferry service. Chris Sanders, a son of one of the men who did the hanging, and Maria fall in love. The "strangler" seizes Chris and Maria offers her life if Chris is spared.', 'A number of swamp land men have died by strangulation and the inhabitants believe that an innocent man they hanged is seeking revenge on all of the male descendants of those responsible for his death. Maria, granddaughter of the innocent ferryman, decides to operate the ferry service. Chris Sanders, a son of one of the men who did the hanging, and Maria fall in love. The "strangler" seizes Chris and Maria offers her life if Chris is spared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUwRgxKVmtASaIheIM2QjB6DJnc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29468'),
  ('514332726259195373', 'Strangler vs Strangler', 1984, 'Comedy, Thriller, Horror', 'Slobodan Šijan', 'Nebojša Pajkić, Slobodan Šijan', 'Taško Načić, Srđan Šaper, Rahela Ferari, Nikola Simić, Sonja Savić, Branislav Zeremski, Jelisaveta Sablić, Radmila Savićević', null, 'When it comes to crime, Belgrade is same as any other modern metropolis, except for having its own serial killers. That blank is filled when a flower salesman begins strangling women. A popular, but very disturbed rock star soon becomes telepathically connected with the killer.', 'When it comes to crime, Belgrade is same as any other modern metropolis, except for having its own serial killers. That blank is filled when a flower salesman begins strangling women. A popular, but very disturbed rock star soon becomes telepathically connected with the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKMD2Iki6tpiwfWw1sd0dnkewgN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15203'),
  ('852429798845285704', 'Strapped', 1993, 'Drama, Action, TV Movie', 'Forest Whitaker, James McMillan', 'Dena Kleiman', 'Michael Biehn, Bokeem Woodbine, Kia Goodwin, William James Stiggers Jr., Chi Ali, Starletta DuPois, Isaiah Washington, Fredro Starr', null, 'Ex-con attempting to go straight runs across serious problems. His girlfriend gets arrested for dealing crack to an undercover police officer. In a desperate attempt to get the charges dropped against his woman, he strikes a deal with a weapons cop to turn in local gun dealers. However, the D.A. is not satisfied with the results, resulting in some serious game playing and double crossing.', 'Ex-con attempting to go straight runs across serious problems. His girlfriend gets arrested for dealing crack to an undercover police officer. In a desperate attempt to get the charges dropped against his woman, he strikes a deal with a weapons cop to turn in local gun dealers. However, the D.A. is not satisfied with the results, resulting in some serious game playing and double crossing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txcj4qo5wJ1Vdv0jLCL8Bl1hzU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26479'),
  ('796067330842617940', 'Strasbourg 1518', 2020, 'Music', 'Jonathan Glazer, Darius Khondji', 'Jonathan Glazer', 'Andrey Berezin, Botis Seva, Ditta Miranda Jasjfi, Germaine Acogny, Jamila Johnson-Small, Kaori Ito, Nazareth Panadero, Oleg Stepanov', null, 'Inspired by a powerful involuntary mania which took hold of citizens in the city of Strasbourg just over five hundred years ago, this film is a collaboration in isolation with some of the greatest dancers working today.', 'Inspired by a powerful involuntary mania which took hold of citizens in the city of Strasbourg just over five hundred years ago, this film is a collaboration in isolation with some of the greatest dancers working today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMKUZOtfjcWqOzWSJZoK24kctg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:722815'),
  ('716054226859827500', 'Strategic Air Command', 1955, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Anthony Mann, William H. Daniels', 'Valentine Davies, Beirne Lay Jr.', 'James Stewart, June Allyson, Frank Lovejoy, Barry Sullivan, Alex Nicol, Bruce Bennett, Jay C. Flippen, James Millican', 'NR', 'Air Force reservist Lt. Col. Robert "Dutch" Holland is recalled into active duty at the peak of his professional baseball career.', 'Air Force reservist Lt. Col. Robert "Dutch" Holland is recalled into active duty at the peak of his professional baseball career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nchi3AbPuRox08MedoDpaHvdeQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61880'),
  ('1123897446442784441', 'Strategic Command', 1997, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Rick Jacobson, Gary Graver, Larry Poindexter', 'Tripp Reed, Sean McGinly', 'Michael Dudikoff, Richard Norton, Paul Winfield, Amanda Wyss, Jsu Garcia, Robin Lange, Gina Mari, Stephen Quadros', null, 'Rick Harding is a former Marines officer, now working in the FBI as a chemical weapons designer. While packing up for the night, a group of armed soldiers led by wanted criminal Carlos Gruber, break into the FBI research lab. They steal large amounts of a newly created germ warfare chemical called Bromax-360, loosing two of their men in the process before escaping into the night.', 'Rick Harding is a former Marines officer, now working in the FBI as a chemical weapons designer. While packing up for the night, a group of armed soldiers led by wanted criminal Carlos Gruber, break into the FBI research lab. They steal large amounts of a newly created germ warfare chemical called Bromax-360, loosing two of their men in the process before escaping into the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sm4GAuVc07hU7Oj6DgPnWCIRcHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80846'),
  ('339920718995315487', 'Stratosphere Girl', 2004, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Michael Mieke, Matthias X. Oberg', 'Matthias X. Oberg', 'Chloé Winkel, Tara Elders, Filip Peeters, Burt Kwouk, Tuva Novotny, Jon Yang, Rebecca Palmer, Linda Steinhoff', null, 'Angela is a French art student living in Germany who loves to draw comics and creates elaborate tales drawn in a soft and romantic style. One night, Angela meets Yamamoto, a club DJ from Japan, who invites her to come to Tokyo with him. Infatuated with Yamamoto, Angela impulsively agrees, and is soon sharing an apartment with a handful of Western expatriates who work at a nightclub where Japanese businessmen drink, sing karaoke, and date the "hostesses" for a fee.', 'Angela is a French art student living in Germany who loves to draw comics and creates elaborate tales drawn in a soft and romantic style. One night, Angela meets Yamamoto, a club DJ from Japan, who invites her to come to Tokyo with him. Infatuated with Yamamoto, Angela impulsively agrees, and is soon sharing an apartment with a handful of Western expatriates who work at a nightclub where Japanese businessmen drink, sing karaoke, and date the "hostesses" for a fee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qbhiIPBviYUCfugTv1ysSOBZtY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36353'),
  ('224069098901295182', 'Stratton', 2017, 'Action, Thriller', 'Simon West, Felix Wiedemann, Ben Collins', 'Duncan Falconer, Warren Davis II', 'Dominic Cooper, Gemma Chan, Connie Nielsen, Austin Stowell, Tyler Hoechlin, Tom Felton, Thomas Kretschmann, Derek Jacobi', 'R', 'A British Special Boat Service commando tracks down an international terrorist cell.', 'A British Special Boat Service commando tracks down an international terrorist cell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iH5ioYSYZiWI2cCaYmCikaNcSP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348389'),
  ('971895796473018287', 'STRAW', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Tyler Perry, Kim Taylor-Coleman, Justyn Moro', 'Tyler Perry', 'Taraji P. Henson, Sherri Shepherd, Teyana Taylor, Sinbad, Rockmond Dunbar, Ashley Versher, Mike Merrill, Glynn Turman', 'R', 'What will be her last straw? A devastatingly bad day pushes a hardworking single mother to the breaking point — and into a shocking act of desperation.', 'What will be her last straw? A devastatingly bad day pushes a hardworking single mother to the breaking point — and into a shocking act of desperation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3cmnXYtxJb9vVL1ThvT2CWSe1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1426776'),
  ('307433894906935309', 'Straw Dogs', 1971, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Sam Peckinpah, John Coquillon, Terry Marcel', 'David Zelag Goodman, Sam Peckinpah', 'Dustin Hoffman, Susan George, Peter Vaughan, T. P. McKenna, Del Henney, Jim Norton, Donald Webster, Ken Hutchison', 'R', 'David Sumner, a mild-mannered academic from the United States, marries Amy, an Englishwoman. In order to escape a hectic stateside lifestyle, David and his wife relocate to the small town in rural Cornwall where Amy was raised. There, David is ostracized by the brutish men of the village, including Amy''s old flame, Charlie. Eventually the taunts escalate.', 'David Sumner, a mild-mannered academic from the United States, marries Amy, an Englishwoman. In order to escape a hectic stateside lifestyle, David and his wife relocate to the small town in rural Cornwall where Amy was raised. There, David is ostracized by the brutish men of the village, including Amy''s old flame, Charlie. Eventually the taunts escalate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yigkfHE1OhkxPPrjrV78Y9ibGEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:994'),
  ('368425210990021857', 'Straw Dogs', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rod Lurie, Alik Sakharov, Mark Anthony Little', 'David Zelag Goodman, Sam Peckinpah', 'James Marsden, Kate Bosworth, Alexander Skarsgård, Dominic Purcell, Laz Alonso, Willa Holland, James Woods, Walton Goggins', 'R', 'A young couple moves to a quaint southern town. Soon their perfect getaway turns out to become a living hell when dark secrets and lethal passions spiral out of control.', 'A young couple moves to a quaint southern town. Soon their perfect getaway turns out to become a living hell when dark secrets and lethal passions spiral out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSW5Msz5Cr6vUQxChPSPdxufnss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64639'),
  ('1149002406239967349', 'Strawberry and Chocolate', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tomás Gutiérrez Alea, Juan Carlos Tabío, Mario García Joya', 'Senel Paz', 'Jorge Perugorría, Vladimir Cruz, Mirta Ibarra, Francisco Gattorno, Joel Angelino, Marilyn Solaya, Andrés Cortina, Antonio Carmona', 'R', 'In 1979 Cuba, flamboyant gay artist Diego attempts to seduce straitlaced David, an idealistic young communist, and fails dismally. But David conspires to be "friends" with Diego so he can monitor the artist''s subversive life for the state. As Diego and David discuss politics, individuality and personal expression in Castro''s Cuba, a genuine friendship develops between the two.', 'In 1979 Cuba, flamboyant gay artist Diego attempts to seduce straitlaced David, an idealistic young communist, and fails dismally. But David conspires to be "friends" with Diego so he can monitor the artist''s subversive life for the state. As Diego and David discuss politics, individuality and personal expression in Castro''s Cuba, a genuine friendship develops between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8riS2hGneWg78MHuhP7NqvLERRy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12527'),
  ('25241831018619082', 'Strawberry Bubblegums', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Benjamin Teske, Niklas Lindschau', 'Cherokee Agnew', 'Gloria de Oliveira, André Hennicke, Jasmin Tabatabai, Eva Nürnberg, David Schütter, Ronald Nitschke, Lars Rudolph, Lo Rivera', null, 'After Lucy (17) finds out that she was conceived during a porn shoot she sets out to find her father and meets Udo, a has-been former porn star. Together this unlikely couple go on a journey during which both find more than they bargained for…', 'After Lucy (17) finds out that she was conceived during a porn shoot she sets out to find her father and meets Udo, a has-been former porn star. Together this unlikely couple go on a journey during which both find more than they bargained for…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fA2Hf5KITce8ijSE91YczwfPqyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413313'),
  ('72552847191469782', 'Strawberry in the Supermarket', 2003, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Dušan Krivec, Dušan Milić, Petar Popović', 'Dušan Milić', 'Branka Katić, Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Mirjana Karanović, Nikola Simić, Goran Radaković, Danilo Lazović, Dubravka Mijatović, Zorka Manojlović', null, 'An ex-soldier storms a supermarket and takes all the cashiers captive because one of them insulted his grandmother.', 'An ex-soldier storms a supermarket and takes all the cashiers captive because one of them insulted his grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTiYapRSVVXrFewi1conO0mFVE4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11373'),
  ('906237277819021922', 'Strawberry Mansion', 2021, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Adventure, Romance, Drama', 'Matisse Rifai, Tyler Davis, Albert Birney', 'Albert Birney, Kentucker Audley', 'Penny Fuller, Kentucker Audley, Grace Glowicki, Reed Birney, Linas Phillips, Constance Shulman, Albert Birney, Ephraim Birney', null, 'In the not-too-distant future, an all-seeing surveillance state conducts “dream audits” to collect taxes on the unconscious lives of the populace. Mild-mannered government agent James Preble travels to a remote farmhouse to audit the dreams of Arabella “Bella” Isadora, an eccentric, aging artist. Entering Bella’s vast VHS archive, which contains a lifetime of dreams, Preble stumbles upon a secret that offers him a chance at love—and hope for escape.', 'In the not-too-distant future, an all-seeing surveillance state conducts “dream audits” to collect taxes on the unconscious lives of the populace. Mild-mannered government agent James Preble travels to a remote farmhouse to audit the dreams of Arabella “Bella” Isadora, an eccentric, aging artist. Entering Bella’s vast VHS archive, which contains a lifetime of dreams, Preble stumbles upon a secret that offers him a chance at love—and hope for escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJtBlQIJaioDugwl5ZQbgrMRSi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776561'),
  ('946007030148656255', 'Strawberry Night', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Yuichi Satoh, Toshiyuki Honma', 'Yukari Tatsui', 'Yuko Takeuchi, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Takao Osawa, Keisuke Koide, Takashi Ukaji, Kenichi Endo, Katsuhisa Namase, Renji Ishibashi', null, 'Reiko Himekawa (Yuko Takeuchi) is a female detective at the Metropolitan Police Department. Reiko doesn''t come from an elite background, but she has risen fast through the ranks with hard work. Reiko than becomes involved in a murder case named "Strawberry Night" due to the mysterious use of those words surrounding the case ...', 'Reiko Himekawa (Yuko Takeuchi) is a female detective at the Metropolitan Police Department. Reiko doesn''t come from an elite background, but she has risen fast through the ranks with hard work. Reiko than becomes involved in a murder case named "Strawberry Night" due to the mysterious use of those words surrounding the case ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JXz3c5cCKn4BxQdTMy0XkwAwJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208430'),
  ('691216071231855925', 'Strawberry Road', 1991, 'Drama', 'Koreyoshi Kurahara, Yudai Kato', 'Nobuo Yamada', 'Ken Matsudaira, Mako, Mariska Hargitay, Toshirō Mifune, Norihei Miki, Tamotsu Ishibashi, Pat Morita, Junko Sakurada', null, 'Hisa Ishii and his brother Akira emigrate from Japan to the United States. They settle in rural California and start a strawberry farm, slowly integrating themselves into the life of the community, which includes Japanese-Americans of both lengthy and brief residence.', 'Hisa Ishii and his brother Akira emigrate from Japan to the United States. They settle in rural California and start a strawberry farm, slowly integrating themselves into the life of the community, which includes Japanese-Americans of both lengthy and brief residence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjyC5azNveQsWnDvawNN3qoAX6o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365081'),
