  ('1022342048478481473', 'Strawberry Time', 1978, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rajko Ranfl, Tomislav Pinter', 'Ivan Potrč', 'Irena Kranjc, Roman Goršič, Metod Pevec, Aleksander Krošl, Lidija Kozlovič, Majda Potokar, Jerca Mrzel, Matjaž Turk', null, 'Jagoda Kopriva is a typical teenage girl who hangs out with her friends from school, flirting with boys, quarreling with her parents, and discovering her own sexuality.', 'Jagoda Kopriva is a typical teenage girl who hangs out with her friends from school, flirting with boys, quarreling with her parents, and discovering her own sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkM92S5Y7sHKYwoTmV1ml8DO7Ip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239700'),
