  ('120415621481044044', 'Stray Cat Rock: Delinquent Girl Boss', 1970, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Action, Music', 'Yasuharu Hasebe, Muneo Ueda, Koretsugu Kurahara', 'Hideichi Nagahara', 'Akiko Wada, Meiko Kaji, Tatsuya Fuji, Yosui Inoue, Ken Sanders, Hanako Tokachi, Kōji Wada, Bunjaku Han', null, 'A wandering tough biker girl aids a female delinquent gang in their battles against an all-male Seiyu group over a fixed boxing match.', 'A wandering tough biker girl aids a female delinquent gang in their battles against an all-male Seiyu group over a fixed boxing match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgPfjFNXSlT04uczY45rnc9lNOr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64576'),
  ('693262497336883377', 'Stray Cat Rock: Machine Animal', 1970, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Yasuharu Hasebe, Tatsuro Shigaki, Noboru Tanaka', 'Ryuzo Nakanishi', 'Meiko Kaji, Tatsuya Fuji, Noriko Kurosawa, Bunjaku Han, Mako Ichikawa, Masami Maki, Yuka Ohashi, Takama Sari', null, 'Two Japanese men help a Vietnam war deserter escape from Japan for Sweden. They plan to fund the escape by selling LSD pills. After word of the drug deal gets spread around they find themselves fending off rival gangs.', 'Two Japanese men help a Vietnam war deserter escape from Japan for Sweden. They plan to fund the escape by selling LSD pills. After word of the drug deal gets spread around they find themselves fending off rival gangs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRgzCYptkuADNz7Uu0Pd7Kz88II.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64719'),
  ('272397587391124748', 'Stray Cat Rock: Sex Hunter', 1970, 'Action, Thriller', 'Yasuharu Hasebe, Muneo Ueda, Nobuaki Shirai', 'Atsushi Yamatoya, Yasuharu Hasebe', 'Meiko Kaji, Rikiya Yasuoka, Tatsuya Fuji, Jiro Okazaki, Yuki Arikawa, Yôko Takagi, Akemi Nara, Setsuko Minami', null, 'Mako and her girl friends enter a dispute with rival street gangsters The Eagles, a band of racist macho pigs led by the evil Baron, who hate half-breeds. When one of the girls start dating a half-breed, they start a terror campaign to take all of them out of town. Mako and her gang fight back, helping their new friend Kazuma find his long gone sister.', 'Mako and her girl friends enter a dispute with rival street gangsters The Eagles, a band of racist macho pigs led by the evil Baron, who hate half-breeds. When one of the girls start dating a half-breed, they start a terror campaign to take all of them out of town. Mako and her gang fight back, helping their new friend Kazuma find his long gone sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nz4Wvi4m1iVpzQTXVS7h3gNxLO3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64651'),
  ('17744432465805809', 'Stray Cat Rock: Wild Jumbo', 1970, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Toshiya Fujita, Shōhei Andō', 'Hideichi Nagahara, Toshiya Fujita', 'Meiko Kaji, Bunjaku Han, Takeo Chii, Tatsuya Fuji, Yūsuke Natsu, Soichiro Maeno, Ryōhei Uchida, Mari Shiraki', 'NR', 'Wild young people kidnap a wealthy woman and she becomes attracted to one of them. When she tells the man that she is the mistress of a religious leader, he and his posse make plans to rob her partner.', 'Wild young people kidnap a wealthy woman and she becomes attracted to one of them. When she tells the man that she is the mistress of a religious leader, he and his posse make plans to rob her partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTdsd1VAWOOY8Vd8uh9oj4PDW9d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64721'),
  ('278200824901985191', 'Stray Dog', 1949, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Akira Kurosawa, Asakazu Nakai, Yoshirō Muraki', 'Akira Kurosawa, Ryuzo Kikushima', 'Toshirō Mifune, Takashi Shimura, Keiko Awaji, Eiko Miyoshi, Noriko Sengoku, Noriko Honma, Reikichi Kawamura, Chōko Iida', null, 'A bad day gets worse for young detective Murakami when a pickpocket steals his gun on a hot, crowded bus. Desperate to right the wrong, he goes undercover, scavenging Tokyo’s sweltering streets for the stray dog whose desperation has led him to a life of crime. With each step, cop and criminal’s lives become more intertwined and the investigation becomes an examination of Murakami’s own dark side.', 'A bad day gets worse for young detective Murakami when a pickpocket steals his gun on a hot, crowded bus. Desperate to right the wrong, he goes undercover, scavenging Tokyo’s sweltering streets for the stray dog whose desperation has led him to a life of crime. With each step, cop and criminal’s lives become more intertwined and the investigation becomes an examination of Murakami’s own dark side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riBzUgeYawBDi2q9PjARjHrQM7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30368'),
  ('869454962754106646', 'Stray Dog', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Beto Brant, Toca Seabra, Betânia Vargas Furtado', 'Beto Brant, Marçal Aquino, Renato Ciasca', 'Júlio Andrade, Tainá Müller, Marcos Contreras, Roberto Oliveira, Sandra Possani, Janaína Kremer, Luiz Carlos V. Coelho', null, 'In Porto Alegre, the unemployed Ciro has a dull life in a simple apartment with a nameless stray dog that he had found on the streets. Ciro is supported by his parents and works every now and then in translation of Russian. When he meets the aspirant actress Marcela, who dreams on traveling to other places, they immediately fall in love for each other. However, Marcela has a lymphoma and travels for a treatment, and alone Marcelo becomes depressed and returns to his parents home.', 'In Porto Alegre, the unemployed Ciro has a dull life in a simple apartment with a nameless stray dog that he had found on the streets. Ciro is supported by his parents and works every now and then in translation of Russian. When he meets the aspirant actress Marcela, who dreams on traveling to other places, they immediately fall in love for each other. However, Marcela has a lymphoma and travels for a treatment, and alone Marcelo becomes depressed and returns to his parents home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqWILk3NenCSMkWSnX0qkPDNj5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86172'),
  ('375085856598434950', 'Stray Dog: Kerberos Panzer Cops', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Mamoru Oshii, Yoshihiro Akase', 'Mamoru Oshii', 'Yoshikatsu Fujiki, Shigeru Chiba, Takashi Matsuyama, Yi-Ching Sue, Fumihiko Tachiki, Masaru Ikeda, Ryoichi Tanaka, Keinosuke Suzuki', null, 'An elite police unit, rebelled against disarmament orders. Their leader Koichi escaped after the uprising. Years later, ex-member Inui seeks him, encountering unexpected twists. Upon finding Koichi, Inui realizes he''s been manipulated.', 'An elite police unit, rebelled against disarmament orders. Their leader Koichi escaped after the uprising. Years later, ex-member Inui seeks him, encountering unexpected twists. Upon finding Koichi, Inui realizes he''s been manipulated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1H4sK54zm69BQ4qtZ5DRS47oKOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62301'),
  ('497730436723178776', 'Stray Dogs', 1989, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Dmitriy Svetozarov, Aleksandr Ustinov, Aleksandr Schurok', 'Dmitriy Svetozarov, Arkadiy Krasilshchikov', 'Mikhail Zhigalov, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Andrey Krasko, Sergey Kokovkin, Aleksey Krychenkov, Aleksandr Susnin, Andrey Nikolaev, Rajhan Ajtkozhanova', null, 'A group of hunters enters a ghost town in Central Asia with a mission to kill packs of abandoned, and now wild cannibal dogs. But tables turn and there seems to be no way for the hunters to survive the horrific battle.', 'A group of hunters enters a ghost town in Central Asia with a mission to kill packs of abandoned, and now wild cannibal dogs. But tables turn and there seems to be no way for the hunters to survive the horrific battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aqr9oEfxQ2A4V1rbnfVu1IuKhic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324084'),
  ('780240171302861021', 'Stray Dogs', 2014, 'Drama', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Liao Pen-jung, Lu Ching-hsin', 'Peng Fei, Tsai Ming-liang, Chen Yu Tung', 'Lee Kang-sheng, Lu Yi-ching, Chen Shiang-Chyi, Yang Kuei-mei, Lee Yi-cheng, Lee Yi-Chieh, Wu Jin-Kai', null, 'An alcoholic man and his two young children barely survive in Taipei. They cross paths with a lonely grocery clerk who might help them make a better life.', 'An alcoholic man and his two young children barely survive in Taipei. They cross paths with a lonely grocery clerk who might help them make a better life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRwQzUDQlGwCeHkRUTuCkIyaaJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209840'),
  ('1037028419472379891', 'Stray Kids: The dominATE Experience', 2026, 'Music, Documentary', 'Paul Dugdale, Farah Khalid', null, 'Bang Chan, Lee Know, Changbin, Hyunjin, Han, Felix, Seungmin, I.N', null, 'Featuring the global K-Pop sensation Stray Kids and a live performance from their record-breaking world tour, alongside exclusive behind-the-scenes footage and intimate interviews with the band, Stray Kids: The dominATE Experience is an epic concert film that gives fans both a spectacular front-row seat and unique access to their favourite band.', 'Featuring the global K-Pop sensation Stray Kids and a live performance from their record-breaking world tour, alongside exclusive behind-the-scenes footage and intimate interviews with the band, Stray Kids: The dominATE Experience is an epic concert film that gives fans both a spectacular front-row seat and unique access to their favourite band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pi8IZ2lqJB0k0XKgh2b89OYqYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1600421'),
  ('990262595619049543', 'Strayed', 2003, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'André Téchiné, Aurélien Vernhes-Lermusiaux, Agnès Godard', 'Gilles Taurand, André Téchiné', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Gaspard Ulliel, Clémence Meyer, Samuel Labarthe, Jean Fornerod, Eric Kreikenmayer, Nicholas Mead, Nigel Hollidge', null, 'Fleeing the June 1940 arrival of Hitler''s army in Paris, a young war widow and her two children are rescued from dive-bombing German fighters by a cocky, reckless teenager. He finds them refuge in an abandoned house, but despite the fact that the family quickly comes to be depending much on his cunning and survival abilities, their cohabitation proves uneasy.', 'Fleeing the June 1940 arrival of Hitler''s army in Paris, a young war widow and her two children are rescued from dive-bombing German fighters by a cocky, reckless teenager. He finds them refuge in an abandoned house, but despite the fact that the family quickly comes to be depending much on his cunning and survival abilities, their cohabitation proves uneasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94aX13B3Rjz6F8lqV1fkvnXYrAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38018'),
  ('870679838301276945', 'Strayed', 2014, 'Horror', 'Diego Cohen', 'Diego Cohen', 'Eduardo Montes, Adrián Romero, Daniela Steinhauer, Román García, Carlos Craviotto, Orlando Moguel', null, 'In September 2012, four film students mysteriously disappeared while making a documentary at an abandoned building in downtown Mexico City. This is the footage recovered from the shooting.', 'In September 2012, four film students mysteriously disappeared while making a documentary at an abandoned building in downtown Mexico City. This is the footage recovered from the shooting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfCwmzLzeWsODKdnZikoe5bPuDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295465'),
  ('1132602063968143480', 'Strayer''s Chronicle', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Takahisa Zeze, Yuji Shimomura, Ryuto Kondo', 'Kohei Kiyasu, Takahisa Zeze', 'Masaki Okada, Shota Sometani, Riko Narumi, Mayu Matsuoka, Sara Takatsuki, Hiroya Shimizu, Nobuyuki Suzuki, Shuntaro Yanagi', null, 'In the early 1990s, experiments were carried out secretly in Japan. Two different methods were used in the experiments. One method involved forcing stress upon expecting parents and when the baby was born, provoke the baby into mutations and develop their special abilities. The other method involved birth to babies having abilities of animals and insects. The special abilities were derived from gene manipulation. Subaru, Saya and others were born from those experiments.', 'In the early 1990s, experiments were carried out secretly in Japan. Two different methods were used in the experiments. One method involved forcing stress upon expecting parents and when the baby was born, provoke the baby into mutations and develop their special abilities. The other method involved birth to babies having abilities of animals and insects. The special abilities were derived from gene manipulation. Subaru, Saya and others were born from those experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQ6zRpLlx9q5jr6CwfgB964RLiY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338409'),
  ('758139301292127691', 'Strays', 1991, 'Horror', 'John McPherson, Jacques Haitkin', 'Shaun Cassidy', 'Kathleen Quinlan, Timothy Busfield, Claudia Christian, William Boyett, Eve Brenner, Heather Lilly, Jessica Lilly, Gary McGurk', null, 'A young married couple and their daughter are terrorized by a pride of ferocious feral felines.', 'A young married couple and their daughter are terrorized by a pride of ferocious feral felines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c15Se3INJVYhBswkQ8UQOhXovz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123324'),
  ('538912478191108038', 'Strays', 1997, 'Drama', 'Vin Diesel, Anke Menzel, Andrew Dunn', 'Vin Diesel', 'Vin Diesel, Mike Epps, Mihaela Kolich, Joey Dedio, F. Valentino Morales, Darnell Williams, Eugene Osborne Smith, Suzanne Lanza', null, 'Rick is frustrated by the repetitious grind of one-night stands and aimless hustling. Whilst looking for more to his life he meets Heather, a neighbour. Rick takes the opportunity to escape his boring life style with her, but soon finds that his volatile behaviour threatens to finish their relationship before it even really begins.', 'Rick is frustrated by the repetitious grind of one-night stands and aimless hustling. Whilst looking for more to his life he meets Heather, a neighbour. Rick takes the opportunity to escape his boring life style with her, but soon finds that his volatile behaviour threatens to finish their relationship before it even really begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppTv3pRVoYeDBl7i2POJz26AwJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19083'),
  ('441392736385581943', 'Strays', 2023, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Stephen E. Hagen, Josh Greenbaum, Tim Orr', 'Dan Perrault', 'Will Ferrell, Jamie Foxx, Isla Fisher, Randall Park, Will Forte, Brett Gelman, Rob Riggle, Josh Gad', 'R', 'When Reggie is abandoned on the mean city streets by his lowlife owner, Doug, Reggie is certain that his beloved owner would never leave him on purpose. But once Reggie falls in with Bug, a fast-talking, foul-mouthed stray who loves his freedom and believes that owners are for suckers, Reggie finally realizes he was in a toxic relationship and begins to see Doug for the heartless sleazeball that he is.', 'When Reggie is abandoned on the mean city streets by his lowlife owner, Doug, Reggie is certain that his beloved owner would never leave him on purpose. But once Reggie falls in with Bug, a fast-talking, foul-mouthed stray who loves his freedom and believes that owners are for suckers, Reggie finally realizes he was in a toxic relationship and begins to see Doug for the heartless sleazeball that he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1hqbSCtyBAxaXEl1Dj3ipXJAJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912908'),
  ('367806826513605007', 'Streaker', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Peter Luisi', 'Peter Luisi, Beat Schlatter', 'Beat Schlatter, Bendrit Bajra, Luna Wedler, Doro Müggler, Marco Canadea, Mateja Mikusic, Eliane Iten, Rainer Maria Salzgeber', null, 'A high school teacher who is wrestling with a financial crisis dreams up a get-rich-quick scheme involving streakers and illegal sports betting.', 'A high school teacher who is wrestling with a financial crisis dreams up a get-rich-quick scheme involving streakers and illegal sports betting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IWTECe85PKQGtjrzc3qf6bqWPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463743'),
