  ('657841605178182313', 'Street Dancer 3D', 2020, 'Drama', 'Remo D''Souza, Vijay Kumar Arora, Yusuf Khan', 'Jagdeep Sidhu, Tushar Hiranandani', 'Varun Dhawan, Shraddha Kapoor, Nora Fatehi, Prabhu Deva, Punit Pathak, Dharmesh Yelande, Salman Yusuff Khan, Aparshakti Khurana', null, 'Two rival dance groups from India and Pakistan who are always competing against each other, join forces when it comes to competing at an international dance competition.', 'Two rival dance groups from India and Pakistan who are always competing against each other, join forces when it comes to competing at an international dance competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnsoKSS6EZNB7y2kEzXHdLm1U0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644712'),
  ('1147957175719033581', 'Street Fight', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Marshall Curry', 'Marshall Curry', 'Cory Booker, Sharpe James, Spike Lee, Al Sharpton, Cornel West, Chris Christie, Bill Bradley', null, 'This documentary follows the 2002 mayoral campaign in Newark, New Jersey, in which a City Councilman, Cory Booker, attempted to unseat longtime mayor Sharpe James.', 'This documentary follows the 2002 mayoral campaign in Newark, New Jersey, in which a City Councilman, Cory Booker, attempted to unseat longtime mayor Sharpe James.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1abhRslbpFUSCLD5S4cA3nvu4Kx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29044'),
  ('82625504681418387', 'Street Fighter', 1994, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Thriller', 'Steven E. de Souza, William A. Fraker, Charlie Picerni', 'Steven E. de Souza', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Raúl Juliá, Kylie Minogue, Byron Mann, Damian Chapa, Ming-Na Wen, Andrew Bryniarski, Grand L. Bush', 'PG-13', 'Colonel Guile and various other martial arts heroes fight against the tyranny of dictator M. Bison and his cohorts.', 'Colonel Guile and various other martial arts heroes fight against the tyranny of dictator M. Bison and his cohorts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yh95dD2Y6uWAlPfWCZZygBM1ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11667'),
  ('621160414331536598', 'Street Fighter', 2026, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Kitao Sakurai, Andy McLaren, Nick Satriano', 'Dalan Musson', 'Andrew Koji, Noah Centineo, Callina Liang, Cody Rhodes, 50 Cent, Orville Peck, Jason Momoa, Vidyut Jammwal', null, 'In 1993, estranged Street Fighters Ryu and Ken Masters are thrown back into combat when the mysterious Chun-Li recruits them for the next World Warrior Tournament: a brutal clash of fists, fate, and fury. But behind this battle royale lies a deadly conspiracy that forces them to face off against each other and the demons of their past. And if they don''t, it''s GAME OVER!', 'In 1993, estranged Street Fighters Ryu and Ken Masters are thrown back into combat when the mysterious Chun-Li recruits them for the next World Warrior Tournament: a brutal clash of fists, fate, and fury. But behind this battle royale lies a deadly conspiracy that forces them to face off against each other and the demons of their past. And if they don''t, it''s GAME OVER!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhqpnBEBl9tk42lX64tC4rQInmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1153576'),
  ('210365300665213669', 'Street Fighter Alpha: Generations', 2005, 'Action, Animation', 'Ikuo Kuwana, Yasunori Honda, Hideo Okazaki', 'Mitsuhiro Yamada', 'Yasuyuki Kase, Yuri Amano, Eiji Hanawa, Mao Kawasaki, Daisuke Gori, Tadashi Saitô, Kinryu Arimoto, Takeshi Aono', 'NR', 'When Ryu returns to pay homage to his deceased mentor, Gouken, he is tormented by disturbing memories of his master''s killer (Gouki). In a quest to become a true martial arts master, he sets out to hone his street fighting skills and deliver himself from the haunting legacy of the dark hadou.', 'When Ryu returns to pay homage to his deceased mentor, Gouken, he is tormented by disturbing memories of his master''s killer (Gouki). In a quest to become a true martial arts master, he sets out to hone his street fighting skills and deliver himself from the haunting legacy of the dark hadou.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6amRu0MxrBz1I3oLJz6pkSveG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16228'),
  ('4189397736654976', 'Street Fighter Alpha: The Movie', 1999, 'Action, Animation', 'Shigeyasu Yamauchi, Kazushi Torigoe', 'Joe Romersa, Kirk Thornton, Reiko Yoshida', 'Kane Kosugi, Kazuya Ichijo, Yumi Touma, Tomomichi Nishimura, Ai Orikasa, Chiaki Ōsawa, Reiko Kiuchi, Ken Yamaguchi', 'NR', 'Increasingly disturbed by the dark energies building within him, Ryu is confronted by Shun, a boy claiming to be the brother he never knew. But before Ryu can consider whether Shun''s timely appearance might be more than coincidental, Shun is kidnapped by Shadowlaw. To recover Shun, Ryu must undertake the ultimate journey of self-discovery and learn to control the power threatening to consume him.', 'Increasingly disturbed by the dark energies building within him, Ryu is confronted by Shun, a boy claiming to be the brother he never knew. But before Ryu can consider whether Shun''s timely appearance might be more than coincidental, Shun is kidnapped by Shadowlaw. To recover Shun, Ryu must undertake the ultimate journey of self-discovery and learn to control the power threatening to consume him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1mZ0gMgSsbdI15tRlFtLYnvXIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17433'),
  ('512316784401889000', 'Street Fighter II: The Animated Movie', 1994, 'Animation, Action', 'Gisaburō Sugii, Takuji Endo', 'Kenichi Imai, Gisaburō Sugii', 'Koujiro Shimizu, Kenji Haga, Miki Fujitani, Masane Tsukayama, Takeshi Kusaka, Kaneto Shiozawa, Shigezo Sasaoka, Jouji Nakata', 'PG-13', 'Bison, the ruthless leader of the international terrorist organization Shadowlaw, has been desperately searching for the greatest fighter on the planet for years. He finds it in Ryu, a young wanderer who never stays in one place long enough for Bison to find him. He does, however, get a fix on Ken Masters, an American martial arts champion who studied with Ryu as a child under the same master. Meanwhile, Major Guile of the United States Army is forced to team up with Chun Li from China in hopes of apprehending Bison and putting a stop his international ring of crime.', 'Bison, the ruthless leader of the international terrorist organization Shadowlaw, has been desperately searching for the greatest fighter on the planet for years. He finds it in Ryu, a young wanderer who never stays in one place long enough for Bison to find him. He does, however, get a fix on Ken Masters, an American martial arts champion who studied with Ryu as a child under the same master. Meanwhile, Major Guile of the United States Army is forced to team up with Chun Li from China in hopes of apprehending Bison and putting a stop his international ring of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZ1rqmE4eIhPbUCr7sn2Pw2wwGW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12613'),
  ('170409701347364340', 'Street Fighter IV: The Ties That Bind', 2009, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Jiro Kanai, Koji Morimoto, Masayuki Endo', null, 'Hiroki Takahashi, Yuji Kishi, Fumiko Orikasa, Hiroki Yasumoto, Misato Fukuen, Mie Sonozaki, Toru Okawa, Taketora', 'NR', 'After the fall of Shadaloo, things went quiet and everyone continued with their daily routine. However a new evil is lurking on the horizon and the fighters that battled against Shadaloo must take up arms once again. Meanwhile a mysterious detective, whose motives are unknown, is going to any extent to find the lonesome wanderer Ryu, who appears to play a big part in the scheme of this new evil.', 'After the fall of Shadaloo, things went quiet and everyone continued with their daily routine. However a new evil is lurking on the horizon and the fighters that battled against Shadaloo must take up arms once again. Meanwhile a mysterious detective, whose motives are unknown, is going to any extent to find the lonesome wanderer Ryu, who appears to play a big part in the scheme of this new evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x64hBnOpH6Uqd0aDtyGotlNlKjb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16257'),
  ('184556676457890033', 'Street Fighter: Assassin''s Fist The Movie', 2014, 'Adventure, Action', 'Joey Ansah', null, 'Christian Howard, Mike Moh, Akira Koieyama, Togo Igawa, Shogen, Hyunri, Gaku Space, Hal Yamanouchi', null, 'If one man changes his path, will he be able to change his destiny...or will he only delay the inevitable? Ryu and Ken are two traditional warriors who find themselves isolated in some corner of Japan to carry out their training as fighters, trying to master an ancient style of fighting, known as "Ansatsuken" (The Killing Fist). There they will begin to learn about the mysterious past of their trainer, Goken, and the tragic and dark legacy that the Ansatsuken style hides. Will they be able to choose their destiny or will history repeat itself once again?', 'If one man changes his path, will he be able to change his destiny...or will he only delay the inevitable? Ryu and Ken are two traditional warriors who find themselves isolated in some corner of Japan to carry out their training as fighters, trying to master an ancient style of fighting, known as "Ansatsuken" (The Killing Fist). There they will begin to learn about the mysterious past of their trainer, Goken, and the tragic and dark legacy that the Ansatsuken style hides. Will they be able to choose their destiny or will history repeat itself once again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdp4Ahg8BgpLqPFIi7LLMwqiDt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1016414'),
  ('294419899410028825', 'Street Fighter: The Legend of Chun-Li', 2009, 'Action, Adventure', 'Andrzej Bartkowiak, Geoff Boyle', 'Justin Marks', 'Kristin Kreuk, Chris Klein, Neal McDonough, Michael Clarke Duncan, Moon Bloodgood, Robin Shou, Josie Ho, Taboo', 'PG-13', 'When a teenager, Chun-Li witnesses the kidnapping of her father by wealthy crime lord M. Bison. When she grows up, she goes on a quest for vengeance and becomes the famous crime-fighter of the Street Fighter universe.', 'When a teenager, Chun-Li witnesses the kidnapping of her father by wealthy crime lord M. Bison. When she grows up, she goes on a quest for vengeance and becomes the famous crime-fighter of the Street Fighter universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbNemoc9bRIAIVck0e2cv1cgftN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15268'),
  ('62497663580947377', 'Street Flow', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alix Mathurin, Leïla Sy, Pierre Aïm', 'Alix Mathurin', 'Bakary Diombera, Jammeh Diangana, Chloé Jouannet, Alix Mathurin, Dali Benssalah, Slimane Dazi, Cherine Ghemri, Ahmed Bedda', null, 'Noumouké, from the suburb of Paris, is about to decide which brother''s foot steps to follow - the lawyer student Soulaymaan or the gangster Demba.', 'Noumouké, from the suburb of Paris, is about to decide which brother''s foot steps to follow - the lawyer student Soulaymaan or the gangster Demba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhOFpiEDA9S2rmuz5990KBjLgcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614488'),
  ('907274155470731125', 'Street Flow 2', 2023, 'Drama', 'Leïla Sy, Alix Mathurin, Colin Wandersman', 'Alix Mathurin', 'Bakary Diombera, Jammeh Diangana, Kadi Diarra, Alix Mathurin, Sana Sri, Krystel Roche, Foued Nabba, Mahamadou Coulibaly', 'R', 'Struggling to overcome cycles of betrayal, revenge and violence, the Traoré brothers continue to fight for a brighter future in a seedy Paris suburb.', 'Struggling to overcome cycles of betrayal, revenge and violence, the Traoré brothers continue to fight for a brighter future in a seedy Paris suburb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96I4OKRZICinYFCAvOnXznaCQcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034947'),
  ('783745039932704278', 'Street Flow 3', 2026, 'Drama', 'Leïla Sy, Alix Mathurin', 'Alix Mathurin', 'Bakary Diombera, Mohamed-Lamine Cissé, Bilal Ben Osmane, Jammeh Diangana, Cherine Ghemri, Foued Nabba, Kadi Diarra, Alix Mathurin', null, 'Grieving and facing the consequences of their crimes, the Traoré brothers get one last chance to forge a new path.', 'Grieving and facing the consequences of their crimes, the Traoré brothers get one last chance to forge a new path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vl50ruzFWxrbK4zFz0ySjC3TdyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1629382'),
  ('423705889269917358', 'Street Gang: How We Got to Sesame Street', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Marilyn Agrelo, Luke Geissbühler', null, 'Joan Ganz Cooney, Jim Henson, Jon Stone, Frank Oz, Caroll Spinney, Bob McGrath, Sonia Manzano, Emilio Delgado', 'PG', 'Take a stroll down Sesame Street and witness the birth of the most influential children''s show in television history. From the iconic furry characters to the classic songs you know by heart, learn how a gang of visionary creators changed the world.', 'Take a stroll down Sesame Street and witness the birth of the most influential children''s show in television history. From the iconic furry characters to the classic songs you know by heart, learn how a gang of visionary creators changed the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5o7Lubqk0HDxtLR2aCEoO3P6lp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476044'),
  ('865540525673379928', 'Street Hunter', 1990, 'Action, Drama', 'John A. Gallagher, Phil Parmet', 'John A. Gallagher, Steve James', 'Steve James, Reb Brown, John Leguizamo, Valarie Pettiford, Frank Vincent, Tom Wright, Richie Havens, Richard Panebianco', 'R', 'Logan Blade is a tough police officer who has to confront a gang led by ruthless Colonel Walsh.', 'Logan Blade is a tough police officer who has to confront a gang led by ruthless Colonel Walsh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKUYdBqdRLQN15qbCDzsZBVv2kp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93344'),
  ('882865254253488566', 'Street Kings', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Gabriel Beristain, David Ayer, Steven Bernstein', 'Jamie Moss, James Ellroy, Kurt Wimmer', 'Keanu Reeves, Forest Whitaker, Chris Evans, Hugh Laurie, Naomie Harris, Cedric the Entertainer, Martha Higareda, Common', 'R', 'Tom Ludlow is a disillusioned L.A. Police Officer, rarely playing by the rules and haunted by the death of his wife. When evidence implicates him in the execution of a fellow officer, he is forced to go up against the cop culture he''s been a part of his entire career, ultimately leading him to question the loyalties of everyone around him.', 'Tom Ludlow is a disillusioned L.A. Police Officer, rarely playing by the rules and haunted by the death of his wife. When evidence implicates him in the execution of a fellow officer, he is forced to go up against the cop culture he''s been a part of his entire career, ultimately leading him to question the loyalties of everyone around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTO7sBfVTr7LUqiFtGeFW7g2Ncf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266'),
  ('182474450569880025', 'Street Kings 2: Motor City', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Chris Fisher, Marvin V. Rush', 'Eddie Gonzalez, Jeremy Haft', 'Ray Liotta, Shawn Hatosy, Scott Norman, Clifton Powell, Kevin Chapman, Inbar Lavi, Charlotte Ross, Stephanie Cotton', 'R', 'Detroit detective Marty Kingston (Liotta) is the leader of an undercover narcotics team, whose members are being systematically murdered one by one. To solve the brutal killings, Kingston joins forces with a cocky, young homicide detective. But neither of them is prepared for the shocking corruption their investigation will uncover — stunning secrets that will set both men on a violent collision course with betrayal and vengeance.', 'Detroit detective Marty Kingston (Liotta) is the leader of an undercover narcotics team, whose members are being systematically murdered one by one. To solve the brutal killings, Kingston joins forces with a cocky, young homicide detective. But neither of them is prepared for the shocking corruption their investigation will uncover — stunning secrets that will set both men on a violent collision course with betrayal and vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z91mVJEv9XkryYGZ41OMlrB04BW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58625'),
  ('398507290092293959', 'Street Knight', 1993, 'Action, Crime', 'Albert Magnoli, Rick Avery, Yakov Sklyansky', 'Richard Friedman', 'Jeff Speakman, Christopher Neame, Lewis van Bergen, Jennifer Gatti, Bernie Casey, Richard Coca, Stephen Liska, Grainger Hines', null, 'A former cop returns to challenge a plot to escalate gang violence in the streets of Los Angeles.', 'A former cop returns to challenge a plot to escalate gang violence in the streets of Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nq3eKBmCP2z3TZyd3D0gW3mm69E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94236'),
  ('22444206920420271', 'Street Law', 1974, 'Crime, Action', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Marcello Crescenzi, Carlo Carlini', 'Dino Maiuri, Massimo De Rita', 'Franco Nero, Giancarlo Prete, Barbara Bach, Renzo Palmer, Nazzareno Zamperla, Romano Puppo, Massimo Vanni, Renata Zamengo', 'R', 'Carlo Antonelli, an engineer from Genoa, gets mugged and decides to take justice into his own hands. At first the muggers seem to get the upper hand, but then he''s helped by Tommy, a young robber who takes his side.', 'Carlo Antonelli, an engineer from Genoa, gets mugged and decides to take justice into his own hands. At first the muggers seem to get the upper hand, but then he''s helped by Tommy, a young robber who takes his side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LbC7GRYOOipSo5cgIMJiWL1dkj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90092'),
  ('1129625035699085547', 'Street Mobster', 1972, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Hanjirō Nakazawa', 'Yoshihiro Ishimatsu, Kinji Fukasaku', 'Bunta Sugawara, Noboru Andō, Asao Koike, Hideo Murota, Kyōsuke Machida, Mayumi Nagisa, Noboru Mitani, Nobuo Yana', null, 'After serving time, a defiant street thug is incensed to find his town overrun by two yakuza factions. He gathers his crew and takes them on.', 'After serving time, a defiant street thug is incensed to find his town overrun by two yakuza factions. He gathers his crew and takes them on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/W7V4pe5Psh1TxAsS2qA27zFOn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21613'),
  ('890101534379585924', 'Street Musique', 1972, 'Animation, Music', 'Ryan Larkin', null, null, null, 'Animator Ryan Larkin does a visual improvisation to music performed by a popular group presented as sidewalk entertainers. His take-off point is the music, but his own beat is more boisterous than that of the musicians. The illustrations range from convoluted abstractions to caricatures of familiar rituals. Without words.', 'Animator Ryan Larkin does a visual improvisation to music performed by a popular group presented as sidewalk entertainers. His take-off point is the music, but his own beat is more boisterous than that of the musicians. The illustrations range from convoluted abstractions to caricatures of familiar rituals. Without words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cE3CAxuPqTTbvxT8VWgM8QNlJXl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246663'),
  ('270546036561610289', 'Street of a Thousand Pleasures', 1972, 'Fantasy', 'William Rotsler, William Rotsler', 'William Rotsler', 'John Tull, Sandy Jackson, Alice Doe, Terry Benford, Devonne Carr, Elinor Ellington, Sandi Donaho, Rick Conlin', null, 'An American scientist prevents an attempt against an oil Sheik, who, in return, opens the gates of his harem to his saviour. There, nude girls invite him to explore their bodies. Has anyone escaped from the street of a thousand pleasures?', 'An American scientist prevents an attempt against an oil Sheik, who, in return, opens the gates of his harem to his saviour. There, nude girls invite him to explore their bodies. Has anyone escaped from the street of a thousand pleasures?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o75vdUoO7NUjQzZkhy4nQnXjD0M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94238'),
  ('1026960625778914859', 'Street of Chance', 1930, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Cromwell, Charles Lang', 'Lenore J. Coffee, Howard Estabrook, Ben Hecht', 'William Powell, Jean Arthur, Kay Francis, Regis Toomey, Stanley Fields, Brooks Benedict, Betty Francisco, John Risso', null, '''Natural'' Davis (William Powell) is a respected gambler who follows a ruthless code of honor with those who cheat against him. His wife, Alma (Kay Francis), wants to divorce him because of his addiction and lifestyle, but they agree on a reconciliation and second honeymoon together and ''Natural'' promises to give up gambling. However, his plans change when his brother, ''Babe'' (Regis Toomey), arrives in town looking to score big, and ''Natural'' has to devise a plan quickly to put him off gambling forever.', '''Natural'' Davis (William Powell) is a respected gambler who follows a ruthless code of honor with those who cheat against him. His wife, Alma (Kay Francis), wants to divorce him because of his addiction and lifestyle, but they agree on a reconciliation and second honeymoon together and ''Natural'' promises to give up gambling. However, his plans change when his brother, ''Babe'' (Regis Toomey), arrives in town looking to score big, and ''Natural'' has to devise a plan quickly to put him off gambling forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqwX0TpA6aYQy9DMNSAhvrXiqUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169326'),
  ('285061116313118861', 'Street of Chance', 1942, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jack Hively, Theodor Sparkuhl', 'Garrett Fort', 'Burgess Meredith, Claire Trevor, Louise Platt, Sheldon Leonard, Frieda Inescort, Jerome Cowan, Adeline De Walt Reynolds, Arthur Loft', 'NR', 'In this Cornell Woolrich thriller, a man''s memory is recovered after being injured by falling construction material. Discovering a year-long lapse, he returns to his old life and discovers a lot of mysterious happenings.', 'In this Cornell Woolrich thriller, a man''s memory is recovered after being injured by falling construction material. Discovering a year-long lapse, he returns to his old life and discovers a lot of mysterious happenings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYuhRso8lEZf7f2Nvg4nqmnwtyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42061'),
  ('354603308036367299', 'Street of Crocodiles', 1986, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Timothy Quay, Stephen Quay, Jonathan Bloom', 'Timothy Quay, Stephen Quay', 'Feliks Stawinski', null, 'A puppet, newly released from his strings, explores the sinister room in which he finds himself.', 'A puppet, newly released from his strings, explores the sinister room in which he finds himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbHs6pwSDuuX3n17ARz5Shps3ZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59357'),
  ('510517490455805315', 'Street of Love and Hope', 1959, 'Drama', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Tsutomu Tamura, Hiroshi Kusuda', 'Nagisa Ōshima', 'Fumio Watanabe, Yuki Tominaga, Kakuko Chino, Yūko Mochizuki, Fujio Suga, Hiroshi Fujikawa, Noboru Sakashita, Toyoko Uryû', null, 'The lives of a teenager, his impoverished family, a wealthy young woman who buys a pigeon from him, and his caring teacher converge and consequently become more complicated.', 'The lives of a teenager, his impoverished family, a wealthy young woman who buys a pigeon from him, and his caring teacher converge and consequently become more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ul8RZS5f44lj30FxDL6KXq10AUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98639'),
  ('440078951747024628', 'Street of No Return', 1989, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Samuel Fuller, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Jacques Bral, Samuel Fuller', 'Keith Carradine, Valentina Vargas, Bill Duke, Andréa Ferréol, Bernard Fresson, Marc de Jonge, Rebecca Potok, Jacques Martial', null, 'A rock star-turned-bum, his vocal chords severed at the height of his career for the love of a woman, drunkenly roams the city, torn apart by sponsored race riots. When accused of murder, he may have the chance to get revenge on the magnate who maimed him.', 'A rock star-turned-bum, his vocal chords severed at the height of his career for the love of a woman, drunkenly roams the city, torn apart by sponsored race riots. When accused of murder, he may have the chance to get revenge on the magnate who maimed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUAKWZflEZy5fk4SLszWQ6g0Dqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91620'),
  ('47910813681606852', 'Street of Shadows', 1953, 'Drama, Crime', 'Phil Grindrod, Richard Vernon, Alf Keating', 'Richard Vernon', 'Cesar Romero, Kay Kendall, Victor Maddern, Edward Underdown, Simone Silva, Liam Gaffney, Bill Travers, Molly Hawley-Clifford', 'NR', 'A saloon owner falls in love with the abused wife of a heavy gambler. He is snared into a web of intrigue when an ex-girlfriend is found murdered in his apartment.', 'A saloon owner falls in love with the abused wife of a heavy gambler. He is snared into a web of intrigue when an ex-girlfriend is found murdered in his apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrrtIyQkbqAS5RTwlzzJUro7Tgl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124541'),
  ('514561706916756023', 'Street of Shame', 1956, 'Drama', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Kazuo Miyagawa, Yasuzō Masumura', 'Masashige Narusawa', 'Machiko Kyō, Ayako Wakao, Michiyo Kogure, Aiko Mimasu, Kenji Sugawara, Yasuko Kawakami, Eitarō Shindō, Bontarō Miake', null, 'Follows five sex workers employed at a Japanese brothel while the nation debates the passage of an anti-prostitution law.', 'Follows five sex workers employed at a Japanese brothel while the nation debates the passage of an anti-prostitution law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVKXkGG9xQiVj9kTt9PbdxJJoKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43255'),
  ('603621136936119303', 'Street of the Damned', 1984, 'Crime, Action', 'Gilles Béhat, Jean-François Robin', 'Jean Herman', 'Bernard Giraudeau, Christine Boisson, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Bernard-Pierre Donnadieu, Corinne Dacla, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Michel Auclair, Jean-Pierre Sentier', null, 'In a desolate Paris suburb, no one dares challenge crime boss Hagen, who rules his turf with an iron fist. That includes his former friend Chet, who vows to keep to himself in order to protect his loved ones. But Hagen keeps pushing his buttons… and Chet can only stand for so much before he explodes.', 'In a desolate Paris suburb, no one dares challenge crime boss Hagen, who rules his turf with an iron fist. That includes his former friend Chet, who vows to keep to himself in order to protect his loved ones. But Hagen keeps pushing his buttons… and Chet can only stand for so much before he explodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rfFhkNAGNl5WTUpsdg8dRqjEGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76217'),
  ('467796224238771348', 'Street People', 1976, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Maurizio Lucidi, Aiace Parolin, Franco Fantasia', 'Ernest Tidyman', 'Roger Moore, Stacy Keach, Fausto Tozzi, Ivo Garrani, Ennio Balbo, Loretta Persichetti, Pietro Martellanza, Luigi Casellato', null, 'A Mafia boss is enraged when he is suspected of smuggling a heroin shipment into San Francisco. He dispatches his nephew, a hotshot Anglo-Sicilian lawyer, to identify the real culprit. The lawyer also enlists the aid of his best friend, a grand prix driver with an adventurous streak.', 'A Mafia boss is enraged when he is suspected of smuggling a heroin shipment into San Francisco. He dispatches his nephew, a hotshot Anglo-Sicilian lawyer, to identify the real culprit. The lawyer also enlists the aid of his best friend, a grand prix driver with an adventurous streak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOwjvNaQJ5YUrWQGZPyt3cELGjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67883'),
  ('839685602508130030', 'Street Racer', 2008, 'Action, Crime', 'Oleg Fesenko, Konstantin Zarin, Arunas Baraznauskas', 'Anush Vardanyan, Andrey Libenson', 'Aleksey Chadov, Stanislav Bondarenko, Marina Aleksandrova, Elvira Bolgova, Nikolay Chindyaykin, Aleksey Guskov, Lev Prygunov, Stanislav Bondarenko', 'R', 'Stepan and Doker are street racers. They love cars and speed. But there is a difference between them which brings them to face each other in a deadly race.', 'Stepan and Doker are street racers. They love cars and speed. But there is a difference between them which brings them to face each other in a deadly race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2wfdjjMGg2dQ22RUCp9reUvv7c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71831'),
  ('276171780855707159', 'Street Scene', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, George Barnes, Alfred Newman', null, 'Sylvia Sidney, William Collier Jr., Estelle Taylor, Beulah Bondi, David Landau, Matt McHugh, Russell Hopton, Greta Granstedt', 'NR', 'The setting is a city block during a sweltering summer, where the residents serve as representatives of the not-very-idealized American melting pot. There is idle chitchat, gossip, jealousy, racism, adultery, and suddenly but not unexpectedly, a murder.', 'The setting is a city block during a sweltering summer, where the residents serve as representatives of the not-very-idealized American melting pot. There is idle chitchat, gossip, jealousy, racism, adultery, and suddenly but not unexpectedly, a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x80hXmYooG76fm37j0rQkw3q4Ct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109435'),
  ('635549985865832832', 'Street Scenes', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Martin Scorsese', null, 'Martin Scorsese, Jay Cocks, Harvey Keitel, William Kunstler, Verna Bloom', null, 'Two protest rallies against the Vietnam War that took place in May 1970: the Hard Hat Riot on Wall Street in New York City and Kent State/Cambodia Incursion Protest in Washington, D.C.', 'Two protest rallies against the Vietnam War that took place in May 1970: the Hard Hat Riot on Wall Street in New York City and Kent State/Cambodia Incursion Protest in Washington, D.C.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcD3NLO8kcGUhvXicMOZS6Odpif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421510'),
  ('937761577302314074', 'Street Smart', 1987, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Jerry Schatzberg, Adam Holender', 'David Freeman', 'Christopher Reeve, Kathy Baker, Mimi Rogers, Jay Patterson, Andre Gregory, Morgan Freeman, Anna Maria Horsford, Frederick Rolf', 'R', 'A New York journalist lies when his fake story about a pimp describes a real pimp up for murder.', 'A New York journalist lies when his fake story about a pimp describes a real pimp up for murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aPwpPjrEozWWBr4fZEwmFeTEh5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60631'),
  ('25238002146273277', 'Street Thief', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Malik Bader', null, 'Frank Zieger, Wesley Walker', null, 'Kaspar Carr is a professional burglar who lives and works in Chicago. Carr loves his job and is good at it, and two documentary filmmakers are granted access to his private world when he agrees to let them make a film about him.', 'Kaspar Carr is a professional burglar who lives and works in Chicago. Carr loves his job and is good at it, and two documentary filmmakers are granted access to his private world when he agrees to let them make a film about him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZNxu35mALan9GTQaPPo3Dd3S7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18652'),
  ('909147312170864225', 'Street Trash', 1987, 'Comedy, Horror', 'J. Michael Muro, David Sperling, Bob Hurrie', 'Roy Frumkes', 'Mike Lackey, Bill Chepil, Vic Noto, Mark Sferrazza, Jane Arakawa, Nicole Potter, Pat Ryan, Clarenze Jarmon', 'NR', 'A group of hobos begin melting into multicolored piles of goo after drinking sixty-year-old liquor. At the same time, the psychotic Vietnam War vet who rules the hobo camp snaps and begins killing at random. Two brothers set out to stop the liquor and the killer.', 'A group of hobos begin melting into multicolored piles of goo after drinking sixty-year-old liquor. At the same time, the psychotic Vietnam War vet who rules the hobo camp snaps and begins killing at random. Two brothers set out to stop the liquor and the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwy81HbDoSvccWvculRMUVY39dD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22172'),
  ('904615907589576243', 'Street Warriors', 1977, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'José Antonio de la Loma', 'José Antonio de la Loma', 'Ángel Fernández Franco, Nadia Windell, Víctor Petit, Frank Braña, Xabier Elorriaga, Christa Leem, Miguel Hugal Cuenca, Jesús Miguel Martínez', null, 'Perros Callejeros is based on the juvenile delinquency of the 1970s and 80s in Spain. The story is set in Barrio de la Mina in Barcelona one of the most conflict neighbourhoods in Spain. The characters chosen were real juvenile delinquents all with criminal records, which the director used to give the film a realistic touch. This film is very powerful and dramatic, it shows how these kids were brought up to survive on the streets.', 'Perros Callejeros is based on the juvenile delinquency of the 1970s and 80s in Spain. The story is set in Barrio de la Mina in Barcelona one of the most conflict neighbourhoods in Spain. The characters chosen were real juvenile delinquents all with criminal records, which the director used to give the film a realistic touch. This film is very powerful and dramatic, it shows how these kids were brought up to survive on the streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKOyhly7Sj0Cb4h2a88qQGDK4Fm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47050'),
  ('116086754763335487', 'Street Warriors II', 1979, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'José Antonio de la Loma, Juan Gelpí, Joan Valls', 'José Antonio de la Loma', 'Ángel Fernández Franco, Teresa Giménez, Verónica Miriel, Raúl Ramírez, Isabel Mestres, Reyes Poveda, Conrado Tortosa ''Pipper'', Pep Corominas', null, 'A veteran policeman named Fernando feels a lot of hatred against Ángel because the boy ran him over with a car leaving him lame. Now Fernando accuses the young crook of having participated in a robbery at a gas station in which a murder has occurred. Helped by his friends, Ángel rebuilds the facts that serve him as an alibi, but while he is in pre-trial detention in La Modelo prison (Barcelona) a terrible mutiny will take place.', 'A veteran policeman named Fernando feels a lot of hatred against Ángel because the boy ran him over with a car leaving him lame. Now Fernando accuses the young crook of having participated in a robbery at a gas station in which a murder has occurred. Helped by his friends, Ángel rebuilds the facts that serve him as an alibi, but while he is in pre-trial detention in La Modelo prison (Barcelona) a terrible mutiny will take place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUTV4lVLuW3k5cQ4ZJvLukBfh9Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132001'),
  ('827877701260850722', 'Street Wise', 1984, 'Music, Romance', 'Sergio Véjar', 'Kiki Galindo', 'Pedro Fernández, Lucero, Alma Delfina, Arturo Alegría, Nuria Bages, José Elías Moreno', null, 'A boy living on the streets falls in love with a wealthy girl and tries to win her heart.', 'A boy living on the streets falls in love with a wealthy girl and tries to win her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4u7BgoLZQBFdfibEL0x1xoVCru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361174'),
  ('970588596235339086', 'Street Without End', 1934, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Minoru Shibuya, Satsuo Yamamoto', 'Jitsuzo Ikeda', 'Setsuko Shinobu, Akio Isono, Hikaru Yamanouchi, Nobuko Wakaba, Fumiko Katsuragi, Shinichi Himori, Chiyoko Katori, Ichiro Yuki', null, 'Mikio Naruse’s final silent film is a gloriously rich portrait of a waitress, Sugiko, whose life, despite a host of male admirers and even some intrigued movie talent scouts, ends up taking a suffocatingly domestic turn after a wealthy businessman accidentally hits her with his car.', 'Mikio Naruse’s final silent film is a gloriously rich portrait of a waitress, Sugiko, whose life, despite a host of male admirers and even some intrigued movie talent scouts, ends up taking a suffocatingly domestic turn after a wealthy businessman accidentally hits her with his car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nX8f4gkpMuVM1cE4i1KCABbNNC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126517'),
  ('605180572884213784', 'StreetDance 2', 2012, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Dania Pasquini, Max Giwa, Darren J. Perry', 'Jane English', 'Falk Hentschel, Sofia Boutella, George Sampson, Stephanie Nguyen, Delphine Nguyen, Niek Traa, Elisabetta Di Carlo, Samuel Revell', 'PG', 'After suffering humiliation by the crew Invincible, street dancer Ash looks to gather the best dancers from around the world for a rematch.', 'After suffering humiliation by the crew Invincible, street dancer Ash looks to gather the best dancers from around the world for a rematch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwg8qnQKAbT3EJubK8qyWfi9hTl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85373'),
  ('13434608262777131', 'StreetDance 3D', 2010, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Max Giwa, Dania Pasquini, Sam McCurdy', 'Jane English', 'Nichola Burley, Richard Winsor, Ukweli Roach, Frank Harper, George Sampson, Charlotte Rampling, Eleanor Bron, Patrick Baladi', 'PG-13', 'In order to win the Street Dance Championships, a dance crew is forced to work with ballet dancers from the Royal Dance School in exchange for rehearsal space.', 'In order to win the Street Dance Championships, a dance crew is forced to work with ballet dancers from the Royal Dance School in exchange for rehearsal space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqWSenAtDQsWjMLVTMEDvcCtafU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41592'),
  ('440499338213989312', 'Streeters', 2001, 'Drama', 'Gerardo Tort', null, 'Luis Fernando Peña, Maya Zapata, Armando Hernández, Mario Zaragoza, José Manuel Poncelis, Gustavo Sánchez Parra, Mary Paz Mata, Dolores Heredia', null, 'Authentic and committed, moving and stormy drama of street kids from Mexico City. Wonderful adaptation of successful play about street kids who have more trouble with corrupt cops, than with dirty and heavy work.', 'Authentic and committed, moving and stormy drama of street kids from Mexico City. Wonderful adaptation of successful play about street kids who have more trouble with corrupt cops, than with dirty and heavy work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTBYE1KCye9Zt6uM7FElyFoUxt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55622'),
  ('223437345716693716', 'Streets', 1990, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Katt Shea, Sally Mattison, Phedon Papamichael', 'Katt Shea, Andy Ruben', 'Christina Applegate, David Mendenhall, Eb Lottimer, Starr Andreeff, Alexander Folk, J Bartell, Paul Ben-Victor, Tom Ruben', 'R', 'A teenage prostitute and a runaway rich kid flee a psycho-killer motorcycle patrolman.', 'A teenage prostitute and a runaway rich kid flee a psycho-killer motorcycle patrolman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNLxSxXS3ygs2wdkL5LF2g7Xlmo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76661'),
  ('363552997800993709', 'Streets of Blood', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Charles Winkler, Roy H. Wagner, Simeon Asenov', 'Eugene Hess', 'Val Kilmer, 50 Cent, Sharon Stone, Michael Biehn, Jose Pablo Cantillo, Brian Presley, Barry Shabaka Henley, Luis Rolon', 'R', 'A police officer''s partner has died during Hurricane Katrina, but he later discovers that his partner may have been murdered. An investigation follows, taking the officer and his new partner into the depths of the criminal underworld.', 'A police officer''s partner has died during Hurricane Katrina, but he later discovers that his partner may have been murdered. An investigation follows, taking the officer and his new partner into the depths of the criminal underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UBLsks7CwsWqYil8PAkzOJauq8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19727'),
  ('753186280861415981', 'Streets of Fire', 1984, 'Action', 'Walter Hill, Andrew Laszlo', 'Walter Hill, Larry Gross', 'Michael Paré, Diane Lane, Rick Moranis, Amy Madigan, Willem Dafoe, Bill Paxton, Deborah Van Valkenburgh, Richard Lawson', 'PG', 'Raven Shaddock and his gang of merciless biker friends kidnap rock singer Ellen Aim. Ellen''s former lover, soldier-for-hire Tom Cody, happens to be passing through town on a visit. In an attempt to save his star act, Ellen''s manager hires Tom to rescue her. Along with a former soldier, they battle through dangerous cityscapes, determined to get Ellen back.', 'Raven Shaddock and his gang of merciless biker friends kidnap rock singer Ellen Aim. Ellen''s former lover, soldier-for-hire Tom Cody, happens to be passing through town on a visit. In an attempt to save his star act, Ellen''s manager hires Tom to rescue her. Along with a former soldier, they battle through dangerous cityscapes, determined to get Ellen back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmYHBKCZkbmiUfhfOQKgfh0jvXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14746'),
  ('346541403268266232', 'Streets of Glória', 2026, 'Drama', 'Felipe Sholl', 'Felipe Sholl', 'Caio Macedo, Alejandro Claveaux, Diva Menner, Jade Sassará, Alan Ribeiro', 'Not Rated', 'After suffering a great loss, Gabriel moves to Rio and becomes obsessed with Adriano, a male escort. When Adriano disappears, Gabriel embarks on an investigative journey that ultimately leads him to become an escort himself. This nearly costs him his life.', 'After suffering a great loss, Gabriel moves to Rio and becomes obsessed with Adriano, a male escort. When Adriano disappears, Gabriel embarks on an investigative journey that ultimately leads him to become an escort himself. This nearly costs him his life.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F2%2Fgracenote%2F20ebc2961478bc124e2a1054c863d97e.jpg', 'plex:movie:streets-of-gloria'),
  ('269203616016549444', 'Streets of Gold', 1986, 'Drama', 'Joe Roth, Arthur Albert', 'Heywood Gould, Tom Cole, Richard Price', 'Klaus Maria Brandauer, Adrian Pasdar, Wesley Snipes, Ángela Molina, Elya Baskin, Rainbow Harvest, Daniel O''Shea, John Mahoney', 'R', 'Alek is an immigrant from the Soviet Union who was a talented boxer in his day, but he was not allowed on the Soviet national team because he was a Jew. Depressed and discouraged, he meets two young amateur boxers. As their coach, he trains them for glory.', 'Alek is an immigrant from the Soviet Union who was a talented boxer in his day, but he was not allowed on the Soviet national team because he was a Jew. Depressed and discouraged, he meets two young amateur boxers. As their coach, he trains them for glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UQSskV2Tf23nNtEzDcqqxpVHz6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42026'),
  ('848976743906333229', 'Streets of Laredo', 1949, 'Western', 'Ray Rennahan, Francisco Day, Leslie Fenton', 'Charles Marquis Warren', 'William Holden, Macdonald Carey, Mona Freeman, William Bendix, Stanley Ridges, Alfonso Bedoya, Ray Teal, Clem Bevans', 'NR', 'Texas, 1878: cheerful outlaw-buddies Jim, Lorn and Wahoo rescue spunky orphan Rannie Carter from rustling racketeers, then are forced to separate. Lorn goes on to bigger and better robberies, while Jim and Wahoo are (at first reluctantly) maneuvered into joining the Texas Rangers. For friendship''s sake, the three try to keep out of direct conflict, but a showdown begins to look inevitable. And Rannie, now grown into lovely young womanhood, must choose between Lorn and Jim', 'Texas, 1878: cheerful outlaw-buddies Jim, Lorn and Wahoo rescue spunky orphan Rannie Carter from rustling racketeers, then are forced to separate. Lorn goes on to bigger and better robberies, while Jim and Wahoo are (at first reluctantly) maneuvered into joining the Texas Rangers. For friendship''s sake, the three try to keep out of direct conflict, but a showdown begins to look inevitable. And Rannie, now grown into lovely young womanhood, must choose between Lorn and Jim', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ynSWTl3CFGwFqICAOa8anqSFkv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154091'),
  ('981339239040066627', 'Streetwalker', 1951, 'Drama, Crime', 'Winfield Sánchez, Matilde Landeta, Rosalío Solano', 'Matilde Landeta, José Aguila', 'Miroslava, Ernesto Alonso, Elda Peralta, Miguel Ángel Ferriz Sr., Aurora Izquierdo, Enedina Díaz de León, Juan Orraca, Rogelio Fernández', null, 'In Mexico City, two sisters live radically different lives: Maria, who—along with her supportive group of fellow sex workers—must deal with unscrupulous, abusive clients and her exploitative pimp, Rudy, and Elena, a society woman trapped in a marriage of convenience, who falls prey to Rudy’s fortune-seeking seduction.', 'In Mexico City, two sisters live radically different lives: Maria, who—along with her supportive group of fellow sex workers—must deal with unscrupulous, abusive clients and her exploitative pimp, Rudy, and Elena, a society woman trapped in a marriage of convenience, who falls prey to Rudy’s fortune-seeking seduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjC9FM0zKh5BCuiHalVQnwomsdn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362772'),
  ('58777926122274336', 'Streetwalkin''', 1985, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Steven Fierberg, Robert Alden, Joan Freeman', 'Robert Alden, Joan Freeman', 'Melissa Leo, Dale Midkiff, Leon, Antonio Fargas, Julie Newmar, Randall Batinkoff, Annie Golden, Deborah Offner', 'R', 'Cookie is a teen runaway who escapes her abusive stepfather and heads for the Big Apple with her younger brother. When she arrives at the Port Authority bus terminal, Cookie meets a charming but sadistic pimp named Duke. With nowhere to go, Cookie is soon working for Duke, who introduces her to the harsh, brutal life of being a prostitute.', 'Cookie is a teen runaway who escapes her abusive stepfather and heads for the Big Apple with her younger brother. When she arrives at the Port Authority bus terminal, Cookie meets a charming but sadistic pimp named Duke. With nowhere to go, Cookie is soon working for Duke, who introduces her to the harsh, brutal life of being a prostitute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngtjxdItwB8VtpvZ3EQsiO9lxxs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85598'),
  ('316005733670272924', 'Streetwise', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Martin Bell', null, 'Erin Blackwell, Dewayne Pomeroy, Roberta Joseph Hayes, Lulu Couch, Reed Early, Patrice Pitts, Rat', null, 'This documentary about teenagers living on the streets in Seattle began as a magazine article. The film follows nine teenagers who discuss how they live by panhandling, prostitution, and petty theft.', 'This documentary about teenagers living on the streets in Seattle began as a magazine article. The film follows nine teenagers who discuss how they live by panhandling, prostitution, and petty theft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fW9z3HXWYTKzlqE3CYMMxaXyyy2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42098'),
  ('548894756737404337', 'Stregati', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Umberto Angelucci, Giovanni Angeloni, Francesco Nuti', 'Vincenzo Cerami, Francesco Nuti, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Francesco Nuti, Ornella Muti, Novello Novelli, Mirta Pepe, Sergio Solli, Alessandro Partexano', null, 'Lorenzo is the conductor of Radio Strega''s night show, making up false court sentences for those who suffer from insomnia.', 'Lorenzo is the conductor of Radio Strega''s night show, making up false court sentences for those who suffer from insomnia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ji7FuDhJUKCeRMWW3gng1PZYEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168971'),
  ('508497359575693952', 'Stregati dalla luna', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Federico Nuti, Gaia Gorrini', 'Nicola Pistoia, Pino Ammendola', 'Nicola Pistoia, Pino Ammendola, Megan Gale, Maurizio Casagrande, Maurizio Aiello, Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Sergio Fiorentini, Gianni Musy', null, 'Dario and Carlo are the owners of a small restaurant organizing a wedding. Everything goes awry after Miria confesses a fling to her fiance.', 'Dario and Carlo are the owners of a small restaurant organizing a wedding. Everything goes awry after Miria confesses a fling to her fiance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0KBrYK1Wk8iNIyfoX5sj2RcC5Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186576'),
  ('1123706555518028861', 'Streghe verso nord', 2001, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Marco Limberti, Tani Canevari, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Massimiliano Governi, Sandro Veronesi', 'Teo Mammucari, Paul Sorvino, Daniele Liotti, Emmanuelle Seigner, Anna Valle, Valéria Cavalli, Bianca Guaccero, Vittorio Amandola', null, 'Gallio and Teo are two witch defusers. Their task is to track them down and fight them by any means. The second is secretly in love with his sister-in-law Lucilla without knowing that she is a supreme witch. Teo will have to resort to Gallio''s teachings (a headbutt, seven steps north and a flash of light to forget everything) to try to render her harmless.', 'Gallio and Teo are two witch defusers. Their task is to track them down and fight them by any means. The second is secretly in love with his sister-in-law Lucilla without knowing that she is a supreme witch. Teo will have to resort to Gallio''s teachings (a headbutt, seven steps north and a flash of light to forget everything) to try to render her harmless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hO31yhlKakFOfTza1p4ijZAFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206122'),
  ('222082198360249280', 'Strella', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Panos H. Koutras, Christina Ioakeimidi, Fotis Zampetakis', 'Panos H. Koutras, Panagiotis Evangelidis', 'Mina Orfanou, Yannis Kokiasmenos, Minos Theocharis, Argyris Kavvidas, Akis Ioannou, Konstadinos Siradakis, Konstadinos Aspiotis, Mania Lembesi', null, 'Yiorgos is released from prison after 14 years of incarceration for a murder he committed in his small Greek village. He spends his first night out in a cheap downtown hotel in Athens. There he meets Strella, a young trans sex worker. They spend the night together and soon they fall in love.', 'Yiorgos is released from prison after 14 years of incarceration for a murder he committed in his small Greek village. He spends his first night out in a cheap downtown hotel in Athens. There he meets Strella, a young trans sex worker. They spend the night together and soon they fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0KvrOzDdmd845nrElq4zddzCas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50535'),
  ('84890187396063329', 'Stress Is Three', 1968, 'Drama', 'José Luis Ruiz Marcos, Carlos Saura, Luis Cuadrado', 'Angelino Fons', 'Geraldine Chaplin, Juan Luis Galiardo, Fernando Cebrián, Porfiria Sanchiz, Charo Soriano, Humberto Sempere, Fernando Sánchez Polack, Rafael Taibo', null, 'Set in one-day, three people embark together on a car trip from Madrid to Almeria. Antonio (Cebrián) is a successful industrialist, however he is dismayed that his personal life does not reflect his glittering career. He is insecure about his faltering marriage to Teresa (Chaplin), whom he believes is having an affair with his best friend, Antonio (Galiardo).', 'Set in one-day, three people embark together on a car trip from Madrid to Almeria. Antonio (Cebrián) is a successful industrialist, however he is dismayed that his personal life does not reflect his glittering career. He is insecure about his faltering marriage to Teresa (Chaplin), whom he believes is having an affair with his best friend, Antonio (Galiardo).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PQTaREENvKHiPsiJoqE3LbxNrK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115242'),
  ('686723750767499824', 'Stretch', 2014, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Joe Carnahan, Yasu Tanida', 'Joe Carnahan', 'Patrick Wilson, Kevin Bigley, Chris Pine, Jessica Alba, Ray Liotta, Brooklyn Decker, James Badge Dale, Ed Helms', 'R', 'A hard-luck limo driver struggling to go straight and pay off a debt to his bookie takes on a job with a crazed passenger whose sought-after ledger implicates some seriously dangerous criminals.', 'A hard-luck limo driver struggling to go straight and pay off a debt to his bookie takes on a job with a crazed passenger whose sought-after ledger implicates some seriously dangerous criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLmIFQu2fFB6YkYuYzBotKMFGqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227300'),
  ('1111302543780682096', 'Stricken', 2009, 'Drama', 'Reinout Oerlemans', 'Gert Embrechts', 'Barry Atsma, Carice van Houten, Anna Drijver, Jeroen Willems, Sacha Bulthuis, Pierre Bokma, Gijs Scholten van Aschat, Walid Benmbarek', null, 'Handsome Dutchman Stijn is the star of an advertising agency with his buddy Frenk and a hot womanizer. The boys start their own agency and Stijn marries colleague Carmen, who accepts his incurable greed for truly meaningless one-night-stands. Even fatherhood and a move to the boring country go well, until Carmen gets breast cancer. Now their lives are turned upside-down, maybe wrecked', 'Handsome Dutchman Stijn is the star of an advertising agency with his buddy Frenk and a hot womanizer. The boys start their own agency and Stijn marries colleague Carmen, who accepts his incurable greed for truly meaningless one-night-stands. Even fatherhood and a move to the boring country go well, until Carmen gets breast cancer. Now their lives are turned upside-down, maybe wrecked', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmPhy9Y5sUAHnk8TfIZMCTKnX9N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36784'),
  ('118680405518395675', 'Strictly Ballroom', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Baz Luhrmann, Steve Mason, Keith Heygate', 'Baz Luhrmann, Craig Pearce', 'Paul Mercurio, Tara Morice, Bill Hunter, Pat Thomson, Gia Carides, Peter Whitford, Barry Otto, John Hannan', 'PG', 'Brave new steps put Scott''s career in jeopardy. With a new partner and determination, can he still succeed?', 'Brave new steps put Scott''s career in jeopardy. With a new partner and determination, can he still succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6vs4DQGuNpLuA5Z7k69uuKpbVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10409'),
  ('1019438930302825465', 'Strictly Business', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Leonid Gaidai, Varvara Sevastyanova, A. Vanichkin', 'Leonid Gaidai', 'Vladlen Paulus, Aleksandr Shvorin, Viktor Gromov, Vladimir Pitsek, Viktor Uralsky, Lev Lobov, Yuri Chulyukin, Rostislav Plyatt', null, 'Three stories based on O. Henry novels. (1) Bob Tidball recovers $30,000 in pristine credit cards from a bandit’s sack and races across the plains until his horse breaks its leg. Forced to mount Dodson’s stallion, he’s ambushed and killed by “Shark” Dodson, who seizes the entire loot. (2) A thief slips through a third-floor window to steal a stack of bills from a sleeping gentleman’s dressing table. When the homeowner awakens and raises only one hand against the revolver—his other immobilized by a sudden rheumatic attack—the would-be robber reconsiders his plan. (3) Sam and Bill, two small-time grifters short $2,000 for their swindle, decide to kidnap Ebeneger Dorset’s young son. They demand exactly that sum as ransom, setting in motion a desperate bargain.', 'Three stories based on O. Henry novels. (1) Bob Tidball recovers $30,000 in pristine credit cards from a bandit’s sack and races across the plains until his horse breaks its leg. Forced to mount Dodson’s stallion, he’s ambushed and killed by “Shark” Dodson, who seizes the entire loot. (2) A thief slips through a third-floor window to steal a stack of bills from a sleeping gentleman’s dressing table. When the homeowner awakens and raises only one hand against the revolver—his other immobilized by a sudden rheumatic attack—the would-be robber reconsiders his plan. (3) Sam and Bill, two small-time grifters short $2,000 for their swindle, decide to kidnap Ebeneger Dorset’s young son. They demand exactly that sum as ransom, setting in motion a desperate bargain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJWXUFMcL21m7QgUBqQqcvTokPf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92983'),
  ('170417842688684838', 'Strictly Business', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kevin Hooks, Zoltán David, Gary Marcus', 'Nelson George, Pamela Church Gibson', 'Joseph C. Phillips, Halle Berry, Tommy Davidson, Anne-Marie Johnson, Samuel L. Jackson, Kim Coles, Sam Rockwell, Denis Leary', 'PG-13', 'Waymon has a great job in real estate and a promising future, but he''s also trapped in a loveless longterm relationship. He meets Natalie, a beautiful club-hopping hipster, and quickly falls in love. Realizing he''s just not cool enough to attract her on his own, he seeks the help of his friend Bobby, a free-spirited smooth talker who works in the mail room at Waymon''s firm and utilizes the predicament as leverage to advance in the company.', 'Waymon has a great job in real estate and a promising future, but he''s also trapped in a loveless longterm relationship. He meets Natalie, a beautiful club-hopping hipster, and quickly falls in love. Realizing he''s just not cool enough to attract her on his own, he seeks the help of his friend Bobby, a free-spirited smooth talker who works in the mail room at Waymon''s firm and utilizes the predicament as leverage to advance in the company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aH8NjAzgxQckbt1oY4YBpCYLrDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45147'),
  ('1120072829174608869', 'Strictly Confidential', 2024, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Damian Hurley, George Burt', 'Damian Hurley', 'Elizabeth Hurley, Georgia Lock, Lauren McQueen, Freddie Thorp, Genevieve Gaunt, Pear Chiravara, Max Parker, Llyrio Boateng', 'R', 'A haunted young woman finds herself drawn into a world of seduction, duplicity and betrayal as she desperately tries to uncover the mystery surrounding her best friend''s suicide.', 'A haunted young woman finds herself drawn into a world of seduction, duplicity and betrayal as she desperately tries to uncover the mystery surrounding her best friend''s suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkOuvoomDuzuV6jHGyUZZwP9ijL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1182297'),
  ('717439114411067363', 'Strictly Sexual', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Joel Viertel', 'Stevie Long', 'Amber Benson, Johann Urb, Kristen Kerr, Stevie Long, Trevor Murphy, Scott Weston, Lindsay Frame, Shravan Kambam', 'R', 'Two successful women, sick and tired of dating and relationships, decide to keep two young men in their pool house for strictly sexual purposes.', 'Two successful women, sick and tired of dating and relationships, decide to keep two young men in their pool house for strictly sexual purposes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niIJVD4CPvGg05AWNbLFoAcQSp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13808'),
  ('652169367397142812', 'Stride, Soviet!', 1926, 'Documentary', 'Dziga Vertov, Elizaveta Svilova', 'Dziga Vertov', null, null, 'Commissioned by the Moscow Soviet as a documentary and information film for the citizens of Moscow prior to municipal elections, film is a tableau of Soviet life and achievements in the period of reconstruction following the Civil War of 1917-1921.', 'Commissioned by the Moscow Soviet as a documentary and information film for the citizens of Moscow prior to municipal elections, film is a tableau of Soviet life and achievements in the period of reconstruction following the Civil War of 1917-1921.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NL4SIMCXaqUFJaJTuNKy2psAZr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189505'),
  ('65158339104572404', 'Striding Into the Wind', 2021, 'Drama', 'Li Xingbo, Wei Shujun, Wang Jiehong', 'Gao Linyang, Wei Shujun', 'Zhou You, Liu Yang, Tong Linkai, Zhao Xiaodong, Zheng Yingchen, Li Kui, Wang Xiaomu, Liu Yuting', null, 'An aimless film school student goes on an ambling road trip across China in a rickety old Jeep in this charming, deeply personal road movie.', 'An aimless film school student goes on an ambling road trip across China in a rickety old Jeep in this charming, deeply personal road movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWWakNJ17dqAlA42QYYkZKNBNdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712164'),
  ('626903965769702584', 'Strigoi', 2009, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Kathinka Minthe, Faye Jackson', 'Faye Jackson', 'Roxana Guttman, Cătălin Paraschiv, Rudy Rosenfeld, Constantin Bărbulescu, Camelia Maxim, Adrian Donea, Vlad Jipa, Zane Jarcu', null, 'When the villagers killed Constantin Tirescu, they thought it was justice. Vlad Cozma thinks it was murder. Now, Constantin thinks pickles might go nice with blood.', 'When the villagers killed Constantin Tirescu, they thought it was justice. Vlad Cozma thinks it was murder. Now, Constantin thinks pickles might go nice with blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qThjN9nvLhBQNUk5nFTtiOLeTlS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54398'),
  ('416436109550694027', 'Strike', 1925, 'Drama', 'Sergei Eisenstein, Eduard Tisse, Aleksandr Levshin', 'Ilya Kravchunovsky, Grigori Aleksandrov, Sergei Eisenstein', 'Maksim Shtraukh, Grigori Aleksandrov, Mikhail Gomorov, Ivan Klyukvin, Aleksandr Antonov, Vladimir Uralskiy, Anatoliy Kuznetsov, I. Ivanov', null, 'Workers in a factory in pre-revolutionary Russia go on strike and are met by violent suppression.', 'Workers in a factory in pre-revolutionary Russia go on strike and are met by violent suppression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrDTaMxQKxWZ3uEs2G58vJWJDDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44967'),
  ('1144240491507046892', 'Strike Commando', 1987, 'Action, War', 'Bruno Mattei, Riccardo Grassetti, Claudio Fragasso', 'Claudio Fragasso, Bruno Mattei', 'Reb Brown, Christopher Connelly, Louise Kamsteeg, Luciano Pigozzi, Alex Vitale, Karen Lopez, Philip Gordon, Edison Navarro', 'R', 'The sole survivor of a Vietnam mission is ordered by his commanding officer to photograph Soviets.', 'The sole survivor of a Vietnam mission is ordered by his commanding officer to photograph Soviets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwjLhZ781E6tOHPT3TEaAjcUU7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86251'),
  ('950488074518173472', 'Strike Commando 2', 1988, 'Action, War', 'Bruno Mattei, Riccardo Grassetti, Claudio Fragasso', 'Claudio Fragasso, Rossella Drudi', 'Brent Huff, Mary Stavin, Richard Harris, Ottaviano Dell''Acqua, Vic Diaz, Mel Davidson, Massimo Vanni', null, 'A commando rescues his squad leader from heroin smugglers in Burma.', 'A commando rescues his squad leader from heroin smugglers in Burma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YmmzQsnBUPrKA4FtPYFgJbegfo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122473'),
  ('531382709078708494', 'Strike First Freddy', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Erik Balling', 'Erik Balling, Jens K. Holm, Henning Bahs', 'Morten Grunwald, Ove Sprogøe, Essy Persson, Poul Bundgaard, John Wittig, Frankie Steele, Jørgen Blaksted, Edward Fleming', null, 'Frede Hansen, a game salesman, is mistaken for a secret service agent on a ferry and kidnapped by enemy agents. He escapes and now the secret service want to use him as bait to track the enemy. They assign their best agent, Smith to be his partner and supervisor. Their main task is to eliminate the head of the enemy conspiracy, the mysterious ''Dr. Pax'' who''s real identity is unknown. Freddy accompanies Smith to Stockholm where they are to meet Sonja, an agent for Dr. Pax, who is also on Smith''s liquidation list. Thanks to his bag of game tricks, Freddy manages to avoid being done in by Kolick, a killer for Dr. Pax. Freddy falls for Sonja, and he, she and Smith are taken as prisoners to Dr. Pax''s hideout, a remote island fortress from which a major power is to be attacked by missiles guided by trained pigeons. Freddy manages to teach Dr. Pax a lasting lesson in the difference between trained pigeons and homing pigeons.', 'Frede Hansen, a game salesman, is mistaken for a secret service agent on a ferry and kidnapped by enemy agents. He escapes and now the secret service want to use him as bait to track the enemy. They assign their best agent, Smith to be his partner and supervisor. Their main task is to eliminate the head of the enemy conspiracy, the mysterious ''Dr. Pax'' who''s real identity is unknown. Freddy accompanies Smith to Stockholm where they are to meet Sonja, an agent for Dr. Pax, who is also on Smith''s liquidation list. Thanks to his bag of game tricks, Freddy manages to avoid being done in by Kolick, a killer for Dr. Pax. Freddy falls for Sonja, and he, she and Smith are taken as prisoners to Dr. Pax''s hideout, a remote island fortress from which a major power is to be attacked by missiles guided by trained pigeons. Freddy manages to teach Dr. Pax a lasting lesson in the difference between trained pigeons and homing pigeons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88Dd6rjmd20GuEO5ICGki9t8fUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33445'),
  ('353582611502674626', 'Strike of the Panther', 1989, 'Action', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Simon Akkerman', 'Peter West', 'Edward John Stazak, John Stanton, Rowena Wallace, James Richards, Paris Jefferson, Zale Daniel, Matthew Quartermaine, Brian Fitzsimmons', 'R', 'Jason Blade is a man who can''t bring himself to commit fully to his woman, and who spends all his time with a special crime task force taking on assignments to fight crime and right wrong do-ers. When his love is kidnapped by his arch-enemy the race is on to get into the power station where she is being held and battle an army of ninjas. Only then can he face Baxter, his arch-enemy, and stop a bomb from exploding to save his sweetheart, and show her that he is a man. A man who can commit. A man who is strong.', 'Jason Blade is a man who can''t bring himself to commit fully to his woman, and who spends all his time with a special crime task force taking on assignments to fight crime and right wrong do-ers. When his love is kidnapped by his arch-enemy the race is on to get into the power station where she is being held and battle an army of ninjas. Only then can he face Baxter, his arch-enemy, and stop a bomb from exploding to save his sweetheart, and show her that he is a man. A man who can commit. A man who is strong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6FtuB6gvg2G0pRx4RDStdDowbQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163466'),
  ('422806599406012981', 'Strike the Whore', 1973, 'Drama', 'Halit Refiğ, Ali Yaver', 'Halit Refiğ, Orhan Aksoy', 'Hale Soygazi, Tugay Toksöz, Tanju Gürsu, Muharrem Gürses, Kamran Usluer, Murat Tok, Diler Saraç, Mahmure Handan', null, 'In Romania, the idealistic Istanbul teacher, Aliye, communicate activities to a town in Anatolia supporting the idea of National Struggle in the region.', 'In Romania, the idealistic Istanbul teacher, Aliye, communicate activities to a town in Anatolia supporting the idea of National Struggle in the region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oDaBQ0D06uYK9W3XgCMKTaKkgM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522821'),
  ('828955909546831695', 'Strike Up the Band', 1940, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Ray June, Busby Berkeley, William Ryan', 'Fred F. Finklehoffe, John Monks Jr.', 'Mickey Rooney, Judy Garland, June Preisser, William Tracy, Larry Nunn, Paul Whiteman, Margaret Early, Ann Shoemaker', 'NR', 'Jimmy and Mary get a group of kids together to play in a school orchestra. A huge contest between schools is coming up and they have a hard time raising money to go to Chicago for the contest.', 'Jimmy and Mary get a group of kids together to play in a school orchestra. A huge contest between schools is coming up and they have a hard time raising money to go to Chicago for the contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJM42XqJSj4K53btMXg26vXuSDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43819'),
  ('448604007584603767', 'Strike Witches the Movie', 2012, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Kojiro Hayashi, Hiroshi Tamada, Kazuhiro Takamura', 'Humikane Shimada', 'Misato Fukuen, Yumi Hara, Mai Kadowaki, Ami Koshimizu, Ayako Kawasumi, Kaori Mizuhashi, Rika Morinaga, Kaori Nazuka', null, 'The year is 1939 - it was then that the Neuroi appeared. Nobody knows where they came from or what their ultimate agenda is, but the fact remains that their attacks drove people out of their towns and cities. In order to take arms against them, humanity develops a new anti-Neuroi weapon called the "Striker Unit." Using the power of magic to fight against the monsters, this new device enhances and amplifies the power of female magic-wielders. To use this device, young witches from all over the world have been brought together to form an elite task force unit called the 501st Joint Fighter Wing, commonly known as the "Strike Witches."', 'The year is 1939 - it was then that the Neuroi appeared. Nobody knows where they came from or what their ultimate agenda is, but the fact remains that their attacks drove people out of their towns and cities. In order to take arms against them, humanity develops a new anti-Neuroi weapon called the "Striker Unit." Using the power of magic to fight against the monsters, this new device enhances and amplifies the power of female magic-wielders. To use this device, young witches from all over the world have been brought together to form an elite task force unit called the 501st Joint Fighter Wing, commonly known as the "Strike Witches."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPGRxdBtxS1qRES8guq20fmJSWj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44667'),
  ('85393149531488379', 'Strike!', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sarah Kernochan, Anthony Jannelli', 'Sarah Kernochan', 'Kirsten Dunst, Gaby Hoffmann, Lynn Redgrave, Tom Guiry, Rachael Leigh Cook, Vincent Kartheiser, Monica Keena, Matthew Lawrence', 'PG-13', 'In 1963 New England, a group of friends at an all-girls academy learn that they''re going to be combined with a nearby all-boys institution. They concoct a plan to save their school while dealing with everyday problems along the way.', 'In 1963 New England, a group of friends at an all-girls academy learn that they''re going to be combined with a nearby all-boys institution. They concoct a plan to save their school while dealing with everyday problems along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCr8mLqIVkbjBNs1uaZPvkXYnWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19381'),
  ('1042406205671403352', 'Strikes and Spares', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Felix E. Feist', null, 'Pete Smith, Andy Varipapa, Buster Brodie, Ray Turner', null, 'This short features professional bowler Andy Varipapa. He first shows the correct way to grip a bowling ball and the proper form for delivering the ball down the alley. He then performs several trick shots.', 'This short features professional bowler Andy Varipapa. He first shows the correct way to grip a bowling ball and the proper form for delivering the ball down the alley. He then performs several trick shots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXyx3FyaiEAQxgO4XaB8Bx4faAd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178380'),
  ('27940251080249715', 'Striking Daughter', 2004, 'Animation', 'Takashi Kimura', null, null, null, 'One day, Sayuri''s family tells her it is time for her to strike.', 'One day, Sayuri''s family tells her it is time for her to strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLMn59V5l71AKMbFSXPTANPz48D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354113'),
  ('892669918592155343', 'Striking Distance', 1993, 'Crime, Action, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mac Ahlberg, Rowdy Herrington, Dana J. Kuznetzkoff', 'Rowdy Herrington, Marty Kaplan', 'Bruce Willis, Sarah Jessica Parker, Dennis Farina, Tom Sizemore, Brion James, Robert Pastorelli, Timothy Busfield, John Mahoney', 'R', 'Coming from a police family, Tom Hardy ends up fighting his uncle after the murder of his father. Tom believes the killer is another cop, and goes on the record with his allegations. Demoted to water-way duty Tom, along with new partner Jo Christman, navigate the three rivers looking for clues and discovering bodies. This time the victims are women Tom knows, he must find the killer to prove his innocence.', 'Coming from a police family, Tom Hardy ends up fighting his uncle after the murder of his father. Tom believes the killer is another cop, and goes on the record with his allegations. Demoted to water-way duty Tom, along with new partner Jo Christman, navigate the three rivers looking for clues and discovering bodies. This time the victims are women Tom knows, he must find the killer to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bLazrQWJQhO6u58vJZXJZ3ZFDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11074'),
  ('156680773142008098', 'Striking Poses', 1999, 'Thriller', 'Gail Harvey, Ludek Bogner', 'Michael Stokes', 'Shannen Doherty, Joseph Griffin, Tamara Gorski, Aidan Devine, Colm Feore, Diane D''Aquila, Sean Hewitt, Gina Sorell', 'R', 'When a beautiful paparazzo for a tabloid magazine finds herself pursued by a ruthless stalker, she is determined to emerge from this deadly game alive, and independently wealthy.', 'When a beautiful paparazzo for a tabloid magazine finds herself pursued by a ruthless stalker, she is determined to emerge from this deadly game alive, and independently wealthy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuYd743OA8rK8rcnz5DAyMKfX0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49058'),
  ('14078996400378679', 'Striking Rescue', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Cheng Siyi, Ai Yanjie, Guo Yulong', 'Guo Haiwen', 'Tony Jaa, Eason Hung Chun-Ga, Xing Yu, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Chen Duoyi, Peng Bo, Yu Bolin, Mao Fan', 'NR', 'A veteran Muay Thai expert goes on a take-no-prisoners mission of revenge after his wife and daughter are brutally murdered by mysterious forces.', 'A veteran Muay Thai expert goes on a take-no-prisoners mission of revenge after his wife and daughter are brutally murdered by mysterious forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nML8rOI4GOiiEsXgknuhZeUF8M7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1382406'),
  ('866996796780415209', 'Striking The Palace', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Nessim Chikhaoui, Mathis Dujardin, Julie Laloui', 'Nessim Chikhaoui, Hélène Fillières', 'Corinne Masiero, Lucie Charles-Alfred, Marie-Sohna Condé, Salimata Kamate, Maïmouna Gueye, Kool Shen, Abdallah Charki, Mariama Gueye', null, 'Eva, 20, joins Safietou, Djaoua, Violette and Simone, a team of chambermaids at one of Paris’s finest Palace Hotels. She discovers the poor working conditions of these invisible women, who work tirelessly to keep the high standards of these luxurious hotels, where one night can cost their annual salary. Many are not even employed by the hotels directly but by sub-contractors, and are therefore particularly vulnerable. While on strike to fight against subcontracting and to obtain better working conditions, they come up with a colorful idea : having their own “Fashion Week” in front of the hotel!', 'Eva, 20, joins Safietou, Djaoua, Violette and Simone, a team of chambermaids at one of Paris’s finest Palace Hotels. She discovers the poor working conditions of these invisible women, who work tirelessly to keep the high standards of these luxurious hotels, where one night can cost their annual salary. Many are not even employed by the hotels directly but by sub-contractors, and are therefore particularly vulnerable. While on strike to fight against subcontracting and to obtain better working conditions, they come up with a colorful idea : having their own “Fashion Week” in front of the hotel!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIVt1Jr37o5U9opboyBjs6zZ9mB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978090'),
  ('1143425924337500064', 'Strings', 1991, 'Animation, Drama', 'Wendy Tilby', 'Wendy Tilby', null, null, 'This film explores the distant relationship between an elderly amateur musician, the woman who lives in the apartment above him, and the leaky bathtub that is bothering them both.', 'This film explores the distant relationship between an elderly amateur musician, the woman who lives in the apartment above him, and the leaky bathtub that is bothering them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovLSNEuQ3qm9IUHByOIUgVaOoj5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209690'),
  ('491201169414924095', 'Strings', 2004, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Anders Rønnow Klarlund', 'Anders Rønnow Klarlund', 'James McAvoy, Catherine McCormack, Julian Glover, Derek Jacobi, Ian Hart, Claire Skinner, David Harewood, Samantha Bond', null, 'The story of Prince Hal who sets out to avenge his dead father against the city''s rivals, the Zeriths, little knowing it was his wicked uncle Nezo who is the real killer, with his own designs on the throne.', 'The story of Prince Hal who sets out to avenge his dead father against the city''s rivals, the Zeriths, little knowing it was his wicked uncle Nezo who is the real killer, with his own designs on the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJJ5ePSlmx3BZ8jFPndboIA60iH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21290'),
  ('638316729276081970', 'Strings', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'David Ordieres, Pedro Solís, Juan Jesús García Galocha', 'Pedro Solís', 'Miriam Martín, Belén Rueda, María Temprado, Blanca Formáriz, Estefanía Nussio', 'PG', 'María''s routine at school is altered by the arrival of a very special child. Soon, they become close friends.', 'María''s routine at school is altered by the arrival of a very special child. Soon, they become close friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4E8xmnY7ipl04hcKgRvCYBMtXQ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303451'),
  ('93263119176380990', 'Strip Down, Rise Up', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Svetlana Cvetko, Theo van de Sande, Denise Brassard', 'Michèle Ohayon', 'Sheila Kelley, Jenyne Butterfly, Elizabeth Mihelich, Amy Bond', 'R', 'The feature documentary follows women of all walks of life, all ages and ethnic backgrounds, as they shed trauma, body image shame, sexual abuse and other issues locked in their bodies, and embark on a journey to reclaim themselves. The film also gives a rare window into the world of Pole artistry and expression.', 'The feature documentary follows women of all walks of life, all ages and ethnic backgrounds, as they shed trauma, body image shame, sexual abuse and other issues locked in their bodies, and embark on a journey to reclaim themselves. The film also gives a rare window into the world of Pole artistry and expression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CXQ5zOrhHGcw1imsRMwa7W8izS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778870'),
  ('1073102506619858767', 'Strip Jack Naked', 1991, 'Documentary', 'Ron Peck, Ron Peck, Christopher Hughes', 'Ron Peck', 'Ron Peck, John Brown, John Daimon, Nick Bolton, Walter McMonagle, Judy Liebert, Michael Menaugh, Ken Robertson', null, 'Ron Peck talks about his experiences of growing up as a gay man, the attitudes to homosexuality in Britain, and his journey towards making his film "Nighthawks".', 'Ron Peck talks about his experiences of growing up as a gay man, the attitudes to homosexuality in Britain, and his journey towards making his film "Nighthawks".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsJ53YYATeQ0mkCq76ZNi94vD9y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118551'),
  ('465910084149314473', 'Strip Mahjong: Battle Royale', 2011, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Tetsuro Imai, Mac P. Forever', 'Noriyuki Sano, Ryosuke Oomine', 'Mako Higashio, Hiroaki Kawatsure, Nina, Kaori Sasaki, Runa Shimotsuki', null, 'Let the ultimate sexy death games begin! A handful of mysterious Japanese women take part in a deranged web show that makes them strip off their clothes when they lose a round of Mahjong. When there is nothing left to hide, the losers secrets are revealed and the nubile contestants must take their punishment. Can anyone survive, or keep their clothes on, in the dangerous game of STRIP MAHJONG: BATTLE ROYALE? Gleefully adding a risqué, wry twist to an ancient game of strategy, this erotic thriller delivers voyeuristic thrills with the friskiness of Seventies sexploitation flicks, providing strange gameplay at every turn!', 'Let the ultimate sexy death games begin! A handful of mysterious Japanese women take part in a deranged web show that makes them strip off their clothes when they lose a round of Mahjong. When there is nothing left to hide, the losers secrets are revealed and the nubile contestants must take their punishment. Can anyone survive, or keep their clothes on, in the dangerous game of STRIP MAHJONG: BATTLE ROYALE? Gleefully adding a risqué, wry twist to an ancient game of strategy, this erotic thriller delivers voyeuristic thrills with the friskiness of Seventies sexploitation flicks, providing strange gameplay at every turn!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zr4axgMblqh9BFVos0i9O4nWpI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147957'),
  ('1145836236208797269', 'Strip Nude for Your Killer', 1975, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Andrea Bianchi, Franco Delli Colli', 'Massimo Felisatti', 'Edwige Fenech, Nino Castelnuovo, Femi Benussi, Solvi Stübing, Amanda, Franco Diogene, Lucio Como, Erna Schürer', null, 'After a fashion model dies during a botched abortion, the doctor stages her death to exonerate himself but is murdered by a mysterious assailant who soon begins hunting down her agency colleagues.', 'After a fashion model dies during a botched abortion, the doctor stages her death to exonerate himself but is murdered by a mysterious assailant who soon begins hunting down her agency colleagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9TEsOIljW3RBt2HScE3NXNUQTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11226'),
  ('306596655831637457', 'Strip Search', 2004, 'Drama', 'Sidney Lumet, Ron Fortunato', 'Tom Fontana', 'Maggie Gyllenhaal, Glenn Close, Dean Winters, Ken Leung, Bruno Lastra, Shing Ka, Austin Pendleton, Tom Guiry', 'R', 'Strip Search follows several parallel stories examining personal freedoms vs. national security in the aftermath of 9/11; two main subplots involve an American woman detained in China and an Arab man detained in New York City.', 'Strip Search follows several parallel stories examining personal freedoms vs. national security in the aftermath of 9/11; two main subplots involve an American woman detained in China and an Arab man detained in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWoZQE5hcVWSLk2X5MKQ8mvOTCu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41847'),
  ('483087621609212855', 'Strip-Tease intégral', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Jean Libon, Clémentine Bisiaux, Régine Dubois', null, 'Francis Lalanne, Coline Mordillat, Denis Mordillat', null, 'More faithful than ever to the spirit of the cult series that has been inspiring filmmakers for nearly thirty years, STRIP-TEASE INTEGRAL offers us, this time on the big screen, five sensitive, touching, sometimes absurd, often funny, sometimes dark, sometimes bright - but always the vanities of human society in all their marvelous banality.', 'More faithful than ever to the spirit of the cult series that has been inspiring filmmakers for nearly thirty years, STRIP-TEASE INTEGRAL offers us, this time on the big screen, five sensitive, touching, sometimes absurd, often funny, sometimes dark, sometimes bright - but always the vanities of human society in all their marvelous banality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPmmzgcMqViBRjednv2G0vaBqFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1358082'),
  ('428145009089963490', 'Striped Trip', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Vladimir Fetin, Dmitri Meskhiyev, Arnold Shargorodsky', 'Aleksei Kapler, Viktor Konetsky', 'Aleksei Gribov, Ivan Dmitriev, Margarita Nazarova, Evgeni Leonov, Vladimir Belokurov, Nikolai Volkov St., Aleksandr Beniaminov, Arkadi Trusov', null, 'A Soviet cruise ship "Evgeni Onegin" is carrying cages with tigers and lions for a Soviet Circus. One loose monkey unlocks all cages, letting the tigers and lions out. Poor passengers and crew have no place to run. The captain abandons his post out of fear, and the monkey takes over the captain''s post. The ship gets under total control by the tigers and lions. Only one lady is standing up to the challenge. Her name is Marianna, she loves animals, and she takes the situation under control.', 'A Soviet cruise ship "Evgeni Onegin" is carrying cages with tigers and lions for a Soviet Circus. One loose monkey unlocks all cages, letting the tigers and lions out. Poor passengers and crew have no place to run. The captain abandons his post out of fear, and the monkey takes over the captain''s post. The ship gets under total control by the tigers and lions. Only one lady is standing up to the challenge. Her name is Marianna, she loves animals, and she takes the situation under control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlCyS3UPjTMBiYjGJsQWoZFmpvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45210'),
  ('1025324063408626996', 'Stripes', 1981, 'Action, Comedy', 'Ivan Reitman, Bill Butler, Richard Learman', 'Harold Ramis, Len Blum, Daniel Goldberg', 'Bill Murray, Harold Ramis, Warren Oates, P. J. Soles, Sean Young, John Candy, John Larroquette, John Voldstad', 'R', 'Hard-luck cabbie John Winger, directionless after being fired from his job and dumped by his girlfriend, enlists in the U.S. Army with his close pal, Russell Ziskey. After his barely satisfactory performance in basic training, the irreverent Winger emerges as the figurehead for a ragtag band of misfits. However, his hijinks threaten to cause an international scandal when he inadvertently commandeers a military assault vehicle behind enemy lines.', 'Hard-luck cabbie John Winger, directionless after being fired from his job and dumped by his girlfriend, enlists in the U.S. Army with his close pal, Russell Ziskey. After his barely satisfactory performance in basic training, the irreverent Winger emerges as the figurehead for a ragtag band of misfits. However, his hijinks threaten to cause an international scandal when he inadvertently commandeers a military assault vehicle behind enemy lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vP8tPOgmJSNOh4bpOv1bFjid3rZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10890'),
  ('203670015103593928', 'Stripped to Kill', 1987, 'Drama, Crime', 'Katt Shea, John LeBlanc', 'Andy Ruben, Katt Shea', 'Kay Lenz, Greg Evigan, Norman Fell, Pia Kamakahi, Tracey Crowder, Debbie Nassar, Lucia Lexington, Carlye Byron', 'R', 'A Los Angeles policewoman''s partner has her pose as a stripper to lure a killer of strippers.', 'A Los Angeles policewoman''s partner has her pose as a stripper to lure a killer of strippers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDZ63RGL3EoSHZibdAL1p3hKNfP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27795'),
  ('650926014818221694', 'Stripped to Kill 2: Live Girls', 1989, 'Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Katt Shea, Phedon Papamichael', 'Katt Shea, Andy Ruben', 'Maria Ford, Eb Lottimer, Karen Mayo-Chandler, Marjean Holden, Debra Lamb, Jeannine Bisignano, Birke Tan', null, 'When the razor blade slasher begins his reign of terror in the alleys behind the Los Angeles strip clubs, the most famous stripper in the spotlight must walk a tightrope between her own fragile sanity and the inescapable murderer''s blade.', 'When the razor blade slasher begins his reign of terror in the alleys behind the Los Angeles strip clubs, the most famous stripper in the spotlight must walk a tightrope between her own fragile sanity and the inescapable murderer''s blade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rT4O42rtThyskk6oUGf6xSMj3KJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27796'),
  ('1025472000202446728', 'Stripper', 1985, 'Documentary', 'Jerome Gary, Edward Lachman', 'Charles Gaines', 'Sara Costa, Venus DeLight, Joy Michael, Rikki Harte, Suzanne Primeau, Janette Boyd, Kimberly Holcomb, Loree Menton', null, 'A strippers'' convention and a major contest. The movie focuses on a few strippers, each with her own strong motive to win.', 'A strippers'' convention and a major contest. The movie focuses on a few strippers, each with her own strong motive to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pB4WjHY6RHzgyy2RqikyLxFHLr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270879'),
  ('1085522810012309466', 'Strippers vs. Werewolves', 2012, 'Comedy, Horror, Action, Crime, Fantasy', 'Jonathan Glendening, David Meadows', 'Pat Higgins', 'Adele Silva, Martin Compston, Billy Murray, Ali Bastian, Barbara Nedeljakova, Sarah Douglas, Simon Phillips, Martin Kemp', 'NR', 'Mickey, who happens to be a werewolf and a crime boss, gets all worked up and hairy during a private dance at a strip club. Justice, the dancer, grabs the nearest weapon and lands a fatal blow: her silver fountain pen right through Mickey''s wolfed-out eye. This ignites a small-scale war between Mickey''s group of werewolf mobsters and the sultry strippers of Vixens.', 'Mickey, who happens to be a werewolf and a crime boss, gets all worked up and hairy during a private dance at a strip club. Justice, the dancer, grabs the nearest weapon and lands a fatal blow: her silver fountain pen right through Mickey''s wolfed-out eye. This ignites a small-scale war between Mickey''s group of werewolf mobsters and the sultry strippers of Vixens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OscWRpUcnqhgqxMJQCxVCwa5ss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94603'),
  ('603938712287824721', 'Striptease', 1977, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bruno Bozzetto, Guido Manuli', null, null, null, 'As a live woman performs a striptease, she''s cheered on by an audience of small cartoon men. Some of them pop in the excitement as she brings down the house.', 'As a live woman performs a striptease, she''s cheered on by an audience of small cartoon men. Some of them pop in the excitement as she brings down the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBYLzESUz9cTbcToIetg1AElY9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232223'),
  ('212661876164598678', 'Striptease', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Andrew Bergman, Stephen Goldblatt, Richard Quinlan', 'Andrew Bergman', 'Demi Moore, Burt Reynolds, Armand Assante, Ving Rhames, Robert Patrick, Paul Guilfoyle, Rumer Willis, Jerry Grayson', 'R', 'Bounced from her job, Erin Grant needs money if she''s to have any chance of winning back custody of her child. But, eventually, she must confront the naked truth: to take on the system, she''ll have to take it all off. Erin strips to conquer, but she faces unintended circumstances when a hound dog of a Congressman zeroes in on her and sharpens the shady tools at his fingertips, including blackmail and murder.', 'Bounced from her job, Erin Grant needs money if she''s to have any chance of winning back custody of her child. But, eventually, she must confront the naked truth: to take on the system, she''ll have to take it all off. Erin strips to conquer, but she faces unintended circumstances when a hound dog of a Congressman zeroes in on her and sharpens the shady tools at his fingertips, including blackmail and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zMy6R7acotCmGoDk4sjzRtDwKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9879'),
  ('339002286363152953', 'Stripteaser', 1995, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Dan Golden, Andrea V. Rossotto', 'Duane Whitaker', 'Maria Ford, Rick Dean, Lance August, Nikki Fritz, R.A. Mihailoff, George Russo, J.R. Kuykendall, George Tovar', 'R', 'As Zipper''s Clown Palace (a strip bar) closes, Neil wanders in and decides to hold the dancers, bartender, and remaining customers hostage. He torments them with little tasks he wants performed, playing on their weaknesses and relying on his gun for intimidation. Eventually the hostages begin formulating plans to thwart his control. Meanwhile, two policemen are observing the outside of the strip joint, realizing that something''s wrong and trying to decide if it''s worth ruining their buzz to intervene.', 'As Zipper''s Clown Palace (a strip bar) closes, Neil wanders in and decides to hold the dancers, bartender, and remaining customers hostage. He torments them with little tasks he wants performed, playing on their weaknesses and relying on his gun for intimidation. Eventually the hostages begin formulating plans to thwart his control. Meanwhile, two policemen are observing the outside of the strip joint, realizing that something''s wrong and trying to decide if it''s worth ruining their buzz to intervene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pR2KiDZfWW8ZKmcZnXNj5BawKeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116253'),
  ('244206490988164870', 'Striving for Freedom', 2013, 'Western', 'Rainer Matsutani, Gerhard Schirlo', 'Caroline Hecht, Rainer Matsutani', 'Emilia Schüle, Nadja Uhl, Benno Fürmann, Wesley French, Thomas Thieme, Tony Caprari, Richard Le Sueur, Jannis Niewöhner', null, 'Silesia, 1844. After her husband dies in a brutally suppressed weavers’ uprising, Mila emigrates to America. En route to Texas, she rescues Countess Cecilie Hohenberg from her violent husband. Captured by Comanche warrior Buffalo Hump, the women must navigate captivity, while Mila forges unexpected bonds amid the struggle for freedom.', 'Silesia, 1844. After her husband dies in a brutally suppressed weavers’ uprising, Mila emigrates to America. En route to Texas, she rescues Countess Cecilie Hohenberg from her violent husband. Captured by Comanche warrior Buffalo Hump, the women must navigate captivity, while Mila forges unexpected bonds amid the struggle for freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gX9j2lNugaiCVkAxQsq68RiO8hI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235437'),
  ('158142358940085158', 'Strobe Edge', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ryuichi Hiroki, Shinji Kuma', 'Sayaka Kuwamura', 'Sota Fukushi, Kasumi Arimura, Yuki Yamada, Yuina Kuroshima, Arisa Sato, Jingi Irie, Rika Kazami, Yoshinari Furuya', null, 'Ninako Kinoshita has never been in love until an encounter with the school''s most popular boy, Ren Ichinose, leads the two to befriending each other. Ren''s patient and kind personality is a far cry from his unapproachable idol status at school, and soon Ninako falls in love with him. However, she must cope with the fact that he already has a long-time girlfriend.', 'Ninako Kinoshita has never been in love until an encounter with the school''s most popular boy, Ren Ichinose, leads the two to befriending each other. Ren''s patient and kind personality is a far cry from his unapproachable idol status at school, and soon Ninako falls in love with him. However, she must cope with the fact that he already has a long-time girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayMKajI5073SZ0MuSbmPnaNS59o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283831'),
  ('334788955769685750', 'Stroker Ace', 1983, 'Action, Comedy', 'Nick McLean, Hal Needham, Jan DeWitt', 'David E. Peckinpah', 'Burt Reynolds, Ned Beatty, Jim Nabors, Parker Stevenson, Loni Anderson, John Byner, Cassandra Peterson, Bubba Smith', 'PG', 'Stroker Ace, a champion NASCAR driver, is standing at the top of his career, but is getting fed up with having to do as he''s told. In between rebelling against his sponsor (a fried chicken chain)''s promotion gimmicks (like making him dress up in giant chicken suit) he spends the rest of the movie trying to bed the buxom Pembrook.', 'Stroker Ace, a champion NASCAR driver, is standing at the top of his career, but is getting fed up with having to do as he''s told. In between rebelling against his sponsor (a fried chicken chain)''s promotion gimmicks (like making him dress up in giant chicken suit) he spends the rest of the movie trying to bed the buxom Pembrook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwN6w9yIScxSCsc39FMWg7B2MrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19258'),
  ('193187283074747596', 'Strokkur', 2011, 'Documentary', 'João Salaviza, João Salaviza', 'João Salaviza', 'Norberto Lobo', null, 'In the beginning the idea was to make something from nothing, in a neutral and unknown place. Collect images and sounds instead of producing them. The camera, the microphone and the mini-amplifier: tools that take away and then give back. We defined a rule: the sound shouldn''t illustrate the image and the image shouldn''t absorb the sound. Less than a hundred kilometres from Reykjavik we found Strokkur. For three days we saw and heard the internal dynamics of the crevice: the boiling water that spat out every seven minutes and the thermal shock, given the eighteen degrees below zero of the atmosphere.', 'In the beginning the idea was to make something from nothing, in a neutral and unknown place. Collect images and sounds instead of producing them. The camera, the microphone and the mini-amplifier: tools that take away and then give back. We defined a rule: the sound shouldn''t illustrate the image and the image shouldn''t absorb the sound. Less than a hundred kilometres from Reykjavik we found Strokkur. For three days we saw and heard the internal dynamics of the crevice: the boiling water that spat out every seven minutes and the thermal shock, given the eighteen degrees below zero of the atmosphere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jE7fFA96ckcGSkb5TuXc1ttKaOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247690'),
  ('995959644605881751', 'Stromberg - Wieder alles wie immer', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Arne Feldhusen, Johannes Imdahl, Susanne Sickert', 'Ralf Husmann', 'Christoph Maria Herbst, Bjarne Mädel, Oliver Wnuk, Diana Staehly, Milena Dreißig, László Branko Breiding, Sophia Burtscher, Anna Mateur', null, 'About twenty years ago, Germany got to know Bernd Stromberg and his team from the claims department at CAPITOL Insurance. Back then, there was nothing vegan in the cafeteria, and bullying and sexism were commonplace in the office. Since then, the world of work has changed enormously. But has Bernd Stromberg changed too?', 'About twenty years ago, Germany got to know Bernd Stromberg and his team from the claims department at CAPITOL Insurance. Back then, there was nothing vegan in the cafeteria, and bullying and sexism were commonplace in the office. Since then, the world of work has changed enormously. But has Bernd Stromberg changed too?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MhUqFHxtl4SEvVdndG9wymvm78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1400626'),
  ('1098856083085597767', 'Stromberg – The Movie', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Arne Feldhusen, Johannes Imdahl', 'Ralf Husmann', 'Christoph Maria Herbst, Bjarne Mädel, Oliver Wnuk, Diana Staehly, Milena Dreißig, Stefan Lampadius, Suzanne Landsfried, Laurens Walter', null, 'The celebration of the 50th anniversary of “Capitol-Insurance” is due – that''s what the bosses thought. All employees are invited to join the party in a hotel. However, rumors say the company''s not doing very well. To avoid unemployment due to the possible shutdown of the smaller branch office the only option is to move to the headquarters. Now that''s the ultimate challange for Stromberg, who is notoriously trying to be the example of a department manager, gathering all of his employees behind him.', 'The celebration of the 50th anniversary of “Capitol-Insurance” is due – that''s what the bosses thought. All employees are invited to join the party in a hotel. However, rumors say the company''s not doing very well. To avoid unemployment due to the possible shutdown of the smaller branch office the only option is to move to the headquarters. Now that''s the ultimate challange for Stromberg, who is notoriously trying to be the example of a department manager, gathering all of his employees behind him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpm2hoHgSa5IikIjnmM5mgmP3jN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240510'),
  ('155210833399753911', 'Stromboli', 1950, 'Drama', 'Roberto Rossellini, Otello Martelli, Marcello Caracciolo Di Laurino', 'Sergio Amidei, Gian Paolo Callegari, Renzo Cesana', 'Ingrid Bergman, Mario Vitale, Renzo Cesana, Mario Sponzo, Gaetano Famularo, Angelo Molino, Roberto Onorati', null, 'After the end of WWII, a young Lithuanian woman and a young Italian man from Stromboli impulsively marry, but married life on the island is more demanding than she can accept.', 'After the end of WWII, a young Lithuanian woman and a young Italian man from Stromboli impulsively marry, but married life on the island is more demanding than she can accept.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsyyzGSspKsawHocchfokskwbeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4173'),
  ('69213170609083593', 'Stromboli', 2022, 'Drama', 'Michiel van Erp', 'Roos Ouwehand, Paula van der Oest', 'Elise Schaap, Tim McInnerny, Christian Hillborg, Pieter Embrechts, Anna Chancellor, Neerja Naik, Taz Munyaneza, Marisa van Eyle', 'R', 'Haunted by memories of her broken marriage and a fight with her daughter, a woman joins an intense self-help retreat when her vacation goes awry.', 'Haunted by memories of her broken marriage and a fight with her daughter, a woman joins an intense self-help retreat when her vacation goes awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rQcKxoJkm6CViK82UfZwVkW2ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034629'),
  ('181640442606999406', 'Strong Island', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Yance Ford, Alan Jacobsen', null, 'Yance Ford, Harvey Walker, Kevin Myers, Barbara Dunmore Ford, Lauren Ford, David Breen, Ed Boyar', null, 'Examining the violent death of the filmmaker’s brother and the judicial system that allowed his killer to go free, this documentary interrogates murderous fear and racialized perception, and re-imagines the wreckage in catastrophe’s wake, challenging us to change.', 'Examining the violent death of the filmmaker’s brother and the judicial system that allowed his killer to go free, this documentary interrogates murderous fear and racialized perception, and re-imagines the wreckage in catastrophe’s wake, challenging us to change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGq7WCNv9S8GBbP8DfIchiaodWn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428612'),
  ('262205525690240347', 'Stronger', 2017, 'Drama', 'Mariela Comitini, Kenneth Donaldson, Anthony Raymond', 'John Pollono', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Tatiana Maslany, Miranda Richardson, Richard Lane Jr., Nate Richman, Lenny Clarke, Patty O''Neil, Clancy Brown', 'R', 'A victim of the Boston Marathon bombing in 2013 helps the police track down the killers while struggling to recover from devastating trauma.', 'A victim of the Boston Marathon bombing in 2013 helps the police track down the killers while struggling to recover from devastating trauma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnkxdFeY7YAgnicxkvwuxY7gVaT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395993'),
