  ('30788016842562594', 'Stuck Apart', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kader Ezgeç, Yağmur Taylan, Durul Taylan', 'Berkun Oya, Yağmur Taylan, Durul Taylan', 'Engin Günaydın, Haluk Bilginer, Binnur Kaya, Öner Erkan, Fatih Artman, İrem Sak, Gülçin Santırcıoğlu, İlker Aksum', 'R', 'Entrenched in a midlife crisis, Aziz seeks solace from his mundane job, lonesome friends and rowdy family while pretending to have his act together.', 'Entrenched in a midlife crisis, Aziz seeks solace from his mundane job, lonesome friends and rowdy family while pretending to have his act together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMVAcoYtfQuoEBxtZhCJAAJTafE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646955'),
  ('320713576722481753', 'Stuck in Love', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Scott Hardwick, Josh Boone, Tim Orr', 'Josh Boone', 'Greg Kinnear, Jennifer Connelly, Lily Collins, Nat Wolff, Liana Liberato, Logan Lerman, Kristen Bell, Spencer Breslin', 'R', 'An acclaimed writer, his ex-wife, and their teenaged children come to terms with the complexities of love in all its forms over the course of one tumultuous year.', 'An acclaimed writer, his ex-wife, and their teenaged children come to terms with the complexities of love in all its forms over the course of one tumultuous year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byic4VFVrpPyjDWK54CcsxYWW85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111969'),
  ('710157540669269652', 'Stuck in the Suburbs', 2004, 'Family, Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Savage Steve Holland', null, 'Danielle Panabaker, Brenda Song, Amanda Shaw, CiCi Hedgpeth, Jennie Garland, Ryan Belleville, Todd Stashwick, Taran Killam', 'G', 'Brittany Aarons is one of the many girls who has a crush on popular singer and boy-toy Jordan Cahill. However, she is bored of living a suburban existence and seeks a little something more.', 'Brittany Aarons is one of the many girls who has a crush on popular singer and boy-toy Jordan Cahill. However, she is bored of living a suburban existence and seeks a little something more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iTQNq076Q7eNzUJpScDdxgQtcH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115626'),
  ('407930116951230261', 'Stuck on You', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Dan Mindel, Bobby Farrelly, Peter Farrelly', 'Peter Farrelly, Bobby Farrelly', 'Matt Damon, Greg Kinnear, Eva Mendes, Wen Yann Shih, Pat Crawford Brown, Ray ''Rocket'' Valliere, Tommy Songin, Terence Bernie Hines', 'PG-13', 'In Martha''s Vineyard, Mass., conjoined twins Walt and Bob Tenor make the best of their handicap by being the fastest grill cooks in town. While outgoing Walt hopes to one day become a famous actor, shy Bob prefers to stay out of the spotlight. When a fading Hollywood actress, Cher, decides to get her show "Honey and the Beaze" cancelled, she hires Walt -- and his brotherly appendage -- as her costars. But their addition surprisingly achieves the opposite.', 'In Martha''s Vineyard, Mass., conjoined twins Walt and Bob Tenor make the best of their handicap by being the fastest grill cooks in town. While outgoing Walt hopes to one day become a famous actor, shy Bob prefers to stay out of the spotlight. When a fading Hollywood actress, Cher, decides to get her show "Honey and the Beaze" cancelled, she hires Walt -- and his brotherly appendage -- as her costars. But their addition surprisingly achieves the opposite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TmPGPsOP4EgMo8X14pyywxB1j2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1792'),
  ('468748778649171771', 'Stuck on You!', 1982, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Michael Herz, Lloyd Kaufman', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Melanie Mintz, Don Perman', 'Virginia Penta, Irwin Corey, Mark Mikulski, Denise Silbert, Julie Newdow, Barbie Kielian, Patricia Tallman, Tom Delahunty', 'R', 'A couple with marriage problems goes to Family Court, where a judge takes them back in time to view lovers through the ages.', 'A couple with marriage problems goes to Family Court, where a judge takes them back in time to view lovers through the ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nITSgbrqzfWQuJHFM1AnK50w3jr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86466'),
  ('980918975262715916', 'Stuck Together', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Glynn Speeckaert, Dany Boon', 'Laurence Arné, Dany Boon', 'Dany Boon, François Damiens, Laurence Arné, Élie Semoun, Nawell Madani, Jorge Calvo, Yvan Attal, Tom Leeb', null, 'Seven families live in the Parisian apartment building at 8, Rue de l’Humanite - and they didn’t escape to the countryside at the arrival of the coronavirus. Three months of life under lockdown will reveal the best and worst of these neighbours.', 'Seven families live in the Parisian apartment building at 8, Rue de l’Humanite - and they didn’t escape to the countryside at the arrival of the coronavirus. Three months of life under lockdown will reveal the best and worst of these neighbours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvK9AMUvh0TzjSmWwv74CgBEfg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785516'),
  ('200678297001008754', 'Stuck with You', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Frank Bellocq', 'Frank Bellocq, Jean-Luc Cano', 'Kev Adams, Camille Lellouche, Audrey Pirault, Gaël Mectoob, Chantal Ravalec, Paul Lasfargues, Laurinda Hudgens, Léon Plazol', 'R', 'En route to a party, two strangers get stuck in an elevator on New Year''s Eve — and find themselves connecting in unexpected ways.', 'En route to a party, two strangers get stuck in an elevator on New Year''s Eve — and find themselves connecting in unexpected ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVtOWr1DE5YV4i426NK0lkzwX8e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1057648'),
  ('963149492576934969', 'Student A', 2018, 'Drama', 'Son Jin-yong, Lee Kyung-sub, Jeong Ik-jung', 'Sin Dong sik, Lee Kyung-sub', 'Kim Hwan-hee, Suho, Lee Jong-hyuk, Jung Da-bin, Yoo Jae-sang, Jeong Da-eun, Kim Hyun-bin, Uh Sung-wook', null, 'Jang Mi-rae is a teenage girl who struggles to coexist with her classmates and her alcoholic father. She then interacts with a fellow gamer she meets online, which helps her grow as a person.', 'Jang Mi-rae is a teenage girl who struggles to coexist with her classmates and her alcoholic father. She then interacts with a fellow gamer she meets online, which helps her grow as a person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0kF3RBn01XMTHh3pNVSDHBQQfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525395'),
  ('251791732614640483', 'Student Bodies', 1981, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Mickey Rose, Gary Chason, Robert Ebinger', 'Mickey Rose', 'Kristen Riter, Matthew Goldsby, Joe Flood, Mimi Weddell, Joe Talarowski, Carl Jacobs, Oscar James, Robyn Flanery', 'R', 'This zany send-up of teen slasher flicks features a maniacal psycho known as the Breather, who stalks –and murders– promiscuous students at a suburban high school. The fanatical killer''s unusual weapons include paper clips, blackboard erasers and eggplants.', 'This zany send-up of teen slasher flicks features a maniacal psycho known as the Breather, who stalks –and murders– promiscuous students at a suburban high school. The fanatical killer''s unusual weapons include paper clips, blackboard erasers and eggplants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zY7FeYeHLspAOeLxEpMlgI2Z4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21515'),
  ('1006461002957796448', 'Student Body', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Lee Ann Kurr, Luka Bazeli', 'Lee Ann Kurr', 'Montse Hernandez, Cheyenne Haynes, Anthony Keyvan, Harley Quinn Smith, Austin Zajur, Christian Camargo, Ty Trumbo, Suehyla El-Attar Young', 'NR', 'High school student Jane Shipley seeks to mend her splintering relationship with childhood best friend Merritt, and fit in with her rebellious peers. When Jane''s math teacher oversteps his bounds, an apathetic high school administration forces Jane and Merritt to take matters into their own hands, driving their relationship into further turmoil and inciting deadly consequences.', 'High school student Jane Shipley seeks to mend her splintering relationship with childhood best friend Merritt, and fit in with her rebellious peers. When Jane''s math teacher oversteps his bounds, an apathetic high school administration forces Jane and Merritt to take matters into their own hands, driving their relationship into further turmoil and inciting deadly consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6WnHUG65DriFyUXZe0qBnZgZTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842891'),
  ('150559839326228057', 'Student Council Staff Members Movie', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Takanori Kikuchi, Shouhei Adachi, Hiromitsu Kanazawa', 'Hiromitsu Kanazawa', 'Shintaro Asanuma, Yoko Hikasa, Satomi Sato, Sayuri Yahagi, Chiwa Saito, Yu Kobayashi, Satomi Arai, Asami Shimoda', null, 'The work of Ousai Private Academy''s student council is never done. This time, Takatoshi, Shino, Aria and Suzu are back with their very own movie! From TV interviews to a new teacher, there''s even more potential for misunderstandings as the double entendres, innuendos and euphemisms reach critical mass.', 'The work of Ousai Private Academy''s student council is never done. This time, Takatoshi, Shino, Aria and Suzu are back with their very own movie! From TV interviews to a new teacher, there''s even more potential for misunderstandings as the double entendres, innuendos and euphemisms reach critical mass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ms4Oap8T5UakgiawWHJr7R2P9T7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440362'),
  ('897062263421191793', 'Student Council Staff Members Movie 2', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Makoto Furuta, Masayuki Tachibana, Tetsuichi Yamagishi', 'Tozen Ujiie', 'Shintaro Asanuma, Yoko Hikasa, Satomi Sato, Sayuri Yahagi, Asami Shimoda, Yu Kobayashi, Chiaki Omigawa, Satomi Arai', null, 'The student council must grapple with a mix of double-entendres and potent teen hormones.', 'The student council must grapple with a mix of double-entendres and potent teen hormones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7xVIzrdpAcnJn7obAzlzXsmyWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653858'),
  ('480135725716571632', 'Student Exchange', 1987, 'Comedy, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mollie Miller, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'William Osborne, William Davies', 'Viveka Davis, Todd Field, Mitchell Anderson, Heather Graham, Maura Tierney, Gavin MacLeod, Lisa Hartman, O. J. Simpson', null, 'Carol and Neil are are successful in terms of grades, but not very popular at their highschool. When Carol comes to know that two foreign exchange students from France and Italy were redirected to another school, she figures she and Neil could take their places and be in the middle of public interest for one semester.', 'Carol and Neil are are successful in terms of grades, but not very popular at their highschool. When Carol comes to know that two foreign exchange students from France and Italy were redirected to another school, she figures she and Neil could take their places and be in the middle of public interest for one semester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOjLUpg7uUk8nU9n2FfUF8QTerW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59977'),
  ('769101897724677407', 'Student Gerber', 1981, 'Drama', 'Evelyn Siewert, Wolfgang Glück, Xaver Schwarzenberger', 'Wolfgang Glück, Werner Schneyder, Friedrich Torberg', 'Gabriel Barylli, Werner Kreindl, Romuald Pekny, Paola Loew, Doris Mayer, Eduard Linkers, Oskar Willner, Helmut Janatsch', null, 'Kurt Gerber is attending his final class and gets into trouble with the math professor, a frustrated self-assured petty bourgeois sadist. The duel ends in catastrophe.', 'Kurt Gerber is attending his final class and gets into trouble with the math professor, a frustrated self-assured petty bourgeois sadist. The duel ends in catastrophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qs6pVSfWlOmwwfr7JEtJs24uCIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119809'),
  ('289407347266494038', 'Student Of The Year', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Karan Johar, Nandini Shrikent, Ayananka Bose', 'Karan Johar, Renzil D''Silva', 'Sidharth Malhotra, Varun Dhawan, Alia Bhatt, Rishi Kapoor, Sana Saeed, Ram Kapoor, Ronit Roy, Sahil Anand', null, 'Several alumni reminisce about their final year at St. Theresa''s College and the events that shaped their lives.', 'Several alumni reminisce about their final year at St. Theresa''s College and the events that shaped their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQIph97KwXmMiXu1kOWPj065P8J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138122'),
  ('534087146817871024', 'Student of the Year 2', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Punit Malhotra, Sharic Sequeira, Ravi K. Chandran', 'Aditya Pawar', 'Tiger Shroff, Ananya Panday, Tara Sutaria, Aditya Seal, Harsh Beniwal, Samir Soni, Gul Panag, Abhishek Bajaj', null, 'A student must overcome bullies and hardships, both academic and romantic, in order to win his college''s coveted Student of the Year trophy.', 'A student must overcome bullies and hardships, both academic and romantic, in order to win his college''s coveted Student of the Year trophy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upy2LuSohFYnMGJQl3039TPnlmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503129'),
  ('123304789803065259', 'Student Services', 2010, 'Drama', 'Emmanuelle Bercot, Christophe Offenstein', 'Emmanuelle Bercot', 'Déborah François, Mathieu Demy, Alain Cauchi, Benjamin Siksou, Anna Sigalevitch, Joseph Braconnier, Marc Chapiteau, Pascal Bongard', 'NR', 'Nineteen-year-old Laura is stressed by her first year at college when money worries distract her from her studies and so, desperate for cash, she answers an online advertisement for intimate companionship that leads her down a dangerous path.', 'Nineteen-year-old Laura is stressed by her first year at college when money worries distract her from her studies and so, desperate for cash, she answers an online advertisement for intimate companionship that leads her down a dangerous path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSpMWP1iX2KeRyIcHV3nINeBxlQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65496'),
  ('90909119774276147', 'Studies on Hysteria', 2012, 'Drama', 'Gabriel Borgetto, Matthias Bäuerle, Bernd Faaß', 'Gabriel Borgetto, Bernd Faaß, Matthias Bäuerle', 'Philip Wilhelmi, Hannah Kobitzsch, Christian Serritiello, Moritz Berg, Michael Görgner, Falk Tröber, Priska Schweißer, Luzie Loose', null, 'Short film about a young man discovering pants in a nudist world. A parable of the societal intolerance to anything different.', 'Short film about a young man discovering pants in a nudist world. A parable of the societal intolerance to anything different.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTlepBAm41eeJ2eSvZLxLcguPDn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244285'),
  ('40400926025631759', 'Studio 54', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Matt Tyrnauer, Tom Hurwitz', null, 'Ian Schrager, Steve Rubell, Donald Rubell, Michael Jackson, Farrah Fawcett, Liza Minnelli, Mikhail Baryshnikov, Jack Benny', null, 'Studio 54 was the epicenter of 70s hedonism - a place that not only redefined the nightclub, but also came to symbolize an entire era. Its co-owners, Ian Schrager and Steve Rubell, two friends from Brooklyn, seemed to come out of nowhere to suddenly preside over a new kind of New York society. Now, 39 years after the velvet rope was first slung across the club''s hallowed threshold, a feature documentary tells the real story behind the greatest club of all time.', 'Studio 54 was the epicenter of 70s hedonism - a place that not only redefined the nightclub, but also came to symbolize an entire era. Its co-owners, Ian Schrager and Steve Rubell, two friends from Brooklyn, seemed to come out of nowhere to suddenly preside over a new kind of New York society. Now, 39 years after the velvet rope was first slung across the club''s hallowed threshold, a feature documentary tells the real story behind the greatest club of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x10hLXIQVGJ5n0Nn2pLVTKBNxXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493101'),
  ('778295815614501321', 'Studio 666', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy, Music', 'Jesse Bellis, Deborah Chung, Christopher T. Sadler', 'Jeff Buhler, Rebecca Hughes', 'Dave Grohl, Taylor Hawkins, Nate Mendel, Pat Smear, Chris Shiflett, Rami Jaffee, Whitney Cummings, Leslie Grossman', 'R', 'Legendary rock band Foo Fighters move into an Encino mansion steeped in grisly rock and roll history to record their much anticipated 10th album. Once in the house, Dave Grohl finds himself grappling with supernatural forces that threaten both the completion of the album and the lives of the band.', 'Legendary rock band Foo Fighters move into an Encino mansion steeped in grisly rock and roll history to record their much anticipated 10th album. Once in the house, Dave Grohl finds himself grappling with supernatural forces that threaten both the completion of the album and the lives of the band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zD2XyaV6eGEEgEzVnjg0hQVR5yz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895744'),
