  ('1090071914503116376', 'Stuff for the Rich', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Sergio D''Offizi, Mimmola Girosi', 'Mario Amendola, Bruno Corbucci, Sergio Corbucci', 'Paolo Villaggio, Serena Grandi, Lino Banfi, Laura Antonelli, Renato Pozzetto, Francesca Dellera, Maurizio Micheli, Aldo Ralli', null, '3 episodes set in Monte Carlo. In the first one a priest is compelled to become the lover of a princess. In the second, a con woman tries to cheat an insurance man. In the third, a man has to deal with his wife''s suicidal attempts.', '3 episodes set in Monte Carlo. In the first one a priest is compelled to become the lover of a princess. In the second, a con woman tries to cheat an insurance man. In the third, a man has to deal with his wife''s suicidal attempts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r933CJTEvu4t3YLuljwws74pmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58613'),
  ('514713692768276145', 'Stuff Stephanie in the Incinerator', 1990, 'Comedy, Thriller, Horror', 'Don Nardo', 'Peter Jones, Don Nardo', 'Catherine Dee, William Dame, M.R. Murphy, Dennis Cunningham, Paul Nielsen, Andy Milkis, Phil Vincent, Paula Lee Gangemi', 'PG-13', 'A bored, filthy rich married couple and their hired help play sordid games of deception, kidnap, sexual intrigue, and perhaps murder when a secret alliance is formed to kill domineering husband Jared for money he''s been hoarding from them. Meanwhile, he may have a secret or two up his sleeves.', 'A bored, filthy rich married couple and their hired help play sordid games of deception, kidnap, sexual intrigue, and perhaps murder when a secret alliance is formed to kill domineering husband Jared for money he''s been hoarding from them. Meanwhile, he may have a secret or two up his sleeves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXzjvv8IfDd50uMbqXMtdKp8ZbX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92495'),
  ('1109002421121703561', 'Stung', 2015, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Benni Diez, Stephan Burchardt', 'Adam Aresty', 'Matt O''Leary, Jessica Cook, Lance Henriksen, Clifton Collins Jr., David Masterson, Ceciiia Pillado, Kathleen Renish, Florentine Lahme', null, 'A fancy garden party turns into upper class prey when a colony of killer wasps mutates into seven foot tall predators.', 'A fancy garden party turns into upper class prey when a colony of killer wasps mutates into seven foot tall predators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcVeFuvxqnWlvoMEWevaeVO0Mm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254472'),
  ('475294953857028860', 'Stunt Rock', 1978, 'Action, Drama, Music', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Helmen Ilmer, Robert Primes', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Paul-Michel Mielche Jr.', 'Grant Page, Monique van de Ven, Margaret Gerard, Paul Haynes, Curtis Hyde, Greg Magie, Smokey Huff , Richie King', null, 'Australian stuntman Grant Page goes to Los Angeles to work on a television series. He uses his spare time to lend his expertise to rock band Sorcery. Page helps the band develop pyrotechnic magic tricks for their shows, and also recounts to his own exploits as a stuntman and daredevil as well as various stunts by other greats.', 'Australian stuntman Grant Page goes to Los Angeles to work on a television series. He uses his spare time to lend his expertise to rock band Sorcery. Page helps the band develop pyrotechnic magic tricks for their shows, and also recounts to his own exploits as a stuntman and daredevil as well as various stunts by other greats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2mIbjRbOan7kB8RikQOLAtPIu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27805'),
