  ('62099693295957538', 'Subedaar', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Suresh Triveni, Ayan Saxena, Anmol Ahuja', 'Suresh Triveni, Prajwal Chandrashekar', 'Anil Kapoor, Radhikka Madan, Aditya Rawal, Saurabh Shukla, Mona Singh, Faisal Malik, Khushboo, Nana Patekar', null, 'Haunted by loss and drifting away from his daughter, a retired Subedaar Arjun Maurya’s newly found civilian life is jolted by one reckless act. As old wounds reopen, he must summon the warrior within to face a new kind of war - one that hits too close to his heart.', 'Haunted by loss and drifting away from his daughter, a retired Subedaar Arjun Maurya’s newly found civilian life is jolted by one reckless act. As old wounds reopen, he must summon the warrior within to face a new kind of war - one that hits too close to his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKn63ZWEVK66OaC1svlI7g6r9ah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1262547'),
