  ('869710375858177021', 'Sublet', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Miller, Eytan Fox', 'Eytan Fox, Itay Segal', 'John Benjamin Hickey, Niv Nissim, Lihi Kornowski, Miki Kam, Peter Spears, Tamir Ginsburg, Gabriel Omri Loukas, Tamar Hannah Shtaierman', null, 'A gay New York Times travel writer comes to Tel Aviv after suffering a tragedy. The energy of the city and his relationship with a younger man brings him back to life.', 'A gay New York Times travel writer comes to Tel Aviv after suffering a tragedy. The energy of the city and his relationship with a younger man brings him back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8imAWfQqfS9DuNWJocJpIjvYmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680635'),
  ('1117268002706976403', 'Sublime', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tony Krantz, Dermott Downs', null, 'Tom Cavanagh, Kathleen York, Kat Coiro, Kyle Gallner, Shanna Collins, Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs, David Clayton Rogers, Cas Anvar', 'R', 'Admitted to Mt. Abaddon Hospital for a routine procedure, George Grieves discovers that his condition is much more serious and complicated than originally expected; and as his own fears begin to manifest around him, he learns that Mt. Abaddon is not a place where people come to get better... it is a place where people come to die.', 'Admitted to Mt. Abaddon Hospital for a routine procedure, George Grieves discovers that his condition is much more serious and complicated than originally expected; and as his own fears begin to manifest around him, he learns that Mt. Abaddon is not a place where people come to get better... it is a place where people come to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/285yCXj3JIe7rXdedZJ0FD4KPnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9783'),
  ('273188838626928392', 'Sublime', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mariano Biasin', 'Mariano Biasin', 'Martín Miller, Teo Inama Chiabrando, Joaquín Arana, Facundo Trotonda, Azul Mazzeo, Pedro González, Agustina Midolo, Candela de Carli', null, 'When 16-year-old Manu realises that he has fallen in love with his bandmate Felipe, turbulent emotions start brewing beneath the surface. How do you avoid losing a friendship once its very foundation has shifted?', 'When 16-year-old Manu realises that he has fallen in love with his bandmate Felipe, turbulent emotions start brewing beneath the surface. How do you avoid losing a friendship once its very foundation has shifted?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8B2aIWVoaJJ40tixneEWcDJJn6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831986'),
