  ('533927019595446241', 'Submarine Alert', 1943, 'Action, Thriller, War', 'Frank McDonald, Fred Jackman Jr.', 'Maxwell Shane', 'Richard Arlen, Wendy Barrie, Nils Asther, Roger Pryor, Abner Biberman, Marc Lawrence, John Miljan, Patsy Nash', 'NR', 'Nazi spies use a stolen shortwave transmitter prototype to broadcast top secret shipping info to an offshore Japanese sub. To nab the spy ring, the Government has the West Coast''s top radio engineers fired and shadowed to see if the Nazis recruit them to complete work on the prototype radio. Radio engineer Lew Deerhold, a resident alien without a job to pay for his adorable little ward Gina''s life-saving operation, falls prey to the spy ring, and is swept up in a maelstrom of deceit and danger.', 'Nazi spies use a stolen shortwave transmitter prototype to broadcast top secret shipping info to an offshore Japanese sub. To nab the spy ring, the Government has the West Coast''s top radio engineers fired and shadowed to see if the Nazis recruit them to complete work on the prototype radio. Radio engineer Lew Deerhold, a resident alien without a job to pay for his adorable little ward Gina''s life-saving operation, falls prey to the spy ring, and is swept up in a maelstrom of deceit and danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aofjS2KvnJh8ap7cE1ZWQnany9N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80259'),
  ('591423580319251679', 'Submarine Command', 1951, 'War, Drama', 'John Farrow, Lionel Lindon, Ralph Axness', 'Jonathan Latimer', 'William Holden, Nancy Olson, William Bendix, Don Taylor, Arthur Franz, Darryl Hickman, Peggy Webber, Moroni Olsen', 'NR', 'Submarine commander Ken White is forced to suddenly submerge, leaving his captain and another crew member to die outside the sub during WW II. Subsequent years of meaningless navy ground assignments and the animosity of a former sailor, leave White (now a captain) feeling guilty and empty. His life spirals downward and his wife is about to leave him. Suddenly, he is forced into a dangerous rescue situation at the start of the Koren War.... reassigned to the same submarine where all of his problems began.', 'Submarine commander Ken White is forced to suddenly submerge, leaving his captain and another crew member to die outside the sub during WW II. Subsequent years of meaningless navy ground assignments and the animosity of a former sailor, leave White (now a captain) feeling guilty and empty. His life spirals downward and his wife is about to leave him. Suddenly, he is forced into a dangerous rescue situation at the start of the Koren War.... reassigned to the same submarine where all of his problems began.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/X1SkdILiz4r3rsn80bSEkdDCYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152266'),
  ('847373061066415756', 'Submarine X-1', 1968, 'War', 'William A. Graham, Paul Beeson', 'Guy Elmes, Donald S. Sanford', 'James Caan, David Sumner, Norman Bowler, Paul Young, Brian Grellis, William Dysart, John Kelland, Kenneth Farrington', null, 'After losing a submarine and fifty crew in a battle with a German ship during WWII, a Royal Navy officer gets a second chance in a daring raid with midget subs.', 'After losing a submarine and fifty crew in a battle with a German ship during WWII, a Royal Navy officer gets a second chance in a daring raid with midget subs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peGy8op8kUvQTI3cEvBjBUrFzgl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65049'),
  ('105140336685963185', 'Submarino', 2010, 'Drama', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Charlotte Bruus Christensen', 'Tobias Lindholm, Thomas Vinterberg', 'Jakob Cedergren, Peter Plaugborg, Gustav Fischer Kjærulff, Morten Rose, Henrik Strube, Helene Reingaard Neumann, Patricia Schumann, Dar Salim', null, 'As children, Nick and his little brother take care of their baby brother while their mother drinks herself senseless. But the baby dies, and both brothers blame themselves. Many years later, Nick is out of prison after serving time for an assault. He drinks, lives in a shelter and tries to help an old friend. When their mother dies, Nick meets his brother at the funeral. The brother, who remains nameless, is a single father to a young boy, but also supports a drug habit that is spiraling out of control. When an opportunity presents itself, he becomes a drug dealer to secure his son''s future. Eventually, the two brothers meet again.', 'As children, Nick and his little brother take care of their baby brother while their mother drinks herself senseless. But the baby dies, and both brothers blame themselves. Many years later, Nick is out of prison after serving time for an assault. He drinks, lives in a shelter and tries to help an old friend. When their mother dies, Nick meets his brother at the funeral. The brother, who remains nameless, is a single father to a young boy, but also supports a drug habit that is spiraling out of control. When an opportunity presents itself, he becomes a drug dealer to secure his son''s future. Eventually, the two brothers meet again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzkQqjphmXSMoJjxOGcDitPhjAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46789'),
  ('427158858700836622', 'Submerged', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Anthony Hickox, David Bridges', 'Anthony Hickox, Paul de Souza', 'Steven Seagal, Christine Adams, William Hope, Nick Brimble, Vinnie Jones, Alison King, P.H. Moriarty, Gary Daniels', 'R', 'Chris Kody, imprisoned member of the US military, is released from prison and reunited with his old team in order to pursue a renegade scientist. The catch, the scientist has developed mind control technology that can make even your friends into heartless killers.', 'Chris Kody, imprisoned member of the US military, is released from prison and reunited with his old team in order to pursue a renegade scientist. The catch, the scientist has developed mind control technology that can make even your friends into heartless killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSK2kpsxFx6l1rgH3OnLJJfSek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14180'),
  ('866392536210135026', 'Submerged', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Steven C. Miller, Joseph White, Duane Journey', 'Scott Milam', 'Jonathan Bennett, Talulah Riley, Tim Daly, Mario Van Peebles, Cody Christian, Rosa Salazar, Denzel Whitaker, Willa Ford', null, 'A limo ride turns hellish as several kidnappers set their sights on the young people inside.', 'A limo ride turns hellish as several kidnappers set their sights on the young people inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9kIgLMpXdZ4AmYhDb39UzL7o5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291290'),
  ('104576687343099618', 'Submergence', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Virginie Hernvann, Andreas Olshausen, Wim Wenders', 'Erin Dignam', 'James McAvoy, Alicia Vikander, Celyn Jones, Alexander Siddig, Alex Hafner, Harvey Friedman, Jean-Pierre Lorit, Loïc Corbery', 'NR', 'While James More is held captive by terrorists in Somalia, thousands of miles away on the Greenland Sea, his lover Danny Flinders prepares to dive herself in a submersible into the deep bottom of the ocean, tormented by the memories of their brief encounter in France and her inability to know his whereabouts.', 'While James More is held captive by terrorists in Somalia, thousands of miles away on the Greenland Sea, his lover Danny Flinders prepares to dive herself in a submersible into the deep bottom of the ocean, tormented by the memories of their brief encounter in France and her inability to know his whereabouts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPwANB5cMjJLfRru45sc7Mnkjrq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375327'),
