  ('400366915329901596', 'Submit to Me', 1986, 'Horror', 'Richard Kern', 'Richard Kern', 'Adrienne Altenhaus, Margo Day, Cruella De Ville, Richard Kern, Phil Forrest, Lung Leg, Lydia Lunch, Brian Moran', null, 'Cinema of Transgression pioneers and participants (Lydia Lunch, Lung Leg, Nick Zedd, etc.) perform a series of acts as they submit to director Richard Kern''s camera. Originally created for DTNY acid parties; Submit to Me was eventually edited down to 10 minutes and given an accompanying score.', 'Cinema of Transgression pioneers and participants (Lydia Lunch, Lung Leg, Nick Zedd, etc.) perform a series of acts as they submit to director Richard Kern''s camera. Originally created for DTNY acid parties; Submit to Me was eventually edited down to 10 minutes and given an accompanying score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NugTemLCTJCC7Mzi3h8DqpPCTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183363'),
