  ('365596745425494307', 'Subramaniapuram', 2008, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'M. Sasikumar, S. R. Kathir', 'M. Sasikumar', 'Jai Sampath, M. Sasikumar, Ganja Karuppu, Maari, Vichithran, Samuthirakani, Swathi Reddy, Sithan Mohan', null, 'In 1980, five friends live a carefree life in Madurai until they commit a near-perfect crime but do not manage to get away with it.', 'In 1980, five friends live a carefree life in Madurai until they commit a near-perfect crime but do not manage to get away with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6fX9TDrzNPEYBK6ia1FMz84g2j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76850'),
  ('863542173272611569', 'Subservience', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'SK Dale, Daniel Lindholm, Nancy Foy', 'Will Honley, April Maguire', 'Megan Fox, Michele Morrone, Madeline Zima, Matilda Firth, Andrew Whipp, Atanas Srebrev, Kate Nichols, Trevor Van Uden', 'R', 'With his wife out sick, a struggling father brings home a lifelike AI, only to have his self-aware new help want everything her new family has to offer... Like the affection of her owner and she''ll kill to get it.', 'With his wife out sick, a struggling father brings home a lifelike AI, only to have his self-aware new help want everything her new family has to offer... Like the affection of her owner and she''ll kill to get it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBenxR01Uy0Ev9RTIw6dVBPoyQU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064028'),
  ('141951121407030377', 'Subspecies', 1991, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Ted Nicolaou, Carmencita-Antoaneta Marin, David Allen', 'David Pabian, Jackson Barr', 'Anders Hove, Angus Scrimm, Laura Mae Tate, Irina Movilă, Michelle McBride, Ivan J. Rado, Mara Grigore, Adrian Vâlcu', 'R', 'Three students get caught in the struggle between a good vampire and his evil brother in the Transylvanian mountains.', 'Three students get caught in the struggle between a good vampire and his evil brother in the Transylvanian mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDN4ILUNcYpy4IxnBkSspKHeUUb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24789'),
  ('615715524505199671', 'Subspecies 4: Bloodstorm', 1998, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Ted Nicolaou, Teodor Oprea, Adolfo Bartoli', 'Ted Nicolaou', 'Anders Hove, Denice Duff, Ioana Abur, Jonathon Morris, Mihai Dinvale, Floriela Grappini, Dan Aştileanu, Ion Haiduc', 'R', 'Vampire fledgling Michelle Morgan has escaped the grasp of her master Radu Vladislas. Found by a woman named Ana, she is taken to a hospital where a doctor claims to be able to cure her vampirism. Radu, recovering from the near-death delivered by Michelle and her friends, travels to Bucharest to follow his fledgling. He visits the vampire Ash''s stronghold. Ash and his protege Serena plot to destroy Radu and employ the help of the humans, Ana and the Doctor.', 'Vampire fledgling Michelle Morgan has escaped the grasp of her master Radu Vladislas. Found by a woman named Ana, she is taken to a hospital where a doctor claims to be able to cure her vampirism. Radu, recovering from the near-death delivered by Michelle and her friends, travels to Bucharest to follow his fledgling. He visits the vampire Ash''s stronghold. Ash and his protege Serena plot to destroy Radu and employ the help of the humans, Ana and the Doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubgguzW7B3wyHmVVDNYnujHfnSp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52022'),
  ('1121867766513871295', 'Subspecies V: Blood Rise', 2023, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Janko Djuric, Vladimir Vladica Ilić, Ted Nicolaou', 'Ted Nicolaou', 'Anders Hove, Denice Duff, Kevin Spirtas, Staša Nikolić, Yulia Graut, Petar Arsić, Olivera Peruničić, Marko Filipović', 'NR', 'Stolen by crusaders on the night of his birth, Radu (Anders Hove) has no knowledge of his bloodline: his mother is a demon; his father is a vampire. Trained and exploited by a brotherhood of mystic monks to slay all enemies of the church, fate brings him back one night to the castle of his father, armed with the monster-slaying Sword of Laertes, to destroy the vampire Vladislas and reclaim a holy relic: The Bloodstone. The events of that night turn Radu from a noble man into a vampire with no master, setting him on a centuries-long quest for sustenance, and companionship, for the treacherous one who stole him from the sun, and for the Bloodstone he hopes will bring him peace.', 'Stolen by crusaders on the night of his birth, Radu (Anders Hove) has no knowledge of his bloodline: his mother is a demon; his father is a vampire. Trained and exploited by a brotherhood of mystic monks to slay all enemies of the church, fate brings him back one night to the castle of his father, armed with the monster-slaying Sword of Laertes, to destroy the vampire Vladislas and reclaim a holy relic: The Bloodstone. The events of that night turn Radu from a noble man into a vampire with no master, setting him on a centuries-long quest for sustenance, and companionship, for the treacherous one who stole him from the sun, and for the Bloodstone he hopes will bring him peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5H3MghbnOahWeUuM8dn5mmDrrDO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596702'),
  ('827802143709639232', 'Substitute Teacher', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Guido Leoni, Romolo Garroni', 'Guido Leoni, Sandro Leoni', 'Carmen Villani, Eligio Zamara, Carlo Giuffrè, Dayle Haddon, Alvaro Brunetti, Gisela Hahn, Gastone Pescucci, Giusi Raspani Dandolo', null, 'A high school student falls in love with the provocative substitute, but she prefers the gym teacher.', 'A high school student falls in love with the provocative substitute, but she prefers the gym teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfEhxeqcd94LXSnbY9s06rTAYUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403446'),
  ('920571446616569228', 'Subtraction', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mani Haghighi', 'Amir Reza Koohestani, Mani Haghighi', 'Navid Mohammadzadeh, Taraneh Alidoosti, Farham Azizi, Ismaeel Pourreza, Vahid Aghapoor, Ali Bagheri, Saeed Changizian, Gilda Vishki', null, 'After a confusing interaction in downtown Tehran, a married couple seems to have found their doppelgängers.', 'After a confusing interaction in downtown Tehran, a married couple seems to have found their doppelgängers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGsBOd9aXPcRAkSODEZBMX5lMTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008043'),
  ('60774870812917726', 'Suburban Commando', 1991, 'Action, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Burt Kennedy, Bernd Heinl', 'Frank A. Cappello', 'Hulk Hogan, Christopher Lloyd, Shelley Duvall, Larry Miller, William Ball, Jo Ann Dearing, Jack Elam, Roy Dotrice', 'PG', 'Shep Ramsey is an interstellar hero, righting wrongs, etc. His ship is damaged after a fight with an interstellar nasty and he must hide out on Earth until it can recharge. He leaves his power suit at home, but still finds himself unable to allow wrongs to go unrighted and so mixes it up with bad drivers, offensive paperboys, muggers and the like.', 'Shep Ramsey is an interstellar hero, righting wrongs, etc. His ship is damaged after a fight with an interstellar nasty and he must hide out on Earth until it can recharge. He leaves his power suit at home, but still finds himself unable to allow wrongs to go unrighted and so mixes it up with bad drivers, offensive paperboys, muggers and the like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wE8WUFEfkZnNDLMpWNmyiJr8E7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11504'),
  ('151949630153600900', 'Suburban Girl', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Marc Klein, Steven Fierberg', 'Marc Klein', 'Sarah Michelle Gellar, Alec Baldwin, Maggie Grace, James Naughton, Chris Carmack, Vanessa Branch, Peter Scolari, Marian Seldes', 'PG-13', 'Publishing assistant Brett Eisenberg wants to be a big-time editor. However, she lacks self-confidence, a problem that isn''t helped by her new, overbearing boss. Brett soon enters into a relationship with Archie, an older man who has plenty of his own issues, including alcoholism, diabetes and a difficult relationship with his daughter. Intent on helping Archie get past his problems, she turns to her dying father for advice.', 'Publishing assistant Brett Eisenberg wants to be a big-time editor. However, she lacks self-confidence, a problem that isn''t helped by her new, overbearing boss. Brett soon enters into a relationship with Archie, an older man who has plenty of his own issues, including alcoholism, diabetes and a difficult relationship with his daughter. Intent on helping Archie get past his problems, she turns to her dying father for advice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkXyvlMzlU9yszj6Y2TyjbxLUkj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13525'),
  ('503764208195216632', 'Suburban Gothic', 2014, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Lucas Lee Graham, Richard Bates Jr.', 'Mark Bruner, Richard Bates Jr.', 'Matthew Gray Gubler, Ray Wise, Kat Dennings, Sally Kirkland, Jeffrey Combs, John Waters, Mackenzie Phillips, Barbara Niven', 'R', 'An awkward, unemployed man who can talk to the dead teams up with a rebellious bartender to find the vengeful ghost that''s been terrorizing their town.', 'An awkward, unemployed man who can talk to the dead teams up with a rebellious bartender to find the vengeful ghost that''s been terrorizing their town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3oWzE9jzCNfJ1B1R1ndVVG5Uh9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277688'),
  ('586085215956116039', 'Suburban Mayhem', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Paul Goldman, Robert Humphreys', 'Alice Bell', 'Emily Barclay, Steve Bastoni, Laurence Breuls, Michael Dorman, Anthony Hayes, Geneviève Lemon, Robert Morgan, Susan Prior', null, 'Can you really get away with murder? Welcome to the world of Katrina, a 19-year-old single mum who''s planning to do just that. Katrina lives in a world of petty crime, fast cars, manicures and blow-jobs. A master manipulator of men living at home with her father in suburban Golden Grove, Katrina will stop at nothing to get what she wants - even murder.', 'Can you really get away with murder? Welcome to the world of Katrina, a 19-year-old single mum who''s planning to do just that. Katrina lives in a world of petty crime, fast cars, manicures and blow-jobs. A master manipulator of men living at home with her father in suburban Golden Grove, Katrina will stop at nothing to get what she wants - even murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhEKR2Zy3blAURztzqhSUp7SUvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13943'),
  ('244679008536023534', 'Suburban Sasquatch', 2004, 'Horror', 'Dave Wascavage, Dave Wascavage', 'Dave Wascavage', 'Sue Lynn Sanchez, Bill Ushler, Dave Bonavita, Juan Fernandez, Wes Miller, Loretta Wascavage, Troy Stephen Sanders, Dave Wascavage', null, 'A mystical Sasquatch is on the loose in suburbia and only a Native American warrior can stop it.', 'A mystical Sasquatch is on the loose in suburbia and only a Native American warrior can stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vqj2LTv5p37N9KdbiFh8c8e6P1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84297'),
  ('29580194556819406', 'Suburbia', 1984, 'Drama, Music, Thriller', 'Penelope Spheeris, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Penelope Spheeris', 'Chris Pedersen, Bill Coyne, Jennifer Clay, Timothy Eric O''Brien, Wade Walston, Flea, Maggie Ehrig, Grant Miner', 'R', 'When household tensions and a sense of worthlessness overcome Evan, he finds escape when he clings with the orphans of a throw-away society. The runaways hold on to each other like a family until a tragedy tears them apart.', 'When household tensions and a sense of worthlessness overcome Evan, he finds escape when he clings with the orphans of a throw-away society. The runaways hold on to each other like a family until a tragedy tears them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vydIE7nizxO04ER9EcDdbdaHh8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28054'),
  ('1075105664194706407', 'SubUrbia', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Catherine Hardwicke, Donald Murphy, James Alan Hensz', 'Eric Bogosian', 'Giovanni Ribisi, Steve Zahn, Amie Carey, Nicky Katt, Parker Posey, Ajay Naidu, Jayce Bartok, Dina Spybey-Waters', 'R', 'A group of suburban teenagers try to support each other through the difficult task of becoming adults.', 'A group of suburban teenagers try to support each other through the difficult task of becoming adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PdRbG09K9JHYyOwwCSn3OdJb0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28059'),
  ('380484132044158215', 'Suburbicon', 2017, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'George Clooney, Christa Munro, Eric Richard Lasko', 'Ethan Coen, Joel Coen, George Clooney', 'Matt Damon, Julianne Moore, Noah Jupe, Oscar Isaac, Landon Gordon, Glenn Fleshler, Alex Hassell, Karimah Westbrook', 'R', 'In the quiet family town of Suburbicon during the 1950s, the best and worst of humanity is hilariously reflected through the deeds of seemingly ordinary people. When a home invasion turns deadly, a picture-perfect family turns to blackmail, revenge and murder.', 'In the quiet family town of Suburbicon during the 1950s, the best and worst of humanity is hilariously reflected through the deeds of seemingly ordinary people. When a home invasion turns deadly, a picture-perfect family turns to blackmail, revenge and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqYwf0kPK2SaCWM80msl4nYK6U7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395458'),
  ('488683456248659016', 'Suburra', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Paolo Carnera, Stefano Sollima', 'Stefano Rulli, Sandro Petraglia, Carlo Bonini', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Claudio Amendola, Alessandro Borghi, Elio Germano, Greta Scarano, Giulia Elettra Gorietti, Adamo Dionisi, Giacomo Ferrara', null, 'A gangster known as "Samurai" wants to turn the waterfront of Rome into a new Las Vegas. All the local mob bosses have agreed to work for this common goal. But peace is not to last long.', 'A gangster known as "Samurai" wants to turn the waterfront of Rome into a new Las Vegas. All the local mob bosses have agreed to work for this common goal. But peace is not to last long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ml6iNvTVrWxDusMhbizphQjCHPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356296'),
  ('956893620401923738', 'Subway', 1985, 'Action, Thriller', 'Luc Besson, Carlo Varini, Patrick Alessandrin', 'Luc Besson, Alain Le Henry, Pierre Jolivet', 'Isabelle Adjani, Christopher Lambert, Richard Bohringer, Michel Galabru, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Jean Bouise, Jean Reno', null, 'Fred, a raffish safe blower, takes refuge in the Paris Metro after being chased by the henchmen of a shady businessman from whom he has just stolen some documents. While hiding out in the back rooms and conduits of the Metro, Fred encounters a subterranean society of eccentric characters and petty criminals.', 'Fred, a raffish safe blower, takes refuge in the Paris Metro after being chased by the henchmen of a shady businessman from whom he has just stolen some documents. While hiding out in the back rooms and conduits of the Metro, Fred encounters a subterranean society of eccentric characters and petty criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EOFUWs0ImeyiRUtFpbHuGGTNUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10656'),
  ('949164210378987680', 'Subway in the Sky', 1959, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Muriel Box, Wilkie Cooper', 'Jack Andrews', 'Van Johnson, Hildegard Knef, Albert Lieven, Cec Linder, Katherine Kath, Vivian Matalon, Carl Jaffe, Chuck Keyser', 'NR', 'Berlin provides the backdrop for this crime drama that centers on a military doctor falsely accused of dealing illegal drugs. Determined to prove his innocence, he escapes from the MPs and ends up holing up in the apartment his wife rented. He doesn''t know that she has sublet the flat to a nightclub singer. When he finds out, he begs the singer to assist him. She is attracted to him and agrees. The doctor believes that his wife is behind the black-market dealings, but in the end, they find the real culprit.', 'Berlin provides the backdrop for this crime drama that centers on a military doctor falsely accused of dealing illegal drugs. Determined to prove his innocence, he escapes from the MPs and ends up holing up in the apartment his wife rented. He doesn''t know that she has sublet the flat to a nightclub singer. When he finds out, he begs the singer to assist him. She is attracted to him and agrees. The doctor believes that his wife is behind the black-market dealings, but in the end, they find the real culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OIRLAE1zdFl6OXr8ZZnnMwyUeG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4455'),
  ('241209332130328757', 'Subway Stories', 1997, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Bob Balaban, Patricia Benoit, Julie Dash', 'Adam Brooks, John Guare, Lynn Grossman', 'Sarita Choudhury, Anne Heche, Taral Hicks, Gregory Hines, Danny Hoch, Israel Horovitz, Bonnie Hunt, Bill Irwin', 'R', 'An anthology of 10 stories depicting real-life incidents of subway riders in New York City, which range from compassion and love to violence and loss.', 'An anthology of 10 stories depicting real-life incidents of subway riders in New York City, which range from compassion and love to violence and loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzy2cwGh3fssoxqaIJFWOnMax5x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209802'),
  ('522182659907868478', 'Successive Slidings of Pleasure', 1974, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet, Yves Lafaye, Luc Béraud', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet', 'Anicée Alvina, Olga Georges-Picot, Michael Lonsdale, Marianne Eggerickx, Isabelle Huppert, Maxence Mailfort, Claude Marcault, Nathalie Zeiger', null, 'A young woman is questioned by the police and the judges, suspected of being a modern witch. The girl who shared her apartment has been found dead, and a pair of scissors impaled through her heart, as she lay attached to the bedposts. Apparently, the girl does have powers, to make all people around her fall prey to her spell, glissing progressively into desire, lust, and the unknown.', 'A young woman is questioned by the police and the judges, suspected of being a modern witch. The girl who shared her apartment has been found dead, and a pair of scissors impaled through her heart, as she lay attached to the bedposts. Apparently, the girl does have powers, to make all people around her fall prey to her spell, glissing progressively into desire, lust, and the unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBJoqPs9FL7HvlI1qOLLp9IiC6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78071'),
  ('887085083690516161', 'Successor', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Peng Damo, Yan Fei, Sun Ming', 'Yan Fei, Peng Damo, Lin Bingbao', 'Teng Shen, Ma Li, Shi Pengyuan, Sa Rina, Xiao Bochen, Zhang Zidong, Jackie Li, Wei Xiang', null, 'Ma Chenggang, a wealthy man in Xihong City, worries that his eldest son is too spoiled to succeed him. Determined to raise a capable successor, he takes an unconventional approach. They conceal their wealth, moving the family to a dilapidated neighborhood, and maintain an illusion of poverty, so that his son could develop qualities such as hard work, knowledge, careful budgeting, physical fitness, and perseverance.', 'Ma Chenggang, a wealthy man in Xihong City, worries that his eldest son is too spoiled to succeed him. Determined to raise a capable successor, he takes an unconventional approach. They conceal their wealth, moving the family to a dilapidated neighborhood, and maintain an illusion of poverty, so that his son could develop qualities such as hard work, knowledge, careful budgeting, physical fitness, and perseverance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqGZEk4sLGGmIXBDQzxTuT1lZx2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1299537'),
  ('835182161971482387', 'Succubus', 1968, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Jorge Herrero, Franz Xaver Lederle', 'Pier A. Caminnecci', 'Janine Reynaud, Jack Taylor, Adrian Hoven, Howard Vernon, Nathalie Nort, Michel Lemoine, Pier A. Caminnecci, Eva Brauner', null, 'Lorna Green is a performer at a Lisbon nightclub who performs fictionalized acts that involve erotically charged sadomasochistic murders. As she begins to suffer violent, surreal nightmares, she starts to believe that she may be under mind control by a man who may be Satan incarnate.', 'Lorna Green is a performer at a Lisbon nightclub who performs fictionalized acts that involve erotically charged sadomasochistic murders. As she begins to suffer violent, surreal nightmares, she starts to believe that she may be under mind control by a man who may be Satan incarnate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4CtRLNX29DWgUGk9pjqUnQbjok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28279'),
  ('692547236535422221', 'Succubus', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'R.J. Daniel Hanna', 'R.J. Daniel Hanna', 'Brendan Bradley, Rachel Cook, Olivia Grace Applegate, Derek Smith, Emily Kincaid, Ron Perlman, Rosanna Arquette', null, 'A new father going through a marital separation joins a dating app and matches with a beautiful but mysterious young woman... whose powers of seduction and manipulation entangle him in a mystery more horrifying than he could have ever imagined.', 'A new father going through a marital separation joins a dating app and matches with a beautiful but mysterious young woman... whose powers of seduction and manipulation entangle him in a mystery more horrifying than he could have ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AfBMebJS8mEtSV5ymdxEPpgvXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1130276'),
