  ('822461745659685026', 'Suck', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror, Music', 'Rob Stefaniuk, D. Gregor Hagey', 'Rob Stefaniuk', 'Malcolm McDowell, Iggy Pop, Henry Rollins, Alice Cooper, Jessica Paré, Dave Foley, Moby, Rob Stefaniuk', 'R', 'The film follows a petty rock band called the Winners, consisting of vocalist Joey Winner, bassist Jennifer, guitarist Tyler, drummer Sam, and French-Canadian roadie Hugo, along with their sleazy manager Jeff, as they tour across Canada and the USA after Jennifer is turned into a vampire by Queeny. Meanwhile, a vampire hunter who is afraid of the dark named Eddie Van Helsing quickly chases them down.', 'The film follows a petty rock band called the Winners, consisting of vocalist Joey Winner, bassist Jennifer, guitarist Tyler, drummer Sam, and French-Canadian roadie Hugo, along with their sleazy manager Jeff, as they tour across Canada and the USA after Jennifer is turned into a vampire by Queeny. Meanwhile, a vampire hunter who is afraid of the dark named Eddie Van Helsing quickly chases them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23cE4h55B8fgtt0XiQZZNWE3RfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44028'),
  ('921639863308429026', 'Suck Me Shakespeer', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Bora Dağtekin, Christof Wahl, Katharina Haase', 'Bora Dağtekin, Simon Hauschild', 'Elyas M''Barek, Karoline Herfurth, Katja Riemann, Jana Pallaske, Alwara Höfels, Jella Haase, Max von der Groeben, Lena Klenke', null, 'Ex-con Zeki Müller goes undercover as a teacher at a below average Gymnasium to find money he''d stashed prior to incarceration.', 'Ex-con Zeki Müller goes undercover as a teacher at a below average Gymnasium to find money he''d stashed prior to incarceration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hV88MiailtnGVF6rbp6Ug6UBKYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233063'),
  ('146394258165545443', 'Suck Me Shakespeer 2', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Andreas Berger, Bora Dağtekin, Chanon Amorntatpong', 'Bora Dağtekin', 'Elyas M''Barek, Jella Haase, Karoline Herfurth, Katja Riemann, Volker Bruch, Max von der Groeben, Aram Arami, Lena Klenke', null, 'A rowdy teacher accompanies a class trip to Thailand to recover some diamonds accidentally sent there and restore the school''s reputation.', 'A rowdy teacher accompanies a class trip to Thailand to recover some diamonds accidentally sent there and restore the school''s reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbpmtx3XUZIwHA8sVqWpHyTIV0V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329263'),
  ('699144288438074112', 'Suck Me Shakespeer 3', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Bora Dağtekin, Markus Nestroy, Kim Doyen', 'Bora Dağtekin', 'Elyas M''Barek, Jella Haase, Sandra Hüller, Katja Riemann, Max von der Groeben, Gizem Emre, Aram Arami, Lucas Reiber', null, 'A bank robber becomes a teacher after being released from prison and finds himself at the center of a number of crazy adventures.', 'A bank robber becomes a teacher after being released from prison and finds himself at the center of a number of crazy adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXNF83QyA2YsBaTh3aATnBw4iQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437670'),
  ('306832636465191025', 'Suck Seed', 2011, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Siwawut Sewatanon, Saroch Nuamsamran, Weerachai Yaikwawong', 'Thodsapon Thiptinnakorn, Chayanop Bunprakob, Siwawut Sewatanon', 'Jirayu La-ongmanee, Pachara Chirathivat, Thawat Pornrattanaprasert, Nattasha Nauljam, Napat Chokejindachai, Gunn Junhavat, Tonhon Tantivejakul, Warinthorn Makhornsirisri', null, 'When his boyhood crush Ern returns, Ped forms a band with his friend to impress her. Romantic rivalries bloom after the talented Ern joins the group.', 'When his boyhood crush Ern returns, Ped forms a band with his friend to impress her. Romantic rivalries bloom after the talented Ern joins the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkdXbzR52ghc6ZN729MHAjenUlm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64004'),
  ('377564528452916537', 'Sucker Free City', 2004, 'Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Spike Lee, César Charlone', 'Alex Tse', 'Ben Crowley, Ken Leung, Anthony Mackie, Darris Love, Laura Allen, T.V. Carpio, Kathy Baker, James Hong', null, 'The film follows three young men as they are drawn into lives of crime. Nick (Crowley) uses his entry-level corporate job to commit credit card fraud and deals drugs on the side. K-Luv (Mackie) is a member of the "V-Dubs", an African-American street gang. Lincoln (Leung) is a rising figure in the Chinese mafia. Gentrification forces Nick''s family to move out of their home in the Mission District into Hunter''s Point where they are harassed by the V-Dubs. K-Luv''s side business of selling bootleg compact discs leads him to enlist Nick''s help to bootleg CDs and to negotiate a truce with Lincoln. Lincoln conducts an affair with his boss'' daughter Angela (Carpio), a Stanford student engaged to a medical student classmate.', 'The film follows three young men as they are drawn into lives of crime. Nick (Crowley) uses his entry-level corporate job to commit credit card fraud and deals drugs on the side. K-Luv (Mackie) is a member of the "V-Dubs", an African-American street gang. Lincoln (Leung) is a rising figure in the Chinese mafia. Gentrification forces Nick''s family to move out of their home in the Mission District into Hunter''s Point where they are harassed by the V-Dubs. K-Luv''s side business of selling bootleg compact discs leads him to enlist Nick''s help to bootleg CDs and to negotiate a truce with Lincoln. Lincoln conducts an affair with his boss'' daughter Angela (Carpio), a Stanford student engaged to a medical student classmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1F5fspEEqpK5MkpfFLicNMYRoFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65724'),
  ('391585831372990273', 'Sucker Punch', 2008, 'Action', 'Malcolm Martin', 'Malcolm Martin', 'Danny John-Jules, Gordon Alexander, Lisa Nash, Leon Walters, Kara Scott, Jimmy Kent, Ian Freeman, Tom Hardy', null, 'Ray ''Harley'' Davidson is a hustler. With flash clothes and a fast mouth, Harley lives life in the fast lane. With his passion for all things gambling, money runs like water through Harley''s hands and as quickly as he makes a killing he takes a beating, normally at the poker table. Nominally an illegal prize-fight manager, Harley hasn''t produced a live one in months, until Charles Buchinsky literally wanders into his life. Charles Buchinsky, street fighter extraordinaire. He''s from out of town looking for a fight and the chance to tie up a few loose ends. Keeps himself to himself, lets his fists do the talking and his word is his bond. Victor Maitland, top illegal fight promoter and porn baron. Hates losing and loves the prestige of managing the best hitter in town. Harley dreams of bringing Maitland down and after seeing Buchinsky at work, engineers a fragile partnership. The duo soon becomes a hot ticket...', 'Ray ''Harley'' Davidson is a hustler. With flash clothes and a fast mouth, Harley lives life in the fast lane. With his passion for all things gambling, money runs like water through Harley''s hands and as quickly as he makes a killing he takes a beating, normally at the poker table. Nominally an illegal prize-fight manager, Harley hasn''t produced a live one in months, until Charles Buchinsky literally wanders into his life. Charles Buchinsky, street fighter extraordinaire. He''s from out of town looking for a fight and the chance to tie up a few loose ends. Keeps himself to himself, lets his fists do the talking and his word is his bond. Victor Maitland, top illegal fight promoter and porn baron. Hates losing and loves the prestige of managing the best hitter in town. Harley dreams of bringing Maitland down and after seeing Buchinsky at work, engineers a fragile partnership. The duo soon becomes a hot ticket...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyR5sKqwUkPCsv0Ru53IceiQdBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54185'),
  ('132971773912103104', 'Sucker Punch', 2011, 'Action, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Zack Snyder, Larry Fong, Stefan Dechant', 'Zack Snyder, Steve Shibuya', 'Emily Browning, Abbie Cornish, Jena Malone, Vanessa Hudgens, Jamie Chung, Carla Gugino, Oscar Isaac, Jon Hamm', 'PG-13', 'A young woman, institutionalized by her abusive stepfather, retreats into a vivid fantasy world where she envisions a plan to escape. Gathering a group of fellow inmates, she embarks on a quest to collect five mystical items, blurring the lines between reality and imagination.', 'A young woman, institutionalized by her abusive stepfather, retreats into a vivid fantasy world where she envisions a plan to escape. Gathering a group of fellow inmates, she embarks on a quest to collect five mystical items, blurring the lines between reality and imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtaUDnvIiHUd2ranDcjB5AbPx6o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23629'),
  ('807629944028160051', 'Sucker: The Vampire', 1998, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Hans Rodionoff', 'Hans Rodionoff', 'Yan Birch, Alex Erkiletian, Monica Baber, P.K. Phillips, Colleen Moore, Harvey J. Alperin, Gregory Fawcett, Melissa Park', null, 'Working as henchman to the lead singer of the vampire rock group "Plasma", Reed Buccholz''s [Mex Erkiletian] job has definite high points, like finding sexy girls to bring home for Anthony [Yan Birch] and being able to photograph and have sex with their blood-drained bodies prior to disposing of them in the morgue of the hospital where Reed holds a daytime job as a nurse. Vampire hunter Vanessa Helsing [Monica Baber] has dedicated her life to destroying vampires, in particular Anthony, the vampire who killed her famous father. So far, she has managed to destroy Seth and Tobin, the band''s lead guitarist and drummer, but she hasn''t gotten to Anthony yet.', 'Working as henchman to the lead singer of the vampire rock group "Plasma", Reed Buccholz''s [Mex Erkiletian] job has definite high points, like finding sexy girls to bring home for Anthony [Yan Birch] and being able to photograph and have sex with their blood-drained bodies prior to disposing of them in the morgue of the hospital where Reed holds a daytime job as a nurse. Vampire hunter Vanessa Helsing [Monica Baber] has dedicated her life to destroying vampires, in particular Anthony, the vampire who killed her famous father. So far, she has managed to destroy Seth and Tobin, the band''s lead guitarist and drummer, but she hasn''t gotten to Anthony yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kw6tRpqHg8d353PMpCj4mus7Pk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235746'),
  ('409378774638483644', 'Suckers', 1999, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Roger Nygard, Nathan Hope', 'Roger Nygard, Joe Yannetty', 'Daniel Benzali, Louis Mandylor, Lori Loughlin, B.T., Jake Johannsen, Eli Danker, David Poland, Walter Jones', 'R', 'A fiercely dishonest car salesman hires a new employee who owes a serious debt to loan sharks.', 'A fiercely dishonest car salesman hires a new employee who owes a serious debt to loan sharks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJf4KTQWnOAs7t78T0xfTpiKHpE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29120'),
  ('390452329982605377', 'Sud', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Italo Petriccione, Fabio Scamoni', 'Angelo Pasquini, Franco Bernini, Gabriele Salvatores', 'Silvio Orlando, Francesca Neri, Antonio Catania, Marco Manchisi, Ighèzu Mussiè, Gigio Alberti, Antonio Petrocelli, Mario Santella', null, 'During a hot Sunday afternoon in a small Southern Italian town, a school serving as a polling place is occupied by a group of three locals and an Eritrean immigrant, all unemployed, desperate and armed.', 'During a hot Sunday afternoon in a small Southern Italian town, a school serving as a polling place is occupied by a group of three locals and an Eritrean immigrant, all unemployed, desperate and armed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuW31XFnBnsqXOavWQazugcffNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43989'),
  ('651245487205779551', 'Sudden Danger', 1955, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Hubert Cornfield, Ellsworth Fredericks', 'Elwood Ullman', 'Bill Elliott, Tom Drake, Beverly Garland, Minerva Urecal, Helene Stanton, Pierre Watkin, Lucien Littlefield, Lyle Talbot', 'NR', 'Detective Andy Doyle suspects that a suicide is actually a murder. He suspects the victim''s son, Wallace who is blind and he pursues him until he gets to the truth.', 'Detective Andy Doyle suspects that a suicide is actually a murder. He suspects the victim''s son, Wallace who is blind and he pursues him until he gets to the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tu8m9TXL6yu22ZHVusGwxFT42zb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59895'),
  ('1121732959223250844', 'Sudden Death', 1995, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Peter Hyams, Peter Hyams, Marion Kolsby', 'Gene Quintano, Karen Elise Baldwin', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Powers Boothe, Raymond J. Barry, Whittni Wright, Ross Malinger, Dorian Harewood, Kate McNeil, Michael Gaston', 'R', 'When a man''s daughter is suddenly taken during a championship hockey game – with the captors demanding a billion dollars by game''s end – he frantically sets a plan in motion to rescue her and abort an impending explosion before the final buzzer.', 'When a man''s daughter is suddenly taken during a championship hockey game – with the captors demanding a billion dollars by game''s end – he frantically sets a plan in motion to rescue her and abort an impending explosion before the final buzzer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pylO6YX5XdOA6QCc5IRxrrffkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9091'),
  ('185033010723425724', 'Sudden Fear', 1952, 'Thriller, Crime', 'David Miller, Charles Lang', 'Lenore J. Coffee, Robert Smith', 'Joan Crawford, Jack Palance, Gloria Grahame, Bruce Bennett, Virginia Huston, Mike Connors, Bess Flowers, Harold Miller', 'NR', 'Actor Lester Blaine has all but landed the lead in Myra Hudson''s new play when Myra vetoes him because, to her, he doesn''t look like a romantic leading man. On a train from New York to San Francisco, Blaine sets out to prove Myra wrong...by romancing her. Is he sincere, or does he have a dark ulterior motive?', 'Actor Lester Blaine has all but landed the lead in Myra Hudson''s new play when Myra vetoes him because, to her, he doesn''t look like a romantic leading man. On a train from New York to San Francisco, Blaine sets out to prove Myra wrong...by romancing her. Is he sincere, or does he have a dark ulterior motive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDDRhGX99c7smveM3UelCVmi6xi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19171'),
  ('948637336454242463', 'Sudden Fury', 1975, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Brian Damude, James B. Kelly', 'Brian Damude', 'Dominic Hogan, Gay Rowan, Dan Hennessey, Hollis McLaren, David Yorston, Eric Clavering, Sean McCann, Gerry Huckstep', null, 'Fred is a psychotic entrepreneur who hopes to convince his wife Janet to invest in a shady land deal. The wife refuses, and the couple continue their heated argument while driving through the Ontario backwoods. When their car crashes, Janet is seriously injured, but Fred leaves the scene, hoping that his wife won''t last the night.', 'Fred is a psychotic entrepreneur who hopes to convince his wife Janet to invest in a shady land deal. The wife refuses, and the couple continue their heated argument while driving through the Ontario backwoods. When their car crashes, Janet is seriously injured, but Fred leaves the scene, hoping that his wife won''t last the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUgpiB3kw07eV4qISo7udEvPDt4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106730'),
  ('430678390268526632', 'Sudden Fury', 1993, 'Action, Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Craig R. Baxley, João Fernandes', null, 'Neil Patrick Harris, Johnny Galecki, Linda Kelsey, John M. Jackson, Lisa Banes, James Handy, Tim Kelleher, Timothy Bass', null, 'A teenage boy finds his mother and father murdered in their home but as the story goes on he reveals he knows more than he is letting on.', 'A teenage boy finds his mother and father murdered in their home but as the story goes on he reveals he knows more than he is letting on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcJflZpjpDEFooOsX4gXGzumo6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146790'),
  ('217713369147606337', 'Sudden Impact', 1983, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Clint Eastwood, Bruce Surtees', 'Dean Riesner', 'Clint Eastwood, Sondra Locke, Pat Hingle, Bradford Dillman, Paul Drake, Audrie Neenan, Jack Thibeau, Michael Currie', 'R', 'When a young rape victim takes justice into her own hands and becomes a serial killer, it''s up to Dirty Harry Callahan, on suspension from the SFPD, to bring her to justice.', 'When a young rape victim takes justice into her own hands and becomes a serial killer, it''s up to Dirty Harry Callahan, on suspension from the SFPD, to bring her to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSADY0EEM7ntpK5IwumcGS4UNNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10650'),
  ('541562964323816156', 'Sudden Light', 2026, 'Thriller, Action', 'Gregory Hatanaka', 'Gregory Hatanaka', 'Lisa London, Emiko Ishii, Barry Sattels, Dawna Lee Heising, Chris Spinelli', null, 'After witnessing a sudden act of violence, Martin and Kathleen are drawn into a hidden conflict. Strangers close in and intentions blur as they navigate a night where every encounter may be a warning or a trap.', 'After witnessing a sudden act of violence, Martin and Kathleen are drawn into a hidden conflict. Strangers close in and intentions blur as they navigate a night where every encounter may be a warning or a trap.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FqQh1XO9JNmRMUu7eCky7KM1gwAt.jpg', 'plex:movie:sudden-light-2026'),
  ('337987611987758240', 'Sudden Rain', 1956, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Masao Tamai, Sakae Hirosawa', 'Yōko Mizuki', 'Setsuko Hara, Shūji Sano, Kyōko Kagawa, Akemi Negishi, Keiju Kobayashi, Chieko Nakakita, Haruko Tōgō, Teruko Nagaoka', null, 'Fumiko and Ryōtarō Namiki''s marriage has gone stale, with both constantly arguing over what to do on a day off, or about her cutting out recipes from the newspaper before he finishes reading it. Their animosities are witnessed by Fumiko''s niece Ayako, who visits to complain about her own husband''s inattentiveness, and their new neighbours, the Imasatos.', 'Fumiko and Ryōtarō Namiki''s marriage has gone stale, with both constantly arguing over what to do on a day off, or about her cutting out recipes from the newspaper before he finishes reading it. Their animosities are witnessed by Fumiko''s niece Ayako, who visits to complain about her own husband''s inattentiveness, and their new neighbours, the Imasatos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLinlNgPPzk3pmdMpF0kgPWXRj1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137855'),
  ('303806835178955720', 'Suddenly', 1954, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Lewis Allen, Charles G. Clarke, Erich von Stroheim Jr.', 'Richard Sale', 'Frank Sinatra, Sterling Hayden, James Gleason, Nancy Gates, Kim Charney, Willis Bouchey, Paul Frees, Christopher Dark', 'NR', 'The tranquility of a small town is marred only by sheriff Tod Shaw''s unsuccessful courtship of widow Ellen Benson, a pacifist who can''t abide guns and those who use them. But violence descends on Ellen''s household willy-nilly when the U.S. President passes through town... and slightly psycho hired assassin John Baron finds the Benson home ideal for an ambush.', 'The tranquility of a small town is marred only by sheriff Tod Shaw''s unsuccessful courtship of widow Ellen Benson, a pacifist who can''t abide guns and those who use them. But violence descends on Ellen''s household willy-nilly when the U.S. President passes through town... and slightly psycho hired assassin John Baron finds the Benson home ideal for an ambush.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0eQfRMVJtvEkaJjBsSrd6ri1UI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18398'),
  ('273674041020830498', 'Suddenly', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Diego Lerman', null, 'Tatiana Saphir, Carla Crespo, Veronica Hassan, Beatriz Thibaudin, María Merlino, Marcos Ferrante, Susana Pampín, Luis Herrera', null, 'Marcia is young woman who leads a gray and unremarkable life in the city of Buenos Aires. Mao and Lenin are a couple of punk girls who stumble upon Marcia and for some unexplicable reason they want to show her love.', 'Marcia is young woman who leads a gray and unremarkable life in the city of Buenos Aires. Mao and Lenin are a couple of punk girls who stumble upon Marcia and for some unexplicable reason they want to show her love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcCAk1ouTpv7ymy6PICN1WS6TQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99648'),
  ('39365309353258201', 'Suddenly', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Adrian Diepold, Bill Mizel, Alex Burnett', 'Raul Sanchez Inglis', 'Dominic Purcell, Ray Liotta, Erin Karpluk, Steve Bacic, Tyron Leitso, Chris Shields, Brendan Fletcher, Daryl Shuttleworth', null, 'Four assassins led by Baron, pose as Secret Service agents to commandeer the house of war-widow ELLEN. Her home is a prime sniper position for their plan to assassinate the President on his visit to the small town of Suddenly. The men fool the local cops except for one, TODD. A washed-up former war hero and deputy who is now the town drunk, Todd served with Ellen’s deceased husband and has developed romantic feelings for her over the years. But she rebuffs his advances. Todd visits the house and is immediately suspicious of Baron, but no one will listen to the ravings of a drunk. Once Todd realizes what is going on, he manages to kill one of Baron’s crew, but is captured. Now he and Ellen must find a way to stop Baron and his men before they kill the President.', 'Four assassins led by Baron, pose as Secret Service agents to commandeer the house of war-widow ELLEN. Her home is a prime sniper position for their plan to assassinate the President on his visit to the small town of Suddenly. The men fool the local cops except for one, TODD. A washed-up former war hero and deputy who is now the town drunk, Todd served with Ellen’s deceased husband and has developed romantic feelings for her over the years. But she rebuffs his advances. Todd visits the house and is immediately suspicious of Baron, but no one will listen to the ravings of a drunk. Once Todd realizes what is going on, he manages to kill one of Baron’s crew, but is captured. Now he and Ellen must find a way to stop Baron and his men before they kill the President.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBHqiCsV1JXNkeB4fiFhmp18oh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217896'),
  ('765036908593203520', 'Suddenly', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Adventure', 'Thomas Bidegain, Ali Cherkaoui, Simon Witte', 'Thomas Bidegain, Valentine Monteil', 'Gilles Lellouche, Mélanie Thierry', null, 'Ben and Laura are a passionate but volatile couple who embark on a round-the-world sailing adventure to give their relationship a new start. During their trip, they decide to explore a vast deserted island which they discover off the coast of Chile. Caught in a violent storm, they shelter in an abandoned whaling station for the night but wake up the next morning to find their boat has disappeared. Stranded in a hostile environment with no means of communication, dwindling supplies and winter approaching they must work together in a life and death battle for survival, that will challenge their feelings and change their relationship forever.', 'Ben and Laura are a passionate but volatile couple who embark on a round-the-world sailing adventure to give their relationship a new start. During their trip, they decide to explore a vast deserted island which they discover off the coast of Chile. Caught in a violent storm, they shelter in an abandoned whaling station for the night but wake up the next morning to find their boat has disappeared. Stranded in a hostile environment with no means of communication, dwindling supplies and winter approaching they must work together in a life and death battle for survival, that will challenge their feelings and change their relationship forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5Xj72BQVNzk6lREDwNuYt4FLoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843843'),
  ('138520031926204614', 'Suddenly Heaven', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Federica Ciciarelli, Emanuele Imbucci', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Angie Cepeda, Alessandro Haber, Rocco Papaleo, Anna Maria Barbera, Gea Martire, Giulia Montanarini, Fabrizio Pizzuto', null, 'Confirmed bachelor Lorenzo sees his beliefs about commitment put to the test when a gorgeous Latina deserted by her fiancée forces him to take his place in the romantic trip she had planned.', 'Confirmed bachelor Lorenzo sees his beliefs about commitment put to the test when a gorgeous Latina deserted by her fiancée forces him to take his place in the romantic trip she had planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdLPKJ7wEGFDBNibDpNpUg1QhFm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61630'),
  ('363393560886662529', 'Suddenly in the Dark', 1981, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Go Yeong-nam', 'Yoon Sam-yook', 'Kim Young-ae, Lee Ki-seon, Yoon Il-bong, Han Hye-ri', null, 'A wife starts to suspect her husband''s infidelity after the arrival of their new, young housekeeper, who carries a mysterious wooden doll with herself.', 'A wife starts to suspect her husband''s infidelity after the arrival of their new, young housekeeper, who carries a mysterious wooden doll with herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQaqUUJmJSWHZJg5Vky3b2A1RkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124310'),
  ('733495484350766876', 'Suddenly Seventeen', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Li Xiang, Zhang Mo', 'Zhang Mo', 'Ni Ni, Wallace Huo, Darren Wang, Bing Liu, Pan Binlong, Yu Xintian, Michael Kai Sui, Sang Ping', null, 'When Liang Xia''s obsession for a perfect wedding puts a strain in the relationship with her fiancé, he ultimately calls it quits and breaks up with her. In a heartbroken state, Liang Xia carelessly ingests a magical item, which transports the 28-year-old’s mind back to when she was only seventeen years old.', 'When Liang Xia''s obsession for a perfect wedding puts a strain in the relationship with her fiancé, he ultimately calls it quits and breaks up with her. In a heartbroken state, Liang Xia carelessly ingests a magical item, which transports the 28-year-old’s mind back to when she was only seventeen years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGQYUexYjIbfl4T3YIarH07I7Gi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422390'),
  ('776524302130506846', 'Suddenly Twenty', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Supat Rangsipat, Araya Suriharn, Phaklao Jiraungkoonkun', 'Chai-a-nan Soijumpa, Nataporn Rattanachaiwong', 'Davika Hoorne, Saharat Sangkapreecha, Kritsanapoom Pibulsonggram, Neeranuch Pattamasoot, Rong Kaomulkadee, Jirawat Wachirasarunpat, Sumontha Suanpholaat, Suttatip Wutchaipradit', null, 'After taking a magical picture, an elderly woman is transformed into a 20-year-old and decides to live the life she''d always dreamed of.', 'After taking a magical picture, an elderly woman is transformed into a 20-year-old and decides to live the life she''d always dreamed of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YuAahMlPYwU0wb5fwrdYCY0DpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462743'),
  ('1061422267076025345', 'Suddenly, Last Summer', 1959, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Jack Hildyard, Bluey Hill', 'Gore Vidal, Tennessee Williams', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Katharine Hepburn, Montgomery Clift, Albert Dekker, Mercedes McCambridge, Gary Raymond, Mavis Villiers, Patricia Marmont', 'NR', 'The only son of wealthy widow Violet Venable dies while on vacation with his cousin Catherine. What the girl saw was so horrible that she went insane; now Mrs. Venable wants Catherine lobotomized to cover up the truth.', 'The only son of wealthy widow Violet Venable dies while on vacation with his cousin Catherine. What the girl saw was so horrible that she went insane; now Mrs. Venable wants Catherine lobotomized to cover up the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igma0zn9J5srRvOMDRnxyUDQXJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14698'),
  ('841232995804218499', 'Suddenly, Last Winter', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Gustav Hofer, Luca Ragazzi', null, 'Gustav Hofer, Luca Ragazzi, Veronica Pivetti', null, 'Luca and Gustav, two men in their 30s, have been a stable couple for eight years. Nothing to get worked up about in a western European country, you would think – and you’d be wrong. Even in Euroland there are places where the acknowledgment of the basic civil rights of same-sex couples is a hot issue. Suddenly, Gustav’s and Luca’s quiet private life has been turned upside down. When the Italian center-left coalition initiates legislation about same-sex partnerships in Italy, a national debate is triggered instantly. In a matter of days it turns into the hottest political and cultural issue on the national agenda while intolerant homophobic attacks increase dramatically.', 'Luca and Gustav, two men in their 30s, have been a stable couple for eight years. Nothing to get worked up about in a western European country, you would think – and you’d be wrong. Even in Euroland there are places where the acknowledgment of the basic civil rights of same-sex couples is a hot issue. Suddenly, Gustav’s and Luca’s quiet private life has been turned upside down. When the Italian center-left coalition initiates legislation about same-sex partnerships in Italy, a national debate is triggered instantly. In a matter of days it turns into the hottest political and cultural issue on the national agenda while intolerant homophobic attacks increase dramatically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEAUe70bklNtPP8fIvzaeMO7J6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58511'),
  ('594824227783403882', 'Sue', 1998, 'Drama', 'Amos Kollek, Ed Talavera, Scott Ambrozy', 'Amos Kollek', 'Anna Thomson, Matthew Powers, Tahnee Welch, Tracee Ellis Ross, John Ventimiglia, Edoardo Ballerini, Matthew Faber, Robert Kya-Hill', 'NR', 'An unemployed ex-office worker searching for work floats a fragile line of sanity as she struggles to find friendship and companionship. Her tenuous grasp on reality further fluctuates when a man whom she met in a restaurant and started an affair with is called to go to India for an assignment. The final straw occurs when she is evicted and moves into a sleazy hotel. She then starts seeking casual sex in unorthodox locations just to have human contact.', 'An unemployed ex-office worker searching for work floats a fragile line of sanity as she struggles to find friendship and companionship. Her tenuous grasp on reality further fluctuates when a man whom she met in a restaurant and started an affair with is called to go to India for an assignment. The final straw occurs when she is evicted and moves into a sleazy hotel. She then starts seeking casual sex in unorthodox locations just to have human contact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qruld52pQloOmSXp6PxAMheMI6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49813'),
  ('334007786336377448', 'Sue Me', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Massimo Carocci, Carlo Carlini', 'Steno, Enrico Vanzina', 'Christian De Sica, Gigi Proietti, Stefania Sandrelli, Franco Fabrizi, Giorgio Bracardi, Luca Sportelli, Gigi Reder, Antonio Francioni', null, 'Judge Pennisi deals with a lot of citizens every day, some of them criminals, but almost always ordinary people, suffering from a wide range of problems.', 'Judge Pennisi deals with a lot of citizens every day, some of them criminals, but almost always ordinary people, suffering from a wide range of problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cV45blk6nxj8xCySa1iLyiOmAfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120917'),
  ('640003200836581884', 'Suéltate el pelo', 1988, 'Music, Comedy', 'Manuel Summers, Tote Trenas', 'Manuel Summers, Tomás Summers, Francisco Summers', 'David Summers Rodriguez, Paloma San Millán, Vicente Bartual, Tomás Zori, Daniel Mezquita, Rafael Gutiérrez, Javier Molina, Toni Cantó', null, 'A quinceañera pretends to fall in love with David, the singer of the popular group Men G, and chases him to Acapulco. One night, she undresses and pounces on him, while a friend of her makes a few compromising photographs. The publication of these photos in a magazine leads David to pay a large sum and one year in prison, but the rest of the group discovers that Sonia and her friend are going to defraud actor Toni Canto and decide to prepare a trap for them', 'A quinceañera pretends to fall in love with David, the singer of the popular group Men G, and chases him to Acapulco. One night, she undresses and pounces on him, while a friend of her makes a few compromising photographs. The publication of these photos in a magazine leads David to pay a large sum and one year in prison, but the rest of the group discovers that Sonia and her friend are going to defraud actor Toni Canto and decide to prepare a trap for them', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jW6Cbk8uHW1tqt5kxXBnuxJfQ3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156170'),
  ('480614928589898248', 'Sueños de pasión: Una suegra muy ardiente', 2014, 'Drama', 'Fernando del Villar', 'Felipe Silva', 'Aura Cristina Geithner, Erik Guecha, Alejandro Peniche, Florencia Martino, Eduardo Carabajal, Tsuria Díaz, Carlos Gajardo, Manuel Martel', null, 'Miroslava Romani is an exuberant and beautiful executive who hides an insatiable beast under the mask of a dignified business woman. She falls in love with an irresistible young man who turns out to be the crush of her own daughter.', 'Miroslava Romani is an exuberant and beautiful executive who hides an insatiable beast under the mask of a dignified business woman. She falls in love with an irresistible young man who turns out to be the crush of her own daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMzYwUQz6MP0iVsGVvjuKjGkC3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655958'),
  ('418475650658054179', 'Suez', 1938, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Allan Dwan, J. Peverell Marley, Louis Silvers', 'Julien Josephson, Philip Dunne', 'Tyrone Power, Loretta Young, Annabella, J. Edward Bromberg, Joseph Schildkraut, Henry Stephenson, Sidney Blackmer, Maurice Moscovitch', null, 'Ferdinand de Lesseps, disappointed in love, is sent as a junior diplomat to the Isthmus of Suez, and realizes it''s just the place for a canal.', 'Ferdinand de Lesseps, disappointed in love, is sent as a junior diplomat to the Isthmus of Suez, and realizes it''s just the place for a canal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izmSg8bK5y0g7lVpEgJ5EpxnRQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148675'),
  ('768005445364288773', 'Sufferin'' Cats!', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'William Hanna, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Tom fights with another cat over Jerry.', 'Tom fights with another cat over Jerry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvAIVx6N4sfQRtrUYOzhF0p2G1G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40212'),
  ('742988784552876791', 'Suffering of Ninko', 2016, 'Drama', 'Norihiro Niwatsukino, Hideo Masuda, Yoshiya Mera', 'Norihiro Niwatsukino', 'Masato Tsujioka, Miho Wakabayashi, Hideta Iwahashi, Yukino Arimoto, Chris Katô, Hitoshi Murakami, Yuichiro Iwasa, Masamichi Hagiwara', null, 'Ninko is a virtuous Buddhist monk who’s embarrassed to discover that he’s irresistible to many women (and some men). After a particularly troubling encounter with a masked woman, he undertakes a journey to "purify" himself, hoping that this will equip him to rebuff sexual advances. He meets the samurai Kanzo and hears of a village decimated by the rapacious mountain goddess Yama-onna, who kills men to absorb their energy. Finally Ninko has a quest to fulfill…', 'Ninko is a virtuous Buddhist monk who’s embarrassed to discover that he’s irresistible to many women (and some men). After a particularly troubling encounter with a masked woman, he undertakes a journey to "purify" himself, hoping that this will equip him to rebuff sexual advances. He meets the samurai Kanzo and hears of a village decimated by the rapacious mountain goddess Yama-onna, who kills men to absorb their energy. Finally Ninko has a quest to fulfill…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yktUU9c4o8rZSYBNLAOOGMRZJiG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419206'),
  ('85804307280144619', 'Suffocating Love', 2024, 'Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Liao Ming-Yi, Abba Tong, Liao Ming-Yi', 'Liao Ming-Yi', 'Austin Lin, Chloe Xiang, Nikki Hsieh, Lin Da-yuan, YELLOW, McFly Wu, Pei Tzu-chi, Ou Chu', null, 'A man falls in love with a control freak. He willingly obeys and gives his all during the infatuation stage of love. However, when another girl appears, he realizes that love can actually be liberating. In a dream, he is granted a wish for the exchange of girlfriends, and to his astonishment, the wish comes true in real life. Is this the beginning of happiness or the onset of new terror?', 'A man falls in love with a control freak. He willingly obeys and gives his all during the infatuation stage of love. However, when another girl appears, he realizes that love can actually be liberating. In a dream, he is granted a wish for the exchange of girlfriends, and to his astonishment, the wish comes true in real life. Is this the beginning of happiness or the onset of new terror?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeVotaRDwhKeG5km1xa3HBGzjKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1078374'),
  ('337282342738664627', 'Suffocation', 2018, 'Drama', 'Javier Morón, Kenya Marquez', 'Kenya Marquez, Alfonso Suárez', 'Johana Fragoso Blendl, Enrique Arreola, Mónica del Carmen, Raúl Briones, Lety Gómez, Mauricio Isaac, Martha Claudia Moreno, Azul Magaña Muñiz', null, 'After getting out of jail, where she learned to care for the sick, Alma, an albino woman, is determined to recover at any cost something much more important than her own freedom. In order to do so, Alma must spend her nights taking care of Clemente, a hypochondriac compulsively obsessed with avoiding sudden death. Their relationship moves through suspicion, fear and compassion to tenderness and love.', 'After getting out of jail, where she learned to care for the sick, Alma, an albino woman, is determined to recover at any cost something much more important than her own freedom. In order to do so, Alma must spend her nights taking care of Clemente, a hypochondriac compulsively obsessed with avoiding sudden death. Their relationship moves through suspicion, fear and compassion to tenderness and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UWNllCkBgOf1DhEWJhPHed1Zn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553776'),
  ('488042852674972690', 'Suffragette', 2015, 'Drama, History', 'Sarah Gavron, Eduard Grau, Alice Sutton', 'Abi Morgan', 'Carey Mulligan, Helena Bonham Carter, Brendan Gleeson, Anne-Marie Duff, Meryl Streep, Ben Whishaw, Romola Garai, Samuel West', 'PG-13', 'Based on true events about the foot soldiers of the early feminist movement, women who were forced underground to pursue a dangerous game of cat and mouse with an increasingly brutal State.', 'Based on true events about the foot soldiers of the early feminist movement, women who were forced underground to pursue a dangerous game of cat and mouse with an increasingly brutal State.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y706qec117bN2S7XgCs2Yz8jEfv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245168'),
  ('124944661586959701', 'SUGA | Agust D TOUR ''D-DAY'' THE MOVIE', 2024, 'Music, Documentary', 'Park Jun-soo', null, 'SUGA, RM, Jimin, Jung Kook', null, 'As the grand finale of the world tour, "SUGA | Agust D TOUR ''D-DAY'' THE FINAL" marked the culmination of 25 concerts held in 10 cities, which captivated a total audience of 290,000 throughout its run. Experience the pulsating energy and excitement of "''D-DAY'' THE FINAL" on screen, everything from the exquisite sounds traversing the boundary between "21st Century Pop Icon" BTS member SUGA and solo artist Agust D, electrifying performance, explosive energy, to special duet stages featuring fellow BTS members RM, Jimin, and Jung Kook.', 'As the grand finale of the world tour, "SUGA | Agust D TOUR ''D-DAY'' THE FINAL" marked the culmination of 25 concerts held in 10 cities, which captivated a total audience of 290,000 throughout its run. Experience the pulsating energy and excitement of "''D-DAY'' THE FINAL" on screen, everything from the exquisite sounds traversing the boundary between "21st Century Pop Icon" BTS member SUGA and solo artist Agust D, electrifying performance, explosive energy, to special duet stages featuring fellow BTS members RM, Jimin, and Jung Kook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4IzXiX0LjIn3BQHRCcePXzaE4M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1254724'),
  ('1069495791646702799', 'SUGA: Road to D-DAY', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Park Jun-soo', null, 'SUGA, Halsey, Steve Aoki, Anderson .Paak, IU, Ryuichi Sakamoto, Kim Woo-sung', 'R', 'SUGA of the world-renowned group, BTS, works on a new album. He embarks on a journey to find his story to tell through music, while interacting with artists from various cities around the world.', 'SUGA of the world-renowned group, BTS, works on a new album. He embarks on a journey to find his story to tell through music, while interacting with artists from various cities around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Hm3ZcFKjP0rm9GHshNx2MSw892.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1106732'),
  ('1114170664742926257', 'Sugapa', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lawrence Fajardo', 'John Paul Bedia, Lawrence Fajardo', 'AJ Raval, Aljur Abrenica, Jairus Aquino, Dyessa Garcia, Art Acuña, Lander Vera Perez, Lowell Conales, Lou Veloso', null, 'Young lovers chase their big city dreams but get tested by lust, addiction, and the hunger for money. Will their love survive, or will reaching for their dreams tear them apart?', 'Young lovers chase their big city dreams but get tested by lust, addiction, and the hunger for money. Will their love survive, or will reaching for their dreams tear them apart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sY8GRisCOnqs8mDRfOsU5OzOYRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1135727'),
  ('529135851396510616', 'Sugar', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Rouffio, René Mathelin', 'Georges Conchon, Jacques Rouffio', 'Jean Carmet, Gérard Depardieu, Michel Piccoli, Nelly Borgeaud, Georges Descrières, Roger Hanin, Marthe Villalonga, Jean-Paul Muel', null, 'Civil servant Adrien Courtois comes to Paris in order to make his money bear fruits.', 'Civil servant Adrien Courtois comes to Paris in order to make his money bear fruits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksq39dVnwHAZQPyrFwxSdgPuQHd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63577'),
  ('1111280608586017664', 'Sugar', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Palmer, John Westheuser', 'Jaie Laplante, Todd Klinck, John Palmer', 'Brendan Fehr, Andre Noble, Haylee Wanstall, Maury Chaykin, Michael Riley, Marnie McPhail, Sarah Polley, Dorothy Gordon', 'R', 'Cliff receives an unusual 18th birthday gift from his younger sister — marijuana, alcohol, a subway token and the mission to lose his virginity. This results in Cliff meeting a young street hustler named Butch. At first, as Butch introduces Cliff to gay street life in Toronto, Cliff is excited by his new relationship. But as the two grow closer, he finds that Butch has problems, including drug addiction, that are cause for serious concern.', 'Cliff receives an unusual 18th birthday gift from his younger sister — marijuana, alcohol, a subway token and the mission to lose his virginity. This results in Cliff meeting a young street hustler named Butch. At first, as Butch introduces Cliff to gay street life in Toronto, Cliff is excited by his new relationship. But as the two grow closer, he finds that Butch has problems, including drug addiction, that are cause for serious concern.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UHmjRNgnSNG3bXlfjQ5OGwmFoG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36799'),
  ('175108869784016935', 'Sugar', 2008, 'Drama', 'Ryan Fleck, Anna Boden, Andrij Parekh', 'Anna Boden, Ryan Fleck', 'Algenis Perez Soto, Jose Rijo, Walki Cuevas, Santo Silvestre, Emmanuel Nanita Carvajal, Cesar Emilio Minaya C., Joendy Pena Brown, Kelvin Leonardo Garcia', 'R', 'Like many young men in the Dominican Republic, 19-year-old Miguel "Sugar" Santos dreams of winning a slot on an American baseball team. Indeed, his talents as a pitcher eventually land him a slot on a single-A team in Iowa, but culture shock, racism and other curveballs threaten to turn Sugar''s dream sour.', 'Like many young men in the Dominican Republic, 19-year-old Miguel "Sugar" Santos dreams of winning a slot on an American baseball team. Indeed, his talents as a pitcher eventually land him a slot on a single-A team in Iowa, but culture shock, racism and other curveballs threaten to turn Sugar''s dream sour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldiKnTAt8pBB3rY6HQI4QZt6r7n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17003'),
  ('106844282920847071', 'Sugar', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Vic Sarin, Vic Sarin', 'Vic Sarin, Annelies Kavan, Ben Johnstone', 'Katherine McNamara, Jasmine Sky Sarin, Éric Bruneau, Anthony Timpano, Kwame Onwuachi, Armand Assante, Audrey Rannou, Jaden Rain', 'PG-13', 'Inspired by the dramatic true story of the Cocaine Cowgirls, Sugar follows two young Canadian women who get caught up in a major drug smuggling operation aboard a luxury cruise ship sailing around the world. With nowhere to run—the walls close in on them.', 'Inspired by the dramatic true story of the Cocaine Cowgirls, Sugar follows two young Canadian women who get caught up in a major drug smuggling operation aboard a luxury cruise ship sailing around the world. With nowhere to run—the walls close in on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xiBxESLoZAGg3uT7isIIuF7H3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1041623'),
  ('716156449548099961', 'Sugar & Spice', 2001, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Francine McDougall, Robert Brinkmann, Eric Sherman', 'Lona Williams', 'Marley Shelton, Marla Sokoloff, Melissa George, Mena Suvari, Rachel Blanchard, Alexandra Holden, Sara Marsh, James Marsden', 'PG-13', 'When Jack and Diane find themselves in an unexpected adult situation, the A-Squad comes to their rescue. In order to help their friend Diane, the A-Squad goes where no cheerleader has gone before: taking on a little after-school project known as bank robbery. But the A-Squad does things their way -- with sugar and spice -- forever changing their friendship, their future and the nation''s notion of teen spirit.', 'When Jack and Diane find themselves in an unexpected adult situation, the A-Squad comes to their rescue. In order to help their friend Diane, the A-Squad goes where no cheerleader has gone before: taking on a little after-school project known as bank robbery. But the A-Squad does things their way -- with sugar and spice -- forever changing their friendship, their future and the nation''s notion of teen spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etRwjWRjKrXYc7r1vpQLYwVu4ls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16723'),
  ('13430043544431888', 'Sugar & Vice: A Hannah Swensen Mystery', 2026, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Benson, David Pelletier, Kevin Speckmaier, Andy Wong', 'Alison Sweeney', 'Victor Webster, Barbara Niven, Tess Atkins, Mike Dopud, Juliana Wimbles', 'TV-PG', 'Hannah finds a body at the grand re-opening of the Lake Eden Inn. When a storm traps everyone inside, Hannah must find the culprit before the road clears and the killer escapes.', 'Hannah finds a body at the grand re-opening of the Lake Eden Inn. When a storm traps everyone inside, Hannah must find the culprit before the road clears and the killer escapes.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FgN2AASKIg3vIWeMsNwhHpeD0TDX.jpg', 'plex:movie:sugar-and-vice-a-hannah-swensen-mystery-2026'),
  ('121213781256118742', 'Sugar and Spies', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, null, null, 'Wile E. Coyote finds a spy kit and uses its contents (sleeping gas, a mail bomb, explosive putty, and a gadget-filled spy car) in his unsuccessful attempt to catch the Road Runner.', 'Wile E. Coyote finds a spy kit and uses its contents (sleeping gas, a mail bomb, explosive putty, and a gadget-filled spy car) in his unsuccessful attempt to catch the Road Runner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsw5T9QyXgo5Lg4S6rFlBBjZHlQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234286'),
  ('126648868537344813', 'Sugar and Stars', 2023, 'Drama', 'Sébastien Tulard, Pierre Dejon', 'Sébastien Tulard, Cédric Ido', 'Riadh Belaïche, Loubna Abidar, Patrick d''Assumçao, Christine Citti, Alioune Sané, Frédéric Fix, Pascal Légitimus, Dicosh', null, 'Raised in foster and group homes, Yazid pursues his lifelong passion for pastry to work with top chefs and become the best.', 'Raised in foster and group homes, Yazid pursues his lifelong passion for pastry to work with top chefs and become the best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fN5QliajTwupsV8MhzvhXnpGBbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975762'),
  ('499395988864823253', 'Sugar Baby', 2023, 'Romance', 'Christian Paolo Lat', null, 'Azi Acosta, Robb Guinto, Jeffrey Hidalgo, Josef Elizalde, Ralmon Mendoza, Kian Co, Archie Adamos, Shiena Yu', null, 'Two high school friends turned sugar babies, who sacrifice everything for each other. Until love gets in the way', 'Two high school friends turned sugar babies, who sacrifice everything for each other. Until love gets in the way', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96MiE78ur3CQyDVNHTHT4RqBboI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196656'),
  ('64171604279133621', 'Sugar Baby', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alexander Prost, Kirill Gerra, Anna Pestryakova', 'Alexander Prost', 'Daniil Vorobyov, Angelina Zagrebina, Alla Yuganova, Anastasiya Panina, Vladimir Zherebtsov, Yuriy Tsurilo, Dmitriy Podnozov, Mariya Shorokhova', null, 'Love comes without asking. Often not to those, not so and not then. Can a genuine feeling survive when everything started wrong and the whole world is against it? Give up everything or give up? Burn or survive?', 'Love comes without asking. Often not to those, not so and not then. Can a genuine feeling survive when everything started wrong and the whole world is against it? Give up everything or give up? Burn or survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcREsnVDEFFXmt5GuPwyGqyDuDJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1267217'),
  ('440021374994181209', 'Sugar Cane Alley', 1983, 'Drama, Family', 'Euzhan Palcy, Fred Runel, Dominique Chapuis', 'Euzhan Palcy', 'Garry Cadenat, Darling Légitimus, Douta Seck, Joby Barnabé, Francisco Charles, Marie-Ange Farot, Marie-Jo Descas, Henri Melon', null, 'Martinique, in the early 1930s. Young José and his grandmother live in a small village. Nearly everyone works cutting cane and barely earning a living. The overseer can fine a worker for the smallest infraction. The way to advance is to do well in school. José studies hard and succeeds in an exam allowing him to attend school in the capital. With only a partial scholarship, the tuition is very costly. José and his grandmother move to Fort-de-France to make José''s studies easier...', 'Martinique, in the early 1930s. Young José and his grandmother live in a small village. Nearly everyone works cutting cane and barely earning a living. The overseer can fine a worker for the smallest infraction. The way to advance is to do well in school. José studies hard and succeeds in an exam allowing him to attend school in the capital. With only a partial scholarship, the tuition is very costly. José and his grandmother move to Fort-de-France to make José''s studies easier...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfMn3alwmu237SWjvcuRXTWbgky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42115'),
  ('993546287310885409', 'Sugar Colt', 1967, 'Western', 'Franco Giraldi', 'Augusto Finocchi, Giuseppe Mangione, Franco Giraldi', 'Jack Betts, Soledad Miranda, Giuliano Raffaelli, Gina Rovere, Erno Crisa, George Rigaud, Víctor Israel, Paolo Magalotti', null, 'In order to avenge a friend and to fulfill his last wish, Rocco has to find out what happened to an army corps that has mysteriously disappeared. He therefore puts on the disguise of a doctor and starts investigating in a somewhat uncomfortable town', 'In order to avenge a friend and to fulfill his last wish, Rocco has to find out what happened to an army corps that has mysteriously disappeared. He therefore puts on the disguise of a doctor and starts investigating in a somewhat uncomfortable town', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWSlF5OTRXcHQNzlIfXMhYd2pJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99010'),
  ('691576796539279537', 'Sugar Cookies', 1973, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Theodore Gershuny', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Theodore Gershuny', 'Mary Woronov, Lynn Lowry, George Shannon, Monique van Vooren, Maureen Byrnes, Daniel Sadur, Ondine, Jennifer Welles', 'R', 'A film producer murders his star actress during an erotic "game" and makes it look like suicide. The dead girl''s lesbian lover discovers what happened, and plots her revenge.', 'A film producer murders his star actress during an erotic "game" and makes it look like suicide. The dead girl''s lesbian lover discovers what happened, and plots her revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Wl883VX5xYoo73X1PufUgYZSQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29850'),
  ('1036050733651754091', 'Sugar Daddies', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Fred Guiol, Leo McCarey', 'H.M. Walker', 'James Finlayson, Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Noah Young, Charlotte Mineau, Edna Marion, Eugene Pallette, Charlie Hall', 'NR', 'After a night of carousing, a rich oil tycoon awakes to find that he was married the night before. He calls in his lawyer to straighten things out.', 'After a night of carousing, a rich oil tycoon awakes to find that he was married the night before. He calls in his lawyer to straighten things out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YQY7ywDYdxe3nKasa9jAszzU7o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48906'),
  ('83210518073838183', 'Sugar Daddy', 2021, 'Drama', 'Kristin Fieldhouse, Lauren Guyatt, Charles Smith', 'Kelly McCormack', 'Kelly McCormack, Amanda Brugel, Colm Feore, Ishan Davé, Nicholas Campbell, Kaniehtiio Horn, Aaron Ashmore, Hilary McCormack', null, 'When a struggling musician can''t afford her rent, she signs up for a website where rich older men pay to date younger women. Her new money-making venture sends her down a dark rabbit hole that forces her to grow up fast, shaping her music, and how she sees the world.', 'When a struggling musician can''t afford her rent, she signs up for a website where rich older men pay to date younger women. Her new money-making venture sends her down a dark rabbit hole that forces her to grow up fast, shaping her music, and how she sees the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIYAa6dIGCtQbbaCrcy8KBoe1JS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763240'),
  ('669603796167450584', 'Sugar Hill', 1974, 'Crime, Action, Horror', 'Paul Maslansky, Robert C. Jessup, Frank Beetson', 'Tim Kelly', 'Marki Bey, Robert Quarry, Don Pedro Colley, Betty Anne Rees, Richard Lawson, Zara Cully, Charles Robinson, Larry Don Johnson', 'PG', 'When a nightclub owner is murdered by gangsters after refusing to sell his business to the mob boss, his grieving fiancé enlists the help of a voodoo priestess to avenge his death.', 'When a nightclub owner is murdered by gangsters after refusing to sell his business to the mob boss, his grieving fiancé enlists the help of a voodoo priestess to avenge his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEQwADsvIOe43xpMywWSFSKSBWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54008'),
  ('1063344159580346859', 'Sugar Hill', 1994, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Leon Ichaso, Bojan Bazelli, Steven R. McGlothen', 'Barry Michael Cooper', 'Wesley Snipes, Michael Wright, Theresa Randle, Clarence Williams III, Abe Vigoda, Ernie Hudson, Leslie Uggams, Larry Joshua', 'R', 'In the Harlem neighborhood of New York City, the Mafia steps in when a drug dealer quits his partner and brother to lead a straight life with his girlfriend.', 'In the Harlem neighborhood of New York City, the Mafia steps in when a drug dealer quits his partner and brother to lead a straight life with his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bnYhhJS7vuDMRPVSplWaXdK49g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39349'),
  ('1009240602947873868', 'Sugar Kisses', 2013, 'Romance, Drama', 'Carlos Cuarón, Kenji Katori', 'Carlos Cuarón, Luis Usabiaga', 'César Kancino, Daniela Arce, Veronica Falcón, Paloma Arredondo, Enrique Arreola, Héctor Jiménez, Bernardo Terrones, Kristyan Ferrer', null, 'Nacho, a 13 year old boy, crosses the threshold of adolescence trying to find his place in life in all the wrong places: a dysfunctional family and a social setting that is corrupt and violent. Can the purity of first love survive the darkest aspects of our society?', 'Nacho, a 13 year old boy, crosses the threshold of adolescence trying to find his place in life in all the wrong places: a dysfunctional family and a social setting that is corrupt and violent. Can the purity of first love survive the darkest aspects of our society?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oraIdB7iOZift3GSPHHU3VhrNWO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176175'),
  ('1103292191904604537', 'Sugar Mill', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Awi Suryadi, Arfian', 'Lele Laila', 'Ersya Aurelia, Arbani Yasiz, Erika Carlina, Bukie B. Mansyur, Wavi Zihan, Benidictus Siregar, Arif Alfiansyah, Yono Bakrie', null, 'A group of young men and women who work as seasonal workers in a sugar factory face terror from the kingdom of demons where the factory is located. They must find out the cause of the demons'' anger, before the terror ends their lives.', 'A group of young men and women who work as seasonal workers in a sugar factory face terror from the kingdom of demons where the factory is located. They must find out the cause of the demons'' anger, before the terror ends their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8Qy6WltFWdnMaQBowXrOr3Vfyg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1355126'),
  ('1015327771384674496', 'Sugar Mountain', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'John Garrett, Richard Gray, Kim Barnard', 'Abe Pogos', 'Drew Roy, Haley Webb, Shane Coffey, Melora Walters, Anna Hutchison, Crawford Wilson, John Karna, Nick Farnell', 'R', 'Two brothers, down on their luck, fake a disappearance in the Alaskan wilderness so they''ll have a great survival story to sell, but the hoax turns out to be more real than they planned.', 'Two brothers, down on their luck, fake a disappearance in the Alaskan wilderness so they''ll have a great survival story to sell, but the hoax turns out to be more real than they planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhpAX8Igm3sB52U2JRFxsb5rDqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423377'),
  ('104647204863701134', 'Sugar Orange', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Andreas Struck', 'Andreas Struck', 'Sabine Timoteo, Lucas Gregorowicz, Hyun Wanner, Kai Michael Müller, Bruno Cathomas, Barnaby Metschurat', null, 'Lukas is Sugar, Clemens is Orange. Together, they are two ten-year-old boys who are inseparable. More than just playmates, they share a unique bond which seems predestined to last a lifetime. Until, that is, powerful emotions come to the fore and a misunderstanding leads to a rift which tears both them and their world apart. Twenty years later, Lukas is still terrified of being abandoned. He survives by forming loose relationships which don''t threaten him. Then one day he meets Lena who turns his feelings upside down and awakens his inner child, the one still searching for unconditional friendship. While there is never a guarantee of security, there is a bond of trust, and through Lena, Lukas again makes contact with Clemens. After years of silence, they are finally able to exorcise their ghosts in an explosion of emotion.', 'Lukas is Sugar, Clemens is Orange. Together, they are two ten-year-old boys who are inseparable. More than just playmates, they share a unique bond which seems predestined to last a lifetime. Until, that is, powerful emotions come to the fore and a misunderstanding leads to a rift which tears both them and their world apart. Twenty years later, Lukas is still terrified of being abandoned. He survives by forming loose relationships which don''t threaten him. Then one day he meets Lena who turns his feelings upside down and awakens his inner child, the one still searching for unconditional friendship. While there is never a guarantee of security, there is a bond of trust, and through Lena, Lukas again makes contact with Clemens. After years of silence, they are finally able to exorcise their ghosts in an explosion of emotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wg26a1IiZasz5hFJNvRnEdmbpKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270374'),
  ('915792823115658013', 'Sugar Pie Lady', 1983, 'Comedy, Romance, Music, History', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Ertunç Şenkay', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'İlyas Salman, Şener Şen, Yaprak Özdemiroğlu, Ayşen Gruda, Şevket Altuğ, Neriman Köksal, Berrin Koper, Ali Taygun', null, 'In the harsh times of the small time crime in Istanbul, a conscientious police officer Cumali is recognized by the police chief Ziver Bey who sees Cumali as a threat and matches him with Sekerpare, a famous harlot.', 'In the harsh times of the small time crime in Istanbul, a conscientious police officer Cumali is recognized by the police chief Ziver Bey who sees Cumali as a threat and matches him with Sekerpare, a famous harlot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5HXjEcC1gO4vbmhWilh9hwdmUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71193'),
  ('842079159752466623', 'Sugar Town', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Allison Anders, Kurt Voss, Kristian Bernier', 'Allison Anders, Kurt Voss', 'Jade Gordon, John Taylor, Michael Des Barres, Martin Kemp, Larry Klein, John Doe, Lucinda Jenney, Marion Moseley', 'R', 'A look at the lives of several struggling L.A. musicians. Gwen, a singer-songwriter, is on a quest for the big-time. Working as an assistant to a film production designer, Gwen tries to steal her boss'' boyfriend, a veteran rock producer. The producer, meanwhile, is trying to orchestrate a comeback for an ''80s band.', 'A look at the lives of several struggling L.A. musicians. Gwen, a singer-songwriter, is on a quest for the big-time. Working as an assistant to a film production designer, Gwen tries to steal her boss'' boyfriend, a veteran rock producer. The producer, meanwhile, is trying to orchestrate a comeback for an ''80s band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VpZ9apNn5uym9TYEtYEhMYOTEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142132'),
  ('778353770572951418', 'Sugar Water', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Svetislav Prelić', 'Leon Kovke', 'Sonja Savić, Svetislav ''Bule'' Goncić, Milena Dravić, Velimir Živojinović, Ljubiša Samardžić, Zoran Radmilović, Branimir Brstina, Miroslav ''Bata'' Mihailović', null, 'Unsatisfied with her looks and lack of sexual experience, a girl nicknamed Tomboy decides to subject herself under nose surgery. Her best friend begins to observe her from different point of view.', 'Unsatisfied with her looks and lack of sexual experience, a girl nicknamed Tomboy decides to subject herself under nose surgery. Her best friend begins to observe her from different point of view.', null, 'tmdb:movie:268117'),
  ('15083346166737273', 'Sugar, Honey and Pepper', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Martino, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Pipolo, Castellano', 'Lino Banfi, Pippo Franco, Edwige Fenech, Renato Pozzetto, Dagmar Lassander, Glauco Onorato, Enzo Robutti, Patrizia Garganese', null, 'Three episodes. In the first episode Valerio is mistaken for a notorious criminal. Very beautiful journalists succeed to bring him to her house for an exclusive interview. She tries to seduce him. In the second episode Giuseppe, an unlucky and ugly man, gets a job as a maid. His mistress falls in love for him. In the third episode, Plinio is a taxi driver who loves his cab above all. But at one point he is involved with the kidnapping of a woman.', 'Three episodes. In the first episode Valerio is mistaken for a notorious criminal. Very beautiful journalists succeed to bring him to her house for an exclusive interview. She tries to seduce him. In the second episode Giuseppe, an unlucky and ugly man, gets a job as a maid. His mistress falls in love for him. In the third episode, Plinio is a taxi driver who loves his cab above all. But at one point he is involved with the kidnapping of a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbcgyHKpZD5QiSQOHmYHOR6dMs2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48961'),
  ('424465244713429732', 'Sugarbaby', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Percy Adlon', 'Percy Adlon', 'Marianne Sägebrecht, Eisi Gulp, Toni Berger, Manuela Denz, Christiane Blumhoff, Hans Stadlbauer, Willi Spindler, Meret Burger', null, 'A plump Munich mortuary worker tracks down and seduces a married subway conductor.', 'A plump Munich mortuary worker tracks down and seduces a married subway conductor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40zNRl7dqYnLgfF6FNFeetEjGOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42081'),
  ('252271485298359437', 'Sugarcane', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Christopher LaMarca, Emily Kassie, Julian Brave NoiseCat', 'Emily Kassie', 'Julian Brave NoiseCat, Willie Sellars, Charlene Belleau, Ed Archie Noisecat, Chief Willie Sellars', 'R', 'An investigation into abuse and missing children at an Indian residential school in Canada ignites a reckoning on the nearby Sugarcane Reserve.', 'An investigation into abuse and missing children at an Indian residential school in Canada ignites a reckoning on the nearby Sugarcane Reserve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Xx4o4MVSDv0pojOzoHMH5y85hB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1158874'),
  ('575039071257754220', 'Sugarplummed', 2024, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ryan Landels', 'Ryan Landels', 'Maggie Lawson, Janel Parrish, Brendon Zub, Kyra Leroux, Avan Stewart, Shiraine Haas, Charles Jarman, Jessica Garcie', null, 'Emily''s wish for a picture-perfect Christmas comes true when a magical, optimistic movie character steps off the screen to help, but as things spiral out of control, she learns that true holiday perfection might look very different from what she imagined.', 'Emily''s wish for a picture-perfect Christmas comes true when a magical, optimistic movie character steps off the screen to help, but as things spiral out of control, she learns that true holiday perfection might look very different from what she imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oI4K0OiWzZ9DiGHJXatJgtVveED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1359060'),
  ('1036299641058087783', 'Sugartime', 1995, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'John N. Smith, Pierre Letarte', 'Martyn Burke', 'John Turturro, Mary-Louise Parker, Elias Koteas, Maury Chaykin, Louis Del Grande, Deborah Duchêne, Larissa Laskin, Richard Blackburn', null, 'Sam Giancana is a ruthless mob boss from Chicago. During a trip to Las Vegas, he sees a performance by the McGuire Sisters, a popular singing group with a pure image. Sam is attracted to Phyllis and begins aggressively courting her. The two enter into an epic romance, but it brings unwanted attention and tarnishes Phyllis''s reputation. For Sam, however, the consequences are far more drastic, landing him in trouble with the law and his fellow mobsters.', 'Sam Giancana is a ruthless mob boss from Chicago. During a trip to Las Vegas, he sees a performance by the McGuire Sisters, a popular singing group with a pure image. Sam is attracted to Phyllis and begins aggressively courting her. The two enter into an epic romance, but it brings unwanted attention and tarnishes Phyllis''s reputation. For Sam, however, the consequences are far more drastic, landing him in trouble with the law and his fellow mobsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bR1NihaLYcLadZs1ezX5O6tlPM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57689'),
  ('67344773016139428', 'Suhaag', 1994, null, 'Sandesh Kohli', 'Honey Irani', 'Ajay Devgn, Akshay Kumar, Karisma Kapoor, Nagma, Aruna Irani, Dalip Tahil, Tiku Talsania, Romesh Sharma', null, 'Collegian Ajay Sharma was born on 2nd April 1968 and lives in Bombay with his widowed mom, Asha. He is friendly with fellow-collegian, the wealthy Raj Sinha, and both often end up getting beat-up by goons and Madhu (Raj''s girlfriend) respectively. After they graduate from college, Raj''s maternal uncle asks Ajay to bring his birth certificate so that he could make his passport and find work for him in a department store in Canada. Ajay goes home to look for his birth certificate, but is unable to locate. His mother makes a show of helping him, but instead tears a document and tosses it outside. Ajay puts the document together and finds out that his real name is Ajay Malhotra, his father, Dr. Ravi Malhotra, is still alive, serving a life sentence in prison for killing and stealing a patient''s organs. Ajay questions his mother and finds out that his dad was framed by the hospital owner, Rai Bahadur. He and Asha meet Ravi in prison and swear to avenge his humiliation.', 'Collegian Ajay Sharma was born on 2nd April 1968 and lives in Bombay with his widowed mom, Asha. He is friendly with fellow-collegian, the wealthy Raj Sinha, and both often end up getting beat-up by goons and Madhu (Raj''s girlfriend) respectively. After they graduate from college, Raj''s maternal uncle asks Ajay to bring his birth certificate so that he could make his passport and find work for him in a department store in Canada. Ajay goes home to look for his birth certificate, but is unable to locate. His mother makes a show of helping him, but instead tears a document and tosses it outside. Ajay puts the document together and finds out that his real name is Ajay Malhotra, his father, Dr. Ravi Malhotra, is still alive, serving a life sentence in prison for killing and stealing a patient''s organs. Ajay questions his mother and finds out that his dad was framed by the hospital owner, Rai Bahadur. He and Asha meet Ravi in prison and swear to avenge his humiliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y47kzea1h3LkzBHTwMEftbiY8eX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143881'),
  ('601939158060955002', 'Sui Dhaaga - Made in India', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Shanoo Sharma, Sharat Katariya', 'Sharat Katariya', 'Varun Dhawan, Anushka Sharma, Raghubir Yadav, Yamini Das, Sawan Tank, Namit Das, Shrikant Verma, Manukriti Pahwa', null, 'Mauji stays in a village near Delhi with his wife Mamta, father and mother. Varun works at a shop that sells sewing machines, owned by Bansal and his son Prashant. Both have a habit of ill-treating Mauji and make him do fun antics. When Prashant gets married, Bansal invites Mauji and his entire family. Mamta feels humiliated when she sees Mauji being asked to imitate a dog by the Bansals.', 'Mauji stays in a village near Delhi with his wife Mamta, father and mother. Varun works at a shop that sells sewing machines, owned by Bansal and his son Prashant. Both have a habit of ill-treating Mauji and make him do fun antics. When Prashant gets married, Bansal invites Mauji and his entire family. Mamta feels humiliated when she sees Mauji being asked to imitate a dog by the Bansals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dit1yb4Z5WBtCFqn7Bl3oN8l7A1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496327'),
  ('616574851929739894', 'Suicide', 2001, 'Drama, Horror', 'Raoul W. Heimrich, Yvonne Wunschel', 'Yvonne Wunschel', 'Markus H. Eberhardt, Engelbert Weiss, Ralph Polinski, Katja Weber, Beatrice Heimrich, Sophie Ch. Rieger, Tobias Wunschel, Markus Dietz', null, 'A website offers people to have their suicides filmed.', 'A website offers people to have their suicides filmed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuwfWT4h03wl1OdnfUr2YLZy5ES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39926'),
  ('71796256002040962', 'Suicide Bus', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hiroshi Shimizu, Katsumi Yanagijima, Shinsuke Ohno', 'Dankan', 'Dankan, Nanako Okochi, Toshinori Omi, Ippei Souda, Yoichi Nukumizu, Great Gidayu, Hiroyuki Kishi, Takashi Mitsuhashi', null, 'A young girl named Mitsuki receives a ticket for a bus tour from her uncle. The tour appears to be normal (expect that everyone appears to be quite sombre), but Mitsuki learns its true purpose: the other passengers and the tour manager have a suicide pact to send the bus over a cliff so their families can collect the insurance money.', 'A young girl named Mitsuki receives a ticket for a bus tour from her uncle. The tour appears to be normal (expect that everyone appears to be quite sombre), but Mitsuki learns its true purpose: the other passengers and the tour manager have a suicide pact to send the bus over a cliff so their families can collect the insurance money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6l0eYosnX1uwqdfKy7aWZXiP4FY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96538'),
  ('100503805177565254', 'Suicide Club', 2001, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Sion Sono, Kazuto Sato', 'Sion Sono', 'Ryo Ishibashi, Masatoshi Nagase, Mai Hosho, Tamao Sato, Takashi Nomura, Akaji Maro, Hideo Sako, Nao Nagasawa', null, 'When the bizarre mass suicide of 54 high school girls throwing themselves in front of a subway train appears to instigate a string of suicides around the country, Detective Kuroda strives to find the answer, which isn''t as simple as he had hoped.', 'When the bizarre mass suicide of 54 high school girls throwing themselves in front of a subway train appears to instigate a string of suicides around the country, Detective Kuroda strives to find the answer, which isn''t as simple as he had hoped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMjWlKHzR9cwhf3oCUy9j57o67O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12720'),
  ('453142126816560232', 'Suicide Forest Village', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Jun Fukumoto, Takashi Shimizu, Yasutaka Mori', 'Daisuke Hosaka, Takashi Shimizu', 'Anna Yamada, Mayu Yamaguchi, Fuju Kamio, Yuki Kura, Haruka Kudo, Rinka Otani, Muga Tsukaji, Asuka Kurosawa', null, 'One day a mysterious box arrived and a curse began to spread all over. The source of the box is ''Jukai Village''. The village is hidden in Jukai Forest, a suicide spot that once you enter it, you can never come out.', 'One day a mysterious box arrived and a curse began to spread all over. The source of the box is ''Jukai Village''. The village is hidden in Jukai Forest, a suicide spot that once you enter it, you can never come out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJuh5nShLHIMgDzl400fC4oLSuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791570'),
  ('443651293451392304', 'Suicide Kings', 1997, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Christopher Baffa, Peter O''Fallon', 'Wayne Allan Rice, Josh McKinney, Gina Goldman', 'Christopher Walken, Henry Thomas, Sean Patrick Flanery, Jay Mohr, Jeremy Sisto, Johnny Galecki, Nina Siemaszko, Denis Leary', 'R', 'Carlo, a former mobster, is abducted by five privileged young men desperate to raise a $2 million ransom to save the sister of a friend. As Carlo plays mind games, however, his captors splinter -- each wondering whether one of their own had a hand in the crime.', 'Carlo, a former mobster, is abducted by five privileged young men desperate to raise a $2 million ransom to save the sister of a friend. As Carlo plays mind games, however, his captors splinter -- each wondering whether one of their own had a hand in the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQ2Sidqubi7XiHDScFe1faIz3Uv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10668'),
  ('802046573197675161', 'Suicide of Colonel Henry', 1899, null, 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'Shows the interior of the cell of the Prison Militaire du Cherche-Midi, Paris, where Colonel Henry is confined. He is seated at a table writing a letter, on completion of which he rises and takes a razor out he had concealed in his porte-manteau, with which he cuts his throat. The suicide is discovered by the sergeant of the guard and officers.', 'Shows the interior of the cell of the Prison Militaire du Cherche-Midi, Paris, where Colonel Henry is confined. He is seated at a table writing a letter, on completion of which he rises and takes a razor out he had concealed in his porte-manteau, with which he cuts his throat. The suicide is discovered by the sergeant of the guard and officers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYZ33v2gjPQopRDwdvk3H9xUOoC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105330'),
  ('916573709710617681', 'Suicide Room', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jan Komasa, Radek Ładczuk, Adam Torczyński', 'Jan Komasa', 'Jakub Gierszał, Roma Gąsiorowska, Agata Kulesza, Krzysztof Pieczyński, Rafał Fudalej, Karolina Kominek, Natalia Rzeźniak-Pospieszalska, Mateusz Kościukiewicz', 'NR', 'Moody, dark and handsome Dominik is terrorized at school after video footage of his drunken kiss with classmate Aleksandr goes viral. Grappling with public humiliation, Dominik seeks solace in an avatar based ''suicide room'' where the pink-haired rebel Sylwia consoles him.', 'Moody, dark and handsome Dominik is terrorized at school after video footage of his drunken kiss with classmate Aleksandr goes viral. Grappling with public humiliation, Dominik seeks solace in an avatar based ''suicide room'' where the pink-haired rebel Sylwia consoles him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BUyvSeRG4FAkv0jo5FhJ87gHMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72478'),
  ('116040783443232394', 'Suicide Squad', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Roman Vasyanov, David Ayer, Brandt Gordon', 'David Ayer', 'Will Smith, Jared Leto, Margot Robbie, Joel Kinnaman, Viola Davis, Jai Courtney, Jay Hernandez, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje', 'PG-13', 'From DC Comics comes the Suicide Squad, an antihero team of incarcerated supervillains who act as deniable assets for the United States government, undertaking high-risk black ops missions in exchange for commuted prison sentences.', 'From DC Comics comes the Suicide Squad, an antihero team of incarcerated supervillains who act as deniable assets for the United States government, undertaking high-risk black ops missions in exchange for commuted prison sentences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sk3FZgh3sRrmr8vyhaitNobMcfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297761'),
  ('1039487001329970889', 'Suicide Squad: Hell to Pay', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Action, Animation, Fantasy', 'Sam Liu', 'Alan Burnett', 'Christian Slater, Billy Brown, Kristin Bauer, Gideon Emery, Liam McIntyre, C. Thomas Howell, Vanessa Williams, David Boat', 'R', 'Amanda Waller''s top-secret "Task Force X" — consisting of Deadshot, Bronze Tiger, Killer Frost, Captain Boomerang, Harley Quinn, and Copperhead — is on a mission to retrieve a mystical object so powerful that they''re willing to risk their lives to steal it. However, the Suicide Squad isn''t the only group of villains seeking to possess the object. It''s a race for the golden prize, and second place isn''t an option if they want to stay alive.', 'Amanda Waller''s top-secret "Task Force X" — consisting of Deadshot, Bronze Tiger, Killer Frost, Captain Boomerang, Harley Quinn, and Copperhead — is on a mission to retrieve a mystical object so powerful that they''re willing to risk their lives to steal it. However, the Suicide Squad isn''t the only group of villains seeking to possess the object. It''s a race for the golden prize, and second place isn''t an option if they want to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/va1IgsZeWBbKLsZcFwz3CM1MkMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487242'),
  ('1076700508034866089', 'Suitable Flesh', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kim Barnard, Joe Lynch, Nicholas Clark', 'Dennis Paoli', 'Heather Graham, Judah Lewis, Bruce Davison, Johnathon Schaech, Barbara Crampton, Graham Skipper, Brett A. Newton, Chris L. McKenna', 'NR', 'A once-esteemed psychiatrist helplessly watches her life spiral into a nightmarish maelstrom of supernatural hysteria and gruesome deaths, all linked to a seemingly unstoppable ancient curse.', 'A once-esteemed psychiatrist helplessly watches her life spiral into a nightmarish maelstrom of supernatural hysteria and gruesome deaths, all linked to a seemingly unstoppable ancient curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tl3vIpRNKaWyMJiLxkpdT9Q2EWm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006947'),
  ('506060077749128462', 'Suitcase Killer: The Melanie McGuire Story', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Nicole L. Thompson, Jalani Riley', 'Peter O''Brien', 'Candice King, Michael Roark, Jackson Hurst, Wendie Malick, Tristan Laurence Perez, Kevin Brown, Nikki Garza, Jerry O''Donnell', 'PG-13', 'Based on a shocking true story, Melanie McGuire was an exceptional fertility nurse, married to her ex-Navy husband Bill and doting mother of two boys. When she falls for Brad, a doctor at her clinic, and gets entangled in a steamy love affair, Melanie does the unthinkable. After drugging and murdering Bill, she dismembers him and places the body parts into three suitcases, throwing them into Chesapeake Bay. But when the suitcases are found on the shores of Virginia Beach, an investigation is launched leading to Melanie as the prime suspect. Led by the efforts of assistant attorney general Patti Prezioso, authorities eventually bring Melanie to justice, who despite being convicted, continues to maintain her innocence.', 'Based on a shocking true story, Melanie McGuire was an exceptional fertility nurse, married to her ex-Navy husband Bill and doting mother of two boys. When she falls for Brad, a doctor at her clinic, and gets entangled in a steamy love affair, Melanie does the unthinkable. After drugging and murdering Bill, she dismembers him and places the body parts into three suitcases, throwing them into Chesapeake Bay. But when the suitcases are found on the shores of Virginia Beach, an investigation is launched leading to Melanie as the prime suspect. Led by the efforts of assistant attorney general Patti Prezioso, authorities eventually bring Melanie to justice, who despite being convicted, continues to maintain her innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bk9rCfidmjoe4uLHAsUWGjD8urZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:986965'),
  ('212737709989967437', 'Suite 16', 1994, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Dominique Deruddere, Jean-François Robin', 'Charlie Higson, Lise Mayer', 'Pete Postlethwaite, Antonie Kamerling, Géraldine Pailhas, Tom Jansen, Bart Slegers, Suzanne Colin, Viviane de Muynck, Dirk Roofthooft', null, 'After an argument and fight with a wealthy one night stand in a posh hotel, young hustler Chris finds himself trapped inside. With nowhere to go and the cops closing in on the hotel fast, he wanders into "Suite 16" in a fit of despair. Inside, a handicapped and wheelchair bound Glover is held captive for the evening once discovered by Chris. However, things change the next day when Glover informs Chris that the woman he slept with is now dead; and that he surely will be sought out for her murder. Lonely and bored, Glover offers to shelter Chris for awhile while the cuts and bruises from the previous nights escapades have time to heal.', 'After an argument and fight with a wealthy one night stand in a posh hotel, young hustler Chris finds himself trapped inside. With nowhere to go and the cops closing in on the hotel fast, he wanders into "Suite 16" in a fit of despair. Inside, a handicapped and wheelchair bound Glover is held captive for the evening once discovered by Chris. However, things change the next day when Glover informs Chris that the woman he slept with is now dead; and that he surely will be sought out for her murder. Lonely and bored, Glover offers to shelter Chris for awhile while the cuts and bruises from the previous nights escapades have time to heal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TWH8t8pf31LGK0APvsT2HHMryc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47587'),
  ('593263672998116065', 'Suite Dreams', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Koki Mitani, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Koki Mitani', 'Koji Yakusho, Takako Matsu, Koichi Sato, Shingo Katori, Ryoko Shinohara, Keiko Toda, Katsuhisa Namase, Kumiko Aso', null, 'New Year''s Eve at a posh hotel and all should be shipshape. It is not. There is the traditional party, an official ceremony, entertainment and a special dinner planned and yet there is trouble everywhere. An Animal is on the loose, a politician to protect, a prostitute to handle, a bellhop to focus and a few things more.', 'New Year''s Eve at a posh hotel and all should be shipshape. It is not. There is the traditional party, an official ceremony, entertainment and a special dinner planned and yet there is trouble everywhere. An Animal is on the loose, a politician to protect, a prostitute to handle, a bellhop to focus and a few things more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snkfz2KFRfiNPYI3y5QF4w2ThZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112903'),
  ('465938759592648358', 'Suite Française', 2015, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Saul Dibb, Patrick Rolfe, Eduard Grau', 'Saul Dibb, Matt Charman', 'Michelle Williams, Kristin Scott Thomas, Matthias Schoenaerts, Sam Riley, Ruth Wilson, Heino Ferch, Tom Schilling, Harriet Walter', 'NR', 'France, 1940. In the first days of occupation, beautiful Lucile Angellier is trapped in a stifled existence with her controlling mother-in-law as they both await news of her husband: a prisoner of war. Parisian refugees start to pour into their small town, soon followed by a regiment of German soldiers who take up residence in the villagers'' own homes. Lucile initially tries to ignore Bruno von Falk, the handsome and refined German officer staying with them. But soon, a powerful love draws them together and leads them into the tragedy of war.', 'France, 1940. In the first days of occupation, beautiful Lucile Angellier is trapped in a stifled existence with her controlling mother-in-law as they both await news of her husband: a prisoner of war. Parisian refugees start to pour into their small town, soon followed by a regiment of German soldiers who take up residence in the villagers'' own homes. Lucile initially tries to ignore Bruno von Falk, the handsome and refined German officer staying with them. But soon, a powerful love draws them together and leads them into the tragedy of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPgijY9f79FfD7K8MmzsynXpq0R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271674'),
  ('1063325559783051897', 'Suite Habana', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Fernando Pérez', 'Fernando Pérez', 'Heriberto Boroto, Iván Carbonell, Francisco Cardet, Francisquito Cardet, Julio Castro, Ernesto Díaz, Amanda Gautier, Waldo Morales', null, 'Dawn breaks in La Habana, and as the day advances we follow the simple lives of ten ordinary Cubans, with only sounds and images accompanied by music.', 'Dawn breaks in La Habana, and as the day advances we follow the simple lives of ten ordinary Cubans, with only sounds and images accompanied by music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpr1kmuZTfThG9qLSNWMTrONnAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85645'),
  ('357877842223874746', 'Sujata', 1959, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bimal Roy, Kamal Bose, Raghunath Jhalani', 'Nabendu Ghosh', 'Nutan, Sunil Dutt, Tarun Bose, Sulochana Latkar, Asit Sen, Shashikala, Lalita Pawar, Ashim Kumar', null, 'An orphan adopted by an upper caste family never learns of her untouchable caste background. This proves problematic when years later, she falls in love with an upper caste man.', 'An orphan adopted by an upper caste family never learns of her untouchable caste background. This proves problematic when years later, she falls in love with an upper caste man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otEsyJDvnu8MDKZfGTOwnHyNEq8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82567'),
  ('1086920278093618623', 'Sujo', 2024, 'Drama', 'Astrid Rondero, Fernanda Valadez, Ximena Amann', 'Astrid Rondero, Fernanda Valadez', 'Juan Jesús Varela, Yadira Pérez, Sandra Lorenzano, Alexis Varela, Jhon Jairo Hernández, Karla Garrido, Ricardo Luna, Kevin Aguilar', null, 'When a hitman is murdered, he leaves behind Sujo, his beloved 4-year-old son. The shadow of violence stalks Sujo at every stage of his life. As he grows into a man, Sujo will discover that fulfilling his father''s destiny seems inevitable.', 'When a hitman is murdered, he leaves behind Sujo, his beloved 4-year-old son. The shadow of violence stalks Sujo at every stage of his life. As he grows into a man, Sujo will discover that fulfilling his father''s destiny seems inevitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aljgp27QB1JNHSQOHXXsMlR8Ck9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214508'),
  ('366621686606332294', 'Sukeban Boy', 2006, 'Fantasy, Horror, Action, Comedy', 'Noboru Iguchi, Yasutaka Nagano', 'Noboru Iguchi', 'Asami, Emiru Momose, Demo Tanaka, Sarasa Tani, Risa Mizuki, Hiroaki Murakami, Maki Mizui', null, 'A raucous teen boy with a feminine face is teased everywhere, so his odd biker father dresses him as a girl and sends him to an all-girl school. The lad introduces himself as Sukeban, and a classmate, Michiko, takes him to after-school activities. Lessons on humility turn violent when a masked hatchet-wielding woman turns up. Jealousy, syringes of hormones, bare breasts, a blood bath, and more figure in the resolution.', 'A raucous teen boy with a feminine face is teased everywhere, so his odd biker father dresses him as a girl and sends him to an all-girl school. The lad introduces himself as Sukeban, and a classmate, Michiko, takes him to after-school activities. Lessons on humility turn violent when a masked hatchet-wielding woman turns up. Jealousy, syringes of hormones, bare breasts, a blood bath, and more figure in the resolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47VN8uxDOLFL8hRHyRrV3hTZn9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67563'),
  ('787774349053858146', 'Sukhibhavaa', 2026, 'Drama', 'N K Raajesh Naidu, Babu Khan', 'N K Raajesh Naidu', 'Mahender Patel, Sushmita Nayk, Vihanshi Hegede, Ravishanker Gowda, Shobaraj', null, 'Two orphans marry and raise their son with love until the mother dies in an accident. The father leaves him at a hostel. The boy searches for his parents, learning about love along the way, but it eludes him. He seeks his first love.', 'Two orphans marry and raise their son with love until the mother dies in an accident. The father leaves him at a hostel. The boy searches for his parents, learning about love along the way, but it eludes him. He seeks his first love.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:sukhibhavaa'),
  ('508838188008194760', 'Suki', 2023, 'Drama', 'Albert Langitan', 'Albert Langitan', 'Azi Acosta, Alona Navarro, John Rhey Flores, Jiad Arroyo, Gwen Garci, Yda Manzano, Chad Kinis, Soliman Cruz', null, 'A lady stripper and a gigolo promised each other that their work can''t break them apart. But when lust and temptation come into the picture, they begin to question their vow.', 'A lady stripper and a gigolo promised each other that their work can''t break them apart. But when lust and temptation come into the picture, they begin to question their vow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bfDD4mtWYrExQuWDfUiY7JZ3hk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075536'),
  ('751439581622187076', 'Sukiyaki Western Django', 2007, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Western, Thriller', 'Takashi Miike, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Takashi Miike, Masaru Nakamura', 'Hideaki Ito, Koichi Sato, Yūsuke Iseya, Kaori Momoi, Teruyuki Kagawa, Takaaki Ishibashi, Masanobu Ando, Yoshino Kimura', 'R', 'A nameless gunfighter arrives in a town ripped apart by rival gangs and, though courted by both to join, chooses his own path.', 'A nameless gunfighter arrives in a town ripped apart by rival gangs and, though courted by both to join, chooses his own path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnB7lpBknu510z9ATWbfpamPKZa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13637'),
  ('635870978621936613', 'Sukkubus', 1989, 'Drama, Horror', 'Rudolf Blaháček, Christoph Schlingensief, Georg Tressler', 'Franz Seitz Junior', 'Peter Simonischek, Giovanni Früh, Andy Voß, Pamela Prati', null, 'Sometime during the 19th century in Switzerland: After a delirious night of drinking, three herdsmen who are all alone in the alps with their kettle, create a female doll from cloth and a strangely formed wooden root. When their creation comes to life in form of an evil and beautiful female demon, they have to fear for their lives...', 'Sometime during the 19th century in Switzerland: After a delirious night of drinking, three herdsmen who are all alone in the alps with their kettle, create a female doll from cloth and a strangely formed wooden root. When their creation comes to life in form of an evil and beautiful female demon, they have to fear for their lives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5F6OrTdhA1M7CjPPua3jmwkxc89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117560'),
  ('784873015160248793', 'Sukkwan Island', 2026, 'Drama', 'Vladimir de Fontenay, Amine Berrada, Maïmouna Bancel, Remo Catani, Thomas Colban, Halfdan Gjerdrum, Rory Stewart, Elzė Vozbinaitė, Valérie Wery', 'Vladimir de Fontenay, David Vann', 'Swann Arlaud, Woody Norman, Alma Pöysti, Ruaridh Mollica, Tuppence Middleton', null, 'In an effort to reconnect with his estranged father, 13-year-old Roy agrees to spend a formative year of adventure on the remote Sukkwan Island deep in the Norwegian fjords. What starts as a chance to rebuild their relationship quickly descends into a test of survival as they face the harsh realities of their environment and confront their unresolved turmoil.', 'In an effort to reconnect with his estranged father, 13-year-old Roy agrees to spend a formative year of adventure on the remote Sukkwan Island deep in the Norwegian fjords. What starts as a chance to rebuild their relationship quickly descends into a test of survival as they face the harsh realities of their environment and confront their unresolved turmoil.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fuu2MUD6vCJ6MN2BhcWPVysSND7V.jpg', 'plex:movie:sukkwan-island-2026'),
  ('922849571752745308', 'Sukran', 2026, 'Comedy, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Ubaini, Melbin Kurisinkal', 'Rahul Kalyan', 'Bibin George, Shine Tom Chacko, Chandhunadh, Aadhya Prasad, Kottayam Nazeer', null, 'Marked by a horoscope that makes him take the blame for things he never did, Nandu grows up carrying the weight of an unfair fate. Years later, the return of his childhood love brings challenges and turning points that change his life forever.', 'Marked by a horoscope that makes him take the blame for things he never did, Nandu grows up carrying the weight of an unfair fate. Years later, the return of his childhood love brings challenges and turning points that change his life forever.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4C2XqtbOE72nRM9icxzztLxHNoM.jpg', 'plex:movie:sukran-2026-1'),
