  ('299856211159383260', 'Sullivan''s Travels', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance, Adventure', 'Preston Sturges, John F. Seitz, Sigmund Krumgold', 'Preston Sturges', 'Joel McCrea, Veronica Lake, Robert Warwick, William Demarest, Franklin Pangborn, Porter Hall, Byron Foulger, Margaret Hayes', 'NR', 'Successful movie director John L. Sullivan, convinced he won''t be able to film his ambitious masterpiece until he has suffered, dons a hobo disguise and sets off on a journey, aiming to "know trouble" first-hand. When all he finds is a train ride back to Hollywood and a beautiful blonde companion, he redoubles his efforts, managing to land himself in more trouble than he bargained for when he loses his memory and ends up a prisoner on a chain gang.', 'Successful movie director John L. Sullivan, convinced he won''t be able to film his ambitious masterpiece until he has suffered, dons a hobo disguise and sets off on a journey, aiming to "know trouble" first-hand. When all he finds is a train ride back to Hollywood and a beautiful blonde companion, he redoubles his efforts, managing to land himself in more trouble than he bargained for when he loses his memory and ends up a prisoner on a chain gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5cqIM0ysVjkCmaDfyTQnlozdIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16305'),
  ('495001459478487556', 'Sully', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Clint Eastwood, David M. Bernstein, Kevin Ishioka', 'Todd Komarnicki', 'Tom Hanks, Aaron Eckhart, Anna Gunn, Holt McCallany, Mike O''Malley, Jamey Sheridan, Valerie Mahaffey, Delphi Harrington', 'PG-13', 'On 15 January 2009, the world witnessed the ''Miracle on the Hudson'' when Captain ''Sully'' Sullenberger glided his disabled plane onto the Hudson River, saving the lives of all 155 souls aboard. However, even as Sully was being heralded by the public and the media for his unprecedented feat of aviation skill, an investigation was unfolding that threatened to destroy his reputation and career.', 'On 15 January 2009, the world witnessed the ''Miracle on the Hudson'' when Captain ''Sully'' Sullenberger glided his disabled plane onto the Hudson River, saving the lives of all 155 souls aboard. However, even as Sully was being heralded by the public and the media for his unprecedented feat of aviation skill, an investigation was unfolding that threatened to destroy his reputation and career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vs83YcJ8TsabADDtaeCJ6ZTjYY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363676'),
  ('492199599805683263', 'Sultan', 1978, 'Romance, Family, Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet, Süleyman Çekiç', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'Türkan Şoray, Bulut Aras, Şener Şen, Adile Naşit, İhsan Yüce, Erdal Özyağcılar, Tuncer Sevi, İlyas Salman', null, 'A portrait of a young, depressed Turkish widow in the slums whose infinite dignity alone looks after her orphan kids is depicted by the son of the town sheriff, who is in love with her.', 'A portrait of a young, depressed Turkish widow in the slums whose infinite dignity alone looks after her orphan kids is depicted by the son of the town sheriff, who is in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvfp8k0x2BC2M2qOcZxmFiEk4Sn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452606'),
  ('501690497866886396', 'Sultan', 2016, 'Drama, Action, Romance', 'Ali Abbas Zafar, Artur Żurawski, Abhiraj Minawala', 'Aditya Chopra', 'Salman Khan, Anushka Sharma, Randeep Hooda, Amit Sadh, Kumud Mishra, Parikshat Sahni, Tyron Woodley, Marko Zaror', null, 'The ageing wrestler Sultan Ali Khan decides to try his luck on the mat again; to do this, he wants to represent his country at the Olympic Games, but first has to overcome personal issues.', 'The ageing wrestler Sultan Ali Khan decides to try his luck on the mat again; to do this, he wants to represent his country at the Olympic Games, but first has to overcome personal issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPTYtKuV8X5uUd3SqnzO14W6Dti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376812'),
  ('865218897912390194', 'Sultana''s Dream', 2023, 'Animation, Drama', 'Eduardo Elosegi, Isabel Herguera', 'Isabel Herguera, Gianmarco Serra', 'Miren Arrieta, Mireia Gabilondo, Mary Beard, Manu Khurana, Arunima Bhattacharya, Ranjitha Rajeevan, Maurizio Faraoni, Debjani Mukherjee', null, 'Inés sets out on a voyage of discovery around India in search of Ladyland, the Utopian land of women.', 'Inés sets out on a voyage of discovery around India in search of Ladyland, the Utopian land of women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8b4RrqjB0IoVT1KZwkha7xfr4xA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947643'),
  ('772963748238692322', 'Sultans of the South', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Alejandro Lozano', 'Tony Dalton', 'Tony Dalton, Jordi Mollà, Ana de la Reguera, Silverio Palacios, Brian Maya, Celso Bugallo, Oscar Alegre, Juan Carlos Remolina', null, 'A band of thieves steals from a Mexican bank and travel to Argentina to launder the money. Upon their arrival, the plan goes south and it''s up to them to figure out what went wrong.', 'A band of thieves steals from a Mexican bank and travel to Argentina to launder the money. Upon their arrival, the plan goes south and it''s up to them to figure out what went wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jy6jaofP0fEIEhwnlFitfQvFrrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30232'),
  ('726168103729415013', 'Sultry', 2018, 'Drama, Horror', 'Marina Meliande', 'Felipe Bragança, Marina Meliande', 'Marina Provenzzano, Pedro Gracindo, Analú Prestes, Igor Angelkorte, Jéssica Barbosa, Breno de Filippo, Thelmo Fernandes, Jitman Vibranovski', null, 'Rio de Janeiro, 2016: the city simmers in anticipation of the Olympic Games. Lawyer Ana defends the interests of residents of homes to be replaced by stadiums, roads and luxury hotels. Is the heat affecting her perception or is the struggle becoming visible on her skin?', 'Rio de Janeiro, 2016: the city simmers in anticipation of the Olympic Games. Lawyer Ana defends the interests of residents of homes to be replaced by stadiums, roads and luxury hotels. Is the heat affecting her perception or is the struggle becoming visible on her skin?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sITpE5aFi2avN6YBFjU03uYH6H3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498086'),
  ('237165106943028132', 'Sultry Assassin: The Aphrodisiac Kill', 2010, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Ken''ichi Fujiwara', 'Ken''ichi Fujiwara', 'Akiho Yoshizawa, Yoshihiro Satō, Asami, Rin Kawai, Kêsuke, Taiga Etô, Ryôichi Inaba', null, 'When drugs, graft and the illegal sex trade come together, the outcome can be deadly; especially in ancient Edo, where the law is dictated by he who wields the strongest sword. That''s why Yasaburo, a mere commoner, spends all his spare time practicing and refining his prowess with a blade. But when Yasaburo comes to the aid of a woman he believes to be a prostitute, he soon learns that there are more kinds of weapons than he''d ever imagined... For the woman is actually Rin, a female ninja enforcer assigned to pose as a prostitute in order to investigate shipments of an illegal aphrodisiac, and the deadliest weapon in ancient Japan isn''t made of steel or wood, but rather of human flesh in the form of a deadly kunoichi assassin. Get ready for the wildest eroninja film ever as three of Japan''s hottest female stars - Akiho Yoshizawa, Asami and Rin Kawaii - bring Junichi Yagami''s epic erotic novels of sex and steel to life in Sultry Assassin: The Aphrodisiac Kill!', 'When drugs, graft and the illegal sex trade come together, the outcome can be deadly; especially in ancient Edo, where the law is dictated by he who wields the strongest sword. That''s why Yasaburo, a mere commoner, spends all his spare time practicing and refining his prowess with a blade. But when Yasaburo comes to the aid of a woman he believes to be a prostitute, he soon learns that there are more kinds of weapons than he''d ever imagined... For the woman is actually Rin, a female ninja enforcer assigned to pose as a prostitute in order to investigate shipments of an illegal aphrodisiac, and the deadliest weapon in ancient Japan isn''t made of steel or wood, but rather of human flesh in the form of a deadly kunoichi assassin. Get ready for the wildest eroninja film ever as three of Japan''s hottest female stars - Akiho Yoshizawa, Asami and Rin Kawaii - bring Junichi Yagami''s epic erotic novels of sex and steel to life in Sultry Assassin: The Aphrodisiac Kill!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qq4dPGNS8XRgppsfR89bSmxWmu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138503'),
  ('809684098590992473', 'Sulutan', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rodante Pajemna Jr.', 'Rodante Pajemna Jr', 'Astrid Lee, Karen Lopez, Allison Ross, Mark Dionisio, Mhack Morales', null, 'Lena and Mara are drawn into a secret affair that defies boundaries and threatens everything they’ve built. When Mara uncovers her groom’s betrayal, she finds solace in Lena, a newfound friend who soon becomes something more. As passion and secrecy collide, their choices endanger careers, fracture relationships, and lead to devastating consequences.', 'Lena and Mara are drawn into a secret affair that defies boundaries and threatens everything they’ve built. When Mara uncovers her groom’s betrayal, she finds solace in Lena, a newfound friend who soon becomes something more. As passion and secrecy collide, their choices endanger careers, fracture relationships, and lead to devastating consequences.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwwW5sD2Rm6PG1PaZaUJKTekTCAy.jpg', 'plex:movie:sulutan'),
  ('614424110479494884', 'Sumala', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rizal Mantovani, Enggar Budiono, Lila Kodusa', 'Riheam Junianti', 'Luna Maya, Darius Sinathrya, Makayla Rose Hilli, Ivonne Dahler, Denino Basrial, Budi Gunawan, Denny Rahman, Varen Arianda Calief', null, 'An evil spirit seeking vengeance returns to plague the town that wronged her sister. Based on a chilling urban legend.', 'An evil spirit seeking vengeance returns to plague the town that wronged her sister. Based on a chilling urban legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOBX9x98TUSJFM6gfY7eDjZwIuh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1260594'),
  ('572474607966617127', 'Sumathi Sathakam', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'M M Nayudu', 'M M Nayudu', 'Amardeep Chowdary, Mahesh Vitta', null, 'A village shopkeeper pursues the woman he loves, but faces obstacles from local beliefs and strict customs in his wild attempt to overcome community opposition and claim her heart.', 'A village shopkeeper pursues the woman he loves, but faces obstacles from local beliefs and strict customs in his wild attempt to overcome community opposition and claim her heart.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fs5d8fKNObRThIPdD3mCAxyv2voV.jpg', 'plex:movie:sumathi-sathakam'),
