  ('520150264848987519', 'Sumikko Gurashi: The Pop-up Book and the Secret Child', 2019, 'Animation, Family', 'Hiroshi Chida, Mankyu', 'Takashi Sumita', 'Yoshihiko Inohara, Manami Honjo', null, 'Sumikkogurashi debuted in 2012 as slightly negative characters who like to stay in the corner of a room. The characters include "Shirokuma", a polar bear who is sensitive to cold, "Penguin?" (with a question mark in its name), a penguin who is unsure if it is actually a penguin, "Tonkatsu", a piece of pork cutlet that was left uneaten, "Neko", a shy cat, and "Tokage", who hides his nature as one of the last dinosaurs. The franchise has inspired toys, books, stationery material, video games—and now a feature film.', 'Sumikkogurashi debuted in 2012 as slightly negative characters who like to stay in the corner of a room. The characters include "Shirokuma", a polar bear who is sensitive to cold, "Penguin?" (with a question mark in its name), a penguin who is unsure if it is actually a penguin, "Tonkatsu", a piece of pork cutlet that was left uneaten, "Neko", a shy cat, and "Tokage", who hides his nature as one of the last dinosaurs. The franchise has inspired toys, books, stationery material, video games—and now a feature film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Y6ufg3H3bp8655ET8kKM7FGskL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636959'),
  ('313308198182029998', 'Summer', 1930, 'Animation', 'Ub Iwerks', null, null, 'NR', 'In the logical sequel to Springtime, a new set of insects (mostly) dances to a new set of tunes, while doing summer activities. The insects include dung beetles, dragonflies, butterflies, a walking stick, bees, and various other beetles and flies.', 'In the logical sequel to Springtime, a new set of insects (mostly) dances to a new set of tunes, while doing summer activities. The insects include dung beetles, dragonflies, butterflies, a walking stick, bees, and various other beetles and flies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3D6Z5nTnenoSCJWGMpMwtkS1HII.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67501'),
  ('70153492900068543', 'Summer', 1968, 'Drama', 'Marcel Hanoun', 'Marcel Hanoun', 'Graziella Buci, Pierre-Henri Deleau, Marianne', null, 'During the summer of 1968, a young French woman staying in an isolated country house reflects upon her involvement in the events of that May.', 'During the summer of 1968, a young French woman staying in an isolated country house reflects upon her involvement in the events of that May.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Adh0EZQ0eihI9qHtbYd9sg3vyPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273235'),
  ('287353695051448962', 'Summer', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Arvo Kruusement, Mall Jaakson, Peeter Simm', 'Paul-Eerik Rummo', 'Aare Laanemets, Riina Hein, Margus Lepa, Arno Liiver, Ain Lutsepp, Kaljo Kiisk, Kaarel Karm, Rein Aedma', null, 'In the beginning of the 20th century, Joosep Toots has returned from Russia, where he learned agriculture. He wants to start reforming his father''s farm, Ülesoo. At the same time, he''s competing with Kiir to win the love of Teele. Teele has stated that she agrees to marry with a farmer only. So Kiir decides to go to Russia to learn agriculture too.', 'In the beginning of the 20th century, Joosep Toots has returned from Russia, where he learned agriculture. He wants to start reforming his father''s farm, Ülesoo. At the same time, he''s competing with Kiir to win the love of Teele. Teele has stated that she agrees to marry with a farmer only. So Kiir decides to go to Russia to learn agriculture too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bB4335Pdmm8JZvWczBkMPVq11Gy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146030'),
  ('1117285592347468355', 'Summer', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mike Marzuk, Ian Blumers', 'Peer Klehmet, Sebastian Wehlings', 'Jimi Blue Ochsenknecht, Jannis Niewöhner, Julian Krüger, Sonja Gerhardt, Laura Vietzen, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Tim Wilde, Ingeborg Westphal', null, 'Because he can''t accompany his father, a German army officer, on his next deployment in Somalia, 15-year-old Tim has to move in with his grandmother on the North Sea island of Amrum. There, the cool skater from Berlin, who seems to magically attract problems, immediately loses his reputation as a freak and difficult outsider. Only chubby Eric, who suffers teasing and attacks from the surfer clique around rich Lars, stands by him. When Tim also falls in love with pretty Vic, Lars'' girlfriend, a fight is inevitable.', 'Because he can''t accompany his father, a German army officer, on his next deployment in Somalia, 15-year-old Tim has to move in with his grandmother on the North Sea island of Amrum. There, the cool skater from Berlin, who seems to magically attract problems, immediately loses his reputation as a freak and difficult outsider. Only chubby Eric, who suffers teasing and attacks from the surfer clique around rich Lars, stands by him. When Tim also falls in love with pretty Vic, Lars'' girlfriend, a fight is inevitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3P4wi25reejyEkc0Xef164MbY7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8352'),
  ('895206718142691751', 'Summer ''03', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Becca Gleason, Ben Hardwicke', 'Becca Gleason', 'Joey King, Jack Kilmer, Andrea Savage, Erin Darke, Kelly Lamor Wilson, Stephen Ruffin, Paul Scheer, June Squibb', 'NR', '16-year-old Jamie Winkle and her extended family are left reeling after her calculating grandmother unveils an array of secrets on her deathbed. As her family deals with her grandmother''s surprising dying messages, Jamie sets out to make the most of her summer and explores her sexuality.', '16-year-old Jamie Winkle and her extended family are left reeling after her calculating grandmother unveils an array of secrets on her deathbed. As her family deals with her grandmother''s surprising dying messages, Jamie sets out to make the most of her summer and explores her sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZhUcUkDzgvF0pjEjMZvUsvcUqH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501630'),
  ('101897195585163148', 'Summer ''04', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stefan Krohmer, Patrick Orth, Henrik Sauer', 'Daniel Nocke', 'Martina Gedeck, Robert Seeliger, Svea Lohde, Lucas Kotaranin, Nicole Marischka, Gábor Altorjay, Michael Benthin, Peter Davor', null, 'A character study of a family on vacation. The emotional abyss and problems are behind the seemingly nice facade of an intact family as they experience guilt, love, and jealousy.', 'A character study of a family on vacation. The emotional abyss and problems are behind the seemingly nice facade of an intact family as they experience guilt, love, and jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXZX1B2BaAXEo59KCV1CY4K1S4j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428'),
  ('428976654106368457', 'Summer 1993', 2017, 'Drama', 'Carla Simón, Santiago Racaj', 'Carla Simón', 'Laia Artigas, Paula Robles, Bruna Cusí, David Verdaguer, Fermí Reixach, Montse Sanz, Isabel Rocatti, Berta Pipó', 'NR', 'After her mother''s death, six-year-old Frida is sent to her uncle''s family to live with them in the countryside. But Frida finds it hard to forget her mother and adapt to her new life.', 'After her mother''s death, six-year-old Frida is sent to her uncle''s family to live with them in the countryside. But Frida finds it hard to forget her mother and adapt to her new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krdSl7IpDb9c31CXrzA5yfP1oYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438634'),
  ('312584954270148105', 'Summer and Smoke', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Glenville, Michael D. Moore, James A. Rosenberger', 'Meade Roberts, James Poe', 'Laurence Harvey, Geraldine Page, Rita Moreno, Una Merkel, John McIntire, Thomas Gomez, Pamela Tiffin, Malcolm Atterbury', 'NR', 'In a small Mississippi town in 1916, an eccentric spinster battles her romantic yearnings for the randy boy next door.', 'In a small Mississippi town in 1916, an eccentric spinster battles her romantic yearnings for the randy boy next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFpVZFokirARldwjvvoEwGQhUXW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94917'),
  ('80942235804299620', 'Summer Beats', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Romane Gueret, Lise Akoka, Benoit Seiller', 'Romane Gueret, Lise Akoka, Catherine Paillé', 'Fanta Kebe, Shirel Nataf, Zakaria-Tayeb Lazab, Mouctar Diawara, Idir Azougli, Yuming Hey, Suzanne De Baecque, Amel Bent', null, 'Paris, a working-class neighborhood in the 19th arrondissement. Shaï and Djeneba are 19 years old and have been friends since childhood. One is burdened by an overbearing family. The other by deep loneliness. Over the course of a summer, they work as counselors at a summer camp, far from the tower blocks where they grew up—no longer quite children, yet officially responsible for a group of kids aged 6 to 10. On the cusp of adulthood, they will have to make choices to grow up and reinvent their friendship.', 'Paris, a working-class neighborhood in the 19th arrondissement. Shaï and Djeneba are 19 years old and have been friends since childhood. One is burdened by an overbearing family. The other by deep loneliness. Over the course of a summer, they work as counselors at a summer camp, far from the tower blocks where they grew up—no longer quite children, yet officially responsible for a group of kids aged 6 to 10. On the cusp of adulthood, they will have to make choices to grow up and reinvent their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Sfvl3ZgSoGPxBxOiAGoIaOsG97.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290436'),
  ('249965271056750973', 'Summer Blooms', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rei Hirano, Ryutaro Nakagawa, Keitaro Sakon', 'Ryûhei Yoshino', 'Aki Asakura, Takahiro Miura, Yuriko Kawasaki, Fumiko Aoyagi, Kohji Moritsugu, Kotaro Shiga, Keiko Takahashi, Yumiko Takahashi', null, '27-year-old Hatsumi Takimoto is a former teacher and now waitress. She holds a secret. Three years after her boyfriend died, she receives a letter from him. After meeting a former student, Hatsumi Takimoto confesses about her past.', '27-year-old Hatsumi Takimoto is a former teacher and now waitress. She holds a secret. Three years after her boyfriend died, she receives a letter from him. After meeting a former student, Hatsumi Takimoto confesses about her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldpKnpO6UboXVUDmNi6gEezDXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460033'),
  ('789701116175696204', 'Summer Book', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Seyfi Teoman', 'Seyfi Teoman', 'Taner Birsel, Tayfun Gunay, Harun Ozuag, Ayten Tokun, Osman Inan, Rıza Akın, Zafer Inan, Burcu Sanli', null, 'Mustafa is a hard-working and ambitious agricultural merchant who is cold and austere towards his family. One day he has a brain hemorrhage on a business trip and goes into a coma after the operation. Guler is suspicious of her husband having an affair. Veysel, their teenage son, wants to leave the military academy and study business administration. Ali, their 10-year-old son, has to cope both with his bully classmate and the chewing gums he has to sell. Hasan, Mustafa''s younger brother, chose to live a life in solitude after getting a divorce, and has always been an outsider to the family. But now, with his brother in coma, he finds himself involved in family affairs. Hasan has to solve the mystery about Mustafa''s mistress and the money lost during his trip.', 'Mustafa is a hard-working and ambitious agricultural merchant who is cold and austere towards his family. One day he has a brain hemorrhage on a business trip and goes into a coma after the operation. Guler is suspicious of her husband having an affair. Veysel, their teenage son, wants to leave the military academy and study business administration. Ali, their 10-year-old son, has to cope both with his bully classmate and the chewing gums he has to sell. Hasan, Mustafa''s younger brother, chose to live a life in solitude after getting a divorce, and has always been an outsider to the family. But now, with his brother in coma, he finds himself involved in family affairs. Hasan has to solve the mystery about Mustafa''s mistress and the money lost during his trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0q8JJ12DZAoM9G5k6uoakCdTyi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114222'),
  ('311866461970037825', 'Summer Camp', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Chuck Vincent, Ken Gibb', 'Avrumie Schnitzer', 'Matt Michaels, Alexis Schreiner, Ray Holland, Brenda Fogarty, Linnea Quigley, John F. Goff, Verkina Flower, Robert Wald', 'R', 'The director of a failing summer camp decides to invite campers from ten years ago for a free weekend event, hoping that he can trick them into fixing up the place and also get their families to provide them some financial support. The boys and girls return to the camp and play pranks on each other and try to score with the other campers and the staff.', 'The director of a failing summer camp decides to invite campers from ten years ago for a free weekend event, hoping that he can trick them into fixing up the place and also get their families to provide them some financial support. The boys and girls return to the camp and play pranks on each other and try to score with the other campers and the staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9y3s9ERyDheyNTCu16s0BnE6OH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29819'),
  ('844415019325433886', 'Summer Camp', 2016, 'Horror', 'Alberto Marini, Pablo Rosso', 'Alberto Marini, Danielle Schleif', 'Maiara Walsh, Diego Boneta, Jocelin Donahue, Andrés Velencoso, Àlex Monner, Xavier Capdet, Rick Zingale, Mark Schardan', null, 'A group of people have just signed up to be camp Councillors at a foreign country. They expect the camp to be the place for a memorable summer. Instead, something strange is going on and some of the campers begin to act strange. Things go terribly wrong real fast as a terrible game of tag has the campers running for their lives or going after the campers.', 'A group of people have just signed up to be camp Councillors at a foreign country. They expect the camp to be the place for a memorable summer. Instead, something strange is going on and some of the campers begin to act strange. Things go terribly wrong real fast as a terrible game of tag has the campers running for their lives or going after the campers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVwZaHB1IHpjst5EGaW0Ck3gVsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306966'),
  ('955390943805711976', 'Summer Camp', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Castille Landon, Karsten ''Crash'' Gopinath', 'Castille Landon', 'Diane Keaton, Kathy Bates, Alfre Woodard, Eugene Levy, Dennis Haysbert, Beverly D''Angelo, Nicole Richie, Josh Peck', 'PG-13', 'Childhood best friends Nora, Ginny and Mary used to spend every summer at sleepaway camp together, and now, fifty years later, seize the opportunity to get back together for a reunion at the camp — full of food fights, river rafting and emotional revelations.', 'Childhood best friends Nora, Ginny and Mary used to spend every summer at sleepaway camp together, and now, fifty years later, seize the opportunity to get back together for a reunion at the camp — full of food fights, river rafting and emotional revelations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RrcqS0kT5weSqS853WGWFDEATZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094009'),
  ('217351417214920528', 'Summer Camp Nightmare', 1987, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Bert L. Dragin, Don Burgess', 'Penelope Spheeris, Bert L. Dragin', 'Chuck Connors, Charlie Stratton, Adam Carl, Tom Fridley, Melissa Reeves, Stuart Rogers, Harold Pruett, Shawn McLemore', 'PG-13', 'A group of campers revolt against their strict camp director and take over the camp for themselves.', 'A group of campers revolt against their strict camp director and take over the camp for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5kzTvCy8MpBFKV2lQS3RnekcrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27836'),
  ('591944101014228719', 'Summer Catch', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Tollin, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Kevin Falls, John Gatins', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Jessica Biel, Fred Ward, Matthew Lillard, Brian Dennehy, Jason Gedrick, Brittany Murphy, Bruce Davison', 'PG-13', 'Local boy Ryan Dunne, now a pitcher for Boston College, meets Tenley Parrish, the daughter of a wealthy couple who summer on the Cape. Ryan and Tenley fall in love, much to the chagrin of their families, while Ryan clings to one last hope of being discovered and signed to a pro baseball contract.', 'Local boy Ryan Dunne, now a pitcher for Boston College, meets Tenley Parrish, the daughter of a wealthy couple who summer on the Cape. Ryan and Tenley fall in love, much to the chagrin of their families, while Ryan clings to one last hope of being discovered and signed to a pro baseball contract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMp5Iev56BUu3xJGpAeCCPC1ZwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26602'),
  ('240412637014429956', 'Summer Clouds', 1958, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Eizō Sugawa, Masao Tamai', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Chikage Awashima, Yōko Tsukasa, Isao Kimura, Keiju Kobayashi, Kumi Mizuno, Haruko Sugimura, Chōko Iida, Hiroshi Tachikawa', null, 'A war widow with a young boy manages a farm with her bossy mother-in-law. When a reporter comes to interview her, the two begin an affair. He turns out to be married and won''t leave his wife. Her older brother tries to marry off his children and hang on to/ extend his farm through an advantageous marriage in the face of threatened land confiscation and the desire of his children to get comfortable urban jobs instead of the backbreaking work in the paddy fields under parental control.', 'A war widow with a young boy manages a farm with her bossy mother-in-law. When a reporter comes to interview her, the two begin an affair. He turns out to be married and won''t leave his wife. Her older brother tries to marry off his children and hang on to/ extend his farm through an advantageous marriage in the face of threatened land confiscation and the desire of his children to get comfortable urban jobs instead of the backbreaking work in the paddy fields under parental control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4oaryTdOqE4yrpTomivR9B8kY1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119779'),
  ('527324585508945203', 'Summer Clouds', 2004, 'Drama', 'Felipe Vega, Alfonso Parra', null, 'Roberto Enríquez, Natalia Millán, David Selvas, Irene Montalà, Roger Casamajor, Kevin Almodóvar, Kai Puig, Xabier Ruano', null, 'Daniel, Ana, and their little boy, Manuel travel from Madrid to a resort on the Costa Brava for the summer. Ana runs into Marta, a local shopgirl whom she''s met on previous visits. Marta introduces Ana to her cousin, Robert, who runs an antique shop. Robert is immediately attracted to Ana. Marta tells him that Ana is happily married, and confesses that she has a crush on Ana''s husband, Daniel. Robert, intrigued, makes a pact with Marta. Robert will help Marta seduce Daniel if she will help Robert seduce Ana. One night, the cousins cunningly arrange to separate the couple, and some serious flirtation ensues. While Marta, casually dates a local surfer, Tomás, begins to have second thoughts, Robert grows more obsessed with the couple. He befriends Daniel and peppers him with questions about the strength of his nine-year marriage.', 'Daniel, Ana, and their little boy, Manuel travel from Madrid to a resort on the Costa Brava for the summer. Ana runs into Marta, a local shopgirl whom she''s met on previous visits. Marta introduces Ana to her cousin, Robert, who runs an antique shop. Robert is immediately attracted to Ana. Marta tells him that Ana is happily married, and confesses that she has a crush on Ana''s husband, Daniel. Robert, intrigued, makes a pact with Marta. Robert will help Marta seduce Daniel if she will help Robert seduce Ana. One night, the cousins cunningly arrange to separate the couple, and some serious flirtation ensues. While Marta, casually dates a local surfer, Tomás, begins to have second thoughts, Robert grows more obsessed with the couple. He befriends Daniel and peppers him with questions about the strength of his nine-year marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGipY2xtJA7YOltkqmwJj8MVSY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147512'),
  ('143360556530201435', 'Summer Crisis', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Alain Chartrand', 'Mario Bolduc, Jacques Bérubé, Alain Chartrand', 'Mikhaïl Ahooja, Vincent-Guillaume Otis, Benoît Langlais, Charles-Alexandre Dubé, Geneviève Boivin-Roussy, Kevin Parent, Raymond Bouchard, Luc Picard', null, 'In the summer of 1969, Bernard, a Gaspesian fisherman''s son, arrive in Perce to fin work. He meets Paul, Jacques and Francis, Quebec Independence activists who have come to open the ''Fisherman''s House''. They aim to organize public conferences and offer lodgings to young travelers. A motley crowd of Quebecers from all over the province soon flocks to Perce: artists, hippies, rockers, hitchhikers and the like shake local authorities. Bernard is won over by the trio''s ideas and gets increasingly involved in their project. The following year, the will join the Front de liberation du Quebec (FLQ) and play a pivotal role in the Summer Crisis 1969.', 'In the summer of 1969, Bernard, a Gaspesian fisherman''s son, arrive in Perce to fin work. He meets Paul, Jacques and Francis, Quebec Independence activists who have come to open the ''Fisherman''s House''. They aim to organize public conferences and offer lodgings to young travelers. A motley crowd of Quebecers from all over the province soon flocks to Perce: artists, hippies, rockers, hitchhikers and the like shake local authorities. Bernard is won over by the trio''s ideas and gets increasingly involved in their project. The following year, the will join the Front de liberation du Quebec (FLQ) and play a pivotal role in the Summer Crisis 1969.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4A3zyiYjg4gr6DzAZc3BiLu3KMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216040'),
  ('840903539565440079', 'Summer Days with Coo', 2007, 'Animation, Fantasy, Comedy, Romance, Drama, Family', 'Keiichi Hara', 'Keiichi Hara', 'Kazato Tomizawa, Takahiro Yokokawa, Naoki Tanaka, Tamaki Matsumoto, Ken''ichi Nagira, Nanako Hirata, Kyousuke Ikeda, Kazuki Matsuoka', 'G', 'A small, lone Kappa miraculously survives over 200 years into modern day Japan, when he is found by young Koichi. Coo, who is secretly adopted by Koichi''s family, searches with his new human friend for unpopulated places in hopes of finding any remaining of his kind.', 'A small, lone Kappa miraculously survives over 200 years into modern day Japan, when he is found by young Koichi. Coo, who is secretly adopted by Koichi''s family, searches with his new human friend for unpopulated places in hopes of finding any remaining of his kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Hk82Tw50Qevknz3qb8N7Nd5Ti3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17234'),
  ('464512082793494506', 'Summer Detective', 2019, 'Drama', 'Lei Xu', 'Lei Xu', 'Xu Chaoying, Zhang Zhanyi, Su Shuhe', null, 'Chaoying, a retired rancher, decides to renovate his house after selling off his cattle. Shuhe, a villager helping with the renovation, is found badly injured after a hit-and-run. Chaoying and his friend Shuangzi vow to bring the culprit to justice.', 'Chaoying, a retired rancher, decides to renovate his house after selling off his cattle. Shuhe, a villager helping with the renovation, is found badly injured after a hit-and-run. Chaoying and his friend Shuangzi vow to bring the culprit to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iD8G2hEZV6Dm1PD674QPJzTxnER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617571'),
  ('383199438399367220', 'Summer Dream', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Family', 'Paulo Sérgio de Almeida, Jane Guerra Peixe, Edgar Moura', 'Yoya Wursch', 'Sérgio Mallandro, Andréa Veiga, Fafy Siqueira, Paulão, Angel Mattos, Zé Henrique, Mariana Richard, Roberta Richard', null, 'Grieved over the loss of their daughter, an elderly couple has decided do spend their vacation travelling around Europe. The cab driver who takes them to the airport, Leo, overhears their conversation and decides to profit from their situation: Leo convinces the couple''s staff he''s their nephew, and invites his friends and girlfriend over for a special summer. Things go awry when his friend Marcelo arrives with a bus full of teenagers, who believe the mansion is actually a summer camp.', 'Grieved over the loss of their daughter, an elderly couple has decided do spend their vacation travelling around Europe. The cab driver who takes them to the airport, Leo, overhears their conversation and decides to profit from their situation: Leo convinces the couple''s staff he''s their nephew, and invites his friends and girlfriend over for a special summer. Things go awry when his friend Marcelo arrives with a bus full of teenagers, who believe the mansion is actually a summer camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LTF4rCZJn450ne3mecLHtBaDgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71724'),
  ('688448736542643417', 'Summer Frost', 2023, 'Drama', 'Emmanuelle Prévost, Christophe Jeauffroy, Emmanuelle Collinot', 'Laetitia Masson', 'Benjamin Biolay, Élodie Bouchez, Judith Chemla, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Hélène Fillières, Cédric Kahn, Laurent Stocker, Clémence Poésy', null, 'It’s summer and France is hit by a polar cold. Ten lone and lost souls find each other, a profound meeting as a last chance to hope and fear, to love and dream. Ten tales as tribute to Monet’s Water Lilies, ten tales portraying an impressionist painting of today’s France.', 'It’s summer and France is hit by a polar cold. Ten lone and lost souls find each other, a profound meeting as a last chance to hope and fear, to love and dream. Ten tales as tribute to Monet’s Water Lilies, ten tales portraying an impressionist painting of today’s France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VohvTAHsPJ5zKgnvW7K4sQXMMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927946'),
  ('512158119506999827', 'Summer Games', 1995, 'Drama', 'Gilles Marchand, Rafaele Ravinet-Virbel, Laurent Cantet', 'Laurent Cantet', 'Jean Lespert, Jalil Lespert, Julia Minguet, Mario Bels, Marianne Dupont, Adoum Gombo, Arnaud Massard, Jeff Michelas', null, '18 year old Éric, on vacation in the South with his parents, decides to escape the stifling situation especially with his 50 year old father, and join a group of fellow youth.', '18 year old Éric, on vacation in the South with his parents, decides to escape the stifling situation especially with his 50 year old father, and join a group of fellow youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7fEqM3895JIKf3ZlJd4FoEQV8P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753598'),
  ('606025704034598902', 'Summer Games', 2011, 'Drama', 'Rolando Colla', 'Pilar Anguita-MacKay, Olivier Lorelle, Rolando Colla', 'Alessia Barela, Armando Condolucci, Fiorella Campanella, Antonio Merone, Roberta Fossile, Marco D''Orazi, Aaron Hitz', null, 'The story of an adult and a teenage couple during a brief summer holiday by the sea. While Nic''s parents remain trapped in a precarious mutual dependency despite repeated attempts at reconciliation, their 12-year-old son tries to come to terms with his father''s traumatizing violent outbursts in games with other children. He tries to teach Marie, who is of his age and suffers from her own relationship with her father, to feel nothing. In fact, both of them are transformed by their experience of the joys and pains of first love.', 'The story of an adult and a teenage couple during a brief summer holiday by the sea. While Nic''s parents remain trapped in a precarious mutual dependency despite repeated attempts at reconciliation, their 12-year-old son tries to come to terms with his father''s traumatizing violent outbursts in games with other children. He tries to teach Marie, who is of his age and suffers from her own relationship with her father, to feel nothing. In fact, both of them are transformed by their experience of the joys and pains of first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmAOvzQsaTKQQKlmsC1oZvNfJrA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102871'),
  ('445764828337281358', 'Summer Ghost', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Yuusei Koumoto, Eri Irei, Tomotaka Wakumoto', 'Otsuichi', 'Chiaki Kobayashi, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Rina Kawaei, Nobunaga Shimazaki', null, 'An urban legend says that lighting fireworks at an abandoned airfield will beckon the "summer ghost," a spirit that can answer any question. Three teenagers, Tomoya, Aoi, and Ryo, each have their own reason to show up one day. When a ghost named Ayane appears, she reveals she is only visible to those "who are about to touch their death." Compelled by the ghost and her message, Tomoya begins regularly visiting the airfield to uncover the true purpose of her visits.', 'An urban legend says that lighting fireworks at an abandoned airfield will beckon the "summer ghost," a spirit that can answer any question. Three teenagers, Tomoya, Aoi, and Ryo, each have their own reason to show up one day. When a ghost named Ayane appears, she reveals she is only visible to those "who are about to touch their death." Compelled by the ghost and her message, Tomoya begins regularly visiting the airfield to uncover the true purpose of her visits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMXaAvvSw24hYNchhCtCM5z6fhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798544'),
  ('276877641930309518', 'Summer Heat', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michie Gleason, Larry Litton, Elliot Lewis Rosenblatt', 'Michie Gleason', 'Lori Singer, Anthony Edwards, Bruce Abbott, Kathy Bates, Clu Gulager, Jessie Kent, Noble Willingham, Nesbitt Blaisdell', null, 'The young wife of a tobacco farmer falls in love with their handsome hired hand.', 'The young wife of a tobacco farmer falls in love with their handsome hired hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mZ9F3bFaUi10IIsWSekbPfub6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88669'),
  ('1123161856172677849', 'Summer Holiday', 1963, 'Music, Romance', 'Peter Yates, John Wilcox', 'Ronald Cass, Peter Myers', 'Cliff Richard, Lauri Peters, Melvyn Hayes, Una Stubbs, Teddy Green, Pamela Hart, Jeremy Bulloch, Jacqueline Daryl', null, '1960s musical showcasing Cliff Richard. Four bus mechanics working for London Transport strike up a deal with the company: they do up a one of the company''s legendary red double decker buses and take it to southern Europe as a mobile hotel. If it succeeds, they will be put in charge of a whole fleet. While on the road in France they pick up three young British ladies whose car breaks down and offer to take them to their next singing job in Athens. They also pick up a stowaway, who hides the fact that she''s a famous American pop star on the run, chased by the media and her parents.', '1960s musical showcasing Cliff Richard. Four bus mechanics working for London Transport strike up a deal with the company: they do up a one of the company''s legendary red double decker buses and take it to southern Europe as a mobile hotel. If it succeeds, they will be put in charge of a whole fleet. While on the road in France they pick up three young British ladies whose car breaks down and offer to take them to their next singing job in Athens. They also pick up a stowaway, who hides the fact that she''s a famous American pop star on the run, chased by the media and her parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4UwmZrb1ReyTXoAFRXhdgv05Hd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43532'),
  ('749169181260103512', 'Summer Holiday', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Jingle Ma Choh-Sing, Chan Kwok-Hung, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Susan Chan Suk-Yin', 'Sammi Cheng Sau-Man, Richie Jen, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Shen Aojun, Ah Niu, Michael Wong Kong-Leong, Tay Ping-Hui, Katherine Wang', null, 'Summer Holiday is about a Hong Kong (Sammi Cheng) girl who loses her office job and finds that her boyfriend has been cheating on her, and travels to an island in Malaysia to sell her half of a beach that her cousin gave her. Only then does she know that her cousin sold the other half to his best friend (Richie Ren) to pay off debts. In her quest to convince him to sell, they begin to fall in love', 'Summer Holiday is about a Hong Kong (Sammi Cheng) girl who loses her office job and finds that her boyfriend has been cheating on her, and travels to an island in Malaysia to sell her half of a beach that her cousin gave her. Only then does she know that her cousin sold the other half to his best friend (Richie Ren) to pay off debts. In her quest to convince him to sell, they begin to fall in love', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bM162OJbE7EnEY0bf9g595WiBpC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20585'),
  ('777423754860811285', 'Summer Holiday', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Radu Muntean', 'Alexandru Baciu, Radu Muntean, Răzvan Rădulescu', 'Dragoș Bucur, Anamaria Marinca, Mimi Brănescu, Adrian Văncică, Vlad Muntean, Geanina Varga, Roxana Iancu, Maria Alexandru Birleanu', 'NR', 'On his spring break at the seaside, with his wife and his four year old son, Bogdan Ciocazanu runs into his best friends from high-school at the precise date and time that reminds all of them of their most glorious drinking trips and sexual escapades of their younger days. Frustrated that, between his job and his family, time is no longer his to manage and play with, Boogie now takes his shock dosage of freedom and spends a night to tick off all the items on the map of his youth (drinking, games, flirting, prostitutes). In the morning, after the disillusionment of the remake he experiences with his former friends, he returns to his wife.', 'On his spring break at the seaside, with his wife and his four year old son, Bogdan Ciocazanu runs into his best friends from high-school at the precise date and time that reminds all of them of their most glorious drinking trips and sexual escapades of their younger days. Frustrated that, between his job and his family, time is no longer his to manage and play with, Boogie now takes his shock dosage of freedom and spends a night to tick off all the items on the map of his youth (drinking, games, flirting, prostitutes). In the morning, after the disillusionment of the remake he experiences with his former friends, he returns to his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3zU3mtfoZbUx9i0I6ZpxLVpTt6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39395'),
  ('492633847175068663', 'Summer Hours', 2008, 'Drama', 'Olivier Assayas, Éric Gautier, Matthew Gledhill', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Juliette Binoche, Charles Berling, Jérémie Renier, Édith Scob, Dominique Reymond, Valérie Bonneton, Isabelle Sadoyan, Kyle Eastwood', 'NR', 'After the death of a septuagenarian woman, her three children deliberate over what to do with her estate.', 'After the death of a septuagenarian woman, her three children deliberate over what to do with her estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUBEHjL1qa5y0uKQauwPdWoMVUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8282'),
  ('45448291826066174', 'Summer in Berlin', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andreas Dresen, Andreas Höfer', 'Wolfgang Kohlhaase', 'Inka Friedrich, Nadja Uhl, Andreas Schmidt, Vincent Redetzki, Stephanie Schönfeld, Christel Peters, Kurt Radeke, Hannes Stelzer', null, 'An intimate study of two women friends who come to each other because of troubles with everyday life and with men and thus try to enjoy a life based on their ideas.', 'An intimate study of two women friends who come to each other because of troubles with everyday life and with men and thus try to enjoy a life based on their ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zu21w5SwWDSHZI7P5fv8wJqUz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410'),
  ('1134808792246393601', 'Summer in Bethlehem', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sibi Malayil, Sanjeev Shankar', 'Ranjith', 'Suresh Gopi, Jayaram, Manju Warrier, Janardhanan, Kalabhavan Mani, Sukumari, Sangeetha Krish, Sreejaya Nair', null, 'Ravishankar and Dennis live on Dennis’s estate in the hills. When Colonel Menon arrives with his daughters, Ravishankar wonders which one of them has been sending him amorous letters. Meanwhile, Dennis is attracted to the enigmatic Abhirami, but what does Abhirami want?', 'Ravishankar and Dennis live on Dennis’s estate in the hills. When Colonel Menon arrives with his daughters, Ravishankar wonders which one of them has been sending him amorous letters. Meanwhile, Dennis is attracted to the enigmatic Abhirami, but what does Abhirami want?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjT6aJgAjqsMe5fe1x4t19XnWsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280212'),
  ('669147760219660271', 'Summer in February', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christopher Menaul, Andrew Dunn, Daniel Taylor', 'Jonathan Smith', 'Dominic Cooper, Emily Browning, Dan Stevens, Hattie Morahan, Mia Austen, Shaun Dingwall, Max Deacon, Michael Maloney', null, 'The Newlyn School of artists flourished at the beginning of the 20th Century and the film focuses on the wild and bohemian Lamorna Group, which included Alfred Munnings and Laura and Harold Knight. The incendiary anti-Modernist Munnings, now regarded as one of Britain''s most sought-after artists, is at the centre of the complex love triangle, involving aspiring artist Florence Carter-Wood and Gilbert Evans, the land agent in charge of the Lamorna Valley estate. True - and deeply moving - the story is played out against the timeless beauty of the Cornish coast, in the approaching shadow of The Great War.', 'The Newlyn School of artists flourished at the beginning of the 20th Century and the film focuses on the wild and bohemian Lamorna Group, which included Alfred Munnings and Laura and Harold Knight. The incendiary anti-Modernist Munnings, now regarded as one of Britain''s most sought-after artists, is at the centre of the complex love triangle, involving aspiring artist Florence Carter-Wood and Gilbert Evans, the land agent in charge of the Lamorna Valley estate. True - and deeply moving - the story is played out against the timeless beauty of the Cornish coast, in the approaching shadow of The Great War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78p1N5yne7VpEq7s7saaim1fuHB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180951'),
  ('943244895798751128', 'Summer in Red', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Belén Macías', 'Belén Macías, Helio Mira', 'Marta Nieto, Jose Coronado, Luis Callejo, Francesco Carril, Tomás del Estal, Zoé Arnao, Richard Sahagún, Heren de Lucas', null, 'Madrid, summer of 2010. Commissioner María Ruiz investigates the sinister crime of a young man. With no visible identity and no clues or apparent motive, María will begin an investigation that will become more and more complicated.', 'Madrid, summer of 2010. Commissioner María Ruiz investigates the sinister crime of a young man. With no visible identity and no clues or apparent motive, María will begin an investigation that will become more and more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuOJvP8YxynEKn5SMKoEc1CEMXP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1143291'),
  ('191162720169060629', 'Summer in the City', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Vic Sarin, Vic Sarin', 'Gary Goldstein', 'Julianna Guill, Marc Bendavid, Vivica A. Fox, Marla Sokoloff, Natasha Henstridge, Christie Burke, Andrea Brooks, Jasmine Sky Sarin', null, 'When a small town woman with southern charm is given a big promotion managing a store in the Big Apple, she tries to adopt a big city personality and it leads to disastrous results.', 'When a small town woman with southern charm is given a big promotion managing a store in the Big Apple, she tries to adopt a big city personality and it leads to disastrous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srAEQJakSy3o5NmB52lO6WFDBJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407335'),
  ('49753187222434349', 'Summer Interlude', 1951, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ingmar Bergman, Gunnar Fischer', 'Ingmar Bergman, Herbert Grevenius', 'Maj-Britt Nilsson, Birger Malmsten, Alf Kjellin, Annalisa Ericson, Georg Funkquist, Stig Olin, Mimi Pollak, Renée Björling', null, 'During a brief summer vacation, a lonely woman recalls her first love thirteen years earlier.', 'During a brief summer vacation, a lonely woman recalls her first love thirteen years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Yl2nPAzBcygds63L6yf4g7I2k8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47473'),
  ('530190992549812329', 'Summer Job', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Paul Madden', 'Ralph Gaby Wilson', 'Amy Lynn Baxter, Sherrie Rose, James Summer, Cari Mayor, Renee Shugart, George Ortuzar, Chona Jason, Fred Bourdin', 'R', 'In this adolescent comedy a group of college girls get summer jobs at a posh Florida resort and have assorted adventures when they begin competing for the best jobs and for the affections of a hunky male staff member.', 'In this adolescent comedy a group of college girls get summer jobs at a posh Florida resort and have assorted adventures when they begin competing for the best jobs and for the affections of a hunky male staff member.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Nd8NZUxktrcasOXP4MS3BalOTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98103'),
  ('363892104657657454', 'Summer Light', 1943, 'Drama', 'Jean Grémillon, Louis Page', 'Pierre Laroche, Jacques Prévert', 'Madeleine Renaud, Pierre Brasseur, Madeleine Robinson, Paul Bernard, Georges Marchal, Jane Marken, Charles Blavette, Léonce Corne', null, 'A shimmering glass hotel at the top of a remote Provençal mountain provides the setting for a tragicomic tapestry about an obsessive love pentangle, whose principals range from an artist to a hotel manager to a dam worker.', 'A shimmering glass hotel at the top of a remote Provençal mountain provides the setting for a tragicomic tapestry about an obsessive love pentangle, whose principals range from an artist to a hotel manager to a dam worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpE12mduggASPTxdxxCEkR6BVzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63981'),
  ('214728510417218559', 'Summer Love', 2016, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Lynne Stopkewich, Adam Sliwinski', 'Judith Berg, Sandra Berg, Dawn DeKeyser', 'Rachael Leigh Cook, Lucas Bryant, Travis Milne, Aidan Kahn, Crystal Balint, Matt Visser, Madison Desjarlais, Christine Willes', 'G', 'Maya Sulliway is a struggling single mom who''s studying to become an accountant. When her young daughter goes off to sleepaway camp, Maya accepts a summer internship at Kizzmit, a tech company known for developing a popular social app, in order to receive college credit.', 'Maya Sulliway is a struggling single mom who''s studying to become an accountant. When her young daughter goes off to sleepaway camp, Maya accepts a summer internship at Kizzmit, a tech company known for developing a popular social app, in order to receive college credit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dATs3E9PpdAYSIFYBbdsfWjLUEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411081'),
  ('473932390443134141', 'Summer Lovers', 1982, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Randal Kleiser, Stavros Kaplanidis, Mike Moder', 'Randal Kleiser', 'Peter Gallagher, Daryl Hannah, Valérie Quennessen, Barbara Rush, Carole Cook, Hans van Tongeren, Lydia Lenossi, Vladimiros Kiriakidis', 'R', 'Michael Pappas and his girlfriend, Cathy, are enjoying the white sand beaches of a Greek island as well as the freewheeling nature of the locals. When Michael meets Lina, who is in Greece from Paris doing archaeological work, he is enamored with the beautiful foreigner. Cathy, unhappy about Lina getting close to Michael, confronts the woman -- only to be unexpectedly wooed by her charms as well.', 'Michael Pappas and his girlfriend, Cathy, are enjoying the white sand beaches of a Greek island as well as the freewheeling nature of the locals. When Michael meets Lina, who is in Greece from Paris doing archaeological work, he is enamored with the beautiful foreigner. Cathy, unhappy about Lina getting close to Michael, confronts the woman -- only to be unexpectedly wooed by her charms as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94Q5xC4MrSzpyO9x4kYG8yR4DnF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19415'),
  ('854028270326151824', 'Summer Magic', 1963, 'Music, Comedy, Family', 'James Neilson, William E. Snyder', 'Sally Benson', 'Hayley Mills, Burl Ives, Dorothy McGuire, Deborah Walley, Una Merkel, Eddie Hodges, Michael J. Pollard, Peter Brown', 'G', 'Mother Carey, a Bostonian widow, and her three children move to Maine. Postmaster Osh Popham helps them move into a run-down old house and fixes it up for them. It''s not entirely uninhabited, though; the owner, Mr. Hamilton, is a mysterious character away in Europe, but Osh assures them he won''t mind their living there, since he won''t be coming home for a long time yet. The children and a cousin who comes to live with them have various adventures before an unexpected visitor shows up', 'Mother Carey, a Bostonian widow, and her three children move to Maine. Postmaster Osh Popham helps them move into a run-down old house and fixes it up for them. It''s not entirely uninhabited, though; the owner, Mr. Hamilton, is a mysterious character away in Europe, but Osh assures them he won''t mind their living there, since he won''t be coming home for a long time yet. The children and a cousin who comes to live with them have various adventures before an unexpected visitor shows up', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12GBF0hH9DWSaTBPZpCCKq4DiA6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37204'),
  ('470705863901168498', 'Summer Night Fever', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Sigi Rothemund, Heinz Hölscher', 'Sigi Rothemund', 'Stéphane Hillel, Claus Obalski, Olivia Pascal, Betty Vergès, Edwige Pierre, Bea Fiedler, Claudine Bird, Del Negro', null, 'Two buddies head off for a summer holiday, but one of them has to take his sister along. She cramps their style when it comes to picking up chicks. However, they manage to have some fun.', 'Two buddies head off for a summer holiday, but one of them has to take his sister along. She cramps their style when it comes to picking up chicks. However, they manage to have some fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykC0gfevhVJhCLPzBmgRQic2ziV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265011'),
  ('969919659977372688', 'Summer Night in Town', 1990, 'Romance, Drama', 'Michel Deville, Bernard Lutic', 'Rosalinde Deville', 'Marie Trintignant, Jean-Hugues Anglade', null, 'Unable to sleep in the sweltering heat, a young couple bares their bodies --- and their souls --- to each other over one life-changing night. They didn''t know each other when the night began. It got hot, they stayed in. Now they know each other better than most.', 'Unable to sleep in the sweltering heat, a young couple bares their bodies --- and their souls --- to each other over one life-changing night. They didn''t know each other when the night began. It got hot, they stayed in. Now they know each other better than most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnRpquIVbQhZJYHBUMj9cC8QKOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101886'),
  ('802517886414106118', 'Summer Night with Greek Profile, Almond Eyes and Scent of Basil', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Lina Wertmüller, Camillo Bazzoni', 'Lina Wertmüller', 'Mariangela Melato, Michele Placido, Roberto Herlitzka, John Steiner, Arnaldo Ninchi, Massimo Wertmüller, Marta Marzotto, Alessandro Bertoletti', null, 'A charming billionaire manager kidnaps a criminal and locks him up in her private villa in Sardinia.', 'A charming billionaire manager kidnaps a criminal and locks him up in her private villa in Sardinia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsy82Iks0dgBr9s0NPTrVghlXEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56134'),
  ('953722914241852378', 'Summer of ''42', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Mulligan, Robert Surtees, Don Kranze', 'Herman Raucher', 'Jennifer O''Neill, Gary Grimes, Jerry Houser, Oliver Conant, Katherine Allentuck, Christopher Norris, Lou Frizzell, Walter Scott', 'PG', 'Over the summer of 1942 on Nantucket Island, three friends -- Hermie, Oscy and Benjie -- are more concerned with getting laid than anything else. Hermie falls in love with the married Dorothy, whose husband is an army pilot recently sent to the battlefront of World War II.', 'Over the summer of 1942 on Nantucket Island, three friends -- Hermie, Oscy and Benjie -- are more concerned with getting laid than anything else. Hermie falls in love with the married Dorothy, whose husband is an army pilot recently sent to the battlefront of World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4n7m05C2ee3UM5Co2k2BOWqH5o2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41357'),
  ('979571117988401974', 'Summer of ''44 - The Lost Generation', 2017, 'Drama', 'Anton Klima, Valerie Adamer, Katrin Sohler', 'Friedemann Fromm', 'Jonathan Berlin, Theo Trebs, Andreas Warmbrunn, Laurenz Lerch, Joscha Eißen, Johannes Geller, Vica Kerekes, Lili Epply', null, 'Summer 1944, Schwäbisch Hall. Contrary to the war propaganda and the decreed heroism, the 16-year-old boys dream of Swing music, sex and freedom - and of Lore, the air force helper from the air base, who attracts all eyes in her red swimsuit. At the same time, uncle, Knuffke, Bubu, tongue kiss and Hosenmacher suspect that they will not escape the horror of the front. "Stay tuned," Lore calls after them. But tongue kiss gets it first and also pants maker will not survive the war.', 'Summer 1944, Schwäbisch Hall. Contrary to the war propaganda and the decreed heroism, the 16-year-old boys dream of Swing music, sex and freedom - and of Lore, the air force helper from the air base, who attracts all eyes in her red swimsuit. At the same time, uncle, Knuffke, Bubu, tongue kiss and Hosenmacher suspect that they will not escape the horror of the front. "Stay tuned," Lore calls after them. But tongue kiss gets it first and also pants maker will not survive the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jf3Oye5QTYE4gWSqKfh839o2jp0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514780'),
