  ('826611307414543408', 'Summer Things', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michel Blanc, Sean Bobbitt', 'Michel Blanc', 'Charlotte Rampling, Jacques Dutronc, Michel Blanc, Carole Bouquet, Denis Podalydès, Karin Viard, Clotilde Courau, Vincent Elbaz', null, 'Two couple of friends, one very rich, the other almost homeless, decide to go on Holiday. Julie, a single mother, joins them too. Once at seaside, it starts a complicate love cross among them that will involve also a transsexual, a jealous brother, a Latin Lover and another nervous stressed couple. Not to mention about the daughter of one of them that is secretly in Chicago with one of her father''s employees... At the end of the summer, all of them will join the same party...', 'Two couple of friends, one very rich, the other almost homeless, decide to go on Holiday. Julie, a single mother, joins them too. Once at seaside, it starts a complicate love cross among them that will involve also a transsexual, a jealous brother, a Latin Lover and another nervous stressed couple. Not to mention about the daughter of one of them that is secretly in Chicago with one of her father''s employees... At the end of the summer, all of them will join the same party...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laV4Xo5O1COZefAFPJLFZ28pkYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8434'),
  ('752851915941153932', 'Summer Time', 2001, 'Drama', 'Park Jae-ho, Kang Kwang-won', 'Yoo Gap-yeol, Lee Jeong-hak', 'Kim Ji-Hyeon, Ryu Soo-young, Choi Cheol-ho, Jang Seong-won, Song Ok-suk, Yun Yeong-keol', null, 'In the gloomy 80s, Sang-ho is wanted by the authorities for his participation in the student movement. Parting with his colleagues, Sang-ho happens to end up in a town on the outskirts, a town he has no connection to. The place where he is in hiding is the second floor of a worn down wooden house. Spending his time idly in the room, one day, Sang-ho discovers a hole looking into the room downstairs by chance. Casually looking through the hole, Sang-ho exhales. At first, Sang-ho tries to avoid looking, out of guilt. However, before he knows it, he is drawn to the hole. Every gesture she makes is very captivating and seductive. He watches her body, feels her, and takes her into his heart.', 'In the gloomy 80s, Sang-ho is wanted by the authorities for his participation in the student movement. Parting with his colleagues, Sang-ho happens to end up in a town on the outskirts, a town he has no connection to. The place where he is in hiding is the second floor of a worn down wooden house. Spending his time idly in the room, one day, Sang-ho discovers a hole looking into the room downstairs by chance. Casually looking through the hole, Sang-ho exhales. At first, Sang-ho tries to avoid looking, out of guilt. However, before he knows it, he is drawn to the hole. Every gesture she makes is very captivating and seductive. He watches her body, feels her, and takes her into his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njWr4h7koI7LRGtggWxCSJf3S49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137798'),
  ('131097342120255798', 'Summer Time Machine Blues', 2005, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Katsuyuki Motohiro, Kazunari Kawagoe, Takafumi Hatano', 'Makoto Ueda', 'Eita Nagayama, Juri Ueno, Yoshiaki Yoza, Daijiro Kawaoka, Munenori Nagano, Tsuyoshi Muro, Chikara Honda, Yoko Maki', null, 'The members of a sci-fi club accidentally spill Coke on the remote controller of an air-conditioner during summer and suddenly a time machine appears in their sweating bath-like clubroom.', 'The members of a sci-fi club accidentally spill Coke on the remote controller of an air-conditioner during summer and suddenly a time machine appears in their sweating bath-like clubroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RIMLwD9myn20D9Z53Gu5pKr8bG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26130'),
  ('886311942471341628', 'Summer Vacation', 2023, 'Comedy, Family', 'Santiago Segura', 'Marta González de Vega, Santiago Segura', 'Santiago Segura, Leo Harlem, Marta González de Vega, Sirena Segura, Javier García, Cristina Gallego, Patricia Conde, Daniela Pintado', 'PG', 'When two friends lose their jobs and find gigs as children''s entertainers at a luxury hotel, they sneak in their kids to give them a summer vacation.', 'When two friends lose their jobs and find gigs as children''s entertainers at a luxury hotel, they sneak in their kids to give them a summer vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14SsotUuzTYKmPRxvIoFgHzwegf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061634'),
  ('1105945722151314920', 'Summer Vacation 1999', 1988, 'Drama, Romance, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Shusuke Kaneko, Kenji Takama, Hiroyuki Yasukouchi', 'Rio Kishida', 'Eri Miyajima, Tomoko Otakara, Miyuki Nakano, Eri Fukatsu, Masaaki Maeda, Hiromi Murata, Nozomu Sasaki, Minami Takayama', null, 'With no families to return to for summer vacation, three teenage boys spend their summer at their boarding school, alone and unsupervised. Darkness hangs over them after another boy shows up, who looks exactly like one of their classmates who had committed suicide months earlier. His arrival exposes the romances, jealousies, and tensions of growing up.', 'With no families to return to for summer vacation, three teenage boys spend their summer at their boarding school, alone and unsupervised. Darkness hangs over them after another boy shows up, who looks exactly like one of their classmates who had committed suicide months earlier. His arrival exposes the romances, jealousies, and tensions of growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meIvlDbDYRxL9dYIv0T9LNH7Umr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124766'),
  ('776369864996162981', 'Summer Villa', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Pat Kiely, Bruce Chun, Benoît Hamel', 'Carrie L. Evans, Emi Mochizuki', 'Hilarie Burton, Emorphia Margaritis, Victor Webster, Cristina Rosato, Brittany Drisdelle, Joseph Bellerose, Jocelin Haas, Tyrone Benskin', null, 'Although a successful romance novelist, Terry Russell hasn''t had luck in her own love life. After a disastrous first date with cocky, hot-shot New York chef Matthew Everston, she retreats to her friend''s French villa for the summer to finish her latest novel, with her reluctant teenage daughter in tow.', 'Although a successful romance novelist, Terry Russell hasn''t had luck in her own love life. After a disastrous first date with cocky, hot-shot New York chef Matthew Everston, she retreats to her friend''s French villa for the summer to finish her latest novel, with her reluctant teenage daughter in tow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npiWf0kTKOHyQoPnmL7HOfbNAhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407172'),
  ('1088041874471697184', 'Summer Wars', 2009, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Hosoda, Kazutaka Ozaki, Shigeru Fujita', 'Satoko Okudera', 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Hitomi Miyauchi, Mitsuki Tanimura, Sumiko Fuji, Ayumu Saito, Takahiro Yokokawa, Kiyomi Tanigawa, Mutsumi Sasaki', 'PG', 'Teenage math whiz Kenji Koiso agrees to take a summer job at the Nagano hometown of his crush, Natsuki. When he arrives, he finds that her family have reunited to celebrate the 90th birthday of their matriarch. His job: pretend to be Natsuki''s fiancé. Meanwhile, his attempt to solve a mathematical equation causes a parallel world''s collision with Earth.', 'Teenage math whiz Kenji Koiso agrees to take a summer job at the Nagano hometown of his crush, Natsuki. When he arrives, he finds that her family have reunited to celebrate the 90th birthday of their matriarch. His job: pretend to be Natsuki''s fiancé. Meanwhile, his attempt to solve a mathematical equation causes a parallel world''s collision with Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHy8TrRLnuBZ4t2C0l0pSpRXVHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28874'),
  ('374941588670737109', 'Summer White', 2020, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo Ruiz Patterson, María Sarasvati Herrera', 'Raúl Sebastián Quintanilla, Rodrigo Ruiz Patterson', 'Adrián Rossi, Sophie Alexander-Katz, Fabián Corres', null, 'Rodrigo is a solitary teenager, a king in the private world he shares with his mother. Things change when she takes her new boyfriend home to live. He must decide if he fights for his throne and crushes the happiness of the person he loves the most.', 'Rodrigo is a solitary teenager, a king in the private world he shares with his mother. Things change when she takes her new boyfriend home to live. He must decide if he fights for his throne and crushes the happiness of the person he loves the most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3svt3tmjhkpDpqezhcHr9EuMYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653583'),
  ('591691116386938658', 'Summer Window', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Przybylski, Hendrik Handloegten', 'Hendrik Handloegten', 'Nina Hoss, Mark Waschke, Fritzi Haberlandt, Lars Eidinger, Lasse Stadelmann, Susanne Wolff, Barbara Philipp, Ernst Stötzner', null, 'Juliane''s happiness seems perfect. She is head over heals in love and has just begun a new life with August. One morning, however, she wakes up to find that she has been unexplainable thrown back into her past - to the time before she met her new love. Is what seems at first glance a cruel setback in reality actually a second chance?', 'Juliane''s happiness seems perfect. She is head over heals in love and has just begun a new life with August. One morning, however, she wakes up to find that she has been unexplainable thrown back into her past - to the time before she met her new love. Is what seems at first glance a cruel setback in reality actually a second chance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oO4YMearHnM4bLyC17DdBbM27zm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106984'),
  ('38075500770206124', 'Summer Wishes, Winter Dreams', 1973, 'Drama', 'Gilbert Cates, Gerald Hirschfeld, Michael Hertzberg', 'Stewart Stern', 'Joanne Woodward, Martin Balsam, Sylvia Sidney, Tresa Hughes, Dori Brenner, Ron Richards, Win Forman, Nancy Andrews', 'PG', 'Rita, a middle aged New York City homemaker, finds herself in an emotional crisis which forces her to re-examine her life, as well as her relationships with her mother, her eye doctor husband, her alienated daughter and estranged son.', 'Rita, a middle aged New York City homemaker, finds herself in an emotional crisis which forces her to re-examine her life, as well as her relationships with her mother, her eye doctor husband, her alienated daughter and estranged son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iphqHtyVjeuuzYjRUM0DBezYPY1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92311'),
  ('462696494948288012', 'Summer with a Cowboy', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Ivo Novák, Rudolf Milič, Stanislav Veselka', 'Jaromíra Kolárová', 'Daniela Kolářová, Jaromír Hanzlík, Oldřich Vízner, Marie Rosůlková, Dana Medřická, Libuše Švormová, Bohuš Záhorský, Květa Fialová', null, 'The main characters are a young psychologist Doubravka and a village youth, Honza Macháček. He is a tractor driver who temporarily lost his driver''s license in a crazy bet, so he now herds a cooperative herd of cows, she is at the cottage with her boy Boba, who is not very successful in studying medicine and is currently preparing for his remedial exams. Honza''s immediacy, optimism and approach to life and work contrast sharply with the selfish, weak-willed and unbalanced Boba, and Doubravka increasingly realizes that her feelings for Boba have disappeared and that she actually loves Honza. The question is how her somewhat conservative family will view such a game.', 'The main characters are a young psychologist Doubravka and a village youth, Honza Macháček. He is a tractor driver who temporarily lost his driver''s license in a crazy bet, so he now herds a cooperative herd of cows, she is at the cottage with her boy Boba, who is not very successful in studying medicine and is currently preparing for his remedial exams. Honza''s immediacy, optimism and approach to life and work contrast sharply with the selfish, weak-willed and unbalanced Boba, and Doubravka increasingly realizes that her feelings for Boba have disappeared and that she actually loves Honza. The question is how her somewhat conservative family will view such a game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4qyVhrjvSTzSywqeMNqxkpAy5l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58621'),
  ('264501674663844248', 'Summer with Monika', 1953, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ingmar Bergman, Gunnar Fischer', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Harriet Andersson, Lars Ekborg, Dagmar Ebbesen, Åke Fridell, Naemi Briese, Åke Grönberg, Sigge Fürst, John Harryson', 'R', 'One summer day, two teens begin a reckless affair and abandon their families to be with one another.', 'One summer day, two teens begin a reckless affair and abandon their families to be with one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82hLsn67V9TjgrLOZCFL7247pJd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47735'),
