  ('105513497734797351', 'Summerfield', 1977, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ken Hannam, Mike Molloy', 'Clifford Green', 'Nick Tate, John Waters, Elizabeth Alexander, Charles Tingwell, Michelle Jarman, Max Cullen, Geraldine Turner, Barry Donnelly', null, 'When teacher Simon arrives in a small, secluded village to take over the local school, he is surprised to discover that his predecessor has disappeared without a trace - and that nobody seems too concerned about it. As Simon probes deeper into the disappearance, the inhabitants of a forbidding estate called "Summerfield" take on more and more significance.', 'When teacher Simon arrives in a small, secluded village to take over the local school, he is surprised to discover that his predecessor has disappeared without a trace - and that nobody seems too concerned about it. As Simon probes deeper into the disappearance, the inhabitants of a forbidding estate called "Summerfield" take on more and more significance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtgvJbBCh2EFutczEAWqU36uvno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40898'),
  ('752283781625719189', 'Summering', 2022, 'Drama', 'James Ponsoldt, Greta Zozula', 'James Ponsoldt, Benjamin Percy', 'Lia Barnett, Madalen Mills, Eden Grace Redfield, Sanai Victoria, Lake Bell, Sarah Cooper, Ashley Madekwe, Megan Mullally', 'PG-13', 'Four best friends, on the brink of starting middle school, realize their lives are about to change forever. So on the last weekend of summer, they set out to make the most of it. Nothing could prepare them, though, for the startling discovery they make while revisiting one of their favorite haunts.', 'Four best friends, on the brink of starting middle school, realize their lives are about to change forever. So on the last weekend of summer, they set out to make the most of it. Nothing could prepare them, though, for the startling discovery they make while revisiting one of their favorite haunts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UH9yHIqW8IQiDTPHEBTo7RknEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860155'),
