  ('391420058864310937', 'Summers Downstairs', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tom Sommerlatte', 'Tom Sommerlatte', 'Godehard Giese, Karin Hanczewski, Alice Pehlivanyan, William Peiro, Jens Atzorn', null, 'Brothers David and Matthias have contrasting personalities. Long since grown up – one with a wife, the other a girlfriend – they unintentionally meet at their parents'' holiday home. Games and plots about power and dominance with unforeseen consequences.', 'Brothers David and Matthias have contrasting personalities. Long since grown up – one with a wife, the other a girlfriend – they unintentionally meet at their parents'' holiday home. Games and plots about power and dominance with unforeseen consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojfryM4DePAU0UvQa93WKCIdF0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324340'),
  ('973141567997131544', 'Summertime', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Lean, Jack Hildyard, Adrian Pryce-Jones', 'David Lean, H. E. Bates', 'Katharine Hepburn, Rossano Brazzi, Isa Miranda, Darren McGavin, Mari Aldon, Jane Rose, MacDonald Parke, Jeremy Spenser', 'NR', 'Middle-aged Ohio secretary Jane Hudson has never found love and has nearly resigned herself to spending the rest of her life alone. But before she does, she uses her savings to finance a summer in romantic Venice, where she finally meets the man of her dreams, the elegant Renato Di Rossi.', 'Middle-aged Ohio secretary Jane Hudson has never found love and has nearly resigned herself to spending the rest of her life alone. But before she does, she uses her savings to finance a summer in romantic Venice, where she finally meets the man of her dreams, the elegant Renato Di Rossi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mlLfrbP9oYkSXvUPJhk24VdYM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50363'),
