  ('654879717939150953', 'Summertime', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Catherine Corsini, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Catherine Corsini, Laurette Polmanss', 'Izïa Higelin, Cécile de France, Noémie Lvovsky, Laetitia Dosch, Kévin Azaïs, Loulou Hanssen, Benjamin Bellecour, Sarah Suco', null, 'In 1971, a young woman moves from the French countryside to Paris and begins a passionate love affair with a feminist leader.', 'In 1971, a young woman moves from the French countryside to Paris and begins a passionate love affair with a feminist leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugqdTcTEiIl37jv0QiSUlpplEke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273153'),
  ('206524528578080007', 'Summertime', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Paolo Caimi, Alessia Silvetti, Gabriele Muccino', 'Dale Nall, Gabriele Muccino', 'Brando Pacitto, Matilda Lutz, Joseph Haro, Taylor Frey, Laura Cayouette, Jessica Rothe, Tatiana Luter, Timothy Martin', null, 'A gay couple living in San Francisco takes in two strangers traveling from Italy to start a new life in America, discovering each other and forming the most unlikely of relationships along the way.', 'A gay couple living in San Francisco takes in two strangers traveling from Italy to start a new life in America, discovering each other and forming the most unlikely of relationships along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoqQnRX7WQJoGlOWCXJasvWtBhv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413730'),
  ('358399611718046256', 'Summertime', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Sean Wang, Carlos López Estrada, Sarah Balboa', 'Bene''t Benton, Bryce Banks, Marquesha Babers', 'Austin Antoine, Marquesha Babers, Bryce Banks, Bene''t Benton, Amaya Blankenship, Caedmon Branch, Mila Cuda, Gabriela de Luna', 'R', 'Over the course of a hot summer day in Los Angeles, the lives of 25 young Angelinos intersect. A skating guitarist, a tagger, two wannabe rappers, an exasperated fast-food worker, a limo driver—they all weave in and out of each other''s stories. Through poetry they express life, love, heartache, family, home, and fear. One of them just wants to find someplace that still serves good cheeseburgers.', 'Over the course of a hot summer day in Los Angeles, the lives of 25 young Angelinos intersect. A skating guitarist, a tagger, two wannabe rappers, an exasperated fast-food worker, a limo driver—they all weave in and out of each other''s stories. Through poetry they express life, love, heartache, family, home, and fear. One of them just wants to find someplace that still serves good cheeseburgers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ynlG6QRywGyeZxlVkIQDOhMolg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653715'),
  ('755651995841371820', 'Summertime Blues: Lemon Popsicle VIII', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Reinhard Schwabenitzky, Karl Kases, Avner Orshalimy', 'Reinhard Schwabenitzky', 'Yftach Katzur, Zachi Noy, Jonathan Sagall, Elfi Eschke, Sibylle Rauch, Sissi Pitz, Jacques Cohen, Dan Turgeman', 'R', 'It''s summertime and Johnny hits upon the idea of restoring a disused old bar with his old friends Benny and Bobby. Raising the capital however is a problem, but luckily the landlord''s geeky daughter Polly has long harbored a crush on Bobby. Bobby wants no part of this and neither does Polly who smells a rat. As the boys work on restoring the bar, preparing for it''s grand re-opening, Polly''s guard softens as seemingly does Bobby''s but at the expense of possible heartbreak in the unlikeliest of places....', 'It''s summertime and Johnny hits upon the idea of restoring a disused old bar with his old friends Benny and Bobby. Raising the capital however is a problem, but luckily the landlord''s geeky daughter Polly has long harbored a crush on Bobby. Bobby wants no part of this and neither does Polly who smells a rat. As the boys work on restoring the bar, preparing for it''s grand re-opening, Polly''s guard softens as seemingly does Bobby''s but at the expense of possible heartbreak in the unlikeliest of places....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0VsalEzBDUuRN0spQ4P05vn2Pi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12585'),
  ('1054390021401788232', 'Summertime Killer', 1972, 'Action, Crime', 'Antonio Isasi-Isasmendi', 'Jorge Illa, Lluís Josep Comerón, Reid Buckley', 'Christopher Mitchum, Karl Malden, Olivia Hussey, Claudine Auger, Gérard Barray, José Nieto, Gustavo Re, Raf Vallone', 'PG', 'During his childhood, a boy sees four men drown his father; now, the grown young man makes it his business to kill each member of the foursome. His last killing presents him with some challenges, as his victim is only wounded. He kidnaps the man''s daughter and goes to a hideout. In the meantime, an ex-cop has been tracking them down.', 'During his childhood, a boy sees four men drown his father; now, the grown young man makes it his business to kill each member of the foursome. His last killing presents him with some challenges, as his victim is only wounded. He kidnaps the man''s daughter and goes to a hideout. In the meantime, an ex-cop has been tracking them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlpJCdBOkdFPAP6pH0N5XINHCjR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80757'),
  ('85444243310070340', 'Summertime Switch', 1994, 'Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Alan Metter', 'Alan Metter', 'Jason Weaver, Rider Strong, Richard Moll, Teresa Ganzel, Soleil Moon Frye, Barry Williams, Patrick Renna, Nicole Leach', 'PG', 'For the summer, troublemaker Freddie Egan is being sent to a camp-style juvenile detention center, while spoiled rich-kid Frederick Egan III is going to a luxurious getaway for kids of the elite. Until a name mix-up at the bus-boarding area sends the boys to each other''s destinations, and while Eddie gets a taste of the good life, Frederick has to deal with being without all his usual comforts. Eventually, they both learn some valuable life-lessons.', 'For the summer, troublemaker Freddie Egan is being sent to a camp-style juvenile detention center, while spoiled rich-kid Frederick Egan III is going to a luxurious getaway for kids of the elite. Until a name mix-up at the bus-boarding area sends the boys to each other''s destinations, and while Eddie gets a taste of the good life, Frederick has to deal with being without all his usual comforts. Eventually, they both learn some valuable life-lessons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9yRjCt4xGSvMRlxONWCRTEXo5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179590'),
  ('946925220083108798', 'Summit Fever', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Julian Gilbey, Adam Hall', 'Julian Gilbey', 'Freddie Thorp, Michel Biel, Mathilde Warnier, Théo Christine, Ryan Phillippe, Hannah New, Jocelyn Wedow, Gianmarco Saurino', 'R', 'A daring dream to scale the world''s most challenging trio of mountains soon turns into a terrifying nightmare for a group of friends when a deadly storm traps the climbers near the summit and cuts off all hope of rescue. With the odds stacked against them, the friends are forced to trust each other to save themselves by any means necessary.', 'A daring dream to scale the world''s most challenging trio of mountains soon turns into a terrifying nightmare for a group of friends when a deadly storm traps the climbers near the summit and cuts off all hope of rescue. With the odds stacked against them, the friends are forced to trust each other to save themselves by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rX9k5v7JYmnaBO5E89PZ4yMfuvo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:994441'),
