  ('540308160758163846', 'Sun', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Desoindre, Ella Kowalska', null, 'Tewfik Jallab, Aadar Malik, Meriem Serbah, Annabelle Lengronne, Ludovic Berthillot, Xavier Boiffier, Hanna Castera', null, 'Sunil Pratham, aka Sun, is a 30-year-old delivery boy of Indian descent. He leads a hectic life in today''s Paris, but everything threatens to stop the day his Chinese employers put an end to their illegal activities. To continue working, Sun decides to set up a real courier company. His plan was quickly complicated by the unexpected arrival of his cousin, a sitar player who had come to Paris for a career, and to whom Sun had to promise a concert at the Olympia. Caught in his lies, Sun will therefore find it very difficult to invent a future ...', 'Sunil Pratham, aka Sun, is a 30-year-old delivery boy of Indian descent. He leads a hectic life in today''s Paris, but everything threatens to stop the day his Chinese employers put an end to their illegal activities. To continue working, Sun decides to set up a real courier company. His plan was quickly complicated by the unexpected arrival of his cousin, a sitar player who had come to Paris for a career, and to whom Sun had to promise a concert at the Olympia. Caught in his lies, Sun will therefore find it very difficult to invent a future ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQDpjm57cLpgDbo9ikdgihuepyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544334'),
  ('342035430617982506', 'Sun', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kurdwin Ayub', 'Kurdwin Ayub', 'Melina Benli, Law Wallner, Maya Wopienka, Kerim Dogan, Omar Ayub, Awini Barwari, Thomas Momcinovic, Marlene Hauser', null, 'Young women, Austrian style. Yesmin is Kurdish and wears a headscarf. She shoots a cheeky burqa video with Bella and Nati which makes the trio famous in the Muslim community. Controversy and alienation ensue. Immediate, exuberantly introverted cinema.', 'Young women, Austrian style. Yesmin is Kurdish and wears a headscarf. She shoots a cheeky burqa video with Bella and Nati which makes the trio famous in the Muslim community. Controversy and alienation ensue. Immediate, exuberantly introverted cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyfiXDcI6BIiF4rTD6jpthYtNMP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928735'),
  ('1099508963917281047', 'Sun and Concrete', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jieun Yi, David Wnendt, Kathleen Döbbel', 'Felix Lobrecht, David Wnendt', 'Levy Rico Arcos, Rafael Luis Klein-Hessling, Vincent Wiemer, Aaron Maldonado-Morales, Nicole Johannhanwahr, Roland Wolf, Franziska Wulf, Jörg Rühl', null, 'The four friends Lukas, Julius, Gino and Sanchez are trying to survive the everyday life in Neukölln, Berlin between drugs, gangs, rap, violence and boredom. Until they are one day making a serious decision with serious consequences because of a dead certain plan.', 'The four friends Lukas, Julius, Gino and Sanchez are trying to survive the everyday life in Neukölln, Berlin between drugs, gangs, rap, violence and boredom. Until they are one day making a serious decision with serious consequences because of a dead certain plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2S0hvmEMv0lsyp8q4eDiTdXmQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915980'),
  ('1014175072538018040', 'Sun Children', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hooman Behmanesh, Majid Majidi', 'Majid Majidi, Nima Javidi', 'Ali Nasirian, Javad Ezzati, Tannaz Tabatabaei, Roohollah Zamani, Mahdi Mousavi, Shamila Shirzad, Abolfazl Shirzad, Mani Ghafouri', null, 'The story of 12-year-old Ali and his three friends. Together they work hard to survive and support their families, doing small jobs in a garage and committing petty crimes to make fast money. In a turn of events that seems miraculous, Ali is entrusted to find hidden treasure underground. He recruits his gang, but first, to gain access to the tunnel, the children must enroll at the Sun School, a charitable institution that tries to educate street kids and child laborers, close to where the treasure is located.', 'The story of 12-year-old Ali and his three friends. Together they work hard to survive and support their families, doing small jobs in a garage and committing petty crimes to make fast money. In a turn of events that seems miraculous, Ali is entrusted to find hidden treasure underground. He recruits his gang, but first, to gain access to the tunnel, the children must enroll at the Sun School, a charitable institution that tries to educate street kids and child laborers, close to where the treasure is located.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2G3BazaiReAM8bazC1HuQHaltA0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670343'),
  ('296992681452706524', 'Sun Dogs', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jennifer Morrison, Michael Alden Lloyd, Farand Heydari', 'Anthony Tambakis', 'Michael Angarano, Melissa Benoist, Ed O''Neill, Allison Janney, Xzibit, Jennifer Morrison, Nicholas Massouh, Eric Christian Olsen', null, 'A man eager to serve his country but rejected by the Marines pairs up with a young runaway to form an unlikely team on a misguided adventure.', 'A man eager to serve his country but rejected by the Marines pairs up with a young runaway to form an unlikely team on a misguided adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiEHsguMwMyZMRXgjgQaB2Vpbzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403068'),
  ('200539084680354738', 'Sun In Buckets', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Agostino Castiglioni, Laszlo Barbo, Kim Gualino', 'Gennaro Nunziante, Checco Zalone', 'Checco Zalone, Miriam Dalmazio, Marco Paolini, Robert Dancs, Aurore Erguy, Augusto Zucchi, Stefano Sabelli, Claudia Brovedani', null, 'The story of a father and a son. An on the road trip from South to North.', 'The story of a father and a son. An on the road trip from South to North.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jI5WTCv0V3i4J6EcPWmxt4Da6sq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231176'),
  ('438258204692540779', 'Sun of the Sleepless', 1992, 'Crime, Drama', 'Temur Babluani', 'Temur Babluani', 'Elguja Burduli, David Kazishvili, Lia Babluani, Eka Saatashvili, Givi Sikharulidze, Levan Pilpani, Flora Shedania, Lika Kavzharadze', null, 'The director dedicated this lyrical, epic film-confession to the memory of his father who was a doctor. The film’s protagonist, an ambulance doctor, conducts dangerous experiments in search of a vitally important vaccine. His wife believes in his work, though his daughter would not understand him. His son, who is absolutely unlike his father in character, is trying to protect him. But self-denial in the name of science proves too high a price. Just when he is on the verge of discovery, the doctor loses everything he has gathered as a result of his twenty-year-long work. This loss brings him even closer to his son. The shooting of the film continued for seven years (1985-1992), making it a metaphorical culmination of the Soviet cinematography and the Soviet way of life as a whole.', 'The director dedicated this lyrical, epic film-confession to the memory of his father who was a doctor. The film’s protagonist, an ambulance doctor, conducts dangerous experiments in search of a vitally important vaccine. His wife believes in his work, though his daughter would not understand him. His son, who is absolutely unlike his father in character, is trying to protect him. But self-denial in the name of science proves too high a price. Just when he is on the verge of discovery, the doctor loses everything he has gathered as a result of his twenty-year-long work. This loss brings him even closer to his son. The shooting of the film continued for seven years (1985-1992), making it a metaphorical culmination of the Soviet cinematography and the Soviet way of life as a whole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfrnY8mD9xxTlewczcTXbQNbNNY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150100'),
  ('535448039486462591', 'Sun Ra: A Joyful Noise', 1980, 'Documentary, Music', 'Robert Mugge, Lawrence McConkey', null, 'Sun Ra, June Tyson, Danny Thompson, Marshall Allen, John Gilmore, Eloe Omoe, James Jacson', null, 'Robert Mugge filmed jazz great Sun Ra on location in Philadelphia, Baltimore, and Washington, D.C. between 1978 and 1980. The resulting 60-minute film includes multiple public and private performances, poetry readings, a band rehearsal, interviews, and extensive improvisations. Transferred to HD from the original 16mm film and lovingly restored for the best possible viewing experience.', 'Robert Mugge filmed jazz great Sun Ra on location in Philadelphia, Baltimore, and Washington, D.C. between 1978 and 1980. The resulting 60-minute film includes multiple public and private performances, poetry readings, a band rehearsal, interviews, and extensive improvisations. Transferred to HD from the original 16mm film and lovingly restored for the best possible viewing experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTIEkfGgL2psUDlyTZ0isYfueEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82144'),
  ('980781761213457767', 'Sun Scarred', 2006, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Takashi Miike, Masato Kaneko, Bunmei Katô', 'Toshimichi Ohkawa', 'Show Aikawa, Yasukaze Motomiya, Satoshi Morimoto, Aiko Sato, Miho Ninagawa, Sei Hiraizumi, Hiroshi Katsuno, Kenichi Endo', null, 'Katayama is on the way home to his wife and little daughter when he comes across a gang of punks beating up an innocent man. Katamaya decides to help the stranger and surprisingly wins the fight. This turns out to be a bad decision.', 'Katayama is on the way home to his wife and little daughter when he comes across a gang of punks beating up an innocent man. Katamaya decides to help the stranger and surprisingly wins the fight. This turns out to be a bad decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVdVEhUqKgP581jhErlEbVemSS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52401'),
  ('1042368808100751786', 'Sun Valley Serenade', 1941, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'H. Bruce Humberstone, Edward Cronjager', 'Helen Logan, Robert Ellis', 'Sonja Henie, John Payne, Glenn Miller, Milton Berle, Lynn Bari, Joan Davis, Dorothy Dandridge, William B. Davidson', 'NR', 'When Phil Corey''s band arrives at the Idaho ski resort its pianist Ted Scott is smitten with a Norwegian refugee he has sponsored, Karen Benson. When soloist Vivian Dawn quits, Karen stages an ice show as a substitute.', 'When Phil Corey''s band arrives at the Idaho ski resort its pianist Ted Scott is smitten with a Norwegian refugee he has sponsored, Karen Benson. When soloist Vivian Dawn quits, Karen stages an ice show as a substitute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6N7NMzb1iWEtb5NhLT622EKK5ht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43797'),
  ('1088239655009660117', 'Sun, Hay and a Couple of Slaps', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Zdeněk Troška, René Slauka, Oldřich Vlasák', 'Petr Markov, Zdeněk Troška', 'Helena Růžičková, Stanislav Tříska, Veronika Kánská, Martin Šotola, Valerie Kaplanová, Marie Švecová, Marie Pilátová, Václav Troška', null, 'For a second time this film leads us to the village in South Bohemia. We meet again Konopnik family and Skopek family. Venca Konopnik is marrying Blazena Skopek but there is another woman Milada who is very jealous and she is spreading gossips about Venca Konopnik. Those gossips are so powerful that they lead to big fights between Konopnik and Skopek families. You will also see what a progress on milk-yielding-cows-project has been made.', 'For a second time this film leads us to the village in South Bohemia. We meet again Konopnik family and Skopek family. Venca Konopnik is marrying Blazena Skopek but there is another woman Milada who is very jealous and she is spreading gossips about Venca Konopnik. Those gossips are so powerful that they lead to big fights between Konopnik and Skopek families. You will also see what a progress on milk-yielding-cows-project has been made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7MSy0Z9R9JaLIZTdLpnAbOZVSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36993'),
  ('383412888655583897', 'Sun, Hay, Berries', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Zdeněk Troška, Magdalena Pivoňková, Petr Slabý', 'Petr Markov, Zdeněk Troška', 'Pavel Kikinčuk, Broněk Černý, Veronika Kánská, Petra Pyšová, Helena Růžičková, Stanislav Tříska, Erna Červená, Martin Šotola', null, 'A Czech agricultural student, Šimon Plánička, arrives at the small South Bohemian town of Hoštice, and joins the local JZD (agricultural co-op) with the intention of trying out his experiment regarding the "Milk yield of cows in regards to a cultured environment". He runs into difficulty with the directorship of the JZD, but he finds them eager to help once they hear he''s the son of the local agricultural commissioner, as his last name is also Plánička. Blažena Škopková is given the task of finding out how things are looking. However everything is complicated by the jealousy of Blažena''s boyfriend Venca.', 'A Czech agricultural student, Šimon Plánička, arrives at the small South Bohemian town of Hoštice, and joins the local JZD (agricultural co-op) with the intention of trying out his experiment regarding the "Milk yield of cows in regards to a cultured environment". He runs into difficulty with the directorship of the JZD, but he finds them eager to help once they hear he''s the son of the local agricultural commissioner, as his last name is also Plánička. Blažena Škopková is given the task of finding out how things are looking. However everything is complicated by the jealousy of Blažena''s boyfriend Venca.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omG7Wn30TvsXvPi28kC0aGpH5Kh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36994'),
  ('887907798497766098', 'Sun, Hay, Erotica', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Zdeněk Troška, Magdalena Pivoňková, Oldřich Vlasák', 'Petr Markov, Zdeněk Troška', 'Helena Růžičková, Stanislav Tříska, Veronika Kánská, Petra Pyšová, Jaroslava Kretschmerová, Oldřich Kaiser, Martin Dejdar, Broněk Černý', null, 'The local farmers'' cooperative organized a trip to Italy, in which the Škopkovci took part. They went there at the invitation of the Italian agricultural cooperative, whose employees are going to visit Hoštice in return. In addition to the sights, the goal of the tour was also an excursion to a modern Italian cowshed. After returning home, Hoštice and its inhabitants are waiting for a "great approach to Europe" - they plan to improve the neglected village by building a nudist beach. However, as it usually happens, the Italian delegation appears at the least convenient moment. Strangely enough, they like the cooperative''s neglected economy so much that they propose to preserve it as an open-air museum...', 'The local farmers'' cooperative organized a trip to Italy, in which the Škopkovci took part. They went there at the invitation of the Italian agricultural cooperative, whose employees are going to visit Hoštice in return. In addition to the sights, the goal of the tour was also an excursion to a modern Italian cowshed. After returning home, Hoštice and its inhabitants are waiting for a "great approach to Europe" - they plan to improve the neglected village by building a nudist beach. However, as it usually happens, the Italian delegation appears at the least convenient moment. Strangely enough, they like the cooperative''s neglected economy so much that they propose to preserve it as an open-air museum...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEqYRsdujuVdiPGhM8jLBIFMlIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139085'),
  ('757558705688475305', 'Sun, Heart, Love', 2017, 'Drama', 'Saverio Di Biagio, David Ambrosini, Daniele Vicari', 'Daniele Vicari', 'Isabella Ragonese, Eva Grieco, Francesco Montanari, Francesco Acquaroli, Giulia Anchisi, Giordano De Plano, Chiara Scalise, Noemi Abbrescia', null, 'Eli has four children, an unemployed husband and a job with an almost impossible commute. Vale is single and makes ends meet by working in clubs as a dancer. Tied by a profound emotional bond of true sisterhood, the two women''s lives are two sides of the same coin, but their mutual solidarity isn’t always enough to lighten the load of their difficult circumstances.', 'Eli has four children, an unemployed husband and a job with an almost impossible commute. Vale is single and makes ends meet by working in clubs as a dancer. Tied by a profound emotional bond of true sisterhood, the two women''s lives are two sides of the same coin, but their mutual solidarity isn’t always enough to lighten the load of their difficult circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3usjC7tkuSdt6ubMB3ddAQWjiVN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419878'),
  ('737760418598922952', 'Sunan Kalijaga', 1983, 'History, Drama', 'Sofyan Sharna', 'Sofyan Sharna', 'Deddy Mizwar, W.D. Mochtar, Zainal Abidin, Clara Sinta', null, 'Raden Mas Said, the first son of Tumenggung Wilarikta, who rules Tuban, a district in the powerful kingdom of Majapahit, sees a poor family who suffers from hunger. He tries to take some food out secretly. His parents disapprove, and as punishment, he is locked inside the food storage. Since the incident, R.M. Said, does not feel comfortable at home. So he travels from one place to another and witnesses many cases of fraud and injustice. The Tumenggung is often blamed to cover up their crimes. Listening to his son''s report, his father realises the real situation. Then he meets Sunan Bonang, who teaches his knowledge to R.M. Said. They meditate together on a riverbank. Due to his dedication, R.M. Said gets a "Nur" (enlightenment) from God. Shortly after, he is appointed as a Wali (a dated term for Islamic leader), and becomes the famous one amongst the Nine Great Wali (Wali Sanga). He is known as Sunan Kalijaga.', 'Raden Mas Said, the first son of Tumenggung Wilarikta, who rules Tuban, a district in the powerful kingdom of Majapahit, sees a poor family who suffers from hunger. He tries to take some food out secretly. His parents disapprove, and as punishment, he is locked inside the food storage. Since the incident, R.M. Said, does not feel comfortable at home. So he travels from one place to another and witnesses many cases of fraud and injustice. The Tumenggung is often blamed to cover up their crimes. Listening to his son''s report, his father realises the real situation. Then he meets Sunan Bonang, who teaches his knowledge to R.M. Said. They meditate together on a riverbank. Due to his dedication, R.M. Said gets a "Nur" (enlightenment) from God. Shortly after, he is appointed as a Wali (a dated term for Islamic leader), and becomes the famous one amongst the Nine Great Wali (Wali Sanga). He is known as Sunan Kalijaga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vY4NX9gJbsY9NFQXmldoeDsUIfA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329435'),
  ('29864500156086341', 'Sunbeat', 2017, 'Drama', 'Vasco Viana, Laura Laperrousaz, Clara Laperrousaz', 'Laura Laperrousaz, Clara Laperrousaz', 'Ana Girardot, Clément Roussier, Agathe Bonitzer, Teresa Madruga, Océane Le Caoussin, Margaux Le Caoussin, Paulo Calatré', null, 'Gabriel and Iris head back to their family holiday home in Portugal with their daughters Emma and Zoé, a couple of adorable six-year-old twins, for a vacation. In the heart of the sun-drenched countryside, as the little ones swim and laugh, the couple’s past begins to rear its head. Emma is overwhelmed by a secret that is simply too big for her to keep, and which she has no right to share with her twin sister.', 'Gabriel and Iris head back to their family holiday home in Portugal with their daughters Emma and Zoé, a couple of adorable six-year-old twins, for a vacation. In the heart of the sun-drenched countryside, as the little ones swim and laugh, the couple’s past begins to rear its head. Emma is overwhelmed by a secret that is simply too big for her to keep, and which she has no right to share with her twin sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyYphOGK7vUWI8o5Q5Doaf44zJz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468528'),
  ('184395558242173684', 'Sunburn', 1979, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Paul Baxley, Steve Barnett, Richard C. Sarafian', 'James Booth, Stephen Oliver, John Daly', 'Farrah Fawcett, Charles Grodin, Art Carney, Joan Collins, William Daniels, John Hillerman, Eleanor Parker, Keenan Wynn', null, 'A model and a private eye help a New York insurance investigator on a deadly case in Acapulco.', 'A model and a private eye help a New York insurance investigator on a deadly case in Acapulco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pP9qJHqqxCxX0QGIJzTCH8W3kYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118887'),
  ('1127854838929741668', 'Sunburn', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nelson Hume, Frankie DeMarco', 'Mark Edgington, Nelson Hume', 'Paloma Baeza, Cillian Murphy, Barry Ward, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Michael Liebman, Sinéad Keenan, Aidan Kelly, Henry Abbott', 'R', 'Davin McDerby is a handsome, irresponsible slacker who arrives in Montauk Long Island for a summer of fun. He has no intention of working too hard and every intention of enjoying himself as much as possible while simultaneously escaping the pressing problems that await him back home in Ireland. Over a summer of car-jacking, pool-hopping, and tequila-drinking Davin and his new found friends discover that they have affected one another causing them to re-evaluate their lives.', 'Davin McDerby is a handsome, irresponsible slacker who arrives in Montauk Long Island for a summer of fun. He has no intention of working too hard and every intention of enjoying himself as much as possible while simultaneously escaping the pressing problems that await him back home in Ireland. Over a summer of car-jacking, pool-hopping, and tequila-drinking Davin and his new found friends discover that they have affected one another causing them to re-evaluate their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDuYolMrty0SoPpVCwwur3igTMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61114'),
  ('175045302494866188', 'Sunburned', 2019, 'Drama', 'Carolina Hellsgård, Wojciech Staroń', 'Carolina Hellsgård', 'Sabine Timoteo, Zita Gaier, Gedion Oduor Wekesa, Nicolais Borger, Malik Blumenthal, Flora Thiemann, Anima Schwinn, Mehdi Lamrini', null, 'Feeling neglected by her mother and sister on their holiday in Spain, 13-year-old Claire tries to help a young Senegalese beach vendor to escape his misery.', 'Feeling neglected by her mother and sister on their holiday in Spain, 13-year-old Claire tries to help a young Senegalese beach vendor to escape his misery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMJC5rNSW6gZbLTrEmP4I3JpBIe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639562'),
  ('1146857894686582108', 'Suncoast', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Laura Chinn, Bruce Francis Cole, Cedric Vara', 'Laura Chinn', 'Nico Parker, Laura Linney, Woody Harrelson, Daniella Taylor, Ella Anderson, Amarr M. Wooten, Ariel Martin, Keyla Monterroso Mejia', 'R', 'While caring for her brother along with her audacious mother, a teenager strikes up an unlikely friendship with an eccentric activist who is protesting one of the most landmark medical cases of all time.', 'While caring for her brother along with her audacious mother, a teenager strikes up an unlikely friendship with an eccentric activist who is protesting one of the most landmark medical cases of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmPLUp5lVMiGomkN3db1WPeNrz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1014209'),
  ('602371148906955539', 'Sundae in New York', 1983, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Andy Stein, Jimmy Picker', null, 'Scott Record', null, 'A character closely resembling then-mayor Ed Koch sings a variation on the "Theme from ''New York, New York''" in an entirely clay-animated film depicting a variety of locations and celebrities associated with New York City. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'A character closely resembling then-mayor Ed Koch sings a variation on the "Theme from ''New York, New York''" in an entirely clay-animated film depicting a variety of locations and celebrities associated with New York City. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pcZXB8QPedWOBKvQlkknLAPkTq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210972'),
  ('335841997385549749', 'Sunday', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jonathan Nossiter, John Foster, Michael F. Barrow', 'Jonathan Nossiter', 'David Suchet, Lisa Harrow, Jared Harris, Arnold Barkus, Larry Pine, Bahman Soltani, Willis Burks II, Joseph Sirola', null, 'Mistaking a homeless man for a famous director, a British actress seeks career help from him.', 'Mistaking a homeless man for a famous director, a British actress seeks career help from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/B3f0ZquyRdOrFyDHiF14L1SxZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70805'),
  ('1116244402658852897', 'Sunday', 2008, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Rohit Shetty', 'Farhad Samji, Sajid Samji', 'Ajay Devgn, Arshad Warsi, Ayesha Takia, Irrfan Khan, Anjana Sukhani, Mukesh Tiwari, Tusshar Kapoor, Esha Deol', 'PG', 'A dead body found floating in a lake… Unexplained scratch marks on her neck… Supari killers out to kill her… A taxi driver who yells ‘bhoot, bhoot’ every time he sees her...', 'A dead body found floating in a lake… Unexplained scratch marks on her neck… Supari killers out to kill her… A taxi driver who yells ‘bhoot, bhoot’ every time he sees her...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEFD2MOV4XrjVTmNwPP7p2Sm7hp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20917'),
  ('968025488461203724', 'Sunday', 2011, 'Animation', 'Patrick Doyon', 'Patrick Doyon', 'Chantal Baril, Natalie Hamel-Roy, Jacques Lavallée, François Sasseville, Nicolas Scott', null, 'An imaginative boy suffers the stifling ordinariness of his family''s weekly Sunday ritual.', 'An imaginative boy suffers the stifling ordinariness of his family''s weekly Sunday ritual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLSpWcpdEQy3bplFMjXxykonxhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91512'),
  ('224081522926353952', 'Sunday at Six', 1965, 'Drama', 'Lucian Pintilie', 'Lucian Pintilie, Ion Mihăileanu', 'Irina Petrescu, Dan Nuțu, Graziela Albini, Eugenia Popovici, Dorina Nila-Bentamar, Eugenia Bosânceanu, Marcel Gingulescu, Costel Constantinescu', null, 'Romania, 1940. A boy meets a girl. They fall in love without suspecting anything about their real identities. They chose an eventful, tense and dangerous life as underground anti-fascists fighters. The significance of their activity is manifest in the consequences it has on the tormented progress of their love. Reality is against it. Two parallel lines which meet for a second, only to drift apart for ever.', 'Romania, 1940. A boy meets a girl. They fall in love without suspecting anything about their real identities. They chose an eventful, tense and dangerous life as underground anti-fascists fighters. The significance of their activity is manifest in the consequences it has on the tormented progress of their love. Reality is against it. Two parallel lines which meet for a second, only to drift apart for ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjhBoPFJUZhHuS58VMDxu0fc4zc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226136'),
  ('535423290759939396', 'Sunday Bloody Sunday', 1971, 'Drama', 'John Schlesinger, Billy Williams', 'Penelope Gilliatt', 'Peter Finch, Glenda Jackson, Murray Head, Peggy Ashcroft, Tony Britton, Maurice Denham, Bessie Love, Vivian Pickles', 'R', 'Recently divorced career woman Alex Greville begins a romantic relationship with glamorous mod artist Bob Elkin, fully aware that he''s also intimately involved with middle-aged doctor Daniel Hirsh. For both Alex and Daniel, the younger man represents a break with their repressive pasts, and though both know that Bob is seeing both of them, neither is willing to let go of the youth and vitality he brings to their otherwise stable lives.', 'Recently divorced career woman Alex Greville begins a romantic relationship with glamorous mod artist Bob Elkin, fully aware that he''s also intimately involved with middle-aged doctor Daniel Hirsh. For both Alex and Daniel, the younger man represents a break with their repressive pasts, and though both know that Bob is seeing both of them, neither is willing to let go of the youth and vitality he brings to their otherwise stable lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7q1h3M1vDlsHDKRhoPOzKjmFCVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45938'),
  ('189413783083778208', 'Sunday Dads', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Louis Becker, Stephan Massis', 'Cécile Boisrond-Becker, Jacques Pibarot', 'Olivier Baroux, Thierry Neuvic, Hélène Fillières, Marilyne Canto, Nina Rodriguez, Nicolas Rompteaux, Arauna Bernheim-Dennery, Thierry Lhermitte', null, 'When he finds out that his wife is cheating, Antoine walks out on his family. His one regret is that he can only see his children every other Sunday.', 'When he finds out that his wife is cheating, Antoine walks out on his family. His one regret is that he can only see his children every other Sunday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMUO19EHZZykXsC1sFN4ZgG3kDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112592'),
  ('39792906465049835', 'Sunday Encounter', 1958, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Marc Allégret', 'Serge de Boissac', 'Bourvil, Danielle Darrieux, Jean-Paul Belmondo, Arletty, Jean Lefebvre, Roger Hanin, Fernand Sardou, Jean Ozenne', null, 'Jean Brevent still did not understand the departure of his wife, Danielle Darieux. It''s been five years, but he still can''t forget her. In spite of a work of writer originator in a newspaper, in which it tried to be invested completely, time did not make its work. One day, by chance, he meets her in the bus...', 'Jean Brevent still did not understand the departure of his wife, Danielle Darieux. It''s been five years, but he still can''t forget her. In spite of a work of writer originator in a newspaper, in which it tried to be invested completely, time did not make its work. One day, by chance, he meets her in the bus...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FF5qWFN5K8Msn46XVE8f9uvxAA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84725'),
  ('591645797428102744', 'Sunday Go to Meetin'' Time', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', 'Allen Rose', 'Gus Wicke', null, 'A Black man sneaks out of church and tries to steal a chicken, but gets a taste of Hell when he''s accidentally knocked unconscious. One of the "Censored 11" banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'A Black man sneaks out of church and tries to steal a chicken, but gets a taste of Hell when he''s accidentally knocked unconscious. One of the "Censored 11" banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGu3zrnq3GTLcmWiAPN4gNnxb5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202008'),
  ('878996454894759599', 'Sunday in August', 1950, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Luciano Emmer, Leonida Barboni, Ubaldo Marelli', 'Luciano Emmer, Cesare Zavattini, Franco Brusati', 'Anna Baldini, Vera Carmi, Emilio Cigoli, Andrea Compagnoni, Anna Di Leo, Franco Interlenghi, Salvo Libassi, Elvi Lissiak', null, 'The plot weaves several episodes with several groups of people, Roman families, youth gangs and young love couples, who spend a Sunday at the beach of Ostia.', 'The plot weaves several episodes with several groups of people, Roman families, youth gangs and young love couples, who spend a Sunday at the beach of Ostia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vk5HnZT5jwEUWf5SY9Af9nQ7ty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85747'),
  ('197099886898639643', 'Sunday in August', 2004, 'Drama', 'Marc Meyer, Peter Polsak-Lohmann, Anna Haas', 'Marc Meyer', 'Rita Lengyel, Milton Welsh', null, 'A couple on a boat. Their love is burnt out. But how to let go when souls are entangled?', 'A couple on a boat. Their love is burnt out. But how to let go when souls are entangled?', null, 'tmdb:movie:9'),
  ('228564632379751805', 'Sunday in New York', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Tewksbury, Leo Tover, Eli Dunn', 'Norman Krasna', 'Jane Fonda, Rod Taylor, Cliff Robertson, Robert Culp, Jo Morrow, Jim Backus, Peter Nero, Rayford Barnes', 'NR', 'An innocent upstarter visits her airline pilot brother and meets a stranger she tries to seduce.', 'An innocent upstarter visits her airline pilot brother and meets a stranger she tries to seduce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybvLO9e7JMrdnZ8XOwZnRrs92I8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61892'),
  ('790300321813257196', 'Sunday in Peking', 1956, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker, Chris Marker', 'Chris Marker', 'Gilles Quéant', null, 'Chris Marker’s travel essay Sunday in Peking transforms a long-held childhood dream into a cinematic journey through Beijing. Blending documentary observation with reflective narration, Marker captures the city’s rhythms, traditions, and everyday life in mid-1950s China with his signature curiosity and lyricism.', 'Chris Marker’s travel essay Sunday in Peking transforms a long-held childhood dream into a cinematic journey through Beijing. Blending documentary observation with reflective narration, Marker captures the city’s rhythms, traditions, and everyday life in mid-1950s China with his signature curiosity and lyricism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhw1iJ4RgobM7DdxMbLw7NwmRTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185366'),
  ('130304762514201515', 'Sunday in the Country', 1974, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'John Trent, Marc Champion', 'John Trent, Robert Maxwell', 'Ernest Borgnine, Michael J. Pollard, Hollis McLaren, Louis Zorich, Cec Linder, Vladimír Valenta, Al Waxman, Tim Henry', 'R', 'Three vicious thugs are on the run in rural America after robbing a local bank. They seek refuge at the home of a reclusive farmer, but he is prepared for their arrival and holds them at gunpoint. Unable to let them simply wait for the law, he decides to take them into into his cellar and torture them a little before the police arrive.', 'Three vicious thugs are on the run in rural America after robbing a local bank. They seek refuge at the home of a reclusive farmer, but he is prepared for their arrival and holds them at gunpoint. Unable to let them simply wait for the law, he decides to take them into into his cellar and torture them a little before the police arrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fi3LETB5pAYLQvbWP6nZrzcKZVr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163549'),
  ('501347008714119413', 'Sunday in the Park with George', 1986, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'James Lapine, Paul Gemignani, Jimmy B. Frazier', 'James Lapine, Stephen Sondheim', 'Mandy Patinkin, Bernadette Peters, Charles Kimbrough, Barbara Bryne, Dana Ivey, Mary D''Arcy, Sue Anne Gershenson, Cris Groenendaal', null, 'The days leading up to the completion of his most famous painting, A Sunday Afternoon on the Island of La Grande Jatte, Georges Seurat is struggling to make meaningful art and maintaining a relationship with his lover, Dot. Amid the scorn of the artistic community, Seurat''s artistic ability thrives while his love diminishes. A century later, Seurat''s descendant – named George and also an artist – finds himself burnt out and in search of what artistic path to follow, but he finds the answer to his future in the past.', 'The days leading up to the completion of his most famous painting, A Sunday Afternoon on the Island of La Grande Jatte, Georges Seurat is struggling to make meaningful art and maintaining a relationship with his lover, Dot. Amid the scorn of the artistic community, Seurat''s artistic ability thrives while his love diminishes. A century later, Seurat''s descendant – named George and also an artist – finds himself burnt out and in search of what artistic path to follow, but he finds the answer to his future in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbPauGSflQzJtLojan9H4WwXjJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155526'),
  ('788105273043115275', 'Sunday Light', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'José Luis Garci, Félix "Chango" Monti, Salvador Gómez Cuenca', 'Horacio Valcárcel', 'Alfredo Landa, Paula Echevarría, Álex González, Kiti Mánver, Manuel Galiana, Toni Acosta, Enrique Villén, Andrea Tenuta', null, 'The small Asturian village of Cenciella, Spain, at the beginning of the twentieth century. The quiet life of Urbano and Estrella, a kind and naive couple in love, is seriously altered when they get involved in the fierce struggle between the local political factions.', 'The small Asturian village of Cenciella, Spain, at the beginning of the twentieth century. The quiet life of Urbano and Estrella, a kind and naive couple in love, is seriously altered when they get involved in the fierce struggle between the local political factions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhKNyhPpSO3gHwsnCwb8d90kTkB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189362'),
  ('603457269551601618', 'Sunday Lovers', 1980, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Dino Risi, Édouard Molinaro, Bryan Forbes', null, 'Roger Moore, Lino Ventura, Ugo Tognazzi, Gene Wilder, Lynn Redgrave, Kathleen Quinlan, Catherine Salviat, Priscilla Barnes', 'R', 'A sex comedy anthology containing four stories, each from a different country (England, France, USA and Italy). "An Englishman''s Home" "The French Method" "Armando''s Notebook" "Skippy"', 'A sex comedy anthology containing four stories, each from a different country (England, France, USA and Italy). "An Englishman''s Home" "The French Method" "Armando''s Notebook" "Skippy"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7comOeg1isuN28AEGzGwtOXf007.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138100'),
  ('933583391457073170', 'Sunday Lunch', 2015, 'Animation', 'Céline Devaux', 'Céline Devaux', 'Vincent Macaigne, George Blagden', null, 'It''s Sunday. During the course of the meal, Jean observes family members. They ask you questions without listening to the answers... It is normal, Sunday dinner.', 'It''s Sunday. During the course of the meal, Jean observes family members. They ask you questions without listening to the answers... It is normal, Sunday dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/af5inEJHgO631C9SM9Hn1ZJof0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378138'),
  ('505492407314022586', 'Sunday Ninth', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Kat Steppe, Renaat Lambeets, Lander Bergs, Philippe Chatard, Francis Isebaert, Valérie Pangrazzi, Robin Peys, Bo Sels, Viktor Renson, Pauline Sonnet, Tuur Truyens, Bram Vaesken, Lennert Verdoodt', 'Kat Steppe', 'Peter van den Begin, Kristien De Proost, Josse De Pauw, Frank Lammers, Yoann Blanc', null, 'Two estranged brothers reunite when one faces Alzheimer''s. As financial troubles tempt one to pursue his brother''s inheritance, an unexpected visitor from the past forces long-buried family secrets to surface.', 'Two estranged brothers reunite when one faces Alzheimer''s. As financial troubles tempt one to pursue his brother''s inheritance, an unexpected visitor from the past forces long-buried family secrets to surface.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fn3ZrlBGLWAUCmFqd2hPboeCGNPA.jpg', 'plex:movie:sunday-ninth'),
  ('96483019988552856', 'Sunday Too Far Away', 1975, 'Drama', 'Ken Hannam, Geoff Burton', 'John Dingwall', 'Jack Thompson, Max Cullen, Reg Lye, Robert Bruning, Peter Cummins, John Ewart, Jerry Thomas, Sean Scully', null, 'The harsh, competitive world of Australian sheep-shearers provides the setting for this powerful film. Foley and ''Black Arthur'' do battle for the position of ''top shearer'' amid the boozy world of men isolated from civilisation. After weeks of work they are confronted with non-union labour undercutting them - a situation which leads to a violent conclusion.', 'The harsh, competitive world of Australian sheep-shearers provides the setting for this powerful film. Foley and ''Black Arthur'' do battle for the position of ''top shearer'' amid the boozy world of men isolated from civilisation. After weeks of work they are confronted with non-union labour undercutting them - a situation which leads to a violent conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y86mrn2zXLFauAbqnk1tNJFzKuM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78094'),
  ('1149278310347621807', 'Sunday''s Children', 1992, 'Drama', 'Daniel Bergman, Steve St. Peter', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Thommy Berggren, Henrik Linnros, Lena Endre, Jacob Leygraf, Anna Linnros, Malin Ek, Marie Richardson, Irma Christenson', 'NR', 'Little Pu spends a summer in Norrland with all his relatives. He and his brother get to hear the story about the watchmaker who hung himself, learns to shoot with a bow and follow his father on a bicycle trip.', 'Little Pu spends a summer in Norrland with all his relatives. He and his brother get to hear the story about the watchmaker who hung himself, learns to shoot with a bow and follow his father on a bicycle trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5voeZ9EYU8PzTamQfmBTmSrXiuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41770'),
  ('339549318035066346', 'Sunday''s Illness', 2018, 'Drama', 'Ramón Salazar, Ricardo de Gracia', 'Ramón Salazar', 'Bárbara Lennie, Susi Sánchez, Greta Fernández, Miguel Ángel Solá, Richard Bohringer, Bruna González, David Kammenos, Ima Ranedo', 'PG-13', 'Annabel is a successful businesswoman with a wealthy husband. At a reception in her villa she meets a woman, a member of the catering staff who has been hired for the evening. This woman is none other than her own daughter Chiara, whom she had left over thirty years ago. Chiara was just eight years old at the time. She now approaches her mother with an unusual request: to spend ten days together with her.', 'Annabel is a successful businesswoman with a wealthy husband. At a reception in her villa she meets a woman, a member of the catering staff who has been hired for the evening. This woman is none other than her own daughter Chiara, whom she had left over thirty years ago. Chiara was just eight years old at the time. She now approaches her mother with an unusual request: to spend ten days together with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqSYUeWKo7CfJqJh8uIzpeTuXqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442811'),
  ('554381859552335491', 'Sundays', 2025, 'Drama', 'Alauda Ruiz de Azúa, Bet Rourich, Eva Leira', 'Alauda Ruiz de Azúa', 'Blanca Soroa, Patricia López Arnaiz, Miguel Garcés, Juan Minujín, Mabel Rivera, Nagore Aranburu, Irina Robledo Espinosa, Nora Careaga Iglesias', 'PG-13', '17-year-old Ainara is a student at a Catholic secondary school, and is about to take her final year exams and choose her future university course. To everyone’s surprise, this brilliant young girl announces to her family that she wants to take part in an induction period at a convent in order to embrace the religious life. Nobody was expecting this. While her father seems to be won over by his daughter’s aspirations, for Maite, Ainara’s aunt, this unexpected vocation is the manifestation of a deeper problem.', '17-year-old Ainara is a student at a Catholic secondary school, and is about to take her final year exams and choose her future university course. To everyone’s surprise, this brilliant young girl announces to her family that she wants to take part in an induction period at a convent in order to embrace the religious life. Nobody was expecting this. While her father seems to be won over by his daughter’s aspirations, for Maite, Ainara’s aunt, this unexpected vocation is the manifestation of a deeper problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3682SbY3rsNKsQzFpPUKrWdGmmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1443576'),
  ('508955732235363170', 'Sundays and Cybele', 1962, 'Drama', 'Serge Bourguignon, Henri Decaë', 'Serge Bourguignon, Antoine Tudal', 'Hardy Krüger, Nicole Courcel, Patricia Gozzi, Daniel Ivernel, André Oumansky, Anne-Marie Coffinet, René Clermont, Malka Ribowska', null, 'The tragic story of a young orphan girl who is befriended by an innocent but emotionally disabled veteran of the French Indochina War.', 'The tragic story of a young orphan girl who is befriended by an innocent but emotionally disabled veteran of the French Indochina War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9L5DtYYlO3yrg2qtTCxROLnLl2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43001'),
  ('704992729638460043', 'Sundays at Tiffany''s', 2010, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Adam Swica, Mark Piznarski', 'Jennifer Heath, Heather Maidat, Nancey Silvers', 'Alyssa Milano, Eric Winter, Kristin Booth, Emily Alyn Lind, Ivan Sergei, Stockard Channing, Robyn Thaler Hickey, Mo Kelso', null, 'Jane, a soon-to-be-married woman, is reunited with her imaginary friend Michael who returns in a human form. Soon, Jane begins doubting her feelings for her fiance as she gets attracted to Michael.', 'Jane, a soon-to-be-married woman, is reunited with her imaginary friend Michael who returns in a human form. Soon, Jane begins doubting her feelings for her fiance as she gets attracted to Michael.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95wNSQvguF9XdGP3KMeIbsVHU6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60695'),
  ('11239996906523075', 'Sundays on Leave', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nae Caranfil, Ion Diaconeasa, Gabriel Bucur', 'Nae Caranfil', 'Nathalie Bonnifay, George Alexandru, Marius Stănescu, Valentin Teodosiu, Florin Călinescu, Liviu Topuzu, Marius Florea Vizante, Marcela Motoc', null, 'It is late in the Ceausescu era in Romania, and Cristina is having a difficult time with her boyfriend. He wants her to have sex with him before he goes off to do his obligatory stint in the army. She wants him to marry her first. She also gets involved with a slightly rebellious actor, a would-be ladies'' man. He has some vague plans to defect - could those be the reason he is receiving mysterious phone calls? Or are they the work of his anonymous admirer?', 'It is late in the Ceausescu era in Romania, and Cristina is having a difficult time with her boyfriend. He wants her to have sex with him before he goes off to do his obligatory stint in the army. She wants him to marry her first. She also gets involved with a slightly rebellious actor, a would-be ladies'' man. He has some vague plans to defect - could those be the reason he is receiving mysterious phone calls? Or are they the work of his anonymous admirer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvxIwusPhAm9kGTdjSrRIeKAgqs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196928'),
  ('128682520717695926', 'Sundown', 1941, 'War, Drama, Adventure', 'Henry Hathaway, Charles Lang, Arthur Jacobson', 'Barré Lyndon', 'Bruce Cabot, George Sanders, Gene Tierney, Reginald Gardiner, Joseph Calleia, Carl Esmond, Harry Carey, Marc Lawrence', 'NR', 'Englishmen fighting Nazis in Africa discover an exotic mystery woman living among the natives and enlist her aid in overcoming the Germans.', 'Englishmen fighting Nazis in Africa discover an exotic mystery woman living among the natives and enlist her aid in overcoming the Germans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4R2c2fp9wULd5W57myi3hUy5mKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94241'),
  ('280868605206438287', 'Sundown', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Fernando Lebrija', 'George Huang, Fernando Lebrija, Miguel Tejada-Flores', 'Devon Werkheiser, Sean Marquette, Silverio Palacios, Camilla Belle, Jordi Mollà, Teri Hatcher, John Michael Higgins, Sara Paxton', null, 'High school seniors Logan and Blake prepare for an epic Spring Break as they travel to the beautiful and exotic Mexican beach resort of Puerto Vallarta hoping to hook up with their high school crushes. Surrounded by hot girls in teeny bikinis, the guys are truly in heaven. After meeting at a club, Logan falls for a mysterious local beauty named Gaby but then realizes the next morning, when his grandfather’s Rolex watch is missing, that she was after more than just his heart.', 'High school seniors Logan and Blake prepare for an epic Spring Break as they travel to the beautiful and exotic Mexican beach resort of Puerto Vallarta hoping to hook up with their high school crushes. Surrounded by hot girls in teeny bikinis, the guys are truly in heaven. After meeting at a club, Logan falls for a mysterious local beauty named Gaby but then realizes the next morning, when his grandfather’s Rolex watch is missing, that she was after more than just his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuqB9ejNH7w4n2067ZSMuwhNnwm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267800'),
  ('592332089230165531', 'Sundown', 2020, 'Animation, Drama', 'Juliette Brocal, Camille Letouze, Ana Moniz', null, 'Léna Soussan, Clara Poudevigne, Sam Horowitz, Léonard Hicks, Daria Pisareva', null, 'A traditional dance troupe prepares for the opening of the Summer Solstice Festival. The group is scheduled to take the stage in a few minutes, but one member is missing.', 'A traditional dance troupe prepares for the opening of the Summer Solstice Festival. The group is scheduled to take the stage in a few minutes, but one member is missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wrEQIRWnQyvfeiqWegaBwhbl5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763464'),
  ('298718635331980938', 'Sundown', 2022, 'Drama', 'Michel Franco, Yves Cape, Renan Bendersky', 'Michel Franco', 'Tim Roth, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Iazua Larios, Henry Goodman, Albertine Kotting McMillan, Samuel Bottomley, Godriyah Faoziati, Ely Guerra', 'R', 'When a distant emergency disrupts a vacation in Acapulco, simmering tensions rise to the fore between scions of a wealthy British family.', 'When a distant emergency disrupts a vacation in Acapulco, simmering tensions rise to the fore between scions of a wealthy British family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12D7arRdEJ9EUk6FPPJfNmWyxjO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854359'),
  ('621549675121722598', 'Sundown: The Vampire in Retreat', 1991, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Anthony Hickox, Levie Isaacks', 'Anthony Hickox, John Burgess', 'David Carradine, Morgan Brittany, Bruce Campbell, Deborah Foreman, Jim Metzler, Maxwell Caulfield, M. Emmet Walsh, John Ireland', null, 'Reclusive vampires lounge in a lonely American town. They wear sunscreen to protect themselves. A descendant of Van Helsing arrives with hilarious consequences.', 'Reclusive vampires lounge in a lonely American town. They wear sunscreen to protect themselves. A descendant of Van Helsing arrives with hilarious consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afyyaG2uJJIXCKn5kDoWT5aJiQS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16159'),
  ('745701910103277691', 'Sundutan', 2026, 'Drama', 'Rodante Pajemna Jr.', null, 'Allison Ross, Jade Esguerra, Mark Dionisio, Zia Zamora, Primo Angeles', null, 'A hole on the wall accidentally connects two women emotionally and physically. Forbidden love, greed, betrayal... what lies beyond the hole? And for how long can they keep covering it up?', 'A hole on the wall accidentally connects two women emotionally and physically. Forbidden love, greed, betrayal... what lies beyond the hole? And for how long can they keep covering it up?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2neZgVuY7prWIak5hhNKT53Hk0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1646787'),
  ('71070165067423554', 'Sune''s Summer', 1993, 'Comedy, Family', 'Stephan Apelgren, Jan Alvermark, Andra Lasmanis', 'Stephan Apelgren', 'Andreas Hoffer, Gabriel Odenhammar, Peter Haber, Carina Lidbom, Nina Almlöf, Lars Väringer, Anna von Rosen, Pär Ericson', null, 'It''s summer and Sune Andersson''s family is planning a holiday in Greece. Sune''s father, Rudolf is sulking because then he won''t be able to go on his beloved fishing trip. But after seeing how much the Greek trip is going to cost, he comes up with a great idea: Let''s go on a camping trip instead. A lot is happens during this trip and after a while Rudolf discovers that the camping trip might not be as cheat as he thought.', 'It''s summer and Sune Andersson''s family is planning a holiday in Greece. Sune''s father, Rudolf is sulking because then he won''t be able to go on his beloved fishing trip. But after seeing how much the Greek trip is going to cost, he comes up with a great idea: Let''s go on a camping trip instead. A lot is happens during this trip and after a while Rudolf discovers that the camping trip might not be as cheat as he thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54gPbrAGeyLDKLkAu8fIdBU9geI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30149'),
  ('869691799712509762', 'Sunflower', 1970, 'Drama, War', 'Giuseppe Rotunno, Vittorio De Sica, Paolo Serbandini', 'Tonino Guerra, Cesare Zavattini, Giorgi Mdivani', 'Sophia Loren, Marcello Mastroianni, Ludmila Savelyeva, Galina Andreeva, Anna Carena, Germano Longo, Glauco Onorato, Silvano Tranquilli', 'G', 'After World War II, a woman refuses to believe her husband, missing on the Russian front, is dead. Flashbacks reveal their brief courtship and marriage. Years later, she travels to Russia with his photo, determined to find him. What will she discover?', 'After World War II, a woman refuses to believe her husband, missing on the Russian front, is dead. Flashbacks reveal their brief courtship and marriage. Years later, she travels to Russia with his photo, determined to find him. What will she discover?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVxcQRc3xfA2IOOzXHT0ML1CjzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1863'),
  ('227160806917367046', 'Sunflower', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zhang Yang, Jong Lin', 'Xin Huo, Zhang Yang, Cai Shangjun', 'Joan Chen, Gao Ge, Wang Haidi, Liang Jing, Liu Zifeng, Li Bin', null, 'Sunflower is the story of the Zhang family in Beijing father, mother and son across three decades, centering on the tensions and misunderstandings between father and son. Nine-year-old Xiangyang is having the time of his life, free of adult supervision until the day he meets the father he can hardly remember. Having spent years away, he returns with strong ideas about his son learning to draw. But Xiangyang chafes under his father''s constant rules and soon stages his own revolution against the lessons enforced.', 'Sunflower is the story of the Zhang family in Beijing father, mother and son across three decades, centering on the tensions and misunderstandings between father and son. Nine-year-old Xiangyang is having the time of his life, free of adult supervision until the day he meets the father he can hardly remember. Having spent years away, he returns with strong ideas about his son learning to draw. But Xiangyang chafes under his father''s constant rules and soon stages his own revolution against the lessons enforced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7NsjHTppTK8KfFBJRk6J4Su6ct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38019'),
  ('1091146109258963617', 'Sunflower', 2006, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kang Suk-bum', 'Kang Suk-bum', 'Kim Rae-won, Kim Hae-sook, Huh Yi-jae, Kim Byeong-ok, Kim Jung-tae, Han Jung-soo, Ji Dae-han, Park Sung-woong', null, 'Tae-sik gets out of a prison after spending 10 years for killing a man and wishes nothing but an ordinary life. A local lady welcomes him into her household like a son and he gets a second chance in life. His former gang tries to destroy his new home in order to build a night club but he won’t let them destroy his new family.', 'Tae-sik gets out of a prison after spending 10 years for killing a man and wishes nothing but an ordinary life. A local lady welcomes him into her household like a son and he gets a second chance in life. His former gang tries to destroy his new home in order to build a night club but he won’t let them destroy his new family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgxZrB4r4OimjYMUZlt6ZmaUm81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49283'),
  ('190964187398771959', 'Sunlight Jr.', 2013, 'Drama', 'Laurie Collyer, Igor Martinović', 'Laurie Collyer', 'Naomi Watts, Matt Dillon, Norman Reedus, Tess Harper, Antoni Corone, William Haze, Yvonne Gougelet, Leyla Lawrence', null, 'Quickie-mart employee Melissa and paraplegic Richie are very much in love. Supported only by Melissa’s small hourly wage, they are nevertheless thrilled to learn that Melissa is pregnant. Then their situation deteriorates, and their tenuous financial situation threatens to bring their happy life crashing down.', 'Quickie-mart employee Melissa and paraplegic Richie are very much in love. Supported only by Melissa’s small hourly wage, they are nevertheless thrilled to learn that Melissa is pregnant. Then their situation deteriorates, and their tenuous financial situation threatens to bring their happy life crashing down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rL1dhso58VmJnCwSSwGsT4usjB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173908'),
  ('450514182008017086', 'Sunny', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Jang-mi, Lee Sung-jae, Kang Hyoung-chul', 'Kang Hyoung-chul', 'Yoo Ho-jeong, Shim Eun-kyung, Jin Hee-kyung, Kang So-ra, Koh Soo-hee, Kim Min-young, Hong Jin-hee, Park Jin-joo', null, 'Seven girls become good friends in high school, then events pull them apart for 25 years. When one of the friends lies dying in a hospital, she wishes to see each of them one last time.', 'Seven girls become good friends in high school, then events pull them apart for 25 years. When one of the friends lies dying in a hospital, she wishes to see each of them one last time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m21yedsv5rGNmvOU0X9ARvxC0XM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77117'),
  ('984670958176289314', 'Sunny Dancer', 2026, 'Drama', 'George Jaques, Oliver Loncraine, Kevin Woodhouse', 'George Jaques', 'Bella Ramsey, Daniel Quinn-Toye, Ruby Stokes, Earl Cave, Conrad Khan, Jasmine Elcock, Neil Patrick Harris, Jessica Gunning', null, 'Ivy is a teenager in remission from cancer, whose mum and dad insist she attend Children Run Free Camp, a summer retreat for young adults affected by cancer. However, as Ivy is reluctantly dragged through camp experience, she discovers new feelings with new friends.', 'Ivy is a teenager in remission from cancer, whose mum and dad insist she attend Children Run Free Camp, a summer retreat for young adults affected by cancer. However, as Ivy is reluctantly dragged through camp experience, she discovers new feelings with new friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQFxX09ufsOmrDdwwownxRAlqv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280015'),
  ('977727617825850077', 'Sunny Sanskari Ki Tulsi Kumari', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Shashank Khaitan, Manush Nandan, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Shashank Khaitan', 'Varun Dhawan, Janhvi Kapoor, Sanya Malhotra, Rohit Saraf, Maniesh Paul, Akshay Oberoi, Abhinav Sharma, Manini Chadha', null, 'Two former lovers in Delhi try to rekindle old flames, leading to amusing mix-ups and deceptions. As chaos unfolds, a new unexpected romance blooms. Who will find their happy ending amid the confusion?', 'Two former lovers in Delhi try to rekindle old flames, leading to amusing mix-ups and deceptions. As chaos unfolds, a new unexpected romance blooms. Who will find their happy ending amid the confusion?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3lncTnK86R8XylpXgpe0JfU1wm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1248454'),
  ('335589866875506853', 'Sunny Side Up', 1929, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Ernest Palmer, John Schmitz, David Butler', 'Lew Brown', 'Janet Gaynor, Charles Farrell, Marjorie White, El Brendel, Mary Forbes, Jackie Cooper, Henry Armetta, Peter Gawthorne', null, 'Molly and Bee, sweet young ''working girls,'' live in a cheap room over a New York grocery store. Molly''s idol, wealthy Jack Cromwell, lives in a Long Island mansion but is markedly less happy, since his fiancée Jane won''t discourage her other admirers. Fleeing in his car, Jack ends up in an urban block party where he meets you-know-who.', 'Molly and Bee, sweet young ''working girls,'' live in a cheap room over a New York grocery store. Molly''s idol, wealthy Jack Cromwell, lives in a Long Island mansion but is markedly less happy, since his fiancée Jane won''t discourage her other admirers. Fleeing in his car, Jack ends up in an urban block party where he meets you-know-who.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPINZiaEZg8R2cVIGQvsBYCCEcL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86360'),
  ('591058269824952653', 'Sunny Spells', 2008, 'Romance', 'Diastème', 'Diastème, Christophe Honoré', 'Bruno Todeschini, Emma de Caunes, Léa Drucker, Frédéric Andrau, Olivier Py, Linh-Dan Pham, Judith El Zein, Olivier Marchal', null, 'This is not a chorus film. Well maybe just a little… Avignon Festival - Summer. First, there’s Maud and Alex, who have just broken up but need to pretend to be two love birds on stage. Then there’s the playwright of their play, Richard, who could start to fall in love with Léna, but is still grieving his lost wife. Léna is also grieving her ex but can’t remember why she dumped him. So she sings her blues, on stage, with Louise, who might have a little crush on her sound engineer. Then there’s the famous dancer Kate who sleeps with her assistant Marko, who’s always prefered men. Oh, did we tell you that Kate the dancer and Maud the actress are friends and would love to invite everyone to a party?', 'This is not a chorus film. Well maybe just a little… Avignon Festival - Summer. First, there’s Maud and Alex, who have just broken up but need to pretend to be two love birds on stage. Then there’s the playwright of their play, Richard, who could start to fall in love with Léna, but is still grieving his lost wife. Léna is also grieving her ex but can’t remember why she dumped him. So she sings her blues, on stage, with Louise, who might have a little crush on her sound engineer. Then there’s the famous dancer Kate who sleeps with her assistant Marko, who’s always prefered men. Oh, did we tell you that Kate the dancer and Maud the actress are friends and would love to invite everyone to a party?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCNTzFaGky9JP93RxPG4ig2l9sE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63332'),
  ('242843938356369290', 'Sunny: Our Hearts Beat Together', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hitoshi One, Keiji Hashimoto, Shôichi Atô', 'Hitoshi One', 'Ryoko Shinohara, Suzu Hirose, Yuka Itaya, Maika Yamamoto, Eiko Koike, Mio Noda, Rie Tomosaka, Momoko Tanabe', null, 'A group of friends from high school days reunite for once more time before one of them dies from cancer.', 'A group of friends from high school days reunite for once more time before one of them dies from cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsYLaz86lWeFHSJSYoidJG39383.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517065'),
  ('946432763503260222', 'Sunnyside', 1919, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charlie Chaplin, Roland Totheroh', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Henry Bergman, Tom Terriss, Tom Wilson, Lulu Jenks, Granville Redmond', null, 'An overworked farmhand who works also at the adjacent hotel dreams of marrying the village belle.', 'An overworked farmhand who works also at the adjacent hotel dreams of marrying the village belle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qcSey0jmMZyEeKUeDD7ZdmnPRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53424'),
  ('509104699891767400', 'Sunray: Fallen Soldier', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'James Clarke, Daniel Shepherd', 'James Clarke, Daniel Shepherd, Sam Seeley', 'Tip Cullen, Tom Leigh, Luke Solomon, Steven Blades, Andy Gatenby, Kevin Golding, Franky Lankester, Alex Montagnani', null, 'Forced to confront the death of his daughter following a fatal encounter with drugs, ex-military soldier Andy becomes hell-bent on finding those responsible. With nothing to lose, a violent criminal underworld unravels in his wake.', 'Forced to confront the death of his daughter following a fatal encounter with drugs, ex-military soldier Andy becomes hell-bent on finding those responsible. With nothing to lose, a violent criminal underworld unravels in his wake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghLaj5dBrdUsD4wjq3QERcisr5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1279947'),
  ('215900419629624286', 'Sunrise', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Andrew Baird, Ivan Abel', 'Ronan Blaney', 'Alex Pettyfer, Guy Pearce, Olwen Fouéré, Crystal Yu, William Gao, Kurt Yaeger, Richard Pettyfer, Forrest Bothwell', 'R', 'When an ex-cop named Fallon returns to the scene of a horrific crime, the residents of a rural town soon discover that this dark visitor is really a vampire who feeds on blood and fear. After he is befriended by a kind immigrant family, the instinctive killer is faced with a choice between revenge and redemption.', 'When an ex-cop named Fallon returns to the scene of a horrific crime, the residents of a rural town soon discover that this dark visitor is really a vampire who feeds on blood and fear. After he is befriended by a kind immigrant family, the instinctive killer is faced with a choice between revenge and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4aRvg2ybz646gciX5M6qaclunC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1216784'),
  ('331153291266246111', 'Sunrise at Campobello', 1960, 'Drama, History', 'Vincent J. Donehue, Russell Harlan, Wes McAfee', 'Dore Schary', 'Ralph Bellamy, Greer Garson, Hume Cronyn, Jean Hagen, Ann Shoemaker, Alan Bunce, Tim Considine, Zina Bethune', null, 'The story of Franklin Roosevelt''s bout with polio at age 40 in 1921 and how his family (and especially his wife Eleanor) cope with his illness. From being stricken while vacationing at Campobello to his triumphant nominating speech for Al Smith''s presidency in 1924, the story follows the various influences on his life and his determination to recover.', 'The story of Franklin Roosevelt''s bout with polio at age 40 in 1921 and how his family (and especially his wife Eleanor) cope with his illness. From being stricken while vacationing at Campobello to his triumphant nominating speech for Al Smith''s presidency in 1924, the story follows the various influences on his life and his determination to recover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9cJA6rz0cEcPmehvc1Rr1GvvCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72354'),
  ('631643895270225639', 'Sunset', 1988, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Western', 'Blake Edwards', 'Blake Edwards', 'James Garner, Bruce Willis, Malcolm McDowell, Mariel Hemingway, Kathleen Quinlan, Jennifer Edwards, Patricia Hodge, Richard Bradford', 'R', 'Tom Mix and Wyatt Earp team up to solve a murder at the Academy Awards in 1929 Hollywood.', 'Tom Mix and Wyatt Earp team up to solve a murder at the Academy Awards in 1929 Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQZtPZwcVMBNoT8hrNpOFNIPQv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38560'),
  ('204981852952049787', 'Sunset', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Mátyás Erdély, László Nemes', 'László Nemes, Matthieu Taponier, Clara Royer', 'Juli Jakab, Vlad Ivanov, Evelin Dobos, Susanne Wuest, Judit Pecháček, Levente Molnár, Christian Harting, Julia Jakubowska', 'R', 'In 1913, an orphaned young woman arrives in Budapest to take up employment as a milliner at the hat store that belonged to her late parents but becomes mired in a search for a brother she had never known of.', 'In 1913, an orphaned young woman arrives in Budapest to take up employment as a milliner at the hat store that belonged to her late parents but becomes mired in a search for a brother she had never known of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kIS2hHxVy3laSWxLjkN5VSibza.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399056'),
  ('308449766435766817', 'Sunset Boulevard', 1950, 'Drama', 'Billy Wilder, John F. Seitz, Charles C. Coleman', 'Billy Wilder, D.M. Marshman Jr., Charles Brackett', 'William Holden, Gloria Swanson, Erich von Stroheim, Nancy Olson, Fred Clark, Lloyd Gough, Jack Webb, Franklyn Farnum', 'NR', 'A hack screenwriter writes a screenplay for a former silent film star who has faded into Hollywood obscurity.', 'A hack screenwriter writes a screenplay for a former silent film star who has faded into Hollywood obscurity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zt8aQ6ksqK6p1AopC5zVTDS9pKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599'),
  ('785994640840294565', 'Sunset Cove', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Al Adamson, Gary Graver', 'Cash Maintenant, Budd Donnelly', 'Jay B. Larson, Burr Smidt, Ray Andrews, Karen Fredrik, Steven Fisher, John Carradine, Sherri Coyle, Jenni Bardell', null, 'At the end of the school year, a group of students head out to Sunset Cove and do everything they can to save their favourite beach.', 'At the end of the school year, a group of students head out to Sunset Cove and do everything they can to save their favourite beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XfQKVIIIALFNVeT79I20ERSQq1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328938'),
  ('114004436425803533', 'Sunset Grill', 1993, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Kevin Connor, Douglas Milsome', 'Marcus Wright, Faruque Ahmed', 'Peter Weller, Lori Singer, Stacy Keach, Alexandra Paul, John Rhys-Davies, Randy Pelish, Michael Anderson Jr., Peter Koch', 'R', 'Ryder Hart is a private investigator and former police officer who is down on his luck and drinks too much. His estranged wife Anita runs a bar and restaurant called the Sunset Grill and is romantically involved with Jeff Carruthers, a detective who worked with Hart. When someone close to them is murdered, Hart and Carruthers team up to try to solve the crime.', 'Ryder Hart is a private investigator and former police officer who is down on his luck and drinks too much. His estranged wife Anita runs a bar and restaurant called the Sunset Grill and is romantically involved with Jeff Carruthers, a detective who worked with Hart. When someone close to them is murdered, Hart and Carruthers team up to try to solve the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVsYm0wXXYXheChjkVVLA4HO6cB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224266'),
  ('631802107482456860', 'Sunset Heat', 1992, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'John Nicolella, Charles Rosher Jr.', 'Max Strom, John Allen Nelson', 'Michael Paré, Adam Ant, Dennis Hopper, Daphne Ashbrook, Charlie Schlatter, Tracy Tweed, Little Richard, Luca Bercovici', null, 'A former drug-dealer photojournalist returns to Los Angeles and helps friends terrorized by his ex-partner.', 'A former drug-dealer photojournalist returns to Los Angeles and helps friends terrorized by his ex-partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijS7XPrSeZUj7EtzzoqfjsG3yeL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91403'),
  ('295461036709595023', 'Sunset in My Hometown', 2018, 'Drama, Music', 'Lee Joon-ik, Lee Eui-tae, Yoo Huck-jun', 'Kim Se-gyeom', 'Park Jeong-min, Kim Go-eun, Jang Hang-seon, Go Joon, Shin Hyun-been, Jeong Gyu-su, Kim Jun-han, Jeong Seon-cheol', null, 'On the day that underground rapper Hak-soo fails his 7th audition, he receives a call from his hometown that his father is in the hospital. But he finds out that it was his father''s plot to bring him to Byeon-san. To top it all, he is suspected as a phishing scam criminal and locked up in this small, boring suburb.', 'On the day that underground rapper Hak-soo fails his 7th audition, he receives a call from his hometown that his father is in the hospital. But he finds out that it was his father''s plot to bring him to Byeon-san. To top it all, he is suspected as a phishing scam criminal and locked up in this small, boring suburb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yB4L8TZhuHZ9s7VgK0Dw0wUGZL4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529859'),
  ('21331270119660673', 'Sunset Park', 1996, 'Drama', 'Steve Gomer, Robbie Greenberg, Gary Marcus', 'Seth Zvi Rosenfeld, Kathleen McGhee-Anderson', 'Rhea Perlman, Fredro Starr, Carol Kane, Terrence Howard, Camille Saviola, De''Aundre Bonds, Talent Harris, Anthony C. Hall', null, 'A white teacher takes over a talented, but undisciplined Black high school basketball team and turns them into winners.', 'A white teacher takes over a talented, but undisciplined Black high school basketball team and turns them into winners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkt8cYfOV6vcqlDbut7jak9qaPh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29649'),
  ('4174620559839129', 'Sunset Song', 2015, 'Drama, History', 'Terence Davies, Michael McDonough, Stephen Mason', 'Terence Davies', 'Agyness Deyn, Peter Mullan, Kevin Guthrie, Ken Blackburn, Mark Bonnar, Stuart Bowman, Emily-Jane Boyle, Ewan Comes', 'PG-13', 'The daughter of a Scottish farmer comes of age in the early 1900s.', 'The daughter of a Scottish farmer comes of age in the early 1900s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loBR4Qm16d0gtaCJ7T1gknMtK4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277713'),
  ('507528415712580622', 'Sunset Strip', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Adam Collis, Ron Fortunato, Louis Shaw Milito', 'Randall Jahnson, Russell DeGrazier', 'Anna Friel, Nick Stahl, Rory Cochrane, Adam Goldberg, Tommy Flanagan, John Randolph, Stephanie Romanov, Jared Leto', 'R', 'A day in Hollywood, 1972, with young people looking for the 24 hours that will change their lives. Zach will open that night for a British rocker at Whisky a Go-Go; he lives in a canyon and plays impromptu duets with a mysterious guitarist he doesn''t see. Tammy is a costume designer, open to quick sex with the various rockers she works with and loved from afar by Michael, a photographer recovering from a case of the clap. His good friend is Felix, a morose, alcoholic songwriter. On hand for comic relief is Marty Shapiro, a fast-talking record producer. Getting ready for the gig at the club, Zach''s performance, and the early-morning aftermath comprise the film.', 'A day in Hollywood, 1972, with young people looking for the 24 hours that will change their lives. Zach will open that night for a British rocker at Whisky a Go-Go; he lives in a canyon and plays impromptu duets with a mysterious guitarist he doesn''t see. Tammy is a costume designer, open to quick sex with the various rockers she works with and loved from afar by Michael, a photographer recovering from a case of the clap. His good friend is Felix, a morose, alcoholic songwriter. On hand for comic relief is Marty Shapiro, a fast-talking record producer. Getting ready for the gig at the club, Zach''s performance, and the early-morning aftermath comprise the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9awEAeVvMolWIAmmqTYeRyXagM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117262'),
  ('1010123668862346389', 'Sunshine', 1973, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Joseph Sargent, Bill Butler', 'Carol Sobieski', 'Cristina Raines, Cliff DeYoung, Meg Foster, Brenda Vaccaro, Bill Mumy, Alan Fudge, Corey Fischer, Lindsay Greenbush', 'G', 'A young woman living in the woods with her husband, a struggling musician, and her young daughter, discovers she has terminal cancer. She begins to tape-record a journal of the time she has left so her daughter will know something of her when she grows up.', 'A young woman living in the woods with her husband, a struggling musician, and her young daughter, discovers she has terminal cancer. She begins to tape-record a journal of the time she has left so her daughter will know something of her when she grows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32ABwDLbZmUhCyvOuJL8B9oyOpt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327160'),
  ('782836496543152454', 'Sunshine', 1999, 'Drama, History, Romance, War', 'Lajos Koltai, István Szabó, Gábor Gajdos', 'Israel Horovitz, István Szabó', 'Ralph Fiennes, Rosemary Harris, Rachel Weisz, Jennifer Ehle, Deborah Kara Unger, William Hurt, Molly Parker, James Frain', 'R', 'The fate of a Hungarian Jewish family throughout the 20th century.', 'The fate of a Hungarian Jewish family throughout the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcHDFrjClW35u0dSuLjsQEi8gDk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17771'),
  ('100395480157841621', 'Sunshine', 2007, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Danny Boyle, Alwin H. Küchler, David Warren', 'Alex Garland', 'Cillian Murphy, Rose Byrne, Chris Evans, Michelle Yeoh, Cliff Curtis, Hiroyuki Sanada, Troy Garity, Benedict Wong', 'R', 'Fifty years into the future, the sun is dying, and Earth is threatened by arctic temperatures. A team of astronauts is sent to revive the Sun — but the mission fails. Seven years later, a new team is sent to finish the mission as mankind’s last hope.', 'Fifty years into the future, the sun is dying, and Earth is threatened by arctic temperatures. A team of astronauts is sent to revive the Sun — but the mission fails. Seven years later, a new team is sent to finish the mission as mankind’s last hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKGGeJ8qvm0UmClz43VJ31fzPP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1272'),
  ('185019822600734741', 'Sunshine Barry & the Disco Worms', 2008, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Thomas Borch Nielsen', 'Morten Dragsted', 'Peter Frödin, Lars Hjortshøj, Troels Lyby, Helle Dolleris, Birthe Neumann, Peter Hesse Overgaard, Trine Dyrholm, Henning Jensen', null, 'It''s not easy to be Barry. An earthworm gets no respect. He lives at the bottom of the food chain. But one day, an old disco record turns his life upside down. Suddenly he sees before him his own destiny, the star of the world''s greatest disco band: Sunshine Barry &amp; The Disco Worms! Okay, he''s got no arms, no rhythm and no band. But as Barry says: "We''ll do it anyway!"', 'It''s not easy to be Barry. An earthworm gets no respect. He lives at the bottom of the food chain. But one day, an old disco record turns his life upside down. Suddenly he sees before him his own destiny, the star of the world''s greatest disco band: Sunshine Barry &amp; The Disco Worms! Okay, he''s got no arms, no rhythm and no band. But as Barry says: "We''ll do it anyway!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eW4z9K2w7cZripBDQzdf2EAg07R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15838'),
  ('619069542252311309', 'Sunshine Cleaning', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Christine Jeffs, Chemen A. Ochoa, Gregory J. Smith', 'Megan Holley', 'Amy Adams, Emily Blunt, Steve Zahn, Alan Arkin, Clifton Collins Jr., Eric Christian Olsen, Kevin Chapman, Jason Spevack', 'R', 'A single mother and her slacker sister find an unexpected way to turn their lives around in this off-beat dramatic comedy. In order to raise the tuition to send her young son to private school the mom starts an unusual business – a biohazard removal/crime scene clean-up service.', 'A single mother and her slacker sister find an unexpected way to turn their lives around in this off-beat dramatic comedy. In order to raise the tuition to send her young son to private school the mom starts an unusual business – a biohazard removal/crime scene clean-up service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwtJyfme086wcz9MXpP0i5Hrgxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13090'),
  ('54840904860213028', 'Sunshine for the Poor', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Antoine Héberlé, Alain Guiraudie', 'Alain Guiraudie', 'Isabelle Girardet, Alain Guiraudie, Jean-Paul Jourdàa, Michel Turquin', null, 'On a hot Sunday morning, Nathalie Sanchez, an unemployed hair stylist, walks across the Causses plateau in search of a shepherd. When she finds one, he tells her that he has lost his flock. They walk together and while chatting they meet several times a shepherd''s son turned outlaw, Carol Izba. The latter, despite being pursued by a famous bounty killer, Pool, proves unable to leave the region...', 'On a hot Sunday morning, Nathalie Sanchez, an unemployed hair stylist, walks across the Causses plateau in search of a shepherd. When she finds one, he tells her that he has lost his flock. They walk together and while chatting they meet several times a shepherd''s son turned outlaw, Carol Izba. The latter, despite being pursued by a famous bounty killer, Pool, proves unable to leave the region...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKt2urWc9Fi9snHz2prDmK823og.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190386'),
  ('1024722804114256524', 'Sunshine on Leith', 2013, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'George Richmond, Dexter Fletcher, Helen Fraser', 'Stephen Greenhorn', 'George MacKay, Kevin Guthrie, Paul Brannigan, Jane Horrocks, Peter Mullan, Freya Mavor, Antonia Thomas, Jason Flemyng', 'PG-13', 'Davy and Ally have to re-learn how to live life in Edinburgh after coming home from serving in Afghanistan. Both struggle to learn to live a life outside the army and to deal with the everyday struggles of family, jobs and relationships. Sunshine on Leith is based on the sensational stage hit of the same name, featuring music by pop-folk band The Proclaimers.', 'Davy and Ally have to re-learn how to live life in Edinburgh after coming home from serving in Afghanistan. Both struggle to learn to live a life outside the army and to deal with the everyday struggles of family, jobs and relationships. Sunshine on Leith is based on the sensational stage hit of the same name, featuring music by pop-folk band The Proclaimers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OsWiIBLcYPd2mP6GvyOWykOISJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214100'),
  ('1085234408787971198', 'Sunshine Reggae on Ibiza', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Franz Marischka, Brigitte Thoms, Siegfried Gundel', 'Erich Tomek', 'Karl Dall, Olivia Pascal, Chris Roberts, John Jürgens, Alexander Gittinger, Isa Haller, Bea Fiedler, Werner Böhm', null, 'Karl is a simple farmer who takes a plane to Ibiza to finally meet his idol, pop-singer Linda Lou. Karl has long ago fallen in love with his idol and has written her numerous love letters, But a farmer like Karl is not the kind of man she could be interested in. At the same time however, a famous millionaire, who happens to look just like Karl, is staying on the island', 'Karl is a simple farmer who takes a plane to Ibiza to finally meet his idol, pop-singer Linda Lou. Karl has long ago fallen in love with his idol and has written her numerous love letters, But a farmer like Karl is not the kind of man she could be interested in. At the same time however, a famous millionaire, who happens to look just like Karl, is staying on the island', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90iqTzqQg6xBK6rt7AisaBvFIi7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74040'),
