  ('889872384197800128', 'Super Volcano', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Jared Cohn, Marcus Friedlander', 'C.M. Dowling, Marc Gottlieb', 'McKenzie Westmore, Grant Bowler, Tyler Christopher, William Baldwin, Tori Griffith, Jessie B. Evans, Adam H. Marchand, Tola Lawal', null, 'When a super-volcano threatens the island of Hawaii, a team of rescue and disaster experts who are called in to help must race against the clock to save those in the path of the molten lava and stop the volcano for good.', 'When a super-volcano threatens the island of Hawaii, a team of rescue and disaster experts who are called in to help must race against the clock to save those in the path of the molten lava and stop the volcano for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tecxrbVt7pULhSX4f1ksO6W3wyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1089315'),
  ('766646856550063892', 'Super Xuxa Contra Baixo Astral', 1988, 'Fantasy, Family, Music', 'Anna Penido, Nonato Estrela', 'Anna Penido', 'Xuxa Meneghel, Guilherme Karan, Jonas Torres, Paolo Pacelli, Roberto Guimarães, Henriqueta Brieba, Luiz Carlos Tourinho, Tuca Andrada', null, 'Baixo Astral, an evil spirit who lives in the sewers, and whose mission is to bring unhappiness to the world, sees Xuxa on TV asking children to fight for a better world. Threatened by those words, he declares war on her and devises a plan: helped by his allies Titica and Morcegão, he kidnaps Xuxo, her dog. Helped by Xixa (a gypsy caterpillar) and Rafa, a rebel teenager, Xuxa goes on a mission to get her dog back and save the world from Baixo Astral.', 'Baixo Astral, an evil spirit who lives in the sewers, and whose mission is to bring unhappiness to the world, sees Xuxa on TV asking children to fight for a better world. Threatened by those words, he declares war on her and devises a plan: helped by his allies Titica and Morcegão, he kidnaps Xuxo, her dog. Helped by Xixa (a gypsy caterpillar) and Rafa, a rebel teenager, Xuxa goes on a mission to get her dog back and save the world from Baixo Astral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNIDg0IErbI2GuWMY4HnfhlTFpy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70817'),
  ('131817899653206293', 'Super-Rabbit', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Tedd Pierce, Kent Rogers', 'NR', 'Bugs Bunny becomes a superhero who does battle with a rabbit-hating cowboy and his horse.', 'Bugs Bunny becomes a superhero who does battle with a rabbit-hating cowboy and his horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gB9yE0FusKC6xajtRgL3mvwZvB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100356'),
  ('265717473448017972', 'Super/Man: The Christopher Reeve Story', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Brett Wiley, Ian Bonhôte, Peter Ettedgui', 'Peter Ettedgui, Ian Bonhôte, Otto Burnham', 'Christopher Reeve, Will Reeve, Alexandra Reeve Givens, Gae Exton, Glenn Close, Jeff Daniels, Whoopi Goldberg, Steven Kirshblum', 'PG-13', 'Christopher Reeve portrayed the Man of Steel in four Superman films and played dozens of other roles that displayed his talent and range as an actor, before being injured in a near-fatal horse-riding accident in 1995 that left him paralyzed from the neck down. After becoming a quadriplegic, he became a charismatic leader and activist in the quest to find a cure for spinal cord injuries, as well as a passionate advocate for disability rights and care.', 'Christopher Reeve portrayed the Man of Steel in four Superman films and played dozens of other roles that displayed his talent and range as an actor, before being injured in a near-fatal horse-riding accident in 1995 that left him paralyzed from the neck down. After becoming a quadriplegic, he became a charismatic leader and activist in the quest to find a cure for spinal cord injuries, as well as a passionate advocate for disability rights and care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73WchlI0Hj4HQd0T2KOztKquOek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128559'),
  ('600877197627474384', 'Superagente Makey', 2020, 'Comedy, Action', 'Alfonso Sánchez, Fran Fernández-Pardo', 'Jorge Lara, Fernando Pérez', 'Leo Harlem, Jordi Sánchez, Silvia Abril, María Sabaté, Mariam Hernández, Florin Opritescu, Dritan Biba, Anatoly Chugunov', null, 'Makey is a humble police officer that, unexpectedly, gets caught in the middle of a dangerous international drug operation in the Costa del Sol, Spain.', 'Makey is a humble police officer that, unexpectedly, gets caught in the middle of a dangerous international drug operation in the Costa del Sol, Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64WLV282zBoU2WBNuiKidHPzR7g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651586'),
  ('978811698548768181', 'Superargo and the Faceless Giants', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Paolo Bianchini, Tonino Ricci', 'Julio Buchs', 'Giovanni Cianfriglia, Guy Madison, Luisa Baratto, Diana Lorys, Aldo Sambrell, Tomás Blanco, Sergio Testori, Valerio Tordi', null, 'A masked wrestler/superhero goes up against a madman and his army of robots.', 'A masked wrestler/superhero goes up against a madman and his army of robots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNcnsb16gSreIWXwmfTRw3b3Q45.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106923'),
  ('1029715091539768796', 'Superargo vs Diabolicus', 1966, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Francisco Marín, Nick Nostro', 'Jaime Jesús Balcázar', 'Giovanni Cianfriglia, Gérard Tichy, Loredana Nusciak, Mónica Randall, Francisco Castillo Escalona, Emilio Messina, Geoffrey Copleston, Valentino Macchi', null, 'After accidentally killing an opponent in the ring, masked wrestler Superargo quits wrestling and, following the advice of his friend Col. Alex Kinski of the Secret Service, becomes a secret agent, using his superhuman abilities to stop villain Diabolicus'' plans to wreck the global economy by turning uranium into gold.', 'After accidentally killing an opponent in the ring, masked wrestler Superargo quits wrestling and, following the advice of his friend Col. Alex Kinski of the Secret Service, becomes a secret agent, using his superhuman abilities to stop villain Diabolicus'' plans to wreck the global economy by turning uranium into gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6caui99oDIdV1xWE2mionBJiOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195347'),
  ('86800300509829283', 'Superbabies: Baby Geniuses 2', 2004, 'Comedy, Family', 'Bob Clark, Maher Maleh', 'Gregory Poppen', 'Jon Voight, Skyler Shaye, Scott Baio, Vanessa Angel, Gerry Fitzgerald, Myles Fitzgerald, Leo Fitzgerald, David Kaye', 'PG', 'Babies can communicate with each other using ''baby talk'', and have innate knowledge of the secrets of the universe. The infant geniuses become involved in a scheme by media mogul Bill Biscane. Assisting the geniuses is a legendary superbaby named Kahuna, who joins up with several other babies in an attempt to stop Biscane, who intends to use a state-of-the-art satellite system to control the world''s population.', 'Babies can communicate with each other using ''baby talk'', and have innate knowledge of the secrets of the universe. The infant geniuses become involved in a scheme by media mogul Bill Biscane. Assisting the geniuses is a legendary superbaby named Kahuna, who joins up with several other babies in an attempt to stop Biscane, who intends to use a state-of-the-art satellite system to control the world''s population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7viULokoVzqrgVj0EljfXDzEKMk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31117'),
  ('658225443334316106', 'Superbad', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Greg Mottola, Russ T. Alsobrook, Scott Robertson', 'Seth Rogen, Evan Goldberg', 'Jonah Hill, Michael Cera, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Bill Hader, Seth Rogen, Martha MacIsaac, Emma Stone, Aviva Baumann', 'R', 'Two co-dependent high school seniors are forced to deal with separation anxiety after their plan to stage a booze-soaked party goes awry.', 'Two co-dependent high school seniors are forced to deal with separation anxiety after their plan to stage a booze-soaked party goes awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ek8e8txUyUwd2BNqj6lFEerJfbq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8363'),
  ('282901696937265247', 'Superbeast', 1972, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'George Schenck, Nonong Rasca', 'George Schenck', 'Antoinette Bower, Harry Lauter, Vic Diaz, Jose Romulo, John Garwood, Manny Ojeda, Bruno Punzalan, Craig Littler', 'R', 'A doctor finds a jungle laboratory, complete with mad scientist and genetic engineering experiments', 'A doctor finds a jungle laboratory, complete with mad scientist and genetic engineering experiments', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhC3hBjeBCfMnQPND0DXIJT47EB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150014'),
  ('647037640281808550', 'SuperBob', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Jon Drever', 'Brett Goldstein, William Bridges', 'Brett Goldstein, Catherine Tate, Natalia Tena, Laura Haddock, Ruth Sheen, David Harewood, Camilla Beeput, David Broughton-Davies', null, 'After six years without a date, Robert, the world''s only superhero, is looking for love. The only barrier to his plan is that he regularly has to save the world, so he needs to get some time off if he is to meet his superwoman.', 'After six years without a date, Robert, the world''s only superhero, is looking for love. The only barrier to his plan is that he regularly has to save the world, so he needs to get some time off if he is to meet his superwoman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9asWkGz7p2pYsvQkEmQpXMYfHRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339362'),
  ('423922741504687588', 'Superboys of Malegaon', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Reema Kagti, Swapnil S. Sonawane, Nandini Shrikent', 'Varun Grover', 'Adarsh Gourav, Shashank Arora, Vineet Kumar Singh, Anuj Singh Duhan, Saqib Ayub, Pallav Singgh, Manjiri Pupala, Muskkaan Jaferi', 'PG-13', 'The residents of Malegaon look to Bollywood cinema for a much-needed escape from daily drudgery. Amateur filmmaker Nasir Shaikh gets inspired to make a film for the people of Malegaon, by the people of Malegaon. He bands together his ragtag group of friends to bring his vision to life, thereby bringing a fresh lease of life into the town.', 'The residents of Malegaon look to Bollywood cinema for a much-needed escape from daily drudgery. Amateur filmmaker Nasir Shaikh gets inspired to make a film for the people of Malegaon, by the people of Malegaon. He bands together his ragtag group of friends to bring his vision to life, thereby bringing a fresh lease of life into the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLMLaZa0Mu4BqPhA2eYbduFjcD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1226572'),
  ('812260090644282140', 'Superbug, Super Agent', 1972, 'Comedy, Action', 'Rudolf Zehetgruber, Rüdiger Meichsner, Karl Kirchner', 'Rudolf Zehetgruber', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Rudolf Zehetgruber, Heidi Hansen, Kathrin Oginski, Karl-Otto Alberty, Kurt Jaggberg, Heinz Reincke, Sergio Testori', null, 'Jimmy Bondi and his miracle beetle Dudu are on their way to Portugal by sea. In the Algarve, they are witness to a dispute in which ex-inmate Plato and the attractive Tamara have to do with Marchese de la Sotta and his henchmen.', 'Jimmy Bondi and his miracle beetle Dudu are on their way to Portugal by sea. In the Algarve, they are witness to a dispute in which ex-inmate Plato and the attractive Tamara have to do with Marchese de la Sotta and his henchmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3S0S7EgUykz8VhIOht0xvbJPhYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102662'),
  ('760821458782785484', 'Superbug, the Craziest Car in the World', 1975, 'Comedy, Action', 'Rudolf Zehetgruber, Rüdiger Meichsner', 'Rudolf Zehetgruber', 'Rudolf Zehetgruber, Sal Borgese, Kathrin Oginski, Evelyne Kraft, Walter Giller, Walter Roderer, Ruth Jecklin, Ulrich Beiger', null, 'Dudu, the craziest car in the world, takes part in the goofiest race in the world!', 'Dudu, the craziest car in the world, takes part in the goofiest race in the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6bE2UQ7DEM2g1eOI06VhUgSbNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102712'),
  ('144355447976959891', 'Superbug, the Wild One', 1973, 'Comedy, Action', 'Rudolf Zehetgruber, Rüdiger Meichsner, Erich Feigl', 'Rudolf Zehetgruber', 'Rudolf Zehetgruber, Sal Borgese, Kathrin Oginski, Evelyne Kraft, Walter Giller, Franz Muxeneder, Walter Roderer, Ruth Jecklin', null, 'Jimmy Bondi and his miracle yellow VW Beetle Dudu are asked by their boyfriend Aldo to support him at a car show in Liverpool. After the show it turns out that the organizer Ivan Leskovich made off with the proceeds. Dudu and his friends give chase. Leskovich''s trail leads via London to Switzerland, but thanks to Jimmy''s lack of navigational skills, the friends first end up in Portugal...', 'Jimmy Bondi and his miracle yellow VW Beetle Dudu are asked by their boyfriend Aldo to support him at a car show in Liverpool. After the show it turns out that the organizer Ivan Leskovich made off with the proceeds. Dudu and his friends give chase. Leskovich''s trail leads via London to Switzerland, but thanks to Jimmy''s lack of navigational skills, the friends first end up in Portugal...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEZ52Az7cC12hWyCUrE55uOg0ph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102664'),
  ('1072330031263386327', 'Supercell', 2023, 'Action, Drama', 'Herbert James Winterstern, Chelsea Tummolo, Brooks Kephart', 'Herbert James Winterstern, Anna Elizabeth James', 'Skeet Ulrich, Anne Heche, Daniel Diemer, Jordan Kristine Seamón, Alec Baldwin, Richard Gunn, Praiya Suandokmai, Johnny Wactor', 'PG-13', 'Good-hearted teenager William always lived in hope of following in his late father’s footsteps and becoming a storm chaser. His father’s legacy has now been turned into a storm-chasing tourist business, managed by the greedy and reckless Zane Rogers, who is now using William as the main attraction to lead a group of unsuspecting adventurers deep into the eye of the most dangerous supercell ever seen.', 'Good-hearted teenager William always lived in hope of following in his late father’s footsteps and becoming a storm chaser. His father’s legacy has now been turned into a storm-chasing tourist business, managed by the greedy and reckless Zane Rogers, who is now using William as the main attraction to lead a group of unsuspecting adventurers deep into the eye of the most dangerous supercell ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbGHezV6yrhua0KfAgwrknSOiIY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842945'),
  ('147929481700222775', 'Superchick', 1973, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ed Forsyth', 'Gary Crutcher', 'Joyce Jillson, Louis Quinn, Thomas Reardon, Tony Young, Timothy Wayne Brown, John Carradine, Uschi Digard, Junero Jennings', 'R', 'Tara B. True is a flight attendant who makes a weekly swing through New York, Miami, and Los Angeles. In each city, she has a man: Edward, older and wealthy; Johnny, a beach bum with gambling debts; and, Davey, a rock musician on the cusp of success. Tara is a free spirit, faithful to each man in her own way, and so stunning that she dresses in a wig and ill-fitting uniform while she''s working so men won''t harass her constantly. The low-life whom Johnny is in debt to figures out a way to use Tara to help him execute a daring in-flight robbery. But will Tara stand by helplessly, or is superchick ready for action?', 'Tara B. True is a flight attendant who makes a weekly swing through New York, Miami, and Los Angeles. In each city, she has a man: Edward, older and wealthy; Johnny, a beach bum with gambling debts; and, Davey, a rock musician on the cusp of success. Tara is a free spirit, faithful to each man in her own way, and so stunning that she dresses in a wig and ill-fitting uniform while she''s working so men won''t harass her constantly. The low-life whom Johnny is in debt to figures out a way to use Tara to help him execute a daring in-flight robbery. But will Tara stand by helplessly, or is superchick ready for action?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwyHIgtUKMwH5d9lVpLSuo53Buy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86501'),
  ('651689243367506459', 'Superchondriac', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Dany Boon, Romain Winding', 'Dany Boon', 'Dany Boon, Kad Merad, Alice Pol, Jean-Yves Berteloot, Judith El Zein, Marthe Villalonga, Valérie Bonneton, Bruno Lochet', null, 'Romain Faubert is a 39 year old, single, medical photographer... and a raging hypochondriac. His doctor and only friend Dr. Dimitri Zvenka thinks he knows the cure for Romain: dating! But with the arrival of freedom fighter Anton Miroslav, everyone might get more then they bargained for...', 'Romain Faubert is a 39 year old, single, medical photographer... and a raging hypochondriac. His doctor and only friend Dr. Dimitri Zvenka thinks he knows the cure for Romain: dating! But with the arrival of freedom fighter Anton Miroslav, everyone might get more then they bargained for...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3J84HvgThJyBSqNaAiX9EuiIGwx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248507'),
  ('618647128901947089', 'Supercool', 2021, 'Comedy, Action', 'Teppo Airaksinen', 'Ali Moussavi, Olli Haikka', 'Jake Short, Miles J. Harvey, Damon Wayans Jr., Madison Davenport, Iliza Shlesinger, Peter Moses, Odessa A''zion, Jonathan Kite', 'NR', 'Best friends, Neil and Gilbert start their senior year of high school with high hopes and aspirations. Neil has always fantasized about being cool enough to date his long time crush and Gilbert has always dreamed of being a social media super star. After what is, by all accounts, a very disappointing and embarrassing first day in school, Neil makes a magical wish to be cool just at the magical moment when the clock strikes 11:11. The next morning, Neil wakes up to a reality that is straight from the comics of his dreams.', 'Best friends, Neil and Gilbert start their senior year of high school with high hopes and aspirations. Neil has always fantasized about being cool enough to date his long time crush and Gilbert has always dreamed of being a social media super star. After what is, by all accounts, a very disappointing and embarrassing first day in school, Neil makes a magical wish to be cool just at the magical moment when the clock strikes 11:11. The next morning, Neil wakes up to a reality that is straight from the comics of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NV278UG4Z8wOWpKFHz6I7D7Nda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514466'),
  ('561902615077805089', 'Supercop 2', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah, Li Kit-Ming', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, Sandy Shaw Lai-King', 'Michelle Yeoh, Yu Rongguang, Emil Chau, Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Athena Chu Yan, Bill Tung Biu, Dick Wei, Bowie Lam Bo-Yee', null, 'As a crime wave sweeps through Hong Kong, the police call Jessica Yang, a rising star in the ranks, to help stop a notorious gang of thieves! What Jessica doesn''t realize is that her boyfriend – recently discharged from the force – is the leader of this ruthless crime ring!', 'As a crime wave sweeps through Hong Kong, the police call Jessica Yang, a rising star in the ranks, to help stop a notorious gang of thieves! What Jessica doesn''t realize is that her boyfriend – recently discharged from the force – is the leader of this ruthless crime ring!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYGXe2BRIyNX2z7Y6UdQoiw8yfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38955'),
  ('687184430343425548', 'Supercroc', 2007, 'Horror, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Steven Parker, Scott Harper', 'Steve Bevilacqua', 'Cynthia Rose Hall, Matthew Blashaw, Kim Little, David Novak, Kristen Quintrall, Marat Glazer, Steven Glinn, Duncan Allen', null, 'A team of soldiers must stop a giant, bloodthirsty crocodile from reaching a nearby city, while trying to avoid being a meal for the beast themselves.', 'A team of soldiers must stop a giant, bloodthirsty crocodile from reaching a nearby city, while trying to avoid being a meal for the beast themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31CEurmrlKD0RoTtllFDln1Yi9Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62962'),
  ('195661031727432626', 'Supercross', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Steve Boyum, William Wages', 'Ken Solarz, Bart Baker, Keith Alan Bernstein', 'Steve Howey, Mike Vogel, Cameron Richardson, Sophia Bush, Channing Tatum, Robert Carradine, Robert Patrick, Aaron Carter', 'PG-13', 'Faced with the suspicious death of their father, two brothers must motivate one another to get back on their bikes and take the Las Vegas Motocross Championships by storm.', 'Faced with the suspicious death of their father, two brothers must motivate one another to get back on their bikes and take the Las Vegas Motocross Championships by storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82dbqeFOA2iPhwWuciZItw1ELew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17186'),
  ('885052874404347833', 'Superdad', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Vincent McEveety', 'Joseph L. McEveety', 'Bob Crane, Kurt Russell, Barbara Rush, Joe Flynn, Kathleen Cody, Joby Baker, Dick Van Patten, Bruno Kirby', 'G', 'A dad tries to impress the daughter -- a soon-to-be college student he thinks is hanging around with a bad crowd.', 'A dad tries to impress the daughter -- a soon-to-be college student he thinks is hanging around with a bad crowd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6KXXd9LZuAs0iLUUesVOQlOxPq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46667'),
  ('562258495735125418', 'Superdeep', 2020, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Evgeny Musin, Natalya Kharybina, Arseny Syukhin', 'Sergey Torchilin, Victor Bondaryuk, Arseny Syukhin', 'Milena Radulović, Sergey Ivanuk, Nicholay Kovbas, Nikita Dyuvbanov, Vadim Demchog, Albina Chaykina, Kirill Kovbas, Victor Nizovoy', 'R', 'In 1984, a Russian research team goes below the surface to find out what secret the world''s deepest borehole is hiding. On their expedition, something unexpectedly gruesome awaits the researchers.', 'In 1984, a Russian research team goes below the surface to find out what secret the world''s deepest borehole is hiding. On their expedition, something unexpectedly gruesome awaits the researchers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HhlR1XbG1cw7dfAq3rme6Qs1lh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579828'),
  ('863557548592644462', 'Superdome', 1978, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jerry Jameson, Matthew F. Leonetti, Jerry Sobul', null, 'David Janssen, Edie Adams, Clifton Davis, Peter Haskell, Ken Howard, Susan Howard, Van Johnson, Vonetta McGee', 'NR', 'It''s the biggest event of the year — the Super Bowl! But the star players for the Cougars, gathered in New Orleans for the big game, are preoccupied with some serious off-the-field issues. Dave Walecki''s marriage to his wife Nancy is falling apart, while Jim McCauley is involved in a shady deal with a management firm that could destroy his career. But that''s nothing compared to the real drama. There''s an assassin killing off many of the team''s personnel (as well as their chances of winning)!', 'It''s the biggest event of the year — the Super Bowl! But the star players for the Cougars, gathered in New Orleans for the big game, are preoccupied with some serious off-the-field issues. Dave Walecki''s marriage to his wife Nancy is falling apart, while Jim McCauley is involved in a shady deal with a management firm that could destroy his career. But that''s nothing compared to the real drama. There''s an assassin killing off many of the team''s personnel (as well as their chances of winning)!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MLuHiV5wNs8kO7ndfVotMfddvb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264098'),
  ('98031818391004900', 'SuperDragon: The Bruce Lee Story', 1974, 'Action, Drama', 'Ti Shih, Lui Ban-Chung', 'Lui Ban-Chung', 'Ho Tsung-Tao, Cheng Fu-Hung, Chin Yung-Hsiang, Ngai Yat-Ping, Shih Ting-Ken, Tsang Ming-Cheong, Chen Chin-Hai, Robert Tai', null, 'Considered the first biopic of the legendary Bruce Lee, fact blurs with fiction in this low-budget, loose interpretation of the great martial arts expert''s life starring Bruce Li, the most well known Lee impersonator. The film takes a look at Bruce''s humble beginnings as a paperboy to his rise in fame as a martial arts phenom, who later gets tangled up in a love affair with actress Betty Ting-Pei.', 'Considered the first biopic of the legendary Bruce Lee, fact blurs with fiction in this low-budget, loose interpretation of the great martial arts expert''s life starring Bruce Li, the most well known Lee impersonator. The film takes a look at Bruce''s humble beginnings as a paperboy to his rise in fame as a martial arts phenom, who later gets tangled up in a love affair with actress Betty Ting-Pei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSZyyG8ZJFbxZ3CH1MlpNOkpASl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310847'),
  ('675087928939051570', 'Superegos', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Benjamin Heisenberg, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Benjamin Heisenberg, Josef Lechner', 'Georg Friedrich, André Wilms, Bettina Stucky, Susanne Wolff, Elisabeth Orth, Maria Hofstätter, Margarita Broich, Markus Schleinzer', null, 'Nick Gutlicht lives of illegally selling valuable books, owes money to a bunch of other crooks and has to hide from them. By chance he ends up in the mansion of the famous, now very old philosopher Curt Ledig, who despite the age related forgetfulness and pathological kitchen phobia resists to move to his daughter. Nick is hired by the family as watchdog. Now Curt can work on a presentation for the upcoming symposium, which anybody thinks he''s capable of anymore. Nick thinks he has an excellent hiding place. This partnership of convenience of the two individuals quickly develops its own momentum. Curt regards Nick as an exciting research object and subjects him to an absurd therapy. For Nick it''s a unique opportunity to fund his finances with Curt''s phenomenal library. The strange couple is going through turmoil of incalculable proportions.', 'Nick Gutlicht lives of illegally selling valuable books, owes money to a bunch of other crooks and has to hide from them. By chance he ends up in the mansion of the famous, now very old philosopher Curt Ledig, who despite the age related forgetfulness and pathological kitchen phobia resists to move to his daughter. Nick is hired by the family as watchdog. Now Curt can work on a presentation for the upcoming symposium, which anybody thinks he''s capable of anymore. Nick thinks he has an excellent hiding place. This partnership of convenience of the two individuals quickly develops its own momentum. Curt regards Nick as an exciting research object and subjects him to an absurd therapy. For Nick it''s a unique opportunity to fund his finances with Curt''s phenomenal library. The strange couple is going through turmoil of incalculable proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1i6RSnokDET5JxIGpg0AeNXD8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256008'),
  ('1054203766922828824', 'Superfast!', 2015, 'Comedy, Action', 'Jason Friedberg, Aaron Seltzer, Shawn Maurer', 'Aaron Seltzer, Jason Friedberg', 'Alex Ashbaugh, Dale Pavinski, Andrea Navedo, Lili Mirojnick, Gonzalo Menendez, Shakira Barrera, Dio Johnson, Shantel Wislawski', 'PG-13', 'Undercover cop Lucas White joins Vin Serento''s gang of illegal street racers. They are fast and they are furious and they plan to double cross Los Angeles kingpin Juan Carlos de la Sol, who hides his cash in a downtown Taco Bell.', 'Undercover cop Lucas White joins Vin Serento''s gang of illegal street racers. They are fast and they are furious and they plan to double cross Los Angeles kingpin Juan Carlos de la Sol, who hides his cash in a downtown Taco Bell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuIWl90qCpoxv6g775JB6Kg0m86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325358'),
  ('392383261369980009', 'Superfights', 1995, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Tony Leung Siu-Hung', 'Keith W. Strandberg', 'Brandon Gaines, Keith Vitali, Yu Feihong, Chuck Jeffreys, James Rocha, Rob Szatkowski, Kelly Gallant, Cliff Lenderman', null, 'Jack Cody has always wanted to enter the world of the Superfights, a free fighting tournament. One night, Jack rescues a girl from a mugging and becomes a national hero. Only then is he given his opportunity to become a Superfighter. Jack soon meets a ninja who informs him that the man behind the Superfights is involved in illegal acts. Armed with this knowledge Jack must fight . . . for his life!', 'Jack Cody has always wanted to enter the world of the Superfights, a free fighting tournament. One night, Jack rescues a girl from a mugging and becomes a national hero. Only then is he given his opportunity to become a Superfighter. Jack soon meets a ninja who informs him that the man behind the Superfights is involved in illegal acts. Armed with this knowledge Jack must fight . . . for his life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8onEs0hALhjiOuioyMNDay7I2cC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182484'),
  ('987798174853943797', 'Superflat Monogram', 2003, 'Animation', 'Mamoru Hosoda, Takashi Otsuka', 'Mamoru Hosoda, Takashi Murakami', null, null, 'While waiting to meet her friends outside of a Louis Vuitton store, Aya''s cell phone is eaten by the LV Panda, who then promptly swallows Aya - but the inside of his stomach is gateway to a psychadelic wonderland. Based on characters created by famed superflat artist Takashi Murakami.', 'While waiting to meet her friends outside of a Louis Vuitton store, Aya''s cell phone is eaten by the LV Panda, who then promptly swallows Aya - but the inside of his stomach is gateway to a psychadelic wonderland. Based on characters created by famed superflat artist Takashi Murakami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4u3KomeLDVr0xYJhGIqjFzaMuC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247029'),
  ('749468902840586588', 'SuperFly', 2018, 'Action, Crime', 'Director X., Amir Mokri, Andi Crumbley', 'Phillip Fenty', 'Trevor Jackson, Jason Mitchell, Michael Kenneth Williams, Lex Scott Davis, Jennifer Morrison, Kaalan Rashad Walker, Esai Morales, Andrea Londo', 'R', 'Career criminal Youngblood Priest wants out of the Atlanta drug scene, but as he ramps up sales, one little slip up threatens to bring the whole operation down before he can make his exit.', 'Career criminal Youngblood Priest wants out of the Atlanta drug scene, but as he ramps up sales, one little slip up threatens to bring the whole operation down before he can make his exit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGk9H5PVpWzbsYkmnBeKevQkwwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500475'),
