  ('744652891982785909', 'Superstar: The Karen Carpenter Story', 1987, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Todd Haynes, Barry Ellsworth', 'Cynthia Schneider', 'Merrill Gruver, Michael Edwards, Melissa Brown, Rob LaBelle, Cynthia Schneider, Todd Haynes, Bruce Tuthill, Gwen Kraus', 'NR', 'The final 17 years of American singer and musician Karen Carpenter, performed almost entirely by modified Barbie dolls.', 'The final 17 years of American singer and musician Karen Carpenter, performed almost entirely by modified Barbie dolls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kMRTa9K442K1D5d0tQYqyFsZh9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1387'),
  ('315803089543211141', 'Superstau', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Manfred Stelzer, Frans Bromet, Gabriele Heberling', 'Gerd Weiss, Klaus Pohl, Manfred Stelzer', 'Ottfried Fischer, Ralf Richter, Monika Baumgartner, Hildegard Kuhlenberg, Petra Ehlert, Ulrich Anschütz, Achim Konejung, Horst Schroth', null, 'Every year, many Germans are preparing to spend their vacations in the sunny south. And they all have to use the same highways. And every year everything ends in a big traffic jam.', 'Every year, many Germans are preparing to spend their vacations in the sunny south. And they all have to use the same highways. And every year everything ends in a big traffic jam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iz5CnljIdPCkmxoz9HFaeKn8Gme.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10899'),
  ('168931786994296247', 'Superstition', 1982, 'Horror', 'James W. Roberson, Leon Blank, Brad White', 'Galen Thompson', 'James Houghton, Albert Salmi, Lynn Carlin, Larry Pennell, Jacquelyn Hyde, Robert Symonds, Heidi Bohay, Maylo McCaslin', 'NR', 'A witch put to death in 1692 swears vengeance on her persecutors and returns to the present day to punish their descendants.', 'A witch put to death in 1692 swears vengeance on her persecutors and returns to the present day to punish their descendants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6X3AVdhVXIPEp4A3bg2tKCV0sp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52702'),
  ('3916647857926014', 'SüperTürk', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Tamer Karadağlı', 'İzlen Erdem', 'Tamer Karadağlı, Arzu Balkan, Buket Dereoğlu, Murat Serezli, Cem Emüler, Necmi Yapıcı, Suna Keskin, Atilla Arcan', null, 'What makes a superhero? Of course, he flies and splits fruit or other objects in two with rays of light from his eyes. He cheats at gambling without anyone noticing, and his mother has lead poured and beads strung to protect him from the evil eye! Although his family manages to keep this super kid, SuperTurk, out of sight and hide his abilities for a long time, one day he is accidentally exposed. Now he has to shuttle between TV channels, doing monkey business for people...', 'What makes a superhero? Of course, he flies and splits fruit or other objects in two with rays of light from his eyes. He cheats at gambling without anyone noticing, and his mother has lead poured and beads strung to protect him from the evil eye! Although his family manages to keep this super kid, SuperTurk, out of sight and hide his abilities for a long time, one day he is accidentally exposed. Now he has to shuttle between TV channels, doing monkey business for people...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAqzWi0jD4RNCl1pCPCZPKRylxb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138725'),
  ('561382423402613887', 'Supervan', 1977, 'Comedy, Action', 'Lamar Card, John Arnoldy, Irv Goodnoff', 'Neva Friedenn, Robert Easter', 'Mark Schneider, Katie Saylor, Morgan Woodward, Len Lesser, Skip Riley, Bruce Kimball, Charles Bukowski, Tom Kindle', 'PG', 'A man named Clint enters a solar-powered van called Vandora into a competition called Freakout.', 'A man named Clint enters a solar-powered van called Vandora into a competition called Freakout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmwhBwluPawG27QddGXxIr7Z1LZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73273'),
  ('1064964771296608079', 'Supervenus', 2014, 'Horror, Animation, Comedy', 'Frédéric Doazan', null, null, null, 'An update of our classic human anatomy.', 'An update of our classic human anatomy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUd8AT5oPBacoPeuFK1wFwODtLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291506'),
  ('75901789894896064', 'Supervolcano', 2005, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Derek Rogers, Marcia Gay, Tony Mitchell', 'Edward Canfor-Dumas', 'Michael Riley, Gary Lewis, Shaun Johnston, Adrian Holmes, Jennifer Copping, Rebecca Jenkins, Tom McBeath, Fred Keating', null, 'Yellowstone is a park, but it''s also the deadliest volcano on Earth. Beneath it, a sleeping ''dragon'' is stirring. When an earthquake opens a crack for magma to seep through, other warning signs of an eruption start popping up, but they are ignored or dismissed as ''minor''. But when they learn an eruption will happen, panic breaks out through people of the USA and the world.', 'Yellowstone is a park, but it''s also the deadliest volcano on Earth. Beneath it, a sleeping ''dragon'' is stirring. When an earthquake opens a crack for magma to seep through, other warning signs of an eruption start popping up, but they are ignored or dismissed as ''minor''. But when they learn an eruption will happen, panic breaks out through people of the USA and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVmVm2gZduw857yU4LR6C1nb2lO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18230'),
  ('884343391523806238', 'Superwho?', 2022, 'Comedy, Action, Family', 'Vincent Richard-Marquis, Philippe Lacheau', 'Julien Arruti, Pierre Dudan, Philippe Lacheau', 'Philippe Lacheau, Julien Arruti, Tarek Boudali, Élodie Fontan, Alice Dufour, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Amr Waked, Chantal Ladesou', null, 'A struggling actor seems doomed to live life as a loser. When he finally snatches a lead role as a superhero named “Badman,” he feels like everything is possible, but fate strikes again.', 'A struggling actor seems doomed to live life as a loser. When he finally snatches a lead role as a superhero named “Badman,” he feels like everything is possible, but fate strikes again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aie2kiYOUgZeakpshM2N64PKof1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746333'),
  ('522199052075993605', 'Support the Girls', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Andrew Bujalski, Matthias Grunsky, Isaac Lewis', 'Andrew Bujalski', 'Regina Hall, Haley Lu Richardson, Shayna McHayle, James Le Gros, Dylan Gelula, Lea DeLaria, AJ Michalka, Christopher Weimer', 'R', 'Lisa Conroy is general manager at a highway-side ''sports bar with curves'', Double Whammies. She nurtures and protects her employees fiercely - but over the course of one trying day, her optimism is battered from every direction. Double Whammies sells a big, weird American fantasy, but what happens when reality pokes a bunch of holes in it?', 'Lisa Conroy is general manager at a highway-side ''sports bar with curves'', Double Whammies. She nurtures and protects her employees fiercely - but over the course of one trying day, her optimism is battered from every direction. Double Whammies sells a big, weird American fantasy, but what happens when reality pokes a bunch of holes in it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXfwrs8g3pY4mmaO5WDAowWLqBg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456086'),
  ('408496533146105805', 'Support Your Local Gunfighter', 1971, 'Comedy, Western', 'Joseph M. Ellis, Al Murphy, Burt Kennedy', 'James Edward Grant', 'James Garner, Suzanne Pleshette, Jack Elam, Harry Morgan, Joan Blondell, Marie Windsor, John Dehner, Henry Jones', 'G', 'A con artist arrives in a mining town controlled by two competing companies. Both companies think he''s a famous gunfighter and try to hire him to drive the other out of town.', 'A con artist arrives in a mining town controlled by two competing companies. Both companies think he''s a famous gunfighter and try to hire him to drive the other out of town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjKN4XYKHVGmGikiIda4iIEeL4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18287'),
  ('730109005148025324', 'Support Your Local Sheriff!', 1969, 'Comedy, Western', 'Harry Stradling Jr., Burt Kennedy, Ray DeCamp', 'William Bowers', 'James Garner, Joan Hackett, Walter Brennan, Harry Morgan, Jack Elam, Henry Jones, Bruce Dern, Willis Bouchey', 'G', 'In the old west, a man becomes a Sheriff just for the pay, figuring he can decamp if things get tough.', 'In the old west, a man becomes a Sheriff just for the pay, figuring he can decamp if things get tough.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7s8uz1dGA8JtPRSDg04zSYMUbnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11574'),
  ('1119167755801586651', 'Supremacy', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Deon Taylor', 'Eric J. Adams', 'Danny Glover, Julie Benz, Joe Anderson, Dawn Olivieri, Derek Luke, Evan Ross, Lela Rochon, Mahershala Ali', null, 'The story centers on paroled white supremacist who has just killed a cop, and takes a black family hostage. Within hours of being released from 14 years of solitary confinement in maximum-security Pelican Bay State Prison, Garrett Tully is on the run again. When he finds a house off a dirt road and takes a family hostage, he thinks the Aryan Brotherhood has his back–and his kidnap victims are black. The family’s patriarch, Mr. Walker, is a jaded ex-con who hates cops so much he disavowed his own son for becoming one. Seeing a familiar desperation in Tully, Walker refuses to call the authorities for help, causing familial tensions to escalate, and soon grave missteps are made.', 'The story centers on paroled white supremacist who has just killed a cop, and takes a black family hostage. Within hours of being released from 14 years of solitary confinement in maximum-security Pelican Bay State Prison, Garrett Tully is on the run again. When he finds a house off a dirt road and takes a family hostage, he thinks the Aryan Brotherhood has his back–and his kidnap victims are black. The family’s patriarch, Mr. Walker, is a jaded ex-con who hates cops so much he disavowed his own son for becoming one. Seeing a familiar desperation in Tully, Walker refuses to call the authorities for help, causing familial tensions to escalate, and soon grave missteps are made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyuFA9AYBLNJY4Zb2Q5ty8cSIbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277702'),
  ('554811005410789370', 'Sur un fil', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Reda Kateb, Mathilde Soursas, Arthur Meynier', 'Fadette Drouard, Reda Kateb', 'Aloïse Sauvage, Philippe Rebbot, Sara Giraudeau, Samir Guesmi, Jean-Philippe Buzaud, Eva Yelmani, Justine Viotty, Amine Lajiri', null, 'Jo, a young woman and street circus artist, discovers the work of the professional clowns of “Nez pour Rire”. Quickly - perhaps too quickly - entering the association, she found herself at the hospital in contact with children, sick people, caregivers and families, to whom these clowns tirelessly try to bring joy and comfort. .', 'Jo, a young woman and street circus artist, discovers the work of the professional clowns of “Nez pour Rire”. Quickly - perhaps too quickly - entering the association, she found herself at the hospital in contact with children, sick people, caregivers and families, to whom these clowns tirelessly try to bring joy and comfort. .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWRMxWPFkKDv5kh8eKkbYSTsITn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001473'),
  ('388834479387601373', 'Suraj Pe Mangal Bhari', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Abhishek Sharma, Vikram Singh Dahiya, Shruti Mahajan', 'Rohan Shankar', 'Diljit Dosanjh, Manoj Bajpayee, Fatima Sana Shaikh, Annu Kapoor, Supriya Pilgaonkar, Manoj Pahwa, Seema Pahwa, Manuj Sharma', null, 'In the 1990s, a wedding detective has to perform background checks on prospective grooms. In the time before social media and mobile phones, everything has to be done in person.', 'In the 1990s, a wedding detective has to perform background checks on prospective grooms. In the time before social media and mobile phones, everything has to be done in person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbwcuXBp554Ef6s9aFE1x5Wq1pV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:738567'),
  ('1118245733523527004', 'Surcos', 1951, 'Drama', 'José Antonio Nieves Conde, Sebastián Perera, José María Ochoa', 'José Antonio Nieves Conde', 'María Asquerino, Luis Peña, Marisa de Leza, Félix Dafauce, Francisco Arenzana, José Prada, María Francés, Ricardo Lucía', null, 'A farm family moves into a city maybe at the end of the Spanish Civil War. They move in with the sister of the farmers wife. In the city everything is illegal or immoral or both.', 'A farm family moves into a city maybe at the end of the Spanish Civil War. They move in with the sister of the farmers wife. In the city everything is illegal or immoral or both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5G5Oen4mik64ewaFu7Prnm0meW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103937'),
  ('503974725345780834', 'Sure Death', 1984, 'Drama, Crime, Action', 'Masahisa Sadanaga, Shigeru Ishihara, Masaru Tsushima', 'Tatsuo Nogami, Takeshi Yoshida', 'Makoto Fujita, Kunihiko Mitamura, Izumi Ayukawa, Kin Sugai, Mari Shiraki, Ippei Hikaru, Toshio Yamauchi, Kiyoshi Nakajo', null, 'A group of seemingly ordinary merchants is really a band of assassins for hire. When they discover that all the assassins in Edo are being killed they must act quickly to find the culprit.', 'A group of seemingly ordinary merchants is really a band of assassins for hire. When they discover that all the assassins in Edo are being killed they must act quickly to find the culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giD6MJmUMoaKQTaHlyY3iX7Pesq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210713'),
  ('953458574521504486', 'Surf 2', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Randall M. Badat, Stephen L. Posey, Álex Phillips Jr.', 'Randall M. Badat', 'Eddie Deezen, Linda Kerridge, Terry Kiser, Eric Stoltz, Jeffrey Rogers, Lyle Waggoner, Lucinda Dooling, Peter Isacksen', 'R', 'Evil Nerd Menlo wants to get revenge on some surfers by selling a bad batch of soda called Buzz Cola which turns people into mutant zombies. Its up to Jocko, Chuck, Bob and their surfer buddies to save the day.', 'Evil Nerd Menlo wants to get revenge on some surfers by selling a bad batch of soda called Buzz Cola which turns people into mutant zombies. Its up to Jocko, Chuck, Bob and their surfer buddies to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRMJ7rE40XTd1kiUVpa6gqLTwmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30411'),
