  ('972653242660160860', 'Surfwise', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Doug Pray', null, null, 'R', 'The inspiring and tumultuous story of 85-year old surfer, health advocate and sex guru, Dr. Dorian "Doc" Paskowitz, his wife Juliette, and their nine children who were all home-schooled and raised in a small camper on the beach, where they surfed and had to adhere to the strict diet and lifestyle of animals in the wild.', 'The inspiring and tumultuous story of 85-year old surfer, health advocate and sex guru, Dr. Dorian "Doc" Paskowitz, his wife Juliette, and their nine children who were all home-schooled and raised in a small camper on the beach, where they surfed and had to adhere to the strict diet and lifestyle of animals in the wild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUDhBB4UPEifhPmjwviul5KxhIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26354'),
  ('595369420047808946', 'Surge', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Matt Alder, James R. Kipping, Alexandra Beahan', 'Rita Kalnejais, Rupert Jones', 'Ben Whishaw, Ellie Haddington, Ian Gelder, Jasmine Jobson, Dan Renton Skinner, Laurence Spellman, Chris Coghill, Hammed Animashaun', null, 'A man goes on a bold and reckless journey of self-liberation through London. After he robs a bank he releases a wilder version of himself, ultimately experiencing what it feels like to be alive.', 'A man goes on a bold and reckless journey of self-liberation through London. After he robs a bank he releases a wilder version of himself, ultimately experiencing what it feels like to be alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tR68Qbd0ETPXGDtC6HZtTmliX1G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653584'),
  ('130069000001429440', 'Suri Anna', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Salaga Suri Anna', 'Salaga Suri Anna', 'Salaga Suri Anna, UV Nanjappa Benaka, Ashwini Gowda', null, 'A gripping story of a man torn between circumstances and conscience, who is drawn into the dark world of crime. As his choices spiral out of control, only the unconditional love of his parents keeps him grounded.', 'A gripping story of a man torn between circumstances and conscience, who is drawn into the dark world of crime. As his choices spiral out of control, only the unconditional love of his parents keeps him grounded.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F3ee0OkGwJzuZ0wLjYK4labxPybq.jpg', 'plex:movie:suri-anna'),
  ('803256011404172584', 'Surname Viêt Given Name Nam', 1989, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Trịnh T. Minh-hà, Jim Kallett, Linda Peckman', 'Trịnh T. Minh-hà', 'Tran Thi Hein, Ngo Kim Nhuy, Khien Lai, Tran Tai Bich Yen, Lan Trinh, Sue Whitfield', null, 'The film evolves around questions of identity, popular memory and culture. While focusing on aspects of Vietnamese reality as seen through the lives and history of women resistance in Vietnam and in the U.S, it raises questions on the politics of interviewing and documenting.', 'The film evolves around questions of identity, popular memory and culture. While focusing on aspects of Vietnamese reality as seen through the lives and history of women resistance in Vietnam and in the U.S, it raises questions on the politics of interviewing and documenting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlvMUtwV4epz57VvL1nE6JcM2xd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162539'),
  ('52347866778537086', 'Suro', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Mikel Gurrea, Julián Elizalde', 'Francisco Kosterlitz, Mikel Gurrea', 'Pol López, Victoria Luengo, Ilyass El Ouahdani, Josep Estragués, David Parcet, Vicente Botella, Josep Maria Gómez, Irina Moradell', null, 'Elena and Ivan are getting ready to enter into a new phase in their life. They are leaving the metropolis of Barcelona to settle in the Catalan countryside, where they are taking over a cork oak plantation. Not only will the business pay for their living, but they also want to exploit the plantation equitably and sustainably. But despite their ideals, Elena and Ivan soon find themselves in a crisis which will endanger not only their project, but also their relationship.', 'Elena and Ivan are getting ready to enter into a new phase in their life. They are leaving the metropolis of Barcelona to settle in the Catalan countryside, where they are taking over a cork oak plantation. Not only will the business pay for their living, but they also want to exploit the plantation equitably and sustainably. But despite their ideals, Elena and Ivan soon find themselves in a crisis which will endanger not only their project, but also their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hY9cQQuRilOFQYwHDXudKTPDKn7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835268'),
  ('371161363076707812', 'Surplus: Terrorized Into Being Consumers', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Erik Gandini', 'Erik Gandini', 'John Zerzan, George W. Bush, Fidel Castro, Kalle Lasn, Matt McMullen, Steve Ballmer, Bill Gates, Tania', null, 'Swedish documentary film on consumerism and globalization, created by director Erik Gandini and editor Johan Söderberg. It looks at the arguments for capitalism and technology, such as greater efficiency, more time and less work, and argues that these are not being fulfilled, and they never will be. The film leans towards anarcho-primitivist ideology and argues for "a simple and fulfilling life".', 'Swedish documentary film on consumerism and globalization, created by director Erik Gandini and editor Johan Söderberg. It looks at the arguments for capitalism and technology, such as greater efficiency, more time and less work, and argues that these are not being fulfilled, and they never will be. The film leans towards anarcho-primitivist ideology and argues for "a simple and fulfilling life".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JDIDRCUzfSw3EzeGLOZmyp6L2G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39179'),
  ('226273003426697821', 'Surprise', 2015, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Joshua', null, 'Yang Zishan, White-K, Xunzimo Liu, Ma Tianyu, Chen Bolin, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Xunzimo Liu, Joshua', null, 'A monster crosses paths with the foursome from the classic Chinese story Journey To The West.', 'A monster crosses paths with the foursome from the classic Chinese story Journey To The West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPI8lt791iM0oK2CxnemI0ZeJxV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372836'),
  ('516785456108193713', 'Surprise Cinema', 1999, 'Animation', 'Bill Plympton', 'Bill Plympton', null, null, 'A mischievous man plays an assortment of extreme practical jokes on unsuspecting victims - like replacing one man''s razor with a chainsaw.', 'A mischievous man plays an assortment of extreme practical jokes on unsuspecting victims - like replacing one man''s razor with a chainsaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8S0wWFKwg8zpBPMEmKlgUHRPPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200627'),
