  ('903710936354272539', 'Surprised by Oxford', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ryan Whitaker, Edd Lukas, Lance Johann', 'Ryan Whitaker', 'Rose Reid, Ruairí O''Connor, Simon Callow, Phyllis Logan, Mark Williams, Ed Stoppard, Olisa Odele, Lourdes Faberes', 'PG-13', 'Brilliant but emotionally-guarded Caro Drake arrives in Oxford with the singular goal of attaining her PhD, but through a turbulent friendship with a charming young man she starts to open herself up to mystery, vulnerability, and love.', 'Brilliant but emotionally-guarded Caro Drake arrives in Oxford with the singular goal of attaining her PhD, but through a turbulent friendship with a charming young man she starts to open herself up to mystery, vulnerability, and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bE8wDiRzOHvfqMCJ74oGVYX9fYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:988452'),
  ('359293639901314942', 'Surreal Love From the Wasteland', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan, Demet Akbağ', null, 'A male (Yilmaz Erdogan) and female (Demet Akbag) meets at desolate balcony during a party. After a little while they start to talk via phone for hours and like each other. Their relationship turns into a passionate love which brings about a marriage; sooner or later they start to realize that their relationship has critical problems which are needed to be solved.', 'A male (Yilmaz Erdogan) and female (Demet Akbag) meets at desolate balcony during a party. After a little while they start to talk via phone for hours and like each other. Their relationship turns into a passionate love which brings about a marriage; sooner or later they start to realize that their relationship has critical problems which are needed to be solved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3D3Nl4XDIsF9O87cvELjLeVoeFG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27950'),
  ('287139677083922906', 'Surrender', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Jerry Belson, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Jerry Belson', 'Sally Field, Michael Caine, Steve Guttenberg, Peter Boyle, Jackie Cooper, Julie Kavner, Louise Lasser, Iman', null, 'A wealthy writer who has had terrible experiences with money-hungry girlfriends & ex-wives pretends to be a broke, washed-up novelist to see if the woman he loves wants him for himself or just for his money.', 'A wealthy writer who has had terrible experiences with money-hungry girlfriends & ex-wives pretends to be a broke, washed-up novelist to see if the woman he loves wants him for himself or just for his money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeOUXSo8UeswXZO9QJ10uE0OLCu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123392'),
  ('399198839352495056', 'Surrender, Dorothy', 2006, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Charles McDougall, Vilmos Zsigmond', null, 'Diane Keaton, Tom Everett Scott, Alexa Davalos, Lauren German, Josh Hopkins, Chris Pine, Peter Riegert, Marnie Crossen', null, 'When her daughter Sara unexpectedly passes away, Natalie retreats to the summer home where she and Sara used to visit. Time with her best friends and some of Sara''s friends help her deal with her loss.', 'When her daughter Sara unexpectedly passes away, Natalie retreats to the summer home where she and Sara used to visit. Time with her best friends and some of Sara''s friends help her deal with her loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efaQ0P8wiZlbFgCa4piNYlIEFde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55657'),
  ('1065385770420859092', 'Surrogates', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Jonathan Mostow, Oliver Wood, Andrew Max Cahn', 'Michael Ferris, John Brancato', 'Bruce Willis, Radha Mitchell, Rosamund Pike, James Cromwell, Ving Rhames, Helena Mattsson, Boris Kodjoe, Ian Novick', 'PG-13', 'Set in a futuristic world where humans live in isolation and interact through surrogate robots, a cop is forced to leave his home for the first time in years in order to investigate the murders of others'' surrogates.', 'Set in a futuristic world where humans live in isolation and interact through surrogate robots, a cop is forced to leave his home for the first time in years in order to investigate the murders of others'' surrogates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3Z0Hbl0oe57njrrIPh0fJPFoo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19959'),
  ('324937697127297822', 'Surrounded', 2023, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'Max Goldman, Anthony Mandler', 'Justin Thomas, Andrew Pagana', 'Letitia Wright, Jamie Bell, Michael Kenneth Williams, Jeffrey Donovan, Kevin Wiggins, Brett Gelman, Luce Rains, Andrew Pagana', 'R', 'After her stagecoach is ambushed, a woman is tasked with holding a dangerous outlaw captive and must survive the day when the bandit’s gang tries to free him.', 'After her stagecoach is ambushed, a woman is tasked with holding a dangerous outlaw captive and must survive the day when the bandit’s gang tries to free him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVVvlosgMU6aePXavihV3L3V3D6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759584'),
  ('500606506960616531', 'Surveillance', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jennifer Lynch, Peter Wunstorf', 'Kent Harper, Jennifer Lynch', 'Julia Ormond, Bill Pullman, Pell James, Ryan Simpkins, Cheri Oteri, Michael Ironside, French Stewart, Kent Harper', 'R', 'An FBI agent tracks a serial killer with the help of three of his would-be victims - all of whom have wildly different stories to tell.', 'An FBI agent tracks a serial killer with the help of three of his would-be victims - all of whom have wildly different stories to tell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CYX53rLeRonQjJOKyHkwAwBIWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10900'),
  ('313508571233690886', 'Surveilled', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Perri Peltz, Matthew O''Neill, Matthew O''Neill', 'Ronan Farrow, Matthew O''Neill, Perri Peltz', 'Ronan Farrow, David Remnick, Claudiu Dan Gheorghe, Unjin Lee, David Rohde, Sami Abu Shehadeh, Ariella Ben Abraham, Ellynoy Baron', 'PG-13', 'Uncover the insidious ways in which our daily lives are being surveilled by the state. In a gripping chase, Ronan Farrow travels across the world following breadcrumbs and finally exposing a dark world of spywares, hacking, and peddling of private information, where activists and journalists are persecuted, and no one is protected from the watchful and vicious eyes of authoritarianism.', 'Uncover the insidious ways in which our daily lives are being surveilled by the state. In a gripping chase, Ronan Farrow travels across the world following breadcrumbs and finally exposing a dark world of spywares, hacking, and peddling of private information, where activists and journalists are persecuted, and no one is protected from the watchful and vicious eyes of authoritarianism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihBBgm2Nz754KRnsqQwhuNDvFsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1369240'),
  ('173557073197623301', 'Survival Family', 2017, 'Comedy, Family, Drama, Adventure', 'Shinobu Yaguchi, 島根淳, Takahito Kasai', 'Shinobu Yaguchi', 'Fumiyo Kohinata, Eri Fukatsu, Yuki Izumisawa, Wakana Aoi, Saburo Tokito, Norika Fujiwara, Takuro Ohno, Jun Shison', 'PG', 'A world wide electrical outage occurs. Everything that requires electricity comes to a stop. Tokyo is nearly ruined. Yoshiyuki Suzuki decides to escape from Tokyo with his family.', 'A world wide electrical outage occurs. Everything that requires electricity comes to a stop. Tokyo is nearly ruined. Yoshiyuki Suzuki decides to escape from Tokyo with his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdJWsWODt3wAsAGQ2M9WZIOFSas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429918'),
  ('864286876791046261', 'Survival Island', 2002, 'Horror', 'Scott Hillenbrand, David Hillenbrand, Philip D. Schwartz', 'David Hillenbrand, Scott Hillenbrand', 'Jaime Pressly, Nicholas Brendon, Lara Wickes, Casey Fallo, Garrett Wang, Julia Mendoza, Eugene Byrd, Nate Richert', 'R', 'A group of teens on a remote island for a scavenger hunt accidentally unleash vengeful spirits from a cursed piñata and must fight to survive.', 'A group of teens on a remote island for a scavenger hunt accidentally unleash vengeful spirits from a cursed piñata and must fight to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcuMxyhglRpsN7PhP1SdLbDhNmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32301'),
  ('74973042507801339', 'Survival of the Dead', 2010, 'Horror, Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'George A. Romero, Adam Swica, Jason Graham', 'George A. Romero', 'Alan van Sprang, Kenneth Welsh, Kathleen Munroe, Devon Bostick, Athena Karkanis, Stefano DiMatteo, Joris Jarsky, Richard Fitzpatrick', 'R', 'Off the coast of North America, locals simultaneously fight a zombie epidemic while hoping for a cure to revert their undead relatives back to normal.', 'Off the coast of North America, locals simultaneously fight a zombie epidemic while hoping for a cure to revert their undead relatives back to normal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BmqSRt10J2mpJmCgZbo5YYkQLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29426'),
  ('1030547559708493290', 'Survival Quest', 1989, 'Action, Adventure', 'Don Coscarelli, Daryn Okada, Lisa Patten', 'Don Coscarelli', 'Lance Henriksen, Mark Rolston, Steve Antin, Michael Allen Ryder, Paul Provenza, Ben Hammer, Dominic Hoffman, Traci Lind', 'R', 'A bunch of city slickers from different backgrounds go into the wild mountains to be one with nature, but basically to have a good time. However, a paramilitary group has chosen the same time to go camping. When one of the soldiers thinks their boss has been killed by one of the city slickers, he coaxes his team into exterminating all of them. They will have to rely on their wits and on each other in order to survive.', 'A bunch of city slickers from different backgrounds go into the wild mountains to be one with nature, but basically to have a good time. However, a paramilitary group has chosen the same time to go camping. When one of the soldiers thinks their boss has been killed by one of the city slickers, he coaxes his team into exterminating all of them. They will have to rely on their wits and on each other in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weaF990jmJw6VIAlxKyxvH7bAJP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100110'),
  ('103862311727810115', 'Survive', 2022, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Mark Pellington', 'Richard Abate, Alex Morel, Jeremy Ungar', 'Sophie Turner, Corey Hawkins, Dane Foxx, Caroline Goodall, Makgotso M, Laurel Marsden, Elliott Wooster', null, 'When their plane crashes on a remote snow-covered mountain, Jane and Paul have to fight for their lives as the only remaining survivors. Together they embark on a harrowing journey out of the wilderness.', 'When their plane crashes on a remote snow-covered mountain, Jane and Paul have to fight for their lives as the only remaining survivors. Together they embark on a harrowing journey out of the wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFOkcoEzVX2VAu0OaDn94seP2gd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1132079'),
  ('957567380164477594', 'Survive', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Adventure, Action', 'Théo Richard, Kenza Salaheddine, Frédéric Jardin', 'Matt Alexander', 'Émilie Dequenne, Andreas Pietschmann, Lisa Delamar, Lucas Ebel, Arben Bajraktaraj, Olivier Ho Hio Hen, Stéphanie Guerin, Rida Ait Oufqir', null, 'A couple celebrates their son’s birthday in the middle of the ocean on their boat. A violent storm hits and it brings up hungry creatures from the depths and they fight for their survival.', 'A couple celebrates their son’s birthday in the middle of the ocean on their boat. A violent storm hits and it brings up hungry creatures from the depths and they fight for their survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fR3KxswtY8OHHZuOUB9td58CRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196470'),
  ('745349496817417713', 'Survive Style 5+', 2004, 'Mystery, Comedy, Thriller', 'Gen Sekiguchi, Yasuhisa Serizawa, Makoto Sigma', 'Taku Tada', 'Tadanobu Asano, Reika Hashimoto, Kyoko Koizumi, Hiroshi Abe, Ittoku Kishibe, Yumi Aso, Kanji Tsuda, Yoshiyuki Morishita', null, 'Five bizarre stories with no apparent connection to one another eventually become intertwined, resulting in surreal circumstances.', 'Five bizarre stories with no apparent connection to one another eventually become intertwined, resulting in surreal circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plk0CXzSH9SeWCnbj2hoQEJJmy4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16133'),
  ('534574659853053535', 'Survive the Game', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'James Cullen Bressack, Bryan Koss', 'Ross Peacock', 'Chad Michael Murray, Swen Temmel, Bruce Willis, Michael Sirow, Kate Katzman, Sean Kanan, Simon Phillips, Zack Ward', 'R', 'When cop David is injured in a drug bust gone wrong, his partner Cal chases the two criminals who shot him. They all land at a remote farm owned by troubled vet Eric, and as Cal and Eric plot their defense, more of the gang arrives - along with a wounded David. Outnumbered, the three heroes must use stealth, smarts, and good shooting to take down the drug-dealing mob.', 'When cop David is injured in a drug bust gone wrong, his partner Cal chases the two criminals who shot him. They all land at a remote farm owned by troubled vet Eric, and as Cal and Eric plot their defense, more of the gang arrives - along with a wounded David. Outnumbered, the three heroes must use stealth, smarts, and good shooting to take down the drug-dealing mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xF1uc2pEf34X2G41wvZaF5H0V7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787310'),
  ('672990789843251935', 'Survive the Night', 2020, 'Action, Thriller', 'Matt Eskandari, Bryan Koss, Jonathan Southard', 'Doug Wolfe', 'Chad Michael Murray, Bruce Willis, Lydia Hull, Tyler Jon Olson, Shea Buckner, Jessica Abrams, Riley Wolfe Rach, Charlie Alvarado', 'R', 'A disgraced doctor and his family are held hostage at their home by criminals on the run, when a robbery-gone-awry requires them to seek immediate medical attention.', 'A disgraced doctor and his family are held hostage at their home by criminals on the run, when a robbery-gone-awry requires them to seek immediate medical attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3YyfWhzqvYqdd8YV6eixFEZJ3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:686245'),
  ('386901717589633290', 'Survive!', 1976, 'Adventure, Drama', 'René Cardona', 'Charles Blair Jr.', 'Hugo Stiglitz, Norma Lazareno, Luz María Aguilar, Fernando Larrañaga, Lorenzo de Rodas, Pablo Ferrel, Leonardo Daniel, Sara Guasch', 'R', 'A Uruguayan rugby team crashes in the Andes Mountains and has to survive the extremely cold temperatures and rough climate. As some of the people die, the survivors are forced to make a terrible decision between starvation and cannibalism.', 'A Uruguayan rugby team crashes in the Andes Mountains and has to survive the extremely cold temperatures and rough climate. As some of the people die, the survivors are forced to make a terrible decision between starvation and cannibalism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KqmtANgUKhUc8nlKWzLsEkp8x7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202619'),
  ('225238930143402391', 'Surviving Christmas', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mike Mitchell, Tom Priestley Jr., Peter Lyons Collister', 'Deborah Kaplan, Harry Elfont, Jennifer Ventimilia', 'Ben Affleck, James Gandolfini, Christina Applegate, Catherine O''Hara, Josh Zuckerman, Bill Macy, Jennifer Morrison, Udo Kier', 'PG-13', 'A wealthy executive, Drew Latham (Ben Affleck) has no close relationships and becomes nostalgic for his childhood home as Christmas approaches. When he visits the house and finds another family living there, he offers the residents, Tom Valco (James Gandolfini) and his wife, Christine (Catherine O''Hara), a large sum of money to pretend they are his parents. Soon Drew tests the couple''s patience, and, when their daughter, Alicia (Christina Applegate), arrives, things get increasingly tense.', 'A wealthy executive, Drew Latham (Ben Affleck) has no close relationships and becomes nostalgic for his childhood home as Christmas approaches. When he visits the house and finds another family living there, he offers the residents, Tom Valco (James Gandolfini) and his wife, Christine (Catherine O''Hara), a large sum of money to pretend they are his parents. Soon Drew tests the couple''s patience, and, when their daughter, Alicia (Christina Applegate), arrives, things get increasingly tense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jHtvFpCOOqp2U2qwI3L3h10cUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15566'),
  ('140714375137589433', 'Surviving Desire', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Hal Hartley, Brian Gutherman, Pamela Koffler', 'Hal Hartley', 'Martin Donovan, Matt Malloy, Rebecca Nelson, Julie Kessler, Mary B. Ward, Thomas J. Edwards, George Feaster, Lisa Gorlitsky', null, 'Jude, a college professor, is obsessed with Sophie, his student. She, in turn, is intrigued by his scholarly charm. Flirtation turns to lust and the two become lovers.', 'Jude, a college professor, is obsessed with Sophie, his student. She, in turn, is intrigued by his scholarly charm. Flirtation turns to lust and the two become lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VfE2VZu75iGJG5w65uOjVQ4HoN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94666'),
  ('124900283577397227', 'Surviving Evil', 2009, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Terence Daw, Mike Downie, Sam Kelly', 'Terence Daw', 'Billy Zane, Christina Cole, Joel Torre, Colin Moss, Louise Barnes, Natalie Mendoza', null, 'A TV documentary crew arrive on a remote island in the Philippines to film a survival special. Their back-to-the-wild adventure proves to be more terrifying than they ever could have imagined', 'A TV documentary crew arrive on a remote island in the Philippines to film a survival special. Their back-to-the-wild adventure proves to be more terrifying than they ever could have imagined', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z64juxTz82jhXu1nauJ7q4qPamm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32857'),
