  ('550528829131461825', 'Surya Power of Love', 2026, 'Romance', 'Sagar Das, Manuraj DB Halli', 'Sagar Das', 'Prashanth Surya, Harshitha MK, Kaddipudi Chandru, Kiran Das, Deepika Gowda', null, 'Thirty years ago, a prominent zamindar family resided in Bangalore, consisting of Maari and Dr. Mamtha. This period marked the advent of IT and biotech companies entering Bangalore, juxtaposed with the city''s notorious underworld activity', 'Thirty years ago, a prominent zamindar family resided in Bangalore, consisting of Maari and Dr. Mamtha. This period marked the advent of IT and biotech companies entering Bangalore, juxtaposed with the city''s notorious underworld activity', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:surya-power-of-love'),
