  ('154080835463343344', 'Susan Slept Here', 1954, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nicholas Musuraca, Frank Tashlin, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Alex Gottlieb', 'Dick Powell, Debbie Reynolds, Alvy Moore, Anne Francis, Glenda Farrell, Horace McMahon, Herb Vigran, Les Tremayne', 'NR', 'On Christmas Eve, suffering from a case of writer''s block, screenwriter Mark Christopher and his gofer Virgil get an unexpected visit from Sergeant Maizel. Knowing Christopher is working on a juvenile delinquent script, the sergeant brings by delinquent Susan thinking she will inspire Christopher while providing a place for her to spend the holidays outside of juvenile hall.', 'On Christmas Eve, suffering from a case of writer''s block, screenwriter Mark Christopher and his gofer Virgil get an unexpected visit from Sergeant Maizel. Knowing Christopher is working on a juvenile delinquent script, the sergeant brings by delinquent Susan thinking she will inspire Christopher while providing a place for her to spend the holidays outside of juvenile hall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdS7eU6DPxeWwdcW1B5R1o7mtX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50356'),
