  ('401901451054565370', 'Suspect', 1987, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Peter Yates, Billy Williams', 'Eric Roth', 'Cher, Dennis Quaid, Liam Neeson, John Mahoney, Joe Mantegna, Philip Bosco, E. Katherine Kerr, Fred Melamed', 'R', 'When a Supreme Court judge commits suicide and his secretary is found murdered, all fingers point to Carl Anderson, a homeless veteran who''s deaf and mute. But when public defender Kathleen Riley is assigned to his case, she begins to believe that Anderson may actually be innocent. Juror Eddie Sanger, a Washington lobbyist, agrees, and together the pair begins their own investigation of events.', 'When a Supreme Court judge commits suicide and his secretary is found murdered, all fingers point to Carl Anderson, a homeless veteran who''s deaf and mute. But when public defender Kathleen Riley is assigned to his case, she begins to believe that Anderson may actually be innocent. Juror Eddie Sanger, a Washington lobbyist, agrees, and together the pair begins their own investigation of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hL79lrrMgRZO21otWbTTiljufeU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12623'),
  ('981939465528779555', 'Suspect X', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Hiroshi Nishitani, Hideo Yamamoto, Hideaki Murakami', 'Yasushi Fukuda', 'Masaharu Fukuyama, Ko Shibasaki, Kazuki Kitamura, Ikkei Watanabe, Miki Maya, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Yasuko Matsuyuki, Keishi Nagatsuka', null, 'A male corpse is discovered with a smashed face and burned hands. Strangely, the cause of death is determined to be strangulation. When Detective Kaoru Utsumi attempts to corroborate the victim’s ex-wife’s alibi she discovers the mysterious neighbor and only a few small clues to help her disprove a seemingly "airtight" alibi...', 'A male corpse is discovered with a smashed face and burned hands. Strangely, the cause of death is determined to be strangulation. When Detective Kaoru Utsumi attempts to corroborate the victim’s ex-wife’s alibi she discovers the mysterious neighbor and only a few small clues to help her disprove a seemingly "airtight" alibi...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKV6Tj4BqrFyRV03rkwHNYIQJY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42341'),
