  ('243336443336895634', 'Suspension', 2008, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Alec Joler, Ethan Shaftel', 'Aris Blevins', 'Scott Cordes, Annie Tedesco, Caroline Vinciguerra, Dan Nichols, David Fritts', null, 'Daniel loses his wife and son in a car accident. While slowly recovering from his injuries, he rebuilds his son''s video camera that was destroyed in the crash. Infused with power from the moment of the crash, the camera develops the ability to stop time when Daniel presses the pause button.', 'Daniel loses his wife and son in a car accident. While slowly recovering from his injuries, he rebuilds his son''s video camera that was destroyed in the crash. Infused with power from the moment of the crash, the camera develops the ability to stop time when Daniel presses the pause button.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQ1rYct8j2idvpC4qVQAOXQG1K5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15055'),
