  ('470662196087659312', 'Suzzanna: Witchcraft', 2026, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Azhar Kinoi Lubis, Muhammad Firdaus, Hollynov Renafia, Nurul Ravika, Mutia Effendi, Dewi Yulia Razif', 'Sunil Soraya, Ferry Lesmana, Jujur Prananto, Naryono Prayitno', 'Luna Maya, Reza Rahadian, Clift Sangra, Restu Triandy, Iwa K', 'TV-MA', 'Suzzanna is determined to exact revenge on Bisman, the cruel village ruler who killed her father with black magic. To achieve this, she learns black magic, but realizes Bisman''s power is immense. In the midst of her efforts, Suzzanna falls in love with Pramuja, a religious man who doesn''t know her secret, forcing her to choose between pursuing her revenge or sacrificing him for love.', 'Suzzanna is determined to exact revenge on Bisman, the cruel village ruler who killed her father with black magic. To achieve this, she learns black magic, but realizes Bisman''s power is immense. In the midst of her efforts, Suzzanna falls in love with Pramuja, a religious man who doesn''t know her secret, forcing her to choose between pursuing her revenge or sacrificing him for love.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F840LaWIjbftEQ4prjt64Hd5gpxo.jpg', 'plex:movie:suzzanna-witchcraft'),
  ('775778802535028795', 'Svaha: The Sixth Finger', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Jang Jae-hyun, Kim Tae-soo, Choi Eun-ae', 'Jang Jae-hyun', 'Lee Jung-jae, Park Jeong-min, Lee Jae-in, Yoo Ji-tae, Jung Jin-young, Jin Sun-kyu, David Lee, Ji Seung-hyun', null, 'Pastor Park, the head of a religious investigation center that exposes cults and cult leaders, begins looking into a suspicious new religion called Deer Mount.', 'Pastor Park, the head of a religious investigation center that exposes cults and cult leaders, begins looking into a suspicious new religion called Deer Mount.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yE6q03pfWg9xZ4a7MoeldDXMV5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:556509'),
  ('687226983403183440', 'Sven Klang''s Combo', 1976, 'Music, Drama', 'Stellan Olsson', 'Henric Holmberg, Ninne Olsson', 'Henric Holmberg, Eva Remaeus, Jan Lindell, Anders Granström, Bo Gunnar Andersson, Christer Boustedt, Ingvar Andersson, Reinhold Andersson', null, 'Sweden 1958. In a small provincial town there is a band who plays dance music twice every week. All decisions are made by Sven Klang, the undisputed leader of the band. A new member joins them, saxophone player Lasse. He starts to criticize Sven''s decisions, questions the way they divide the money and he also wants them to be more of a jazz band.', 'Sweden 1958. In a small provincial town there is a band who plays dance music twice every week. All decisions are made by Sven Klang, the undisputed leader of the band. A new member joins them, saxophone player Lasse. He starts to criticize Sven''s decisions, questions the way they divide the money and he also wants them to be more of a jazz band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzOdyHkR2HpH4DpVqB18OiPAAfz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125499'),
  ('419599039292872500', 'Svengali', 1931, 'Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Archie Mayo, Barney McGill, Gordon Hollingshead', 'J. Grubb Alexander', 'John Barrymore, Marian Marsh, Donald Crisp, Bramwell Fletcher, Carmel Myers, Luis Alberni, Lumsden Hare, Paul Porcasi', 'NR', 'A music maestro uses hypnotism on a young model he meets in Paris to make her both his muse and wife.', 'A music maestro uses hypnotism on a young model he meets in Paris to make her both his muse and wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLE87vAc9bqytSZAfU76MmnQdMh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45803'),
  ('604930057441019649', 'Svengali', 1983, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Anthony Harvey, Larry Pizer', 'Frank Cucci', 'Peter O''Toole, Jodie Foster, Elizabeth Ashley, Larry Joshua, Barbara Bryne, Pamela Blair, Robin Thomas, Madeleine Potter', null, 'An old singer coaches a young woman whom he believes will be the next singing sensation. As she starts off with her career, their bond gets stronger. An adaptation of George L. Du Maurier''s novel "Trilby"', 'An old singer coaches a young woman whom he believes will be the next singing sensation. As she starts off with her career, their bond gets stronger. An adaptation of George L. Du Maurier''s novel "Trilby"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIMocGdCrs26kRQSk1HHpInDrlg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144208'),
  ('475967243815723589', 'Svensson, Svensson - The Movie', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Björn Gunnarsson, Mats Olofson, Richard Holm', 'Michael Hjorth, Johan Kindblom, Tomas Tivemark', 'Suzanne Reuter, Allan Svensson, Chelsie Bell Dickson, Gabriel Odenhammar, Gun Arvidsson, Sten Ljunggren, Jonas Falk, Johan H:son Kjellgren', null, 'Lena Svensson has been offered a new and exiting job in Stockholm that she can''t say no to. But her husband, Gustav, has no plan of what so ever to move from his quiet little town of Vivalla, and especially his job as a very proud postman. After Lena started to commute between Stockholm and Vivalla, he decides to sell the house and give Stockholm a chance. He starts of with a job as a postman in one of Stockholm''s worst districts, but after a mistake on a conference, Gustav seems to do quite a success at his new job, while Lena is struggling with annoying colleagues and a demanding boss.', 'Lena Svensson has been offered a new and exiting job in Stockholm that she can''t say no to. But her husband, Gustav, has no plan of what so ever to move from his quiet little town of Vivalla, and especially his job as a very proud postman. After Lena started to commute between Stockholm and Vivalla, he decides to sell the house and give Stockholm a chance. He starts of with a job as a postman in one of Stockholm''s worst districts, but after a mistake on a conference, Gustav seems to do quite a success at his new job, while Lena is struggling with annoying colleagues and a demanding boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wffX0DP6qlaIRj3VMerDCFum5DP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17964'),
  ('425777479823441630', 'Swades', 2004, 'Drama', 'Ashutosh Gowariker, Danish Aslam, Janani Ravichandran', 'Ashutosh Gowariker', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Gayatri Joshi, Kishori Ballal, Smit Sheth, Lekh Tandon, Rajesh Vivek, Daya Shankar Pandey, Farrukh Jaffar', null, 'A successful Indian scientist returns home to his village to take his nanny back to America with him, and in the process rediscovers his roots.', 'A successful Indian scientist returns home to his village to take his nanny back to America with him, and in the process rediscovers his roots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUSL24kpHc9Nls4Pohia4shgcIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15774'),
  ('916821953608096153', 'Swagger', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Olivier Babinet, Timo Salminen', 'Olivier Babinet', 'Aïssatou Dia, Mariyama Diallo, Abou Fofana, Nazario Giordano, Astan Gonie, Salimata Gonie, Naïla Hanafi, Aaron N''Kiambi', null, 'A teen-movie documentary, Swagger carries us in the midst of the astonishing minds of eleven teenagers from an underprivileged neighborhood.', 'A teen-movie documentary, Swagger carries us in the midst of the astonishing minds of eleven teenagers from an underprivileged neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4RyjabHOVRu7BGzZIfg1Yaubi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396917'),
  ('720961333239961791', 'Swallow', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mike Moran, Carlo Mirabella-Davis, Katelin Arizmendi', 'Carlo Mirabella-Davis', 'Haley Bennett, Austin Stowell, Elizabeth Marvel, David Rasche, Denis O''Hare, Luna Lauren Vélez, Zabryna Guevara, Laith Nakli', 'R', 'Hunter, a newly pregnant housewife, finds herself increasingly compelled to consume dangerous objects. As her husband and his family tighten their control over her life, she must confront the dark secret behind her new obsession.', 'Hunter, a newly pregnant housewife, finds herself increasingly compelled to consume dangerous objects. As her husband and his family tighten their control over her life, she must confront the dark secret behind her new obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40Zrwud1EVxNvcjQkotZo7jmr4L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586461'),
  ('285751352669429180', 'Swallowed', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Carter Smith, Alexander W. Lewis', 'Carter Smith', 'Cooper Koch, Jose Colon, Jena Malone, Mark Patton, Roe Pacheco, Michael Shawn Curtis, Hannah Perry, Thee Suburbia', 'R', 'Benjamin and Dom have been best friends since they were kids. On their last night together, Dom plans to send Benjamin off with a pocketful of cash. All he has to do is deliver a package over the border for a friend...', 'Benjamin and Dom have been best friends since they were kids. On their last night together, Dom plans to send Benjamin off with a pocketful of cash. All he has to do is deliver a package over the border for a friend...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfTtTAjkE2rw91HRSdJsHnHYGmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:851972'),
  ('703455135467896791', 'Swallows and Amazons', 1974, 'Adventure, Family', 'Claude Whatham, Dennis C. Lewiston, David Bracknell', 'David Wood', 'Virginia McKenna, Ronald Fraser, Suzanna Hamilton, Simon West, Sophie Neville, Stephen Grendon, Kit Seymour, Lesley Bennett', null, 'On holiday with their mother in the Lake District in 1929 four children are allowed to sail over to the nearby island in their boat Swallow and set up camp for a few days. They soon realise this has been the territory of two other girls who sail the Amazon, and the scene is set for serious rivalry.', 'On holiday with their mother in the Lake District in 1929 four children are allowed to sail over to the nearby island in their boat Swallow and set up camp for a few days. They soon realise this has been the territory of two other girls who sail the Amazon, and the scene is set for serious rivalry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lewCN0u5NOE7fBSPLP2NqGFrKeK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14685'),
  ('1110675247464561539', 'Swallows and Amazons', 2016, 'Adventure, Family', 'Julian Court, Philippa Lowthorpe, Nige Watson', 'Andrea Gibb', 'Dane Hughes, Orla Hill, Teddie Allen, Bobby McCulloch, Seren Hawkes, Hannah Jayne Thorp, Rafe Spall, Kelly Macdonald', null, 'Four children dream of escaping the tedium of a summer holiday with their mother. When finally given permission to camp on their own on an island in the middle of a vast lake, they are overjoyed. But when they get there they discover they may not be alone… The battle for ownership of a lonely island teaches them the skills of survival, the value of friendship and the importance of holding your nerve.', 'Four children dream of escaping the tedium of a summer holiday with their mother. When finally given permission to camp on their own on an island in the middle of a vast lake, they are overjoyed. But when they get there they discover they may not be alone… The battle for ownership of a lonely island teaches them the skills of survival, the value of friendship and the importance of holding your nerve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5ZVbjos0CqhKLMV77YzX6r12Ls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347035'),
  ('903547961120337535', 'Swallowtail Butterfly', 1996, 'Drama, Crime, Music, Science Fiction', 'Noboru Shinoda, Shunji Iwai, Daizaburo Harada', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Ayumi Ito, Yosuke Eguchi, Chara, Hiroshi Mikami, Andy Hui Chi-On, Atsuro Watabe, Kaori Momoi, Tomoko Yamaguchi', null, 'The struggles of a group of outcasts living in "Yentown", in an alternate-future Japan.', 'The struggles of a group of outcasts living in "Yentown", in an alternate-future Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbHrboUJnLFvAG5eiB9LJaErjPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8426'),
  ('873315196666375373', 'Swamp Devil', 2008, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'David Winning, Érik Ajduk, Nadine Brassard', null, 'Bruce Dern, Cindy Sampson, Nicolas Wright, Robert Higden, Allison Graham, James Kidnie, Bronwen Mantel, Kwasi Songui', null, 'SWAMP DEVIL is the story of young Melanie Blaime (Cindy Sampson) and her father Howard (Bruce Dern). After a long estrangement from her father for reasons not entirely clear, Melanie returns to her childhood home of Gibbington, Vermont to confront the realization that her father is wanted for murder. As Melanie digs a little more deeply into the stories of the past, she uncovers a tale wound about the town like Spanish moss, composed of secrets and lies, murder and revenge.', 'SWAMP DEVIL is the story of young Melanie Blaime (Cindy Sampson) and her father Howard (Bruce Dern). After a long estrangement from her father for reasons not entirely clear, Melanie returns to her childhood home of Gibbington, Vermont to confront the realization that her father is wanted for murder. As Melanie digs a little more deeply into the stories of the past, she uncovers a tale wound about the town like Spanish moss, composed of secrets and lies, murder and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGDjPNtfLbS0YEPkVQsFcnwqp8S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56109'),
  ('524477369935496270', 'Swamp Fire', 1946, 'Drama, Adventure, Action', 'William H. Pine, Fred Jackman Jr., Harold E. Knox', 'Daniel Mainwaring', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Virginia Grey, Buster Crabbe, Carol Thurston, Pedro de Cordoba, Marcelle Corday, William Edmunds, Edwin Maxwell', 'NR', 'Buster Crabbe and Johnny Weissmuller battle it out in Cajun country! Johnny, a riverboat pilot on the Mississippi, is seduced away from his fiance (Carol Thurston) by a rich outsider (Virginia Grey) who''s nursed him back to health after a serious accident. She owns a large piece of the swamp and has outlawed hunting on her property. His rival Mike (Crabbe) is a trapper who harbors deep resentment for Johnny and his new wealthy friends. When he feels Johnny is responsible for the hunting ban, he resorts to destructive acts of vengeance.', 'Buster Crabbe and Johnny Weissmuller battle it out in Cajun country! Johnny, a riverboat pilot on the Mississippi, is seduced away from his fiance (Carol Thurston) by a rich outsider (Virginia Grey) who''s nursed him back to health after a serious accident. She owns a large piece of the swamp and has outlawed hunting on her property. His rival Mike (Crabbe) is a trapper who harbors deep resentment for Johnny and his new wealthy friends. When he feels Johnny is responsible for the hunting ban, he resorts to destructive acts of vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mY09UdKsxjuQABVkjWeCnRBYncn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338029'),
  ('508768344577787242', 'Swamp Shark', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Horror, TV Movie', 'Griff Furst, Sean O''Regan, Lorenzo Senatore', 'Charles Bolon, Eric Miller', 'Kristy Swanson, Robert Davi, D. B. Sweeney, Wade Boggs, Sophie Sinise, Jason Rogel, Jeff Chase, Christopher Berry', 'R', 'Open on gorgeous swamplands of the Atchafalaya Basin in the summer. Lots of beautiful teens are at the beach the weekend before Gator Fest. That night an animal smuggling deal goes wrong and a large sea creature escapes into a swampy backwoods river. At the McDaniel''s "Gator Shack" restaurant, a local, Jackson is drunk, and gets mangled to bits. The town sheriff blames the carnage on the McDaniel''s "escaped" pack of gators and tries hauling them off to jail. Rachel McDaniel, head of the family, claims to have seen the fin of a shark! Rachel and her family, along with the help of a mysterious stranger, Charlie, take on the Swampshark and the law to clear their names, save Rachel''s kid sister Krystal and prevent the unwitting folks at the upcoming Gator Fest from being torn to shreds by a beast the likes of which no one has ever seen!', 'Open on gorgeous swamplands of the Atchafalaya Basin in the summer. Lots of beautiful teens are at the beach the weekend before Gator Fest. That night an animal smuggling deal goes wrong and a large sea creature escapes into a swampy backwoods river. At the McDaniel''s "Gator Shack" restaurant, a local, Jackson is drunk, and gets mangled to bits. The town sheriff blames the carnage on the McDaniel''s "escaped" pack of gators and tries hauling them off to jail. Rachel McDaniel, head of the family, claims to have seen the fin of a shark! Rachel and her family, along with the help of a mysterious stranger, Charlie, take on the Swampshark and the law to clear their names, save Rachel''s kid sister Krystal and prevent the unwitting folks at the upcoming Gator Fest from being torn to shreds by a beast the likes of which no one has ever seen!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QtPPiLSKHZ3bI7oLbLHlMFRcyr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63749'),
  ('1023933933928141405', 'Swamp Thing', 1982, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Wes Craven, Robbie Greenberg', 'Wes Craven', 'Louis Jourdan, Adrienne Barbeau, Ray Wise, David Hess, Nicholas Worth, Don Knight, Al Ruban, Dick Durock', 'PG', 'Mutated by his own secret formula, Dr. Alec Holland becomes Swamp Thing; a half-human, half-plant superhero who will stop at nothing to rescue government agent Alice Cable and defeat his evil arch nemesis...Even if it costs him his life.', 'Mutated by his own secret formula, Dr. Alec Holland becomes Swamp Thing; a half-human, half-plant superhero who will stop at nothing to rescue government agent Alice Cable and defeat his evil arch nemesis...Even if it costs him his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BGaE9A7UeyxH29aeFbQfzEmIi0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17918'),
