  ('625618219586617472', 'Swedish Wildcats', 1972, 'Drama', 'Joseph W. Sarno', 'Vernon P. Becker, Joseph W. Sarno', 'Diana Dors, Cia Löwgren, Solveig Andersson, Christina Lindberg, Peder Kinberg, Ib Mossin, John Harryson, Samira Wale', null, 'The sadistic Madam Margareta is a talking side of beef that serves as the hostess and ring leader for a live sex tease show and whorehouse. Madam''s shows always feature her bodacious nieces Susanna and Karen, who perform in everything from striptease to S&M acts. Karen meets and eventually runs away with a rich guy. Susanna falls in love with a deceptive airport cargo handler. After several more kinky shows and various soft core sex scenes, Karen is gone and Susanna and her man find out the truth behind each others lies.', 'The sadistic Madam Margareta is a talking side of beef that serves as the hostess and ring leader for a live sex tease show and whorehouse. Madam''s shows always feature her bodacious nieces Susanna and Karen, who perform in everything from striptease to S&M acts. Karen meets and eventually runs away with a rich guy. Susanna falls in love with a deceptive airport cargo handler. After several more kinky shows and various soft core sex scenes, Karen is gone and Susanna and her man find out the truth behind each others lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0NDfmHxSbVriCBOyzw6xnnx7uJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123069'),
  ('423420101545108433', 'Sweeney 2', 1978, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Tom Clegg', 'Troy Kennedy Martin', 'John Thaw, Dennis Waterman, Denholm Elliott, Nigel Hawthorne, Ken Hutchison, Anna Gaël, Derrick O''Connor, Georgina Hale', null, 'The plot is set on a group of bank robbers, who are both violent and successful, strangely getting away each time with an amount around the £60,000 mark, and often leaving behind cash in excess of this sum. The robbers are willing to kill their own team, to get away. As Jack Regan himself puts it after the first raid in the film: "I''ve never seen so many dead people". Armed with gold-plated Purdey shotguns, they evaded Regan and the Flying Squad for quite some time, before Regan finds encouragement from his Detective Chief Superintendent who was sent down for corruption because Jack wouldn''t testify in court for him.', 'The plot is set on a group of bank robbers, who are both violent and successful, strangely getting away each time with an amount around the £60,000 mark, and often leaving behind cash in excess of this sum. The robbers are willing to kill their own team, to get away. As Jack Regan himself puts it after the first raid in the film: "I''ve never seen so many dead people". Armed with gold-plated Purdey shotguns, they evaded Regan and the Flying Squad for quite some time, before Regan finds encouragement from his Detective Chief Superintendent who was sent down for corruption because Jack wouldn''t testify in court for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cNQxY9P6sF21pUZ1O4WAMLwr8t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55766'),
  ('678998267037787000', 'Sweeney Todd', 2006, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, Music', 'David Moore', 'Joshua St Johnston', 'Ray Winstone, Essie Davis, David Warner, Tom Hardy, David Bradley, Anthony O''Donnell, Roger Frost, David Foxxe', null, 'A BBC adaptation of the Victorian "penny dreadful" tale of 19th century "demon barber" Sweeney Todd, of Fleet Street, who cuts the throats of unsuspecting clients in his London shop.', 'A BBC adaptation of the Victorian "penny dreadful" tale of 19th century "demon barber" Sweeney Todd, of Fleet Street, who cuts the throats of unsuspecting clients in his London shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40ntPvTqjqEJlME1AtBEzwVUPHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37924'),
  ('510996148970527595', 'Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street', 1936, 'Drama, Crime, Horror', 'George King, Ronnie Kinnoch, Jack Parker', 'Frederick Hayward', 'Tod Slaughter, Stella Rho, John Singer, Eve Lister, Bruce Seton, D.J. Williams, Davina Whitehouse, Jerry Verno', 'NR', 'It is England in the 1830s. London''s dockside is teeming with ships and sailors who have made their fortune in foreign lands. Sweeney Todd, a Fleet Street barber, awaits the arrival of men whose first port of call is for a good, close shave. For most it will be the last time they are seen alive. Using a specially designed barber''s chair, Sweeney Todd despatches his victims to the cellar below, where he robs them of their new found fortunes and chops their remains into small pieces. Meanwhile, Mrs Lovett is enjoying a roaring trade for her popular penny meat pies.', 'It is England in the 1830s. London''s dockside is teeming with ships and sailors who have made their fortune in foreign lands. Sweeney Todd, a Fleet Street barber, awaits the arrival of men whose first port of call is for a good, close shave. For most it will be the last time they are seen alive. Using a specially designed barber''s chair, Sweeney Todd despatches his victims to the cellar below, where he robs them of their new found fortunes and chops their remains into small pieces. Meanwhile, Mrs Lovett is enjoying a roaring trade for her popular penny meat pies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EmPHyueexsshJC7nFcQgi6nGGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87911'),
  ('531614134981113549', 'Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street', 1982, 'Music, Drama, Thriller, Horror, TV Movie', 'Hal Prince, Hal Prince, Terry Hughes', 'Hugh Wheeler, Stephen Sondheim', 'George Hearn, Angela Lansbury, Cris Groenendaal, Sara Woods, Edmund Lyndeck, Calvin Remsberg, Betsy Joslyn, Ken Jennings', null, 'In 1846, Anthony Hope sails into London with the mysterious Sweeney Todd, a once-naive barber whose life and marriage was uprooted by a corrupt justice system. Todd confides in Nellie Lovett, the owner of a local meat pie shop, and the two become partners, as Todd swears revenge on those that have wronged him and decides to take up his old profession.', 'In 1846, Anthony Hope sails into London with the mysterious Sweeney Todd, a once-naive barber whose life and marriage was uprooted by a corrupt justice system. Todd confides in Nellie Lovett, the owner of a local meat pie shop, and the two become partners, as Todd swears revenge on those that have wronged him and decides to take up his old profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Aes0rgHVM1PT0FmeXDzvgb2yJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24745'),
  ('291162516753583481', 'Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street', 2007, 'Drama, Horror', 'Tim Burton, Toby Hefferman, Katterli Frauenfelder', 'John Logan', 'Johnny Depp, Helena Bonham Carter, Alan Rickman, Timothy Spall, Sacha Baron Cohen, Jamie Campbell Bower, Laura Michelle Kelly, Jayne Wisener', 'R', 'The infamous story of Benjamin Barker, a.k.a Sweeney Todd, who sets up a barber shop down in London which is the basis for a sinister partnership with his fellow tenant, Mrs. Lovett. Based on the hit Broadway musical.', 'The infamous story of Benjamin Barker, a.k.a Sweeney Todd, who sets up a barber shop down in London which is the basis for a sinister partnership with his fellow tenant, Mrs. Lovett. Based on the hit Broadway musical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAW4J1bkRjZKmFsJsIiOBASeoAp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13885'),
  ('972167157549501451', 'Sweeney!', 1977, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'David Wickes, Dusty Miller', 'Ranald Graham', 'John Thaw, Dennis Waterman, Barry Foster, Ian Bannen, Colin Welland, Diane Keen, Lynda Bellingham, Brian Glover', null, 'When one of Regan''s snouts complains that his girlfriend''s recent suicide was murder, the flying squad detective feels compelled to investigate. He uncovers a conspiracy that reaches the heart of the government, and finds himself fitted up, suspended and under the scrutiny of Special Branch.', 'When one of Regan''s snouts complains that his girlfriend''s recent suicide was murder, the flying squad detective feels compelled to investigate. He uncovers a conspiracy that reaches the heart of the government, and finds himself fitted up, suspended and under the scrutiny of Special Branch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEyhV0vwH8HrCyKLe1goSNSwkji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55762'),
  ('825649290621073917', 'Sweep the Leg', 2007, 'Action', 'William Zabka, Ketil Dietrichson', 'William Zabka', 'Ralph Macchio, William Zabka, Martin Kove, Ron Thomas, Rob Garrison, Tony O''Dell, Pete Mitchell, Dennis Haskins', null, 'Sweep the Leg incorpoarates elements of the 1984 film The Karate Kid and features appearances by nearly the entire original cast. Martin Kove reprises his role as Sensei Kreese, and actors who played the Cobra Kai members in the 1984 film, Ron Thomas, Rob Garrison, and Tony O''Dell are also part of the cast. William Zabka, who played Johnny Lawrence in the film, directed the video. Pat E. Johnson, who was the martial arts director for the film as well as the martial arts director for Bruce Lee, worked on this video. Dennis Haskins and Liza Snyder also make an appearance. "Sweep the Leg" was also featured on Sony''s MLB 08: The Show.', 'Sweep the Leg incorpoarates elements of the 1984 film The Karate Kid and features appearances by nearly the entire original cast. Martin Kove reprises his role as Sensei Kreese, and actors who played the Cobra Kai members in the 1984 film, Ron Thomas, Rob Garrison, and Tony O''Dell are also part of the cast. William Zabka, who played Johnny Lawrence in the film, directed the video. Pat E. Johnson, who was the martial arts director for the film as well as the martial arts director for Bruce Lee, worked on this video. Dennis Haskins and Liza Snyder also make an appearance. "Sweep the Leg" was also featured on Sony''s MLB 08: The Show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/andLAIRedm9046IuiQrKKMHjo1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835599'),
  ('854987442563615618', 'Sweepers', 1998, 'Action', 'Yossi Wein, Keoni Waxman', 'Kevin Bernhardt, Darby Black', 'Dolph Lundgren, Bruce Payne, Claire Stansfield, Ian Roberts, Fats Bookholane, Nick Boraine, David Dukas, Grant Swanby', 'R', 'Dolph Lundgren is Christian Erickson, a leading demolition expert trained to disarm mine fields in a humanitarian minesweeping operation in Angola. His son is killed and he discovers that mines are being planted during the war to kill people in the area.', 'Dolph Lundgren is Christian Erickson, a leading demolition expert trained to disarm mine fields in a humanitarian minesweeping operation in Angola. His son is killed and he discovers that mines are being planted during the war to kill people in the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8M31PAMj8XhrbfXfILLJHRX8UPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44808'),
  ('371890921766723970', 'Sweet & Sour', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Yoo Ji-sun, Jun Young-seok, Lee Kae-byeok', 'Seong Da-som', 'Jang Ki-yong, Chae Soo-bin, Krystal Jung, Lee Woo-je, Park Cheol-min, Kim Mi-kyeong, Hwang Jeong-min, Lee Kyung-young', 'NR', 'Faced with real-world opportunities and challenges, a couple endures the highs and lows of trying to make a long-distance relationship survive.', 'Faced with real-world opportunities and challenges, a couple endures the highs and lows of trying to make a long-distance relationship survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yGwAPl6LWpi8QwHjwCMaqsPgNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662237'),
  ('694890083115401860', 'Sweet and Lowdown', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Woody Allen, Zhao Fei, Lisa Janowski', 'Woody Allen', 'Sean Penn, Samantha Morton, Anthony LaPaglia, Uma Thurman, James Urbaniak, John Waters, Gretchen Mol, Denis O''Hare', 'PG-13', 'In the 1930s, jazz guitarist Emmet Ray idolizes Django Reinhardt, faces gangsters and falls in love with a mute woman.', 'In the 1930s, jazz guitarist Emmet Ray idolizes Django Reinhardt, faces gangsters and falls in love with a mute woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23S5qa8j3ajYnERcYCqMLfSeOvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9684'),
  ('10430240075775829', 'Sweet as Pie', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Jonathan MacPherson, Maximilian Brey', 'Haidyn Janae Harvey, Amy Katherine Taylor', 'Rhiannon Fish, Kurtis Szarka, Mercedes De La Cruz, Roark Critchlow, Dave Kenneth MacKinnon, Tracey Power, Beth Fotheringham, Maia Mae', null, 'Tamara Hayes an entrepreneur dealing with the implosion of her startup and her relationship, visits her family’s apple orchard in hopes of taking a break from life. She begins to fall for her childhood best friend and now the farm manager, Will Lewis, and together they go to great lengths to keep the orchard alive. Will’s gentle encouragement reminds Tamara that home is worth fighting for – and when she reveals her secret apple pie recipe she is inspired to make one more go at a “million dollar idea”.', 'Tamara Hayes an entrepreneur dealing with the implosion of her startup and her relationship, visits her family’s apple orchard in hopes of taking a break from life. She begins to fall for her childhood best friend and now the farm manager, Will Lewis, and together they go to great lengths to keep the orchard alive. Will’s gentle encouragement reminds Tamara that home is worth fighting for – and when she reveals her secret apple pie recipe she is inspired to make one more go at a “million dollar idea”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alBEcKy5V8fB7DWAaKXb9hvEGvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925850'),
  ('28129905338481518', 'Sweet Autumn', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul Suderman, Diana Kim, Ehud Ellman', 'Tyler Straessle', 'Nikki DeLoach, Andrew W. Walker, Henriette Ivanans, Daina Leitold, Michael Karl Richards, Paul Essiembre, Stephanie Sy, Eugene Baffoe', null, 'Maggie, a successful entrepreneur, returns home for a will reading and discovers she’s inherited half of her aunt’s famed maple candy business. What she doesn’t understand is why Aunt Dee’s maple supplier, Dex, inherited the other half. Her return also coincides with the town’s Sweet Autumn Fest, and through a series of letters Aunt Dee left, Maggie and Dex search for the reason behind her aunt’s final wishes. As she and Dex grow closer, Maggie must decide if the life she built is the one she wants.', 'Maggie, a successful entrepreneur, returns home for a will reading and discovers she’s inherited half of her aunt’s famed maple candy business. What she doesn’t understand is why Aunt Dee’s maple supplier, Dex, inherited the other half. Her return also coincides with the town’s Sweet Autumn Fest, and through a series of letters Aunt Dee left, Maggie and Dex search for the reason behind her aunt’s final wishes. As she and Dex grow closer, Maggie must decide if the life she built is the one she wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNiwExRiyf2Kd6B7ButFiQUQ6p2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737684'),
  ('909757800960954107', 'Sweet Bean', 2015, 'Drama', 'Naomi Kawase, Shigeki Akiyama, Miho Hôjô', 'Naomi Kawase', 'Kirin Kiki, Masatoshi Nagase, Kyara Uchida, Miki Mizuno, Etsuko Ichihara, Miyoko Asada, Taiga Nakano, Wakato Kanematsu', null, 'The master of a dorayaki pastry store hires a 76-year-old woman whose talents attract customers from all over. But she''s hiding a troubling secret. Life''s joys are found in the little details, and no matter what may be weighing you down, everyone loves a good pastry.', 'The master of a dorayaki pastry store hires a 76-year-old woman whose talents attract customers from all over. But she''s hiding a troubling secret. Life''s joys are found in the little details, and no matter what may be weighing you down, everyone loves a good pastry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YV0eoUBFQ4vKaN71SPtUte2YcD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319373'),
  ('86488504483467493', 'Sweet Bird of Youth', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Brooks, Milton Krasner, Hank Moonjean', 'Richard Brooks', 'Paul Newman, Geraldine Page, Shirley Knight, Ed Begley, Rip Torn, Mildred Dunnock, Madeleine Sherwood, Philip Abbott', 'NR', 'Gigolo and drifter Chance Wayne returns to his hometown as the companion of a faded movie star, Alexandra Del Lago, whom he hopes to use to help him break into the movies. Chance runs into trouble when he finds his ex-girlfriend, the daughter of the local politician Tom "Boss" Finley, who more or less forced him to leave his daughter and the town many years ago.', 'Gigolo and drifter Chance Wayne returns to his hometown as the companion of a faded movie star, Alexandra Del Lago, whom he hopes to use to help him break into the movies. Chance runs into trouble when he finds his ex-girlfriend, the daughter of the local politician Tom "Boss" Finley, who more or less forced him to leave his daughter and the town many years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uA9tl4o8P1hNB3lDBhHKHcNGdtr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33632'),
  ('920083219546341286', 'Sweet Bird of Youth', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Nicolas Roeg, Francis Kenny', 'Tennessee Williams', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Mark Harmon, Valerie Perrine, Seymour Cassel, Rip Torn, Kevin Geer, Ronnie Claire Edwards, Cheryl Paris', 'NR', 'Tennessee William’s masterful melodrama about an aging movie star who, appalled by her own image on the screen, flees from her movie premiere and goes into seclusion, becoming entangled with a much younger hotel masseur and resident gigolo.', 'Tennessee William’s masterful melodrama about an aging movie star who, appalled by her own image on the screen, flees from her movie premiere and goes into seclusion, becoming entangled with a much younger hotel masseur and resident gigolo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNx3J2DcM3V0MuHEUy0bETUXXsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90994'),
  ('607059733032834866', 'Sweet Bobby: My Catfish Nightmare', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Lyttanya Shannon, Geoffrey Sentamu', 'Lyttanya Shannon', 'Kirat Assi, Bobby Jandu, Sanj Jandu, Hemma Gulhane, Anurag Mehra, Ariya Larker', 'PG-13', 'Kirat falls for a man she meets online, only to get swept up in a virtual relationship that upends her life for years. Her online courtship takes an unsettling turn when she learns that her romantic interest harbours a dark secret and sinister motives, leading to a harrowing ordeal, in this shocking documentary.', 'Kirat falls for a man she meets online, only to get swept up in a virtual relationship that upends her life for years. Her online courtship takes an unsettling turn when she learns that her romantic interest harbours a dark secret and sinister motives, leading to a harrowing ordeal, in this shocking documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOYSWDkW3lKOZNHkR4WdHG0sb8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1361048'),
  ('612059135810551574', 'Sweet Boy', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Niroon Limsomwong, Sathanapong Limwongthong', null, 'Wachirawit Ruangwiwat, Palm Natchakan Raungrong, Thanwa Heffels, Priyaporn Suksang, Chaichart Bunditsakulporn, Sakulkarn Wijitsittipaisan, Chaiyakorn Dejkajornwut, Tanachai Kungcharonetanachot', null, 'Lonely and living with his hardworking single mom, a studious teen begins to grasp the ideas of sex and his sexuality until a stranger makes a move.', 'Lonely and living with his hardworking single mom, a studious teen begins to grasp the ideas of sex and his sexuality until a stranger makes a move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KPuX63MffEOVljWEwzRRqBwfZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455355'),
  ('20542389803735618', 'Sweet Bunch', 1983, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Nikos Nikolaidis, Aris Stavrou, Theodoros Konstadopoulos', 'Nikos Nikolaidis', 'Despina Tomazani, Dora Masklavanou, Takis Moschos, Takis Spyridakis, Alkis Panagiotidis, Lenia Polycrati, Konstantinos Tzoumas, Charis Romas', null, 'The diary of the life and death of a group of "amoral" young people, who have reached the point of no return and seek something to believe in and to die for. Their behavior brings them to the attention of the State. A discreet surveillance begins. A vigilante group monitors their house, headed by a nameless blonde man.', 'The diary of the life and death of a group of "amoral" young people, who have reached the point of no return and seek something to believe in and to die for. Their behavior brings them to the attention of the State. A discreet surveillance begins. A vigilante group monitors their house, headed by a nameless blonde man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTolMQR8qOU3jCqICVUzSbY2FiX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131476'),
  ('28691752083327630', 'Sweet Carolina', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance, Family, Drama', 'Peter Benson, Geoff Wallace', null, 'Lacey Chabert, Tyler Hynes, Gregory Harrison, Jesse Moss, Teryl Rothery, Cassidy Nugent, Glen Gordon, Donna Benedicto', 'G', 'Josie is a successful New York marketing executive who returns to her small hometown. While there, she becomes the unexpected guardian of her niece and nephew and reconnects with Cooper, her high school boyfriend.', 'Josie is a successful New York marketing executive who returns to her small hometown. While there, she becomes the unexpected guardian of her niece and nephew and reconnects with Cooper, her high school boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsjBwsv3opnYXbv6syyn7kkBxiy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:819701'),
