  ('1082211859326691480', 'Sweet Country', 2018, 'Western, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Warwick Thornton, Warwick Thornton, Tom Read', 'Steven McGregor, David Tranter', 'Hamilton Morris, Bryan Brown, Sam Neill, Thomas M. Wright, Ewen Leslie, Matt Day, Gibson John, Natassia Gorey Furber', 'R', 'In 1929, an Australian Aboriginal stockman kills a white station owner in self-defense and goes on the lam, pursued by a posse.', 'In 1929, an Australian Aboriginal stockman kills a white station owner in self-defense and goes on the lam, pursued by a posse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szJdZCSiEIYybmPymoP2UTEvOUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468210'),
  ('966751568178954708', 'Sweet Deceptions', 1960, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alberto Lattuada, Aldo Buzzi, Leo Pescarolo', 'Alberto Lattuada, Francesco Ghedini, Claude Brulé', 'Christian Marquand, Catherine Spaak, Jean Sorel, Milly, Juanita Faust, Marilù Tolo, Patrizia Bini, Oliviero Dani', null, 'Francesca, a seventeen-year-old Roman, is finally sure she has found love. Almost sure. She spends the day observing other lovers'' behaviors and considering whether she is ready to jump. Her age notwithstanding, this movie is more about coming of age than about improper or illegal romantic relationships.', 'Francesca, a seventeen-year-old Roman, is finally sure she has found love. Almost sure. She spends the day observing other lovers'' behaviors and considering whether she is ready to jump. Her age notwithstanding, this movie is more about coming of age than about improper or illegal romantic relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4jtZ3yAwO9ZIF1Wc7f9VbqxD5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82858'),
  ('1132022687212663566', 'Sweet Dreams', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nanni Moretti, Inigo Lezzi, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Nanni Moretti', 'Nanni Moretti, Nicola Di Pinto, Laura Morante, Alessandro Haber, Remo Remotti, Piera Degli Esposti, Gigio Morra, Giampiero Mughini', null, 'Michele criticizes the film industry and its inhabitants, and is particularly embattled with a Neapolitan director making a musical about the 1968 student demonstrations. At the same time, Michele has a creative block and struggles to finish his film titled "Freud’s Mother." Nanni Moretti’s self-inquiry into filmmaking, political ennui, and men’s relations with their mothers.', 'Michele criticizes the film industry and its inhabitants, and is particularly embattled with a Neapolitan director making a musical about the 1968 student demonstrations. At the same time, Michele has a creative block and struggles to finish his film titled "Freud’s Mother." Nanni Moretti’s self-inquiry into filmmaking, political ennui, and men’s relations with their mothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TSmNeUdA1EtGyqKS7UH00i9kew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57967'),
  ('235431199627155232', 'Sweet Dreams', 1985, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Robbie Greenberg, Karel Reisz, Ric Kidney', 'Robert Getchell', 'Jessica Lange, Ed Harris, Ann Wedgeworth, David Clennon, James Staley, Gary Basaraba, John Goodman, P. J. Soles', 'PG-13', 'The story of Patsy Cline, the velvet-voiced country music singer who died in a tragic plane crash at the height of her fame.', 'The story of Patsy Cline, the velvet-voiced country music singer who died in a tragic plane crash at the height of her fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BuTH2W1s2AQTZAfiLoUMTx1PmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42045'),
  ('254121351341554448', 'Sweet Dreams', 2016, 'Drama', 'Marco Bellocchio, Daniele Ciprì', 'Valia Santella, Edoardo Albinati, Marco Bellocchio', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Bérénice Bejo, Guido Caprino, Emmanuelle Devos, Fabrizio Gifuni, Roberto Herlitzka, Miriam Leone, Barbara Ronchi', null, 'Turin, 1969. Nine-year-old Massimo’s idyllic childhood is shattered by the mysterious death of his mother. The young boy refuses to accept this brutal loss, even if the priest says she is now in Heaven. Years later in the 90s, adult Massimo has become an accomplished journalist. After reporting on the war in Sarajevo, he begins to suffer from panic attacks. As he prepares to sell his parents’ apartment, Massimo is forced to relive his traumatic past. Compassionate doctor Elisa could help tormented Massimo open up and confront his childhood wounds…', 'Turin, 1969. Nine-year-old Massimo’s idyllic childhood is shattered by the mysterious death of his mother. The young boy refuses to accept this brutal loss, even if the priest says she is now in Heaven. Years later in the 90s, adult Massimo has become an accomplished journalist. After reporting on the war in Sarajevo, he begins to suffer from panic attacks. As he prepares to sell his parents’ apartment, Massimo is forced to relive his traumatic past. Compassionate doctor Elisa could help tormented Massimo open up and confront his childhood wounds…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hVOxQX6Q7K6IsOJAw4D7zPIssX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394260'),
  ('300539428173142242', 'Sweet Dreams', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Lije Sarki, Sing Howe Yam', 'Lije Sarki', 'Johnny Knoxville, Bobby Lee, Jay Mohr, Kate Upton, Brian Van Holt, Theo Von, GaTa, Mo Amer', 'R', 'Morris navigates his way through a mandatory stay at Sweet Dreams sober living. In an attempt to get his life back on track, he agrees to coach a misfit softball team of his fellow housemates.', 'Morris navigates his way through a mandatory stay at Sweet Dreams sober living. In an attempt to get his life back on track, he agrees to coach a misfit softball team of his fellow housemates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1TyT5umEoAM2SXQIp7OwNBn7Hv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1062421'),
  ('490788653387189484', 'Sweet Ecstasy', 1962, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Max Pécas, Robert Topart, Marc Fossard', 'Jacques Aucante', 'Pierre Brice, Elke Sommer, Vittoria Prada, Christian Pezey, Jenny Astruc, Michèle Bardollet, Agnès Spaak, Robert Darame', null, 'Olivier, a handsome but callow and moody young student, picks up an enthusiastic actress during a theatre rehearsal, and is introduced to her acquaintances -- a group of jaded rich kids who spend their time storming around the Riviera harassing passersby, throwing wild parties and following all the latest trends. When sexy Elke gives him the eye, he leaves the actress in the lurch and joins the gang for a decadent party aboard a yacht. However, Elke''s wanton ways and Olivier''s inexperience do not mesh, and in a snit, he accidentally sets the yacht afire. The gang wreaks its vengeance by luring him into a dangerous contest of bravura on a construction site.', 'Olivier, a handsome but callow and moody young student, picks up an enthusiastic actress during a theatre rehearsal, and is introduced to her acquaintances -- a group of jaded rich kids who spend their time storming around the Riviera harassing passersby, throwing wild parties and following all the latest trends. When sexy Elke gives him the eye, he leaves the actress in the lurch and joins the gang for a decadent party aboard a yacht. However, Elke''s wanton ways and Olivier''s inexperience do not mesh, and in a snit, he accidentally sets the yacht afire. The gang wreaks its vengeance by luring him into a dangerous contest of bravura on a construction site.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXwGtGP8OE1FuZuXHYHhlO0sXdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206191'),
  ('954445387228581499', 'Sweet Emma, Dear Böbe', 1992, 'Drama', 'István Szabó, Lajos Koltai', 'István Szabó, Andrea Vészits', 'Johanna ter Steege, Enikő Börcsök, Péter Andorai, Éva Kerekes, Ildikó Bánsági, Irma Patkós, Erzsi Pásztor, Hédi Temessy', null, 'The story shows Emma''s and Böbe''s fight for survival, for keeping their position in society which they achieved with hard work in the previous regime. They don''t want to lose their place and become village girls again.', 'The story shows Emma''s and Böbe''s fight for survival, for keeping their position in society which they achieved with hard work in the previous regime. They don''t want to lose their place and become village girls again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anGU5jd6JiNfNlWoXHiP7uRGnR1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41194'),
  ('30251619838287022', 'Sweet Evil', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Olivier Coussemacq, Alexis Kavyrchine', 'Olivier Coussemacq', 'Anaïs Demoustier, Pascal Greggory, Ludmila Mikaël, Sylvain Dieuaide, Aurélia Petit, Jacky Lambert, Hubert Saint-Macary, Catherine Benguigui', null, 'Fifteen-year-old Céline knows more about life than is appropriate for her age. She wanders the streets, surviving, with the help of her boyfriend Romain, thanks to her defiance and ruthless practicality. She secretly sleeps in the garden house of a luxury villa, where one evening she is discovered by the owner, Judge Henri van Eyck. Despite his wife Nathalie''s reticence, he takes the girl in and Céline gradually gains their goodwill and affection. The fragile balance of their mutual trust, however, comes in serious jeopardy when the web of lies the girl has told her protectors begins to unravel, revealing her real motives.', 'Fifteen-year-old Céline knows more about life than is appropriate for her age. She wanders the streets, surviving, with the help of her boyfriend Romain, thanks to her defiance and ruthless practicality. She secretly sleeps in the garden house of a luxury villa, where one evening she is discovered by the owner, Judge Henri van Eyck. Despite his wife Nathalie''s reticence, he takes the girl in and Céline gradually gains their goodwill and affection. The fragile balance of their mutual trust, however, comes in serious jeopardy when the web of lies the girl has told her protectors begins to unravel, revealing her real motives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zi91t9CMr1XmQwOa6z4xZi60g6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118778'),
