  ('457043253576234818', 'Sweet Home', 2015, 'Horror', 'Rafa Martínez', 'Ángel Agudo, Rafa Martínez, Teresa de Rosendo', 'Ingrid García Jonsson, Bruno Sevilla, José María Blanco, Eduardo Lloveras, Luka Peroš, Oriol Tarrida, Miguel Ángel Alarcón, Leticia Dolera', null, 'A couple decides to spend a romantic evening in a floor of a semi-abandoned building that slip because she works as a consultant for the council house and got the keys. During the evening they discover that a hooded murderer is the only tenant left in the building...and they have become the new target.', 'A couple decides to spend a romantic evening in a floor of a semi-abandoned building that slip because she works as a consultant for the council house and got the keys. During the evening they discover that a hooded murderer is the only tenant left in the building...and they have become the new target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tdfWey5HoXmgM0hdXsJWGbxfR1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328252'),
  ('550494154337154715', 'Sweet Home Alabama', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Andy Tennant, Andrew Dunn, Louis D''Esposito', 'C. Jay Cox', 'Reese Witherspoon, Josh Lucas, Patrick Dempsey, Candice Bergen, Mary Kay Place, Fred Ward, Jean Smart, Ethan Embry', 'PG-13', 'New York fashion designer, Melanie Carmichael suddenly finds herself engaged to the city''s most eligible bachelor. But her past holds many secrets—including Jake, the redneck husband she married in high school, who refuses to divorce her. Bound and determined to end their contentious relationship once and for all, Melanie sneaks back home to Alabama to confront her past.', 'New York fashion designer, Melanie Carmichael suddenly finds herself engaged to the city''s most eligible bachelor. But her past holds many secrets—including Jake, the redneck husband she married in high school, who refuses to divorce her. Bound and determined to end their contentious relationship once and for all, Melanie sneaks back home to Alabama to confront her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/698cbxq0SRwCdOPG5Bwi7JDk12d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11529'),
