  ('1112153368554324836', 'Sweet Karma', 2009, 'Action, Thriller', 'Andrew Thomas Hunt', 'Andrew Thomas Hunt, James Fler', 'Shera Bechard, John Tokatlidis, Frank J. Zupancic, Christian Bako, Laura McLean, Patricia Stasiak, Lana Koseniv, Mark Wiebe', 'R', 'A mute Russian girl infiltrates Toronto''s underground sex trade to avenge the death of her sister.', 'A mute Russian girl infiltrates Toronto''s underground sex trade to avenge the death of her sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eICrJCzM4M5nBCgtWpTe3l4lhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46534'),
