  ('1089381163912826523', 'Sweet Mother', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Jorge Furtado, Ana Luíza Azevedo, Sara Valar', 'Miguel da Costa Franco, Jorge Furtado, Ana Luíza Azevedo', 'Fernanda Montenegro, Marco Ricca, Louise Cardoso, Matheus Nachtergaele, Mariana Lima, Daniel de Oliveira, Mirna Spritzer, Elisa Volpatto', null, 'Picucha may seem old-fashioned, but she has modern ideas and a great sense of humor. As the matriarch of a big family, she is involved in the daily lives of her children, grandchildren and other relatives. Undeterred by the typical problems of old age, she uses her many years of experience to solve problems in the best way possible.', 'Picucha may seem old-fashioned, but she has modern ideas and a great sense of humor. As the matriarch of a big family, she is involved in the daily lives of her children, grandchildren and other relatives. Undeterred by the typical problems of old age, she uses her many years of experience to solve problems in the best way possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1MIeEnpnFz1uFhGyIkgEw9RDO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156031'),
