  ('823801496735561225', 'Sweet Rain: Accuracy of Death', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Masaya Kakehi, Takahide Shibanushi', 'Masaya Kakehi, Hirotoshi Kobayashi', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Manami Konishi, Sumiko Fuji, Takuya Ishida, Ken Mitsuishi, Jun Murakami, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Erika Okuda', null, 'Chiba appears seven days before a person dies an unexpected death. His job is to observe the person for seven days then decide either to ‘execute’ or ‘pass over’. Today, again, in the rain, he waits. His subject, her death due in seven days, is Kazue Fujiki. She works for a manufacturing company in the complaints department. Exhausted after her day, she emerges from her office. It’s time for the Reaper to go to work.', 'Chiba appears seven days before a person dies an unexpected death. His job is to observe the person for seven days then decide either to ‘execute’ or ‘pass over’. Today, again, in the rain, he waits. His subject, her death due in seven days, is Kazue Fujiki. She works for a manufacturing company in the complaints department. Exhausted after her day, she emerges from her office. It’s time for the Reaper to go to work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYxR64OzLf3Ak7EEwQtDAMG0g8x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13128'),
