  ('976315101912065981', 'Sweet Sex', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Park Sun-Uk', 'Kim Min-joo-III', 'Lee Chae-dam, Sin Seong-hoon, Yoon Se-na, Min Do-yoon, Jang Ji-eun-I', null, 'A famous patissier and his women enjoy work and sex. Neung-geum has dreamt of being a pattisier. She stops supporting her boyfriends school bills. Woo-hyeon is a famous dessert patissier and he has secretive sex to get secret recipes but to him this is just a way to find sweetness. Neung-geum learns how to make dessert from Woo-hyeon. What kind of sex will they have today? What flavor?', 'A famous patissier and his women enjoy work and sex. Neung-geum has dreamt of being a pattisier. She stops supporting her boyfriends school bills. Woo-hyeon is a famous dessert patissier and he has secretive sex to get secret recipes but to him this is just a way to find sweetness. Neung-geum learns how to make dessert from Woo-hyeon. What kind of sex will they have today? What flavor?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkt25KjYmyuRchMpGUPhdEgxnd2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465595'),
  ('474893317175163172', 'Sweet Sex and Love', 2003, 'Romance, Drama', 'Bong Man-dae, Choi Sang-muk', 'Kwak Jieong-duk', 'Kim Seo-hyung, Kim Sung-su, Seo Beom-sik, Kim Ji-hoon, Park Byeong-seon, Cha Soo-yeon-I', null, 'Shin-ah, a free spirit, has an unexpected encounter with Dong-gi, who seeks excitement. After a passionate night, she breaks up with her boyfriend and reunites with Dong-gi when he calls. The two fall madly in love.', 'Shin-ah, a free spirit, has an unexpected encounter with Dong-gi, who seeks excitement. After a passionate night, she breaks up with her boyfriend and reunites with Dong-gi when he calls. The two fall madly in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zu002fbXHiJbtOgKMpOxhb9vJN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75432'),
  ('708121268425761337', 'Sweet Sixteen', 1983, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery', 'Jim Sotos, Gary Graver, James L. Carter', 'Erwin Goldman', 'Bo Hopkins, Susan Strasberg, Patrick Macnee, Don Stroud, Dana Kimmell, Don Shanks, Aleisa Shirley, Steve Antin', null, 'A beautiful lonely girl named Melissa tries to make new friends from a town she''s currently living in. The only problem is, each of the boys that she spends time with end up brutally murdered. Her sixteenth birthday is on the way, but Melissa turns out to be a suspect when it seems she''s the last person who has seen her boyfriends alive.', 'A beautiful lonely girl named Melissa tries to make new friends from a town she''s currently living in. The only problem is, each of the boys that she spends time with end up brutally murdered. Her sixteenth birthday is on the way, but Melissa turns out to be a suspect when it seems she''s the last person who has seen her boyfriends alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPnuYWok19qgYZi6NiOi6KQegM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78552'),
  ('1059360780325408512', 'Sweet Sixteen', 2002, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ken Loach, Barry Ackroyd', 'Paul Laverty', 'Martin Compston, Annmarie Fulton, William Ruane, Michelle Abercromby, Michelle Coulter, Gary McCormack, Tommy McKee, Calum McAlees', null, 'Determined to have a normal family life once his mother gets out of prison, a Scottish teenager from a tough background sets out to raise the money for a home.', 'Determined to have a normal family life once his mother gets out of prison, a Scottish teenager from a tough background sets out to raise the money for a home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5h50WEZQ4pRFffnSULqL4cEuLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1376'),
  ('805230980774064072', 'Sweet Sixteen', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cho Jin-gyu', 'Cho Jin-gyu', 'Kris Wu, Han Geng, Joo Won, Zhang Yao, Sung Yoo-bin', null, 'Xia Mu is a troubled child whose salvation comes in the form of Shu Yawang. When something terrible happens to her, he seeks revenge. Nothing is the same in their lives after that.', 'Xia Mu is a troubled child whose salvation comes in the form of Shu Yawang. When something terrible happens to her, he seeks revenge. Nothing is the same in their lives after that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eY9il7HkZb1QsZYyGSNoYxu7PTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411757'),
  ('613967045085178404', 'Sweet Sixty', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Maxime Cointe, Emmanuelle Tan, Robin Sykes', 'Haroun, Elise Larnicol, Antoine Raimbault', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Marie Bunel, Patrick Timsit, Zineb Triki, Grégoire Oestermann, Olivia Côte, Célia Pilastre, Xavier Robic', null, 'At sixty years old, two friends in financial difficulties are going to take advantage of their image in the fashion and advertising world. One is still beautiful, the other never was. But beyond the game of appearances, what does it really mean to be of retirement age today?', 'At sixty years old, two friends in financial difficulties are going to take advantage of their image in the fashion and advertising world. One is still beautiful, the other never was. But beyond the game of appearances, what does it really mean to be of retirement age today?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31dkjJJty4gVA2t5LKi2WBd9x15.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960543'),
  ('1057380951618239439', 'Sweet Skin', 1963, 'Drama', 'Jacques Poitrenaud, Raymond Lemoigne', 'Jacques Sigurd, Jacques Poitrenaud', 'Nico, Dany Saval, Jean Sobieski, Joe Turner, Darry Cowl, Jean Tissier, Robert Rollis, Marcel Charvey', null, 'Strip-tease has a pleasing Paris setting and a convincing strip club atmosphere, where a roster of exotic dancers do their thing. Making the club atmosphere work is the animated Dany Saval, as a charming gossip and outspoken cheerleader for the art of the strip-tease. Berthe encourages Ariane to loosen up and enjoy what she''s doing.', 'Strip-tease has a pleasing Paris setting and a convincing strip club atmosphere, where a roster of exotic dancers do their thing. Making the club atmosphere work is the animated Dany Saval, as a charming gossip and outspoken cheerleader for the art of the strip-tease. Berthe encourages Ariane to loosen up and enjoy what she''s doing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tO5zsOt7DjZRIiWIaA6BiO4Sy0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90930'),
  ('591927496993185555', 'Sweet Smell of Success', 1957, 'Drama', 'Alexander Mackendrick, James Wong Howe, Richard Maybery', 'Clifford Odets, Ernest Lehman', 'Burt Lancaster, Tony Curtis, Susan Harrison, Martin Milner, Jeff Donnell, Sam Levene, Joe Frisco, Barbara Nichols', null, 'New York City newspaper writer J.J. Hunsecker holds considerable sway over public opinion with his Broadway column, but one thing that he can''t control is his younger sister, Susan, who is in a relationship with aspiring jazz guitarist Steve Dallas. Hunsecker strongly disapproves of the romance and recruits publicist Sidney Falco to find a way to split the couple, no matter how ruthless the method.', 'New York City newspaper writer J.J. Hunsecker holds considerable sway over public opinion with his Broadway column, but one thing that he can''t control is his younger sister, Susan, who is in a relationship with aspiring jazz guitarist Steve Dallas. Hunsecker strongly disapproves of the romance and recruits publicist Sidney Falco to find a way to split the couple, no matter how ruthless the method.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akzvV8JasNrgEl5iAP9K6zPHGJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976'),
  ('972724832704963136', 'Sweet Sugar', 1972, 'Action, Drama', 'Michel Levesque, Gabriel Torres', 'Don Spencer', 'Phyllis Davis, Ellaraino, Timothy Brown, Pamela Collins, Cliff Osmond, Angus Duncan, Jacqueline Giroux, Darl Severns', 'R', 'A young woman nabbed in a drug bust chooses to work on a sugarcane plantation with other convicts instead of going to jail.', 'A young woman nabbed in a drug bust chooses to work on a sugarcane plantation with other convicts instead of going to jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unKGH53cXsYlQYSQQzZG5akJDdO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38035'),
  ('571592595697483711', 'Sweet Talker', 1972, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ertem Eğilmez', null, 'Tarık Akan, Filiz Akın, Halit Akçatepe, Metin Akpınar, Kemal Sunal, Zeki Alasya, Münir Özkul, Hulusi Kentmen', null, 'Ferit is a basketball player from Istanbul. One day, at a camp he attends, he meets Emine, a village teacher. They fall in love at first sight and get married, but the spell is broken when Ferit''s friends from the city arrive.', 'Ferit is a basketball player from Istanbul. One day, at a camp he attends, he meets Emine, a village teacher. They fall in love at first sight and get married, but the spell is broken when Ferit''s friends from the city arrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hn47axAnJKPVVOlXPcdOjQpoexV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110028'),
  ('1065092472832768919', 'Sweet Thing', 2020, 'Drama', 'Lasse Ulvedal Tolbøll, Alexandre Rockwell', 'Alexandre Rockwell', 'Lana Rockwell, Nico Rockwell, Will Patton, Karyn Parsons, ML Josepher, Jabari Watkins, Steven Randazzo', 'NR', 'For Billie and Nico, life with their father is a roller-coaster ride of playfulness and unease. When he is in the grip of alcohol, tears flow and their apparently idyllic family life collapses. Their mostly absent and irresponsible mother is not much help either. But their friendship with Malik, a boy of Billie’s age, frees them from their shackles. Together they embark on a journey full of intense moments of freedom. The colourful, emotional world of the three young people is depicted in kaleidoscopic black and white imagery, which opens space for their own notions of childhood. Alexandre Rockwell''s tale portrays a profound sense of solidarity and deep love: for cinema and Billie Holiday, and also for risk and adventure.', 'For Billie and Nico, life with their father is a roller-coaster ride of playfulness and unease. When he is in the grip of alcohol, tears flow and their apparently idyllic family life collapses. Their mostly absent and irresponsible mother is not much help either. But their friendship with Malik, a boy of Billie’s age, frees them from their shackles. Together they embark on a journey full of intense moments of freedom. The colourful, emotional world of the three young people is depicted in kaleidoscopic black and white imagery, which opens space for their own notions of childhood. Alexandre Rockwell''s tale portrays a profound sense of solidarity and deep love: for cinema and Billie Holiday, and also for risk and adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxBeb2FXPOCuOJo8APu8hfUTCnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626882'),
  ('470351294230363833', 'Sweet Virginia', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David Roncin, Hannah Shrader, Andrew McEwan', 'Benjamin China, Paul China', 'Jon Bernthal, Christopher Abbott, Imogen Poots, Rosemarie DeWitt, Odessa Young, Joseph Lyle Taylor, Jonathan Tucker, Garry Chalk', 'R', 'A former rodeo star, now a motel manager, meets a young man who is responsible for the violence that suddenly has seized his small town.', 'A former rodeo star, now a motel manager, meets a young man who is responsible for the violence that suddenly has seized his small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTch1l0ZMU4MiOBDEJ14jVmANVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413992'),
  ('256667254266300935', 'Sweet Whip', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Takashi Ishii, Shin Ikemoto, Yasushi Sasakibara', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Mitsu Dan, Yuki Mamiya, Naoto Takenaka, Hiroko Nakajima, Tsuyoshi Nakano, Ito Yozaburo, Hiroko Yashiki, Shun Nakayama', null, 'When Naoko was a freshman in high school she was kidnapped and imprisoned by a man who lived next door. For one month, she went through hell. Finally, she killed the man and escaped. Now as an adult, Naoko is a doctor specializing in infertility treatment, but she also has another side.', 'When Naoko was a freshman in high school she was kidnapped and imprisoned by a man who lived next door. For one month, she went through hell. Finally, she killed the man and escaped. Now as an adult, Naoko is a doctor specializing in infertility treatment, but she also has another side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGicTWd9sHk0TinuLNm4I5DCVSV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231164'),
  ('1078297866987267470', 'Sweeter Than Chocolate', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'David Weaver', 'Kim Beyer-Johnson, Tracy Andreen', 'Eloise Mumford, Dan Jeannotte, Brenda Strong, Jordana Summer, Linda Ko, Nik Andrews, Bobby Stewart, Lesley Mirza', 'G', 'A local bakery is rumored to have the secret recipe to finding true love on Feb. 14, drawing in a TV reporter to investigate.', 'A local bakery is rumored to have the secret recipe to finding true love on Feb. 14, drawing in a TV reporter to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrzaNZgwftpiGO29LnUajnTyD1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1068817'),
  ('989020755139753635', 'Sweetgrass', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Lucien Castaing-Taylor, Lucien Castaing-Taylor, Ilisa Barbash', null, 'John Ahern, Elaine Allestad, Lawrence Allestad, Pat Connolly, Billy Allestad, John Jankens, Jackie McKenney, Mark Miller', null, 'An unsentimental elegy to the American West, Sweetgrass follows the last modern-day cowboys to lead their flocks of sheep up into Montana''s breathtaking and often dangerous Absaroka-Beartooth mountains for summer pasture, revealing a world in which nature and culture, animals and humans, vulnerability and violence are all intimately meshed.', 'An unsentimental elegy to the American West, Sweetgrass follows the last modern-day cowboys to lead their flocks of sheep up into Montana''s breathtaking and often dangerous Absaroka-Beartooth mountains for summer pasture, revealing a world in which nature and culture, animals and humans, vulnerability and violence are all intimately meshed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTQ7URCmLBWkMJeT4G8uyvpciqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50071'),
  ('246325175028381190', 'Sweetheart', 1992, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Bernard Lutic, Michel Deville', 'Rosalinde Deville', 'Patrick Bruel, Jacques Dutronc, Mathilda May, Sophie Broustal, Vernon Dobtcheff, Eric da Silva, Michaël Pas, François Loriquet', null, 'A young French police inspector, Christophe Vade, is assigned to investigate some mysterious murders in a village in the Swiss Alps. His superior is a man named Thurston, who uses some unorthodox methods to fight crime. Vade’s investigations lead him to a wealthy industrialist, Gardella, a dangerous and powerful man.', 'A young French police inspector, Christophe Vade, is assigned to investigate some mysterious murders in a village in the Swiss Alps. His superior is a man named Thurston, who uses some unorthodox methods to fight crime. Vade’s investigations lead him to a wealthy industrialist, Gardella, a dangerous and powerful man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSwdXmhXFxpsvshVFAt1YjxLKpk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217683'),
  ('1057469927257449999', 'Sweetheart', 2019, 'Horror', 'J.D. Dillard, Stefan Duscio, Toby Pease', 'Alex Hyner, Alex Theurer, J.D. Dillard', 'Kiersey Clemons, Emory Cohen, Hanna Mangan Lawrence, Benedict Samuel, Andrew Crawford', null, 'Jenn has washed ashore a small tropical island and it doesn’t take her long to realize she’s completely alone. She must spend her days not only surviving the elements, but must also fend off the malevolent force that comes out each night.', 'Jenn has washed ashore a small tropical island and it doesn’t take her long to realize she’s completely alone. She must spend her days not only surviving the elements, but must also fend off the malevolent force that comes out each night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyPPBPkGbZxfS6UM4PjR5bnVfwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463843'),
