  ('518779020115328933', 'Sweethearts', 1938, 'Music, Comedy', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Joseph C. Wright, Douglas Shearer', 'Robert B. Smith', 'Jeanette MacDonald, Nelson Eddy, Frank Morgan, Ray Bolger, Florence Rice, Mischa Auer, Herman Bing, George Barbier', null, 'The team behind a successful Broadway production tries to stop the married stars from transitioning to Hollywood.', 'The team behind a successful Broadway production tries to stop the married stars from transitioning to Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBj60AHDKS9Bf4UxezVf2N8xqze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43849'),
