  ('829570757867238693', 'Sweethearts', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Jordan Weiss, Andrew Wehde, Alejandro Ramia', 'Dan Brier, Jordan Weiss', 'Kiernan Shipka, Nico Hiraga, Caleb Hearon, Ava DeMary, Charlie Hall, Tramell Tillman, Joel Kim Booster, Miles Gutierrez-Riley', 'R', 'Two college freshmen who decided to stick with their high school sweethearts have to pull a ''Turkey Dump'' and break up with them over ''Drunksgiving'' the one chaotic night before Thanksgiving in their hometown that puts their codependent friendship to the test.', 'Two college freshmen who decided to stick with their high school sweethearts have to pull a ''Turkey Dump'' and break up with them over ''Drunksgiving'' the one chaotic night before Thanksgiving in their hometown that puts their codependent friendship to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/890UDXYal6i8A9NbMV5TAxZpOzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999890'),
  ('709209737763218641', 'Sweetie', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jane Campion, Martin Say, Jennifer Kernke', 'Jane Campion, Gerard Lee', 'Geneviève Lemon, Karen Colston, Tom Lycos, Jon Darling, Dorothy Barry, Andre Pataczek, Michael Lake, Jean Hadgraft', 'R', 'The buttoned-down, superstitious Kay is attempting to lead a normal existence with her new boyfriend Louis. That’s until Sweetie, her rampaging, devil-may-care sister, returns home after an absence, exposing the rotten roots of their family and placing a strain on Kay and Louis’ relationship.', 'The buttoned-down, superstitious Kay is attempting to lead a normal existence with her new boyfriend Louis. That’s until Sweetie, her rampaging, devil-may-care sister, returns home after an absence, exposing the rotten roots of their family and placing a strain on Kay and Louis’ relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25lpQtxNWXzOimnXmbwF0Y0GYej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65015'),
  ('559781480252277137', 'Sweetie, You Won''t Believe It', 2020, 'Comedy, Thriller, Horror', 'Azamat Dulatov, Yernar Nurgaliyev', 'Yernar Nurgaliyev', 'Daniyar Alshinov, Azamat Marklenov, Assel Kaliyeva, Yerlan Primbetov, Rustem Zhaniyamanov, Dulyga Akmolda, Almat Sakatov, Zhandos Aibassov', null, 'Dastan can no longer stand the constant nagging of his highly pregnant wife and decides to run away for at least one day with his friends. The men go fishing, which would have gone smoothly, if not for a series of unforeseen events.', 'Dastan can no longer stand the constant nagging of his highly pregnant wife and decides to run away for at least one day with his friends. The men go fishing, which would have gone smoothly, if not for a series of unforeseen events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS32slEbrXMJJhL6P1JrjaBDTWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681880'),
  ('337707410067760783', 'Sweetness', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama, Music', 'Emma Higgins, Mat Barkley', 'Emma Higgins', 'Justin Chatwin, Kate Hallett, Amanda Brugel, Steven Ogg, Erika Swayze', 'R', 'When a chance encounter with her rockstar crush leads 16 year old Rylee to discover that he''s a dysfunctional drug addict, she takes it upon herself to help him, ultimately forcing her teenage fantasies into reality.', 'When a chance encounter with her rockstar crush leads 16 year old Rylee to discover that he''s a dysfunctional drug addict, she takes it upon herself to help him, ultimately forcing her teenage fantasies into reality.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F2%2Fgracenote%2F27881f66b03bdb20dafc4569825a6e37.jpg', 'plex:movie:sweetness-2026'),
  ('12558591023964952', 'Sweets from a Stranger', 1987, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'Franco Ferrini, Giuseppe Bernardini', 'Franco Ferrini, Andrea Giuseppini', 'Barbara De Rossi, Marina Suma, Athina Cenci, Mara Venier, Laura Betti, Anny Papa, Gerardo Amato, Sabrina Ferilli', null, 'In Rome, a sadistic serial killer begins stalking and murdering sex workers, leaving the community terrified and the authorities struggling to stop the violence. After several attacks, four women—Lena, Angela, Nadine, and Stella—decide they can’t wait to be the next victims, and band together to protect each other and take a more active role in the search. As police pressure mounts and the women start digging for clues on their own, the hunt turns the city into a tense web of fear, rumors, and suspicion.', 'In Rome, a sadistic serial killer begins stalking and murdering sex workers, leaving the community terrified and the authorities struggling to stop the violence. After several attacks, four women—Lena, Angela, Nadine, and Stella—decide they can’t wait to be the next victims, and band together to protect each other and take a more active role in the search. As police pressure mounts and the women start digging for clues on their own, the hunt turns the city into a tense web of fear, rumors, and suspicion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rE8Yc6V80qDrymOrixAARwtwXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57115'),
  ('467890265390273224', 'Sweetwater', 1988, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Lasse Glomm, Philip Øgaard', 'Lasse Glomm, Petter Skavlan', 'Bentein Baardson, Petronella Barker, Alphonsia Emmanuel, Per Jansen, Sven Wollter, Martin Disch, Sverre Anker Ousdal, Bjørn Sundquist', null, 'Allan and Lisa flee the war-torn city of Sweetwater with their young son for the safety of the municipal dump in this sleepy war drama. They join other displaced survivors who were driven from their homes, looking for a better life on the outskirts of Sweetwater.', 'Allan and Lisa flee the war-torn city of Sweetwater with their young son for the safety of the municipal dump in this sleepy war drama. They join other displaced survivors who were driven from their homes, looking for a better life on the outskirts of Sweetwater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ieA7YEk0e7uyVIVAt8nzkzTgl5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197521'),
  ('628987001104512527', 'Sweetwater', 2013, 'Western, Thriller', 'Logan Miller, Brad Shield', 'Andrew McKenzie, Noah Miller, Logan Miller', 'January Jones, Jason Isaacs, Ed Harris, Eduardo Noriega, Stephen Root, Luce Rains, Amy Madigan, Jason Aldean', 'R', 'In the late 1800s, a fanatical religious leader, a renegade Sheriff, and a former prostitute collide in a blood triangle on the rugged plains of the New Mexico Territory.', 'In the late 1800s, a fanatical religious leader, a renegade Sheriff, and a former prostitute collide in a blood triangle on the rugged plains of the New Mexico Territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q69vCHmShdsiXixCIdwJuyJXEXY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158916'),
  ('1138728065285705632', 'Sweetwater', 2023, 'Drama', 'Massimo Zeri, Martin Guigui', 'Martin Guigui', 'Everett Osborne, Cary Elwes, Jeremy Piven, Eric Roberts, Jim Caviezel, Richard Dreyfuss, Kevin Pollak, Mike Starr', 'PG-13', 'In 1990 Chicago, a taxi driver recounts to his passenger, a sportswriter, his life story. He reveals himself to be Nat "Sweetwater" Clifton, one of the first African Americans to play in the NBA.', 'In 1990 Chicago, a taxi driver recounts to his passenger, a sportswriter, his life story. He reveals himself to be Nat "Sweetwater" Clifton, one of the first African Americans to play in the NBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18Jz0oJto5lwsZrQ11w3GKI6rtt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987257'),
  ('854274775482844310', 'Sweety Naughty Crazy', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rajasekar G, C. Vijayasri, Sengeni Anbarasan', 'Snehan, Baskar Dev', 'Jayakumar, C. Dharmaraj, Balveer, Snehan, Baskar Dev', null, 'A bold romantic comedy about Shiva, a charming college student juggling three different relationships. As he tries to keep them secret, love, lust, and chaos collide in a playful mix of adult humor, romance, and comedy.', 'A bold romantic comedy about Shiva, a charming college student juggling three different relationships. As he tries to keep them secret, love, lust, and chaos collide in a playful mix of adult humor, romance, and comedy.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8TUdDDC26HQWNS7SdrYHSzyfYgZ.jpg', 'plex:movie:sweety-naughty-crazy'),
  ('418436113541517070', 'Swelter', 2014, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Keith Parmer', 'Keith Parmer', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Alfred Molina, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Lennie James, Brad Carter, Mindy Robinson, Tracey Walter, Josh Henderson', 'R', 'Ten years after their casino heist, four escaped convicts trace their former partner to a desert town, where he is now a lawman with no memory of his criminal past.', 'Ten years after their casino heist, four escaped convicts trace their former partner to a desert town, where he is now a lawman with no memory of his criminal past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DJ8KOT2t8y8FiLn3hrMyPT9MyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256687'),
  ('359693526019493473', 'Swept Away', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Lina Wertmüller, Gianni Arduini, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Lina Wertmüller', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Mariangela Melato, Riccardo Salvino, Isa Danieli, Aldo Puglisi, Anna Melita, Eros Pagni, Vittorio Fanfoni', null, 'A spoiled rich woman and a brutish Communist deckhand become stranded alone on a desert island after venturing away from their cruise.', 'A spoiled rich woman and a brutish Communist deckhand become stranded alone on a desert island after venturing away from their cruise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bkEUeQWVFBk3HE4qhluDarTMDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37916'),
  ('3940416194650403', 'Swept Away', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Guy Ritchie, Alex Barber, Michael Elliott', 'Lina Wertmüller', 'Madonna, Adriano Giannini, Bruce Greenwood, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Elizabeth Banks, Michael Beattie, David Thornton, Yorgo Voyagis', 'R', 'Stranded and alone on a desert island during a cruise, a spoiled rich woman and a deckhand fall in love and make a date to reunite after their rescue.', 'Stranded and alone on a desert island during a cruise, a spoiled rich woman and a deckhand fall in love and make a date to reunite after their rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAa3nTeDpwgLX6XxnT3wR86C5WE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12779'),
  ('939716945249089063', 'Swept from the Sea', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Beeban Kidron, Dick Pope, Cliff Lanning', 'Tim Willocks', 'Rachel Weisz, Vincent Perez, Ian McKellen, Kathy Bates, Joss Ackland, Tony Haygarth, Fiona Victory, Tom Bell', 'PG-13', 'The film tells the story of Russian emigree and the only survivor from ship crash Yanko Goorall and servant Amy Foster in the end of 19th century. When Yanko enters a farm sick and hungry after the shipwreck, everyone is afraid of him, except for Amy, who is very kind and helps him. Soon he becomes like a son for Dr. James Kennedy and romance between Yanko and Amy follows.', 'The film tells the story of Russian emigree and the only survivor from ship crash Yanko Goorall and servant Amy Foster in the end of 19th century. When Yanko enters a farm sick and hungry after the shipwreck, everyone is afraid of him, except for Amy, who is very kind and helps him. Soon he becomes like a son for Dr. James Kennedy and romance between Yanko and Amy follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5Or62J6mF099MQcn0Cq8ycIfqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1959'),
  ('319088880845659040', 'Swept Under', 2015, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Michel Poulette, Daniel Villeneuve', 'James Taylor Phillips, Doug Barber', 'Devin Kelley, Aaron Ashmore, Stephen Bogaert, Brett Ryan, Joanne Boland, Vladimir Jon Cubrt, Marianne Farley, Patrizio Sanzari', null, 'Meet Morgan. At first glance, she''s just your average cleaning lady. She has no problem getting her hands dirty, which is a good thing considering it''s not fancy houses she cleans for a living - it''s gruesome crime scenes. It''s at one of these scenes that Morgan discovers a key piece of evidence overlooked by the forensics team. This, and her knack for reading blood splatter, catch Nick''s attention, a newbie detective working the case. The pair soon become unofficial partners on what''s become a stream of related murders and the closer they get to solving the mystery the closer they get to each other. But while they succeed in getting a confession from their primary suspect, their feelings for each other risk blinding them to the truth and they find themselves dangerously close to the real killer.', 'Meet Morgan. At first glance, she''s just your average cleaning lady. She has no problem getting her hands dirty, which is a good thing considering it''s not fancy houses she cleans for a living - it''s gruesome crime scenes. It''s at one of these scenes that Morgan discovers a key piece of evidence overlooked by the forensics team. This, and her knack for reading blood splatter, catch Nick''s attention, a newbie detective working the case. The pair soon become unofficial partners on what''s become a stream of related murders and the closer they get to solving the mystery the closer they get to each other. But while they succeed in getting a confession from their primary suspect, their feelings for each other risk blinding them to the truth and they find themselves dangerously close to the real killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsSnOpQzMK3vLG0rYpLfFgVv4az.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372490'),
  ('38855388631881051', 'Swim', 2021, 'Horror, Action', 'Marcus Friedlander, Jared Cohn', 'Anthony C. Ferrante', 'Joey Lawrence, Jennifer Field, Andrew Lauer, Brett Hargrave, Daniel Grogan, Addison Bowman, Rib Hillis, Timothy Jones', 'NR', 'After a storm floods a family''s vacation rental home, they must get past a vicious shark that has found its way inside the house.', 'After a storm floods a family''s vacation rental home, they must get past a vicious shark that has found its way inside the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBSqH6avxduNAnXhyIkcAfcUMJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:861057'),
  ('597990179939025216', 'Swim Little Fish Swim', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lola Bessis, Brett Jutkiewicz, Ruben Amar', 'Ruben Amar, Lola Bessis', 'Dustin Guy Defa, Brooke Bloom, Lola Bessis, Anne Consigny, Olivia Costello, Makeda Declet, Paul Manza, Joy Seligsohn', null, 'Between surrealism, unusual characters, art and magic tricks, "Swim Little Fish Swim" is a dreamlike journey from childhood to adulthood.', 'Between surrealism, unusual characters, art and magic tricks, "Swim Little Fish Swim" is a dreamlike journey from childhood to adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOwv5rAXNceBdL8IGkE8E9DZUNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169817'),
