  ('145445437465548681', 'Swimfan', 2002, 'Thriller, Mystery, Romance, Drama', 'John Polson, Giles Nuttgens, Tom Priestley Jr.', 'Charles F. Bohl, Phillip Schneider', 'Jesse Bradford, Erika Christensen, Shiri Appleby, Kate Burton, Jason Ritter, Peter Hermann, Dan Hedaya, Nick Sandow', 'PG-13', 'Ben Cronin has it all: the admiration of his many friends, a terrific girlfriend, and he''s on the fast-track to an athletic scholarship. Ben''s rock-solid, promising future and romance are turned upside-down with the arrival of Madison Bell. Madison, the new girl in town, quickly sets her sights on the impressionable Ben. While their first few meetings are innocent enough, the obsessive and seductive Madison wants more ... much more.', 'Ben Cronin has it all: the admiration of his many friends, a terrific girlfriend, and he''s on the fast-track to an athletic scholarship. Ben''s rock-solid, promising future and romance are turned upside-down with the arrival of Madison Bell. Madison, the new girl in town, quickly sets her sights on the impressionable Ben. While their first few meetings are innocent enough, the obsessive and seductive Madison wants more ... much more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHSRRxzBeUtxMosSqpCcBiGnPYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20616'),
  ('457110004243776838', 'Swimming for Gold', 2020, 'Family', 'Hayley MacFarlane, Shing Fung Cheung, Ben Parkinson', 'Eric Bergemann', 'Peyton List, Daniel Needs, Lauren Esposito, Olivia Nardini, Johrel Martschinke, Ray Chong Nee, Martin Dingle Wall, Candice Hill', null, 'Young elite swimmer Claire is sent to Australia to coach a boys swimming team, where she must overcome an old rival and a secret fear to save the swimming camp from closing.', 'Young elite swimmer Claire is sent to Australia to coach a boys swimming team, where she must overcome an old rival and a secret fear to save the swimming camp from closing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2pDwrMuZTCZ7WuV35qFgFgFSHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682402'),
