  ('548643306246807259', 'Swimming Out Till the Sea Turns Blue', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Jia Zhangke, Nelson Yu Lik-wai', 'Jia Zhangke, Jiahuan Wan', 'Huifang Duan, Liang Hong, Pingwa Jia, Yu Hua, Su Tong, Jia Zhangke', null, 'Filmmaker Jia Zhangke chronicles his local literature festival in Shanxi, China which includes a multi-generational roster of the country''s most esteemed writers.', 'Filmmaker Jia Zhangke chronicles his local literature festival in Shanxi, China which includes a multi-generational roster of the country''s most esteemed writers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjcsnMdZNODFGn9nKwdr24fEJtU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601368'),
  ('807211171513654287', 'Swimming Pool', 2003, 'Crime, Thriller', 'François Ozon, Yorick Le Saux, Antoine Garceau', 'Emmanuèle Bernheim', 'Charlotte Rampling, Ludivine Sagnier, Charles Dance, Marc Fayolle, Jean-Marie Lamour, Mireille Mossé, Michel Fau, Jean-Claude Lecas', 'R', 'A British crime novelist travels to her publisher''s upmarket summer house in Southern France to seek solitude in order to work on her next book. However, the unexpected arrival of the publisher''s daughter induces complications and a subsequent crime.', 'A British crime novelist travels to her publisher''s upmarket summer house in Southern France to seek solitude in order to work on her next book. However, the unexpected arrival of the publisher''s daughter induces complications and a subsequent crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10xMAznUxI0LZPYyPxA9WjJsThr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302'),
  ('907758282470249227', 'Swimming to Cambodia', 1987, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Jonathan Demme, John Bailey', 'Spalding Gray', 'Spalding Gray, Sam Waterston, Ira Wheeler', null, 'Spalding Gray sits behind a desk throughout the entire film and recounts his exploits and chance encounters while playing a minor role in the film ''The Killing Fields''. At the same time, he gives a background to the events occurring in Cambodia at the time the film was set.', 'Spalding Gray sits behind a desk throughout the entire film and recounts his exploits and chance encounters while playing a minor role in the film ''The Killing Fields''. At the same time, he gives a background to the events occurring in Cambodia at the time the film was set.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33gl89Dw4y51pVK2PcSWi0PaKVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42015'),
  ('742544692956707229', 'Swimming Upstream', 2003, 'Drama', 'Russell Mulcahy, Martin McGrath', 'Anthony Fingleton', 'Geoffrey Rush, Judy Davis, Jesse Spencer, Tim Draxl, Deborah Kennedy, David Hoflin, Craig Horner, Brittany Byrnes', 'PG-13', 'A young man aspiring for recognition of his talents battles against his estranged father''s sentiment towards him as the father deals with his own demons.', 'A young man aspiring for recognition of his talents battles against his estranged father''s sentiment towards him as the father deals with his own demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gf6tspHI8Doh0hTYaC4mf1Zm87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15474'),
  ('907738760835041487', 'Swimming with Men', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Raedeker, Rory Broadfoot, Andi Coldwell', 'Aschlin Ditta', 'Rob Brydon, Rupert Graves, Jim Carter, Daniel Mays, Adeel Akhtar, Thomas Turgoose, Charlotte Riley, Jane Horrocks', null, 'A man who is suffering a mid-life crisis finds new meaning in his life as part of an all-male, middle-aged, amateur synchronised swimming team.', 'A man who is suffering a mid-life crisis finds new meaning in his life as part of an all-male, middle-aged, amateur synchronised swimming team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18JuZBqLzdDQ7EuXmZVWuLLcZRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506025'),
  ('684378051619780803', 'Swimming with Sharks', 1994, 'Crime, Comedy', 'George Huang, Steven Finestone, Rebecca Fulton', 'George Huang', 'Kevin Spacey, Frank Whaley, Michelle Forbes, Benicio del Toro, T.E. Russell, Roy Dotrice, Matthew Flint, Patrick Fischler', 'R', 'Guy is a young film executive who''s willing to do whatever it takes to make it in Hollywood. He begins working for famed producer Buddy Ackerman, a domineering, manipulative, coldhearted boss. When Guy also finds out that his cynical girlfriend, Dawn, has been using sex as a career move, he reaches his limit. Guy decides to exact revenge on Buddy by kidnapping him and subjecting him to cruel and unusual punishment.', 'Guy is a young film executive who''s willing to do whatever it takes to make it in Hollywood. He begins working for famed producer Buddy Ackerman, a domineering, manipulative, coldhearted boss. When Guy also finds out that his cynical girlfriend, Dawn, has been using sex as a career move, he reaches his limit. Guy decides to exact revenge on Buddy by kidnapping him and subjecting him to cruel and unusual punishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMRiIJIEyMLjWjktIqjNfzs9jGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20306'),
  ('910195255264726387', 'Swindle', 2014, 'Comedy, Crime, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Judge, Thomas M. Harting', null, 'Jennette McCurdy, Noah Crawford, Noah Munck, Ariana Grande, Ciara Bravo, Christopher O''Neal, Fred Ewanuick, Sandy Robson', 'G', 'A boy named Griffin finds a valuable multi-million dollar baseball card. After accidentally selling the card for a million dollar loss, he enlists the help of his best friend Ben and his colleagues to regain the baseball card.', 'A boy named Griffin finds a valuable multi-million dollar baseball card. After accidentally selling the card for a million dollar loss, he enlists the help of his best friend Ben and his colleagues to regain the baseball card.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gccrJwdNv0roucBpG6Dus0gw4Xb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216769'),
  ('234209997135524889', 'Swindled', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Miguel Bardem', 'Carlos Martín, Miguel Bardem', 'Victoria Abril, Ernesto Alterio, Federico Luppi, Manuel Alexandre, Gilbert Melki, Alejandro Casaseca, Manuel Morón, Alfredo Villa', null, 'In a flashback, Ernesto, a young con man, tells us how he got to the edge of a big score: childhood in an orphanage, youthful smash-and-grab burglaries until his partner is caught, then tutelage from Lefty, an aging swindler. After some years of success, they''re joined by Federico, the best, a true artist. Things go well until Pilar, a woman from Federico''s past, re-enters his life with a proposal to con a golden goose - a swindle that will put them all on easy street. A double-cross may be in the cards. The flashback over, can Ernesto hold his own in the present?', 'In a flashback, Ernesto, a young con man, tells us how he got to the edge of a big score: childhood in an orphanage, youthful smash-and-grab burglaries until his partner is caught, then tutelage from Lefty, an aging swindler. After some years of success, they''re joined by Federico, the best, a true artist. Things go well until Pilar, a woman from Federico''s past, re-enters his life with a proposal to con a golden goose - a swindle that will put them all on easy street. A double-cross may be in the cards. The flashback over, can Ernesto hold his own in the present?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBj8WwPitRNZuMAoCG4jTUl9rJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53750'),
  ('1025511443715131465', 'Swineherd and Shepherd', 1941, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Ivan Pyryev, Valentin Pavlov, Vyacheslav Leshchyov', 'Viktor Gusev', 'Marina Ladynina, Vladimir Zeldin, Nikolay Kryuchkov, Osip Abdulov, Nikita Kitaev, Grigoriy Alekseev, Yevdokia Schastlivtseva, Tikhon Khrennikov', null, 'They met in Moscow - a shy swineherd Glasha and shepherd Musaib. Long and difficult will be their way to love and a new meeting in this classic Soviet musical comedy.', 'They met in Moscow - a shy swineherd Glasha and shepherd Musaib. Long and difficult will be their way to love and a new meeting in this classic Soviet musical comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxGNfkukcyIUFMT8U356JTHMoNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69841'),
  ('932668366009573058', 'Swing', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Tony Gatlif, Claude Garnier', 'Tony Gatlif', 'Oscar Copp, Lou Rech, Tchavolo Schmitt, Mandino Reinhardt, Abdellatif Chaarani, Fabienne Mai, Ben Zimet, Marie Genin', null, 'In a suburb of Strasbourg, Alsace, France, ten year old boy, Max, spends his summer vacation with his grandmother. He hears Manouche gypsy Romani music being played in a local bar, and loves it. He goes to visit the gypsies in search of a guitar, where he meets a young Romani tomboy, ''Swing''. She introduces Max to her gypsy community who live in caravans and down-at-heel public housing. Over several days, Max is taken into the community to witness Romani lifestyle, traditions, knowledge of plants, and particularly their Manouche music. Max is particularly fascinated by Miraldo, the Romani guitarist he first heard in the bar, and asks to take guitar lessons with him (Miraldo is played by one of the greatest guitarists of gypsy jazz, Tchavolo Schmitt).', 'In a suburb of Strasbourg, Alsace, France, ten year old boy, Max, spends his summer vacation with his grandmother. He hears Manouche gypsy Romani music being played in a local bar, and loves it. He goes to visit the gypsies in search of a guitar, where he meets a young Romani tomboy, ''Swing''. She introduces Max to her gypsy community who live in caravans and down-at-heel public housing. Over several days, Max is taken into the community to witness Romani lifestyle, traditions, knowledge of plants, and particularly their Manouche music. Max is particularly fascinated by Miraldo, the Romani guitarist he first heard in the bar, and asks to take guitar lessons with him (Miraldo is played by one of the greatest guitarists of gypsy jazz, Tchavolo Schmitt).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leikw0ujDkP4R4B1g0zuS4OwH5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32616'),
  ('626598838737487555', 'Swing Girls', 2004, 'Comedy, Music', 'Shinobu Yaguchi, Takahide Shibanushi, Shozo Katashima', 'Shinobu Yaguchi, Junko Yaguchi', 'Juri Ueno, Yuta Hiraoka, Shihori Kanjiya, Yuika Motokariya, Yukari Toyoshima, Naoto Takenaka, Nagisa Abe, Noriko Eguchi', null, 'A group of delinquent high school girls form a band when they accidentally poison their school''s brass band and have to replace them.', 'A group of delinquent high school girls form a band when they accidentally poison their school''s brass band and have to replace them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7lAziuBxlX4DQQzuPHDRoOwtDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36592'),
  ('250619843897433065', 'Swing High', 1932, 'Documentary', 'Jack Cummings', null, 'Pete Smith, Edward Codona, Lalo Codona, Alfredo Codona, Vera Codona', null, 'Swing High is a 1932 American Pre-Code short documentary film directed by Jack Cummings. In 1932, it was nominated for an Academy Award at the 5th Academy Awards for Best Short Subject (Novelty). The film documents The Flying Codonas, a family of flying trapeze artists.', 'Swing High is a 1932 American Pre-Code short documentary film directed by Jack Cummings. In 1932, it was nominated for an Academy Award at the 5th Academy Awards for Best Short Subject (Novelty). The film documents The Flying Codonas, a family of flying trapeze artists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlbJbWT4sNyZ3raX5TgsdOzi4hp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173753'),
  ('888181359147037180', 'Swing High, Swing Low', 1937, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Mitchell Leisen, Ted Tetzlaff', 'Virginia Van Upp, Oscar Hammerstein II', 'Carole Lombard, Fred MacMurray, Charles Butterworth, Jean Dixon, Dorothy Lamour, Harvey Stephens, Cecil Cunningham, Charles Arnt', 'NR', 'In Panama, Maggie King meets soldier Skid Johnson on his last day in the army and reluctantly agrees to a date to celebrate. The two become involved in a nightclub brawl which causes Maggie to miss her ship back to the States. Now stranded, she''s forced to move in with Skid and his pal Harry. She soon falls in love with Skid. Skid gets a job playing the trumpet at a local club and becomes a big success. Fame and fortune go to his head which eventually destroys his relationship with Maggie and his career.', 'In Panama, Maggie King meets soldier Skid Johnson on his last day in the army and reluctantly agrees to a date to celebrate. The two become involved in a nightclub brawl which causes Maggie to miss her ship back to the States. Now stranded, she''s forced to move in with Skid and his pal Harry. She soon falls in love with Skid. Skid gets a job playing the trumpet at a local club and becomes a big success. Fame and fortune go to his head which eventually destroys his relationship with Maggie and his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tysr4TsbjzLlTHi65PMtIYPyQU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105551'),
  ('351375262458837730', 'Swing Into Romance', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bradley Walsh', 'Marcy Holland', 'Danica McKellar, David Haydn-Jones, Gleb Savchenko, Brenda Bazinet, Valerie Boyle, Taya Messier, Michelle Jackett-Webster, Ipsita Paul', 'G', 'The former dancer Christine Sims when she temporarily returns to her hometown for the Fall Festival and learns that her family''s General Store is struggling. In order to help save the business, Christine will need to dust off her dancing shoes and face her ex-fiancé — and she may even find love in the process.', 'The former dancer Christine Sims when she temporarily returns to her hometown for the Fall Festival and learns that her family''s General Store is struggling. In order to help save the business, Christine will need to dust off her dancing shoes and face her ex-fiancé — and she may even find love in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGjcWn55YmVsDn1SORwqnHYPTLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104102'),
  ('574556496412930806', 'Swing Kids', 1993, 'Music, Drama', 'Thomas Carter, Jerzy Zieliński', 'Jonathan Marc Feldman', 'Robert Sean Leonard, Christian Bale, Frank Whaley, Barbara Hershey, Tushka Bergen, David Tom, Mary Fogarty, Kenneth Branagh', 'PG-13', 'The story of a close-knit group of young kids in Nazi Germany who listen to banned swing music from the US. Soon dancing and fun leads to more difficult choices as the Nazis begin tightening the grip on Germany. Each member of the group is forced to face some tough choices about right, wrong, and survival.', 'The story of a close-knit group of young kids in Nazi Germany who listen to banned swing music from the US. Soon dancing and fun leads to more difficult choices as the Nazis begin tightening the grip on Germany. Each member of the group is forced to face some tough choices about right, wrong, and survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o85xTgX5ByDewuYo5yOLIsP02CX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10419'),
  ('1007916579646663380', 'Swing Kids', 2018, 'Drama, War', 'Kang Hyoung-chul, Kim Ji-yong, Kang Seung-yeon', 'Kang Hyoung-chul', 'Doh Kyung-soo, Jared Grimes, Park Hye-su, Oh Jung-se, Kim Min-ho, Ross Kettle, A.J. Simmons, Song Jae-ryong', null, 'Rebellious Ki-soo from North Korea is mesmerized by tap dance in prison camps. Ki-soo joins as a team member of a dance team named ''Swing Kids''. Yet suddenly, their dreams about dancing in prison camps are put in danger.', 'Rebellious Ki-soo from North Korea is mesmerized by tap dance in prison camps. Ki-soo joins as a team member of a dance team named ''Swing Kids''. Yet suddenly, their dreams about dancing in prison camps are put in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHTGysp05nfUZ3SJJtAVMjzTsTt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554779'),
  ('720378270926095547', 'Swing Parade of 1946', 1946, 'Romance, Music, Comedy', 'Phil Karlson', 'Edmond Kelso, Nicholas Ray', 'Gale Storm, Phil Regan, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Connee Boswell, Louis Jordan, Edward Brophy', 'NR', 'A struggling young singer falls for a nightclub owner whose father, a millionaire, is trying to shut it down.', 'A struggling young singer falls for a nightclub owner whose father, a millionaire, is trying to shut it down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TD0y8dX5rlrfrB2LqZSTw7Kc7D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45828'),
  ('1065383888199123776', 'Swing Ride', 2022, 'Drama', 'Chiara Bellosi, Claudio Cofrancesco', 'Luca De Bei, Maria Teresa Venditti', 'Gaia Di Pietro, Andrea Carpenzano, Barbara Chichiarelli, Giandomenico Cupaiuolo, Francesca Antonelli, Alessio Praticò, Claudia Salerno, Paola Tintinelli', null, 'Benedetta, an obese fifteen-year-old yearning for attention, lives in a tawdry province in the south of Italy, emblematic of her inner landscape where everything could be and yet is not. She falls in love with Armando, aka Amanda, a young transvestite who is attracted to the young girl''s innocence and begins an unhealthy relationship of mutual dependence with her. Amanda runs a carousel at the fair across the street from Benedetta''s house, and the girl is magnetically drawn to this colorful and exciting world. But Amanda not only runs the carousel, she''s also a call boy and sells drugs. Between intoxication and family rebellion and the discovery of sex - a great disappointment - she completes her rite of passage into adulthood.', 'Benedetta, an obese fifteen-year-old yearning for attention, lives in a tawdry province in the south of Italy, emblematic of her inner landscape where everything could be and yet is not. She falls in love with Armando, aka Amanda, a young transvestite who is attracted to the young girl''s innocence and begins an unhealthy relationship of mutual dependence with her. Amanda runs a carousel at the fair across the street from Benedetta''s house, and the girl is magnetically drawn to this colorful and exciting world. But Amanda not only runs the carousel, she''s also a call boy and sells drugs. Between intoxication and family rebellion and the discovery of sex - a great disappointment - she completes her rite of passage into adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWKNhW8R6TzBKpgtKNF9pCJHvzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:870712'),
  ('925751034370488589', 'Swing Shift', 1984, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Jonathan Demme, Evelyn Purcell, Tak Fujimoto', 'Nancy Dowd', 'Goldie Hawn, Kurt Russell, Christine Lahti, Fred Ward, Ed Harris, Sudie Bond, Holly Hunter, Patty Maloney', 'PG', 'In 1941 America, Kay and her husband are happy enough until he enlists after Pearl Harbor. Against his wishes, she takes a job at the local aircraft plant where she meets Hazel, the singer from across the way. The two soon become firm friends and with the other girls become increasingly expert workers. As the war drags on, Kay finally dates her trumpet-playing foreman and life gets more complicated.', 'In 1941 America, Kay and her husband are happy enough until he enlists after Pearl Harbor. Against his wishes, she takes a job at the local aircraft plant where she meets Hazel, the singer from across the way. The two soon become firm friends and with the other girls become increasingly expert workers. As the war drags on, Kay finally dates her trumpet-playing foreman and life gets more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Q8YQ35rqzJmZ6tQDPXkT9WATZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18446'),
  ('684540436463373318', 'Swing Shift Cinderella', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Sara Berner, Frank Graham, Imogene Lynn, Billy Bletcher', null, 'The big bad wolf starts out chasing Little Red Riding Hood but switches to Cinderella after seeing the film''s title, and ends up being chased in turn by her fairy godmother.', 'The big bad wolf starts out chasing Little Red Riding Hood but switches to Cinderella after seeing the film''s title, and ends up being chased in turn by her fairy godmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SVJzUs3njFbKO8q6d36iyKZ8Fa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87196'),
  ('758432768308935760', 'Swing Time', 1936, 'Romance, Comedy', 'George Stevens, David Abel, Nathaniel Shilkret', 'Allan Scott, Howard Lindsay', 'Fred Astaire, Ginger Rogers, Victor Moore, Helen Broderick, Eric Blore, Betty Furness, Georges Metaxa, Landers Stevens', 'NR', 'Lucky is tricked into missing his own wedding to Margaret and has to make $25,000 so her father will allow him to marry her. He and business partner Pop go to New York where they run into dancing instructor Penny. She and Lucky form a successful dance partnership, but romance is blighted by his old attachment to Margaret and hers for Ricky.', 'Lucky is tricked into missing his own wedding to Margaret and has to make $25,000 so her father will allow him to marry her. He and business partner Pop go to New York where they run into dancing instructor Penny. She and Lucky form a successful dance partnership, but romance is blighted by his old attachment to Margaret and hers for Ricky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iukS0hzUAmhwHdqWrgQuKwMnJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20325'),
  ('965672356044976920', 'Swing Vote', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'David Anspaugh, Johnny E. Jensen', 'Ronald Bass, Jane Rusconi', 'Andy Garcia, Harry Belafonte, Robert Prosky, Ray Walston, James Whitmore, Kate Nelligan, Milo O''Shea, Albert Hall', null, 'A newly-appointed Supreme Court Justice must settle a controversial moral and legal dilemma with his tie-breaking decision which may also have serious implications on his own family''s harmony.', 'A newly-appointed Supreme Court Justice must settle a controversial moral and legal dilemma with his tie-breaking decision which may also have serious implications on his own family''s harmony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azgcPstqDrZNk8X5uKJiKvaAsFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288069'),
  ('463387374343380942', 'Swing Vote', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joshua Michael Stern, Shane Hurlbut', 'Jason Richman, Joshua Michael Stern', 'Kevin Costner, Madeline Carroll, Paula Patton, Kelsey Grammer, Dennis Hopper, Nathan Lane, Stanley Tucci, George López', 'PG-13', 'In a remarkable turn of events, the result of the presidential election comes down to one man''s vote.', 'In a remarkable turn of events, the result of the presidential election comes down to one man''s vote.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aa5pWY2IVObKS7JZpfEw7Fe4FJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10187'),
  ('806882261544876212', 'Swing You Sinners!', 1930, 'Animation, Horror, Music', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Billy Murray', null, 'Bimbo is seen late at night, trying to steal a chicken. He runs away from a policeman and enters a haunted cemetery. Various ghosts and monsters tell him that he will be punished for his sin.', 'Bimbo is seen late at night, trying to steal a chicken. He runs away from a policeman and enters a haunted cemetery. Various ghosts and monsters tell him that he will be punished for his sin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLVdKwKN0evOlKkAoPGGatFEHIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162804'),
  ('633728780138666262', 'Swing Your Lady', 1938, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Ray Enright, Arthur Edeson', 'Joseph Schrank, Maurice Leo', 'Humphrey Bogart, Frank McHugh, Louise Fazenda, Nat Pendleton, Penny Singleton, Allen Jenkins, Ronald Reagan, Leon Weaver', null, 'Promoter Ed Hatch comes to the Ozarks with his slow-witted wrestler Joe Skopapoulos whom he pits against a hillbilly Amazon blacksmith, Sadie Horn. Joe falls in love with her and won''t fight. At least not until Sadie''s beau Noah shows up.', 'Promoter Ed Hatch comes to the Ozarks with his slow-witted wrestler Joe Skopapoulos whom he pits against a hillbilly Amazon blacksmith, Sadie Horn. Joe falls in love with her and won''t fight. At least not until Sadie''s beau Noah shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igrWNNbGKgxhSB6IEz699ym0SaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82092'),
  ('383922874230528680', 'Swingers', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Doug Liman, Doug Liman', 'Jon Favreau', 'Jon Favreau, Vince Vaughn, Ron Livingston, Patrick Van Horn, Alex Désert, Heather Graham, Deena Martin, Katherine Kendall', 'R', 'After 6 years together, Mike''s girlfriend leaves him, so he travels to LA to be a star. Six months on, he''s still not doing very well— so a few of his friends try to reconnect him to the social scene and hopefully help him forget his failed relationship.', 'After 6 years together, Mike''s girlfriend leaves him, so he travels to LA to be a star. Six months on, he''s still not doing very well— so a few of his friends try to reconnect him to the social scene and hopefully help him forget his failed relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRjWk68kU3a2so4lgr3TKB7Y5vA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10218'),
  ('151687514976524288', 'Swingers', 2002, 'Romance, Drama', 'Stephan Brenninkmeijer', 'Stephan Brenninkmeijer', 'Ellen van der Koogh, Nienke Brinkhuis, Danny de Kok, Joep Sertons, Eleanore Merrill', null, 'Despite Diana''s insecure nature, she and her husband Julian agree with the idea to sexually experiment with another couple. They put out an ad on the net to which the well experienced Alex and Timo react. We follow Diana and Julian as they prepare for the arrival of Alex and Timo, who they have invited to their home for the weekend. Diana is nervous. As soon as she is confronted with the self-confident and ravishingly sexy Alex, her insecurity increases even more. Timo seems disinterested, a sharp contrast to the boyish excitement of Julian. But as night falls and their sexual exploration begins, we notice Timo may not be as casual as he initially seemed and Diana on the other hand contains hidden strength. And so we realize there''s more to ''Swingers'' than just sex. Swingers: could your relationship stand the test?', 'Despite Diana''s insecure nature, she and her husband Julian agree with the idea to sexually experiment with another couple. They put out an ad on the net to which the well experienced Alex and Timo react. We follow Diana and Julian as they prepare for the arrival of Alex and Timo, who they have invited to their home for the weekend. Diana is nervous. As soon as she is confronted with the self-confident and ravishingly sexy Alex, her insecurity increases even more. Timo seems disinterested, a sharp contrast to the boyish excitement of Julian. But as night falls and their sexual exploration begins, we notice Timo may not be as casual as he initially seemed and Diana on the other hand contains hidden strength. And so we realize there''s more to ''Swingers'' than just sex. Swingers: could your relationship stand the test?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEIVkvx6mGSjnkOxlXh6eHd1Y4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93685'),
  ('277556403176978234', 'Swingers', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Tom Green', null, 'Belinda Stewart-Wilson', null, 'Observational documentary unlocking the doors of Britain''s hidden swinging scene via access to one of the country''s most popular swinging clubs and candid interviews with the club''s founder, staff and clientele.', 'Observational documentary unlocking the doors of Britain''s hidden swinging scene via access to one of the country''s most popular swinging clubs and candid interviews with the club''s founder, staff and clientele.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4uwQVm0Th3lngECVZvMHVaaFur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737043'),
  ('1036482824122558944', 'swingers ZwingerZ', 2022, 'Documentary, Romance, Drama', 'zwingerz.com', null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lemo5hfG4w7Sm9mKjiIGmJ3hkYB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939099'),
  ('597061573537537537', 'Swinging Safari', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stephan Elliott, Brad Shield', 'Stephan Elliott', 'Guy Pearce, Kylie Minogue, Radha Mitchell, Julian McMahon, Asher Keddie, Jack Thompson, Jacob Elordi, Jeremy Sims', null, '1975: A 200-ton blue whale gets washed up on a local beach and the kids think it’s the biggest thing that’s ever happened in Australia. Behind closed doors, the Mums and Dads of a quiet suburban street are going to celebrate in their own special way, by joining the sexual revolution and throwing a wife-swapping key party. And like the rotting whale, it’s all about to go spectacularly wrong.', '1975: A 200-ton blue whale gets washed up on a local beach and the kids think it’s the biggest thing that’s ever happened in Australia. Behind closed doors, the Mums and Dads of a quiet suburban street are going to celebrate in their own special way, by joining the sexual revolution and throwing a wife-swapping key party. And like the rotting whale, it’s all about to go spectacularly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zs9wcNHidBPhcTmiWzXuFam823v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454033'),
  ('650631197022682771', 'Swinging the Lambeth Walk', 1940, 'Music, Animation', 'Len Lye', null, null, null, 'Len Lye’s camera-less film animates “swing” versions of the popular Lambeth Walk—featuring Django Reinhardt on guitar and Stéphane Grappelli on violin—through scratched and painted imagery directly on celluloid. Sponsored by the Tourist and Industrial Development Association after Lye and his family fell into hardship, the film blends vibrant visual rhythms with music, free of advertising slogans, and stands out as one of Lye’s most playful experiments in direct cinema.', 'Len Lye’s camera-less film animates “swing” versions of the popular Lambeth Walk—featuring Django Reinhardt on guitar and Stéphane Grappelli on violin—through scratched and painted imagery directly on celluloid. Sponsored by the Tourist and Industrial Development Association after Lye and his family fell into hardship, the film blends vibrant visual rhythms with music, free of advertising slogans, and stands out as one of Lye’s most playful experiments in direct cinema.', null, 'tmdb:movie:203091'),
  ('535063256685502996', 'Swinging with the Finkels', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jonathan Newman, Dirk Nel', 'Jonathan Newman', 'Mandy Moore, Martin Freeman, Melissa George, Jonathan Silverman, Elizabeth Tan, Carolyn Tomkinson, Daisy Beaumont, Jerry Stiller', 'R', 'A suburban couple decide to spice up their lives by swinging with another couple.', 'A suburban couple decide to spice up their lives by swinging with another couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pff0aaPS1GgDI95lVnm7gegIx0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65762'),
  ('85714118696002826', 'Swinging Wives', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Ernst Hofbauer, Giorgio Tonti, Walter Boos', 'Manfred Purzer', 'Astrid Frank, Eva Garden, Karin Götz, Elfi Helfrich, Romana Lizalova, Rosl Mayr, Marlene Rahn, Thomas Fischer', null, 'Sex comedy about lonely housewives and their activities while the husband is away. It’s a series of vignettes connected by documentary-style interviews with people on the street. The eroticism relies completely on nudity, not altogether different from British sex comedies of the era.', 'Sex comedy about lonely housewives and their activities while the husband is away. It’s a series of vignettes connected by documentary-style interviews with people on the street. The eroticism relies completely on nudity, not altogether different from British sex comedies of the era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOLPkScz0fN7m3kYCpsWXxgFvwO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264966'),
  ('1027630006594973914', 'Swingtime in the Movies', 1938, 'Comedy, Music', 'Crane Wilbur, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Crane Wilbur', 'Fritz Feld, Kathryn Kane, John Carroll, Charley Foy, Jerry Colonna, Helen Lynd, Irene Franklin, George Brent', 'NR', 'In this musical short, a waitress at the Warner Bros. commissary gets her big break.', 'In this musical short, a waitress at the Warner Bros. commissary gets her big break.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yo2cx7lJnuvZ9pIkSW26oNGKfQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157382'),
  ('1007742234531173497', 'Swiped', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jon Schellenger, John Hamblin, Ann Deborah Fishman', 'Ann Deborah Fishman', 'Kendall Ryan Sanders, Noah Centineo, Leigh-Allyn Baker, Kristen Johnston, George Hamilton, Alana Stewart, Kalani Hilliker, Shelby Wulfert', null, 'James, a college freshman and computer genius, is enlisted by his womanizing roommate, Lance, to code the ultimate hook-up app. But when James discovers that his divorced mother is using the app, unexpected consequences ensue.', 'James, a college freshman and computer genius, is enlisted by his womanizing roommate, Lance, to code the ultimate hook-up app. But when James discovers that his divorced mother is using the app, unexpected consequences ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXlGDWGCB2zpmnUzYpQYgYhNrpS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535437'),
  ('565635614600742372', 'Swiped', 2025, 'History, Drama', 'Rachel Lee Goldenberg, Doug Emmett, Paula Case', 'Rachel Lee Goldenberg, Bill Parker, Kim Caramele', 'Lily James, Ben Schnetzer, Myha''la, Jackson White, Dan Stevens, Ian Colletti, Mary Neely, Ana Yi Puig', 'R', 'Whitney Wolfe uses extraordinary grit and ingenuity to break into the male-dominated tech industry.', 'Whitney Wolfe uses extraordinary grit and ingenuity to break into the male-dominated tech industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEeFRU5ADkyP7JtOFFV8tYMm3zD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1265344'),
  ('481177746928129169', 'Swiping Love', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Martín Armoya', 'Andrés Alvarado, Federico Viescas', 'Nicolás Riera, Inés Palombo, Agustín Sierra, Julián Larquier Tellarini, Candelaria Molfese, Bárbara Vélez, Marcelo Sein, Julieta Cayetina', null, 'Rodrigo is quite sure about his ability to seduce all women, and he never stays with anyone. Love doesn’t exist to him. In this, his game, he has faced some diffcult catches, but not impossible ones. Now he will meet Sol, and she will break all the rules that he has made up.', 'Rodrigo is quite sure about his ability to seduce all women, and he never stays with anyone. Love doesn’t exist to him. In this, his game, he has faced some diffcult catches, but not impossible ones. Now he will meet Sol, and she will break all the rules that he has made up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18gB2rF9WAd14qL2TyjMsJZF4yX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628450'),
  ('575943656144779345', 'Swiss Army Knife with Rats and Pigeons', 1980, 'Animation', 'Robert Breer', null, null, null, 'Utilising an apparently new-found obsession with the colour red and reinvigorating some of the circular imagery of A Man and His Dog Out for Air and 69, Breer delves into the very basis of animation to explore how a variety of easily recognisable objects can be portrayed and manipulated differently using pixillation and classically drawn animation. -Malcolm Turner', 'Utilising an apparently new-found obsession with the colour red and reinvigorating some of the circular imagery of A Man and His Dog Out for Air and 69, Breer delves into the very basis of animation to explore how a variety of easily recognisable objects can be portrayed and manipulated differently using pixillation and classically drawn animation. -Malcolm Turner', null, 'tmdb:movie:211244'),
  ('721180088315735691', 'Swiss Army Man', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Daniel Kwan, Daniel Scheinert, Larkin Seiple', 'Daniel Kwan, Daniel Scheinert', 'Paul Dano, Daniel Radcliffe, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Antonia Ribero, Timothy Eulich, Richard Gross, Marika Casteel, Andy Hull', 'R', 'Alone on a tiny deserted island, Hank has given up all hope of ever making it home again. But one day everything changes when a dead body washes ashore, and he soon realizes it may be his last opportunity to escape certain death. Armed with his new “friend” and an unusual bag of tricks, the duo go on an epic adventure to bring Hank back to the woman of his dreams.', 'Alone on a tiny deserted island, Hank has given up all hope of ever making it home again. But one day everything changes when a dead body washes ashore, and he soon realizes it may be his last opportunity to escape certain death. Armed with his new “friend” and an unusual bag of tricks, the duo go on an epic adventure to bring Hank back to the woman of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pxn8CQ6SD6tly75lrKw08wfZKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347031'),
  ('472194942597877399', 'Swiss Family Robinson', 1940, 'Adventure', 'Edward Ludwig, Nicholas Musuraca', 'C. Graham Baker, Walter Ferris, Gene Towne', 'Thomas Mitchell, Edna Best, Freddie Bartholomew, Terry Kilburn, Tim Holt, Bobbie Quillan, Christian Rub, John Wray', null, 'A family setting out for a new life across the sea is shipwrecked on a deserted island. The family members collaborate to create a home for themselves in the jungle environment.', 'A family setting out for a new life across the sea is shipwrecked on a deserted island. The family members collaborate to create a home for themselves in the jungle environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMhPuHqq7p1MsCtDpurEJZyD7dN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188125'),
  ('167453434779335123', 'Swiss Family Robinson', 1960, 'Adventure, Family', 'Harry Waxman, Ken Annakin', 'Lowell S. Hawley', 'John Mills, Dorothy McGuire, James MacArthur, Janet Munro, Sessue Hayakawa, Tommy Kirk, Kevin Corcoran, Cecil Parker', 'G', 'After being shipwrecked, the Robinson family is marooned on an island inhabited only by an impressive array of wildlife. In true pioneer spirit, they quickly make themselves at home but soon face a danger even greater than nature: dastardly pirates.', 'After being shipwrecked, the Robinson family is marooned on an island inhabited only by an impressive array of wildlife. In true pioneer spirit, they quickly make themselves at home but soon face a danger even greater than nature: dastardly pirates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZItm1RcdwNuPnCaaqEFGrbVlcO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18444'),
  ('86241658430572782', 'Swiss Miss', 1938, 'Comedy, Music', 'John G. Blystone', 'Felix Adler, James Parrott, Charlie Melson', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Grete Natzler, Walter Woolf King, Eric Blore, Adia Kuznetzoff, Charles Judels, Ludovico Tomarchio', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie are mousetrap salesmen hoping for better business in Switzerland, with Stan''s theory that because there is more cheese in Switzerland, there should be more mice.', 'Stan and Ollie are mousetrap salesmen hoping for better business in Switzerland, with Stan''s theory that because there is more cheese in Switzerland, there should be more mice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQVANoTbB4Q8UW0Lbv5dgPnKTd1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82394'),
  ('346263193259727937', 'Switch', 1991, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Blake Edwards, Dick Bush, David C. Anderson', 'Blake Edwards', 'Ellen Barkin, Jimmy Smits, JoBeth Williams, Lorraine Bracco, Tony Roberts, Perry King, Bruce Payne, Lysette Anthony', 'R', 'Steve Brooks, a sexist womanizer, is killed by a group of his angry former lovers. In heaven, he makes a bargain with God for redemption and agrees to return to Earth. Once there, he must have a sincere relationship with a female and make her fall in love with him. If not, Steve''s soul will become the property of the devil. But the devil hedges his bet, and Steve is reincarnated as a woman named Amanda Brooks.', 'Steve Brooks, a sexist womanizer, is killed by a group of his angry former lovers. In heaven, he makes a bargain with God for redemption and agrees to return to Earth. Once there, he must have a sincere relationship with a female and make her fall in love with him. If not, Steve''s soul will become the property of the devil. But the devil hedges his bet, and Steve is reincarnated as a woman named Amanda Brooks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddmOMoFWMpXJSU0YFddBU7d6kWT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10261'),
  ('522244107068867600', 'Switch', 2011, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Frédéric Schoendoerffer, Vincent Gallot, Stéphanie Bertrand', 'Jean-Christophe Grangé, Frédéric Schoendoerffer', 'Éric Cantona, Karine Vanasse, Mehdi Nebbou, Aurélien Recoing, Karina Testa, Niseema Theillaud, Bruno Todeschini, Maxim Roy', null, 'In Montreal, the unemployed fashion designer Sophie Malaterre is shown a website, switch.com, where it is possible to switch houses with a stranger for vacation. Sophie seeks an apartment in Paris nearby the Eiffel Tower that belongs to Bénédicte Serteaux and they change apartments. Sophie arrives in Paris on Saturday morning. The next morning, policemen break in the apartment and arrest Sophie while she is having a bath. Detective Damien Forgeat interrogates Sophie believing that she is Bénédicte and she learns that a beheaded body was found in her room and all evidence of her life has been deleted.', 'In Montreal, the unemployed fashion designer Sophie Malaterre is shown a website, switch.com, where it is possible to switch houses with a stranger for vacation. Sophie seeks an apartment in Paris nearby the Eiffel Tower that belongs to Bénédicte Serteaux and they change apartments. Sophie arrives in Paris on Saturday morning. The next morning, policemen break in the apartment and arrest Sophie while she is having a bath. Detective Damien Forgeat interrogates Sophie believing that she is Bénédicte and she learns that a beheaded body was found in her room and all evidence of her life has been deleted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOroxNJftPkGLjordf8IcYkjjZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69225'),
  ('1096829155358346497', 'Switch', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, Crime', 'Sun Jianjun, Shao Dan, Peng Zhang', 'Sun Jianjun', 'Andy Lau, Zhang Jingchu, Tong Dawei, Lin Chi-ling, Siqin Gaowa, Zhang Guangbei, Xu Ge-Hui, Vanessa Wang Manni', null, 'To recover and ancient scroll, a Chinese agent battles the Japanese yakuza and British mercenaries.', 'To recover and ancient scroll, a Chinese agent battles the Japanese yakuza and British mercenaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXmbA7pIkSo7IUNLCuLX0qLIPXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196385'),
  ('798739038355038807', 'Switch', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Jo Gyeong-hun, Park Min-woo, Kim Min-jae', 'Ma Dae-yun', 'Kwon Sang-woo, Oh Jung-se, Lee Min-jung, Park Soi, Kim Joon, Kim Mi-kyeong, Cha Hee, Lee Seo-hwan', null, 'A story of how Park Kang''s life is changed on Christmas day. Park Kang is a popular actor, but he is also a scandal maker. His manager is Jo Yoon and they are also long-time friends. One day, Park Kang''s ex-girlfriend Soo-hyun suddenly appears in front of Park Kang.', 'A story of how Park Kang''s life is changed on Christmas day. Park Kang is a popular actor, but he is also a scandal maker. His manager is Jo Yoon and they are also long-time friends. One day, Park Kang''s ex-girlfriend Soo-hyun suddenly appears in front of Park Kang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQcyguoOX3Tu2fjLO4qDLxM4d6S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:773910'),
  ('376516702812887', 'Switchback', 1997, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Jeb Stuart, Oliver Wood, Gary Hymes', 'Jeb Stuart', 'Dennis Quaid, Danny Glover, R. Lee Ermey, Jared Leto, Ted Levine, William Fichtner, Walton Goggins, Kevin Cooney', 'R', 'After FBI agent Frank Lacrosse believes his son was kidnapped by a notorious serial killer, he travels to Amarillo, Texas, where he believes the murderer is in hiding. Although officially taken off the case because of its personal significance to him, Frank continues to pursue the killer, causing concern for local sheriff Buck Olmstead. When another victim pops up at a nearby car garage, Frank knows that he is as close as he''ll ever be to tracking down the elusive killer.', 'After FBI agent Frank Lacrosse believes his son was kidnapped by a notorious serial killer, he travels to Amarillo, Texas, where he believes the murderer is in hiding. Although officially taken off the case because of its personal significance to him, Frank continues to pursue the killer, causing concern for local sheriff Buck Olmstead. When another victim pops up at a nearby car garage, Frank knows that he is as close as he''ll ever be to tracking down the elusive killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3v4nX475G97Vd8XCapTKQ7NTqMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10871'),
  ('866409834657887967', 'Switchblade Sisters', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Jack Hill, Stephen M. Katz, Donald Heitzer', 'F.X. Maier', 'Robbie Lee, Joanne Nail, Monica Gayle, Asher Brauner, Chase Newhart, Marlene Clark, Kitty Bruce, Janice Karman', 'R', 'The leader of an inner city girl gang is challenged when a new girl moves into the neighborhood.', 'The leader of an inner city girl gang is challenged when a new girl moves into the neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axVIxmkYZFBDwMMhifeUXLHzu56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52633'),
  ('299875623394357810', 'Switched', 2020, 'Family, Comedy', 'Catherine Stroud, John K.D. Graham, Richard Galli', 'Alexandra Boylan, John K.D. Graham, Andrea Polnaszek', 'Miya Horcher, Madeleine Byrne, John Schneider, Vanessa Merrell, Laurine Price, Denise Richards, Nicole Weider, Daniel Chioco', null, 'Tired of being bullied, Cassandra Evans prays that her nemesis, Katie Sharp, the queen bee of social media, would know what it’s like to walk a day in her shoes. Her prayer is answered in an unexpected way when they get switched.', 'Tired of being bullied, Cassandra Evans prays that her nemesis, Katie Sharp, the queen bee of social media, would know what it’s like to walk a day in her shoes. Her prayer is answered in an unexpected way when they get switched.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Q5OBXE0JDeyU11bYeHC08cQuE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732310'),
  ('972329020679436143', 'Switched at Birth', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Douglas Barr, James Bartle', 'Arlene Sarner, Jerry Leichtling', 'Melissa Gilbert, Rosanna Arquette, James McCaffrey, David Andrews, Mary Mara, Susan Barnes, Ron Snyder, Joe Ivy', null, 'Sarah Barlow and Linda Wells are two mothers who give birth on the same day in the same hospital. Eighteen months later, a DNA test proves the infants were switched at birth by the hospital.', 'Sarah Barlow and Linda Wells are two mothers who give birth on the same day in the same hospital. Eighteen months later, a DNA test proves the infants were switched at birth by the hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4a3traQfNfMuGAQMmzj1f4CYvVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166433'),
  ('442135208159055727', 'Switched for Christmas', 2017, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Michael Marshall, Stephanie Fugleberg, Lee Friedlander', 'Lee Friedlander, Tracy Andreen', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Eion Bailey, Natasha Bure, Mark Deklin, Cooper Johnson, Walter Platz, James Jamison, Ben Olsen', null, 'Identical twins Kate and Chris Lockhart plot to be the other sister – at Kate’s office and Chris’ school – and take on planning their sister’s Christmas events. One rule, though: no romance.', 'Identical twins Kate and Chris Lockhart plot to be the other sister – at Kate’s office and Chris’ school – and take on planning their sister’s Christmas events. One rule, though: no romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tu6fM4b9izPZU3EQc1bOvx3rmZc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475830'),
  ('1009097978476061553', 'Switched Up', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Beto Gómez, Marya Saab', 'El Huevo Charlie Barrientos', 'Mariana Treviño, Bruno Bichir, Luis de la Rosa, Blanca Guerra, Pau Menna, María Paleta, Paola Madrigal, Daniel Elbittar', null, 'It follows an unconventional family who find themselves embroiled in a personality swap after little Zoe has a mystical encounter with an ancient god. As a result, each family member finds themselves in the body of another.', 'It follows an unconventional family who find themselves embroiled in a personality swap after little Zoe has a mystical encounter with an ancient god. As a result, each family member finds themselves in the body of another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xohRCoJS9kNKal3MhFBNO3060YR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1255017'),
  ('350501390623761354', 'Switchin'' Kitten', 1961, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Gene Deitch', null, null, null, 'Tom becomes fearless when he feels like going into the eerie castle.', 'Tom becomes fearless when he feels like going into the eerie castle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0h3eUeJoWYj3f5s7FipF3un7xi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234663'),
  ('897012571401125109', 'Switching – Goodbye Me', 2007, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Yudai Kato', 'Tadashi Naitô, Chûkon Minami, Wataru Kenmotsu', 'Misako Renbutsu, Naoyuki Morita, Misa Shimizu, Takuro Atsuki, Saki Terashima, Hikari Ishida, Tomorowo Taguchi, Yuko Kotegawa', null, 'After his parent''s divorce, Kazuo Saito moves with his mother from Onomichi and must leave his girlfriend behind. At his new school, Kazuo is surprised to reunite with his childhood friend Kazumi.', 'After his parent''s divorce, Kazuo Saito moves with his mother from Onomichi and must leave his girlfriend behind. At his new school, Kazuo is surprised to reunite with his childhood friend Kazumi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xhCzPQCUSQuWanL64mqwJdOM8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36178'),
  ('157653778897508453', 'Switching Channels', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Ted Kotcheff, François Protat, Stephen Andrzejewski', 'Ben Hecht, Charles MacArthur', 'Kathleen Turner, Burt Reynolds, Christopher Reeve, Ned Beatty, Henry Gibson, George Newbern, Al Waxman, Ken James', 'PG', 'A television news chief courts his anchorwoman ex-wife with an eleventh-hour story.', 'A television news chief courts his anchorwoman ex-wife with an eleventh-hour story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6Il30LOnvD5rVx4lEp7LEfMl09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26798'),
  ('329180652301916379', 'Switching Goals', 1999, 'Family, TV Movie', 'David Steinberg, David A. Makin', 'Matt Roshkow, David Kukoff', 'Mary-Kate Olsen, Ashley Olsen, Kathryn Greenwood, Trevor Blumas, Joe Grifasi, Eric Lutes, Keith Knight, Jake LeDoux', 'G', 'Twin sisters Emma and Sam come up with a scheme to switch places so each can play in the soccer team they prefer.', 'Twin sisters Emma and Sam come up with a scheme to switch places so each can play in the soccer team they prefer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ostcLXSpg25JHbaUkoXIHblCmsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36251'),
  ('1022571542248386679', 'Swoon', 1992, 'Drama', 'Tom Kalin, Ellen Kuras', 'Tom Kalin, Hilton Als', 'Daniel Schlachet, Craig Chester, Ron Vawter, Michael Stumm, Valda Z. Drabla, Paul Connor, Adina Porter, Todd Haynes', null, 'Teenagers Nathan Leopold Jr. and Richard Loeb share a dangerous sexual bond and an amoral outlook on life. They spend afternoons breaking into storefronts and engaging in petty crimes, until the calculating Nathan ups the ante by kidnapping, and murdering, a young boy.', 'Teenagers Nathan Leopold Jr. and Richard Loeb share a dangerous sexual bond and an amoral outlook on life. They spend afternoons breaking into storefronts and engaging in petty crimes, until the calculating Nathan ups the ante by kidnapping, and murdering, a young boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgbeuxyPhyde8jV8AvZEalZ4OsG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54934'),
  ('955323182061308976', 'Swooner Crooner', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc, Sara Berner, Bea Benaderet, Richard Bickenbach, Stan Freberg', null, 'Porky Pig''s egg farm faces production problems when a crooning rooster distracts the hens from their jobs.', 'Porky Pig''s egg farm faces production problems when a crooning rooster distracts the hens from their jobs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shtQCXEDuQf5prrk9fOu3SpMIwV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100359'),
  ('214764130789161686', 'Sword Art Online the Movie – Progressive – Scherzo of Deep Night', 2022, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Kento Toya, Yasuyuki Kai, Ayako Kono', 'Yukito Kizawa', 'Haruka Tomatsu, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Inori Minase, Shiori Izawa, Hiroki Yasumoto, Tomokazu Seki, Kaede Hondo, Yuusuke Nagano', 'NR', 'Over a month has passed since 10,000 users were trapped inside the "Sword Art Online" world. Asuna, who cleared the first floor of the floating iron castle of Aincrad, joined up with Kirito and continued her journey to reach the top floor. With the support of female Information Broker Argo, clearing the floors seemed to be progressing smoothly, but conflict erupts between two major guilds who should be working together – the top player groups ALS (the Aincrad Liberation Squad) and DKB (the Dragon Knights Brigade). And meanwhile, behind the scenes exists a mysterious figure pulling the strings…', 'Over a month has passed since 10,000 users were trapped inside the "Sword Art Online" world. Asuna, who cleared the first floor of the floating iron castle of Aincrad, joined up with Kirito and continued her journey to reach the top floor. With the support of female Information Broker Argo, clearing the floors seemed to be progressing smoothly, but conflict erupts between two major guilds who should be working together – the top player groups ALS (the Aincrad Liberation Squad) and DKB (the Dragon Knights Brigade). And meanwhile, behind the scenes exists a mysterious figure pulling the strings…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8B3bagkYRULdmnhgKMcxXaVcFm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893712'),
  ('171924949560049555', 'Sword Art Online: Extra Edition', 2013, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Tomohiko Ito, Yoshikazu Iwanami, Heo Pyoung-kang', null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Haruka Tomatsu, Kanae Itou, Ayana Taketatsu, Rina Hidaka, Ayahi Takagaki, Hiroki Yasumoto, Hiroaki Hirata', null, 'A special recap of the first season with an original story in which Kirito and the others decide to go on an underwater mission so that Yui can see a whale, but they face a shocking revelation... Suguha is afraid of water. So Asuna and the other girls decide to teach Suguha how to swim. Meanwhile, Kirito is meeting somebody.', 'A special recap of the first season with an original story in which Kirito and the others decide to go on an underwater mission so that Yui can see a whale, but they face a shocking revelation... Suguha is afraid of water. So Asuna and the other girls decide to teach Suguha how to swim. Meanwhile, Kirito is meeting somebody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWr2GUTKRR4d8aCApF93OzBfq3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1012404'),
  ('895464474921179741', 'Sword Devil', 1965, 'Action, Drama', 'Kenji Misumi, Chikashi Makiura', 'Seiji Hoshikawa', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Michiko Sugata, Kei Satō, Ryūtarō Gomi, Gorō Mutsumi, Kentaro Kudo, Asao Uchida, Ryūzō Shimada', null, 'Hanpei is a gentle young samurai that loves flowers. One day, he witnesses an old man''s quick draw of the sword. He is so impressed that he becomes the old man''s pupil. Soon, Hanpei''s skill of sword comes to attention of his lord. The lord orders him to assassinate a man...', 'Hanpei is a gentle young samurai that loves flowers. One day, he witnesses an old man''s quick draw of the sword. He is so impressed that he becomes the old man''s pupil. Soon, Hanpei''s skill of sword comes to attention of his lord. The lord orders him to assassinate a man...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kMOMxQuZ5xqMO4uEc0s08hisp0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96972'),
  ('759343028679598693', 'Sword Fishing', 1939, 'Documentary', 'De Leon Anthony', 'De Leon Anthony', 'Ronald Reagan, Howard Hill', null, 'A group of fishermen, including Howard Hill, "the world''s greatest archer," go in search of marlin off the California coast. With a fishing line attached to his arrow, Hill plans to spear the fish, which would then be brought aboard the boat by rod and reel.', 'A group of fishermen, including Howard Hill, "the world''s greatest archer," go in search of marlin off the California coast. With a fishing line attached to his arrow, Hill plans to spear the fish, which would then be brought aboard the boat by rod and reel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQxtqSCui36DZ0YJ1DQ7tae1pcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235660'),
  ('849686601385835603', 'Sword for Truth', 1990, 'Animation, Horror', 'Osamu Dezaki', 'Takeshi Narumi', 'Kazuhiko Inoue, Rei Sakuma, Tessyo Genda, Yuko Mizutani, Ginzo Matsuo, Kazuhiko Kishino, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Masashi Hirose', null, 'Shurannosuke Sakaki is a masterless samurai with a razor-sharp katana and a cold-hearted personality. Whenever you see the mark of two crossed scythes on his back, death is sure to follow. Because of his exceptional swordsmanship, Shurannosuke is hired by the Nakura Clan to rescue Princess Mayu from the Seki Ninja. In this mission, he must use his full potential to survive the Seki Ninja''s notorious henchmen.', 'Shurannosuke Sakaki is a masterless samurai with a razor-sharp katana and a cold-hearted personality. Whenever you see the mark of two crossed scythes on his back, death is sure to follow. Because of his exceptional swordsmanship, Shurannosuke is hired by the Nakura Clan to rescue Princess Mayu from the Seki Ninja. In this mission, he must use his full potential to survive the Seki Ninja''s notorious henchmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2oxY22JJl1xaukAAXir176jQ7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68922'),
  ('1112227041717363838', 'Sword In The Moon', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Won Jin, Kim Eui-suk, Ma Dae-yun', 'Kim Hae-gon, Ma Dae-yun, Park Kye-ok', 'Choi Min-soo, Cho Jae-hyun, Kim Bo-kyung, Lee Jong-soo, Yoo Yeon-soo, Ki Joo-bong, Jeong Seong-hwan, Jo Sang-geon', null, 'Kingdom of Joseon, ancient Korea. A usurper has conquered the throne. His ministers are being systematically eliminated by a mysterious assassin. An arrogant master swordsman is in charge of putting an end to the carnage.', 'Kingdom of Joseon, ancient Korea. A usurper has conquered the throne. His ministers are being systematically eliminated by a mysterious assassin. An arrogant master swordsman is in charge of putting an end to the carnage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDp5vC60tzHSfNBxOKzN1M1j8n1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13512'),
  ('1086518040969667674', 'Sword Master', 2016, 'Action', 'Chan Chi-Ying, Derek Yee', 'Derek Yee, Chun Tin-Nam, Tsui Hark', 'Lin Gengxin, Jiang Mengjie, Jiang Yiyan, Peter Ho, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Ma Jing, Tie Nan, Ng Yuen-Jun', null, 'Weary of the bloodshed and violence from the martial arts world, a powerful swordsman banishes himself to the humble life a vagrant, wandering the fringes of society. But his violent past refuses to let him go quietly. The master swordsman must regain the ability to wield his sword and fight those disrupting the peace he so desperately craves.', 'Weary of the bloodshed and violence from the martial arts world, a powerful swordsman banishes himself to the humble life a vagrant, wandering the fringes of society. But his violent past refuses to let him go quietly. The master swordsman must regain the ability to wield his sword and fight those disrupting the peace he so desperately craves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jritqkUKkS8cB90jvRvtWiGRE18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367206'),
  ('757575076922619386', 'Sword of Blood', 2011, 'Horror, Action', 'Takanori Tsujimoto, Hiroaki Yuasa, Takanori Tsujimoto', 'Takanori Tsujimoto, Eiichi Yonekawa', 'Natsuki Kato, Yuma Ishigaki, Karin Yamaguchi, Ayaka Morita, Koji Nakamura, Yasuaki Kurata', null, 'A serial killer leaves behind a trail of headless bodies; the special agent assigned to the case begins to uncover the supernatural truth, as his young protégé falls for a beautiful girl who may be more than humanity can handle.', 'A serial killer leaves behind a trail of headless bodies; the special agent assigned to the case begins to uncover the supernatural truth, as his young protégé falls for a beautiful girl who may be more than humanity can handle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2u02Qj3NkselzB11wyjHDJqw72E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138860'),
  ('484561160427472542', 'Sword of Desperation', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Romance', 'Hideyuki Hirayama, Koichi Ishii', 'Hidehiro Ito, Itaru Era', 'Etsushi Toyokawa, Chizuru Ikewaki, Koji Kikkawa, Tsumami Edamame, Tenkyû Fukuda, Mitsutoshi Gotô, Yudai Ishiyama, Hana Kino', null, 'A talented but troubled Edo Period swordsman, Kanemi Sanzaemon. Three years earlier, Kanemi killed a woman, Renko, the corrupt mistress of the powerful daimyo Tabu Ukyou. Unexpectedly, Kanemi received a lenient sentence for his crime and is allowed to return to his clan after only one year of imprisonment. Following his return, Kanemi is faced with the death of his wife, Mutsue. Thereafter, Kanemi lives with and cares for his wife''s niece, Satoo, who has secret affections for Kanemi and expresses them by helping change his bleak outlook on life. Meanwhile, Kanemi''s develops his unique "bird-catching" sword technique which he will soon put to test in battle for the first time against the fearsome swordsman, Hayatonosho Obiya.', 'A talented but troubled Edo Period swordsman, Kanemi Sanzaemon. Three years earlier, Kanemi killed a woman, Renko, the corrupt mistress of the powerful daimyo Tabu Ukyou. Unexpectedly, Kanemi received a lenient sentence for his crime and is allowed to return to his clan after only one year of imprisonment. Following his return, Kanemi is faced with the death of his wife, Mutsue. Thereafter, Kanemi lives with and cares for his wife''s niece, Satoo, who has secret affections for Kanemi and expresses them by helping change his bleak outlook on life. Meanwhile, Kanemi''s develops his unique "bird-catching" sword technique which he will soon put to test in battle for the first time against the fearsome swordsman, Hayatonosho Obiya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8TMnfNBUJ83Bangh8demRKjJdO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55884'),
  ('535582694406509078', 'Sword of Destiny', 2021, 'Action', 'Li Yuxi', null, 'Eric Hsiao, Yang Yi, Chai Yuanle, Man Ningxi, Lu Shun', null, 'The peerless swordsmith, Meng Yezi, suffered the calamity of family extermination from the traitor Zhao Han served in the court for casting the famous Hanguang Sword. He desperately saved his son Meng Yang and left him the unforged Chengying Sword. Twenty years later, Meng Yang grew up and tried to avenge his father. At that time, Chengying Sword had not been cast yet to compete with Hanguang Sword. Then, the emperor was dying, and by chance, Meng Yang was assigned to escort the prince Gong Zidu back to the palace to succeed to the throne. Meng Yang accepted the task to investigate the truth about his family extermination for avenge. However, he met a fatal disaster on the way...', 'The peerless swordsmith, Meng Yezi, suffered the calamity of family extermination from the traitor Zhao Han served in the court for casting the famous Hanguang Sword. He desperately saved his son Meng Yang and left him the unforged Chengying Sword. Twenty years later, Meng Yang grew up and tried to avenge his father. At that time, Chengying Sword had not been cast yet to compete with Hanguang Sword. Then, the emperor was dying, and by chance, Meng Yang was assigned to escort the prince Gong Zidu back to the palace to succeed to the throne. Meng Yang accepted the task to investigate the truth about his family extermination for avenge. However, he met a fatal disaster on the way...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8GzRgxXfLIzLnQirNobSukj7XP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:812584'),
  ('701619337274951144', 'Sword of Gideon', 1986, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Michael Anderson', 'Chris Bryant', 'Steven Bauer, Michael York, Rod Steiger, Colleen Dewhurst, Leslie Hope, Lino Ventura, Robert Joy, Laurent Malet', null, 'Chronicles a Mossad team hand picked to hunt down the terrorists involved in the 1972 Munich Olympic massacre of Israeli athletes.', 'Chronicles a Mossad team hand picked to hunt down the terrorists involved in the 1972 Munich Olympic massacre of Israeli athletes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xohJrnuUGlij7raPx9wcA6xY6GO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43626'),
  ('47251406825241067', 'Sword of God', 2020, 'History, Horror, Mystery', 'Jakub Wielecki, Jacek Podgórski, Bartosz Konopka', 'Anna Wydra, Bartosz Konopka, Przemysław Nowakowski', 'Krzysztof Pieczyński, Jacek Koman, Karol Bernacki, Jan Bijvoet, Wiktoria Gorodecka, Jeroen Perceval, Olivier De Sagazan, Karolina Porcari', null, 'In the early Middle Ages, two Christian knights set off to christen a small pagan village hidden deep in the mountains. Despite the differences in their views and perspectives on religion, the two men become travel companions and create a father-son relationship. As they settle into the local community, their faith, belief system and the bond between them are all put to the test. Soon, love is confronted with hate, dialogue with violence, madness with rules and many will have to die.', 'In the early Middle Ages, two Christian knights set off to christen a small pagan village hidden deep in the mountains. Despite the differences in their views and perspectives on religion, the two men become travel companions and create a father-son relationship. As they settle into the local community, their faith, belief system and the bond between them are all put to the test. Soon, love is confronted with hate, dialogue with violence, madness with rules and many will have to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25VwWdsDu6g3anaYYANN6VRKnjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548392'),
  ('1022394399648453585', 'Sword of Lancelot', 1963, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Cornel Wilde, Harry Waxman', 'Richard Schayer, Cornel Wilde', 'Cornel Wilde, Jean Wallace, Brian Aherne, George Baker, Archie Duncan, Adrienne Corri, Michael Meacham, Iain Gregory', null, 'Lancelot is King Arthur''s most valued Knight of the Round Table and a paragon of courage and virtue. Things change, however, when he falls in love with Queen Guinevere.', 'Lancelot is King Arthur''s most valued Knight of the Round Table and a paragon of courage and virtue. Things change, however, when he falls in love with Queen Guinevere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCMJ44A8XxSZRennSiypLrn9iDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42810'),
  ('445714643251929337', 'Sword of Sherwood Forest', 1960, 'Adventure, History', 'Terence Fisher, Ken Hodges, Stuart Lyons', 'Alan Hackney', 'Richard Greene, Peter Cushing, Niall MacGinnis, Richard Pasco, Jack Gwillim, Sarah Branch, Nigel Green, Edwin Richfield', 'NR', 'Robin of Loxley and his men stumble on a plot to overthrow Hubert Walter, King''s Chancellor and Archbishop of Canterbury. The plotters, the Sheriff of Nottingham and the Earl of Newark, have set an ambush for Walter and Lady Marian Fitzwater. Will Robin get to them before it is too late?', 'Robin of Loxley and his men stumble on a plot to overthrow Hubert Walter, King''s Chancellor and Archbishop of Canterbury. The plotters, the Sheriff of Nottingham and the Earl of Newark, have set an ambush for Walter and Lady Marian Fitzwater. Will Robin get to them before it is too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvpCGViDZkHTF0EoeFdL7Jwa8CK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115972'),
  ('840692218428182563', 'Sword of the Beast', 1965, 'Action, Drama', 'Hideo Gosha', 'Hideo Gosha, Eizaburo Shiba', 'Mikijiro Hira, Gō Katō, Shima Iwashita, Kunie Tanaka, Eijirō Tōno, Toshie Kimura, Kantarō Suga, Yōko Mihara', null, 'Legendary swordplay filmmaker Hideo Gosha''s Sword of the Beast chronicles the flight of the low-level swordsman Gennosuke, who kills one of his ministers as part of a reform plot. His former comrades then turn on him, and this betrayal so shakes his sense of honor that he decides to live in the wild, like an animal. There he joins up with a motley group who are illegally mining the shogun’s gold, and, with the aid of another swordsman, gets a chance not just at survival but to recover his name and honor.', 'Legendary swordplay filmmaker Hideo Gosha''s Sword of the Beast chronicles the flight of the low-level swordsman Gennosuke, who kills one of his ministers as part of a reform plot. His former comrades then turn on him, and this betrayal so shakes his sense of honor that he decides to live in the wild, like an animal. There he joins up with a motley group who are illegally mining the shogun’s gold, and, with the aid of another swordsman, gets a chance not just at survival but to recover his name and honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CoqruUTwDldSP8iNSKvmhq2sOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46917'),
  ('634921200064286340', 'Sword of the Stranger', 2007, 'Action, Animation, History', 'Masahiro Ando, Yohei Miyahara', 'Fumihiko Takayama', 'Tomoya Nagase, Yuri Chinen, Koichi Yamadera, Akio Otsuka, Unsho Ishizuka, Mamoru Miyano, Maaya Sakamoto, Jun Hazumi', 'PG', 'Pursued by formidable Chinese assassins, young Kotaro and his dog run into No Name, a mysterious stranger who gets pulled into the chase. The unlikely companions form a bond over saving the dog from a poison attack, but chaos erupts when the assassins find Kotaro, and No Name must face his past before a horrible fate is met again.', 'Pursued by formidable Chinese assassins, young Kotaro and his dog run into No Name, a mysterious stranger who gets pulled into the chase. The unlikely companions form a bond over saving the dog from a poison attack, but chaos erupts when the assassins find Kotaro, and No Name must face his past before a horrible fate is met again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMsUYZq5ITW3rAqF3tB7v74KEnH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13980'),
  ('532973557408095702', 'Sword of the Valiant: The Legend of Sir Gawain and the Green Knight', 1984, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Stephen Weeks, Peter Hurst, Freddie Young', 'Howard C. Pen, Stephen Weeks, Philip M. Breen', 'Miles O''Keeffe, Cyrielle Clair, Leigh Lawson, Sean Connery, Trevor Howard, Peter Cushing, Ronald Lacey, Lila Kedrova', 'PG', 'Gawain was a squire in King Arthur''s court when the Green Knight burst in and offered to play a game with a brave knight. Gawain journeys across the land, learning about life, saving damsels, and solving the Green Knight''s riddle.', 'Gawain was a squire in King Arthur''s court when the Green Knight burst in and offered to play a game with a brave knight. Gawain journeys across the land, learning about life, saving damsels, and solving the Green Knight''s riddle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqcmaLS8yECWb1skKJnmO9vGIj4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30584'),
  ('39196567948078229', 'Sword of Trust', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Lynn Shelton, Emily A. Neumann, Jason Oldak', 'Lynn Shelton, Michael Patrick O''Brien', 'Marc Maron, Jon Bass, Michaela Watkins, Jillian Bell, Toby Huss, Dan Bakkedahl, Lynn Shelton, Timothy Paul', 'R', 'When Cynthia and Mary show up to collect Cynthia''s inheritance from her deceased grandfather, the only item she''s received is an antique sword that he believed to be proof that the South won the Civil War.', 'When Cynthia and Mary show up to collect Cynthia''s inheritance from her deceased grandfather, the only item she''s received is an antique sword that he believed to be proof that the South won the Civil War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OK1xEzEQEwkh0F4FwyTbulMm2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575942'),
  ('599632973859445477', 'Sword of Vengeance', 2015, 'History', 'Jim Weedon, August Jakobsson, Ivan Živković', 'Matthew Read, Julian Unthank', 'Stanley Weber, Karel Roden, Annabelle Wallis, Ed Skrein, Dave Legeno, Edward Akrout, Peter J. Chaffey, Gianni Giardinelli', null, 'Returning to his homeland after years of slavery, a Norman prince seeks revenge on his father''s murderer – his ruthless uncle, Earl Durant. Gaining the trust of a band of exiled farmers, he leads them into battle against Durant, exploiting them in his inexorable quest for vengeance. As one by one they are slaughtered in the brutal battle, will the prince sacrifice everything an everyone to fulfil his quest for blood?', 'Returning to his homeland after years of slavery, a Norman prince seeks revenge on his father''s murderer – his ruthless uncle, Earl Durant. Gaining the trust of a band of exiled farmers, he leads them into battle against Durant, exploiting them in his inexorable quest for vengeance. As one by one they are slaughtered in the brutal battle, will the prince sacrifice everything an everyone to fulfil his quest for blood?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzGCV0V4B5L0VgmAYGMawqaIhha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313074'),
  ('611398834725044405', 'Swordfish', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Dominic Sena, Paul Cameron, Lora Kennedy', 'Skip Woods', 'John Travolta, Hugh Jackman, Halle Berry, Don Cheadle, Vinnie Jones, Sam Shepard, Drea De Matteo, Rudolf Martin', 'R', 'Rogue agent Gabriel Shear is determined to get his mitts on $9 billion stashed in a secret Drug Enforcement Administration account. He wants the cash to fight terrorism, but lacks the computer skills necessary to hack into the government mainframe. Enter Stanley Jobson, a n''er-do-well encryption expert who can log into anything.', 'Rogue agent Gabriel Shear is determined to get his mitts on $9 billion stashed in a secret Drug Enforcement Administration account. He wants the cash to fight terrorism, but lacks the computer skills necessary to hack into the government mainframe. Enter Stanley Jobson, a n''er-do-well encryption expert who can log into anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mM6h4jMqC4q5IaFgBIGKQDLnRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9705'),
  ('6323939399003172', 'Swordsman', 1990, 'Action, Adventure', 'King Hu, Tsui Hark, Tony Ching Siu-Tung', 'Wong Ying, Edward Leung Yiu-Ming, Tai Foo-Ho', 'Sam Hui, Cecilia Yip Tung, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Sharla Cheung, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying, Lau Siu-Ming, Yuen Wah, Lau Shun', null, 'A kung-fu manual known as the Sacred Scroll is stolen from the Emperor''s library. An army detachment is sent to recover it. Meanwhile, a young swordsman and his fellow disciple are accidentally drawn into the chaos.', 'A kung-fu manual known as the Sacred Scroll is stolen from the Emperor''s library. An army detachment is sent to recover it. Meanwhile, a young swordsman and his fellow disciple are accidentally drawn into the chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnbQngk3fKAqwqyVmqxBXvoD3DZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18860'),
  ('11955854011180706', 'Swordsman III: The East Is Red', 1993, 'Action, Romance', 'Raymond Lee Wai-Man, Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Tom Lau Moon-Tong', 'Tsui Hark, Roy Szeto Wai-Cheuk, Charcoal Tan', 'Brigitte Lin, Joey Wong, Jean Wang Ching-Ying, Yu Rongguang, Lau Shun, Eddy Ko Hung, Steve Lee Ka-Ting, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan', null, 'A royal official accompanies a Portuguese warship to the Black Cliffs to see the site of the defeat of the evil Invincible Asia, who attained supernatural abilities by following the sacred scroll and castrating himself.', 'A royal official accompanies a Portuguese warship to the Black Cliffs to see the site of the defeat of the evil Invincible Asia, who attained supernatural abilities by following the sacred scroll and castrating himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hWOc6GfQWTwdDrTmVOJNIu7YEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18667'),
  ('848349785477119130', 'Sworn to Justice', 1996, 'Thriller, Action', 'Paul Maslak, Richard Benda, Cody Allen', 'Robert Easter', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Tony Lo Bianco, Kurt McKinney, Brad Dourif, Mako, Walter Koenig, Kenn Scott, Katie Mitchell', null, 'After masked attackers kill her sister and young nephew, a female psychologist takes the law into her own hands by acting as a defense witness by day and a ruthless avenger by night.', 'After masked attackers kill her sister and young nephew, a female psychologist takes the law into her own hands by acting as a defense witness by day and a ruthless avenger by night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SoAdpYgAjrq1rQ4sZFEHMKwpgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76807'),
  ('176311537863657103', 'Sworn Virgin', 2015, 'Drama', 'Laura Bispuri, Vladan Radović, Francesca Borromeo', 'Laura Bispuri, Francesca Manieri', 'Alba Rohrwacher, Emily Ferratello, Lars Eidinger, Flonja Kodheli, Luan Jaha, Bruno Shllaku, Ilire Vinca Çelaj, Drenica Selimaj', null, 'Years after declaring her eternal virginity and opting to live life as a man in the mountains of Albania, Hana looks to return to living as a woman as she settles into a new existence in modern-day Milan.', 'Years after declaring her eternal virginity and opting to live life as a man in the mountains of Albania, Hana looks to return to living as a woman as she settles into a new existence in modern-day Milan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piSe5rV0crFgHHJgXrjrTwGNJmi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319998'),
  ('165541138419238546', 'Swung', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Colin Kennedy, Jean-François Hensgens', 'Ewan Morrison', 'Elena Anaya, Steven Cree, Elizabeth McGovern, Owen McDonnell, Shauna Macdonald, David Elliot, Irvine Welsh, Allison McKenzie', null, 'David’s life is on the slide: he’s broke, in the middle of a divorce and ‘can’t get it up’. His girlfriend, Alice, is his rock, but the magazine she writes for is going down and the pressure is on to find a story. While job hunting online, David stumbles across the perfect antidote to his boredom: a ‘Swingers’ site. The resulting inbox of lewd invitations on the home-laptop justifiably upsets Alice, until she realises this could be just the ‘story’ she needs. The idea of uncovering the swinging scene causes quite a stir in Alice’s office and, much to David’s chagrin, she is urged to pursue the story. Their first reluctant foray is an hysterically low-rent initiation, however, an unexpected upturn for David’s manhood is all the extra encouragement they need. As events accelerate beyond their control the once adoring couple become lost and fundamental questions are asked of their relationship.', 'David’s life is on the slide: he’s broke, in the middle of a divorce and ‘can’t get it up’. His girlfriend, Alice, is his rock, but the magazine she writes for is going down and the pressure is on to find a story. While job hunting online, David stumbles across the perfect antidote to his boredom: a ‘Swingers’ site. The resulting inbox of lewd invitations on the home-laptop justifiably upsets Alice, until she realises this could be just the ‘story’ she needs. The idea of uncovering the swinging scene causes quite a stir in Alice’s office and, much to David’s chagrin, she is urged to pursue the story. Their first reluctant foray is an hysterically low-rent initiation, however, an unexpected upturn for David’s manhood is all the extra encouragement they need. As events accelerate beyond their control the once adoring couple become lost and fundamental questions are asked of their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRjm5zztXRUYhXEl3FQKbIbgtMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287284'),
  ('340102556558576877', 'Sx_Tape', 2013, 'Horror', 'Bernard Rose, Bernard Rose', 'Eric Reese', 'Caitlyn Folley, Ian Duncan, Diana García, Chris Coy, Julie Marcus, Daniel Faraldo, Eric Neil Gutierrez', 'R', 'From the director of CANDYMAN and the producers of PARANORMAL ACTIVITY comes a found-footage nightmare of lust, possession, and destruction. Jill''s an artist. Ian''s a filmmaker. And their love life is off the chain. There''s no experience too wild, no dare too dangerous—not even when Jill lets Ian strap her to a gurney in the abandoned hospital they''re scoping out for their next art show. But he shouldn''t have left her alone. Not even as a joke. Now, Jill''s hookup with horror has awakened something in that place. Something with a lust for more than flesh.', 'From the director of CANDYMAN and the producers of PARANORMAL ACTIVITY comes a found-footage nightmare of lust, possession, and destruction. Jill''s an artist. Ian''s a filmmaker. And their love life is off the chain. There''s no experience too wild, no dare too dangerous—not even when Jill lets Ian strap her to a gurney in the abandoned hospital they''re scoping out for their next art show. But he shouldn''t have left her alone. Not even as a joke. Now, Jill''s hookup with horror has awakened something in that place. Something with a lust for more than flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n484SE5u944nFRw4sJ9kr6IN1O3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228496'),
  ('566514910628118179', 'Sybil', 2007, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Joseph Sargent', null, 'Jessica Lange, Tammy Blanchard, JoBeth Williams, Alison Murray, Fab Filippo, Brian Downey, Brianna MacDonald, Joey Campbell', null, 'A true story of a young woman whose abusive childhood results in her developing a multiple personality disorder.', 'A true story of a young woman whose abusive childhood results in her developing a multiple personality disorder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCO7uL61kh71kniTlcaTADLhFSm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27137'),
  ('811289518194993704', 'Sycorax', 2021, 'Drama', 'Matías Piñeiro, Lois Patiño, Mauro Herce', 'Lois Patiño, Matías Piñeiro', 'Agustina Muñoz, Diana Diegues, Susana Abreu', null, 'Who is Sycorax? The first character in Shakespeare''s "Tempest" to set foot on the island. The problem is that she has no voice. She is barely mentioned by Prospero as a crooked, old, wicked witch who vilely locked Ariel, the spirit of the air, in a tree. But why would she do that? Here, we wouldn''t believe Prospero so much.', 'Who is Sycorax? The first character in Shakespeare''s "Tempest" to set foot on the island. The problem is that she has no voice. She is barely mentioned by Prospero as a crooked, old, wicked witch who vilely locked Ariel, the spirit of the air, in a tree. But why would she do that? Here, we wouldn''t believe Prospero so much.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVmtlma7PBEnMvbJrkc00tZ9dr8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838186'),
  ('980825073823138779', 'Sydney White', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Joe Nussbaum, Mark Irwin', 'Chad Gomez Creasey', 'Amanda Bynes, Sara Paxton, Matt Long, Jeremy Howard, Danny Strong, Jack Carpenter, John Schneider, Samm Levine', 'PG-13', 'College freshman Sydney White arrives at Southern Atlantic University, determined to pledge her late mother''s sorority. Unfortunately, she finds that the sisterhood has changed since her parent''s day. Banished to a condemned house, Sydney joins forces with seven outcasts to take over the student government and win equal rights for nerd and noted alike.', 'College freshman Sydney White arrives at Southern Atlantic University, determined to pledge her late mother''s sorority. Unfortunately, she finds that the sisterhood has changed since her parent''s day. Banished to a condemned house, Sydney joins forces with seven outcasts to take over the student government and win equal rights for nerd and noted alike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ce3NNmhVZY5NkUe5Y8Je8CciKqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10760'),
  ('741900210086381908', 'Sylvia', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christine Jeffs, John Toon', 'John Brownlow', 'Gwyneth Paltrow, Daniel Craig, Jared Harris, Amira Casar, Andrew Havill, Sam Troughton, Lucy Davenport, Anthony Strachan', 'R', 'Story of the relationship between the poets Ted Hughes and Sylvia Plath.', 'Story of the relationship between the poets Ted Hughes and Sylvia Plath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEhrg0uQqhmHUDRqODxxvRPipfB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28200'),
  ('547358572829307866', 'Sylvia and the Ghost', 1946, 'Fantasy, Romance, Comedy', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Philippe Agostini, Ghislaine Autant-Lara', 'Jean Aurenche', 'Odette Joyeux, François Périer, Jean Desailly, Jacques Tati, Pierre Larquey, Julien Carette, Paul Demange, Marguerite Cassan', null, 'A teenager becomes fixated on a painting of the handsome suitor who died in a duel for her grandmother''s love. On her sixteenth birthday, her father hires three men who pretend to be the ghost of the suitor to entertain her. Little do they know, the ghost of the suitor himself is roaming the castle halls.', 'A teenager becomes fixated on a painting of the handsome suitor who died in a duel for her grandmother''s love. On her sixteenth birthday, her father hires three men who pretend to be the ghost of the suitor to entertain her. Little do they know, the ghost of the suitor himself is roaming the castle halls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jSCQcK9T9FkHB0D5Je36lgnnsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43486'),
  ('725115809369023142', 'Sylvia Scarlett', 1935, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'George Cukor, Roy Webb, Sturges Carne', 'Gladys Unger, John Collier, Mortimer Offner', 'Katharine Hepburn, Cary Grant, Brian Aherne, Edmund Gwenn, Natalie Paley, Dennie Moore, Lennox Pawle, Harrold Cheevers', 'NR', 'When her father decides to flee to England, young Sylvia Scarlett must become Sylvester Scarlett and protect her father every step of the way, with the questionable help of plenty others.', 'When her father decides to flee to England, young Sylvia Scarlett must become Sylvester Scarlett and protect her father every step of the way, with the questionable help of plenty others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hMesbV20CgdzODWgOgL2t1iHdp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31866'),
  ('426801449645013626', 'Sylvie''s Love', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Eugene Ashe, Kerry Barden, Paul Schnee', 'Eugene Ashe', 'Tessa Thompson, Nnamdi Asomugha, Aja Naomi King, Jemima Kirke, Tone Bell, Alano Miller, Erica Gimpel, Lance Reddick', 'PG-13', 'When a young woman meets an aspiring saxophonist in her father’s record shop in 1950s Harlem, their love ignites a sweeping romance that transcends changing times, geography, and professional success.', 'When a young woman meets an aspiring saxophonist in her father’s record shop in 1950s Harlem, their love ignites a sweeping romance that transcends changing times, geography, and professional success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48P3lTdsg19OfmrD5av0VJYcjLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584288'),
  ('1000578454496041287', 'Symbiopsychotaxiplasm: Take One', 1968, 'Documentary', 'William Greaves, Terence Macartney-Filgate, Stevan Larner', 'William Greaves', 'Patricia Ree Gilbert , Don Fellows, Jonathan Gordon, William Greaves, Susan Anspach, Audrey Heningham, Stevan Larner, Terence Macartney-Filgate', null, 'In Manhattan''s Central Park, a film crew directed by William Greaves is shooting a screen test with various pairs of actors. It''s a confrontation between a couple: he demands to know what''s wrong, she challenges his sexual orientation. Cameras shoot the exchange, and another camera records Greaves and his crew. Sometimes we watch the crew discussing this scene, its language, and the process of making a movie. Is there such a thing as natural language? Are all things related to sex? The camera records distractions - a woman rides horseback past them; a garrulous homeless vet who sleeps in the park chats them up. What''s the nature of making a movie?', 'In Manhattan''s Central Park, a film crew directed by William Greaves is shooting a screen test with various pairs of actors. It''s a confrontation between a couple: he demands to know what''s wrong, she challenges his sexual orientation. Cameras shoot the exchange, and another camera records Greaves and his crew. Sometimes we watch the crew discussing this scene, its language, and the process of making a movie. Is there such a thing as natural language? Are all things related to sex? The camera records distractions - a woman rides horseback past them; a garrulous homeless vet who sleeps in the park chats them up. What''s the nature of making a movie?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8INKiTZWT6DBkpIRVtv85tKunh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44783'),
  ('1128051349509747876', 'Symbol', 2009, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Hitoshi Matsumoto, Kensuke Shiga', 'Hitoshi Matsumoto', 'Hitoshi Matsumoto, David Quintero, Carlos C. Torres, Luis Accinelli, Lilian Tapia, Ivana Wong Yuen-Chi, Adriana Fricke, Salam Diagne', null, 'A Japanese man in polka-dot pajamas wakes up in a room with no doors. Meanwhile, a middle-aged Mexican wrestler prepares for his most challenging match ever.', 'A Japanese man in polka-dot pajamas wakes up in a room with no doors. Meanwhile, a middle-aged Mexican wrestler prepares for his most challenging match ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hWWrQ86GJMb0JQEY6JhHPnveW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42430'),
  ('878949783647290620', 'Symmetry', 2003, 'Drama', 'Konrad Niewolski, Arkadiusz Tomiak', 'Konrad Niewolski', 'Arkadiusz Detmer, Andrzej Chyra, Janusz Bukowski, Marcin Jędrzejewski, Mariusz Jakus, Borys Szyc, Kinga Preis, Janusz Chabior', null, 'Łukasz, an unemployed geography graduate, is wrongfully arrested for robbery. His alibi is weak, and he is identified during a lineup. The situation gets hopeless when, a few hours later, the alleged victim suddenly dies. The defense lawyer promises to do everything in his power, but Łukasz ends up in custody. He must find his place in a world of harsh prison rules. He chooses the cell of the “grypsujący” (inmates who communicate by coded messages)…', 'Łukasz, an unemployed geography graduate, is wrongfully arrested for robbery. His alibi is weak, and he is identified during a lineup. The situation gets hopeless when, a few hours later, the alleged victim suddenly dies. The defense lawyer promises to do everything in his power, but Łukasz ends up in custody. He must find his place in a world of harsh prison rules. He chooses the cell of the “grypsujący” (inmates who communicate by coded messages)…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jJAcF5eE1yBGwMHYRj9xmOkEte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38530'),
  ('617046546974049421', 'Sympathy for Mr. Vengeance', 2002, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Park Chan-wook, Kim Byeong-il, Lee So-yeong', 'Lee Jae-soon, Lee Jong-yong, Park Chan-wook', 'Song Kang-ho, Shin Ha-kyun, Bae Doona, Im Ji-eun, Han Bo-bae, Lee Dae-yeon, Ki Joo-bong, Kim Se-dong', 'R', 'A deaf man and his girlfriend resort to desperate measures in order to fund a kidney transplant for his sister. Things go horribly wrong, and the situation spirals rapidly into a cycle of violence and revenge.', 'A deaf man and his girlfriend resort to desperate measures in order to fund a kidney transplant for his sister. Things go horribly wrong, and the situation spirals rapidly into a cycle of violence and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uj42ubGbgVL65T10SvPVr0p9mJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4689'),
  ('433880329989947768', 'Sympathy for the Devil', 1968, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jean-Luc Godard, John Stoneman, Tim Van Rellim', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Mick Jagger, Keith Richards, Brian Jones, Charlie Watts, Bill Wyman, Anne Wiazemsky, Iain Quarrier, Frankie Dymon', 'NR', 'While The Rolling Stones rehearse "Sympathy for the Devil" in the studio, an alternating narrative reflects on 1968 society, politics and culture through five different vignettes.', 'While The Rolling Stones rehearse "Sympathy for the Devil" in the studio, an alternating narrative reflects on 1968 society, politics and culture through five different vignettes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxfNcj87BORjRYYKhY1jGMnVPLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50789'),
  ('542333608277949556', 'Sympathy for the Devil', 2019, 'War, Drama', 'Guillaume de Fontenay, Pierre Aïm, Valérie Aragües', 'Guillaume de Fontenay, Guillaume Vigneault, Jean Barbe', 'Niels Schneider, Ella Rumpf, Izudin Bajrović, Adnan Omerović, Mirsad Ibišević, Ejla Bavčić, Aldin Tucić, Toussaint Colombani', null, 'In an urban war zone where everything that moves is a target, Paul tries to live, love and inform.', 'In an urban war zone where everything that moves is a target, Paul tries to live, love and inform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnJaitYJPQfQl1I5CsH7Rk5ouLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636835'),
  ('692476907152211107', 'Sympathy for the Devil', 2023, 'Thriller, Action', 'Alexander Armero, Allan Aguilar, Yuval Adler', 'Luke Paradise', 'Joel Kinnaman, Nicolas Cage, Alexis Zollicoffer, Cameron Lee Price, Oliver McCallum, Rich Hopkins, Kaiwi Lyman, Burns Burns', 'R', 'After being forced to drive a mysterious passenger at gunpoint, a man finds himself in a high-stakes game of cat and mouse where it becomes clear that not everything is as it seems.', 'After being forced to drive a mysterious passenger at gunpoint, a man finds himself in a high-stakes game of cat and mouse where it becomes clear that not everything is as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afGdVMa80LMs6ibLP22CwM5uI4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030987'),
  ('423433068039614875', 'Sympathy for the Lobster', 2007, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Sabina Guzzanti, Caroline Champetier', 'Luca Bandirali, Sabina Guzzanti', 'Sabina Guzzanti, Franza Di Rosa, Antonello Fassari, Cinzia Leone, Pierfrancesco Loche, Stefano Masciarelli, Francesca Reggiani, Gianni Usai', null, 'The actors of Avanzi reunite after 15 years in Su Pallosu, a small village in Sardinia. They have decided to put together a show to support the cause of the local fishermen who are having great difficulty because of fish depopulation.', 'The actors of Avanzi reunite after 15 years in Su Pallosu, a small village in Sardinia. They have decided to put together a show to support the cause of the local fishermen who are having great difficulty because of fish depopulation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7W4e66FCyo8eYsnkygB4EJ2N43M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46030'),
  ('1125712824407040266', 'Sympathy for the Underdog', 1971, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Kunimitsu Teranishi, Hanjirō Nakazawa', 'Fumio Kōnami, Hirō Matsuda, Kinji Fukasaku', 'Koji Tsuruta, Tomisaburō Wakayama, Noboru Andō, Asao Koike, Tsunehiko Watase, Akiko Kudō, Kenji Imai, Harumi Sone', null, 'A yakuza gang gets driven out of Yokohama by a big gang from Tokyo. They relocate to Okinawa to violently start over.', 'A yakuza gang gets driven out of Yokohama by a big gang from Tokyo. They relocate to Okinawa to violently start over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anVq54Gx3dyM46Vt4DORKCp7sHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90351'),
  ('924947221992686879', 'Sympathy Seeker', 1997, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Vladimir Mashkov, Yekaterina Berezovskaya, Nikolay Nemolyaev', 'Oleg Antonov', 'Elena Shevchenko, Nikolay Fomenko, Valentin Gaft, Oleg Tabakov, Lev Durov, Viktor Pavlov, Mikhail Filipchuk, Vladimir Mashkov', null, 'A Christmas story, almost a fairy tale. An ordinary Russian girl brought up without a father could not even think that one fine day she would find him. And who could suppose that three "fathers" at once would pretend to the role?', 'A Christmas story, almost a fairy tale. An ordinary Russian girl brought up without a father could not even think that one fine day she would find him. And who could suppose that three "fathers" at once would pretend to the role?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTnV12xH9Vu7M2ACEnyeqXzP9Rh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143056'),
  ('507895472807666266', 'Symphony for a Massacre', 1963, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jacques Deray, Claude Renoir, Pierre Duquesne', 'José Giovanni, Claude Sautet, Jacques Deray', 'Michel Auclair, Claude Dauphin, Charles Vanel, Jean Rochefort, Michèle Mercier, José Giovanni, Daniela Rocca, Marcello Pagliero', null, 'A band of gangsters devise a plan to steal a game contested between two drug gangs of drug traffickers: the five fraudsters will face bigger problems than them.', 'A band of gangsters devise a plan to steal a game contested between two drug gangs of drug traffickers: the five fraudsters will face bigger problems than them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MjBc6HJZ7OXJ9Gg00rBQB4wT0s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434050'),
  ('812407738583992116', 'Symphony Hour', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Riley Thomson, Ray DeVally', null, 'Walt Disney, Billy Bletcher, Pinto Colvig, Florence Gill, Clarence Nash, John McLeish', 'NR', 'Mickey guest-directs a radio orchestra. The sponsor loves the rehearsal, but come the actual performance, Goofy drops all the instruments under an elevator, so they sound like toys. The sponsor hates it, but the audience loves it anyway.', 'Mickey guest-directs a radio orchestra. The sponsor loves the rehearsal, but come the actual performance, Goofy drops all the instruments under an elevator, so they sound like toys. The sponsor hates it, but the audience loves it anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xSI8M0crOD2w6eCxe1cbS1dC8P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67502'),
  ('549455295999869292', 'Symphony in Black: A Rhapsody of Negro Life', 1935, 'Music, Drama', 'Fred Waller, William O. Steiner', 'Milton Hockey, Fred Rath', 'Duke Ellington, Billie Holiday, Earl ''Snake Hips'' Tucker, Barney Bigard, Joe ''Tricky Sam'' Nanton', null, 'A rising nineteen-year-old singer by the name of Billie Holiday made her screen debut in this musical landmark, which features Duke Ellington and his orchestra performing his symphonic jazz piece “A Rhapsody of Negro Life” set to scenes of everyday African American life.', 'A rising nineteen-year-old singer by the name of Billie Holiday made her screen debut in this musical landmark, which features Duke Ellington and his orchestra performing his symphonic jazz piece “A Rhapsody of Negro Life” set to scenes of everyday African American life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/at7gJgyLT1zLqtGCjzauWrhjqhS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197127'),
  ('845436215536021784', 'Symphony In Blood Red', 2010, 'Horror', 'Luigi Pastore, Tiziano Pancotti', 'Luigi Pastore, Antonio Tentori', 'Sharon Alessandri, Nikol Brown, Federica Carpico, Tony Cimarosa, Michela Foresta, Fabio Giovannini, Anna Morosetti, Simona Oliverio', null, 'During an analytic session, a psychologist recommends that one of her patients be admitted to a specialist clinic, but this decision unleashes the mysterious individual''s latent madness. Abandonment is the key to his delusion, which will lead him to kill once again, as he had done in the past with his first, lost love. So, after disposing of the analyst''s body, he decides to continue the "therapy" alone with the aid of a small video camera, recording his emotional states in a hallucinatory crescendo.', 'During an analytic session, a psychologist recommends that one of her patients be admitted to a specialist clinic, but this decision unleashes the mysterious individual''s latent madness. Abandonment is the key to his delusion, which will lead him to kill once again, as he had done in the past with his first, lost love. So, after disposing of the analyst''s body, he decides to continue the "therapy" alone with the aid of a small video camera, recording his emotional states in a hallucinatory crescendo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRbibcD6YpC2qZNtgh1i4EWGvdR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147965'),
  ('434995627321911255', 'Symphony in Slang', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'John Brown', null, 'At the gates of Heaven, the admitting officials have a hard time understanding a newcomer''s life story with all his contemporary slang.', 'At the gates of Heaven, the admitting officials have a hard time understanding a newcomer''s life story with all his contemporary slang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnM7xJ2Kg0m91269PPPBqoRRUkG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87197'),
  ('950142625358927349', 'Symphony of a City', 1947, 'Documentary', 'Arne Sucksdorff', 'Arne Sucksdorff', 'Mats Björne, Björn Näslund, Bo Tobiasson, Erland Colliander, Sven Ericsson, Sala-Frasse, Anders Nohrborg', null, 'An impressionistic short film celebrating Stockholm’s rhythms of life, blending images of its streets, waterways, people, and architecture into a visual “symphony.” Winner of the Academy Award (Oscar) for Best Short Subject, One-Reel in 1949 — the first Swedish film ever to receive an Oscar.', 'An impressionistic short film celebrating Stockholm’s rhythms of life, blending images of its streets, waterways, people, and architecture into a visual “symphony.” Winner of the Academy Award (Oscar) for Best Short Subject, One-Reel in 1949 — the first Swedish film ever to receive an Oscar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySFm62JVFdGPXx8ZQt7pqlFk4Cf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240444'),
  ('338238709024530671', 'Symptoms', 1974, 'Horror', 'José Ramón Larraz, Trevor Wrenn, Chris Cook', 'José Ramón Larraz, Stanley Miller', 'Angela Pleasence, Peter Vaughan, Lorna Heilbron, Nancy Nevinson, Ronald O''Neil, Marie-Paule Mailleux, Mike Grady, Raymond Huntley', null, 'A young woman is invited by her girlfriend, who lives in an English country mansion, to stay there with her. The estate, however, isn''t quite what it seems--and neither is the friend who issued the invitation.', 'A young woman is invited by her girlfriend, who lives in an English country mansion, to stay there with her. The estate, however, isn''t quite what it seems--and neither is the friend who issued the invitation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iPfWp5Zo1e1ayzwQHXARV9xyNO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110412'),
  ('517611792631723206', 'Synchromy', 1971, 'Animation', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'The film''s soundtrack is an original musical composition produced with synthetic sound - through photographing unusual geometric shapes and running them through an optical sound head. The images are an artistic rendering of this soundtrack.', 'The film''s soundtrack is an original musical composition produced with synthetic sound - through photographing unusual geometric shapes and running them through an optical sound head. The images are an artistic rendering of this soundtrack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PKYHJKMHZTx7WZm96hI8kq0MRr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215061'),
  ('570384466675215365', 'Synchromy No. 2', 1935, 'Animation', 'Mary Ellen Bute, Ted Nemeth', null, null, null, 'Synchromy No. 2, synchronized to the "Evening Star" aria from Wagner''s Tannhäuser, uses a statue of Venus to represent the star.', 'Synchromy No. 2, synchronized to the "Evening Star" aria from Wagner''s Tannhäuser, uses a statue of Venus to represent the star.', null, 'tmdb:movie:184519'),
  ('280025316770720937', 'Synchronic', 2020, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jessica Dean Rose, Ryan Orenstein, Mark Bennett', 'Justin Benson', 'Anthony Mackie, Jamie Dornan, Katie Aselton, Alexia Ioannides, Ramiz Monsef, Bill Oberst Jr., Betsy Holt, Shane Brady', 'R', 'Two New Orleans paramedics'' lives are ripped apart after encountering a series of horrific deaths linked to a designer drug with bizarre, otherworldly effects.', 'Two New Orleans paramedics'' lives are ripped apart after encountering a series of horrific deaths linked to a designer drug with bizarre, otherworldly effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgm4gdJwb7iSYX0uBsRAZmHQmPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549294'),
  ('652920533044892669', 'Synchronicity', 2015, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jacob Gentry, Eric Maddison, Robert Ballentine', 'Jacob Gentry', 'Chad McKnight, Brianne Davis, AJ Bowen, Scott Poythress, Michael Ironside, Claire Bronson, Wade Tilton, Sergine Dumais', 'R', 'A daring physicist travels into the past to stop a mysterious woman from stealing his invention. But once there, he uncovers a surprising truth about the machine, the woman, and his own fractured reality.', 'A daring physicist travels into the past to stop a mysterious woman from stealing his invention. But once there, he uncovers a surprising truth about the machine, the woman, and his own fractured reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGHoYDswvx96PVF43qFErVAnQHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347945'),
  ('833744626608952286', 'Syndicate Sadists', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Umberto Lenzi, Alessandro Metz, Federico Zanni', 'Vincenzo Mannino', 'Tomas Milian, Joseph Cotten, Maria Fiore, Luciano Catenacci, Mario Piave, Guido Alberti, Femi Benussi, Silvano Tranquilli', 'R', 'A biker''s brother is killed while investigating the kidnapping of a young boy, the byproduct of a war between two crime families. The biker vows to get revenge by finding the kidnapped boy and destroying the two families.', 'A biker''s brother is killed while investigating the kidnapping of a young boy, the byproduct of a war between two crime families. The biker vows to get revenge by finding the kidnapped boy and destroying the two families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fE1ccN1cPFR2dlWvjpnJPHuMCgu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28489'),
  ('62645872272106187', 'Syndromes and a Century', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul, Sayombhu Mukdeeprom, Suchada Sirithanawuddhi', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul', 'Nantarat Sawaddikul, Jaruchai Iamaram, Sophon Pukanok, Jenjira Pongpas, Arkanae Cherkam, Sakda Kaewbuadee, Nu Nimsomboon, Apirak Mitrpracha', null, 'A story about director Apichatpong Weerasethakul’s parents who were both doctors, and his memories of growing up in a hospital environment.', 'A story about director Apichatpong Weerasethakul’s parents who were both doctors, and his memories of growing up in a hospital environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XUMd93PRMUkCtE2NWn0zQb1NC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27904'),
  ('351789806020622254', 'Synecdoche, New York', 2008, 'Drama', 'Frederick Elmes, H.H. Cooper, Charlie Kaufman', 'Charlie Kaufman', 'Philip Seymour Hoffman, Samantha Morton, Michelle Williams, Catherine Keener, Emily Watson, Dianne Wiest, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Hope Davis', 'R', 'A theater director struggles with his work, and the women in his life, as he attempts to create a life-size replica of New York inside a warehouse as part of his new play.', 'A theater director struggles with his work, and the women in his life, as he attempts to create a life-size replica of New York inside a warehouse as part of his new play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UwdhrjXhUgsiDhe1dpS9z4yj7q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4960'),
  ('858824544792880705', 'Syngenor', 1990, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'George Elanjian Jr., James Mathers, Michael Cutler', 'Brent V. Friedman', 'Starr Andreeff, Mitchell Laurance, Jeff Doucette, Riva Spier, Lewis Arquette, Jon Korkes, David Gale, Bill Gratton', 'R', 'A scientist engineers a group of genetically engineered cyborgs for use as "super soldiers" to fight U.S. wars in the Middle East. However, things get ugly when the cyborgs malfunction and turn on their creators.', 'A scientist engineers a group of genetically engineered cyborgs for use as "super soldiers" to fight U.S. wars in the Middle East. However, things get ugly when the cyborgs malfunction and turn on their creators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vze6vU6gNF5eH3kPhMk2EjsL5ow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87469'),
  ('154889829961488998', 'Synoikia to Oneiro', 1961, 'Drama', 'Alekos Alexandrakis', 'Kostas Kotzias, Tasos Leivaditis', 'Alekos Alexandrakis, Manos Katrakis, Aliki Georgouli, Spyros Mousouris, Elektra Kalamidou, Alekos Petsos, Aleka Paizi, Athanasia Moustaka', null, 'A poor neighborhood of Athens, Asyrmatos, is the center of the world for the people who live there and try in every way to escape from poverty and destitution. A handsome released youth, Ricos (Alekos Alexandrakis), is trying to make money, at the same time that his lover, Stefi (Aliki Georgoulis), is seeing other men and her father, Nekrophoras (Manos Katrakis), is trying to contribute in family finances. Rico will set up a job, but will spend the money raised before he can put it into action. As a result, one of his "partners" (Alekos Petsos) will commit suicide, leaving his pregnant wife, Eleni (Aleka Paizis), to her fate. Rikos, his beloved and her father, defeated and disappointed because of the expectations that were never fulfilled, will be forced to come to terms with the harsh reality.', 'A poor neighborhood of Athens, Asyrmatos, is the center of the world for the people who live there and try in every way to escape from poverty and destitution. A handsome released youth, Ricos (Alekos Alexandrakis), is trying to make money, at the same time that his lover, Stefi (Aliki Georgoulis), is seeing other men and her father, Nekrophoras (Manos Katrakis), is trying to contribute in family finances. Rico will set up a job, but will spend the money raised before he can put it into action. As a result, one of his "partners" (Alekos Petsos) will commit suicide, leaving his pregnant wife, Eleni (Aleka Paizis), to her fate. Rikos, his beloved and her father, defeated and disappointed because of the expectations that were never fulfilled, will be forced to come to terms with the harsh reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2ilTBnQyag8wsosnao46RnxC94.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275500'),
  ('16718923230238513', 'Synonyms', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nadav Lapid, Shai Goldman', 'Nadav Lapid, Haim Lapid', 'Tom Mercier, Quentin Dolmaire, Louise Chevillotte, Uria Hayik, Olivier Loustau, Yehuda Almagor, Léa Drucker, Gaya von Schwarze', null, 'A young Israeli man absconds to Paris to flee his nationality, aided by his trusty Franco-Israeli dictionary.', 'A young Israeli man absconds to Paris to flee his nationality, aided by his trusty Franco-Israeli dictionary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Jh2h0XsUBFxxeRgDUdfrDjVgFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501590'),
  ('271327004028655460', 'Syriana', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Stephen Gaghan, Robert Elswit, Wilson Tang', 'Stephen Gaghan', 'George Clooney, Matt Damon, Jeffrey Wright, Chris Cooper, Amanda Peet, William Hurt, Christopher Plummer, Alexander Siddig', 'R', 'The Middle Eastern oil industry is the backdrop of this tense drama, which weaves together numerous story lines. Bennett Holiday is an American lawyer in charge of facilitating a dubious merger of oil companies, while Bryan Woodman, a Switzerland-based energy analyst, experiences both personal tragedy and opportunity during a visit with Arabian royalty. Meanwhile, veteran CIA agent Bob Barnes uncovers an assassination plot with unsettling origins.', 'The Middle Eastern oil industry is the backdrop of this tense drama, which weaves together numerous story lines. Bennett Holiday is an American lawyer in charge of facilitating a dubious merger of oil companies, while Bryan Woodman, a Switzerland-based energy analyst, experiences both personal tragedy and opportunity during a visit with Arabian royalty. Meanwhile, veteran CIA agent Bob Barnes uncovers an assassination plot with unsettling origins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mO3hWUTOxmLJxihvDU0YFkb0Mb5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231'),
  ('774697587271050122', 'Syrinx', 1965, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Ryan Larkin', null, null, null, 'She was the nymph who found refuge in the river reeds when the goat-god Pan pursued her. Syrinx is the first film of Ryan Larkin, a young artist from Norman McLaren’s student group. To illustrate the ancient Greek legend of how Pan made his pipes, he employs various charcoal sketches. Accompanying music is Claude Debussy’s Syrinx for solo flute.', 'She was the nymph who found refuge in the river reeds when the goat-god Pan pursued her. Syrinx is the first film of Ryan Larkin, a young artist from Norman McLaren’s student group. To illustrate the ancient Greek legend of how Pan made his pipes, he employs various charcoal sketches. Accompanying music is Claude Debussy’s Syrinx for solo flute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KOxBP7lHs1S3dd9KSQzolOz471.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215657'),
  ('780574329948270127', 'Syrup', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Aram Rappaport, Julio Macat', 'Max Barry, Aram Rappaport', 'Amber Heard, Shiloh Fernandez, Kellan Lutz, Brittany Snow, Josh Pais, Kate Nash, Jack Gilpin, Zachary Booth', 'R', 'A slacker hatches a million-dollar idea. But, in order to see it through, he has to learn to trust his attractive corporate counterpart. Based on Max Barry''s novel.', 'A slacker hatches a million-dollar idea. But, in order to see it through, he has to learn to trust his attractive corporate counterpart. Based on Max Barry''s novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3HSd4Nj6YKKUiE6q9WGow94f45.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72525'),
  ('932556981186359444', 'System Error', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Florian Opitz', 'Florian Opitz', 'Anthony Scaramucci, Florian Opitz, Ulrike Herrmann', null, 'Melting glaciers, gullied seas, the financial markets are about to collapse. Spectacular images of how growth continues to be blinding. Outside you can hardly see anything because of the smog and the smoke screen.', 'Melting glaciers, gullied seas, the financial markets are about to collapse. Spectacular images of how growth continues to be blinding. Outside you can hardly see anything because of the smog and the smoke screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTiXjrj3dvWlxxrygQM8MwcaoDJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514752'),
  ('150697978141524741', 'System K', 2020, 'Documentary, Drama, History', 'Renaud Barret, Renaud Barret, Paul Shemisi Betutua', 'Renaud Barret', 'Freddy Tsimba, Géraldine Tobe, Béni Baras, Majestikos, Kongo Astronaut, Yas Ilunga, Strombo Kayumba', null, 'Kinshasa, Democratic Republic of Congo, 2017. In the urban jungle of Kinshasa, amid social and political chaos, an eclectic and bubbling street art scene is emerging.', 'Kinshasa, Democratic Republic of Congo, 2017. In the urban jungle of Kinshasa, amid social and political chaos, an eclectic and bubbling street art scene is emerging.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEvkHfJQpW8Z0d0E0HMkXyJBmbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577100'),
  ('213943709257463331', 'Szamanka', 1996, 'Drama, Horror', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Andrzej J. Jaroszewicz', 'Manuela Gretkowska', 'Bogusław Linda, Iwona Petry, Piotr Machalica, Paweł Burczyk, Stanisław Jaskułka, Agnieszka Wagner, Paweł Deląg, Piotr Zelt', null, 'Anthropology professor Michal develops two overwhelming obsessions. The first one is a mummified, 3,000 year-old, perfectly preserved body of a shaman he and his colleagues have recently dragged out of a swamp. The second is an enigmatic student he meets by chance at a railway station.', 'Anthropology professor Michal develops two overwhelming obsessions. The first one is a mummified, 3,000 year-old, perfectly preserved body of a shaman he and his colleagues have recently dragged out of a swamp. The second is an enigmatic student he meets by chance at a railway station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feVJnyUX5f1tvQzn64zeaGWMghm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81217'),
  ('52729830624855984', 'Sztos', 1997, 'Crime, Action', 'Olaf Lubaszenko', 'Jerzy Kolasa', 'Jan Nowicki, Cezary Pazura, Ewa Gawryluk, Krzysztof Zaleski, Leon Niemczyk, Jerzy Kolasa, Agnieszka Sitek, Henryk Bista', null, 'Two friends recall the PRL. After serving time in jail, they took up an illegal currency exchange. Cheated by partner - they decide to take revenge. Preparations take many months, but the action ends differently than it was planned.', 'Two friends recall the PRL. After serving time in jail, they took up an illegal currency exchange. Cheated by partner - they decide to take revenge. Preparations take many months, but the action ends differently than it was planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBpGmiY2I7LFSUoN0mPHo9MhFw2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52257'),
  ('361039425720173249', 'T-34', 2018, 'Action, Drama, History, War', 'Dmitry Galperin, Andrey Krauzov, Dmitry Korabelnikov', 'Alexey Sidorov', 'Alexander Petrov, Victor Dobronravov, Irina Starshenbaum, Vinzenz Kiefer, Petr Skvortsov, Semyon Treskunov, Artyom Bystrov, Michael Janibekyan', null, 'In 1944, a courageous group of Russian soldiers managed to escape from German captivity in a half-destroyed legendary T-34 tank. Those were the times of unforgettable bravery, fierce fighting, unbreakable love, and legendary miracles.', 'In 1944, a courageous group of Russian soldiers managed to escape from German captivity in a half-destroyed legendary T-34 tank. Those were the times of unforgettable bravery, fierce fighting, unbreakable love, and legendary miracles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMO5XGq2ybhL3CdCEPJ8OXWbNZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505954'),
  ('1034858183342048293', 'T-Bird Gang', 1959, 'Action', 'Richard Harbinger, Lawrence Raimond, Beach Dickerson', 'John Brinkley, Tony Miller', 'John Brinkley, Ed Nelson, Tony Miller, Coleman Francis, Vic Tayback, Nola Thorp, Beach Dickerson', null, 'Cooperating with the police in order to revenge his father''s death, Frank joins a youth syndicate master-minded by the sadistic Alex. When members become suspicious, Frank must cooperate with the gang activities in order to prove his loyalty. Now personally involved and unable to contact the law or his girl friend, Frank''s true identity is revealed to brutal leader whose anger he must now face. Meanwhile the selfish disloyalty of the boss is revealed and in bitter hatred the most trusting youth of the syndicate turns on the leader.', 'Cooperating with the police in order to revenge his father''s death, Frank joins a youth syndicate master-minded by the sadistic Alex. When members become suspicious, Frank must cooperate with the gang activities in order to prove his loyalty. Now personally involved and unable to contact the law or his girl friend, Frank''s true identity is revealed to brutal leader whose anger he must now face. Meanwhile the selfish disloyalty of the boss is revealed and in bitter hatred the most trusting youth of the syndicate turns on the leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnfPENwuodROtQ7w5pFkTiDFGnR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94249'),
  ('497995199159543476', 'T-Bone for Two', 1942, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Clyde Geronimi, Don A. Duckwall', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Pluto finds a bone - but also finds Butch the bulldog, who claims it for himself. Idea: Pluto paces off a distance, buried treasure style, and digs a large bone-shaped hole. Butch falls for it, and while he''s digging deeper, Pluto almost makes off with the bone. Butch catches on just in time and chases Pluto, who ducks into a junkyard. The bone gets sucked into in a squeeze-bulb horn, which Pluto does battle with.', 'Pluto finds a bone - but also finds Butch the bulldog, who claims it for himself. Idea: Pluto paces off a distance, buried treasure style, and digs a large bone-shaped hole. Butch falls for it, and while he''s digging deeper, Pluto almost makes off with the bone. Butch catches on just in time and chases Pluto, who ducks into a junkyard. The bone gets sucked into in a squeeze-bulb horn, which Pluto does battle with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxwPihr8rfP1Itn4nmWoYwwWxWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68514'),
  ('129333875644989212', 'T-Force', 1994, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Richard Pepin, Ken Blakey, Scott Hohnbaum', 'Joe Hart, Lenore Kletter', 'Jack Scalia, Evan Lurie, Erin Gray, Bobby Johnston, Deron McBee, Jennifer MacDonald, Martin E. Brooks, Vernon Wells', null, 'In the 21st Century, cybernetic research has developed advanced robots with human traits, whioch are widely used in the service industry. They have also been turned into cyber cops with a licence to kill....', 'In the 21st Century, cybernetic research has developed advanced robots with human traits, whioch are widely used in the service industry. They have also been turned into cyber cops with a licence to kill....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTVB17df51wUuD7uVKXO7JgqP4V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81859'),
  ('707846982859809281', 'T-Men', 1947, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Anthony Mann, John Alton, Howard W. Koch', 'John C. Higgins', 'Dennis O''Keefe, Mary Meade, Alfred Ryder, Wallace Ford, June Lockhart, Charles McGraw, Jane Randolph, Art Smith', 'NR', 'Two U.S. Treasury ("T-men") agents go undercover in Detroit, and then Los Angeles, in an attempt to break a U.S. currency counterfeiting ring.', 'Two U.S. Treasury ("T-men") agents go undercover in Detroit, and then Los Angeles, in an attempt to break a U.S. currency counterfeiting ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmFklBSJdi38WDjJUq0mXRXe2qt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26174'),
  ('930350696035826816', 'T-Rex: Back to the Cretaceous', 1998, 'Family, Adventure', 'Brett Leonard', 'Andrew Gellis, David Young, Jeanne Rosenberg', 'Peter Horton, Liz Stauber, Kari Coleman, Charlene Sashuk, Laurie Murdoch, Tuck Milligan', null, 'Dinosaurs are very much alive -- at least in the mind of teenager Ally Hayden who shares her father''s passion for paleontology. When a museum accident transports Ally on a surreal adventure back in time, she encounters people and makes discoveries that might help her solve the mystery of her father''s newest fossil... and even comes face to face with the most dangerous apex predator on earth.', 'Dinosaurs are very much alive -- at least in the mind of teenager Ally Hayden who shares her father''s passion for paleontology. When a museum accident transports Ally on a surreal adventure back in time, she encounters people and makes discoveries that might help her solve the mystery of her father''s newest fossil... and even comes face to face with the most dangerous apex predator on earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4dmpoHm48TpcXD4Zu96LW0QV1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82623'),
  ('645304356988492467', 'T,O,U,C,H,I,N,G', 1969, 'Drama', 'Paul Sharits', null, 'David Franks', null, 'T,O,U,C,H,I,N,G uses flickering frames of solid color juxtaposed with positive and negative still images of a man—sometimes cutting off his own tongue with glitter-covered scissors, sometimes suffering a series of glitter-stained fingernail scratches across the face. Other rapidly alternating still images of eye surgery and a couple in the midst of intercourse. The soundtrack is a continuous looped recording of the word "destroy" over the entire length of the film.', 'T,O,U,C,H,I,N,G uses flickering frames of solid color juxtaposed with positive and negative still images of a man—sometimes cutting off his own tongue with glitter-covered scissors, sometimes suffering a series of glitter-stained fingernail scratches across the face. Other rapidly alternating still images of eye surgery and a couple in the midst of intercourse. The soundtrack is a continuous looped recording of the word "destroy" over the entire length of the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7Z3WBl80FbwRcs9lE86peeAoZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163068'),
