  ('175108674055064980', 'Tabloid Truth', 2014, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Kim Kwang-sik, Park Hong-yeol', 'Kim Yu-jin, Hwang Sung-goo', 'Kim Kang-woo, Jung Jin-young, Ko Chang-seok, Park Sung-woong, Park Won-sang, Kim Eui-sung, Go Won-hee, Lee Chae-eun', null, 'Woo-gon, a passionate manager who lost everything due to stock advertisements and a specialist gets together to find out the truth behind the rumors that have shaken up the country. From precious information to distribution, this crime chasing movie surrounds the invisible truth.', 'Woo-gon, a passionate manager who lost everything due to stock advertisements and a specialist gets together to find out the truth behind the rumors that have shaken up the country. From precious information to distribution, this crime chasing movie surrounds the invisible truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pt1bswa5kV1tfpXqfpaxrVlf6Lh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256316'),
  ('255334456059953846', 'Taboo', 1999, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Nagisa Ōshima', 'Takeshi Kitano, Ryuhei Matsuda, Tadanobu Asano, Yōichi Sai, Shinji Takeda, Susumu Terajima, Tomorowo Taguchi, Yoji Tanaka', 'NR', 'Set during Japan''s Shogun era, this film looks at life in a samurai compound where young warriors are trained in swordfighting. A number of interpersonal conflicts are brewing in the training room, all centering around a handsome young samurai named Sozaburo Kano. The school''s stern master can choose to intervene, or to let Kano decide his own path.', 'Set during Japan''s Shogun era, this film looks at life in a samurai compound where young warriors are trained in swordfighting. A number of interpersonal conflicts are brewing in the training room, all centering around a handsome young samurai named Sozaburo Kano. The school''s stern master can choose to intervene, or to let Kano decide his own path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJxYFrbWhgK2FCjUDWZAkqlXX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20617'),
  ('611200554186494408', 'Taboo', 2002, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Max Makowski, Viorel Sergovici', 'Chris Fisher, Eric Drilling', 'Nick Stahl, Eddie Kaye Thomas, January Jones, Lori Heuring, Derek Hamilton, Amber Benson', 'R', 'Six young adults struggle with their personal demons while staying at a secluded mansion during a dark and stormy night where a seemingly innocent game of ''taboo'' brings out their inter-most secrets which soon leads to murder.', 'Six young adults struggle with their personal demons while staying at a secluded mansion during a dark and stormy night where a seemingly innocent game of ''taboo'' brings out their inter-most secrets which soon leads to murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eNwSS38g40j1JDoe6cCu2eoG1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97206'),
  ('284520687178375838', 'Taboo: Family Secrets', 2024, 'Romance, Drama, Thriller', 'Deborah Twiss', 'Deborah Twiss', 'Costas Mandylor, Deborah Twiss, Staffan Edenholm, Ashley Westover, Patricia McKenzie, Russ Camarda', null, 'A family is fractured by Lukas, the patriarch, and his ongoing infidelities. When the son Tyler comes home for a visit, a taboo passion between him and his stepmother Amanda blossoms, changing the family dynamics forever. The allegiances and expectations shift radically as the truth is revealed.', 'A family is fractured by Lukas, the patriarch, and his ongoing infidelities. When the son Tyler comes home for a visit, a taboo passion between him and his stepmother Amanda blossoms, changing the family dynamics forever. The allegiances and expectations shift radically as the truth is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xatpxQfUVblKveWHXNOidaNg4ju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1358280'),
  ('1025794390308304658', 'Tabu', 1983, 'Comedy, Music', 'Júlio Bressane, Júlio Bressane, Murilo Salles', 'Júlio Bressane', 'Caetano Veloso, Colé Santana, José Lewgoy, Norma Bengell, Sandro Solviatti, Guará Rodrigues, Mário Gomes, Sônia Dias', null, 'The fictional encounter in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil (in the 30s) between popular songwriter Lamartine Babo and inconoclast poet and playwright Oswald de Andrade.', 'The fictional encounter in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil (in the 30s) between popular songwriter Lamartine Babo and inconoclast poet and playwright Oswald de Andrade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srpnzVpigLZ5Bpwur2fabDXfB3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249578'),
  ('322526906595099597', 'Tabu', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Miguel Gomes, Rui Poças, Joaquim Carvalho', 'Miguel Gomes, Mariana Ricardo', 'Teresa Madruga, Laura Soveral, Ana Moreira, Henrique Espírito Santo, Carloto Cotta, Isabel Cardoso, Ivo Müller, Manuel Mesquita', 'NR', 'Lisbon, Portugal, 2010. Pilar, a pious woman devoted to social causes, maintains a peculiar relationship with her neighbor Aurora, a temperamental old woman obsessed with gambling who lives tormented by a mysterious past.', 'Lisbon, Portugal, 2010. Pilar, a pious woman devoted to social causes, maintains a peculiar relationship with her neighbor Aurora, a temperamental old woman obsessed with gambling who lives tormented by a mysterious past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtr1ztUkJs6jsYdzK3gBLsuffr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93858'),
  ('271938753739621489', 'Tabu - Es ist die Seele ein Fremdes auf Erden', 2011, 'Drama', 'Christoph Stark, Bogumił Godfrejów', 'Ursula Mauder', 'Lars Eidinger, Peri Baumeister, Rainer Bock, Rafael Stachowiak, Petra Morzé, Jules Werner, Katharina Straßer, Susi Stach', null, 'The Austrian expressionist poet Georg Trakl was in love with his sister. And she loved him back. Their relationship became sexual and caused quite a stir in the local society. But when his sister asked him to flee with her to Australia where no one knew them and they could live as husband and wife, he refused for he could not live without the beauty of the German language. Torn between his love for words and his love for Grete, Georg turned to drugs and entered a downward spiral.', 'The Austrian expressionist poet Georg Trakl was in love with his sister. And she loved him back. Their relationship became sexual and caused quite a stir in the local society. But when his sister asked him to flee with her to Australia where no one knew them and they could live as husband and wife, he refused for he could not live without the beauty of the German language. Torn between his love for words and his love for Grete, Georg turned to drugs and entered a downward spiral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRNU87qE4xA2jV9hIC2CDjZMoz4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315276'),
  ('848206353781420584', 'Tabu: A Story of the South Seas', 1931, 'Romance, Drama, Adventure', 'F. W. Murnau, Floyd Crosby, Bill Bambridge', 'F. W. Murnau, Robert Flaherty, Edgar G. Ulmer', 'Matahi, Anne Chevalier, Bill Bambridge, Hitu, Jules', 'NR', 'On the South Pacific island of Bora Bora, a young couple''s love is threatened when the tribal chief declares the girl a sacred virgin.', 'On the South Pacific island of Bora Bora, a young couple''s love is threatened when the tribal chief declares the girl a sacred virgin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4zfawkB8Jsp5lhWl62QCzczR3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977'),
  ('687177238069452391', 'Tach, Herr Dokter! – Der Heinz-Becker-Film', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Gernot Roll, Gerd Dudenhöffer', 'Gerd Dudenhöffer', 'Gerd Dudenhöffer, Sabine Urig, Horst Krause, Petra Zieser, Henning Hoffsten, Susanna Simon', null, 'Next to the home of Heinz and Hilde Becker is the villa of the company boss Dr. Bernhard Schenkberg and his wife, who he called "Püppchen". While Schenkberg always politely strives for a good neighborly relationship, his elegant, arrogant wife looks down contemptuously on the grumpy, constantly do-it-yourself Heinz and the conservative, naive housewife Hilde.', 'Next to the home of Heinz and Hilde Becker is the villa of the company boss Dr. Bernhard Schenkberg and his wife, who he called "Püppchen". While Schenkberg always politely strives for a good neighborly relationship, his elegant, arrogant wife looks down contemptuously on the grumpy, constantly do-it-yourself Heinz and the conservative, naive housewife Hilde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzRK5Yvn4V7DEy8KLMW9DSAm59k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27384'),
  ('1145380737468862554', 'Tachigui: The Amazing Lives of the Fast Food Grifters', 2006, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Mamoru Oshii, Kazuhiro Wakabayashi, Keiichi Sakazaki', 'Mamoru Oshii', 'Mako Hyodo, Koichi Yamadera, Shinji Higuchi, Katsuya Terada, Toshio Suzuki, Kenji Kawai, Shoji Kawamori, Kenji Kamiyama', null, 'Tachigui retells Japan''s history from 1945 to 21st century through the feats of self-proclaimed dine and dash professionals - the Fast Food Grifters are the phantoms that rise and fall with the shifting diet-styles. They are the dissenting heroes who carved their names on the dark side of dietary culture with their glare. Now their legend revives, strong as ever...', 'Tachigui retells Japan''s history from 1945 to 21st century through the feats of self-proclaimed dine and dash professionals - the Fast Food Grifters are the phantoms that rise and fall with the shifting diet-styles. They are the dissenting heroes who carved their names on the dark side of dietary culture with their glare. Now their legend revives, strong as ever...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdnSTDpAAHKFrznxfkiwPoTbD0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39267'),
  ('804479587340763473', 'Tacoma Narrows Bridge Collapse', 1940, 'Documentary', 'Barney Elliott, Harbine Monroe', null, 'Frederick Burt Farquharson', null, 'The collapse of the bridge was recorded on film by Barney Elliott, owner of a local camera shop. The film shows Leonard Coatsworth leaving the bridge after exiting his car. In 1998, The Tacoma Narrows Bridge Collapse was selected for preservation in the United States National Film Registry by the Library of Congress as being culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant. This footage is still shown to engineering, architecture, and physics students as a cautionary tale. Elliott''s original film of the construction and collapse of the bridge was shot at 16 frames a second, on 16mm Kodachrome film, but most copies in circulation are in black and white because newsreels of the day copied the film onto 35 mm black-and-white stock (not to mention, often showed the film at the wrong speed).', 'The collapse of the bridge was recorded on film by Barney Elliott, owner of a local camera shop. The film shows Leonard Coatsworth leaving the bridge after exiting his car. In 1998, The Tacoma Narrows Bridge Collapse was selected for preservation in the United States National Film Registry by the Library of Congress as being culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant. This footage is still shown to engineering, architecture, and physics students as a cautionary tale. Elliott''s original film of the construction and collapse of the bridge was shot at 16 frames a second, on 16mm Kodachrome film, but most copies in circulation are in black and white because newsreels of the day copied the film onto 35 mm black-and-white stock (not to mention, often showed the film at the wrong speed).', null, 'tmdb:movie:147016'),
  ('995271678929515115', 'Tacos al Carbon', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Alejandro Galindo, Fernando Colín', null, 'Vicente Fernández, Adalberto Martínez, Ana Martín, Sonia Amelio, Fernando Soto, David Silva, Nadia Milton, Hortensia Santoveña', null, 'Tacos al carbón is a mexican movie released on june 8th 1972 on Mexico City.', 'Tacos al carbón is a mexican movie released on june 8th 1972 on Mexico City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRkcSDJ093uZSPpMPLHBu5VDDRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282431'),
