  ('258355901212163252', 'Tactical Force', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Adamo P. Cultraro, Bruce Chun, Lauro David Chartrand-DelValle', 'Adamo P. Cultraro', 'Steve Austin, Michael Jai White, Michael Shanks, Lexa Doig, Darren Shahlavi, Steve Bacic, Adrian Holmes, Michael Eklund', 'R', 'A training exercise for the LAPD SWAT Team goes terribly wrong when they find themselves pitted against two rival gangs while trapped in an abandoned Hangar, armed with nothing but blanks.', 'A training exercise for the LAPD SWAT Team goes terribly wrong when they find themselves pitted against two rival gangs while trapped in an abandoned Hangar, armed with nothing but blanks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pDQqh3q1VNBFCs8eANeAxrn6nB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70008'),
  ('200963970597240221', 'Tad and The Emerald Tablet', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Enrique Gato', 'Manuel Burque, Josep Gatell', 'Óscar Barberán, Luis Posada, Michelle Jenner, Anuska Alborg, Alexandra Jiménez, Tito Valverde, Cecilia Suárez, José Corbacho', null, 'Tad accidentally unleashes an ancient spell, endangering the lives of his friends Mummy, Jeff, and Belzoni. With everyone against him and only helped by Sara, he sets off on an adventure to end the Curse of the Mummy.', 'Tad accidentally unleashes an ancient spell, endangering the lives of his friends Mummy, Jeff, and Belzoni. With everyone against him and only helped by Sara, he sets off on an adventure to end the Curse of the Mummy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvIVl8zdNSOAJImw1elQEzxStMN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676701'),
  ('254307116036492217', 'Tad Jones', 2004, 'Adventure, Animation', 'Enrique Gato', 'Enrique Gato, José Ángel Esteban, Carlos López', 'David García, Blanca Rada', null, 'Tadeo is a foolish and stubborn adventurer who explores an old pyramid and comes across a modern family of mummies.', 'Tadeo is a foolish and stubborn adventurer who explores an old pyramid and comes across a modern family of mummies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWx3h8Bt0QVa07d1GilLjuY39lu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156910'),
  ('56645023989225102', 'Tad Jones and the Basement of Doom', 2007, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Enrique Gato', 'Gorka Magallón, Enrique Gato, Javier López Barreira', 'Jordi Brau, Miguel Ángel Jenner', null, 'Tad, a foolish and stubborn adventurer, seeks for a disappeared cute dog and finds a mysterious basement where a terrible secret is hidden.', 'Tad, a foolish and stubborn adventurer, seeks for a disappeared cute dog and finds a mysterious basement where a terrible secret is hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHpQxOAGc3CV433AdUoyB7GhXnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205432'),
  ('176971654292862703', 'Tad, the Lost Explorer', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Enrique Gato', 'Jordi Gasull, Javier López Barreira, Gorka Magallón', 'Óscar Barberán, Michelle Jenner, José Mota, Pep Anton Muñoz, Miguel Ángel Jenner, Luis Posada, Meritxell Ané, José Corbacho', 'PG', 'Tad is a celebrity archaeologist and adventurer just like his hero Max Mordon... in his dreams! In reality, Tad is a Chicago construction worker. One day, however, he is mistaken for a real professor and takes his place on a flight to Peru in search of the lost city of Paititi.', 'Tad is a celebrity archaeologist and adventurer just like his hero Max Mordon... in his dreams! In reality, Tad is a Chicago construction worker. One day, however, he is mistaken for a real professor and takes his place on a flight to Peru in search of the lost city of Paititi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmysxjUJkYmp6CmjNOKOeHMOzFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121734'),
  ('659811163910780229', 'Tad, the Lost Explorer, and the Secret of King Midas', 2017, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Enrique Gato, David Alonso', 'Jordi Gasull, Javier López Barreira, Neil Landau', 'Óscar Barberán, Michelle Jenner, Adriana Ugarte, Luis Posada, Miguel Ángel Jenner, José Corbacho, Roser Batalla, Pau López', 'PG', 'Tad dreams of becoming an archaeologist traveling the world, uncovering hidden secrets and lost treasure, but his job working construction keeps him daydreaming instead of exploring. The chance of a lifetime comes when he is invited to attend archaeologist Sara Lavrof''s presentation of her latest discovery - the papyrus that proves the existence of the Necklace of Midas, the legendary King who turned everything he touched into solid gold.', 'Tad dreams of becoming an archaeologist traveling the world, uncovering hidden secrets and lost treasure, but his job working construction keeps him daydreaming instead of exploring. The chance of a lifetime comes when he is invited to attend archaeologist Sara Lavrof''s presentation of her latest discovery - the papyrus that proves the existence of the Necklace of Midas, the legendary King who turned everything he touched into solid gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WtFoWtGp45PLNmajM8iGtjAA7B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452773'),
  ('159502387650145420', 'Tada''s Do-It-All House', 2011, 'Drama', 'Tatsushi Ōmori, Ryo Otsuka, Katsumi Nojiri', 'Tatsushi Ōmori', 'Eita Nagayama, Ryuhei Matsuda, Anne Suzuki, Reiko Kataoka, Tasuku Emoto, Kengo Kora, Yuko Nakamura, Masaki Miura', null, 'In Mahoro, the fictional suburb of Tokyo, Tada works as a general problem solver for hire. One day, former classmate Gyoten appears unannounced. Both men are over 30 years old and divorced. With no explanation, Gyoten suddenly asks to spend the night at Tada''s home. Eventually, Tada accepts Gyoten as his assistant and together they become involved in various cases concerning an assortment of people from different walks of life.', 'In Mahoro, the fictional suburb of Tokyo, Tada works as a general problem solver for hire. One day, former classmate Gyoten appears unannounced. Both men are over 30 years old and divorced. With no explanation, Gyoten suddenly asks to spend the night at Tada''s home. Eventually, Tada accepts Gyoten as his assistant and together they become involved in various cases concerning an assortment of people from different walks of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZcGMy2Typl0omP6669yqOqGY38.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129237'),
  ('360363406787177117', 'Tadap', 2021, 'Action, Romance', 'Ragul Dharuman, Vikram Dahiya, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Rajat Arora, Muhammad Asif Ali', 'Ahan Shetty, Tara Sutaria, Saurabh Shukla, Kumud Mishra, Mangala Kenkre, Sumit Gulati, Saurav Chakrabarti, Rajesh Khera', null, 'Passionate Ishana falls madly in love with Ramisa. As their love grows stronger by the day, fate plays the villain and throws one hurdle after another.', 'Passionate Ishana falls madly in love with Ramisa. As their love grows stronger by the day, fate plays the villain and throws one hurdle after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nj0cMoZjLRrqN9SFW3wCXlSTYxd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669696'),
  ('814955544470273963', 'Tadpole', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gary Winick, Michael G. Johnson, Elaine Kavanagh', 'Heather McGowan, Niels Mueller', 'Aaron Stanford, Sigourney Weaver, John Ritter, Bebe Neuwirth, Robert Iler, Adam LeFevre, Peter Appel, Alicia Van Couvering', 'PG-13', 'Beautiful, sophisticated women are all over Oscar Grubman. He is sensitive and compassionate, speaks French fluently, is passionate about Voltaire, and thinks the feature that tells the most about a woman is her hands. On the train home from Chauncey Academy for the Thanksgiving weekend, Oscar confides in his best friend that he has plans for this vacation--he will win the heart of his true love. But there is one major problem--Oscar''s true love is his stepmother Eve.', 'Beautiful, sophisticated women are all over Oscar Grubman. He is sensitive and compassionate, speaks French fluently, is passionate about Voltaire, and thinks the feature that tells the most about a woman is her hands. On the train home from Chauncey Academy for the Thanksgiving weekend, Oscar confides in his best friend that he has plans for this vacation--he will win the heart of his true love. But there is one major problem--Oscar''s true love is his stepmother Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7wCSE5Hj82GHywm2evC1ERmK0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39141'),
  ('186795628284859949', 'Taekwondo', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Martín Farina, Marco Berger, Juan Tomás Fernández', 'Marco Berger', 'Gabriel Epstein, Lucas Papa, Francisco Bertín, Gaston Re, Juan Manuel Martino, Darío Miño, Nicolás Barsoff, Andrés Gavaldá', null, 'Fernando is on holiday with his closest male friends in a beautiful country house in a suburb of Buenos Aires. On their own without their girlfriends in a “men only” environment, the hunky young studs bask in the hot sun, play in the pool, smoke pot, and drink, most often semi-clad or naked. In this freewheeling and testosterone-infused environment, they talk of their desires and strengthen their individual bonds.', 'Fernando is on holiday with his closest male friends in a beautiful country house in a suburb of Buenos Aires. On their own without their girlfriends in a “men only” environment, the hunky young studs bask in the hot sun, play in the pool, smoke pot, and drink, most often semi-clad or naked. In this freewheeling and testosterone-infused environment, they talk of their desires and strengthen their individual bonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nc5dO2rWhUpmc8hdVaOmo4QGQCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413666'),
  ('749219767657510192', 'Taffin', 1988, 'Action, Thriller', 'Francis Megahy, Paul Beeson', 'David Ambrose', 'Pierce Brosnan, Ray McAnally, Alison Doody, Jeremy Child, Dearbhla Molloy, Jim Bartley, Alan Stanford, Gerard McSorley', 'R', 'When a small Irish town is terrorized by a corrupt business syndicate, a lone hero wages an all out war.', 'When a small Irish town is terrorized by a corrupt business syndicate, a lone hero wages an all out war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niIHSyg2Wgj3v4POepjtlMaWUtw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28975'),
  ('593839933815623656', 'Tag', 2015, 'Horror, Action', 'Sion Sono, Shinya Ayabe, Maki Ito', 'Sion Sono', 'Reina Triendl, Mariko Shinoda, Erina Mano, Yuki Sakurai, Aki Hiraoka, Ami Tomite, Sayaka Isoyama, Maryjun Takahashi', null, 'As the sole survivor of a horrendous and rather mysterious accident, teenage Mitsuko''s day is off to a bad start. An unstoppable force of nature, a doomed field trip, and a strange case of amnesia easily coexist in a bizarre parallel universe, where a desperate Mitsuko is always on the run from something inexplicable, intangible, and utterly deadly. However, amid piles of fresh corpses, mounds of scorching bullet shells, and rivulets of fragrant adolescent blood, Mitsuko must fight to stay alive, before her already messed-up day becomes even stranger. But one question still remains: who or what is the enemy?', 'As the sole survivor of a horrendous and rather mysterious accident, teenage Mitsuko''s day is off to a bad start. An unstoppable force of nature, a doomed field trip, and a strange case of amnesia easily coexist in a bizarre parallel universe, where a desperate Mitsuko is always on the run from something inexplicable, intangible, and utterly deadly. However, amid piles of fresh corpses, mounds of scorching bullet shells, and rivulets of fragrant adolescent blood, Mitsuko must fight to stay alive, before her already messed-up day becomes even stranger. But one question still remains: who or what is the enemy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xqQv9PoOIVX4nHlKVQELaAHyvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340176'),
  ('936360530054503314', 'Tag', 2018, 'Comedy, Action', 'Tara Feldstein Bennett, Jeff Tomsic, Larry Blanford', 'Rob McKittrick, Mark Steilen', 'Ed Helms, Jon Hamm, Jeremy Renner, Jake Johnson, Hannibal Buress, Annabelle Wallis, Isla Fisher, Rashida Jones', 'R', 'For one month every year, five highly competitive friends hit the ground running in a no-holds-barred game of tag they’ve been playing since the first grade. This year, the game coincides with the wedding of their only undefeated player, which should finally make him an easy target. But he knows they’re coming...and he’s ready.', 'For one month every year, five highly competitive friends hit the ground running in a no-holds-barred game of tag they’ve been playing since the first grade. This year, the game coincides with the wedding of their only undefeated player, which should finally make him an easy target. But he knows they’re coming...and he’s ready.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXXpuW2xaq5Aen9N5prFlARVIvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455980'),
  ('1007128100287739409', 'Tag: The Assassination Game', 1982, 'Thriller', 'Nick Castle, Willy Kurant', 'Nick Castle', 'Robert Carradine, Linda Hamilton, Kristine DeBell, Perry Lang, John Mengatti, Michael Winslow, Frazer Smith, Bruce Abbott', 'PG', 'Pretending to do research for his newspaper, college student Alex Marsh teams up with the somewhat older Susan Swayze, who he long admired from afar. Susan participates in The Assassination Game, in which every player tries to shoot another with a toy dart gun, until only one remains. While doing his best to win her over, and helping her finding her targets, Alex discovers that this year the Game may be more serious than most contenders realize...', 'Pretending to do research for his newspaper, college student Alex Marsh teams up with the somewhat older Susan Swayze, who he long admired from afar. Susan participates in The Assassination Game, in which every player tries to shoot another with a toy dart gun, until only one remains. While doing his best to win her over, and helping her finding her targets, Alex discovers that this year the Game may be more serious than most contenders realize...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iO835SEunKhxwtIHQYAkKXOuvQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48313'),
  ('63062015592292997', 'Taggart', 1965, 'Western', 'R.G. Springsteen, Carl Beringer, William Margulies', 'Robert Creighton Williams', 'Tony Young, Dan Duryea, Dick Foran, Elsa Cárdenas, Jean Hale, Emile Meyer, David Carradine, Peter Duryea', 'NR', 'Taggart''s family is slaughtered by a rival rancher. Taggart mortally wounds the rancher and kills his son. Before he dies the rancher hires three bounty hunters to avenge him with the promise of $5000 as a reward. Taggart must flee into Apache territory to escape the wrath of the trio of hired killers.', 'Taggart''s family is slaughtered by a rival rancher. Taggart mortally wounds the rancher and kills his son. Before he dies the rancher hires three bounty hunters to avenge him with the promise of $5000 as a reward. Taggart must flee into Apache territory to escape the wrath of the trio of hired killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTU9d2E3T94sxVkpzRagKct2PYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118259'),
  ('144454385590418289', 'Tähdet kertovat, komisario Palmu', 1962, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Matti Kassila, Esko Töyri', 'Kaarlo Nuorvala, Matti Kassila', 'Joel Rinne, Matti Ranin, Leo Jokela, Helge Herala, Esko Salminen, Aino Mantsas, Pentti Siimes, Pia Hattara', null, 'A man''s body is found on Tähtitorninmäki in Helsinki. Palmu starts to investigate the case, but the scandalous newspaper story causes problems for the police.', 'A man''s body is found on Tähtitorninmäki in Helsinki. Palmu starts to investigate the case, but the scandalous newspaper story causes problems for the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adMU4TzWWBlElOSwsBTPUlWUtC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144728'),
  ('992453739052780167', 'Tahong', 2024, 'Drama', 'Christopher Novabos, Alex Espartero, Roni S. Benaid', 'Maya Diaz, John Philip Doria, Melnar Arquillo', 'Candy Veloso, Marlon Marcia, Salome Salvi, Emil Sandoval, James Lomahan, Richard Flores, Mharissa Mandado, Mary Yonson Tucay', null, 'Mira, the daughter of a mussel farmer who needs to fight a reclamation project. She would do everything to save their livelihood even if it means sacrificing her innocence.', 'Mira, the daughter of a mussel farmer who needs to fight a reclamation project. She would do everything to save their livelihood even if it means sacrificing her innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvvb92EslVzouKKcw4xbUHN6vS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1337404'),
  ('372850422818921922', 'Tai Chi Hero', 2012, 'Action, Adventure', 'Stephen Fung, Du Jie, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', 'Zhang Jialu, Cheng Hsiao-Tse', 'Jayden Yuan, Yuan Wenkang, AngelaBaby, Shu Qi, Stephen Fung, Xiong Xinxin, Shen Si, Wei Ai-Xuan', 'NR', 'Chinese steampunk martial arts blockbuster about the early years of Tai chi master Yang Luchan, the man who founded in the 19th century what has now become the most popular Tai Chi style in the world. The second instalment of the "Tai Chi" trilogy continues the journey of Yang Luchan, a gifted child with a fleshy growth on his forehead who helped save a village from a frightening army of steampunk soldiers bearing strange machines with the knowledge of Tai Chi that they entrusted him with.', 'Chinese steampunk martial arts blockbuster about the early years of Tai chi master Yang Luchan, the man who founded in the 19th century what has now become the most popular Tai Chi style in the world. The second instalment of the "Tai Chi" trilogy continues the journey of Yang Luchan, a gifted child with a fleshy growth on his forehead who helped save a village from a frightening army of steampunk soldiers bearing strange machines with the knowledge of Tai Chi that they entrusted him with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9eIaUQY6NO3qP7wgTW8ORjaBMb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149085'),
  ('551844185123184632', 'Tai Chi II', 1996, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Cheung Sing-Yim, Chau Pak-Ling', 'Sze Yeung-Ping', 'Wu Jing, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Sibelle Hu Hui-Chung, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Lau Shun, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Yu Hai, Ji Chunhua', null, 'A young Tai Chi master fights Opium smugglers with the aid of his powerful braid while wooing a girl.', 'A young Tai Chi master fights Opium smugglers with the aid of his powerful braid while wooing a girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8q5i64zMjO2EmRRb6aKmLcwdXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62960'),
  ('597424985758422327', 'Tai Chi Zero', 2012, 'Action, Drama', 'Stephen Fung, Du Jie, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', 'Cheng Hsiao-Tse, Zhang Jialu', 'Jayden Yuan, Fung Hak-On, Stephen Fung, Shu Qi, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, AngelaBaby, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan', 'PG-13', 'In legendary Chen Village, everyone is a martial arts master, using their powerful Chen Style Tai Chi in all aspects of their lives. Lu Chan has arrived to train, but the villagers are forbidden to teach Chen Style to outsiders, and do their best to discourage him by challenging him to a series of fights. Everyone, from strong men to young children, defeats him using their Tai Chi moves. But when a man from the village''s past returns with a frightening steampowered machine and plans to build a railroad through the village at any costs, the villagers realize they may have no choice but to put their faith in Lu Chan... who has a secret power of his own.', 'In legendary Chen Village, everyone is a martial arts master, using their powerful Chen Style Tai Chi in all aspects of their lives. Lu Chan has arrived to train, but the villagers are forbidden to teach Chen Style to outsiders, and do their best to discourage him by challenging him to a series of fights. Everyone, from strong men to young children, defeats him using their Tai Chi moves. But when a man from the village''s past returns with a frightening steampowered machine and plans to build a railroad through the village at any costs, the villagers realize they may have no choice but to put their faith in Lu Chan... who has a secret power of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhAua7Q0VsdkEKkIK2PKPhszPTy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121823'),
  ('916017932109684701', 'Tai-Chi Master', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Tom Lau Moon-Tong', 'Kim Yip Kwong-Kim', 'Jet Li, Michelle Yeoh, Chin Siu-Ho, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying, Yu Hai, Yuen Cheung-Yan, Lau Shun, Chow Gam-Kong', 'R', 'Falsely accused for cheating in a martial arts competition, two boyhood friends are banished from their Shaolin Temple and go their separate ways. As adults, they join opposing sides in a civil war. When one betrays the other, they settle their differences mano-a-mano.', 'Falsely accused for cheating in a martial arts competition, two boyhood friends are banished from their Shaolin Temple and go their separate ways. As adults, they join opposing sides in a civil war. When one betrays the other, they settle their differences mano-a-mano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzodCpQ3xBaVuFLUl0w0iYp4V7G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11143'),
  ('918939812063346689', 'Tai-Pan', 1986, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Daryl Duke, Jack Cardiff, James Devis', 'Stanley Mann, John Briley', 'Bryan Brown, Kyra Sedgwick, Katy Behean, John Stanton, Janine Turner, Russell Wong, Joan Chen, Tim Guinee', 'R', 'The film begins following the British victory of the first Opium War and the seizure of Hong Kong. Although the island is largely uninhabited and the terrain unfriendly, it has a large port that both the British government and various trading companies believe will be useful for the import of merchandise to be traded on mainland China, a highly lucrative market.', 'The film begins following the British victory of the first Opium War and the seizure of Hong Kong. Although the island is largely uninhabited and the terrain unfriendly, it has a large port that both the British government and various trading companies believe will be useful for the import of merchandise to be traded on mainland China, a highly lucrative market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inAgrq4xzZeMUb2OMViLTtwGRho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29584'),
