  ('781777820243405543', 'Taimour & Shafi''aa', 2007, 'Action, Romance, Comedy', 'Sameh Selim, Khaled Marei', 'Tamer Habib', 'Ahmed Al Saqqa, Mona Zaki, Hala Fakher, Ragaa Al-Giddawy, Gamil Ratib, Mohamed El Sadaany, Mohamed Zaza, Boutros Ghaly', null, 'Taymour and Shafika have grown up together as next door neighbours and are deeply in love. However, their love is put to the test when he is assigned to protect her as her personal body guard when she is promoted to the level of Minister.', 'Taymour and Shafika have grown up together as next door neighbours and are deeply in love. However, their love is put to the test when he is assigned to protect her as her personal body guard when she is promoted to the level of Minister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQI4h7rxxlwpO3CsLCUPRKBdKBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469789'),
  ('140378440610506284', 'Tainá 2 - A New Amazon Adventure', 2004, 'Adventure, Family', 'Mauro Lima, Uli Burtin, Tomás Portella', 'Claudia Levay', 'Eunice Baía, Vítor Morosini, Arilene Rodrigues, Kadu Moliterno, Daniel Munduruku, Ruy Polanah, Chris Couto, Leandro Hassum', null, 'The young warrior indian Tainá must now battle against biopirates, and is joined by a new boy from the big city and an indian little girl who wants to follow her steps as a protector of the jungle.', 'The young warrior indian Tainá must now battle against biopirates, and is joined by a new boy from the big city and an indian little girl who wants to follow her steps as a protector of the jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIBdGH3AV2Hni30KWwuq76XN1ty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51186'),
  ('285756522939643575', 'Tainá: An Amazon Adventure', 2001, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Tania Lamarca, Sérgio Bloch, Marcelo Corpanni', 'Claudia Levay, Reinaldo Moraes', 'Eunice Baía, Caio Romei, Ruy Polanah, Jairo Mattos, Branca de Camargo, Betty Erthal, Luiz Carlos Tourinho, Alexandre Zacchia', null, 'A brave and bold indigenous girl, protector of her jungle and its wild life and guided by her shaman grandfather, pairs with a boy from the big city, against animal traffickers in the Amazon forest.', 'A brave and bold indigenous girl, protector of her jungle and its wild life and guided by her shaman grandfather, pairs with a boy from the big city, against animal traffickers in the Amazon forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eWXD2818d5VVHhayLIOvyTI9wy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294161'),
  ('154450299445675366', 'Tainted Love', 2023, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Wang Jiehong, Ma Yingxin', 'Ma Yingxin', 'Zhou Dongyu, Zhang Yu, Zhang Youhao, Li Meng, Cai Xiangyu, Jiang Qiming, A Mao, Dora Ng', null, 'Following a woman’s search for truth after being cheated in a romance scam.', 'Following a woman’s search for truth after being cheated in a romance scam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Gzi2aqgnSYIwasdIKoKfPCONM1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083792'),
  ('176440649232234142', 'Tainted Souls', 2017, 'Drama', 'Matteo Botrugno, Daniele Coluccini, Giuseppe Barletta', 'Matteo Botrugno, Daniele Coluccini, Nuccio Siano', 'Anna Foglietta, Vinicio Marchioni, Giulia Bevilacqua, Vincenzo Salemme, Maurizio Tesei, Daniele Parisi, Nuccio Siano, Carmen Giardina', null, 'The lives of the tenants of a lower-class apartment building in the outskirts intersect on a backdrop of crime, drug dealing, confused feelings and tainted relationships, in a lucid portrait of contemporary Rome. Marcello, a bisexual former body builder married with Chiara, has an affair with the bourgeois professor Walter; the ambitious Mauro and cold-blooded dealer and his wife Simona get involved in the ambiguous business of the local boss Carmine to move up to the elegant and cruel circles of central Rome that profit from the public funds for the disadvantaged; Valeria and her son Attilio, Flaminia and her violent husband Bruno face the daily difficulties of their troubled lives. The corrupted powers of urban speculation invade a suspended corner of the suburbs, contaminating the lives of a group of lost souls,revealing the desperate world of the slum and the pitiless scene of the city center as the hidden face of the same coin.', 'The lives of the tenants of a lower-class apartment building in the outskirts intersect on a backdrop of crime, drug dealing, confused feelings and tainted relationships, in a lucid portrait of contemporary Rome. Marcello, a bisexual former body builder married with Chiara, has an affair with the bourgeois professor Walter; the ambitious Mauro and cold-blooded dealer and his wife Simona get involved in the ambiguous business of the local boss Carmine to move up to the elegant and cruel circles of central Rome that profit from the public funds for the disadvantaged; Valeria and her son Attilio, Flaminia and her violent husband Bruno face the daily difficulties of their troubled lives. The corrupted powers of urban speculation invade a suspended corner of the suburbs, contaminating the lives of a group of lost souls,revealing the desperate world of the slum and the pitiless scene of the city center as the hidden face of the same coin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df384ZH7kOXjm3V6bladg8qjU1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474585'),
  ('161232442754204131', 'Taipei Exchanges', 2010, 'Drama', 'Hsiao Ya-chuan, Lin Tse-chung', 'Hsiao Ya-chuan', 'Gwei Lun-mei, Zaizai Lin, Chang Han, Yuli Ma, Atari Kousuke, Pa Yu, Kenny Chang, Yu-Wen Chang', null, 'Doris simply wanted to open a refined, stylish coffee shop in a bohemian Taipei neighborhood, but when she''s stuck with a load of useless gifts from the opening celebration, her younger sister Josie turns the café into a burgeoning bartering business. There, even a soulful song (by Japanese singer Atari Kosuke in a cameo) is a tradable commodity. One day, a traveler brings in 35 soaps from around the world with a story for each of them, awakening Doris'' imagination about the outside world that she has never seen.', 'Doris simply wanted to open a refined, stylish coffee shop in a bohemian Taipei neighborhood, but when she''s stuck with a load of useless gifts from the opening celebration, her younger sister Josie turns the café into a burgeoning bartering business. There, even a soulful song (by Japanese singer Atari Kosuke in a cameo) is a tradable commodity. One day, a traveler brings in 35 soaps from around the world with a story for each of them, awakening Doris'' imagination about the outside world that she has never seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7ZaIOsyArETXxFETYZhq8MyAyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42355'),
  ('531475238141908795', 'Taipei Story', 1985, 'Drama', 'Edward Yang, Yang Wei-han, Chen Hwai-En', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Chu Tien-Wen, Edward Yang', 'Tsai Chin, Hou Hsiao-hsien, Wu Nien-jen, Lin Hsiu-Ling, Su-Yun Ko, Ko I-chen, Mei Fang, Wu Ping-nan', null, 'A young woman urgently seeks to navigate the maze of contemporary Taipei and find a future. She hopes that her boyfriend Lung is the key to the future, but Lung is stuck in a past that combines baseball and traditional loyalty that leads him to squander his nest egg bailing her father out of financial trouble.', 'A young woman urgently seeks to navigate the maze of contemporary Taipei and find a future. She hopes that her boyfriend Lung is the key to the future, but Lung is stuck in a past that combines baseball and traditional loyalty that leads him to squander his nest egg bailing her father out of financial trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veJ93QUnTBX4WXk5qSl1s42Uosj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106380'),
  ('340458087967256030', 'Taipei Suicide Story', 2020, 'Drama', 'Kao Tzu-hao, KEFF', 'KEFF', 'Vivian Sung, Tender Huang, Tsai Ming-shiou, Pan Chin-yu, Li Chia-Chen, Snoopy Yu, Lu Mu-yao, Chung Yu-Lin', null, 'A receptionist at a suicide hotel in Taipei forms a fleeting friendship over the course of one night with a guest who can’t decide if she wants to live or die.', 'A receptionist at a suicide hotel in Taipei forms a fleeting friendship over the course of one night with a guest who can’t decide if she wants to live or die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkvrRLxq3wRZcjEaKzBoMnNRAqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741780'),
  ('407263241718104389', 'Taira Clan Saga', 1955, 'Drama, History', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Kōhei Sugiyama, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Masashige Narusawa, Yoshikata Yoda, Hisakazu Tsuji', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Yoshiko Kuga, Naritoshi Hayashi, Michiyo Kogure, Ichijirō Oya, Tatsuya Ishiguro, Akitake Kōno, Tamao Nakamura', null, 'Japan, 1137. The Taira family, a samurai clan, becomes involved in the disputes between Emperor Toba and the monks of Mount Hiei.', 'Japan, 1137. The Taira family, a samurai clan, becomes involved in the disputes between Emperor Toba and the monks of Mount Hiei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jT7srjv8OzZ1cBBUsE5EMCZttev.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45987'),
  ('240837071659511716', 'Taish', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Bejoy Nambiar, Ian van Temperley, Harshvir Oberai', 'Kartik R Iyer, Anjali Nair, Gunjit Chopra', 'Harshvardhan Rane, Jim Sarbh, Pulkit Samrat, Kriti Kharbanda, Sanjeeda Sheikh, Abhimanyu Singh, Saurabh Sachdeva, Zoa Morani', null, 'A revenge drama, which revolves around two families based out of London. One family which plans an elaborate countryside wedding and the other is a violent criminal family of moneylenders. Amidst a week-long function, both these worlds collide. A past secret sparks an incident of violence - in turn changing all their lives drastically.', 'A revenge drama, which revolves around two families based out of London. One family which plans an elaborate countryside wedding and the other is a violent criminal family of moneylenders. Amidst a week-long function, both these worlds collide. A past secret sparks an incident of violence - in turn changing all their lives drastically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6Ri4CZieXT2s1hJEfbxN1pk3Ve.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605456'),
  ('1112569678035375434', 'Taiwan Canasta', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Goran Marković', 'Goran Marković, Milan Nikolić', 'Boris Komnenić, Ivona Marinkov, Gordana Gadžić, Petar Božović, Neda Arnerić, Radko Polič, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Borivoje Todorović', null, 'A frustrated and unemployed architect experiences flashbacks of his youth and 1968 protests while the life passes by. Unable to adapt and to accept the reality, he’s constantly getting into conflicts with the people around him.', 'A frustrated and unemployed architect experiences flashbacks of his youth and 1968 protests while the life passes by. Unable to adapt and to accept the reality, he’s constantly getting into conflicts with the people around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ROsijmjpSruxd6qjLo7i4oNIAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261510'),
  ('858782973187729659', 'Taj Mahal', 2015, 'Thriller', 'Nicolas Saada, Léo Hinstin, François Mathon', 'Nicolas Saada', 'Stacy Martin, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Gina McKee, Alba Rohrwacher, Fred Epaud, Praveena Vivekananthan, Mohammad Mahadi, Mark Simpson', null, 'One evening, while her parents go out for dinner, 18-year-old Louise, alone in her hotel room at Taj Mahal Mumbai, hears strange noises out in the corridor. Within minutes, she realises that a terrorist attack is underway. Her only connection to the outside world is her cell phone, which allows her to maintain contact with her father, who is desperately trying to reach her from the other side of a city that has been plunged into chaos. Louise must spend a long night alone in the face of danger. She will never be the same again.', 'One evening, while her parents go out for dinner, 18-year-old Louise, alone in her hotel room at Taj Mahal Mumbai, hears strange noises out in the corridor. Within minutes, she realises that a terrorist attack is underway. Her only connection to the outside world is her cell phone, which allows her to maintain contact with her father, who is desperately trying to reach her from the other side of a city that has been plunged into chaos. Louise must spend a long night alone in the face of danger. She will never be the same again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mscbgXlFLm5NVRZywsdwxdSWkR1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358403'),
  ('808992595009797074', 'Tajomaru: Avenging Blade', 2009, 'Action, History, Drama', 'Hiroyuki Nakano, Takumi Furuya, Kôji Soejima', 'Mataichirô Yamamoto, Shin''ichi Ichikawa', 'Shun Oguri, Yuki Shibamoto, Kei Tanaka, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Hirotaro Honda, Kyosuke Yabe, Hiroki Matsukata, Yoshiyuki Yamaguchi', null, 'TAJOMARU is the famous ''bandit'' of the forest from RASHOMON. Whoever kills Tajomaru inherits his name, status and sword. A royal brother leaves his kingdom to protect the princess he loves, only to find a series of harrowing adventures along the way which lead him back to where he came from, and then disinheriting his past to become the bandit TAJOMARU.', 'TAJOMARU is the famous ''bandit'' of the forest from RASHOMON. Whoever kills Tajomaru inherits his name, status and sword. A royal brother leaves his kingdom to protect the princess he loves, only to find a series of harrowing adventures along the way which lead him back to where he came from, and then disinheriting his past to become the bandit TAJOMARU.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MaVf12PBdVBjT8lhCvaAVEjgRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48230'),
  ('479927419593756499', 'Takano Tofu', 2023, 'Family, Drama', 'Mitsuhiro Mihara, Shuichiro Suzuki', 'Mitsuhiro Mihara', 'Tatsuya Fuji, Kumiko Aso, Kumi Nakamura, Yuu Tokui, Masato Yamada, Jyo Hyuga, Miyako Takeuchi, Daikichi Sugawara', null, 'Tatsuo and his daughter Haru run Takano Tofu Store in Onomichi. They begin their work before dawn every day. They carefully select beans to make their tofu. While they have peaceful days, Tatsuo worries about his daughter being alone after his death.', 'Tatsuo and his daughter Haru run Takano Tofu Store in Onomichi. They begin their work before dawn every day. They carefully select beans to make their tofu. While they have peaceful days, Tatsuo worries about his daughter being alone after his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okYgaytwvw6iGGIoItUPupNUcvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1167490'),
  ('505901901514899915', 'Take', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Charles Oliver, Tristan Whitman, Roger Udwin', 'Charles Oliver', 'Minnie Driver, Jeremy Renner, Emily Harrison, Rocky Marquette, Paul Schackman, Veronica Lauren, Louis Mandylor, Allison Miller', null, 'The lives of two strangers - a struggling mother and a gambling addict - meet in tragedy. Years pass, and they must come to terms with themselves, and one another.', 'The lives of two strangers - a struggling mother and a gambling addict - meet in tragedy. Years pass, and they must come to terms with themselves, and one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHpPFevxOBi5Czwd1VN5AWQKh5q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13941'),
  ('1098094455819614835', 'Take a Chance on Me', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nina Boussad, Léa Géneau, Virginie Saint-Martin', 'Marion Michau, Jean-Pierre Améris', 'Louane, Michel Blanc, Victor Belmondo, Philippe Rebbot, Nathalie Richard, Alexandra Gentil, Ekaterina Rusnak, Ambre Munié', null, 'Marie-Line is juggling between odd jobs to support her agoraphobic father. Despite the precariousness of their lifestyle, she remains a lively and cheerful young woman. Yet, after a series of unfortunate events, she is fired from her job and sentenced by a judge to a small penalty. A few days later, this very judge will be in a position to help her get back on track – a chance for Marie-Line but also the beginning of an unlikely friendship.', 'Marie-Line is juggling between odd jobs to support her agoraphobic father. Despite the precariousness of their lifestyle, she remains a lively and cheerful young woman. Yet, after a series of unfortunate events, she is fired from her job and sentenced by a judge to a small penalty. A few days later, this very judge will be in a position to help her get back on track – a chance for Marie-Line but also the beginning of an unlikely friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pR0PaKMr1Lrp6hAdBXxDdNFrDwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995408'),
  ('534768721205054915', 'Take a Girl Like You', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Dick Bush, Jonathan Miller', 'George Melly', 'Hayley Mills, Oliver Reed, Noel Harrison, John Bird, Sheila Hancock, Geraldine Sherman, Ronald Lacey, Aimi MacDonald', null, 'Young Jenny heads to the South of England to start a new career as a school teacher. Even before she has had a chance to settle in she meets Patrick, one of the local "lads". Within a short time she has her hands full when a number of the local boys take a liking to her. But who will be the lucky one who wins her affections?', 'Young Jenny heads to the South of England to start a new career as a school teacher. Even before she has had a chance to settle in she meets Patrick, one of the local "lads". Within a short time she has her hands full when a number of the local boys take a liking to her. But who will be the lucky one who wins her affections?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWHyqsgeftJXSfZYH6MLygksLr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194817'),
  ('1144430237010602686', 'Take a Hard Ride', 1975, 'Action, Western', 'Antonio Margheriti, Riccardo Pallottini, José López Rodero', 'Jerrold L. Ludwig, Eric Bercovici', 'Jim Brown, Lee Van Cleef, Fred Williamson, Catherine Spaak, Jim Kelly, Barry Sullivan, Dana Andrews, Harry Carey, Jr.', 'PG', 'After his cattle rancher boss dies, right-hand man Pike is given the job of returning $86,000 to some families who live across the border in Sonora, Mexico. Honest Pike is joined on the trip through the wilderness by a dishonest gambler named Tyree.', 'After his cattle rancher boss dies, right-hand man Pike is given the job of returning $86,000 to some families who live across the border in Sonora, Mexico. Honest Pike is joined on the trip through the wilderness by a dishonest gambler named Tyree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exQBHadvEXRa3o3XOrfqmiS6faw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44697'),
