  ('744719467231072253', 'Take Back the Night', 2022, 'Horror', 'Gia Elliot, Justin Hogan', 'Emma Fitzpatrick, Gia Elliot', 'Emma Fitzpatrick, Jennifer Lafleur, Angela Gulner, Sibongile Mlambo, Corina Kinnear, Kati Sharp, Natalie D''Amico, Jess Varley', null, 'Finding herself the victim of a violent monster attack, Jane launches a vigilante campaign to hunt the beast that tried to kill her. Jane''s efforts intensify, but her troubling history of drug use and mental illness bubbles to the surface causing her family, community, and authorities to question the authenticity of her account. Suddenly alone in her fight, Jane starts to doubt her own memory of the attack...to doubt if Monster exists at all.', 'Finding herself the victim of a violent monster attack, Jane launches a vigilante campaign to hunt the beast that tried to kill her. Jane''s efforts intensify, but her troubling history of drug use and mental illness bubbles to the surface causing her family, community, and authorities to question the authenticity of her account. Suddenly alone in her fight, Jane starts to doubt her own memory of the attack...to doubt if Monster exists at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVSr0wEkrLNRx9PXz2PH4Ue5xWp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:861069'),
  ('689616653539385711', 'Take Care', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Giannis Daskalothanasis, Iraklis Mavroidis, Loukas Yannatos', 'Giorgos Tsemperopoulos, Vassilis Alexakis', 'Ketty Papanika, Alkis Kourkoulos, Vana Barba, Nikos Dimitratos, Tania Trypi, Kostas Koklas, Vaggelis Liodakis, Spyros Drosos', null, 'A young man just released from the army is making great dreams for his life. Finally he gets a job in a butcher''s shop and gains the confidence of the owner. After the butcher''s death he falls in love with his daughter but also has an affair with the widow and cannot decide between them', 'A young man just released from the army is making great dreams for his life. Finally he gets a job in a butcher''s shop and gains the confidence of the owner. After the butcher''s death he falls in love with his daughter but also has an affair with the widow and cannot decide between them', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nW1NTfX2dhi7wkdi1lC3IMLzEgQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267993'),
  ('1011856260317261980', 'Take Care', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Liz Tuccillo, Anne Etheridge, Forrest McClain', 'Liz Tuccillo', 'Leslie Bibb, Thomas Sadoski, Betty Gilpin, Michael Stahl-David, Nadia Dajani, Marin Ireland, Elizabeth Rodriguez, Tracee Chimo', 'PG-13', 'When a car crash leaves Frannie immobilized, she is brushed off by everyone she can count on. With nowhere else to turn and desperate for help, she turns to an unlikely source, her ex Devon.', 'When a car crash leaves Frannie immobilized, she is brushed off by everyone she can count on. With nowhere else to turn and desperate for help, she turns to an unlikely source, her ex Devon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZmsE2TY9IOZALFjG0wqGNnARWZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253283'),
