  ('485706898003063221', 'Take Me', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, Horror', 'Cha Chuen-Yee, Stephen Poon Tak-Yip, William Leung Chi-Ming', 'Rico Chung Kai-Cheong', 'Veronica Yip Yuk-Hing, Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Maria Tung Ling, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Charlie Cho Cha-Lee, Ridley Tsui Bo-Wah', null, 'Milk''s husband dies on their wedding night while having sex. He returns as a ghost as she attempts to get her life back on track whilst choosing between two new men in her life.', 'Milk''s husband dies on their wedding night while having sex. He returns as a ghost as she attempts to get her life back on track whilst choosing between two new men in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vClWyGaQmNMiBZ35h9IypVXJ7Qi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298200'),
  ('793108748056315809', 'Take Me', 2017, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Nathan M. Miller, Pat Healy, Drew Langer', 'Mike Makowsky', 'Taylor Schilling, Pat Healy, Alycia Delmore, Brooke Dillman, Jim O''Heir, Mark Kelly, Toby Huss, Alejandro Patiño', null, 'Ray is a fledgling entrepreneur who specializes in high-end simulated abductions. He jumps at the chance when a mysterious client contracts him for a weekend kidnapping with a handsome payday at the end. But the job isn''t all that it seems.', 'Ray is a fledgling entrepreneur who specializes in high-end simulated abductions. He jumps at the chance when a mysterious client contracts him for a weekend kidnapping with a handsome payday at the end. But the job isn''t all that it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fd3hbfrx2lUzQr5uOTI9Ej4lcx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426272'),
  ('303946559707932805', 'Take Me Back for Christmas', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Stephen Chandler Whitehead, Corey Sevier', 'Kate Pragnell', 'Vanessa Lengies, Corey Sevier, Brynn Godenir, Kimberly-Ann Truong, Miguel Rivas, Moni Ogunsuyi, Gerry Mendicino, Paula Boudreau', 'G', 'A Christmas wish gives Renee the successful life she’d always dreamed of. This new reality is perfect, except for one thing… she is no longer married to her husband Aaron. Now, Renee must race against the clock to win him back before Christmas Eve.', 'A Christmas wish gives Renee the successful life she’d always dreamed of. This new reality is perfect, except for one thing… she is no longer married to her husband Aaron. Now, Renee must race against the clock to win him back before Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNZUnfDR1ThpiE9F1jOG7paby16.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1135453'),
  ('661760970274572127', 'Take Me for a Ride', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Renata Duque Lasio, Manuel Bascoy, Micaela Rueda', 'Micaela Rueda, Juan José Vallejo', 'Samanta Caicedo, María Juliana Rángel, Diego Naranjo, Paty Loor, Monserrath Astudillo', null, 'Starting her senior year in high school, Sara doesn''t have many friends and is caught between an overbearing mother, and a more understanding father. With uneasiness at school and tension in the household, Sara escapes to smoke in a little alley alone – that is – until Andrea, a new classmate, arrives. A close friendship develops to all that can see, but behind closed doors, an intimate relationship unfolds, which, when discovered, throws everything into disarray.', 'Starting her senior year in high school, Sara doesn''t have many friends and is caught between an overbearing mother, and a more understanding father. With uneasiness at school and tension in the household, Sara escapes to smoke in a little alley alone – that is – until Andrea, a new classmate, arrives. A close friendship develops to all that can see, but behind closed doors, an intimate relationship unfolds, which, when discovered, throws everything into disarray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWdMsvHsUC5Ht7y1Oyt9VUUMAA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381094'),
  ('710423596866195797', 'Take Me High', 1973, 'Romance, Comedy', 'David Askey, Norman Warwick, Maude Spector', 'Christopher Penfold', 'Cliff Richard, Deborah Watling, Hugh Griffith, George Cole, Anthony Andrews, Richard Wattis, Madeline Smith', null, 'Tim (Cliff Richard) is a successful ambitious young financier working for a London Merchant bank, but even his happy-go-lucky attitude is severely jolted when he is sent to Birmingham instead of his promised New York for his posting! But comedy reigns when the enterprising bank manager helps an unsuccessful Birmingham restaurant compete with its rivals by introducing a new fast food - the Brumburger!', 'Tim (Cliff Richard) is a successful ambitious young financier working for a London Merchant bank, but even his happy-go-lucky attitude is severely jolted when he is sent to Birmingham instead of his promised New York for his posting! But comedy reigns when the enterprising bank manager helps an unsuccessful Birmingham restaurant compete with its rivals by introducing a new fast food - the Brumburger!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS6p5Xk2pU5rdS0Xw16XZ3I4nG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170137'),
  ('203249580640099640', 'Take Me Home', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Sam Jaeger, Abimbola Ogun, Anthony Ollman', 'Sam Jaeger', 'Amber Jaeger, Sam Jaeger, Bree Turner, Victor Garber, Cristine Rose, Lin Shaye, Brennan Elliott, Michelle Krusiec', 'PG-13', 'In New York City, Thom is broke and jobless, illegally working as a taxi driver. Claire is a successful business-woman, but personally she''s in shambles - then comes the phone call that her estranged father is in the hospital. Not knowing what to do, Claire hops in Thom''s cab and orders him to just drive and so he does. They find themselves in Pennsylvania and Claire makes the rash decision to drive across the country to California. On the road, there are many detours as the obstacles and secrets force them to learn about themselves and each other.', 'In New York City, Thom is broke and jobless, illegally working as a taxi driver. Claire is a successful business-woman, but personally she''s in shambles - then comes the phone call that her estranged father is in the hospital. Not knowing what to do, Claire hops in Thom''s cab and orders him to just drive and so he does. They find themselves in Pennsylvania and Claire makes the rash decision to drive across the country to California. On the road, there are many detours as the obstacles and secrets force them to learn about themselves and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kYbG53ka8Wc8tctkaBbzcRA5CB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85431'),
  ('441795107008488744', 'Take Me Home', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Pipat Jomkoh, Chinnapat Pothieng, Pramett Chankrasse', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri', 'Mario Maurer, Wannarot Sonthichai, Nopachai Jayanama, Duangjai Hiransri, Nabhada Sukhakrit, Grace Mahadumrongkul, Jongjet Vacharanan, Soontorn Meesri', null, 'After losing his memory from an accident, Tan tried to find his identity. Eventually, he found something and led him back to his home sweet home. The more he knows them, the more he learns to fear of their secrets of his so-called family.', 'After losing his memory from an accident, Tan tried to find his identity. Eventually, he found something and led him back to his home sweet home. The more he knows them, the more he learns to fear of their secrets of his so-called family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmKcGP0qaXD7Brt3QgZxSlzbMHA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431889'),
  ('294474312410839289', 'Take Me Home', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michel Tavarès, Karine Blanc, Romain Le Bonniec', 'Karine Blanc, Michel Tavarès', 'Clovis Cornillac, Eye Haïdara, Mehdi Senoussi, Laurence Côte, Jean-Pierre Martins, Sophie Guillemin, Shirel Nataf, Géraldine Salès', null, 'Paul Barral, mayor of a small mountain town at the foot of Mont-Blanc, is fighting to maintain business and protect the school from an announced closure. Not without determination, the Mayor may have found the solution.', 'Paul Barral, mayor of a small mountain town at the foot of Mont-Blanc, is fighting to maintain business and protect the school from an announced closure. Not without determination, the Mayor may have found the solution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txY9XpF14wVB97uaKvxK35qyCIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000088'),
  ('1089381256278908177', 'Take Me Home', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Liz Sargent, Minos Papas, Farhad Ahmed Dehlvi, Andrew Harrington, Tiffany Little Canfield, Keertana Sastry', 'Liz Sargent', 'Anna Sargent, Ali Ahn, Victor Slezak, Marceline Hugot, Shane Harper', null, 'Anna cares for her aging parents in a fragile balance of meeting one another''s needs. When a Florida heat wave shatters their family and Anna''s routine, her future is uncertain until she creates a world where she can thrive.', 'Anna cares for her aging parents in a fragile balance of meeting one another''s needs. When a Florida heat wave shatters their family and Anna''s routine, her future is uncertain until she creates a world where she can thrive.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjUniqOsIgXcCdgxUbBTKnkFGG9o.jpg', 'plex:movie:take-me-home-2026'),
  ('385640280043873858', 'Take Me Home Tonight', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Dowse, Jody Spilkoman, David M. Bernstein', 'Jeff Filgo, Jackie Filgo', 'Topher Grace, Anna Faris, Dan Fogler, Teresa Palmer, Michelle Trachtenberg, Michael Biehn, Chris Pratt, Jeanie Hackett', 'R', 'Recent MIT grad Matt Franklin should be well on his way to a successful career at a Fortune 500 company, but instead he rebels against maturity by taking a job at a video store. Matt rethinks his position when his unrequited high-school crush, Tori, walks in and invites him to an end-of-summer party. With the help of his twin sister and his best friend, Matt hatches a plan to change the course of his life.', 'Recent MIT grad Matt Franklin should be well on his way to a successful career at a Fortune 500 company, but instead he rebels against maturity by taking a job at a video store. Matt rethinks his position when his unrequited high-school crush, Tori, walks in and invites him to an end-of-summer party. With the help of his twin sister and his best friend, Matt hatches a plan to change the course of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nInduPOusI1alDIC0UttFjDIKsO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50725'),
  ('570437410726034036', 'Take Me Out to the Ball Game', 1949, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Busby Berkeley, Dolph Zimmer, Leslie H. Martinson', 'Harry Tugend, George Wells', 'Frank Sinatra, Esther Williams, Gene Kelly, Betty Garrett, Edward Arnold, Jules Munshin, Richard Lane, Tom Dugan', 'NR', 'The Wolves baseball team gets steamed when they find they''ve been inherited by one K.C. Higgins, a suspected "fathead" who intends to take an active interest in running the team. But K.C. turns outs to be a beautiful woman who really knows her baseball. Second baseman Dennis Ryan promptly falls in love. But his playboy roommate Eddie O''Brien has his own notions about how to treat the new lady owner and some unsavory gamblers have their own ideas about how to handle Eddie.', 'The Wolves baseball team gets steamed when they find they''ve been inherited by one K.C. Higgins, a suspected "fathead" who intends to take an active interest in running the team. But K.C. turns outs to be a beautiful woman who really knows her baseball. Second baseman Dennis Ryan promptly falls in love. But his playboy roommate Eddie O''Brien has his own notions about how to treat the new lady owner and some unsavory gamblers have their own ideas about how to handle Eddie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icP984Ob3Sa4hcA47a5KUEMqdfb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33738'),
  ('431047204271528752', 'Take Me to the Moon', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Chun-Yi Hsieh', null, 'Jasper Liu, Vivian Sung, Shih Chih-tian, Vera Yen, Yao Ai-ning', null, 'Zheng Xiang reunites with the members of his high school band and reminisces about their lead singer and his past love, En Pei, whose pursuit of her dreams ended in tragedy. He regrets encouraging her to join the pageant, wondering if she would have died if he hadn''t done so. Drunk after the memorial, he''s suddenly transported back to the past, where he sets out to stop En Pei from making the same mistake.', 'Zheng Xiang reunites with the members of his high school band and reminisces about their lead singer and his past love, En Pei, whose pursuit of her dreams ended in tragedy. He regrets encouraging her to join the pageant, wondering if she would have died if he hadn''t done so. Drunk after the memorial, he''s suddenly transported back to the past, where he sets out to stop En Pei from making the same mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdPqVOWplyMZrcfDf7ty7okOgeO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487734'),
  ('161759564944988372', 'Take Me to the River', 2015, 'Drama', 'Matt Sobel, Thomas Scott Stanton', 'Matt Sobel', 'Logan Miller, Robin Weigert, Josh Hamilton, Richard Schiff, Ursula Parker, Azura Skye, Ashley Gerasimovich, Elizabeth Franz', null, 'A naive California teen plans to remain above the fray at his Nebraskan family reunion, but a strange encounter places him at the center of a long-buried family secret.', 'A naive California teen plans to remain above the fray at his Nebraskan family reunion, but a strange encounter places him at the center of a long-buried family secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66bbjih3YVrHpGV537SCuU0xZvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309024'),
  ('451124512455637126', 'Take My Eyes', 2003, 'Romance, Drama', 'Icíar Bollaín, Carles Gusi', 'Alicia Luna', 'Laia Marull, Luis Tosar, Candela Peña, Rosa María Sardà, Kiti Mánver, Elisabet Gelabert, Nicolás Fernández Luna, David Mooney', null, 'One winter night, Pilar runs away from home. With her, she takes only a few belongings and her son, Juan. Antonio soon sets out to look for her. He says Pilar is his sunshine, and what''s more, "She gave him her eyes"...', 'One winter night, Pilar runs away from home. With her, she takes only a few belongings and her son, Juan. Antonio soon sets out to look for her. He says Pilar is his sunshine, and what''s more, "She gave him her eyes"...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2U9z48ULc5eQSlkERAaLjTZ276m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1418'),
  ('435494987067085613', 'Take Off', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Yong-hwa, Park Seong-jun, Lee Seok-hwan', 'Kim Yong-hwa', 'Ha Jung-woo, Sung Dong-il, Kim Ji-seok, Kim Dong-wook, Choi Jae-hwan, Lee Jae-eung, Lee Eun-sung, Hyun Jyu-ni', null, 'Cha Heon-tae, a Korean-American, was adopted with his sister to American parents. He appears on a Korean television program in search of his mother. Since Heon-tae is a trained alpine skier, he is approached by Coach Bang who wants to recruit members for a new national ski jumping team for the approaching 1998 Winter Olympics.', 'Cha Heon-tae, a Korean-American, was adopted with his sister to American parents. He appears on a Korean television program in search of his mother. Since Heon-tae is a trained alpine skier, he is approached by Coach Bang who wants to recruit members for a new national ski jumping team for the approaching 1998 Winter Olympics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wH4XJtvNPDzRdJjHV7s8pszuvRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37870'),
  ('816952686630855470', 'Take Off', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Mahesh Narayanan, Sanu John Varghese', 'Mahesh Narayanan, P. V. Shajikumar', 'Parvathy Thiruvothu, Kunchacko Boban, Fahadh Faasil, Prakash Belawadi, Asif Ali, Maala Parvathi, Joju George, Anjali Aneesh Upasana', null, 'A group of Malayali nurses stranded in Iraq, must survive their capture by the extremists and reach out to the rescue team headed by the Indian government.', 'A group of Malayali nurses stranded in Iraq, must survive their capture by the extremists and reach out to the rescue team headed by the Indian government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8Sp0gyC0dLdzrHoZ4Knh78p5GE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430521'),
  ('644414478592109394', 'Take Off', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Peng Fei, Lü Songye, Liu Qing', 'Peng Fei, Yizhou Xu, Gao Linyang, Lei Sheng, Sui He', 'Jiang Qiming, Li Xueqin, Dong Baoshi, Jiang Wu, Yang Le', null, 'In rural China, a determined factory worker pours his heart into building a homemade flying machine, while his devoted wife stands by his side through years of trials and aspirations.', 'In rural China, a determined factory worker pours his heart into building a homemade flying machine, while his devoted wife stands by his side through years of trials and aspirations.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4MCXfUEaIDLLZew1JQg817fqyb0.jpg', 'plex:movie:take-off-2026'),
  ('476139128123142850', 'Take One False Step', 1949, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Chester Erskine, Franz Planer, John Sherwood', 'Chester Erskine, Irwin Shaw', 'William Powell, Shelley Winters, Marsha Hunt, Dorothy Hart, James Gleason, Felix Bressart, Art Baker, Sheldon Leonard', 'NR', 'Catherine Sykes disappears after a midnight drive with Professor Andrew Gentling . When she''s presumed murdered, his friend Martha convinces him that he''s a prime suspect and should investigate before he''s arrested.', 'Catherine Sykes disappears after a midnight drive with Professor Andrew Gentling . When she''s presumed murdered, his friend Martha convinces him that he''s a prime suspect and should investigate before he''s arrested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54LjTCgvgZgibT8xZkAYeOqm0CC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30625'),
  ('467565804619283219', 'Take Out', 2008, 'Drama', 'Sean Baker, Tsou Shih-ching, Sean Baker', 'Tsou Shih-ching, Sean Baker', 'Charles Jang, Jeng-Hua Yu, Wang-Thye Lee, Justin Wan, Jeff Huang, Shih-Yun Tsou, Joe Chien, Waley Liu', 'R', 'An illegal Chinese immigrant falls behind on payments on an enormous smuggling debt. Ming Ding has only until the end of the day to come up with the money.', 'An illegal Chinese immigrant falls behind on payments on an enormous smuggling debt. Ming Ding has only until the end of the day to come up with the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBpAozLANehQQnvTPcCHcKQt2vP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37736'),
  ('922025089563462191', 'Take Point', 2018, 'Action, Thriller', 'Kim Byung-woo, Kim Byung-seo, Shin Kyung-man', 'Kim Byung-woo', 'Ha Jung-woo, Lee Sun-kyun, Jennifer Ehle, Kevin Durand, Kang Shin-chul, Spencer Daniels, Malik Yoba, Julian Juaquin', null, 'On the day of the U.S. presidential election in 2024, a team of elite mercenaries embark on a secret CIA mission to abduct North Korea''s politician in an underground bunker below the Korean Demilitarized Zone. However, they get caught in the crossfire which causes tensions to escalate to the brink of World War III.', 'On the day of the U.S. presidential election in 2024, a team of elite mercenaries embark on a secret CIA mission to abduct North Korea''s politician in an underground bunker below the Korean Demilitarized Zone. However, they get caught in the crossfire which causes tensions to escalate to the brink of World War III.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fl9VBbIGHUoBY6Ixzt9lEGjhxzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557972'),
  ('681671799025612695', 'Take Shelter', 2011, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Jeff Nichols, Adam Stone, Kenneth Neil Moore', 'Jeff Nichols', 'Michael Shannon, Jessica Chastain, Shea Whigham, Tova Stewart, Katy Mixon, Robert Longstreet, Ray McKinnon, Kathy Baker', 'R', 'Plagued by a series of apocalyptic visions, a young husband and father questions whether to shelter his family from a coming storm, or from himself.', 'Plagued by a series of apocalyptic visions, a young husband and father questions whether to shelter his family from a coming storm, or from himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dldIX0q5jewe8rSyCh8d5I1RYx3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64720'),
  ('510068156366049132', 'Take the 10', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Chester Tam, Ricardo Jacques Gale, Parker Tolifson', 'Chester Tam', 'Josh Peck, Tony Revolori, Stella Maeve, Andy Samberg, Kevin Corrigan, Fred Armisen, Cleopatra Coleman, Emily Kuroda', null, 'A day in the life of two best friends, a drug dealer, and a store manager collide at a hip-hop concert in the Inland Empire.', 'A day in the life of two best friends, a drug dealer, and a store manager collide at a hip-hop concert in the Inland Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxfCWWyvU1ZIOomTXFHMYrCS4fs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433245'),
  ('742385761190112806', 'Take the 5:10 to Dreamland', 1976, 'Documentary', 'Bruce Conner', 'Bruce Conner', null, null, 'Its slow somnambulic rhythm, its animalistic jungle sounds as well as the eerily mixed images create a dream mood that comes closest to my actual dreaming-feeling. The long black phases between the sequences are as important as the images themselves because they leave empty space where the "echo" of the last image can seep through without interfering with the following image. But our logical mind still somehow feels compelled to construe some kind of sense, parallel, or some erratic story out of it.', 'Its slow somnambulic rhythm, its animalistic jungle sounds as well as the eerily mixed images create a dream mood that comes closest to my actual dreaming-feeling. The long black phases between the sequences are as important as the images themselves because they leave empty space where the "echo" of the last image can seep through without interfering with the following image. But our logical mind still somehow feels compelled to construe some kind of sense, parallel, or some erratic story out of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnuPqaksNX6oaaRkqTW3Yf2DVwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130842'),
  ('842661504817165688', 'Take the Ball, Pass the Ball', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Duncan McMath', 'Graham Hunter', 'Pep Guardiola, Lionel Messi, Xavi, Andrés Iniesta, Gerard Piqué, Sergio Busquets, Carles Puyol, Thierry Henry', null, 'Take the Ball, Pass the Ball is the definitive story of the greatest football team ever assembled. For four explosive years, Pep Guardiola''s Barça produced the greatest football in history, seducing fans around the world. In this exclusive, first-hand account of events between 2008 and 2012, the players themselves reveal the tension of the bitter Guardiola-Mourinho rivalry, the emotion of Abidal''s fight back from cancer to lift the European Cup and how Messi, the best footballer the world''s ever seen, was almost rejected by Barça as a 13-year-old.', 'Take the Ball, Pass the Ball is the definitive story of the greatest football team ever assembled. For four explosive years, Pep Guardiola''s Barça produced the greatest football in history, seducing fans around the world. In this exclusive, first-hand account of events between 2008 and 2012, the players themselves reveal the tension of the bitter Guardiola-Mourinho rivalry, the emotion of Abidal''s fight back from cancer to lift the European Cup and how Messi, the best footballer the world''s ever seen, was almost rejected by Barça as a 13-year-old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncNuVIVSQqKJ3xDoMC3DxhElqgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555530'),
  ('325225610095124348', 'Take the High Ground!', 1953, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Richard Brooks, John Alton, Jerry Thorpe', 'Millard Kaufman', 'Richard Widmark, Karl Malden, Elaine Stewart, Carleton Carpenter, Russ Tamblyn, Jerome Courtland, Steve Forrest, Robert Arthur', null, 'Sgt. Thorne Ryan, who once fought bravely in Korea, now serves as a hard-nosed drill instructor to new Army recruits at Fort Bliss, Texas. But is he really the man he is often described as? His fellow instructor, and friend helps him to face the ghosts of his past experiences in Korea. One night in a bar across the border in Juarez, Mexico, Sgt. Ryan meets a lady who begins to turn his life around. Will this be enough to help him deal with the past? Or will he continue to be so hard on his troops?', 'Sgt. Thorne Ryan, who once fought bravely in Korea, now serves as a hard-nosed drill instructor to new Army recruits at Fort Bliss, Texas. But is he really the man he is often described as? His fellow instructor, and friend helps him to face the ghosts of his past experiences in Korea. One night in a bar across the border in Juarez, Mexico, Sgt. Ryan meets a lady who begins to turn his life around. Will this be enough to help him deal with the past? Or will he continue to be so hard on his troops?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71ZNVdhhvJaaxPxwwl4Xs5Ydrw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102091'),
  ('331159827805373973', 'Take the Lead', 2006, 'Drama, Music', 'Alex Nepomniaschy, Liz Friedlander', 'Dianne Houston', 'Antonio Banderas, Rob Brown, Yaya DaCosta, Alfre Woodard, John Ortiz, Laura Benanti, Katya Virshilas, Jenna Dewan', 'PG-13', 'A former professional dancer volunteers to teach dance in the New York public school system and, while his background first clashes with his students'' tastes, together they create a completely new style of dance. Based on the story of ballroom dancer, Pierre Dulane.', 'A former professional dancer volunteers to teach dance in the New York public school system and, while his background first clashes with his students'' tastes, together they create a completely new style of dance. Based on the story of ballroom dancer, Pierre Dulane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkGSs0eeOOISEe9jddBZnRSkn46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12763'),
  ('872052159530124484', 'Take the Money and Run', 1969, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Woody Allen, Lester Shorr, Louis A. Stroller', 'Woody Allen, Mickey Rose', 'Woody Allen, Janet Margolin, Marcel Hillaire, Jacquelyn Hyde, Lonny Chapman, Jan Merlin, James Anderson, Howard Storm', 'NR', 'Virgil Starkwell is intent on becoming a notorious bank robber. Unfortunately for Virgil and his not-so-budding career, he is completely incompetent.', 'Virgil Starkwell is intent on becoming a notorious bank robber. Unfortunately for Virgil and his not-so-budding career, he is completely incompetent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dT7cKFxsuHzSnDBxKeP5acoIpWZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11485'),
  ('523654985152378008', 'Take the Trash', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Rasmus Heide, Eric Kress, Jan Pallesen', 'Mick Øgendahl, Rasmus Heide', 'Thure Lindhardt, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Mick Øgendahl, Troels Lyby, Beate Bille, Helle Fagralid, Per Rosenberg, Maibritt Saerens', null, 'Jesper Jensen is a successful IT salesman who stops at nothing, even if it means backstabbing his best friend. Being number one in the company and having a beautiful wife and a lovely home, Jesper seems to lead a perfect life, but one day his arrogance and self confidence hits him in the face like a boomerang and he loses everything overnight. Jesper is sentenced to do community service at a recycling center with the odd and funny characters Dion, Theodor, and Lotte. At first he looks down on these people and doesn''t want to be associated with them. When he begins to loosen up, however, he discovers that he can learn a lot from their straight forward and honest approach to life.', 'Jesper Jensen is a successful IT salesman who stops at nothing, even if it means backstabbing his best friend. Being number one in the company and having a beautiful wife and a lovely home, Jesper seems to lead a perfect life, but one day his arrogance and self confidence hits him in the face like a boomerang and he loses everything overnight. Jesper is sentenced to do community service at a recycling center with the odd and funny characters Dion, Theodor, and Lotte. At first he looks down on these people and doesn''t want to be associated with them. When he begins to loosen up, however, he discovers that he can learn a lot from their straight forward and honest approach to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWStUAZoG3g4gAJIgxJCgUJgm9j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15149'),
  ('928107553283120760', 'Take This Job and Shove It', 1981, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gus Trikonis, James Devis, Craig R. Baxley', 'Barry Schneider', 'Barbara Hershey, Art Carney, Robert Hays, David Keith, Tim Thomerson, Martin Mull, Eddie Albert, Penelope Milford', 'PG', 'A junior executive is ordered to boost output in the hometown brewery where his old friends work.', 'A junior executive is ordered to boost output in the hometown brewery where his old friends work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAlLrcOr1ZSjXXIP1yY3FcXyLBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42371'),
  ('416294960002123262', 'Take This Waltz', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Sarah Polley, Luc Montpellier', 'Sarah Polley', 'Michelle Williams, Seth Rogen, Luke Kirby, Sarah Silverman, Jennifer Podemski, Diane D''Aquila, Vanessa Carter, Graham Abbey', 'R', 'Twenty-eight-year-old Margot is happily married to Lou, a good-natured cookbook author. But when Margot meets Daniel, a handsome artist who lives across the street, their mutual attraction is undeniable.', 'Twenty-eight-year-old Margot is happily married to Lou, a good-natured cookbook author. But when Margot meets Daniel, a handsome artist who lives across the street, their mutual attraction is undeniable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjE6XUPNNaG6VGPyq1SdCghoMos.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86555'),
  ('381081604695333277', 'Take Your Pills', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Alison Klayman, Julia Liu', null, 'Eben Britton, Dr. Wendy Brown, Ariana, Delaney, Jasper Holt-Teza, Leigh, Anjan Chatterjee, Alan Schwarz', 'PG-13', 'In a hypercompetitive world, drugs like Adderall offer students, athletes, coders and others a way to do more -- faster and better. But at what cost?', 'In a hypercompetitive world, drugs like Adderall offer students, athletes, coders and others a way to do more -- faster and better. But at what cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnYrGNcj1KKE8Vs4FjVvAafXceK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502166'),
