  ('704894651739677413', 'Take-Away Romance', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Amelle Chahbi', 'Noom Diawara, Alexandre Coquelle, Amelle Chahbi', 'Amelle Chahbi, Noom Diawara, Pablo Pauly, Aude Pépin, Sébastien Castro, Nader Boussandel, Marie-Julie Baup, François Godart', null, 'Amelle and Noom are two young thirties are total opposites and that fate will bring. Serious She manager at Starbucks, and dynamic IT dilettante, smart, and apprentice comic. Both victims disappointments in love, they swore that it does take longer. So how do when despite all these opposites attract? A game of seduction then sets up for our greatest happiness. But all is not so rosy, families, friends, colleagues get involved, wars are declared, quarrels explode. Caught between the roots of their education and the fire of their feelings, which side will they choose? The love he will triumph? One thing is sure, they will make us have a good loads of fun and excitement ...', 'Amelle and Noom are two young thirties are total opposites and that fate will bring. Serious She manager at Starbucks, and dynamic IT dilettante, smart, and apprentice comic. Both victims disappointments in love, they swore that it does take longer. So how do when despite all these opposites attract? A game of seduction then sets up for our greatest happiness. But all is not so rosy, families, friends, colleagues get involved, wars are declared, quarrels explode. Caught between the roots of their education and the fire of their feelings, which side will they choose? The love he will triumph? One thing is sure, they will make us have a good loads of fun and excitement ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruAkkXyXIwuMDZoslmEsK5E0nGP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277231'),
  ('347133823901708675', 'Takeaway', 2022, 'Drama', 'Renzo Carbonera, Luca Coassin', 'Renzo Carbonera', 'Carlotta Antonelli, Libero De Rienzo, Primo Reggiani, Paolo Calabresi, Anna Ferruzzo, Camillo Grassi, Camillo Ventola, Ivan Polidoro', null, 'A racewalking athlete Maria runs a petrol station with a takeaway shop in a desolate mountain village, she is almost 30 years old, she may have little chance to fulfill her lifelong dream of success but at what cost?', 'A racewalking athlete Maria runs a petrol station with a takeaway shop in a desolate mountain village, she is almost 30 years old, she may have little chance to fulfill her lifelong dream of success but at what cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfHTuCYMr2ph3vyFjo2YlqJgO4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:851721'),
  ('889492281005974633', 'Takedown', 2000, 'Thriller', 'Joe Chappelle, Dermott Downs', 'Leslie Newman, David Newman, John Danza', 'Skeet Ulrich, Angela Featherstone, Donal Logue, Russell Wong, Christopher McDonald, Tom Berenger, Jeremy Sisto, Amanda Peet', 'R', 'Kevin Mitnick is quite possibly the best hacker in the world. Hunting for more and more information, seeking more and more cyber-trophies every day, he constantly looks for bigger challenges. When he breaks into the computer of a security expert and an ex-hacker, he finds one - and much more than that...', 'Kevin Mitnick is quite possibly the best hacker in the world. Hunting for more and more information, seeking more and more cyber-trophies every day, he constantly looks for bigger challenges. When he breaks into the computer of a security expert and an ex-hacker, he finds one - and much more than that...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axBeZMzdFUEMu4j59JLUSV3Cf2A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10429'),
  ('144474992979982756', 'Taken', 2008, 'Action, Thriller', 'Pierre Morel, Michel Abramowicz, Mathilde Cavillan', 'Luc Besson, Robert Mark Kamen', 'Liam Neeson, Maggie Grace, Famke Janssen, Olivier Rabourdin, Leland Orser, Jon Gries, David Warshofsky, Holly Valance', 'PG-13', 'Bryan Mills, a former government operative, is trying to reconnect with his teenage daughter Kim. After reluctantly agreeing with his ex-wife to let Kim go to Paris on vacation with a friend, his worst nightmare comes true. While on the phone with his daughter shortly after she arrives in Paris, she and her friend are abducted by a gang of human traffickers. Working against the clock, Bryan relies on his extensive training and skills to track down the ruthless gang that abducted her and launch a one-man war to rescue his daughter.', 'Bryan Mills, a former government operative, is trying to reconnect with his teenage daughter Kim. After reluctantly agreeing with his ex-wife to let Kim go to Paris on vacation with a friend, his worst nightmare comes true. While on the phone with his daughter shortly after she arrives in Paris, she and her friend are abducted by a gang of human traffickers. Working against the clock, Bryan relies on his extensive training and skills to track down the ruthless gang that abducted her and launch a one-man war to rescue his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ognkaUSNgJe1a2pjB4UNdzEo5jT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8681'),
  ('806247531618645560', 'Taken 2', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Olivier Megaton, Romain Lacourbas, Richard Robinson', 'Robert Mark Kamen, Luc Besson', 'Liam Neeson, Maggie Grace, Famke Janssen, Leland Orser, D. B. Sweeney, Jon Gries, Rade Šerbedžija, Luke Grimes', 'PG-13', 'In Istanbul, retired CIA operative Bryan Mills and his wife are taken hostage by the father of a kidnapper Mills killed while rescuing his daughter.', 'In Istanbul, retired CIA operative Bryan Mills and his wife are taken hostage by the father of a kidnapper Mills killed while rescuing his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzAlcuJhpnxRPjaj7AHBRbNPQCJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82675'),
  ('634964683967470826', 'Taken 3', 2014, 'Thriller, Action', 'Olivier Megaton, Eric Kress, Dominique Moisan', 'Robert Mark Kamen, Luc Besson', 'Liam Neeson, Forest Whitaker, Maggie Grace, Dougray Scott, Famke Janssen, Sam Spruell, Don Harvey, Dylan Bruno', 'PG-13', 'Ex-government operative Bryan Mills finds his life is shattered when he''s falsely accused of a murder that hits close to home. As he''s pursued by a savvy police inspector, Mills employs his particular set of skills to track the real killer and exact his unique brand of justice.', 'Ex-government operative Bryan Mills finds his life is shattered when he''s falsely accused of a murder that hits close to home. As he''s pursued by a savvy police inspector, Mills employs his particular set of skills to track the real killer and exact his unique brand of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzvMXMypMq7ieDofKThsxjHj9hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260346'),
  ('1049225329464060142', 'Taken from Rio Bravo', 2024, 'Western, Action', 'Joe Cornet, Sam Wilkerson', 'Craig Hamann, Alexander Nevsky', 'Alexander Nevsky, Cynthia Rothrock, Matthias Hues, Don Wilson, Jon Mack, Art Camacho, Irina Antonenko, Robert Madrid', null, '1874, East Texas. Two friends pursue the Posse, a group of sadistic human traffickers who have kidnapped five women. Along with an Indian scout, they race against time to find and free the women before the traffickers sell them to sex-slave buyers at the Mexican border.', '1874, East Texas. Two friends pursue the Posse, a group of sadistic human traffickers who have kidnapped five women. Along with an Indian scout, they race against time to find and free the women before the traffickers sell them to sex-slave buyers at the Mexican border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sh4VsOuYnqhdz1ghPS8gVMpEaVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1249358'),
  ('598006493212778534', 'Taken in Broad Daylight', 2009, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Gary Yates, Brenton Spencer, Ronaldo Nacionales', 'Charlene Blaine, Kim Delgado', 'James Van Der Beek, Sara Canning, LeVar Burton, Diana Reis, Tom Anniko, Brian Roach, Sarah Constible, Alexandra Castillo', null, 'Every 24 hrs. after a child''s been kidnapped by a stranger, chances of finding them alive diminishes to almost 100% ... The true and inspiring survival story of kidnapped teen, Anne Sluti, and how she manages to stay alive by manipulating her captor, engineering her own rescue and negotiating her safe release after 6 days of hell.', 'Every 24 hrs. after a child''s been kidnapped by a stranger, chances of finding them alive diminishes to almost 100% ... The true and inspiring survival story of kidnapped teen, Anne Sluti, and how she manages to stay alive by manipulating her captor, engineering her own rescue and negotiating her safe release after 6 days of hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZdxdNJSh8qgqLz0TZoPcpG2YyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19560'),
  ('562755162315641558', 'Takeover', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Patrick-David Kaethner, Florian Ross', 'Tim Gondi', 'Heiko Lochmann, Roman Lochmann, Lisa-Marie Koroll, Luna Marie Maxeiner, Alexandra Neldel, Kai Wiesinger, Jürgen Heinrich, Thore Schölermann', null, 'Two teenagers, who look exactly the same, but never met before, are changing places during holidays in a theme park.', 'Two teenagers, who look exactly the same, but never met before, are changing places during holidays in a theme park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgkLPmPFJSqcrmg6NSdm76gqnnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:721077'),
  ('87643323535624908', 'Takers', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Luessenhop, Michael Barrett, Brian Relyea', 'Gabriel Casseus, John Luessenhop, Avery Duff', 'Matt Dillon, Paul Walker, Idris Elba, Hayden Christensen, Chris Brown, Jay Hernandez, Michael Ealy, Steve Harris', 'PG-13', 'A seasoned team of bank robbers, including Gordon Jennings, John Rahway, A.J., and brothers Jake and Jesse Attica successfully complete their latest heist and lead a life of luxury while planning their next job. When Ghost, a former member of their team, is released from prison he convinces the group to strike an armored car carrying $20 million. As the "Takers" carefully plot out their strategy and draw nearer to exacting the grand heist, a reckless police officer inches closer to apprehending the criminals.', 'A seasoned team of bank robbers, including Gordon Jennings, John Rahway, A.J., and brothers Jake and Jesse Attica successfully complete their latest heist and lead a life of luxury while planning their next job. When Ghost, a former member of their team, is released from prison he convinces the group to strike an armored car carrying $20 million. As the "Takers" carefully plot out their strategy and draw nearer to exacting the grand heist, a reckless police officer inches closer to apprehending the criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2zx7JA87rkQcmsV40k0vbVJ6oh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22907'),
  ('853504497743428523', 'Takeshi: Childhood Days', 1990, 'Drama', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Tatsuo Suzuki, Kozo Sudo', 'Taichi Yamada', 'Tetsuya Fujita, Yuji Horioka, Kazuyo Mita, Katsuhisa Yamazaki, Noritake Kobinata, Atsuko Koyama, Shima Iwashita, Toshiyuki Hosokawa', null, 'A story of childhood life during wartime Japan. Takeshi, the intelligent son of a fisherman, is the schoolyard bully. When his cousin comes to stay with his family to avoid bombing raids, Takeshi at first treats him well, then begins bullying him too. Takeshi eventually loses his position of leadership.', 'A story of childhood life during wartime Japan. Takeshi, the intelligent son of a fisherman, is the schoolyard bully. When his cousin comes to stay with his family to avoid bombing raids, Takeshi at first treats him well, then begins bullying him too. Takeshi eventually loses his position of leadership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCQ6LAPKxjnjKtGQ7zCuCu2zGuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83419'),
  ('1134360035706355439', 'Takeshis''', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Takeshi Kitano, Kotomi Kyono, Kayoko Kishimoto, Ren Osugi, Susumu Terajima, Tetsu Watanabe, Akihiro Miwa, Naomasa Musaka', null, 'Beat Takeshi lives the busy and sometimes surreal life of a showbiz celebrity. One day he meets his blond lookalike named Kitano, a shy convenience store cashier, who, still an unknown actor, is waiting for his big break. After their paths cross, Kitano seems to begin hallucinating about becoming Beat.', 'Beat Takeshi lives the busy and sometimes surreal life of a showbiz celebrity. One day he meets his blond lookalike named Kitano, a shy convenience store cashier, who, still an unknown actor, is waiting for his big break. After their paths cross, Kitano seems to begin hallucinating about becoming Beat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e14XCjaYzzkaVcuM3hZn5UZRYbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20347'),
  ('524610966223127233', 'Takin'' It All Off', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Ed Hansen', 'Ed Hansen, George Buck Flower', 'Candie Evans, Kitten Natividad, John Alderman, Gail Harris, Becky LeBeau, John F. Goff, George Buck Flower, Diane Pedersen', 'R', 'A school for strippers is in trouble. They audition for the owner, and he''s pleased, except that the new girl can''t make herself take her clothes off. After hypnosis, she''s ready, willing, and able, but always strips when she hears music, and threatens the future of the strip school.', 'A school for strippers is in trouble. They audition for the owner, and he''s pleased, except that the new girl can''t make herself take her clothes off. After hypnosis, she''s ready, willing, and able, but always strips when she hears music, and threatens the future of the strip school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEVZE9EWuKjqnci5kXiyRUV2Wlu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77967'),
  ('614971276018977971', 'Taking 5', 2007, 'Comedy, Family', 'Andrew Waller, Gonzalo Amat', 'Shauna Cross', 'Alona Tal, Daniella Monet, Christy Carlson Romano, Bart Johnson, Marcus T. Paulk, Eric Dill, Joey Zehr, Ben Romans', 'PG', 'Just when BFFs Gabby and Devon have a chance to get the hottest band to perform a free concert at Highland High, their plan goes up in smoke... literally. Desperate not to be labeled losers for life they resort to plan B: kidnap the band! Now it''s limos, hot jams and a shot at love with 5 Leo Rise (played by pop smash, The Click Five). But when the girls discover a secret about the band things hit a sour note. Will 5 Leo Rise to the occasion and play at their homecoming or will Gabby and Devon be stuck in social Siberia forever?', 'Just when BFFs Gabby and Devon have a chance to get the hottest band to perform a free concert at Highland High, their plan goes up in smoke... literally. Desperate not to be labeled losers for life they resort to plan B: kidnap the band! Now it''s limos, hot jams and a shot at love with 5 Leo Rise (played by pop smash, The Click Five). But when the girls discover a secret about the band things hit a sour note. Will 5 Leo Rise to the occasion and play at their homecoming or will Gabby and Devon be stuck in social Siberia forever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNd2bGbhkaDyEE1LFsT1iUW88vO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37685'),
  ('776399592873313218', 'Taking a Shot at Love', 2021, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Kevin Fair, Shawn Seifert', 'Laura Grant, Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Alexa PenaVega, Luke Macfarlane, Nolen Dubuc, Andrew Dunbar, Heather-Claire Nortey, Kurt Long, Kristina Lao, Nelson Giles', 'G', 'Former professional ballet dancer Jenna works with NHL star Ryan Cooper to help him recover from an injury using ballet as therapy, and as they grow close, he helps her mend her injured heart. But when it’s time for Ryan to return to the ice and leave Jenna and her small, Connecticut town, they both must consider the paths they want to take and just maybe, love will find its way.', 'Former professional ballet dancer Jenna works with NHL star Ryan Cooper to help him recover from an injury using ballet as therapy, and as they grow close, he helps her mend her injured heart. But when it’s time for Ryan to return to the ice and leave Jenna and her small, Connecticut town, they both must consider the paths they want to take and just maybe, love will find its way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wperP8EmDlClErBF8zEdmMGNqKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:775209'),
  ('421606743080152489', 'Taking Care of Business', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Arthur Hiller, David M. Walsh', 'J.J. Abrams, Jill Mazursky', 'Jim Belushi, Charles Grodin, Anne DeSalvo, Loryn Locklin, Stephen Elliott, Héctor Elizondo, Veronica Hamel, Mako', 'R', 'An uptight advertising exec has his entire life in a filofax organizer which mistakenly ends up in the hands of a friendly convict who poses as him.', 'An uptight advertising exec has his entire life in a filofax organizer which mistakenly ends up in the hands of a friendly convict who poses as him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3yEyOqJ5e3vAjK70qTnBMnmgYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6393'),
  ('775555130080584908', 'Taking Chance', 2009, 'Drama, War, TV Movie', 'Alar Kivilo, Ross Katz', 'Michael Strobl, Ross Katz', 'Kevin Bacon, Tom Aldredge, Nicholas Art, Blanche Baker, Guy Boyd, Gordon Clapp, Emily Wickersham, Mike Colter', 'NR', 'Lt. Col. Michael Strobl, a volunteer military escort accompanies the body of Lance Cpl. Chance Phelps to his hometown in Wyoming.', 'Lt. Col. Michael Strobl, a volunteer military escort accompanies the body of Lance Cpl. Chance Phelps to his hometown in Wyoming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gPpwshMJHiaIcbL2K234zPGvK1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25405'),
  ('893704887961929446', 'Taking Chances', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Talmage Cooley, Steve Gainer', 'Annie Nocenti', 'Justin Long, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Rob Corddry, Keir O''Donnell, Missi Pyle, David Jensen, Jimmi Simpson, Nick Offerman', null, 'When he discovers that an Indian casino is about to be built over the town''s historic battlefield, Chase Revere, the self-appointed protector of a small town''s rather meager place in American history, joins forces with sexy but dangerous town siren Lucy Shanks to launch an all-out offensive against the project - earning the wrath of the entire town.', 'When he discovers that an Indian casino is about to be built over the town''s historic battlefield, Chase Revere, the self-appointed protector of a small town''s rather meager place in American history, joins forces with sexy but dangerous town siren Lucy Shanks to launch an all-out offensive against the project - earning the wrath of the entire town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNyahBbrFSD0cwky3keePg5O6bu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25451'),
  ('69402429142729096', 'Taking Lives', 2004, 'Thriller', 'D.J. Caruso, Amir Mokri, Albert Cho', 'Jon Bokenkamp', 'Angelina Jolie, Ethan Hawke, Kiefer Sutherland, Gena Rowlands, Olivier Martinez, Tchéky Karyo, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Paul Dano', 'R', 'Recruited to assist Montreal police in their desperate search for a serial killer who assumes the identities of his victims, FBI profiler Illeana Scott knows it''s only a matter of time before the killer strikes again. Her most promising lead is a museum employee who might be the killer''s only eyewitness.', 'Recruited to assist Montreal police in their desperate search for a serial killer who assumes the identities of his victims, FBI profiler Illeana Scott knows it''s only a matter of time before the killer strikes again. Her most promising lead is a museum employee who might be the killer''s only eyewitness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JEt0qtEaYrJZuPeTArR691V256.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11081'),
  ('964869087721087763', 'Taking Off', 1971, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Miloš Forman, Miroslav Ondříček, Edward Folger', 'Miloš Forman, John Guare, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Lynn Carlin, Buck Henry, Georgia Engel, Tony Harvey, Audra Lindley, Paul Benedict, Vincent Schiavelli, David Gittler', 'R', 'Unable to deal with her parents, Jeannie Tyne runs away from home. Larry and Lynn Tyne search for her, and in the process meet other people whose children ran away. With their children gone, the parents are now free to rediscover/enjoy life.', 'Unable to deal with her parents, Jeannie Tyne runs away from home. Larry and Lynn Tyne search for her, and in the process meet other people whose children ran away. With their children gone, the parents are now free to rediscover/enjoy life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UXNQy39AqER8Y5LjuZcA1pliwq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59881'),
  ('892043032559942344', 'Taking Off', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Nicolas Mercier, Rémy Chevrin', 'Nicolas Mercier, Simone Study', 'Pio Marmaï, Jérémie Elkaïm, Eddy Mitchell, Chantal Lauby, Charlotte de Turckheim, Zoé Félix, Timothée De Roux, Benjamin Rolland', null, 'Romain, a handsome young man in his thirties, only thinks about his work and never reveals his emotions. He can''t manage to "flirt" with girls. His older brother Luc, who has become a screenwriter, is homosexual and never stops putting his brother down. However, the two brothers get along better than they seem to. Their father has a neurodegenerative disease and must be placed in a specialized institution. This ordeal will allow Romain to better understand himself as a man.', 'Romain, a handsome young man in his thirties, only thinks about his work and never reveals his emotions. He can''t manage to "flirt" with girls. His older brother Luc, who has become a screenwriter, is homosexual and never stops putting his brother down. However, the two brothers get along better than they seem to. Their father has a neurodegenerative disease and must be placed in a specialized institution. This ordeal will allow Romain to better understand himself as a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIYtTVepD4kP6SccH19QPqVB7XR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204681'),
  ('842888926910329188', 'Taking Sides', 2002, 'Drama, War, Music', 'István Szabó, Anja Müller, Lajos Koltai', 'Ronald Harwood', 'Harvey Keitel, Stellan Skarsgård, Moritz Bleibtreu, R. Lee Ermey, Birgit Minichmayr, Ulrich Tukur, Oleg Tabakov, Hanns Zischler', null, 'One of the most spectacular and renowned conductors of the 1930s, Wilhelm Furtwangler''s reputation rivaled that of Toscanini''s. After the war, he was investigated as part of the Allies'' de-Nazification programme. In the bombed-out Berlin of the immediate post-war period, the Allies slowly bring law and order to bear on an occupied Germany. An American major is given the Furtwangler file, and is told to find everything he can and to prosecute the man ruthlessly. Tough and hard-nosed, Major Steve Arnold sets out to investigate a world of which he knows nothing.', 'One of the most spectacular and renowned conductors of the 1930s, Wilhelm Furtwangler''s reputation rivaled that of Toscanini''s. After the war, he was investigated as part of the Allies'' de-Nazification programme. In the bombed-out Berlin of the immediate post-war period, the Allies slowly bring law and order to bear on an occupied Germany. An American major is given the Furtwangler file, and is told to find everything he can and to prosecute the man ruthlessly. Tough and hard-nosed, Major Steve Arnold sets out to investigate a world of which he knows nothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRkyqGbJC7omaeKgMid8LQcKsLt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31094'),
  ('759246813287882337', 'Taking the Plunge', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Frédérik D''Amours', 'Caroline Héroux, Martine Pagé', 'Mélissa Désormeaux-Poulin, Jason Roy-Léveillée, Mariloup Wolfe, Alexandre Despatie, Sylvie Moreau, Guy Jodoin, Catherine de Léan, Alyssa Labelle', 'G', 'After 5 years, 16-year-old Gaby Roberge, returned to Sainte-Victoire High School with a rebellious air and a dirty attitude. Gaby can''t stop thinking about graduating and moving on to CÉGEP where she will meet more intelligent young people. Peggy Lamothe, the school principal, decided to take Gaby under her wing so she could take advantage of her last year in college. She forces Gaby to integrate with the young people in her life and be less aggressive and more social.', 'After 5 years, 16-year-old Gaby Roberge, returned to Sainte-Victoire High School with a rebellious air and a dirty attitude. Gaby can''t stop thinking about graduating and moving on to CÉGEP where she will meet more intelligent young people. Peggy Lamothe, the school principal, decided to take Gaby under her wing so she could take advantage of her last year in college. She forces Gaby to integrate with the young people in her life and be less aggressive and more social.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yz0BNn46EwW6bmWsnrnxu2cEWe3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86216'),
  ('818898964427322618', 'Taking the Reins', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Clare Niederpruem, Branden James Maxham, David Eric Chapman', 'Alex Wright, Ron Oliver', 'Nikki DeLoach, Scott Porter, Corbin Bernsen, Janine Turner, Fredric Odgaard, Damien Jimenez, Jeorge Bennett Watson, Eliza Hayes Maher', 'G', 'A writer goes back to the family ranch to write an article about her passion for horses and discovers what ended her marriage and why she stopped riding horses.', 'A writer goes back to the family ranch to write an article about her passion for horses and discovers what ended her marriage and why she stopped riding horses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQA4Snh9ZPB2Rhzcu9ojVMR71Bd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858910'),
  ('302419865392280445', 'Taking Woodstock', 2009, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Ang Lee, Éric Gautier', 'James Schamus', 'Demetri Martin, Imelda Staunton, Henry Goodman, Jonathan Groff, Eugene Levy, Emile Hirsch, Dan Fogler, Liev Schreiber', 'R', 'The story of Elliot Tiber and his family, who inadvertently played a pivotal role in making the famed Woodstock Music and Arts Festival into the happening that it was. When Elliot hears that a neighboring town has pulled the permit on a hippie music festival, he calls the producers thinking he could drum up some much-needed business for his parents'' run-down motel. Three weeks later, half a million people are on their way to his neighbor’s farm in White Lake, New York, and Elliot finds himself swept up in a generation-defining experience that would change his life–and American culture–forever.', 'The story of Elliot Tiber and his family, who inadvertently played a pivotal role in making the famed Woodstock Music and Arts Festival into the happening that it was. When Elliot hears that a neighboring town has pulled the permit on a hippie music festival, he calls the producers thinking he could drum up some much-needed business for his parents'' run-down motel. Three weeks later, half a million people are on their way to his neighbor’s farm in White Lake, New York, and Elliot finds himself swept up in a generation-defining experience that would change his life–and American culture–forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIdyAJCvIj3QUoNmmDdnhXpCMpp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26320'),
  ('439604621811203897', 'Takıntılar', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Yunus Nihat Özcan, Aydın Sarıoğlu', 'Laurent Baffie', 'Seda Bakan, Ecem Erkek, Sarp Akkaya, Bora Akkaş, Çiçek Dilligil, Özge Özberk, Zafer Algöz, Dost Elver', null, 'The film, adapted from French writer Laurent Baffie’s play “Toc Toc,” revolves around the adventures of six individuals with obsessive-compulsive disorder (OCD) whose appointments with renowned psychiatrist Orhan Kerim Baykal overlap, only to find that the doctor is nowhere to be found.', 'The film, adapted from French writer Laurent Baffie’s play “Toc Toc,” revolves around the adventures of six individuals with obsessive-compulsive disorder (OCD) whose appointments with renowned psychiatrist Orhan Kerim Baykal overlap, only to find that the doctor is nowhere to be found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMZGiMBsNx50a94ioI09nhnrBYf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1285495'),
  ('723952196174631285', 'Taklee Genesis', 2024, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action, Mystery', 'Chookiat Sakveerakul, Chookiat Narongrit, Kotchakorn Ratananukul', 'Sorawit Meungkeaw, Thanamat Talerngsuk, Chookiat Sakveerakul', 'Paula Taylor, Peter Corp Dyrendal, Wanarat Ratsameerat, Nutthacha Padovan, Phutharit Prombandal, Noutnapha Soydara, Intira Jaroenpura, Pasakorn Saisombut', null, 'A time-travel adventure that takes place during the Cold War when a US military base in Thailand was testing the Taklee Genesis, a warp-speed teleporter even though it had not yet been fully developed. After the war, the Taklee Genesis was left behind in Thailand and was being illegally used by someone.', 'A time-travel adventure that takes place during the Cold War when a US military base in Thailand was testing the Taklee Genesis, a warp-speed teleporter even though it had not yet been fully developed. After the war, the Taklee Genesis was left behind in Thailand and was being illegally used by someone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUAjLT1ODkMnLR2z7KZHsErfnA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1086495'),
  ('779257936623631727', 'Taksim Hold''em', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Onder', null, 'Kenan Ece, Damla Sönmez, Nezih Cihan Aksoy, Emre Yetim, Ahmet Tansu Taşanlar, Ege Kökenli, Berk Hakman, Irmak Ecem Aydemir', null, 'On a Saturday night in Istanbul, despite the pleas of his fiancée, cynical Alper refuses to join the anti-government protests happening on his doorstep. He just wants to stay home for his weekly dose of poker, played with his regular crew of high-school friends. Alper''s game is threatened as his friends set off on a series of passionate, and at times ill-thought-out, squabbles on whether they should join the demonstrations or not.', 'On a Saturday night in Istanbul, despite the pleas of his fiancée, cynical Alper refuses to join the anti-government protests happening on his doorstep. He just wants to stay home for his weekly dose of poker, played with his regular crew of high-school friends. Alper''s game is threatened as his friends set off on a series of passionate, and at times ill-thought-out, squabbles on whether they should join the demonstrations or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HSHULCtLFOu5alO1mVclkLcTTl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517112'),
  ('254039843429069406', 'Taksu', 2014, 'Drama', 'Kiki Sugino', 'Kotaro Wajima', 'Yoko Mitsuya, Takumi Saitoh, Kiki Sugino, Hayate Matsuzaki, Cornelio Sunny, Hiroyuki Takashima, Tom Mes', null, 'Chihiro is depressed and obsessed with his own mortality. Him and his wife, Yuri (Yoko Mitsuya), decide to take a trip to Bali, Indonesia to see his pregnant sister, Kumi (Kiki Sugino). They hope the trip can bring about change.', 'Chihiro is depressed and obsessed with his own mortality. Him and his wife, Yuri (Yoko Mitsuya), decide to take a trip to Bali, Indonesia to see his pregnant sister, Kumi (Kiki Sugino). They hope the trip can bring about change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0tFUHAf0HoTorjtE8YklhHbtqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345169'),
  ('422525125868692958', 'Takumi-kun Series: And the Spring Breeze Whispers', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yokoyama Kazuhiro, Atsuhiro Nabeshima', 'Hiroko Kanasugi', 'Yanagishita Tomo, Keisuke Kato, Saito Yasuka, Yukihiro Takiguchi, Tetsuya Makita, Wataru Hatano, Sakaguchi Ryo, Hiroki Aiba', 'NR', 'A 2nd year student is assigned a handsome new roommate at the start of the school year.', 'A 2nd year student is assigned a handsome new roommate at the start of the school year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6wJxETFJF8qFxPYKkxkL2jwCn9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276032'),
  ('971949696116919879', 'Takumi-kun Series: Pure', 2010, 'Drama', 'Takeshi Yokoi, Satoshi Shimomoto', 'Hiroko Kanasugi', 'Ryoma Baba, Naito Taiki, Ryō Mitsuya, Yutaka Kobayashi, Kyosuke Hamao, Daisuke Watanabe, Yusuke Hirose, Yukihiro Takiguchi', 'NR', 'Unlike the three previous films, Pure focuses on the relationship between Misu Arata and Shingyouji Kanemitsu , which begins when Shingyouji takes the test to enter Shidou Gakuen . That''s when he meets Misu and falls for him. Then we come back to the present where the sempai who admires Misu appears, bringing Shingyouji problems and jealousy.', 'Unlike the three previous films, Pure focuses on the relationship between Misu Arata and Shingyouji Kanemitsu , which begins when Shingyouji takes the test to enter Shidou Gakuen . That''s when he meets Misu and falls for him. Then we come back to the present where the sempai who admires Misu appears, bringing Shingyouji problems and jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vppNY4LpYrmKmZtc9RD8Mf6hhng.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275994'),
  ('9429584373369297', 'Takumi-kun Series: Rainbow Colored Glass', 2009, 'Romance', 'Takeshi Yokoi, Satoshi Shimomoto', 'Hiroko Kanasugi', 'Kyosuke Hamao, Daisuke Watanabe, Yukihiro Takiguchi, Takahashi Yuuta, Kei Hosogai, Hiyori Yuki', 'NR', 'Takumi and Gii are now a couple, but Takumi is still uncomfortable with showing affection. Not only that, but Takumi grows jealous when Gii starts paying attention to a good-looking first year student. Is Gii''s love really that fickle?', 'Takumi and Gii are now a couple, but Takumi is still uncomfortable with showing affection. Not only that, but Takumi grows jealous when Gii starts paying attention to a good-looking first year student. Is Gii''s love really that fickle?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byIUJU136gOJygzb7EeGpJRL7BZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276008'),
  ('240840324147118735', 'Takumi-kun Series: That, Sunny Blue Sky', 2011, 'Romance', 'Takeshi Yokoi, Satoshi Shimomoto', 'Hiroko Kanasugi', 'Kyosuke Hamao, Daisuke Watanabe, Yukihiro Takiguchi, Ryoma Baba, Naito Taiki, Shōta Takasaki', 'NR', 'It''s June of their third year of high school, and Takumi has an important anniversary to attend back in his hometown. He wants to invite Gii along for the trip, but time and scheduling and possibly broken promises stand in the way.', 'It''s June of their third year of high school, and Takumi has an important anniversary to attend back in his hometown. He wants to invite Gii along for the trip, but time and scheduling and possibly broken promises stand in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QsaKaF68kr6nkCWwnLd3cnLMYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276024'),
  ('1114489972060993815', 'Takumi-kun Series: The Beauty of Detail', 2010, 'Drama', 'Takeshi Yokoi, Satoshi Shimomoto', 'Hiroko Kanasugi', 'Kyosuke Hamao, Daisuke Watanabe, Yukihiro Takiguchi, Ryoma Baba, Bishin Kawasumi, Akaba Mio, Saito Yasuka', 'NR', 'Another school year is starting. Upon meeting up with Gii, Takumi is worried when it turns out Gii has changed, suddenly acting cold and distant. Could their relationship be in danger for real this time?', 'Another school year is starting. Upon meeting up with Gii, Takumi is worried when it turns out Gii has changed, suddenly acting cold and distant. Could their relationship be in danger for real this time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdZPtfbCk2QjQvJUUsx9XUjhxHL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276016'),
  ('861939380766140230', 'Takva: A Man''s Fear of God', 2006, 'Drama', 'Soykut Turan, Özer Kızıltan, Yunus Emre Yurtseven', 'Önder Çakar', 'Erkan Can, Güven Kıraç, Meray Ülgen, Erman Saban, Settar Tanrıöğen, Engin Günaydın, Öznur Kula, Murat Cemcir', null, 'Humble and introvert Muharrem lives in a solitary and meager existence of a prayer and sexual abstinence adhering strictly to the most severe Islamic doctrines.His extraordinary devotion attracts the attention of the leader of a rich and powerful Istanbul religious group and he offers him an administrative post as a rent collector for their numerous properties. Muharrem''s new job throws him into the modern outside world he has successfully avoided for so long. He soon witnesses conflict attitude toward alcohol consumption and goodwill.He notices that he himself has become proud, domineering and even dishonest.To make matters worse, Muharrem''s inner peace is unnerved by the tormenting image of seductive woman who tempts him in his dreams,both night and day.With the balance of his devotion now upset,his fear of God begins to eat away at his senses.', 'Humble and introvert Muharrem lives in a solitary and meager existence of a prayer and sexual abstinence adhering strictly to the most severe Islamic doctrines.His extraordinary devotion attracts the attention of the leader of a rich and powerful Istanbul religious group and he offers him an administrative post as a rent collector for their numerous properties. Muharrem''s new job throws him into the modern outside world he has successfully avoided for so long. He soon witnesses conflict attitude toward alcohol consumption and goodwill.He notices that he himself has become proud, domineering and even dishonest.To make matters worse, Muharrem''s inner peace is unnerved by the tormenting image of seductive woman who tempts him in his dreams,both night and day.With the balance of his devotion now upset,his fear of God begins to eat away at his senses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ta0V8MRI7rQJXNRdnaKARpgUASw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4887'),
  ('655565422771692140', 'Talaash', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Reema Kagti, K.U. Mohanan, Mihir Lath', 'Zoya Akhtar, Reema Kagti', 'Aamir Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Rani Mukerji, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Rajkummar Rao, Shernaz Patel, Suhaas Ahuja, Sheeba Chaddha', null, 'A cop, investigating the mysterious death of a filmstar, meets a sex-worker, while he faces some personal problems psychologically. The mystery connects these people in a way, that ultimately changes their lives.', 'A cop, investigating the mysterious death of a filmstar, meets a sex-worker, while he faces some personal problems psychologically. The mystery connects these people in a way, that ultimately changes their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCxyN7HmJ7zWp8jtJeMRHABnutF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86004'),
  ('731325993903011138', 'Talcum Powder', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Verdone, Luca Verdone, Albino Cocco', 'Enrico Oldoini, Carlo Verdone', 'Carlo Verdone, Eleonora Giorgi, Christian De Sica, Angelo Infanti, Enrico Papa, Roberta Manfredi, Mario Brega, Isa Gallinelli', null, 'Sergio Benvenuti is a shy seller of contracts for a Roman company of music, but because of his character he cannot find even a customer, so he asks for help from a fellow named Nadia.', 'Sergio Benvenuti is a shy seller of contracts for a Roman company of music, but because of his character he cannot find even a customer, so he asks for help from a fellow named Nadia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IMlCia3G1EoI2fetNZkCVEkAzq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37768'),
  ('286896300330689486', 'Tale About Czar Pyotr Arranging Arap''s Wedding', 1976, 'Romance, Comedy, History', 'Aleksandr Mitta, Valery Shuvalov, Marina Koldobskaya', 'Aleksandr Mitta, Yuli Dunsky, Valeri Frid', 'Vladimir Vysotsky, Aleksey Petrenko, Irina Mazurkevich, Semyon Morozov, Valeriy Zolotukhin, Ivan Ryzhov, Mikhail Kokshenov, Evgeny Mitta', null, 'Peter the Great takes a Russian man of African heritage - Ibrahim Petrovich Hannibal - under his wing as the tsar builds his grand navy. After having a disastrous affair in France, Ibrahim vows to never fall in love again, until he sees the daughter of a wealthy boyar. Peter the Great insists the two be married, but Ibrahim goes against the tsar''s wishes, refusing to force her to marry him since she doesn''t consent. When another man tries to marry her, however, Ibrahim''s loyalties and generous nature are put to the test.', 'Peter the Great takes a Russian man of African heritage - Ibrahim Petrovich Hannibal - under his wing as the tsar builds his grand navy. After having a disastrous affair in France, Ibrahim vows to never fall in love again, until he sees the daughter of a wealthy boyar. Peter the Great insists the two be married, but Ibrahim goes against the tsar''s wishes, refusing to force her to marry him since she doesn''t consent. When another man tries to marry her, however, Ibrahim''s loyalties and generous nature are put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UNJaIjJNImLy9XikPiXau5UFPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75390'),
  ('717249967955173546', 'Tale About the Cat and the Moon', 1997, 'Animation', 'Pedro Serrazina', 'Pedro Serrazina', 'Joaquim de Almeida', null, 'A poem. A tale made of silence and complicity. Light and shadows, the charm of the night, the moon as a passion... This is a tale about someone who tried to make the dream come true. This is the tale about the cat and the moon.', 'A poem. A tale made of silence and complicity. Light and shadows, the charm of the night, the moon as a passion... This is a tale about someone who tried to make the dream come true. This is the tale about the cat and the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDrv0KjDp5zcEuaWiTy322Xes0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67303'),
  ('246368574240850855', 'Tale for Natasha', 1986, 'Animation', 'Aida Zyablikova', 'Marina Vishnevetskaya', 'Grigory Bolshakov, Andrei Kryukov, Tatyana Pelttser, Eleonora Prokhnitskaya, Svetlana Travkina, Georgiy Vitsin', null, 'Baba Yaga didn''t tolerate Kuzya''s escape, so she infiltrated Natasha''s apartment to return him into the woods.', 'Baba Yaga didn''t tolerate Kuzya''s escape, so she infiltrated Natasha''s apartment to return him into the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XOFD8QKC9TlMHBWMFLgZeV2x55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469449'),
  ('259495431524181295', 'Tale of a Vampire', 1993, 'Romance, Horror, Drama', 'Shimako Sato, Zubin Mistry', 'Shimako Sato, Jane Corbett', 'Julian Sands, Kenneth Cranham, Suzanna Hamilton, Marian Diamond, Mark Kempner, Oliver Smith, David King', null, 'Condemned to life without end, and to an undying passion for a lost love he can never find, a vampire stalks a beautiful young woman.', 'Condemned to life without end, and to an undying passion for a lost love he can never find, a vampire stalks a beautiful young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6K6jKfG0xQHX9iUmLN4ANaExIK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41771'),
  ('719608967822035853', 'Tale of Cinema', 2005, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Kim Hyung-koo, Sohn Young-sung', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Kim Sang-kyung, Uhm Ji-won, Lee Ki-woo, Son Sook, Lee Kyung-jin, Kim Myung-soo, Cho Han-cheul, Choi Moo-seong', null, 'In Seoul, a suicidal student meets a young woman who decides to join him in his fatal gesture. Dongsoo, an unsuccessful filmmaker, spots a beautiful young woman, who happens to be the lead actress in the film he has just seen. Their stories will cross paths thanks to their love for cinema.', 'In Seoul, a suicidal student meets a young woman who decides to join him in his fatal gesture. Dongsoo, an unsuccessful filmmaker, spots a beautiful young woman, who happens to be the lead actress in the film he has just seen. Their stories will cross paths thanks to their love for cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YrfSqpiTtJvmYqstkFHyzX5SEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85550'),
  ('570516726549373240', 'Tale of Japanese Burglars', 1965, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Hanjirō Nakazawa, Katsuhiko Taguchi, Satsuo Yamamoto', 'Hajime Takaiwa, Atsushi Takeda', 'Rentaro Mikuni, Yūnosuke Itō, Yoshiko Sakuma, Shinjirō Ehara, Mako Midori, Tanie Kitabayashi, Sonny Chiba, Hideo Murota', null, 'Gisuke Hayashida is an illegal dentist during the day and a burglar by night. One night during a burglary he witnesses a train derailment. Some communists are found guilty of causing the incident, but he knows it wasn''t them. He can save innocent people but for that he must confess his own crime.', 'Gisuke Hayashida is an illegal dentist during the day and a burglar by night. One night during a burglary he witnesses a train derailment. Some communists are found guilty of causing the incident, but he knows it wasn''t them. He can save innocent people but for that he must confess his own crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihwePg7ZQmk1Jkt059YOFTfdL0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398030'),
  ('645155494020549319', 'Tale of Tales', 1979, 'Animation', 'Yuri Norstein, Igor Skidan-Bosin', 'Lyudmila Petrushevskaya', 'Aleksandr Kalyagin', null, 'Distant, well-worn memories of childhood are inhabited by a little gray wolf. Through astonishing imagery, the memory of all of Russia is depicted.', 'Distant, well-worn memories of childhood are inhabited by a little gray wolf. Through astonishing imagery, the memory of all of Russia is depicted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gWBy9z4JrkDPSfG5VbjWbbgvxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36079'),
  ('189907940034447105', 'Tale of Tales', 2015, 'Romance, Fantasy, Horror', 'Matteo Garrone, Peter Suschitzky, Gianpaolo Rifino', 'Ugo Chiti, Edoardo Albinati, Massimo Gaudioso', 'Salma Hayek Pinault, Vincent Cassel, Toby Jones, Shirley Henderson, Hayley Carmichael, Bebe Cave, Stacy Martin, Christian Lees', 'R', 'The Queen of Selvascura risks everything to be a mother; the King of Roccaforte falls in love with the voice of a mysterious girl; the King of Altomonte becomes obsessed with a flea and neglects his daughter.', 'The Queen of Selvascura risks everything to be a mother; the King of Roccaforte falls in love with the voice of a mysterious girl; the King of Altomonte becomes obsessed with a flea and neglects his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryZsoaYmcEJsye6P5uo5thEjpqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314405'),
  ('566308494197121408', 'Tale of the Mummy', 1998, 'Horror, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Russell Mulcahy, Gabriel Beristain, David Daniels', 'Keith Williams, Russell Mulcahy, John Esposito', 'Jason Scott Lee, Louise Lombard, Sean Pertwee, Lysette Anthony, Michael Lerner, Jack Davenport, Honor Blackman, Shelley Duvall', 'R', 'Centuries ago, under the sands of ancient Egypt, a Prince was buried and his tomb eternally cursed so that no man would ever again suffer from his evil ways. But hundreds of years later on a greedy search for treasure, a group of archaeologists break the cursed seal of the tomb. Every man vanishes without a trace, leaving behind only a log book, and a deadly warning of the legend of the bloodthirsty Talos.', 'Centuries ago, under the sands of ancient Egypt, a Prince was buried and his tomb eternally cursed so that no man would ever again suffer from his evil ways. But hundreds of years later on a greedy search for treasure, a group of archaeologists break the cursed seal of the tomb. Every man vanishes without a trace, leaving behind only a log book, and a deadly warning of the legend of the bloodthirsty Talos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlcBJeRiX81GhIzLtNoc6pI23YT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66892'),
  ('93969493978349482', 'Tales from Earthsea', 2006, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Kazuhiro Wakabayashi, Goro Miyazaki, Takeshi Inamura', 'Keiko Niwa, Goro Miyazaki', 'Junichi Okada, Aoi Teshima, Bunta Sugawara, Yuko Tanaka, Teruyuki Kagawa, Jun Fubuki, Takashi Naito, Mitsuko Baisho', 'PG-13', 'Something bizarre has come over the land. The kingdom is deteriorating. People are beginning to act strange... What''s even more strange is that people are beginning to see dragons, which shouldn''t enter the world of humans. Due to all these bizarre events, Ged, a wandering wizard, is investigating the cause. During his journey, he meets Prince Arren, a young distraught teenage boy. While Arren may look like a shy young teen, he has a severe dark side, which grants him strength, hatred, ruthlessness and has no mercy, especially when it comes to protecting Teru. For the witch Kumo this is a perfect opportunity. She can use the boy''s "fears" against the very one who would help him, Ged.', 'Something bizarre has come over the land. The kingdom is deteriorating. People are beginning to act strange... What''s even more strange is that people are beginning to see dragons, which shouldn''t enter the world of humans. Due to all these bizarre events, Ged, a wandering wizard, is investigating the cause. During his journey, he meets Prince Arren, a young distraught teenage boy. While Arren may look like a shy young teen, he has a severe dark side, which grants him strength, hatred, ruthlessness and has no mercy, especially when it comes to protecting Teru. For the witch Kumo this is a perfect opportunity. She can use the boy''s "fears" against the very one who would help him, Ged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0VnJt4eRPMjA1hpJ8f1EFoVaSf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37933'),
  ('238174274310715778', 'Tales from the Crapper', 2004, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Comedy', 'Gabriel Friedman, Brian Spitz, Dave Paiko', 'Gabriel Friedman, Mark C. Adams', 'Julie Strain, Lloyd Kaufman, Arban Ornelas, Masuimi Max, Kevin Eastman, Rob Zazzali, Joel Himelhoch, Elwood Carlisle', null, 'The Crapkeeper hosts two stories combining highbrow entertainment with kung fu action, alien adventure and vampire lesbian sex.', 'The Crapkeeper hosts two stories combining highbrow entertainment with kung fu action, alien adventure and vampire lesbian sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lp24DmwfzTxqQ4Ts1fI5HmOlX27.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41568'),
  ('768743214957105785', 'Tales from the Crypt', 1972, 'Horror', 'Freddie Francis, Norman Warwick', 'Milton Subotsky', 'Joan Collins, Peter Cushing, Roy Dotrice, Richard Greene, Ian Hendry, Patrick Magee, Barbara Murray, Nigel Patrick', 'PG', 'When a tourist group become lost within ancient catacombs, they meet the sinister Crypt Keeper, who tells them each their fate. The enigmatic figure''s macabre stories involve a wife dabbling in murder, a retired sanitation worker targeted by his suspicious neighbors, and an adulterer who may face a fitting demise if the yarns come true.', 'When a tourist group become lost within ancient catacombs, they meet the sinister Crypt Keeper, who tells them each their fate. The enigmatic figure''s macabre stories involve a wife dabbling in murder, a retired sanitation worker targeted by his suspicious neighbors, and an adulterer who may face a fitting demise if the yarns come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vA3wsl2lfurU6UFVs0Hg0cZJDah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38939'),
  ('965855807343309175', 'Tales from the Crypt: Demon Knight', 1995, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller', 'Ernest R. Dickerson, Christopher Faloona, Leigh Webb', 'Cyrus Voris, Mark Bishop, Ethan Reiff', 'Billy Zane, William Sadler, Jada Pinkett Smith, CCH Pounder, Brenda Bakke, Dick Miller, Thomas Haden Church, John Schuck', 'R', 'Ex-soldier Frank Brayker is the guardian of an ancient key that can unlock tremendous evil; the sinister Collector is a demon who wants the key so he can initiate the apocalypse. On the run from wicked mercenaries for almost 90 years, Brayker finally stops in at a boarding house in New Mexico where — with the help of its residents — he plans to face off against the Collector and his band of ghouls, preventing them from ever seizing the key.', 'Ex-soldier Frank Brayker is the guardian of an ancient key that can unlock tremendous evil; the sinister Collector is a demon who wants the key so he can initiate the apocalypse. On the run from wicked mercenaries for almost 90 years, Brayker finally stops in at a boarding house in New Mexico where — with the help of its residents — he plans to face off against the Collector and his band of ghouls, preventing them from ever seizing the key.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uD5yk0ECebJ59lhvhTBKhUojc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9059'),
  ('491656200925020149', 'Tales from the Dark 2', 2013, 'Horror', 'Gordon Chan, Teddy Robin, Chan Chi-Ying', 'Gordon Chan, Matthew Tang Hon-Keung, Lilian Lee Bik-Wah', 'Fala Chen, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Tony Ho, Joman Chiang, Fatkuk Chan, Sham Ka-Ki, Kiki Tam, Ronny Yuen', null, 'In "Haunted Pillow," TVB starlet Fala Chen is still obsessed with her lover (Gordon Lam) after their breakup and invariably suffers from insomnia. She gets hold of a Chinese herbal pillow that eventually helps her fall asleep again but it also draws her near something unexpected. "Hide And Seek" casts a group of young newcomers into an abandoned school campus where they meet longtime janitor Mr. Chan who takes shelter at the school. Playing hide-and-seek after midnight, the teenagers go missing, one after another. In his self-directed piece "Black Umbrella," Teddy Robin makes solving conflicts on the street at night his mission and marks each closed case with his signature black umbrella. Before he calls it a day, he meets a prostitute who forcefully pulls him upstairs for business and unfortunately things spiral out of control.', 'In "Haunted Pillow," TVB starlet Fala Chen is still obsessed with her lover (Gordon Lam) after their breakup and invariably suffers from insomnia. She gets hold of a Chinese herbal pillow that eventually helps her fall asleep again but it also draws her near something unexpected. "Hide And Seek" casts a group of young newcomers into an abandoned school campus where they meet longtime janitor Mr. Chan who takes shelter at the school. Playing hide-and-seek after midnight, the teenagers go missing, one after another. In his self-directed piece "Black Umbrella," Teddy Robin makes solving conflicts on the street at night his mission and marks each closed case with his signature black umbrella. Before he calls it a day, he meets a prostitute who forcefully pulls him upstairs for business and unfortunately things spiral out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ho41qnfgmY8nkOylJlR323wnJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222832'),
  ('441152033338775653', 'Tales from the Darkside: The Movie', 1990, 'Thriller, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'John Harrison, Marybeth Hagner, Amelia Villero', 'Michael McDowell', 'Debbie Harry, Matthew Lawrence, David Forrester, Christian Slater, Robert Sedgwick, Steve Buscemi, Donald Van Horn, Michael Deak', 'R', 'A young boy tells three stories of horror to distract a witch who plans to eat him.', 'A young boy tells three stories of horror to distract a witch who plans to eat him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5q8WK4gW45Knxhpb29IVOCbbfI7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20701'),
  ('130075378950398611', 'Tales from the Far Side', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Marv Newland', 'Gary Larson', 'Kathleen Barr, Doug Parker, Lee Tockar, Dale Wilson', null, 'A series of Gary Larson''s "Far Side" gags are turned into short animated gags, such as a Frankenstein cow; an insect airline''s in-flight movie; deers, hunters, and ufos; wolf home-movies; egg horror flicks; and cowboys & aliens.', 'A series of Gary Larson''s "Far Side" gags are turned into short animated gags, such as a Frankenstein cow; an insect airline''s in-flight movie; deers, hunters, and ufos; wolf home-movies; egg horror flicks; and cowboys & aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcOrwBQ2p1GOU4yBuYgEJR2Xzl5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28588'),
  ('249992612511715014', 'Tales from the Gimli Hospital', 1988, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Guy Maddin, Kyle McCulloch', 'Guy Maddin', 'Kyle McCulloch, Michael Gottli, Angela Heck, Margaret Anne MacLeod, Heather Neale, David Neale, Don Hewak, Ron Eyolfson', null, 'While their mother is dying in the modern Gimli, Manitoba hospital, two young children are told an important tale by their Icelandic grandmother about Einar the lonely, his friend Gunnar, and the angelic Snjofrieder in a Gimli of old.', 'While their mother is dying in the modern Gimli, Manitoba hospital, two young children are told an important tale by their Icelandic grandmother about Einar the lonely, his friend Gunnar, and the angelic Snjofrieder in a Gimli of old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLMyHylKquaPLaT1sdetiJbgpbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41967'),
  ('555748244458904378', 'Tales from the Golden Age', 2009, 'Comedy, History', 'Hanno Höfer, Cristian Mungiu, Constantin Popescu Jr.', 'Cristian Mungiu', 'Alexandru Potocean, Teodor Corban, Emanuel Pârvu, Sorin Medeleni, Florin Mircea Jr., Mădălina Ghițescu, Alexandru Nedelcu, Marius Nănău', null, 'Composed of six unconventional vignettes, each one dealing with the late communist period in Romania, a narrative is told through its urban myths from the perspective of ordinary people. The title refers to the alluded "Golden Age" of the last 15 years of Ceaușescu''s regime.', 'Composed of six unconventional vignettes, each one dealing with the late communist period in Romania, a narrative is told through its urban myths from the perspective of ordinary people. The title refers to the alluded "Golden Age" of the last 15 years of Ceaușescu''s regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZN1CSj8xiSCdO6Tmg2d3YI78vi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39376'),
  ('678011149579826457', 'Tales from the Hood', 1995, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller, Drama, Fantasy', 'Rusty Cundieff, Dieter Busch, Douglas Aarniokoski', 'Darin Scott, Rusty Cundieff', 'Clarence Williams III, Joe Torry, De''Aundre Bonds, Samuel Monroe Jr., Wings Hauser, Tom Wright, Anthony Griffith, Michael Massee', 'R', 'A strange mortician tells four horrific tales to three drug dealers that he traps in their local funeral parlor.', 'A strange mortician tells four horrific tales to three drug dealers that he traps in their local funeral parlor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glPNCcI7V8zTTI3BG0iIUJJcwXN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25066'),
  ('115243614929205654', 'Tales from the Hood 2', 2018, 'Horror', 'Rusty Cundieff, Darin Scott, Tracy Kilpatrick', 'Darin Scott, Rusty Cundieff', 'Keith David, Alexandria DeBerry, Bryan Batt, Martin Bats Bradford, Jay Huguley, Kendrick Cross, Andy Cohen, Greg Tarzan Davis', 'R', 'Mr. Simms returns to tell more eerie, unsettling tales involving dolls, psychics, possession and ghosts.', 'Mr. Simms returns to tell more eerie, unsettling tales involving dolls, psychics, possession and ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k93d4au1KByYKi6FsE0dLrKWowj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470614'),
  ('967005550526305419', 'Tales from the Hood 3', 2020, 'Horror', 'Rusty Cundieff, Darin Scott, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Rusty Cundieff, Darin Scott', 'Tony Todd, London Brown, Cooper Huckabee, Patrick Abellard, Sage Arrindell, Savannah Basley, Jaime M. Callica, Lynn Whitfield', 'R', 'Following the franchise''s cult classic roots, this new anthology featuring Tony Todd and Lynn Whitfield will scare and thrill with its horrifying twists and social commentary.', 'Following the franchise''s cult classic roots, this new anthology featuring Tony Todd and Lynn Whitfield will scare and thrill with its horrifying twists and social commentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fT27GgfhKys7aLqXIzhIdv5RLBT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739123'),
  ('1029797313282302193', 'Tales from the Quadead Zone', 1987, 'Horror', 'Chester Novell Turner', 'Chester Novell Turner', 'W.J. Rider, Doug Daverport, Johnnie Tanguy, Chris Calloway, Kim Nichols, Tammy Nichols, Jeff Miza, Ronda Rider', null, 'A woman reads two spooky tales to the ghost of her dead son, Bobby: the first, about a poor family who takes drastic measures to allot more food to their members; the second, about a pair of adversarial brothers and what happens when one of them dies and the other attempts to humiliate his corpse.', 'A woman reads two spooky tales to the ghost of her dead son, Bobby: the first, about a poor family who takes drastic measures to allot more food to their members; the second, about a pair of adversarial brothers and what happens when one of them dies and the other attempts to humiliate his corpse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzUIeF1fElHS7WbRPTs6aJC2DXQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81465'),
  ('951916222037190523', 'Tales from the Script', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Peter Hanson', 'Peter Hanson, Paul Robert Herman', 'John Carpenter, Frank Darabont, Steven E. de Souza, Antwone Fisher, William Goldman, Guinevere Turner, Jose Rivera, Melville Shavelson', 'PG', 'Shane Black ("Lethal Weapon"), John Carpenter ("Halloween"), Frank Darabont ("The Shawshank Redemption"), William Goldman ("The Princess Bride"), Paul Schrader ("Taxi Driver"), and dozens of other Hollywood screenwriters share hilarious anecdotes and penetrating insights in "Tales from the Script," the most comprehensive documentary ever made about screenwriting. By analyzing their triumphs and recalling their failures, the participants explain how successful writers develop the skills necessary for toughing out careers in one of the world''s most competitive industries. They also reveal the untold stories behind some of the greatest screenplays ever written, describing their adventures with luminaries including Harrison Ford, Stanley Kubrick, Joel Silver, Martin Scorsese, and Steven Spielberg. The film was produced in tandem with the upcoming HarperCollins book of the same name.', 'Shane Black ("Lethal Weapon"), John Carpenter ("Halloween"), Frank Darabont ("The Shawshank Redemption"), William Goldman ("The Princess Bride"), Paul Schrader ("Taxi Driver"), and dozens of other Hollywood screenwriters share hilarious anecdotes and penetrating insights in "Tales from the Script," the most comprehensive documentary ever made about screenwriting. By analyzing their triumphs and recalling their failures, the participants explain how successful writers develop the skills necessary for toughing out careers in one of the world''s most competitive industries. They also reveal the untold stories behind some of the greatest screenplays ever written, describing their adventures with luminaries including Harrison Ford, Stanley Kubrick, Joel Silver, Martin Scorsese, and Steven Spielberg. The film was produced in tandem with the upcoming HarperCollins book of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnKAvhpt9unt7nBx86Ma4bk9aFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38124'),
  ('177078230143581215', 'Tales of a Golden Geisha', 1990, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jūzō Itami, Zenko Yamazaki, Nobuhiro Kubota', 'Jūzō Itami', 'Nobuko Miyamoto, Masahiko Tsugawa, Hiroshi Okochi, Ryūnosuke Kaneda, Mitsuko Ishii, Hideji Ōtaki, Akira Takarada, Shōgo Shimada', null, 'Nayoko, a good-hearted geisha, brings luck to the men she sleeps with, even though most are scoundrels who don’t deserve it.', 'Nayoko, a good-hearted geisha, brings luck to the men she sleeps with, even though most are scoundrels who don’t deserve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2Qp3IN9D82T1K7ZSGfV5AmOF9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83183'),
  ('311019891139233012', 'Tales of a Street Corner', 1962, 'Animation', 'Eiichi Yamamoto, Yuusaku Sakamoto, 広川和行', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, 'NR', 'The sad and happy times of a young girl and her bear doll, a young mouse and his family, a sycamore tree, an old lamp post, a hoodlum moth and an alleyway full of posters coming to life.', 'The sad and happy times of a young girl and her bear doll, a young mouse and his family, a sycamore tree, an old lamp post, a hoodlum moth and an alleyway full of posters coming to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0eJ6Ht3jMmMHqPKVTiJmUotRYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85802'),
  ('347311978278024768', 'Tales of an Immoral Couple', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tonatiuh Martínez, Manolo Caro', 'Manolo Caro', 'Cecilia Suárez, Ximena Romo, Manuel Garcia-Rulfo, Mariana Treviño, Paz Vega, Sebastián Aguirre, Juan Pablo Medina, Andrés Almeida', null, 'Lucio and Martina used to share an indescribable chemistry during their highschool years, however, they took separate ways. 25 years later they meet again, but this time they decide to invent an ideal life in order to hide themselves from an inevitable truth: they were really waiting for each other in all of these years.', 'Lucio and Martina used to share an indescribable chemistry during their highschool years, however, they took separate ways. 25 years later they meet again, but this time they decide to invent an ideal life in order to hide themselves from an inevitable truth: they were really waiting for each other in all of these years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bS2QeaSGkEZua61tuFb7ZwagdY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387062'),
  ('857916457189832638', 'Tales of Beatrix Potter', 1971, 'Fantasy, Family, Music', 'Reginald Mills, Jack Causey, Austin Dempster', 'Richard Goodwin, Christine Edzard', 'Frederick Ashton, Alexander Grant, Julie Wood, Keith Martin, Ann Howard, Bob Mead, Garry Grant, Sally Ashby', 'G', 'The Royal Ballet Company brings Squirrel Nutkin, Tom Thumb, Hunca Munca, Jemima Puddle-Duck, Jeremy Fisher, Pigling Bland, and Pigwig to the screen doing pirouettes and pas de deux in this filmed ballet production directed by Reginald Mills. The film more properly belongs, however, to choreographer Frederick Ashmore, composer John Lanchbery, and costume designer Rostislav Douboujinsky. This literal adaptation concerns the shy Beatrix Potter and how, when all of the toy animals in her room come to life, she emerges from her shell and begins to enjoy life. Sequences include a rowdy dance with Tom Thumb and Hunca Munca destroying a collection of plaster food, a midnight pas de deux between Pigling Bland and Pigwig, and a corps de ballet of dancing mice.', 'The Royal Ballet Company brings Squirrel Nutkin, Tom Thumb, Hunca Munca, Jemima Puddle-Duck, Jeremy Fisher, Pigling Bland, and Pigwig to the screen doing pirouettes and pas de deux in this filmed ballet production directed by Reginald Mills. The film more properly belongs, however, to choreographer Frederick Ashmore, composer John Lanchbery, and costume designer Rostislav Douboujinsky. This literal adaptation concerns the shy Beatrix Potter and how, when all of the toy animals in her room come to life, she emerges from her shell and begins to enjoy life. Sequences include a rowdy dance with Tom Thumb and Hunca Munca destroying a collection of plaster food, a midnight pas de deux between Pigling Bland and Pigwig, and a corps de ballet of dancing mice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xinf6K25syd6NxcMGnkpwRm6fFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47509'),
  ('483938205511180578', 'Tales of Ginza', 1955, 'Drama', 'Yūzō Kawashima, Minoru Yokoyama, Shōhei Imamura', 'Ruiju Yanagisawa', 'Yumeji Tsukioka, Tatsuya Mihashi, Seizaburō Kawazu, Mie Kitahara, Shirō Ōsaka, Tōru Abe, Masumi Okada, Takeshi Hasebe', null, 'In the thriving Tokyo neighborhood of Ginza, a woman in the process of selling her estranged husband’s art collection attempts to identify the man who painted her own portrait fifteen years prior.', 'In the thriving Tokyo neighborhood of Ginza, a woman in the process of selling her estranged husband’s art collection attempts to identify the man who painted her own portrait fifteen years prior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Z6j9PnklZSysB6AmyugwUQ6ypd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589260'),
  ('961964864801239403', 'Tales of Halloween', 2015, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Zoran Popović, David Tayar, Scott Winig', 'Dave Parker, Andrew Kasch, Mike Mendez', 'Keir Gilchrist, Pollyanna McIntosh, Sam Witwer, Booboo Stewart, Adrienne Barbeau, Gracie Gillam, Jose Pablo Cantillo, Lin Shaye', 'R', 'Ten stories from horror''s top directors. Ghosts, ghouls, monsters, and the devil delight in terrorizing unsuspecting residents of a suburban neighborhood on Halloween night. This creepy anthology combines classic Halloween tales with the stuff of nightmares.', 'Ten stories from horror''s top directors. Ghosts, ghouls, monsters, and the devil delight in terrorizing unsuspecting residents of a suburban neighborhood on Halloween night. This creepy anthology combines classic Halloween tales with the stuff of nightmares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fc4YBCqjfXv8EZpV5MpNsKPW3fY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306964'),
  ('1127736458906492422', 'Tales of Manhattan', 1942, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Julien Duvivier, Joseph Walker', 'László Görög, Samuel Hoffenstein, Ben Hecht', 'Charles Boyer, Rita Hayworth, Ginger Rogers, Henry Fonda, Charles Laughton, Edward G. Robinson, Paul Robeson, Ethel Waters', 'NR', 'Ten screenwriters collaborated on this series of tales concerning the effect a tailcoat cursed by its tailor has on those who wear it. The video release features a W.C. Fields segment not included in the original theatrical release.', 'Ten screenwriters collaborated on this series of tales concerning the effect a tailcoat cursed by its tailor has on those who wear it. The video release features a W.C. Fields segment not included in the original theatrical release.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKH3Vfx9cPmhD74iAaKLdGdk32w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27655'),
  ('1140753499067737165', 'Tales of Ordinary Madness', 1981, 'Drama', 'Marco Ferreri, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Marco Ferreri, Charles Bukowski, Sergio Amidei', 'Ben Gazzara, Ornella Muti, Susan Tyrrell, Tanya Lopert, Roy Brocksmith, Katya Berger, Hope Cameron, Judith Drake', null, 'Poet/lecturer Charles Serking awakens from his alcoholic haze long enough to take a bus back to L.A. and plunge into an orgy of drink and sexual depravity.', 'Poet/lecturer Charles Serking awakens from his alcoholic haze long enough to take a bus back to L.A. and plunge into an orgy of drink and sexual depravity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riWT9Y5JJ6bzxw2hK1PqAHeFFJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69014'),
  ('535851647585978804', 'Tales of Terror', 1962, 'Horror, Comedy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Roger Corman, Floyd Crosby, Jack Bohrer', 'Richard Matheson', 'Vincent Price, Peter Lorre, Basil Rathbone, Debra Paget, Maggie Pierce, Joyce Jameson, Leona Gage, David Frankham', null, 'Three stories adapted from the work of Edgar Allen Poe: 1) A man and his daughter are reunited, but the blame for the death of his wife hangs over them, unresolved. 2) A derelict challenges the local wine-tasting champion to a competition, but finds the man''s attention to his wife worthy of more dramatic action. 3) A man dying and in great pain agrees to be hypnotized at the moment of death, with unexpected consequences.', 'Three stories adapted from the work of Edgar Allen Poe: 1) A man and his daughter are reunited, but the blame for the death of his wife hangs over them, unresolved. 2) A derelict challenges the local wine-tasting champion to a competition, but finds the man''s attention to his wife worthy of more dramatic action. 3) A man dying and in great pain agrees to be hypnotized at the moment of death, with unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itHjXJLzxeUsPsruQV3r79egxaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29074'),
  ('238217330557579424', 'Tales of Terror from Tokyo and All Over Japan: The Movie', 2004, 'Horror', 'Hirohisa Sasaki, Shunichi Hirano, Keisuke Toyoshima', 'Ryuta Miyake', 'Naoto Takenaka, Yasufumi Hayashi, Daisuke Shima, Maki Sakai, Kaori Sakagami, Yasue Sato, Saki Takaoka, Mikio Osawa', null, '8 short stories comprise this anthology movie, based on the Tales of Terror TV series. The segments are, in order: The Night Watchman (directed by Akio Yoshida), Wisps of Smoke (Kosuke Suzuki), Gloves (Hirohisa Sasaki), The Weight (Kosuke Suzuki), Full-Length Mirror (Ryuta Miyake), Line of Sight (Keisuke Toyoshima), The Promise (Keita Amemiya) and Hisao (Shun''ichi Hirano).', '8 short stories comprise this anthology movie, based on the Tales of Terror TV series. The segments are, in order: The Night Watchman (directed by Akio Yoshida), Wisps of Smoke (Kosuke Suzuki), Gloves (Hirohisa Sasaki), The Weight (Kosuke Suzuki), Full-Length Mirror (Ryuta Miyake), Line of Sight (Keisuke Toyoshima), The Promise (Keita Amemiya) and Hisao (Shun''ichi Hirano).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JClNJoyP9hslWwdQoi3RLXBoKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76822'),
  ('975140292300376227', 'Tales of Terror: Haunted Apartment', 2005, 'Horror', 'Akio Yoshida', 'Mutsuki Watanabe', 'Mei Kurokawa, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Toshie Negishi, Yūta Sone, Hiroko Isayama, Ryoko Takizawa, Yoshihiko Hosoda, Ayaka Maeda', null, 'Aimi and her father move into an old, apartment building and learn quickly that things are not as they seem.', 'Aimi and her father move into an old, apartment building and learn quickly that things are not as they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36CXLonKsO7Fkd6v2BMJwErpUjz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62332'),
  ('420404963432597856', 'Tales of the Black Freighter', 2009, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Daniel DelPurgatorio, Mike Smith', 'Zack Snyder, Alex Tse', 'Gerard Butler, Jared Harris, Cam Clarke, Siobhan Flynn, Salli Saffioti, Lori Tritel', 'R', 'A mariner survives an attack from the dreaded pirates of the Black Freighter, but his struggle to return home to warn it has a horrific cost.', 'A mariner survives an attack from the dreaded pirates of the Black Freighter, but his struggle to return home to warn it has a horrific cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpZNACLrZC7EeZc0iCpnCsewZEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16440'),
  ('790087557841043946', 'Tales of the Grim Sleeper', 2014, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Nick Broomfield, Barney Broomfield', null, 'Lonnie Franklin Jr.', null, 'When Lonnie Franklin Jr. was arrested in South Central Los Angeles in 2010 as the suspected murderer of a string of young black women, police hailed it as the culmination of 20 years of investigations. Four years later documentary filmmaker Nick Broomfield took his camera to the alleged killer’s neighborhood for another view.', 'When Lonnie Franklin Jr. was arrested in South Central Los Angeles in 2010 as the suspected murderer of a string of young black women, police hailed it as the culmination of 20 years of investigations. Four years later documentary filmmaker Nick Broomfield took his camera to the alleged killer’s neighborhood for another view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5c5SxGfEu5cgxErjCa0EXISKL4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289575'),
  ('109836673808804182', 'Tales of the Night', 2011, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Yves Barsacq, Olivier Claverie, Marine Griset, Julien Béramis', null, 'Six exotic fables, each unfold in a unique locale, from Tibet, to medieval Europe, an Aztec kingdom, the African plains, and even the Land of the Dead.', 'Six exotic fables, each unfold in a unique locale, from Tibet, to medieval Europe, an Aztec kingdom, the African plains, and even the Land of the Dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irY2b4KkYZyRAowZdk5okDMn5S8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79000'),
  ('618193130398929884', 'Tales of the Stinking Military Service', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Manuel Esteban, Josep M. Civit, Francisco G. Siurana', 'Joan Potau', 'Juan Echanove, Achero Mañas, Jordi Mollà, José «Saza» Sazatornil, Agustín González, Marc Martínez, David Gil, Carles Romeu', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qufQnE3oIQZ6omfo7VNhSxuCKAS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189301'),
  ('1002428531524746492', 'Tales of the Underworld', 2026, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Darren S. Cook', 'Ian Burfield, AG. Longhurst, Steve Ward', 'Oliver Cotton, Michael McKell, Tony Denham, Matthew Brenher, Brendan Gibson', null, 'Told through the eyes of a journalist digging too deep, Tales of the Underworld exposes a ruthless criminal empire where missing men, police informants, and shifting loyalties make survival a dangerous game.', 'Told through the eyes of a journalist digging too deep, Tales of the Underworld exposes a ruthless criminal empire where missing men, police informants, and shifting loyalties make survival a dangerous game.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlAJjgiPBsOn0BlHvXzwsMF9RLjl.jpg', 'plex:movie:tales-of-the-underworld'),
  ('159730117752724820', 'Tales of the Unusual', 2000, 'Horror, Comedy, Romance', 'Hisao Ogura, Masayuki Ochiai, Masayuki Suzuki', 'Ryôichi Kimizuka, Katsuhide Suzuki, Tomoko Aizawa', 'Kazuyuki Aijima, Izumi Inamori, Renji Ishibashi, Takashi Kashiwabara, Narumi Kayashima, Masahiro Komoto, Saya Takagi, Akihiko Murata', null, 'A four-part anthology in the spirit of The Twilight Zone, this film starts off with a group of commuters stranded at a train station in the rain, listening to stories told by one of the group. These include tales of a group stranded in the mountains and haunted by guilt over a death they inadvertantly caused, an emotionally broken chessmaster pressed into playing a real-life game for an eccentric millionaire, a wandering medieval samurai who finds a modern-day cell phone on the ground and a person on the other end asking questions about the past, and a young couple who agree to try a computer simulation of what their future as husband and wife would be like.', 'A four-part anthology in the spirit of The Twilight Zone, this film starts off with a group of commuters stranded at a train station in the rain, listening to stories told by one of the group. These include tales of a group stranded in the mountains and haunted by guilt over a death they inadvertantly caused, an emotionally broken chessmaster pressed into playing a real-life game for an eccentric millionaire, a wandering medieval samurai who finds a modern-day cell phone on the ground and a person on the other end asking questions about the past, and a young couple who agree to try a computer simulation of what their future as husband and wife would be like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sukwYDxtoHacAlbTQ1rzUzPvTzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40255'),
  ('102562093907440386', 'Tales of Vesperia: The First Strike', 2009, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Kanta Kamei, Kazuhiro Yamada, Takuya Saito', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Kohsuke Toriumi, Mamoru Miyano, Rika Morinaga, Mai Nakahara, Fumie Mizusawa, Arisa Ogasawara, Daisuke Gori, Jurota Kosugi', null, 'In a mythical kingdom, the mighty Imperial Knights harness a magical substance known as Aer to power their weapons and protect humanity from the monsters of the forest. But something strange is afoot; the Aer is somehow changing, causing the wilderness to waste away and stirring the woodland beasts to attack with greater frequency. As danger creeps steadily closer to civilization, two young recruits - Flynn, the rigid son of a fallen hero, and the rebellious and brash Yuri - must ride with their fellow Imperial Knights to distant ruins in hopes of uncovering the truth behind the transforming Aer.', 'In a mythical kingdom, the mighty Imperial Knights harness a magical substance known as Aer to power their weapons and protect humanity from the monsters of the forest. But something strange is afoot; the Aer is somehow changing, causing the wilderness to waste away and stirring the woodland beasts to attack with greater frequency. As danger creeps steadily closer to civilization, two young recruits - Flynn, the rigid son of a fallen hero, and the rebellious and brash Yuri - must ride with their fellow Imperial Knights to distant ruins in hopes of uncovering the truth behind the transforming Aer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwSwCpXfSgiP5FbVPwlmvU22Jjx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39319'),
  ('1078760151630755904', 'Tales That Witness Madness', 1973, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Freddie Francis, Norman Warwick', 'Jennifer Jayne', 'Jack Hawkins, Donald Pleasence, Georgia Brown, Donald Houston, Russell Lewis, David Wood, Suzy Kendall, Peter McEnery', 'R', 'Enigmatic asylum owner Dr Tremayne houses four very special cases. Visited by his colleague Nicholas, Tremayne explains his amazing and controversial theories as to why each patient went mad, be they a ritualistic ''luau'', a time-travelling bicycle, a toy tiger, and a tree stump.', 'Enigmatic asylum owner Dr Tremayne houses four very special cases. Visited by his colleague Nicholas, Tremayne explains his amazing and controversial theories as to why each patient went mad, be they a ritualistic ''luau'', a time-travelling bicycle, a toy tiger, and a tree stump.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeTgxwQokdojbrqmq78GhxaHQxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42468'),
  ('460594355134267378', 'Talespin: Plunder & Lightning', 1990, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Larry Latham, Robert Taylor', 'Len Uhley, Mark Zaslove, Alan Burnett', 'Ed Gilbert, R.J. Williams, Jim Cummings, Tony Jay, Sally Struthers, Janna Michaels, Pat Fraley, Chuck McCann', 'G', 'In the series premiere, Baloo, an air cargo pilot, meets Kit Cloudkicker, a 12-year-old orphan, and takes him on as his navigator. He also loses his business to Rebecca Cunningham, a business major who becomes his boss. Meanwhile, Don Karnage, a notorious air pirate, uses a special gem stolen from Shere Khan''s company, Khan Industries, to power a lightning gun and threaten Cape Suzette.', 'In the series premiere, Baloo, an air cargo pilot, meets Kit Cloudkicker, a 12-year-old orphan, and takes him on as his navigator. He also loses his business to Rebecca Cunningham, a business major who becomes his boss. Meanwhile, Don Karnage, a notorious air pirate, uses a special gem stolen from Shere Khan''s company, Khan Industries, to power a lightning gun and threaten Cape Suzette.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqibpLa84R03KGMRYsUANQ5fPlQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279089'),
  ('582404961858769688', 'Talhotblond', 2009, 'Documentary, Thriller', 'Barbara Schroeder', 'Barbara Schroeder', null, 'G', 'This is the true story of a love triangle that takes place entirely online. Lies lead to murder in real life, as a teenage vixen (screen name ''talhotblond'') lures men into her web. Revealing a shocking true crime story that shows the Internet''s power to unleash our most dangerous fantasies.', 'This is the true story of a love triangle that takes place entirely online. Lies lead to murder in real life, as a teenage vixen (screen name ''talhotblond'') lures men into her web. Revealing a shocking true crime story that shows the Internet''s power to unleash our most dangerous fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bB9zl6vFxqR5Ebz9UR9pFEufNGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39246'),
  ('459777772119795680', 'Talih Kuşu', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet, Ferdi Eğilmez, Ümit Hiçdurmaz', 'Erdoğan Tünaş', 'Kemal Sunal, Yasemin Yalçın, Nevzat Okçugil, Bülent Kayabaş, Şemsi İnkaya, Kuzey Vargın, Reha Yurdakul, Nevzat Açıkgöz', null, 'Osman, who lives a poor life with his wife, children, and mother-in-law, earns his living as a porter. His debts to the local shopkeepers and his landlord have piled up like a mountain. To make matters worse, he is constantly belittled by his wife Leman and mother-in-law! One day, the neighborhood ticket seller Şakir forces him to buy a lottery ticket. Osman hides the ticket somewhere but forgets where he put it. When Osman learns that the jackpot has been won by one of the tickets sold by Şakir, he mistakenly believes it is his and is overcome with joy.', 'Osman, who lives a poor life with his wife, children, and mother-in-law, earns his living as a porter. His debts to the local shopkeepers and his landlord have piled up like a mountain. To make matters worse, he is constantly belittled by his wife Leman and mother-in-law! One day, the neighborhood ticket seller Şakir forces him to buy a lottery ticket. Osman hides the ticket somewhere but forgets where he put it. When Osman learns that the jackpot has been won by one of the tickets sold by Şakir, he mistakenly believes it is his and is overcome with joy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qk25UlnTocBF2J06I5SjzcKG6fc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452926'),
  ('713090184208077228', 'Talisman', 1998, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'David DeCoteau, Laurentiu Maronese, Cristian Ciurea', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'Billy Parish, Walter Jones, Jason Adelman, Ilinca Goia, Oana Ștefănescu, Constantin Bărbulescu, Claudiu Trandafir, Mircea Caraman', 'R', 'As the millenium draws near, an evil being awakens. Fused to an ancient Talisman for centuries -- Theriel, the Black Angel is summoned from his resting place to usher in the end of the world. The ghastly messenger must claim seven human sacrifices to complete the ritual and open the gates of Hell. A teenage boy and girl have been chosen to assist the angel in its deadly mission, yet they alone are the world''s only hope for salvation.', 'As the millenium draws near, an evil being awakens. Fused to an ancient Talisman for centuries -- Theriel, the Black Angel is summoned from his resting place to usher in the end of the world. The ghastly messenger must claim seven human sacrifices to complete the ritual and open the gates of Hell. A teenage boy and girl have been chosen to assist the angel in its deadly mission, yet they alone are the world''s only hope for salvation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elUiODkTakLC2k2wCKEJWeAC3NG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114684'),
  ('158953773392527681', 'Talk', 1997, 'Drama', 'Lukas Moodysson, Ulf Brantås', 'Lukas Moodysson', 'Sten Ljunggren, Cecilia Frode, Erich Hörtnagl, Sara Ragnarsson, Grazyna Göransson, Stig Gustavsson', null, 'Birger is old and retired from work, but he still goes back to work since he has nothing else to do. Back home he gets a rare visitor: a girl from Hare Krishna recruiting new members.', 'Birger is old and retired from work, but he still goes back to work since he has nothing else to do. Back home he gets a rare visitor: a girl from Hare Krishna recruiting new members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idasXom6cvFrag61U37Xuy691Ce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47476'),
