  ('724449983607566704', 'Talking Funny', 2011, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'John Moffitt', null, 'Ricky Gervais, Louis C.K., Jerry Seinfeld, Chris Rock', null, 'What does it mean to be a successful comedian? How far can the boundaries of taste be pushed to get a laugh? Four top comics, Ricky Gervais, Louis C.K., Jerry Seinfeld and Chris Rock, discuss and debate their craft.', 'What does it mean to be a successful comedian? How far can the boundaries of taste be pushed to get a laugh? Four top comics, Ricky Gervais, Louis C.K., Jerry Seinfeld and Chris Rock, discuss and debate their craft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmH2WijtVeAKHPeQ6jPsCaLsf2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62425'),
