  ('927512194173344414', 'Tall Girl', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Matthew Sewell, Eric Alan Edwards, Nzingha Stewart', 'Sam Wolfson', 'Ava Michelle, Sabrina Carpenter, Steve Zahn, Griffin Gluck, Clara Wilsey, Paris Berelc, Angela Kinsey, Bria Condon', 'PG', 'Jodi, the tallest girl in her high school, has always felt uncomfortable in her own skin. But after years of slouching, being made fun of, and avoiding attention at all costs, Jodi finally decides to find the confidence to stand tall.', 'Jodi, the tallest girl in her high school, has always felt uncomfortable in her own skin. But after years of slouching, being made fun of, and avoiding attention at all costs, Jodi finally decides to find the confidence to stand tall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0clsFEXidLVJ0TueqWOvvImOMh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625450'),
