  ('1020426614942778978', 'Tall in the Saddle', 1944, 'Western', 'Edwin L. Marin, Robert De Grasse, Harry Scott', 'Paul Fix, Michael Hogan', 'John Wayne, Ella Raines, Ward Bond, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Audrey Long, Elisabeth Risdon, Donald Douglas, Paul Fix', 'NR', 'When Rocklin arrives in a western town he finds that the rancher who hired him as a foreman has been murdered. He is out to solve the murder and thwart the scheming to take the ranch from its rightful owner.', 'When Rocklin arrives in a western town he finds that the rancher who hired him as a foreman has been murdered. He is out to solve the murder and thwart the scheming to take the ranch from its rightful owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1y566vrPxOXrTFJ9USp4aSTJ43S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15264'),
