  ('904367667884722675', 'Tall Man Riding', 1955, 'Action, Western', 'Lesley Selander, Philip Quinn, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Joseph Hoffman', 'Randolph Scott, Dorothy Malone, Peggie Castle, William Ching, John Baragrey, Robert Barrat, John Dehner, Paul Richards', 'NR', 'Still seeking revenge against ranch owner Tuck Ordway for publicly whipping him years earlier and breaking up his relationship with Ordway''s daughter, cowboy Larry Madden plans to oust Ordway from his ranch by having his claim to the land declared invalid. Ordway''s daughter Corinna, believing Madden to be the cause of the family''s recent misfortunes, is unaware that the local saloon owner also has designs upon the Ordway holdings.', 'Still seeking revenge against ranch owner Tuck Ordway for publicly whipping him years earlier and breaking up his relationship with Ordway''s daughter, cowboy Larry Madden plans to oust Ordway from his ranch by having his claim to the land declared invalid. Ordway''s daughter Corinna, believing Madden to be the cause of the family''s recent misfortunes, is unaware that the local saloon owner also has designs upon the Ordway holdings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUp6kPi9YOs6yjxK2LvRQskHz2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85601'),
  ('842887978151673543', 'Tall Story', 1960, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joshua Logan, Ellsworth Fredericks', 'Julius J. Epstein', 'Jane Fonda, Anthony Perkins, Ray Walston, Marc Connelly, Tom Laughlin, Barbara Darrow, Murray Hamilton, Anne Jackson', 'NR', 'A young insecure college sportsman is in trouble. He wants to marry his very straightforward girlfriend, but has no money. When he is offered a bribe to fix a game, he is torn even more about the matter.', 'A young insecure college sportsman is in trouble. He wants to marry his very straightforward girlfriend, but has no money. When he is offered a bribe to fix a game, he is torn even more about the matter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7j5iMq8SQO2EwFdcUBf67zix4PK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86297'),
  ('218276584962916447', 'Tall Tale: The Unbelievable Adventure', 1995, 'Adventure, Family, Western', 'Jeremiah S. Chechik, Janusz Kamiński, Ernie F. Orsatti', 'Steve Bloom, Robert Rodat', 'Patrick Swayze, Oliver Platt, Roger Aaron Brown, Nick Stahl, Scott Glenn, Stephen Lang, Jared Harris, Catherine O''Hara', 'PG', 'A young boy draws on the inspiration of legendary western characters to find the strength to fight an evil land baron in the old west who wants to steal his family''s farm and destroy their idyllic community. When Daniel Hackett sees his father Jonas gravely wounded by the villainous Stiles, his first urge is for his family to flee the danger, and give up their life on a farm which Daniel has come to despise anyway. Going alone to a lake to try to decide what to do, he falls asleep on a boat and wakes to find himself in the wild west, in the company of such "tall tale" legends as Pecos Bill, Paul Bunyan, John Henry and Calamity Jane. Together, they battle the same villains Daniel is facing in his "real" world, ending with a heroic confrontation in which the boy stands up to Stiles and his henchmen, and rallies his neighbors to fight back against land grabbers who want to destroy their town.', 'A young boy draws on the inspiration of legendary western characters to find the strength to fight an evil land baron in the old west who wants to steal his family''s farm and destroy their idyllic community. When Daniel Hackett sees his father Jonas gravely wounded by the villainous Stiles, his first urge is for his family to flee the danger, and give up their life on a farm which Daniel has come to despise anyway. Going alone to a lake to try to decide what to do, he falls asleep on a boat and wakes to find himself in the wild west, in the company of such "tall tale" legends as Pecos Bill, Paul Bunyan, John Henry and Calamity Jane. Together, they battle the same villains Daniel is facing in his "real" world, ending with a heroic confrontation in which the boy stands up to Stiles and his henchmen, and rallies his neighbors to fight back against land grabbers who want to destroy their town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/di43EvahPBbdTgZrBxx8yZjvFu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41841'),
