  ('490387636352118110', 'Talladega Nights: The Ballad of Ricky Bobby', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Paul Schneider, Oliver Wood, Adam McKay', 'Adam McKay, Will Ferrell', 'Will Ferrell, John C. Reilly, Sacha Baron Cohen, Gary Cole, Leslie Bibb, Michael Clarke Duncan, Jane Lynch, Amy Adams', 'PG-13', 'The fastest man on four wheels, Ricky Bobby, is one of the greatest drivers in NASCAR history. A big, hairy American winning machine, Ricky has everything a dimwitted daredevil could want, a luxurious mansion, a smokin'' hot wife, and all the fast food he can eat. But Ricky''s turbo-charged lifestyle hits an unexpected speed bump when he''s bested by flamboyant Euro-idiot Jean Girard and reduced to a fear-ridden wreck.', 'The fastest man on four wheels, Ricky Bobby, is one of the greatest drivers in NASCAR history. A big, hairy American winning machine, Ricky has everything a dimwitted daredevil could want, a luxurious mansion, a smokin'' hot wife, and all the fast food he can eat. But Ricky''s turbo-charged lifestyle hits an unexpected speed bump when he''s bested by flamboyant Euro-idiot Jean Girard and reduced to a fear-ridden wreck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iCiTqsmJz1mO85AHzTiHNkRmb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9718'),
