  ('820200605052766769', 'Tammy and the T-Rex', 1994, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Romance, Comedy', 'Stewart Raffill, Roger Olkowski', 'Stewart Raffill, Gary Brockette', 'Denise Richards, Paul Walker, George Pilgrim, John Franklin, Terry Kiser, Theo Forsett, Ellen Dubin, George Buck Flower', 'NR', 'An evil scientist implants the brain of a murdered high school student into an animatronic Tyrannosaurus, who later wreaks vengeance on the bullies who killed him, and is reunited with his sweetheart.', 'An evil scientist implants the brain of a murdered high school student into an animatronic Tyrannosaurus, who later wreaks vengeance on the bullies who killed him, and is reunited with his sweetheart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uT3W8PIO0NUZqaSxsgNVKoDij1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55563'),
