  ('746331461208991635', 'Tange Sazen and the Pot Worth a Million Ryo', 1935, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sadao Yamanaka, Jun Yasumoto', 'Shintarō Mimura', 'Denjirō Ōkōchi, Taro Soharu, Kunitaro Sawamura, Ranko Hanai, Reizaburo Yamamoto, Kiyozo Shinbashi, Minoru Takase, Sōji Kiyokawa', null, 'A man gets rid of a cheap pot without knowing it contains a map to a treasure. As word spreads, many join in hunting it.', 'A man gets rid of a cheap pot without knowing it contains a map to a treasure. As word spreads, many join in hunting it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lh34UgRQHrVo3g7qzskhqRpr4GB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112501'),
  ('6723962671483349', 'Tangerine', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sean Baker, Radium Cheung, Sean Baker', 'Sean Baker, Chris Bergoch', 'Kitana Kiki Rodriguez, Mya Taylor, Karren Karagulian, Mickey O''Hagan, Alla Tumanian, James Ransone, Luiza Nersisyan, Arsen Grigoryan', 'R', 'It''s Christmas Eve in Tinseltown and Sin-Dee is back on the block. Upon hearing that her pimp boyfriend hasn''t been faithful during the 28 days she was locked up, the working girl and her best friend, Alexandra, embark on a mission to get to the bottom of the scandalous rumor. Their rip-roaring odyssey leads them through various subcultures of Los Angeles, including an Armenian family dealing with their own repercussions of infidelity.', 'It''s Christmas Eve in Tinseltown and Sin-Dee is back on the block. Upon hearing that her pimp boyfriend hasn''t been faithful during the 28 days she was locked up, the working girl and her best friend, Alexandra, embark on a mission to get to the bottom of the scandalous rumor. Their rip-roaring odyssey leads them through various subcultures of Los Angeles, including an Armenian family dealing with their own repercussions of infidelity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EKLR5c61XQzBTeMokFrmS3kdt8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308084'),
  ('675461789659836196', 'Tangled', 2001, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Romance', 'Jay Lowi, Bobby Bukowski', 'Jeffrey Lieber', 'Rachael Leigh Cook, Shawn Hatosy, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Estella Warren, Lorraine Bracco, Dwayne Hill, Joyce Gordon, Jane Moffat', 'R', 'A young man is found bruised, beaten and stumbling down a secluded road. As the police try to piece together what happened, the convoluted relationship between a young woman and her two suitors gradually emerges.', 'A young man is found bruised, beaten and stumbling down a secluded road. As the police try to piece together what happened, the convoluted relationship between a young woman and her two suitors gradually emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2b2Vm0UZGTSZh0pNr3AS10DsMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51986'),
  ('665271667176501017', 'Tangled', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Nathan Greno, Byron Howard, Dan Cooper', 'Dan Fogelman', 'Mandy Moore, Zachary Levi, Donna Murphy, Ron Perlman, M.C. Gainey, Jeffrey Tambor, Brad Garrett, Paul F. Tompkins', 'PG', 'Feisty teenager Rapunzel, who has long and magical hair, wants to go and see sky lanterns on her eighteenth birthday, but she''s bound to a tower by her overprotective mother. She strikes a deal with Flynn Rider, a charming wanted thief, and the duo set off on an action-packed escapade.', 'Feisty teenager Rapunzel, who has long and magical hair, wants to go and see sky lanterns on her eighteenth birthday, but she''s bound to a tower by her overprotective mother. She strikes a deal with Flynn Rider, a charming wanted thief, and the duo set off on an action-packed escapade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym7Kst6a4uodryxqbGOxmewF235.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38757'),
  ('537003796277070557', 'Tangled Ever After', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Action, Family', 'Byron Howard, Nathan Greno, Aaron Adams', 'Nathan Greno, Byron Howard', 'Mandy Moore, Zachary Levi, Alan Dale, Paul F. Tompkins, Kari Wahlgren, Mark Allan Stewart, Byron Howard, Nathan Greno', 'G', 'The kingdom is in a festive mood as everyone gathers for the royal wedding of Rapunzel and Flynn. However, when Pascal and Maximus, as flower chameleon and ring bearer, respectively, lose the gold bands, a frenzied search and recovery mission gets underway. As the desperate duo tries to find the rings before anyone discovers that they’re missing, they leave behind a trail of comical chaos that includes flying lanterns, a flock of doves, a wine barrel barricade and a very sticky finale. Will Maximus and Pascal save the day and make it to the church in time? And will they ever get Flynn’s nose right?', 'The kingdom is in a festive mood as everyone gathers for the royal wedding of Rapunzel and Flynn. However, when Pascal and Maximus, as flower chameleon and ring bearer, respectively, lose the gold bands, a frenzied search and recovery mission gets underway. As the desperate duo tries to find the rings before anyone discovers that they’re missing, they leave behind a trail of comical chaos that includes flying lanterns, a flock of doves, a wine barrel barricade and a very sticky finale. Will Maximus and Pascal save the day and make it to the church in time? And will they ever get Flynn’s nose right?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IeMW79OxftIUoR5duxyQ4LW5Iy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82881'),
  ('903375359243918086', 'Tangled: Before Ever After', 2017, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Tom Caulfield, Stephen Sandoval', 'Jase Ricci', 'Mandy Moore, Zachary Levi, Eden Espinosa, Clancy Brown, Julie Bowen, Laura Benanti, Jeffrey Tambor, M.C. Gainey', 'G', 'Rapunzel grapples with the responsibilities of being a princess and the overprotective ways of her father. While she wholeheartedly loves Eugene, Rapunzel does not share his immediate desire to get married and settle down within the castle walls. Determined to live life on her own terms, she and her tough-as-nails Lady-in-Waiting Cassandra embark on a secret adventure where they encounter mystical rocks that magically cause Rapunzel''s long blonde hair to grow back. Impossible to break and difficult to hide, Rapunzel must learn to embrace her hair and all that it represents.', 'Rapunzel grapples with the responsibilities of being a princess and the overprotective ways of her father. While she wholeheartedly loves Eugene, Rapunzel does not share his immediate desire to get married and settle down within the castle walls. Determined to live life on her own terms, she and her tough-as-nails Lady-in-Waiting Cassandra embark on a secret adventure where they encounter mystical rocks that magically cause Rapunzel''s long blonde hair to grow back. Impossible to break and difficult to hide, Rapunzel must learn to embrace her hair and all that it represents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zj82L9maBSW6CAVZltBoFBSuTk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438747'),
  ('795472955495949553', 'Tango', 1985, 'Animation', 'Zbigniew Rybczyński, Zbigniew Rybczyński', 'Zbigniew Rybczyński', null, null, 'A static camera observes a room as it slowly fills with thirty-six characters from different stages of life, looping further through an absurd dance of social disconnection as each character moves in.', 'A static camera observes a room as it slowly fills with thirty-six characters from different stages of life, looping further through an absurd dance of social disconnection as each character moves in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haq47eEoNGhLjVEtiqxcH6MUpOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48496'),
  ('146702673152990961', 'Tango', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Patrice Leconte, Eduardo Serra', 'Patrick Dewolf', 'Philippe Noiret, Richard Bohringer, Thierry Lhermitte, Carole Bouquet, Jean Rochefort, Miou-Miou, Judith Godrèche, Michèle Laroque', null, 'Vincent, a stunt pilot, is acquitted of murdering his wife and her lover. However, a few years later, L''Elegant, the Judge in the case, comes to blackmail him. The Judge''s nephew, Paul, is having trouble with his wife and they demand that Vincent kill her. The Judge, a confirmed bachelor, takes Paul and Vincent on the road to search for Paul''s wife Marie. The three men get on well together, and spend their time discussing their relationship with women.', 'Vincent, a stunt pilot, is acquitted of murdering his wife and her lover. However, a few years later, L''Elegant, the Judge in the case, comes to blackmail him. The Judge''s nephew, Paul, is having trouble with his wife and they demand that Vincent kill her. The Judge, a confirmed bachelor, takes Paul and Vincent on the road to search for Paul''s wife Marie. The three men get on well together, and spend their time discussing their relationship with women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFrckeBscdJO0UiLzi0SfUHT14m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66447'),
  ('1136774885913006973', 'Tango', 1998, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Carlos Saura, Vittorio Storaro', 'Carlos Saura', 'Miguel Ángel Solá, Cecilia Narova, Mía Maestro, Juan Carlos Copes, Carlos Rivarola ..., Sandra Ballesteros, Óscar Cardozo Ocampo, Enrique Pinti', 'PG-13', 'A dangerous love affair inspires a director to create the most spectacular and boldly seductive dance film ever made.', 'A dangerous love affair inspires a director to create the most spectacular and boldly seductive dance film ever made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87Ze0JLbWYuYbWc1qf6aGxHipnI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65749'),
  ('1100282703248182903', 'Tango & Cash', 1989, 'Action, Thriller, Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Donald E. Thorin, Andrei Konchalovsky, Peter MacDonald', 'Randy Feldman', 'Sylvester Stallone, Kurt Russell, Teri Hatcher, Jack Palance, Brion James, James Hong, Marc Alaimo, Philip Tan', 'R', 'Ray Tango and Gabriel Cash are two successful narcotics detectives who can''t stand each other. Crime lord Yves Perret, furious at the loss of income they have caused him, plots an elaborate revenge against them.', 'Ray Tango and Gabriel Cash are two successful narcotics detectives who can''t stand each other. Crime lord Yves Perret, furious at the loss of income they have caused him, plots an elaborate revenge against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxxxjTu87OSmQYkMFF7MgOEDXRn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9618'),
  ('634605654667327393', 'Tango Bar', 1935, 'Music, Drama', 'John Reinhardt, William Miller', 'Alfredo Le Pera', 'Carlos Gardel, Rosita Moreno, Enrique de Rosas, Tito Lusiardo, José Luis Tortosa, Colette D''Arville, Manuel Peluffo, Suzanne Dulier', null, 'Ricardo Fuentes (Carlos Gardel) leaves Buenos Aires after loosing in horse races to go to Barcelona, where he plans to open a tango bar, a new concept of tango dance show and dance saloon. On the ship he meets Laura Montalván (Rosita Moreno) who happens to be a thief working with a thief pal. Ricardo watches them robbing a lady''s bracelet aboard but decides not to report them because he has fallen in love with Laura. Once in Barcelona, he opens the tango bar but Laura''s partner tells him he sold the bracelet and now needs to recover it to avoid both Laura and him going to jail.', 'Ricardo Fuentes (Carlos Gardel) leaves Buenos Aires after loosing in horse races to go to Barcelona, where he plans to open a tango bar, a new concept of tango dance show and dance saloon. On the ship he meets Laura Montalván (Rosita Moreno) who happens to be a thief working with a thief pal. Ricardo watches them robbing a lady''s bracelet aboard but decides not to report them because he has fallen in love with Laura. Once in Barcelona, he opens the tango bar but Laura''s partner tells him he sold the bracelet and now needs to recover it to avoid both Laura and him going to jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mR5Lr5R8ZhcF5YMGPquhkBNhBhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170639'),
  ('249937228496863083', 'Tango Charlie', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Mani Shankar', null, 'Ajay Devgn, Bobby Deol, Chitram Basha, Alok Nath, Suniel Shetty, Nandana Sen, Tanishaa Mukerji, Sanjay Mishra', null, 'Indian Army Sepoy Tarun Chauhan is assigned to proceed to Northeastern part of India that has been rocked by riots and violence with orders to report to his superior, Havaldar Mohammed Ali. Once there, he comes to know that things can be quiet for weeks, following by sporadic violence, and casualties on both sides. His group also comes under attack by vicious terrorists, who like to cut an ear from a dead body, then leave the body as bait, in order to kill anyone who comes to the rescue. This is where Tarun makes his first kill.', 'Indian Army Sepoy Tarun Chauhan is assigned to proceed to Northeastern part of India that has been rocked by riots and violence with orders to report to his superior, Havaldar Mohammed Ali. Once there, he comes to know that things can be quiet for weeks, following by sporadic violence, and casualties on both sides. His group also comes under attack by vicious terrorists, who like to cut an ear from a dead body, then leave the body as bait, in order to kill anyone who comes to the rescue. This is where Tarun makes his first kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGfWsWcndUpzrdxZ8uddKYlJUsk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301687'),
  ('435835745818757935', 'Tango Libre', 2012, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Frédéric Fonteyne, Virginie Saint-Martin', 'Anne Paulicevich, Philippe Blasband', 'François Damiens, Sergi López, Jan Hammenecker, Anne Paulicevich, Zacharie Chasseriaud, Jaco Van Dormael', null, 'A prison guard is attracted to a woman at his weekly tango class. They meet again when she visits her husband in the prison where he works and he is drawn into her complicated romantic life. Meanwhile the prisoners are learning the tango.', 'A prison guard is attracted to a woman at his weekly tango class. They meet again when she visits her husband in the prison where he works and he is drawn into her complicated romantic life. Meanwhile the prisoners are learning the tango.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkKHqtj4fvf9X8TMwQgddATau19.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144752'),
  ('823224083266098650', 'Tango Tangles', 1914, 'Comedy', 'Mack Sennett, Frank D. Williams', 'Mack Sennett, Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Ford Sterling, Roscoe Arbuckle, Chester Conklin, Minta Durfee, Sadie Lampe, Edgar Kennedy, Dave Morris', 'NR', 'In a dance hall, two members of the orchestra and a tipsy dancer fight over the hat check girl.', 'In a dance hall, two members of the orchestra and a tipsy dancer fight over the hat check girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOeFttWSuEuafCdfXfiMSEK0JI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53370'),
  ('974090860678121026', 'Tangos Are for Two', 1998, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Jaime Chávarri, Abelardo Kuschnir, Gustavo Wagner', 'Raúl Brambilla, Óscar Plasencia', 'Darío Grandinetti, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Juan Echanove, Ulises Dumont, Raúl Brambilla, Carlos Carella, Ramón Rivero, Pepe Soriano', null, 'A woman''s voice says she was wife to Renzo Franchi and Carlos Gardel (1890-1935), Argentina''s great tango singer. People say she''s crazy. Her story unfolds. Buenos Aires, 1933: Juana Romero, a seamstress who lives for the music of Gardel, dumps her boyfriend Gustavo for Renzo, a singer who looks like Gardel. She insists that his trio performs Gardel''s tangos, which leads to Renzo recording a Ford commercial when Gardel himself is overbooked. The trio, with Joanna in tow, goes on an ill-fated tour of points north. The couple breaks up: she goes home and he tries to get to New York. Fate steps in, and once again he''s called upon to pose as Gardel. Then, legend and a bracelet take over. Written by', 'A woman''s voice says she was wife to Renzo Franchi and Carlos Gardel (1890-1935), Argentina''s great tango singer. People say she''s crazy. Her story unfolds. Buenos Aires, 1933: Juana Romero, a seamstress who lives for the music of Gardel, dumps her boyfriend Gustavo for Renzo, a singer who looks like Gardel. She insists that his trio performs Gardel''s tangos, which leads to Renzo recording a Ford commercial when Gardel himself is overbooked. The trio, with Joanna in tow, goes on an ill-fated tour of points north. The couple breaks up: she goes home and he tries to get to New York. Fate steps in, and once again he''s called upon to pose as Gardel. Then, legend and a bracelet take over. Written by', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueETRSrKjhyqM8cxbPyDDAI7yeH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256916'),
  ('338061223013343196', 'Tangos, the Exile of Gardel', 1985, 'Music, Drama', 'Fernando E. Solanas, Tomás Sánchez, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Djamila Olivessi, Fernando E. Solanas', 'Marie Laforêt, Philippe Léotard, Miguel Ángel Solá, Georges Wilson, Marina Vlady, Ana María Picchio, Gabriela Toscano, Nora Codina', null, 'Some Argentinians, exiled in Paris, decide to put on a tango-ballet, dedicated to Carlos Gardel, a legendary Argentinian tango star.', 'Some Argentinians, exiled in Paris, decide to put on a tango-ballet, dedicated to Carlos Gardel, a legendary Argentinian tango star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVwLXJGbU9mGEcWXJ6XWX9PH9LH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182469'),
  ('447841202359720188', 'Tanguy', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Étienne Chatiliez, Philippe Welt', 'Étienne Chatiliez, Laurent Chouchan', 'Éric Berger, Sabine Azéma, André Dussollier, Hélène Duc, Aurore Clément, Jean-Paul Rouve, André Wilms, Richard Guedj', null, 'Tanguy is 28 years old and still living with his parents. They think it''s time he moves out. He doesn''t, so they hatch a plan.', 'Tanguy is 28 years old and still living with his parents. They think it''s time he moves out. He doesn''t, so they hatch a plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTSALpAPB5ANmplvBqwChgv1Hun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2029'),
  ('731759614097341011', 'Tanguy, le retour', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Étienne Chatiliez, Pierre-Jacques Bénichou, Guinal Riou', 'Laurent Chouchan, Étienne Chatiliez', 'Sabine Azéma, André Dussollier, Éric Berger, Emilie Yili Kang, Nicolas Tang, Weiting Chao, Olivier Claverie, Domitille Bioret', null, '16 years later, Tanguy, now 44, returns to his parents'' house with his daughter Zhu under his arm because Meï Lin left him. Disappointed to see their "little one" in this state, Paul and Edith do everything to give him a taste for life, without realizing that by doing so, they braid the rope to hang themselves. Because Tanguy is starting to feel good with his parents.', '16 years later, Tanguy, now 44, returns to his parents'' house with his daughter Zhu under his arm because Meï Lin left him. Disappointed to see their "little one" in this state, Paul and Edith do everything to give him a taste for life, without realizing that by doing so, they braid the rope to hang themselves. Because Tanguy is starting to feel good with his parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43oLXlxwgZ7ScHU8ubLLwPm4dez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528773'),
  ('1039507885454408634', 'Tanhaji: The Unsung Warrior', 2020, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Om Raut, Tejas Arya, Shraddha Ghanekar', 'Om Raut, Prakash R. Kapadia', 'Ajay Devgn, Saif Ali Khan, Kajol, Sharad Kelkar, Reyhna Malhotra, Luke Kenny, Padmavati Rao, Shashank Shende', null, 'When Aurangzeb recruits his trusted soldier Udaybhan to control the Kondhana fort, Shivaji''s military leader Tanhaji Malusare and his army of Maratha warriors set out to recapture the fortress.', 'When Aurangzeb recruits his trusted soldier Udaybhan to control the Kondhana fort, Shivaji''s military leader Tanhaji Malusare and his army of Maratha warriors set out to recapture the fortress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZhgcUVwV7ocglL5XDq4ygsfXqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584850'),
  ('536074369781973100', 'Tank', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Marvin J. Chomsky, Donald H. Birnkrant', 'Dan Gordon', 'James Garner, Shirley Jones, C. Thomas Howell, Mark Herrier, Sandy Ward, Jenilee Harrison, James Cromwell, Dorian Harewood', 'PG', 'After relocating his family - and his prized restored Sherman tank - to a small Georgia town, Sargeant Major Zack Carey butts heads with the local sheriff. Zack doesn''t agree with the ways of the local police, and when the sheriff goes after Zack''s son, it''s time for Zack to roll out the Sherman tank and wage a little war of his own.', 'After relocating his family - and his prized restored Sherman tank - to a small Georgia town, Sargeant Major Zack Carey butts heads with the local sheriff. Zack doesn''t agree with the ways of the local police, and when the sheriff goes after Zack''s son, it''s time for Zack to roll out the Sherman tank and wage a little war of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FIacxCzFP3eLndNVvhRlFjNVc6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21871'),
  ('429361514514131950', 'Tank Force!', 1958, 'Drama, War', 'Terence Young, Ted Moore, Cyril J. Knowles', 'Richard Maibaum, Terence Young', 'Victor Mature, Leo Genn, Bonar Colleano, Anthony Newley, Alfred Burke, Luciana Paluzzi, George Coulouris, Sean Kelly', 'NR', 'During World War II, members of a British tank unit in northern Africa are captured and held prisoners by Germans.', 'During World War II, members of a British tank unit in northern Africa are captured and held prisoners by Germans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1seOj2e9aSpa08KDwag2bkXi9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241081'),
  ('783154862157493769', 'Tank Girl', 1995, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Gale Tattersall, Rachel Talalay, Charles Dwight Lee', 'Tedi Sarafian', 'Lori Petty, Naomi Watts, Malcolm McDowell, Ice-T, Jeff Kober, Reg E. Cathey, Scott Coffey, Don Harvey', 'R', 'After a comet disrupts the rain cycle of Earth, the planet has become a desolate, barren desert by the year 2033. With resources scarce, Kesslee, head of the powerful and evil Water & Power Corporation, the de facto government, has taken control of the water supply. Unwilling to cower under Kesslee''s tyrannical rule, a pair of outlaws known as Tank Girl and Jet Girl rise up, joining the mysterious rebel Rippers to destroy the corrupt system.', 'After a comet disrupts the rain cycle of Earth, the planet has become a desolate, barren desert by the year 2033. With resources scarce, Kesslee, head of the powerful and evil Water & Power Corporation, the de facto government, has taken control of the water supply. Unwilling to cower under Kesslee''s tyrannical rule, a pair of outlaws known as Tank Girl and Jet Girl rise up, joining the mysterious rebel Rippers to destroy the corrupt system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpX63vJd6k5fMTudLaEOw9ffX8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9067'),
  ('265531985288639093', 'Tankers', 2018, 'War, History, Drama', 'Elena Ivanova, Konstantin Maksimov', 'Valeriya Baykeeva', 'Andrey Chernyshov, Vladimir Yepifantsev, Olga Pogodina, Sergey Gorobchenko, Nikolai Dobrynin, Oleg Fomin, Vasiliy Sedykh, Vladimir Kochetkov', null, 'The film is based on the true story about a Soviet KV-1 crew of a Soviet KV-1 tank, under the command of Semyon Konovalov , whom despite being heavily outnumbered by German forces, destroyed 16 tanks, 2 armored vehicles and 8 other enemy vehicles at the village of Nizhnemytyakin, Tarasovsky district, Rostov region on July 13th, 1942.', 'The film is based on the true story about a Soviet KV-1 crew of a Soviet KV-1 tank, under the command of Semyon Konovalov , whom despite being heavily outnumbered by German forces, destroyed 16 tanks, 2 armored vehicles and 8 other enemy vehicles at the village of Nizhnemytyakin, Tarasovsky district, Rostov region on July 13th, 1942.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ua5RBBd421zvHzJzug71fnJmybo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:556018'),
  ('650298213972965096', 'Tanks a Million', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Fred Guiol, Robert Pittack', 'Edward E. Seabrook, Paul Gerard Smith, Warren Wilson', 'William Tracy, James Gleason, Noah Beery Jr., Joe Sawyer, Elyse Knox, Douglas Fowley, Knox Manning, Frank Faylen', 'NR', 'Chubby William Tracy starred as Dodo Doubleday, a feckless Army draftee blessed (or cursed) with a photographic memory. Inexplicably promoted to sergeant, Doubleday becomes the bane of topkick Sgt. Ames'' (Joe Sawyer) existence.', 'Chubby William Tracy starred as Dodo Doubleday, a feckless Army draftee blessed (or cursed) with a photographic memory. Inexplicably promoted to sergeant, Doubleday becomes the bane of topkick Sgt. Ames'' (Joe Sawyer) existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tK4O2SL8ndBhSA1WTywSgDuZueF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96134'),
  ('457021045202523769', 'Tanna', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Martin Butler, Bentley Dean, Bentley Dean', 'Martin Butler, John Collee, Bentley Dean', 'Mungau Dain, Marie Wawa, Marceline Rofit, Kapan Cook, Charlie Kahla, Lingai Kowia, Dadwa Mungau, Albi Nagia', null, 'In a traditional tribal society in the South Pacific, a young girl, Wawa, falls in love with her chief’s grandson, Dain. When an inter-tribal war escalates, Wawa is unknowingly betrothed as part of a peace deal. The young lovers run away, refusing her arranged fate. They must choose between their hearts and the future of the tribe, while the villagers must wrestle with preserving their traditional culture and adapting it to the increasing outside demands for individual freedom.', 'In a traditional tribal society in the South Pacific, a young girl, Wawa, falls in love with her chief’s grandson, Dain. When an inter-tribal war escalates, Wawa is unknowingly betrothed as part of a peace deal. The young lovers run away, refusing her arranged fate. They must choose between their hearts and the future of the tribe, while the villagers must wrestle with preserving their traditional culture and adapting it to the increasing outside demands for individual freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKk0Nu3dytbDzX1SFwYJvUreQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359151'),
  ('552652182376883115', 'Tanner Hall', 2009, 'Drama', 'Francesca Gregorini, Tatiana von Fürstenberg, Brian Rigney Hubbard', 'Tatiana von Fürstenberg, Francesca Gregorini', 'Rooney Mara, Georgia King, Brie Larson, Amy Ferguson, Tom Everett Scott, Amy Sedaris, Chris Kattan, Shawn Pyfrom', 'R', 'A manipulative childhood acquaintance worms her way into a teenager''s circle of friends at an all-girls boarding school.', 'A manipulative childhood acquaintance worms her way into a teenager''s circle of friends at an all-girls boarding school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoGtVlqaFWngUXuUzAS6uuNcwsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71866'),
  ('845996182943588721', 'Tanu Weds Manu', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Aanand L. Rai, Chirantan Das', 'Himanshu Sharma', 'R. Madhavan, Kangana Ranaut, Jimmy Shergill, Eijaz Khan, Deepak Dobriyal, Swara Bhasker, K.K. Raina, Rajendra Gupta', null, 'Manu comes to India to find a bride for himself and falls for Tanu at first sight but she is a free spirited girl has no plans of marrying him.', 'Manu comes to India to find a bride for himself and falls for Tanu at first sight but she is a free spirited girl has no plans of marrying him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSp16ilrwEyeBorFcBdFtYjhMUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58333'),
  ('1127788586774223707', 'Tanu Weds Manu: Returns', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Aanand L. Rai, Rishika Kumar, Chirantan Das', 'Himanshu Sharma', 'Kangana Ranaut, R. Madhavan, Jimmy Shergill, Deepak Dobriyal, Swara Bhasker, Eijaz Khan, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Rajendra Gupta', null, 'After Tanu and Manu''s marriage breaks apart, the latter finds himself smitten by Datto, a lookalike of his ex-wife. But the estranged couple''s feelings begin to spark again.', 'After Tanu and Manu''s marriage breaks apart, the latter finds himself smitten by Datto, a lookalike of his ex-wife. But the estranged couple''s feelings begin to spark again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sO3XD6ZDZetb2N6YDQrHLTVQrfq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336211'),
  ('1014204327913948562', 'Tanya''s Island', 1980, 'Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Alfred Sole, Mark Irwin', 'Pierre Brousseau', 'Vanity, Richard Sargent, Mariette Levesque, Don McLeod, Donny Burns', 'R', 'Tanya is a female model who lives with her boyfriend Lobo, a surrealist painter who is extremely violent. Subjected to Lobo''s constant abuse, Tanya dreams of escaping to a desert island, which comes true. The only other being on her island is an enormous blue-eyed man-ape who was born from one of Lobo''s paintings.', 'Tanya is a female model who lives with her boyfriend Lobo, a surrealist painter who is extremely violent. Subjected to Lobo''s constant abuse, Tanya dreams of escaping to a desert island, which comes true. The only other being on her island is an enormous blue-eyed man-ape who was born from one of Lobo''s paintings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xClSjkvPfgCkcO7nXwj3VehEHUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68482'),
  ('413451887200536817', 'Taoism Drunkard', 1984, 'Comedy, Action, Horror, Fantasy', 'Yuen Cheung-Yan, Ma Koon-Wah', 'Mai Kei', 'Yuen Yat-Choh, Yuen Cheung-Yan, Chu Hoi-Ling, Lo Pi-Ling, Yuen Shun-Yi, Hilda Liu Hao-Yi, Yen Shi-Kwan, Mandy Chan Chi-Man', 'NR', 'A Taoist priest is ordered to find a Cherry Boy to appease his temple''s ancestors. The boy in question is a young man who lives with his grandmother, trying to protect a sacred writ from a bright red, snarling bad guy. And let''s just say insanity follows!', 'A Taoist priest is ordered to find a Cherry Boy to appease his temple''s ancestors. The boy in question is a young man who lives with his grandmother, trying to protect a sacred writ from a bright red, snarling bad guy. And let''s just say insanity follows!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPoImzcTzlo56R9oKjurzqNVPqP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16036'),
  ('940750426592142945', 'Tap', 1989, 'Drama, Music', 'Nick Castle, David Gribble', 'Nick Castle', 'Gregory Hines, Suzzanne Douglas, Sammy Davis Jr., Savion Glover, Joe Morton, Dick Anthony Williams, Sandman Sims, Bunny Briggs', null, 'Max Washington has just been released from prison after serving time for burglary. He returns to his old hangout, a hoofer club. His old girl friend, Amy, who still works at the club as a Tap instructor, is less than thrilled to see him. Her father, Little Mo, is happy to see him, because he has plans for a show involving Max. In addition, Max''s old partners in crime have another job for him.', 'Max Washington has just been released from prison after serving time for burglary. He returns to his old hangout, a hoofer club. His old girl friend, Amy, who still works at the club as a Tap instructor, is less than thrilled to see him. Her father, Little Mo, is happy to see him, because he has plans for a show involving Max. In addition, Max''s old partners in crime have another job for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjy45SaOAzcyReyl4pr6jWss6uS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16560'),
  ('921406556931428068', 'Tap Roots', 1948, 'Drama, War, Western', 'George Marshall, Winton C. Hoch, Lionel Lindon', 'Alan Le May', 'Van Heflin, Susan Hayward, Boris Karloff, Julie London, Whitfield Connor, Ward Bond, Richard Long, Arthur Shields', 'NR', 'Set at the beginning of the Civil War, Tap Roots is all about a county in Mississippi which chooses to secede from the state rather than enter the conflict. The county is protected from the Confederacy by an abolitionist and a Native American gentleman. The abolitionist''s daughter is courted by a powerful newspaper publisher when her fiance, a confederate officer, elopes with the girl''s sister. The daughter at first resists the publisher''s attentions, but turns to him for aid when her ex-fiance plans to capture the seceding county on behalf of the South.', 'Set at the beginning of the Civil War, Tap Roots is all about a county in Mississippi which chooses to secede from the state rather than enter the conflict. The county is protected from the Confederacy by an abolitionist and a Native American gentleman. The abolitionist''s daughter is courted by a powerful newspaper publisher when her fiance, a confederate officer, elopes with the girl''s sister. The daughter at first resists the publisher''s attentions, but turns to him for aid when her ex-fiance plans to capture the seceding county on behalf of the South.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/844Gez3RtTvbAgb3b9SGWp24H1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30665'),
  ('835773946584815155', 'Tapa na Pantera', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Esmir Filho, Mariana Bastos, Rafael Gomes', null, 'Maria Alice Vergueiro', null, 'Meet a Brazilian lady who uses marijuana for more than thirty years and shares her experiences with the drug.', 'Meet a Brazilian lady who uses marijuana for more than thirty years and shares her experiences with the drug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApJG19Nmwq0OJYWBT5OIRCeDcEf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432924'),
  ('901059515157184262', 'Tapas', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Cruz, José Corbacho', null, 'Ángel de Andrés López, María Galiana, Elvira Mínguez, Rubén Ochandiano, Alberto de Mendoza, Darío Paso, Alberto Jo Lee, Amparo Moreno', null, 'The film centers on a Spanish tapas bar and the love lives of the loosely interconnected people in the neighborhood surrounding the bar. The pairs of lovers include a middle aged woman and a young man; an elderly, drug dealing woman and her terminally ill husband in poor health; the tapas bar owner and his estranged wife; and two Chinese immigrants.', 'The film centers on a Spanish tapas bar and the love lives of the loosely interconnected people in the neighborhood surrounding the bar. The pairs of lovers include a middle aged woman and a young man; an elderly, drug dealing woman and her terminally ill husband in poor health; the tapas bar owner and his estranged wife; and two Chinese immigrants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTtUuXlfFyv3rUbgjs8BVaecjyc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33227'),
  ('828052841818486367', 'Tape', 2001, 'Drama', 'Richard Linklater, Maryse Alberti', 'Stephen Belber', 'Ethan Hawke, Robert Sean Leonard, Uma Thurman', 'R', 'Jon, a first-time filmmaker, finds himself in Lansing, Michigan to present his film at a local film festival. Vince, his high school friend who is now a volunteer fireman and small-time drug dealer, also visits the town to support Jon on his big day, or so it seems. After a raucous hello and much backslapping, it appears that there is an undercurrent of tension in the air.', 'Jon, a first-time filmmaker, finds himself in Lansing, Michigan to present his film at a local film festival. Vince, his high school friend who is now a volunteer fireman and small-time drug dealer, also visits the town to support Jon on his big day, or so it seems. After a raucous hello and much backslapping, it appears that there is an undercurrent of tension in the air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Flz17KOjGdGqJ2dFRhKnB7eg5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23949'),
  ('777060683902580966', 'Tape 407', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Dale Fabrigar, Everette Wallin', 'Robert Shepyer', 'Abigail Schrader, Samantha Lester, James Lyons, Melanie Munt, Samantha Sloyan', 'PG-13', 'Survivors of an airplane crash find themselves within the borders of a government testing area and pursued by predators.', 'Survivors of an airplane crash find themselves within the borders of a government testing area and pursued by predators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spsy2Zn3F9ToDGXWQDHQnSWykFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92393'),
  ('1064604113987531422', 'Tapeheads', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Bill Fishman, Bojan Bazelli, Leslie A. Leitner', 'Bill Fishman, Peter McCarthy', 'John Cusack, Tim Robbins, Mary Crosby, Clu Gulager, Katy Boyer, Jessica Walter, Sam Moore, Junior Walker', 'R', 'The story of Ivan and Josh, two dimwitted ex-security guards who love music videos. Out of work, with no job prospects, they form a music video production company. They soon learn the ins and outs of the business in LA, and with some help from Mo Fuzz, they soon become hot property. But not all goes smoothly when they try to resurrect the career of their favorite R&B duo, the Swanky Modes.', 'The story of Ivan and Josh, two dimwitted ex-security guards who love music videos. Out of work, with no job prospects, they form a music video production company. They soon learn the ins and outs of the business in LA, and with some help from Mo Fuzz, they soon become hot property. But not all goes smoothly when they try to resurrect the career of their favorite R&B duo, the Swanky Modes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVNP2JdzqKaqvOzBcYvI4s68rKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25447'),
  ('690733149388197726', 'Tapped', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Stephanie Soechtig, Jason Lindsey', 'Josh David, Jason Lindsey, Stephanie Soechtig', null, 'G', 'Is access to clean drinking water a basic human right, or a commodity that should be bought and sold like any other article of commerce? Stephanie Soechtig''s debut feature is an unflinching examination of the big business of bottled water. From the producers of Who Killed the Electric Car and I.O.U.S.A., this timely documentary is a behind-the-scenes look into the unregulated and unseen world of an industry that aims to privatize and sell back the one resource that ought never to become a commodity: our water. From the plastic production to the ocean in which so many of these bottles end up, this inspiring documentary trails the path of the bottled water industry and the communities which were the unwitting chips on the table. A powerful portrait of the lives affected by the bottled water industry, this revelatory film features those caught at the intersection of big business and the public''s right to water.', 'Is access to clean drinking water a basic human right, or a commodity that should be bought and sold like any other article of commerce? Stephanie Soechtig''s debut feature is an unflinching examination of the big business of bottled water. From the producers of Who Killed the Electric Car and I.O.U.S.A., this timely documentary is a behind-the-scenes look into the unregulated and unseen world of an industry that aims to privatize and sell back the one resource that ought never to become a commodity: our water. From the plastic production to the ocean in which so many of these bottles end up, this inspiring documentary trails the path of the bottled water industry and the communities which were the unwitting chips on the table. A powerful portrait of the lives affected by the bottled water industry, this revelatory film features those caught at the intersection of big business and the public''s right to water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izCGrNOWzqym7d4iPHv3JlOQrVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41339'),
  ('772858651195223561', 'Tapped', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Teoman Sayin', 'Elijah Baker, Teoman Sayin', 'Vianne Furey, Peter Silva, Simon Howard, Tim Sayin, Kay Boggett', null, 'Armed with Martial Arts skills honed through obsession, Nuro an autistic savant, takes justice into his own hands redefining heroism in a stylized vendetta, when his beloved Clara is victimized by a gang of local thugs.', 'Armed with Martial Arts skills honed through obsession, Nuro an autistic savant, takes justice into his own hands redefining heroism in a stylized vendetta, when his beloved Clara is victimized by a gang of local thugs.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNDNkZjUyNTYtNTBmMC00MTcxLWFhNmMtZWNjNmQ1YjdmNzkyXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:tapped-2026-1'),
  ('792090064428906351', 'Tapped Out', 2014, 'Action, Drama', 'Allan Ungar', 'Allan Ungar', 'Cody Hackman, Michael Biehn, Anderson Silva, Lyoto Machida, Martin Kove, Nick Bateman, Krzysztof Soszynski, Jess Brown', 'R', 'A disgruntled teenager, sent to do community service at a rundown Karate school, enters an MMA tournament to face the man who killed his parents.', 'A disgruntled teenager, sent to do community service at a rundown Karate school, enters an MMA tournament to face the man who killed his parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLoelSHYPWB2sYk1q3bLdVujGtp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257447'),
