  ('406568875062368966', 'TÁR', 2022, 'Music, Drama', 'Todd Field, Florian Hoffmeister, Sebastian Fahr-Brix', 'Todd Field', 'Cate Blanchett, Nina Hoss, Noémie Merlant, Sophie Kauer, Julian Glover, Mark Strong, Sylvia Flote, Allan Corduner', 'R', 'As celebrated conductor Lydia Tár starts rehearsals for a career-defining symphony, the consequences of her past choices begin to echo in the present.', 'As celebrated conductor Lydia Tár starts rehearsals for a career-defining symphony, the consequences of her past choices begin to echo in the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRVAlaU0vbG6hMf2K45NSiIyoUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:817758'),
  ('196335353792811764', 'Tara Road', 2005, 'Drama', 'Gillies MacKinnon, John de Borman', 'Shane Connaughton, Cynthia Cidre', 'Andie MacDowell, Olivia Williams, Stephen Rea, Iain Glen, Jean-Marc Barr, Heike Makatsch, August Zirner, Ruby Wax', null, 'A grieving Connecticut mother temporarily switches houses with a woman in Dublin, Ireland.', 'A grieving Connecticut mother temporarily switches houses with a woman in Dublin, Ireland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NFO90kY1mQ7eZg7PJj2yfJFk1d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3631'),
  ('712467390162102322', 'Tara vs Bilal', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Samar Iqbal, Amarjeet Singh', 'Sanyukta Shaikh Chawla', 'Harshvardhan Rane, Sonia Rathee, Mona Ambegaonkar, Niki Aneja Walia, Shagufta Ali, Deepika Amin, Raheem Mir, Pranay Manchanda', null, 'Sparks fly when vivacious yet sensitive Tara collides with a reclusive charmer Bilal in this slice of life story set in vibrant and diverse London.', 'Sparks fly when vivacious yet sensitive Tara collides with a reclusive charmer Bilal in this slice of life story set in vibrant and diverse London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIf8Ya8gL15uO1A2VBdfIArsjct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033878'),
