  ('553609680282617815', 'Tarkan and the Blood of the Vikings', 1971, 'Adventure, Fantasy, History, Action', 'Mehmet Aslan', 'Sadık Şendil, Sezgin Burak', 'Kartal Tibet, Eva Bender, Seher Şeniz, Fatma Belgen, Bilâl İnci, Can Kurt, Hüseyin Alp, Atıf Kaptan', null, 'Features a mustached villain, who is the leader of a Viking clan that worships an octopus god-monster. The Vikings wish to kidnap a beautiful girl to sacrifice her to their demigod, but the heroic Tarkan, aided by his dog, Kurt, is there to save the day.', 'Features a mustached villain, who is the leader of a Viking clan that worships an octopus god-monster. The Vikings wish to kidnap a beautiful girl to sacrifice her to their demigod, but the heroic Tarkan, aided by his dog, Kurt, is there to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/up4IeoBIZoBFE0OvO5YQptHsuKy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86256'),
  ('293672546731263712', 'Tarkan and the Silver Saddle', 1970, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, History', 'Mehmet Aslan', 'Sezgin Burak', 'Kartal Tibet, Eva Bender, Bilâl İnci, Reha Yurdakul, Kaya Volkan, Altan Günbay, Hüseyin Alp, Mehmet Ali Akpınar', null, 'Atilla the Hun gives a Silver Saddle to Altar as a gift. The intention of Kostok is the get rid of the Huns and seize the valuable saddle. Little Tarkan''s foster mother is forced to leave him in a cave. His cry attracts the attention of a wolf, who raises Tarkan like his own cub.', 'Atilla the Hun gives a Silver Saddle to Altar as a gift. The intention of Kostok is the get rid of the Huns and seize the valuable saddle. Little Tarkan''s foster mother is forced to leave him in a cave. His cry attracts the attention of a wolf, who raises Tarkan like his own cub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYu55hQXn06hEnY723gxTh0bbz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405189'),
  ('566284535843373986', 'Tarkan: The Golden Medallion', 1973, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, History', 'Mehmet Aslan, Erdoğan Engin', 'Sezgin Burak', 'Kartal Tibet, Halit Akçatepe, Eva Bender, Zeki Alasya, Birsen Ayda, Altan Günbay, Kamran Usluer, Can Kurt', null, 'Vandal king Attila''s trying to save his son kidnapped by Tarkan and stories of friends.', 'Vandal king Attila''s trying to save his son kidnapped by Tarkan and stories of friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHl0rEDs8i7ZZQm6too0dZ4HuSx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405188'),
  ('838675421924891948', 'Tarnation', 2003, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Jonathan Caouette, Jonathan Caouette', 'Jonathan Caouette', 'Renee Leblanc, Adolph Davis, Jonathan Caouette, Rosemary Davis, David Sanin Paz', null, 'Filmmaker Jonathan Caouette''s documentary on growing up with his schizophrenic mother -- a mixture of snapshots, Super-8, answering machine messages, video diaries, early short films, and more -- culled from 19 years of his life.', 'Filmmaker Jonathan Caouette''s documentary on growing up with his schizophrenic mother -- a mixture of snapshots, Super-8, answering machine messages, video diaries, early short films, and more -- culled from 19 years of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zeQapdvD8poOizcaHwzmPxN9Km.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1435'),
  ('474167943387229613', 'Taro the Dragon Boy', 1979, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Kirio Urayama, Yōichi Kotabe, Reiko Okuyama', 'Kirio Urayama', 'Junya Kato, Mina Tominaga, Sayuri Yoshinaga, Kirin Kiki, Kazuo Kumakura, Kazuo Kitamura, Toshiko Yabuki, Junko Kuroda', null, 'Patterned after Japanese art and silk screens, Taro, The Dragon Boy is an animated feature about Japanese mythology and cultures, focusing on Taro, a young boy who has to make a voyage to a distant lake to save his mother, who has been turned into a dragon.', 'Patterned after Japanese art and silk screens, Taro, The Dragon Boy is an animated feature about Japanese mythology and cultures, focusing on Taro, a young boy who has to make a voyage to a distant lake to save his mother, who has been turned into a dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gq0Jl63xllabT52gxtls8KlZU3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47486'),
  ('74085365278850462', 'Taro Urashima', 1931, 'Animation', 'Manzo Miyashita', null, null, null, 'A Japanese legend about a fisherman who rescues a turtle and is rewarded for this with a visit to Ryūgū-jō, the palace of Ryūjin, the Dragon God, under the sea.', 'A Japanese legend about a fisherman who rescues a turtle and is rewarded for this with a visit to Ryūgū-jō, the palace of Ryūjin, the Dragon God, under the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6jHwzyagDixF6TWVPn1RNirUgY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220803'),
  ('930536885350844617', 'Tarot', 2024, 'Horror', 'Spenser Cohen, Anna Halberg, Elie Smolkin', 'Nicholas Adams', 'Harriet Slater, Wolfgang Novogratz, Adain Bradley, Avantika, Jacob Batalon, Humberly González, Larsen Thompson, Olwen Fouéré', 'PG-13', 'When a group of friends recklessly violate the sacred rule of Tarot readings, they unknowingly unleash an unspeakable evil trapped within the cursed cards. One by one, they come face to face with fate and end up in a race against death.', 'When a group of friends recklessly violate the sacred rule of Tarot readings, they unknowingly unleash an unspeakable evil trapped within the cursed cards. One by one, they come face to face with fate and end up in a race against death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAEUXC37vl1SnM7PXsHTF23I2vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719221'),
  ('569393339296489044', 'Tars and Stripes', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Charles Lamont, Buster Keaton, Dwight Warren', 'Marcy Klauber', 'Buster Keaton, Vernon Dent, Dorothea Kent, Jack Shutta', 'NR', 'Naval recruit Elmer is seemingly unable to discharge any of his duties without making life miserable for his irascible commanding officer, who winds up getting doused with paint, splattered with muck, and repeatedly tossed into the water due to Elmer''s ineptitude. To make matters worse, Elmer takes a shine to the CO''s girlfriend, which prompts her jealous boyfriend into several wrathful chases after Elmer. He eventually has Elmer locked in the brig -- but his girlfriend is in there too, so she can be together with her beloved Elmer.', 'Naval recruit Elmer is seemingly unable to discharge any of his duties without making life miserable for his irascible commanding officer, who winds up getting doused with paint, splattered with muck, and repeatedly tossed into the water due to Elmer''s ineptitude. To make matters worse, Elmer takes a shine to the CO''s girlfriend, which prompts her jealous boyfriend into several wrathful chases after Elmer. He eventually has Elmer locked in the brig -- but his girlfriend is in there too, so she can be together with her beloved Elmer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1sonu70n9luKvD3YjYcDMkvrK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53582'),
  ('1133751699743694904', 'Tart', 2001, 'Drama, Crime', 'Christina Wayne, Stephen Kazmierski, Jonnie Katz', 'Christina Wayne', 'Dominique Swain, Brad Renfro, Bijou Phillips, Mischa Barton, Alberta Watson, Myles Jeffrey, Lacey Chabert, Scott Thompson', 'R', 'A student will do anything to become part of the "in-crowd" at the exclusive school she attends in New York.', 'A student will do anything to become part of the "in-crowd" at the exclusive school she attends in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEGOIvjeh1FyCelpnywg4ziVWCh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30331'),
  ('324320897589713198', 'Tartuffe', 1926, 'Drama, Comedy', 'F. W. Murnau, Karl Freund', 'Carl Mayer', 'Emil Jannings, Werner Krauss, Lil Dagover, Hermann Picha, Rosa Valetti, André Mattoni, Lucie Höflich, Camilla Horn', null, 'A young man shows his millionaire grandfather a film based on Molière''s play "Tartuffe" in order to expose the old man''s hypocritical governess who covets the young man''s inheritance.', 'A young man shows his millionaire grandfather a film based on Molière''s play "Tartuffe" in order to expose the old man''s hypocritical governess who covets the young man''s inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRin1lHzsK8s8EMfT54wgxiD61H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55544'),
  ('650229674210840778', 'Tarumama', 2021, 'Horror, Drama', 'Andres Beltran', null, 'Paula Castaño, Andres Londono, Alanna de la Rossa, Jerónimo Barón, Carolina Ribón', null, 'Sara and Óscar, a couple going through a marital crisis, decide to spend a week in a remote country cabin with their two children, Alicia and Tomás. The family tries to have a quiet time, but something strange happens there. There is a woman who prowls through the forest and cries uncontrollably looking for a baby she has just lost. This deeply affects the family who will have to stay together to survive this nightmare.', 'Sara and Óscar, a couple going through a marital crisis, decide to spend a week in a remote country cabin with their two children, Alicia and Tomás. The family tries to have a quiet time, but something strange happens there. There is a woman who prowls through the forest and cries uncontrollably looking for a baby she has just lost. This deeply affects the family who will have to stay together to survive this nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDCIUtqZDc9JCKuxRGiqwMuDjUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:775943'),
  ('488493391032070684', 'Tarzan', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Drama, Action', 'Chris Buck, Kevin Lima', 'Bob Tzudiker, Tab Murphy, Noni White', 'Tony Goldwyn, Minnie Driver, Glenn Close, Alex D. Linz, Rosie O''Donnell, Brian Blessed, Nigel Hawthorne, Lance Henriksen', 'G', 'Tarzan was a small orphan who was raised by an ape named Kala since he was a child. He believed that this was his family, but on an expedition Jane Porter is rescued by Tarzan. He then finds out that he''s human. Now Tarzan must make the decision as to which family he should belong to...', 'Tarzan was a small orphan who was raised by an ape named Kala since he was a child. He believed that this was his family, but on an expedition Jane Porter is rescued by Tarzan. He then finds out that he''s human. Now Tarzan must make the decision as to which family he should belong to...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTvHlcqiOjGa3lFtbrTLTM3zasY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37135'),
  ('824202856333532670', 'Tarzan', 2013, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Reinhard Klooss', 'Reinhard Klooss', 'Kellan Lutz, Spencer Locke, Les Bubb, Joe Cappelletti, Brian Huskey, Mark Deklin, Jaime Ray Newman, Robert Capron', 'G', 'One of the most classic and revered stories of all time, Edgar Rice Burroughs'' Tarzan returns to the big screen for a new generation. Tarzan and Jane face a mercenary army dispatched by the evil CEO of Greystoke Energies, a man who took over the company from Tarzan''s parents, after they died in a plane crash in the African jungle.', 'One of the most classic and revered stories of all time, Edgar Rice Burroughs'' Tarzan returns to the big screen for a new generation. Tarzan and Jane face a mercenary army dispatched by the evil CEO of Greystoke Energies, a man who took over the company from Tarzan''s parents, after they died in a plane crash in the African jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIg7TclH6PUcvTWFh0QdtU5Wcvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230222'),
  ('163932217347867358', 'Tarzan and His Mate', 1934, 'Action, Adventure', 'Cedric Gibbons, Charles G. Clarke, Clyde De Vinna', 'James Kevin McGuinness', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Maureen O''Sullivan, Neil Hamilton, Paul Cavanagh, Forrester Harvey, Nathan Curry, Yola d''Avril, Paul Porcasi', 'NR', 'Harry Holt returns to Africa with his friend Martin Arlington to head up a large ivory expedition.', 'Harry Holt returns to Africa with his friend Martin Arlington to head up a large ivory expedition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnLZv1qhaJtzqP8q9ofkSnjoAIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18994'),
  ('515049398395846568', 'Tarzan and the Amazons', 1945, 'Adventure, Action, Romance', 'Kurt Neumann, Scott R. Beal, Archie Stout', 'Hans Jacoby, Marjorie L. Pfaelzer', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Brenda Joyce, Johnny Sheffield, Henry Stephenson, Maria Ouspenskaya, Barton MacLane, Donald Douglas, Steven Geray', 'NR', 'A group of archaeologists asks Tarzan to help them find an ancient city in a hidden valley of women. He refuses, but Boy is tricked into doing the job. The queen of the women asks Tarzan to help them.', 'A group of archaeologists asks Tarzan to help them find an ancient city in a hidden valley of women. He refuses, but Boy is tricked into doing the job. The queen of the women asks Tarzan to help them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3D9irZok7EQ2pLoJLwbVBdedEpQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55872'),
  ('821869956680971605', 'Tarzan and the Brown Prince', 1972, 'Adventure', 'Marcello Masciocchi, Manuel Caño', 'Santiago Moncada', 'Steve Hawkes, Kitty Swan, Robin Aristorenas, Peter Lee Lawrence, Ángel del Pozo, Agata Flori, Ricardo Rodríguez, Javier Maza', null, 'After a ruler dies, tradition dictates the new ruler must accomplish a series of harrowing challenges whilst competing with other aspirants. One of them, Nasu a young prince, engages in the contest, but evildoers plan the young prince''s demise. Tarzan protects him while ensuring he meets the tests', 'After a ruler dies, tradition dictates the new ruler must accomplish a series of harrowing challenges whilst competing with other aspirants. One of them, Nasu a young prince, engages in the contest, but evildoers plan the young prince''s demise. Tarzan protects him while ensuring he meets the tests', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vv8wfpW5qtTp9ld6jgcmCA1hEQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269749'),
  ('228805844474405567', 'Tarzan and the Golden Lion', 1927, 'Action, Adventure', 'J.P. McGowan', null, 'James Pierce, Frederick Peters, Edna Murphy, Harold Goodwin, Dorothy Dunbar, D''Arcy Corrigan, Boris Karloff, Robert Bolder', null, 'Flora Hawks is in love with the overseer of Tarzan''s African estate. After a search for a legendary city of diamonds, Tarzon races with his pet lion Jad-bal-ja to save Haws from being sacrificed to a lion-god.', 'Flora Hawks is in love with the overseer of Tarzan''s African estate. After a search for a legendary city of diamonds, Tarzon races with his pet lion Jad-bal-ja to save Haws from being sacrificed to a lion-god.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oYpQn8MxgvStUWpQ1wnPRHD460.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126259'),
  ('361760759592267955', 'Tarzan and the Green Goddess', 1938, 'Action, Adventure', 'Edward A. Kull, Wilbur McGaugh', 'Charles F. Royal', 'Bruce Bennett, Ula Holt, Ashton Dearholt, Frank Baker, Jack Mower, Lewis Sargent', 'NR', 'Tarzan retells the story of a trip to Guatemala in which the ape-man had gone to aid a friend in searching for a very valuable totem pole called the Green Goddess. Second of two feature versions of the 1935 serial film "The New Adventures Of Tarzan", culled from the serial''s last 10 episodes.', 'Tarzan retells the story of a trip to Guatemala in which the ape-man had gone to aid a friend in searching for a very valuable totem pole called the Green Goddess. Second of two feature versions of the 1935 serial film "The New Adventures Of Tarzan", culled from the serial''s last 10 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkDjW6Rn45QYc8qmf3k1AMmv2Vf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76950'),
  ('169060539559947456', 'Tarzan and the Huntress', 1947, 'Adventure', 'Kurt Neumann, Archie Stout, Bert Briskin', 'Rowland Leigh, Jerome Gruskin', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Brenda Joyce, Johnny Sheffield, Patricia Morison, Barton MacLane, John Warburton, Charles Trowbridge, Ted Hecht', null, 'A shortage of zoo animals after World War II brings beautiful animal trainer Tanya, her financial backer and her cruel trail boss to the jungle. After negotiating a quota with the native king, they take more animals than allowed. Tarzan intervenes.', 'A shortage of zoo animals after World War II brings beautiful animal trainer Tanya, her financial backer and her cruel trail boss to the jungle. After negotiating a quota with the native king, they take more animals than allowed. Tarzan intervenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldOLFlbk6ecRnANiozgh4nX4GrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82053'),
  ('472542451619373023', 'Tarzan and the Jungle Boy', 1968, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Romance', 'Robert Gordon', 'Stephen Lord', 'Mike Henry, Rafer Johnson, Aliza Gur, Steve Bond, Ron Gans', 'G', 'Tarzan is joined by a reporter and her fiance on a journey to find a boy who was abandoned in the jungle six years earlier. The search party must also battle an evil native, who is out to kill the boy and take over as chief of his brother''s tribe.', 'Tarzan is joined by a reporter and her fiance on a journey to find a boy who was abandoned in the jungle six years earlier. The search party must also battle an evil native, who is out to kill the boy and take over as chief of his brother''s tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yO4UbFegpriM8YKzm7xDxcDfG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82132'),
  ('132528838003018552', 'Tarzan and the Leopard Woman', 1946, 'Action, Adventure', 'Kurt Neumann, Karl Struss, Scott R. Beal', 'Carroll Young', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Brenda Joyce, Johnny Sheffield, Acquanetta, Edgar Barrier, Dennis Hoey, Tommy Cook, Anthony Caruso', null, 'A tribe devoted to the leopard cult is dedicated to preventing civilization from moving further into Africa.', 'A tribe devoted to the leopard cult is dedicated to preventing civilization from moving further into Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2AtSeKyuygtbFcKuyurJ6m6tmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55873'),
  ('1117825411080425257', 'Tarzan and the Lost City', 1998, 'Adventure, Action', 'Carl Schenkel, Michael Swan, Paul Gilpin', 'Bayard Johnson, J. Anderson Black', 'Casper Van Dien, Jane March, Steven Waddington, Winston Ntshona, Rapulana Seiphemo, Sean Taylor, Gys de Villiers, Russel Savadier', 'PG', 'Tarzan returns to his homeland of Africa to save his home from destruction.', 'Tarzan returns to his homeland of Africa to save his home from destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kp4gfmC7O10lAuBCDn1cbnPdudU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38618'),
