  ('516704578175190742', 'Tarzan and the She-Devil', 1953, 'Action, Adventure', 'Kurt Neumann', 'Karl Kamb, Carroll Young', 'Lex Barker, Joyce Mackenzie, Raymond Burr, Monique van Vooren, Tom Conway, Michael Granger, Henry Brandon, Mara Corday', null, 'The king of the jungle fights off ivory poachers.', 'The king of the jungle fights off ivory poachers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/de43fI1Q7MyWjwwctv9bmERKL3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73553'),
  ('574046280136512640', 'Tarzan and the Slave Girl', 1950, 'Action, Adventure', 'Lee Sholem, Russell Harlan', 'Arnold Belgard, Hans Jacoby', 'Lex Barker, Vanessa Brown, Robert Alda, Hurd Hatfield, Arthur Shields, Anthony Caruso, Denise Darcel, Robert Warwick', 'NR', 'The Lionians, a tribe of lion worshippers, make a desperate attempt to find a cure for the mysterious disease plaguing their village. Their Chief decides to kidnap Jane and Lola, a half-breed nurse, in order to help repopulate his civilization. Tarzan must rescue them while fending off blowgun attacks from people called the Waddies who are disguised as bushes.', 'The Lionians, a tribe of lion worshippers, make a desperate attempt to find a cure for the mysterious disease plaguing their village. Their Chief decides to kidnap Jane and Lola, a half-breed nurse, in order to help repopulate his civilization. Tarzan must rescue them while fending off blowgun attacks from people called the Waddies who are disguised as bushes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcJaw4I8vFAlYnTZQyWCIANjkQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119325'),
  ('463652240777142833', 'Tarzan and the Trappers', 1958, 'Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Charles F. Haas, Sandy Howard, H. Bruce Humberstone', 'Frederick Schlick, Robert Leach', 'Gordon Scott, Eve Brent, Rickie Sorensen, Leslie Bradley, Maurice Marsac, Bruce Lester, Naaman Brown, Scatman Crothers', 'NR', 'Tarzan goes up against a baddie by the name of Schroeder, who is trapping animals and selling them illegally to zoos. A twist is thrown into the plot when Schroeder''s brother, with the help of money-hungry trader Lapin, hunts a different kind of quarry, human game. Now Tarzan must not only fight to save the animals of the jungle, but he must also save himself. Three episodes of a failed TV series edited for theater release.', 'Tarzan goes up against a baddie by the name of Schroeder, who is trapping animals and selling them illegally to zoos. A twist is thrown into the plot when Schroeder''s brother, with the help of money-hungry trader Lapin, hunts a different kind of quarry, human game. Now Tarzan must not only fight to save the animals of the jungle, but he must also save himself. Three episodes of a failed TV series edited for theater release.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmNL9JuaH3ZlhusAhflVHPSvDFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76080'),
  ('435207010530026565', 'Tarzan and the Valley of Gold', 1966, 'Action, Adventure', 'Robert Day, Irving Lippman', 'Clair Huffaker', 'Mike Henry, David Opatoshu, Manuel Padilla Jr., Nancy Kovack, Don Megowan, Enrique Lucero, Eduardo Noriega, Yerye Beirute', null, 'In Central America, a little native boy, Ramel, is abducted by Vinaro, a madman who believes the child to be the sole link to a lost Aztec city of gold. Vinaro uses one of his diabolical explosive mechanisms to eliminate police and army officials; and the legendary Tarzan is flown in to help locate the jungle city, rescue the boy, and bring Vinaro to justice.', 'In Central America, a little native boy, Ramel, is abducted by Vinaro, a madman who believes the child to be the sole link to a lost Aztec city of gold. Vinaro uses one of his diabolical explosive mechanisms to eliminate police and army officials; and the legendary Tarzan is flown in to help locate the jungle city, rescue the boy, and bring Vinaro to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCWhUAPiyPMI4hkX8LccD7R5vEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76081'),
  ('214043519054419210', 'Tarzan Escapes', 1936, 'Action, Adventure', 'Richard Thorpe, Leonard Smith, John Farrow', 'Cyril Hume', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Maureen O''Sullivan, John Buckler, Benita Hume, William Henry, Herbert Mundin, E. E. Clive, Darby Jones', 'NR', 'White hunter Captain Fry tries to take Tarzan back to civilization, caged for public display. He arrives in the jungle with Jane''s cousins, Eric and Rita, who want Jane''s help in claiming a fortune left her.', 'White hunter Captain Fry tries to take Tarzan back to civilization, caged for public display. He arrives in the jungle with Jane''s cousins, Eric and Rita, who want Jane''s help in claiming a fortune left her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhh3vQt32phMCDgQ3OamIYX2tOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38661'),
  ('570222816408592446', 'Tarzan Finds a Son!', 1939, 'Action, Adventure', 'Richard Thorpe, Urie McCleary, Leonard Smith', 'Cyril Hume', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Maureen O''Sullivan, Johnny Sheffield, Ian Hunter, Henry Stephenson, Frieda Inescort, Henry Wilcoxon, Laraine Day', 'NR', 'A young couple die in a plane crash in the jungle. Their son is found by Tarzan and Jane who name him Boy and raise him as their own. Five years later a search party comes to find the young heir to millions of dollars. Jane agrees, against Tarzan''s will, to lead them to civilization.', 'A young couple die in a plane crash in the jungle. Their son is found by Tarzan and Jane who name him Boy and raise him as their own. Five years later a search party comes to find the young heir to millions of dollars. Jane agrees, against Tarzan''s will, to lead them to civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOdhpqijqm1BDzTBlVv2kvFzgVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40044'),
  ('633102935851098969', 'Tarzan Goes to India', 1962, 'Action, Adventure', 'John Guillermin, Paul Beeson', 'John Guillermin, Robert Hardy Andrews', 'Jock Mahoney, Leo Gordon, Mark Dana, Feroz Khan, Jai, Simi Garewal, Sanjay Khan', 'NR', 'Summoned by an Indian princess, Tarzan travels to India where hundreds of wild elephants are in danger. A company is building a hydroelectric dam and the contractors have only a few weeks to finish the job. The building of the dam will flood the valley surrounded by mountains. There is one pass through which the elephant herd can escape but that is being closed. Tarzan comes up against an old nemesis, Bryce, the chief engineer. Bryce undertook a similar dam project in Africa and had a penchant for shooting elephants. It''s up to Tarzan to organize the move before Bryce manages to close the pass.', 'Summoned by an Indian princess, Tarzan travels to India where hundreds of wild elephants are in danger. A company is building a hydroelectric dam and the contractors have only a few weeks to finish the job. The building of the dam will flood the valley surrounded by mountains. There is one pass through which the elephant herd can escape but that is being closed. Tarzan comes up against an old nemesis, Bryce, the chief engineer. Bryce undertook a similar dam project in Africa and had a penchant for shooting elephants. It''s up to Tarzan to organize the move before Bryce manages to close the pass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kw3ISWZT6QLkWXhbK9v6W46tdOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76082'),
  ('182871801528034629', 'Tarzan II', 2005, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Brian Smith, Alexs Stadermann, Andrew Collins', 'Brian Smith, Noni White, Bob Tzudiker', 'Harrison Chad, George Carlin, Brad Garrett, Ron Perlman, Estelle Harris, Glenn Close, Lance Henriksen, Brenda Grate', 'G', 'When one of his missteps puts his family in jeopardy, Tarzan decides they would be better off without him.', 'When one of his missteps puts his family in jeopardy, Tarzan decides they would be better off without him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eMVKw09M3LPi2QfKi69sxWMX4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15657'),
  ('573264677987362083', 'Tarzan in Manhattan', 1989, 'TV Movie, Action, Adventure', 'Michael Schultz, Dick Ziker, Laszlo George', 'Anna Sandor, William Gough', 'Joe Lara, Kim Crosby, James Medina, Jan-Michael Vincent, Tony Curtis, Joe Seneca, Peter Sherayko, Oliver Muirhead', null, 'Tarzan goes to New York to rescue the chimp Cheetah, who has been captured by an evil animal experimenter. There, he teams up with Jane, a cab driver and daughter of an ex-cop private eye, who help Tarzan free Cheetah and his friends.', 'Tarzan goes to New York to rescue the chimp Cheetah, who has been captured by an evil animal experimenter. There, he teams up with Jane, a cab driver and daughter of an ex-cop private eye, who help Tarzan free Cheetah and his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZUvDjXNemCWd2LEQ8Kh4gYbuUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195752'),
  ('879911852615422868', 'Tarzan Rıfkı', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Natuk Baytan, Yahya Kılıç, Adem Erul', 'Natuk Baytan', 'Kemal Sunal, Suna Yıldızoğlu, Sadettin Erbil, Ece Berkant, Dinçer Çekmez, Asuman Arsan, Hakkı Kıvanç, Demiray Erül', null, 'A story about a poor and guilt guy who is being used by mafia for dirty work.', 'A story about a poor and guilt guy who is being used by mafia for dirty work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uii9igIoUpOPCWrxioc0IY0jLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307020'),
  ('1111580027988907703', 'Tarzan the Ape Man', 1932, 'Action, Adventure', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Harold Rosson, Arthur Rose', 'Ivor Novello, Cyril Hume', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Maureen O''Sullivan, Neil Hamilton, C. Aubrey Smith, Doris Lloyd, Forrester Harvey, Ray Corrigan, Ivory Williams', 'NR', 'James Parker and Harry Holt are on an expedition in Africa in search of the elephant burial grounds that will provide enough ivory to make them rich. Parker''s beautiful daughter Jane arrives unexpectedly to join them. Jane is terrified when Tarzan and his ape friends abduct her, but when she returns to her father''s expedition she has second thoughts about leaving Tarzan.', 'James Parker and Harry Holt are on an expedition in Africa in search of the elephant burial grounds that will provide enough ivory to make them rich. Parker''s beautiful daughter Jane arrives unexpectedly to join them. Jane is terrified when Tarzan and his ape friends abduct her, but when she returns to her father''s expedition she has second thoughts about leaving Tarzan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqtdNAktAI3p1iXmaEooaHjMmWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26845'),
  ('86077475424205425', 'Tarzan the Ape Man', 1981, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'John Derek, John Derek', 'Gary Goddard', 'Bo Derek, Richard Harris, John Phillip Law, Miles O''Keeffe, Steve Strong, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Laurie Main, Harold Ayer', 'R', 'The Tarzan story from Jane''s point of view. Jane Parker visits her father in Africa where she joins him on an expedition. A couple of brief encounters with Tarzan establish a (sexual) bond between her and Tarzan. When the expedition is captured by savages, Tarzan comes to the rescue.', 'The Tarzan story from Jane''s point of view. Jane Parker visits her father in Africa where she joins him on an expedition. A couple of brief encounters with Tarzan establish a (sexual) bond between her and Tarzan. When the expedition is captured by savages, Tarzan comes to the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYoH03aBoyi4Bp0VXodrsc4JI6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26325'),
  ('731826422577988151', 'Tarzan the Fearless', 1933, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Robert F. Hill, Theodore Joos, Harry Neumann', 'George H. Plympton, Basil Dickey', 'Buster Crabbe, Julie Bishop, Edward Woods, Philo McCullough, E. Alyn Warren, Mischa Auer, Matthew Betz, Frank Lackteen', null, 'Mary Brooks'' father, who has been studying ancient tribes, falls into the hands of "the people of Zar, god of the Emerald Fingers." Tarzan helps Mary locate her father, rescues everyone from the High Priest of Zar, and takes Mary to his cave.', 'Mary Brooks'' father, who has been studying ancient tribes, falls into the hands of "the people of Zar, god of the Emerald Fingers." Tarzan helps Mary locate her father, rescues everyone from the High Priest of Zar, and takes Mary to his cave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHN87HvpjSaz6jk6mSerWzAmrqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76083'),
  ('635636068946618019', 'Tarzan the Magnificent', 1960, 'Action, Adventure', 'Robert Day', 'Robert Day, Berne Giler', 'Gordon Scott, Jock Mahoney, Betta St. John, John Carradine, Lionel Jeffries, Alexandra Stewart, Earl Cameron, Al Mulock', null, 'After the Banton family rob a store is a small village and kill the local police constable, Tarzan captures one of them, Coy Banton. He decides to return him to the authorities so that the dead policeman''s family will benefit from the $5000 reward. The head of the clan, Abel Banton and his two sons have no intention of letting Tarzan deliver Coy and burn the river boat they were to use. Several of the passengers are now stranded forcing Tarzan to take them along on a trek through the jungle. Abel Banton trails them intent not only getting his son back but getting rid of Tarzan.', 'After the Banton family rob a store is a small village and kill the local police constable, Tarzan captures one of them, Coy Banton. He decides to return him to the authorities so that the dead policeman''s family will benefit from the $5000 reward. The head of the clan, Abel Banton and his two sons have no intention of letting Tarzan deliver Coy and burn the river boat they were to use. Several of the passengers are now stranded forcing Tarzan to take them along on a trek through the jungle. Abel Banton trails them intent not only getting his son back but getting rid of Tarzan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbbDG9nr4nyHqt2YocaDPHTcdZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83407'),
  ('965941464155791109', 'Tarzan Triumphs', 1943, 'Action, Adventure, War', 'Wilhelm Thiele, Clem Beauchamp, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Carroll Young, Roy Chanslor', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Johnny Sheffield, Frances Gifford, Stanley Ridges, Sig Ruman, Philip Van Zandt, Rex Williams, Pedro de Cordoba', 'NR', 'Zandra, white princess of a lost civilization, comes to Tarzan for help when Nazis invade the jungle with plans to conquer her people and take their wealth. Tarzan, the isolationist, becomes involved after the Nazis shoot at him and capture Boy: "Now Tarzan make war!"', 'Zandra, white princess of a lost civilization, comes to Tarzan for help when Nazis invade the jungle with plans to conquer her people and take their wealth. Tarzan, the isolationist, becomes involved after the Nazis shoot at him and capture Boy: "Now Tarzan make war!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kW131tphE6YLG1uAN3bNm50ka6o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55860'),
  ('361147810583646283', 'Tarzan''s Desert Mystery', 1943, 'Action, Adventure', 'Wilhelm Thiele, Harry J. Wild, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Edward T. Lowe Jr.', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Nancy Kelly, Johnny Sheffield, Otto Kruger, Joe Sawyer, Lloyd Corrigan, Robert Lowery, Frank Puglia', 'NR', 'A letter from Jane, who is nursing British troops, asks Tarzan''s help in obtaining a malaria serum extractable from jungle plants. Tarzan and Boy set out across the desert looking for the plants. Along the way they befriend a stranded American lady magician.', 'A letter from Jane, who is nursing British troops, asks Tarzan''s help in obtaining a malaria serum extractable from jungle plants. Tarzan and Boy set out across the desert looking for the plants. Along the way they befriend a stranded American lady magician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Za6bAgQCSnFJ1PlYhltkoUnrSd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55871'),
  ('988812408446688422', 'Tarzan''s Fight for Life', 1958, 'Action, Adventure', 'H. Bruce Humberstone, William E. Snyder, William Forsyth', 'Thomas Hal Phillips', 'Gordon Scott, Eve Brent, Rickie Sorensen, Woody Strode, Jil Jarmyn, James Edwards, Carl Benton Reid, Harry Lauter', 'G', 'Dr. Sturdy is trying to establish a modern hospital in the jungle. His efforts are strongly opposed by Futa, the witch doctor, and Ramo, a native warrior.', 'Dr. Sturdy is trying to establish a modern hospital in the jungle. His efforts are strongly opposed by Futa, the witch doctor, and Ramo, a native warrior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blDwzhRIeD5JKaJnsMnJaamyBlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76084'),
  ('845407297832896835', 'Tarzan''s Greatest Adventure', 1959, 'Adventure', 'John Guillermin, Edward Scaife, Nora Roberts', 'John Guillermin, Berne Giler', 'Gordon Scott, Anthony Quayle, Sara Shane, Niall MacGinnis, Sean Connery, Al Mulock, Scilla Gabel', null, 'The greatest adventure of jungle king Tarzan. Four British villains raid a settlement to obtain explosives for use in a diamond mine. In doing so they nearly destroy the settlement, so Tarzan pursues them to their mine.', 'The greatest adventure of jungle king Tarzan. Four British villains raid a settlement to obtain explosives for use in a diamond mine. In doing so they nearly destroy the settlement, so Tarzan pursues them to their mine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wD8bHOKqBRoK7Mgj8aIA4NzENa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43205'),
  ('421684767947744212', 'Tarzan''s Hidden Jungle', 1955, 'Romance, Adventure, Drama', 'Harold D. Schuster', 'William Lively', 'Gordon Scott, Vera Miles, Peter van Eyck, Jack Elam, Charles Fredericks, Richard Reeves, Maidie Norman, Jester Hairston', 'PG', 'Hunters trespass into Sukulu country, where animals are sacred, posing as photographers.', 'Hunters trespass into Sukulu country, where animals are sacred, posing as photographers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qz3QwHxz25JDh5RZjiuAWxJ3Cdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76086'),
  ('434207415294355399', 'Tarzan''s Magic Fountain', 1949, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Lee Sholem, Bert Briskin, Karl Struss', 'Harry Chandlee, Curt Siodmak', 'Lex Barker, Brenda Joyce, Evelyn Ankers, Alan Napier, Albert Dekker, Charles Drake, Henry Brandon, Ted Hecht', 'NR', 'An expedition tries to enlist Tarzan''s help in finding the secret Blue Valley, which legend says is the location of a miraculous fountain of youth.', 'An expedition tries to enlist Tarzan''s help in finding the secret Blue Valley, which legend says is the location of a miraculous fountain of youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMQabQlULUogQbJiYmtxlKcfsK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206145'),
  ('1004620606662039737', 'Tarzan''s New York Adventure', 1942, 'Action, Adventure', 'Richard Thorpe, Howard Campbell, Sidney Wagner', 'Myles Connolly, William R. Lipman', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Maureen O''Sullivan, Johnny Sheffield, Virginia Grey, Charles Bickford, Paul Kelly, Chill Wills, Cy Kendall', null, 'Circus owner Buck Rand kidnaps Boy to perform in his show. He forces a pilot to fly him, Boy and his animal trainer out of the jungle. Tarzan and Jane follow them to New York.', 'Circus owner Buck Rand kidnaps Boy to perform in his show. He forces a pilot to fly him, Boy and his animal trainer out of the jungle. Tarzan and Jane follow them to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOt0GhI5McWzEe3MhDOLV4SDuY5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40045'),
  ('753829862260215249', 'Tarzan''s Peril', 1951, 'Action, Adventure', 'Byron Haskin, Philip Brandon, James Paisley', 'Samuel Newman, Francis Swann', 'Lex Barker, Virginia Huston, George Macready, Douglas Fowley, Glenn Anders, Dorothy Dandridge, Alan Napier, Frederick O''Neal', 'NR', 'Escaped convicts are selling weapons to a warlike native tribe.', 'Escaped convicts are selling weapons to a warlike native tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jU3oP47JD2qGCzxL3YtUlkB7umA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76088'),
  ('488344723479896350', 'Tarzan''s Revenge', 1938, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'D. Ross Lederman, Wilbur McGaugh, George Meehan', 'Robert Lee Johnson, Jay Vann', 'Glenn Morris, Eleanor Holm, George Barbier, C. Henry Gordon, Hedda Hopper, Joe Sawyer, George Meeker, Corbet Morris', null, 'Eleanor and her parents are hunting big game, acompanied by her wimpish fiance.', 'Eleanor and her parents are hunting big game, acompanied by her wimpish fiance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52wnUGl9hoIKBfb77TQtMCRWk5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76089'),
  ('767342301039590063', 'Tarzan''s Savage Fury', 1952, 'Action, Adventure', 'Cy Endfield, Karl Struss', 'Cyril Hume, Shirley White, Hans Jacoby', 'Lex Barker, Dorothy Hart, Patric Knowles, Charles Korvin, Tommy Carlton, Wesley Bly, Darby Jones, Peter Mamakos', null, 'The jungle king''s cousin tries to get him to help find a diamond treasure.', 'The jungle king''s cousin tries to get him to help find a diamond treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15eylKQhr8QN6JKrUWw8RxsHoAP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73551'),
  ('886310031331033537', 'Tarzan''s Secret Treasure', 1941, 'Action, Adventure', 'Richard Thorpe, Clyde De Vinna, Howard Campbell', 'Myles Connolly, Paul Gangelin', 'Johnny Weissmüller, Maureen O''Sullivan, Johnny Sheffield, Reginald Owen, Barry Fitzgerald, Tom Conway, Philip Dorn, Cordell Hickman', null, 'A scientific expedition happens to discover that gold exists on Tarzan''s escarpment. The villainous Medford and Vandermeer kidnap Jane and Boy to extort from Tarzan the location of the gold.', 'A scientific expedition happens to discover that gold exists on Tarzan''s escarpment. The villainous Medford and Vandermeer kidnap Jane and Boy to extort from Tarzan the location of the gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmRXYQUtCkqo6N8mc46WImvQ1Wz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40214'),
  ('487162748402497439', 'Tarzan''s Three Challenges', 1963, 'Action, Adventure', 'Robert Day, Edward Scaife', 'Robert Day, Berne Giler', 'Jock Mahoney, Woody Strode, Tsu Kobayashi, Earl Cameron, Anthony Chinn, Salah Jamal', 'NR', 'The spiritual leader of an oriental country is dying. The leader''s evil brother Khan is plotting to prevent Kashi, the youthful heir, from assuming his rightful position. Tarzan is summoned to protect Kashi and, in doing so, he must face Khan in three tests of strength.', 'The spiritual leader of an oriental country is dying. The leader''s evil brother Khan is plotting to prevent Kashi, the youthful heir, from assuming his rightful position. Tarzan is summoned to protect Kashi and, in doing so, he must face Khan in three tests of strength.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ed5wqdeX8HJUkV8fhzv42vBX4JZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76091'),
  ('544461954239735360', 'Tarzoon: Shame of the Jungle!', 1975, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Boris Szulzinger, Picha, Bernard De Visscher', 'Pierre Bartier, Anne Beatts, Picha', 'Georges Aminel, Arlette Thomas, Claude Bertrand, Paule Emanuele, Pierre Trabaud, Roger Carel, Guy Piérauld, Lita Recio', 'R', 'Shame, the ape man of the jungle, is aghast when his woman, June, is kidnapped by a gang of giant penises. They take her to their queen, Bazunga, a bald woman with fourteen breasts. After tangling with a gang of great white hunters, a marauding lion and the Molar Men, Shame sets off to rescue her with only his faithful friend Flicka at his side. He heads for that darkest of areas', 'Shame, the ape man of the jungle, is aghast when his woman, June, is kidnapped by a gang of giant penises. They take her to their queen, Bazunga, a bald woman with fourteen breasts. After tangling with a gang of great white hunters, a marauding lion and the Molar Men, Shame sets off to rescue her with only his faithful friend Flicka at his side. He heads for that darkest of areas', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Xnv2inaDpwSg3sWVbOlbMPNSlT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50237'),
  ('518306856552328475', 'Tashan', 2008, 'Action, Romance', 'Vijay Krishna Acharya, Ali Abbas Zafar', null, 'Akshay Kumar, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Saif Ali Khan, Anil Kapoor, Sanjay Mishra, Yashpal Sharma, Manoj Pahwa, Sreejita De', null, 'Jeetendra Kumar Makwana is employed full-time at a Call Center and works part-time teaching English. He is recruited by an attractive young woman, Pooja, to teach her Hinglish-speaking boss, Bhaiyaji, English. Jeetendra agrees to do so, falls in love with Pooja, and joins forces with her to steal a bag containing 25 Crore Rupees in cash. He will soon find out that Bhaiyaji is a hoodlum and extortionist known to the Police as Lakhan Singh.', 'Jeetendra Kumar Makwana is employed full-time at a Call Center and works part-time teaching English. He is recruited by an attractive young woman, Pooja, to teach her Hinglish-speaking boss, Bhaiyaji, English. Jeetendra agrees to do so, falls in love with Pooja, and joins forces with her to steal a bag containing 25 Crore Rupees in cash. He will soon find out that Bhaiyaji is a hoodlum and extortionist known to the Police as Lakhan Singh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5GHlLJLan8eFFpBazIMP4iD0Rg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14193'),
  ('698428185626222404', 'Tasio', 1984, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Montxo Armendáriz', 'Montxo Armendáriz', 'Patxi Bisquert, José María Asín, Enrique Goicoechea, Paco Hernández, Amaia Lasa, Nacho Martínez, Miguel Rellán', null, 'The childhood, love adventures, and ordinary life of Tasio, a coal maker in rural Navarre.', 'The childhood, love adventures, and ordinary life of Tasio, a coal maker in rural Navarre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3a54ynBn0K401YBx7jkFzEZTrG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115502'),
  ('111122804359182647', 'Task Force', 1949, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Delmer Daves, Robert Burks, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Delmer Daves', 'Gary Cooper, Jane Wyatt, Wayne Morris, Walter Brennan, Julie London, Jack Holt, Stanley Ridges, John Ridgely', 'NR', 'After learning the finer points of carrier aviation in the 1920s, career officer Jonathan Scott and his pals spend the next two decades promoting the superiority of naval air power. But military and political "red tape" continually frustrate their efforts, prompting Scott to even consider leaving the Navy for a more lucrative civilian job. Then the world enters a second World War and Scott finally gets the opportunity to prove to Washington the valuable role aircraft carriers could play in winning the conflict. But what will it cost him and his comrades personally?', 'After learning the finer points of carrier aviation in the 1920s, career officer Jonathan Scott and his pals spend the next two decades promoting the superiority of naval air power. But military and political "red tape" continually frustrate their efforts, prompting Scott to even consider leaving the Navy for a more lucrative civilian job. Then the world enters a second World War and Scott finally gets the opportunity to prove to Washington the valuable role aircraft carriers could play in winning the conflict. But what will it cost him and his comrades personally?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/av1YqGB6yXTumCq2K3DpbCkP1C1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61262'),
  ('354900903916518948', 'Tassels in the Air', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Charley Chase', 'Al Giebler, Elwood Ullman', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Gertrude Astor, Symona Boniface, Kathryn Bates, Vernon Dent, Bess Flowers', 'NR', 'The stooges are janitors in an office building. They stencil the wrong names on all the offices, causing a rich lady to mistakes Moe for famous decorator Omay. She hires the boys to redecorate her house, which they proceed to ruin. More trouble ensues when the real Omay shows up.', 'The stooges are janitors in an office building. They stencil the wrong names on all the offices, causing a rich lady to mistakes Moe for famous decorator Omay. She hires the boys to redecorate her house, which they proceed to ruin. More trouble ensues when the real Omay shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUq4pzmrM1WF6NSIEvGNBPdAYzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115915'),
  ('533114413704979514', 'Taste', 2014, 'Drama', 'Kyung Seokho, Gyeong Seok-Ho', 'Park Seong-ho', 'Jung Myung-seo, Yu Da-eun, Hee-jeong, Lee Eun-mi, Kim Jin-seon, Jeong So-yeong', null, 'One man and five women?! Chic, innocent, sexy, tough and mysterious, take your pick. Myeong-tae was a hot shot in a stock firm who had everything from looks to a hot body but was fired for a mistake he made and is neglected by his hot shot wife. The women in the neighborhood who are always at home for different reasons, start looking out for him.', 'One man and five women?! Chic, innocent, sexy, tough and mysterious, take your pick. Myeong-tae was a hot shot in a stock firm who had everything from looks to a hot body but was fired for a mistake he made and is neglected by his hot shot wife. The women in the neighborhood who are always at home for different reasons, start looking out for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Odvg9CK9tWMzXVsRzubeOeDHMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260550'),
  ('374633415422198817', 'Taste 2', 2015, 'Romance', 'Gyeong Seok-Ho', null, 'Go Eun-seong, Kim Soo-jeong, Zhen Yin, Lee Eun-mi, Je Dong-hwa, Choi Hye-ri, Yoon Da-hyeon, Lee Jae-seok', null, 'Heon-sub is in his third year of cooking major at the Samjin University. He gets a job at the cooking school run by Jeong-min, who lectures at his school department. From a great looking professor to sexy students who have their eyes on young men, a married woman who tries hard to make things right in bed with her husband and the girl who dumped him right away at the blind date! Heon-sub is the only guy at the cooking club and his adult-rated eating fantasy begins.', 'Heon-sub is in his third year of cooking major at the Samjin University. He gets a job at the cooking school run by Jeong-min, who lectures at his school department. From a great looking professor to sexy students who have their eyes on young men, a married woman who tries hard to make things right in bed with her husband and the girl who dumped him right away at the blind date! Heon-sub is the only guy at the cooking club and his adult-rated eating fantasy begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMiPlfYXTeQBO5vWxp69piefIpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359289'),
  ('116963096135243085', 'Taste of Fear', 1961, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Seth Holt, Douglas Slocombe, David Tomblin', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Susan Strasberg, Ronald Lewis, Ann Todd, Christopher Lee, John Serret, Leonard Sachs, Anne Blake, Fred Johnson', 'NR', 'A wheelchair-bound young girl returns to her father''s estate after ten years, and although she''s told he''s away, she keeps seeing his dead body on the estate.', 'A wheelchair-bound young girl returns to her father''s estate after ten years, and although she''s told he''s away, she keeps seeing his dead body on the estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1Eq0XpDAsCkoGUGv5rV8c4uQUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64568'),
  ('74322355298239930', 'Taste of Killing', 1966, 'Western', 'Stelvio Massi, Tonino Valerii, Julio Sempere', 'Víctor Auz', 'Craig Hill, George Martin, Piero Lulli, Fernando Sancho, Franco Ressel, George Wang, Diana Martín, Eugenio Galadini', null, 'Lanky Fellow has a typical cynical SW like way to earn his living. He observes valuable transports of money or gold, but when they are robbed he doesn''t intervene, but follows the robbers and then brings the loot back to collect the insurance. When his "job" brings him in conflict with the notorious outlaw Gus Kenneback, he has personal reasons to protect the money as Kenneback was once responsible for the death of Lanky''s brother.', 'Lanky Fellow has a typical cynical SW like way to earn his living. He observes valuable transports of money or gold, but when they are robbed he doesn''t intervene, but follows the robbers and then brings the loot back to collect the insurance. When his "job" brings him in conflict with the notorious outlaw Gus Kenneback, he has personal reasons to protect the money as Kenneback was once responsible for the death of Lanky''s brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiTSJk1LSmkBms2KcvRAl0lPubY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143754'),
  ('1011326615016343536', 'Taste of Life', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Enrico Oldoini, Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Paolo Costella', 'Alberto Sordi, Enrico Oldoini, Liliana Betti', 'Alberto Sordi, Bernard Blier, Andréa Ferréol, Vittorio Caprioli, Alberto Sorrentino, Elena Falgheri, Nerina Montagnani, Charles Millot', null, 'Elvio Battistini works as a ticket taker in the local cinema of the small town where he lives. He has a prosthesis in one leg, the result of an accident, but he tells anyone who will listen it is a war injury. Giuseppe Mondardini, is also an older man living alone in what was the splendid family home. When Elvio and Giuseppe meet, they hit it off immediately. A trip to a cooler area is in order, so Mordardini unveils his ancient automobile.', 'Elvio Battistini works as a ticket taker in the local cinema of the small town where he lives. He has a prosthesis in one leg, the result of an accident, but he tells anyone who will listen it is a war injury. Giuseppe Mondardini, is also an older man living alone in what was the splendid family home. When Elvio and Giuseppe meet, they hit it off immediately. A trip to a cooler area is in order, so Mordardini unveils his ancient automobile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7nc3qFoVQFaFaZ9PVlWUabL3r4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82827'),
  ('736145781149326290', 'Taste of the Sea', 1983, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Bruno Cortini, Giuseppe Maccari', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Jerry Calà, Virna Lisi, Christian De Sica, Marina Suma, Angelo Cannavacciolo, Karina Huff, Isabella Ferrari, Gianni Ansaldi', null, 'A comedy about the adventures of several families during their sea vacations.', 'A comedy about the adventures of several families during their sea vacations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1uwF07RxBOORBPqHvS4fDGdWG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43559'),
