  ('738199371689626767', 'Tastes of Horror', 2023, 'Horror', 'Lim Dae-wung, Kim Yong-gyun, Johnny Chae', 'Yoon Eun-kyoung, Lim Dae-wung, Ahn Sang-hoon', 'Chang Seung-yeon, Oh Seung-hee, Jang Ye-eun, Shin Eun-soo, Kim Ho-jung, Kim Tae-hun, Jo Jae-yun, Yoon Hyun-min', null, 'A new concept horror IP cross project that turns six selected works out of 19 serial webtoons of the same name (Tastes of Horror) into movies. "DingDong Challenge: The reason why you shouldn''t do dance challenge carelessly", "Four Legged Beast: Story of meeting a doppelganger with broken neck", "Jackpot: what happened when I took a taxi nearby", "The Residents-Only Gym: A woman who appears after 10 PM", "Rehabilitation: Cruel clinical trials currenly underway in the lab", and "Gluttony: The strange things that happened during a live broadcast."', 'A new concept horror IP cross project that turns six selected works out of 19 serial webtoons of the same name (Tastes of Horror) into movies. "DingDong Challenge: The reason why you shouldn''t do dance challenge carelessly", "Four Legged Beast: Story of meeting a doppelganger with broken neck", "Jackpot: what happened when I took a taxi nearby", "The Residents-Only Gym: A woman who appears after 10 PM", "Rehabilitation: Cruel clinical trials currenly underway in the lab", and "Gluttony: The strange things that happened during a live broadcast."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgB23yhNSSGhH7cusyKneKsdEP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1168166'),
  ('1139155841559911422', 'Tasty Trap - Affair', 2015, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Jeong-gyun Shin', null, 'No Seong-gyoon, Han Soo-yeon-I, Yu Seok-hwan', null, 'Moon-ja is bored of her married life with Sang-in who can''t give her what she needs at night. Then a former porn star moves into their house and Sang-in feels shaken by Yeon-hee. He was her fan in the movie "The Swamp of Desire". The two get close as Yeon-hee asks house owner Sang-in to help her fix things in the house. Sang-in then finds out that Moon-ja is sleeping with his good friend Dong-seok and witnesses Yeon-hee get abused by a former manager. Sang-in and Yeon-hee share their misfortune and get closer and in the end something extreme happens between them.', 'Moon-ja is bored of her married life with Sang-in who can''t give her what she needs at night. Then a former porn star moves into their house and Sang-in feels shaken by Yeon-hee. He was her fan in the movie "The Swamp of Desire". The two get close as Yeon-hee asks house owner Sang-in to help her fix things in the house. Sang-in then finds out that Moon-ja is sleeping with his good friend Dong-seok and witnesses Yeon-hee get abused by a former manager. Sang-in and Yeon-hee share their misfortune and get closer and in the end something extreme happens between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUuuzetIXKeKgCYtTHFsScfS5lL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387814'),
  ('1027904344945552728', 'Tata Mía', 1986, 'Drama', 'José Luis Borau, Teo Escamilla, Álvaro de Armiñán', 'José Luis Borau', 'Imperio Argentina, Alfredo Landa, Carmen Maura, Xabier Elorriaga, Miguel Rellán, Marisa Paredes, Julieta Serrano, Enriqueta Carballeira', null, 'Elvira, daughter of a disgraced military, who entered a convent at a young age leaves him and returns home to settle in Madrid with his beloved nanny, seeking help to overcome their crisis. However, the country has changed so much in his years of confinement that has little or nothing to do with his childhood memories ...', 'Elvira, daughter of a disgraced military, who entered a convent at a young age leaves him and returns home to settle in Madrid with his beloved nanny, seeking help to overcome their crisis. However, the country has changed so much in his years of confinement that has little or nothing to do with his childhood memories ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRqKT8aDmwPzlwWeMhyMzFUn6Et.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163422'),
  ('732303991361945432', 'Tatami', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Guy Nattiv, Zar Amir Ebrahimi, Todd Martin', 'Elham Erfani, Guy Nattiv', 'Arienne Mandi, Zar Amir Ebrahimi, Jaime Ray Newman, Nadine Marshall, Lir Katz, Ash Goldeh, Valeriu Andriuță, Mehdi Bajestani', null, 'Iranian female judokas Leila and her coach Maryam, travel to the Judo World Championship, intent on bringing home Iran’s first gold medal. Midway through the Judo World Championships, they receive an ultimatum from the Islamic Republic ordering Leila to fake an injury and lose, or she will be branded a traitor of the state. With her own and her family’s freedom at stake, Leila is faced with an impossible choice: comply with the Iranian regime as her coach Maryam implores her to do, or fight on, for the gold.', 'Iranian female judokas Leila and her coach Maryam, travel to the Judo World Championship, intent on bringing home Iran’s first gold medal. Midway through the Judo World Championships, they receive an ultimatum from the Islamic Republic ordering Leila to fake an injury and lose, or she will be branded a traitor of the state. With her own and her family’s freedom at stake, Leila is faced with an impossible choice: comply with the Iranian regime as her coach Maryam implores her to do, or fight on, for the gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9SUL6wPDGfjX6cCBal0SmUcT47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084066'),
  ('979131777385487005', 'Tatanka', 2011, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michele Paradisi, Giuseppe Gagliardi, Stefania Girolami Goodwin', 'Stefano Sardo, Salvatore Sansone, Massimo Gaudioso', 'Clemente Russo, Carmine Recano, Rade Šerbedžija, Giorgio Colangeli, Suzanne Wolff, Raiz, Sascha Zacharias, Damir Todorović', null, 'Michele and Rosario, childhood friends, grow up in Marcianise, a town in Campania where the laws of the Camorra prevail over those of the state. However, the two men have different destinies: Rosario becomes a crime boss, while Michele, after being arrested for murder and released from prison, discovers the world of boxing thanks to his trainer Sabatino (Giorgio Colangeli). Seeking a definitive change of life and emancipation, Michele moves to Berlin, where he is introduced to the underground boxing circuit.', 'Michele and Rosario, childhood friends, grow up in Marcianise, a town in Campania where the laws of the Camorra prevail over those of the state. However, the two men have different destinies: Rosario becomes a crime boss, while Michele, after being arrested for murder and released from prison, discovers the world of boxing thanks to his trainer Sabatino (Giorgio Colangeli). Seeking a definitive change of life and emancipation, Michele moves to Berlin, where he is introduced to the underground boxing circuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrb0PB4ajr34hxQbk9frsKOcrXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63313'),
  ('628968820428278407', 'Tatar Ramazan', 1990, 'Drama, Romance', 'Melih Gülgen', 'Kerim Korcan', 'Kadir İnanır, Esin Moralıoğlu, Kazım Kartal, Yaman Okay, Hikmet Taşdemir, Mehmet Ezici, Nejat Gürsoy, Samim Meriç', null, 'In 1942 during the time of war, Tatar Ramazan goes to jail because murder after argument on lands. When he gets out, he finds out that the life outside is much harder.', 'In 1942 during the time of war, Tatar Ramazan goes to jail because murder after argument on lands. When he gets out, he finds out that the life outside is much harder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zQfpL8zQNhavCmvI4Jo3AK9CbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201662'),
  ('770495258704144650', 'Tatar Ramazan Sürgünde', 1992, 'Drama', 'Melih Gülgen, Yeşim Tokat', 'Safa Önal', 'Kadir İnanır, Esin Moralıoğlu, Hayati Hamzaoğlu, Turgut Bağır, Yıldırım Gencer, Kazım Kartal, Yaşar Kutbay, Yusuf Çağatay', null, 'In the sequel to Tatar Ramazan, the events begin with Ramazan''s arrival at the Adana closed prison. Abdurrahman Çavuş, who has established a feudal system in prison for years, and his right-hand man Akseli Bey have oppressed the prisoners. When Tatar Ramazan''s reputation reaches the prison, the two worry that the cycle of robbery will come to an end. Their fears are justified. The oppressed prisoners, however, see Ramazan as their savior.', 'In the sequel to Tatar Ramazan, the events begin with Ramazan''s arrival at the Adana closed prison. Abdurrahman Çavuş, who has established a feudal system in prison for years, and his right-hand man Akseli Bey have oppressed the prisoners. When Tatar Ramazan''s reputation reaches the prison, the two worry that the cycle of robbery will come to an end. Their fears are justified. The oppressed prisoners, however, see Ramazan as their savior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXE4MYFiNM0gH1EU4Lua4LwjyUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350823'),
  ('376027925157657857', 'Tato', 1995, 'Drama', 'Maciej Ślesicki, Krystyna Grochowicz, Haider Rizvi', 'Maciej Ślesicki', 'Bogusław Linda, Dorota Segda, Aleksandra Maliszewska, Cezary Pazura, Krystyna Janda, Aleksandra Maliszewska, Teresa Lipowska, Renata Dancewicz', null, 'Tato is the story of a divorced father fighting for the right to raise his 7-year-old daughter. When his marriage falls apart, he decides to kidnap his daughter rather than let the court award custody to his mentally ill wife, whom he deems unfit to raise their child. But as he quickly finds out, it’s easier to be a real man than it is to be a real father.', 'Tato is the story of a divorced father fighting for the right to raise his 7-year-old daughter. When his marriage falls apart, he decides to kidnap his daughter rather than let the court award custody to his mentally ill wife, whom he deems unfit to raise their child. But as he quickly finds out, it’s easier to be a real man than it is to be a real father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGr76YPDXWVy45bTKbTXofrXfdp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135938'),
  ('34333061406493370', 'Tatsumi', 2011, 'Animation, History, Drama', 'Eric Khoo', 'Yoshihiro Tatsumi', 'Tetsuya Bessho, Motoko Gollent, Yoshihiro Tatsumi, Mike Wiluan', null, 'Animated film based on the life and stories of Manga writer Yoshihiro Tatsumi who revolutionised the art form with darker, more adult stories. The film animates several of his stories.', 'Animated film based on the life and stories of Manga writer Yoshihiro Tatsumi who revolutionised the art form with darker, more adult stories. The film animates several of his stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZOc4CM6y9uxENQp7G871AYG1zE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83114'),
  ('1111948759549675652', 'Tatti in the World', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Ruedi Gerber, Greta de Lazzaris, Felix von Muralt, Stefan Kälin', 'Ruedi Gerber', 'Jack Whittaker, Niccolò Baldoni, Enna Bernardini, Daniela Borghi', null, 'During decades of globalization, countless rural communities worldwide found themselves abandoned - from America''s Midwest to Italy''s mountain villages and places like Tatti face extinction. In this small Italian town, elderly residents lacked the strength to reinvent their fading world and lost hope – until outsiders arrived.', 'During decades of globalization, countless rural communities worldwide found themselves abandoned - from America''s Midwest to Italy''s mountain villages and places like Tatti face extinction. In this small Italian town, elderly residents lacked the strength to reinvent their fading world and lost hope – until outsiders arrived.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvC2JmOIUIQW4cJCsA4ccO9VMGuO.jpg', 'plex:movie:tatti-paese-di-sognatori'),
  ('750824258734106082', 'Tattoo', 1981, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Bob Brooks, Arthur J. Ornitz, Michael Seresin', 'Joyce Buñuel', 'Bruce Dern, Maud Adams, Leonard Frey, Frederikke Borge, John Getz, Peter Iacangelo, Alan Leach, Cynthia Nixon', 'R', 'Karl Kinsky, an unbalanced tattoo artist, becomes obsessed with Maddy, a model he meets when he is hired to body-paint several women for a photo shoot, making the women look like they have large tattoos. As Kinsky grows more obsessed with Maddy, he becomes increasingly determined that Maddy should bear his "mark" -- forever.', 'Karl Kinsky, an unbalanced tattoo artist, becomes obsessed with Maddy, a model he meets when he is hired to body-paint several women for a photo shoot, making the women look like they have large tattoos. As Kinsky grows more obsessed with Maddy, he becomes increasingly determined that Maddy should bear his "mark" -- forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wglGuzZm70zkbv97hskUmqNfKoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69169'),
  ('221897713733968052', 'Tattoo', 2002, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Jan Fehse, Robert Schwentke, Katja Bernet', 'Robert Schwentke', 'August Diehl, Christian Redl, Nadeshda Brennicke, Johan Leysen, Ilknur Bahadir, Joe Bausch, Fatih Cevikkollu, Florian Panzner', null, 'Marc Schrader, a rookie cop caught red-handed with drugs in a police raid of an illegal rave, joins a homicide investigation conducted by Chief Inspector Minks. The victim is a naked young woman with the skin stripped off her back, killed as she staggered into traffic. As Schrader and Minks investigate the murder, the case is complicated by a finger found in the stomach of the victim. Forensic examination proves the finger belongs to Nobert Günzel, who was previously convicted of rape and assault. The police raid Günzel’s residence, and discover a blood-stained table with restraints and bits of human flesh in his basement. They also find video equipment and preserved, tattooed skin from the victim’s back. Soon, they found dead bodies buried in the garden. Günzel then goes missing.', 'Marc Schrader, a rookie cop caught red-handed with drugs in a police raid of an illegal rave, joins a homicide investigation conducted by Chief Inspector Minks. The victim is a naked young woman with the skin stripped off her back, killed as she staggered into traffic. As Schrader and Minks investigate the murder, the case is complicated by a finger found in the stomach of the victim. Forensic examination proves the finger belongs to Nobert Günzel, who was previously convicted of rape and assault. The police raid Günzel’s residence, and discover a blood-stained table with restraints and bits of human flesh in his basement. They also find video equipment and preserved, tattooed skin from the victim’s back. Soon, they found dead bodies buried in the garden. Günzel then goes missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zM8eBp85uueFX02SEH5TySPevxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9908'),
  ('472449902066944361', 'Tattoo', 2013, 'Drama', 'Ivo Lopes Araújo, Hilton Lacerda, Milena Times', 'Hilton Lacerda', 'Irandhir Santos, Jesuíta Barbosa, Rodrigo Garcia, Sylvia Prado, Sílvio Restiffe, Ariclenes Barroso, Deyvid Queiroz de Morais, Soia Lira', null, 'Paulete, the star of a daring theater group, is visited by his military brother-in-law, the young Fininha. A torrid relationship arises between the two, and now the soldier must deal with the prevailing repression during the Brazilian military dictatorship.', 'Paulete, the star of a daring theater group, is visited by his military brother-in-law, the young Fininha. A torrid relationship arises between the two, and now the soldier must deal with the prevailing repression during the Brazilian military dictatorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTOAnRwz9LzesLqis5VwR9sWNnM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227493'),
  ('917037848375251367', 'Tattoo of Revenge', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance, Thriller', 'Alejandro Cantú, Julián Hernández, Víctor García', 'Malú Huacuja del Toro', 'Diana Lein, Irving Peña, Mónica del Carmen, César Romero Medrano, Cesar Ramos, Giovanna Zacarías, Rocío Verdejo, Itatí Cantoral', null, 'After suffering a violent incident, a woman decides to become a vigilante, defending every woman who has suffered from physical or psychological abuse.', 'After suffering a violent incident, a woman decides to become a vigilante, defending every woman who has suffered from physical or psychological abuse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25pYdJVvfUeF3fyqbKZwsYgJvas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272094'),
  ('86929243584901290', 'Tattooed Flower Vase', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Masaru Konuma, Masaru Mori, Saburô Takahashi', 'Seiji Matsuoka', 'Naomi Tani, Takako Kitagawa, Hiroshi Chō, Genshū Hanayagi, Keizo Kanie, Shinsho Nakamaru, Mami Yuki, Tamaki Komiyama', null, 'Ms. Yoshino, respectable lady and attractive widow, leads a quiet and peaceful life with her teenage daughter Takako. However, their lifes change radically when fate confronts both with the young Hideo. While spending time with Takako, the latter is more attracted to her mother, and she in turn starts to feel the same, because he reminds her of his late father, a kabuki actor with whom she had an affair in the past.', 'Ms. Yoshino, respectable lady and attractive widow, leads a quiet and peaceful life with her teenage daughter Takako. However, their lifes change radically when fate confronts both with the young Hideo. While spending time with Takako, the latter is more attracted to her mother, and she in turn starts to feel the same, because he reminds her of his late father, a kabuki actor with whom she had an affair in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psYJoLQfeniG1l8oRrECuq3MGGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106973'),
  ('150958873477132356', 'Tattooed Life', 1965, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Seijun Suzuki, Kuratarō Takamura, Masami Kuzū', 'Kei Hattori, Kinya Naoi', 'Hideki Takahashi, Masako Izumi, Akira Yamanouchi, Yuji Odaka, Kotobuki Hananomoto, Hiroko Itō, Kayo Matsuo, Hōsei Komatsu', null, 'After his own gang sets him up to kill a rival mobster, a hit man is forced to flee with his younger brother.', 'After his own gang sets him up to kill a rival mobster, a hit man is forced to flee with his younger brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhJ6fISn8H7NVxEBANb8RKdWhd2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88435'),
