  ('175597317660795800', 'Tau', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Federico D''Alessandro, Larry Smith', 'Noga Landau', 'Maika Monroe, Ed Skrein, Gary Oldman, Fiston Barek, Ivana Živković, Paul Leonard Murray, Dragoljub Ljubičić, Sharon D. Clarke', 'R', 'Held captive in a futuristic smart house, a woman hopes to escape by befriending the A.I. program that controls the house.', 'Held captive in a futuristic smart house, a woman hopes to escape by befriending the A.I. program that controls the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqYOlCee3X7cKg05EOQH1htcHmy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411143'),
  ('160766892777352878', 'Taurus', 2001, 'Drama', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Sergei Razhuk, Tatyana Komarova', 'Yuriy Arabov', 'Leonid Mozgovoy, Mariya Kuznetsova, Sergei Razhuk, Natalya Nikulenko, Lev Eliseev, Nikolay Ustinov, Aleksandr Chaban, Fyodor Lavrov', null, 'Unfolding over two days in 1924, the film depicts the dying Lenin, world revolutionary and father of the USSR, now powerless and isolated at his Gorki estate. Cared for by his wife, Nadezhda Krupskaia, sister Maniasha, his German doctor and several attendants, Lenin raves about his diminishing faculties, discusses the deaths of great figures (including Marx), rides a car to a picnic in a meadow and ponders his historic legacy.', 'Unfolding over two days in 1924, the film depicts the dying Lenin, world revolutionary and father of the USSR, now powerless and isolated at his Gorki estate. Cared for by his wife, Nadezhda Krupskaia, sister Maniasha, his German doctor and several attendants, Lenin raves about his diminishing faculties, discusses the deaths of great figures (including Marx), rides a car to a picnic in a meadow and ponders his historic legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jnNUnul7DQeCCtrz1eImdT4ZLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45943'),
  ('956466748109229146', 'Taurus', 2022, 'Drama, Music', 'John Brawley, Tim Sutton, James Grayford', 'Tim Sutton', 'mgk, Maddie Hasson, Megan Fox, Scoot McNairy, Ruby Rose, Lil Meech, Lil Tjay, Naomi Wild', 'NR', 'A rising but troubled musician searches for the inspiration to record one last song, pushing himself deep into the void.', 'A rising but troubled musician searches for the inspiration to record one last song, pushing himself deep into the void.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWH1s160oYX1vybg3zPnL4ygMpw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844547'),
  ('347575601310352673', 'Tavern Man', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Timo Salminen, Aki Kaurismäki', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Ilkka Koivula', null, 'A typical day in the life of a lonely man who works in an unsuccessful tavern located in the historical center of Guimarães, an old town in Portugal. During the day, the man spends his time coming up with new menu items for his tavern, while at night he gets ready to meet someone special.', 'A typical day in the life of a lonely man who works in an unsuccessful tavern located in the historical center of Guimarães, an old town in Portugal. During the day, the man spends his time coming up with new menu items for his tavern, while at night he gets ready to meet someone special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AFLrACcNB8SIJtAHkXATvoCw0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610428'),
  ('582975527176284679', 'Taxandria', 1996, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure', 'Raoul Servais', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet, Raoul Servais, Frank Daniel', 'Armin Mueller-Stahl, Elliott Spiers, Katja Studt, Richard Kattan, Julien Schoenaerts, Andrew Sachs, Daniel Emilfork, Cris Campion', null, 'A lighthouse guardian leads a young prince towards an imaginary world, Taxandria, where the boy learns about the power of love and the value of liberty. A totalitarian regime has forbidden time: time watches have been confiscated, photo cameras are illegal as they freeze a point in time. A typical Servais theme: a power is oppressed by a constraint that denies what is best in the individual, and therefore has to be twisted in various ways, to establish an entirely artificial world, that has rules that may question some of the rules of our world at this side of the mirror.', 'A lighthouse guardian leads a young prince towards an imaginary world, Taxandria, where the boy learns about the power of love and the value of liberty. A totalitarian regime has forbidden time: time watches have been confiscated, photo cameras are illegal as they freeze a point in time. A typical Servais theme: a power is oppressed by a constraint that denies what is best in the individual, and therefore has to be twisted in various ways, to establish an entirely artificial world, that has rules that may question some of the rules of our world at this side of the mirror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gU0eypUcxcoFaqoZwMrFuXVylb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153272'),
  ('376132199110273096', 'Taxi', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Carlos Saura, Vittorio Storaro', 'Santiago Tabernero', 'Ingrid Rubio, Carlos Fuentes, Ágata Lys, Ángel de Andrés López, Maite Blasco, Eusebio Lázaro, Pilar Ordóñez, Francisco Maestre', null, 'A young girl, after failing an exam, is forced by her father, a taxi-driver, to learn his profession. Soon she discovers that her father is not only a driver but also a member of a racist group eliminating immigrants, homosexual, transvestite, etc. people. She also falls in love with a boy, also a taxi-driver and a "socio" of the group.', 'A young girl, after failing an exam, is forced by her father, a taxi-driver, to learn his profession. Soon she discovers that her father is not only a driver but also a member of a racist group eliminating immigrants, homosexual, transvestite, etc. people. She also falls in love with a boy, also a taxi-driver and a "socio" of the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTJNRFurkigWxwPtHC7pISEDlYf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56284'),
  ('544766034130185560', 'Taxi', 1998, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Adventure', 'Gérard Pirès, Jean-Pierre Sauvaire, Sophie Davin', 'Luc Besson', 'Samy Naceri, Frédéric Diefenthal, Marion Cotillard, Manuela Gourary, Emma Wiklund, Bernard Farcy, Georges Neri, Guy Quang', null, 'In Marseilles a skilled pizza delivery boy Daniel who drives a scooter finally has his dreams come true. He gets a taxi license. Caught by the police for a huge speed infraction, he will help Emilien, a loser inspector who can''t drive, on the track of German bank robbers, so he doesn''t lose his license and his dream job.', 'In Marseilles a skilled pizza delivery boy Daniel who drives a scooter finally has his dreams come true. He gets a taxi license. Caught by the police for a huge speed infraction, he will help Emilien, a loser inspector who can''t drive, on the track of German bank robbers, so he doesn''t lose his license and his dream job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egBxj3ude84theXc3cLbBHrWOkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2330'),
  ('62236219260079729', 'Taxi', 2004, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Tim Story, Vance Burberry, Toni Barton', 'Luc Besson', 'Queen Latifah, Jimmy Fallon, Gisele Bündchen, Jennifer Esposito, Henry Simmons, Christian Kane, Ann-Margret, Ana Cristina Oliveira', 'PG-13', 'A mouthy and feisty taxicab driver has hot tips for a green and inept cop set on solving a string of New York City bank robberies committed by a quartet of female Brazilian bank robbers.', 'A mouthy and feisty taxicab driver has hot tips for a green and inept cop set on solving a string of New York City bank robberies committed by a quartet of female Brazilian bank robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLDoNLJHZPcavTT1vJqZoGydoWB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11045'),
  ('648510000332051750', 'Taxi', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jafar Panahi, Jafar Panahi', 'Jafar Panahi', 'Jafar Panahi, Hana Saeidi, Nasrin Sotoudeh, Majid Panahi', null, 'A yellow cab is driving through the vibrant and colourful streets of Tehran. Very diverse passengers enter the taxi, each candidly expressing their views while being interviewed by the driver who is no one else but the director Jafar Panahi himself. His camera placed on the dashboard of his mobile film studio captures the spirit of Iranian society through this comedic and dramatic drive…', 'A yellow cab is driving through the vibrant and colourful streets of Tehran. Very diverse passengers enter the taxi, each candidly expressing their views while being interviewed by the driver who is no one else but the director Jafar Panahi himself. His camera placed on the dashboard of his mobile film studio captures the spirit of Iranian society through this comedic and dramatic drive…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lY2RW6pxRYyPmrgUF0rjqbeAnTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320006'),
  ('207708699975049407', 'Taxi 2', 2000, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure, Crime', 'Gérard Sterin, Gérard Krawczyk, Andrea Fontana', 'Luc Besson', 'Samy Naceri, Frédéric Diefenthal, Marion Cotillard, Emma Wiklund, Bernard Farcy, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Frédérique Tirmont, Marc Faure', null, 'A cabdriver and a cop race to Paris to rescue a love interest and the Japanese minister of defense from kidnappers.', 'A cabdriver and a cop race to Paris to rescue a love interest and the Japanese minister of defense from kidnappers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0js1eYtKxfw4RBxiTukO7q66Rf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2332'),
  ('417922796880388552', 'Taxi 3', 2003, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Gérard Sterin, Gérard Krawczyk, Olivier Hourton', 'Luc Besson', 'Samy Naceri, Frédéric Diefenthal, Bernard Farcy, Emma Wiklund, Marion Cotillard, Bai Ling, Édouard Montoute, Jean-Christophe Bouvet', null, 'A gang of thieves calling themselves the Santa Claus Gang are wreaking havoc, and the police can''t keep up. Police Captain Gilbert is distracted by a Chinese reporter writing a story on his squad, and taxi driver Daniel is in the midst of a relationship crisis. After a string of mistakes in which the thieves outsmart the police time and time again, Daniel and his super-taxi pitch in.', 'A gang of thieves calling themselves the Santa Claus Gang are wreaking havoc, and the police can''t keep up. Police Captain Gilbert is distracted by a Chinese reporter writing a story on his squad, and taxi driver Daniel is in the midst of a relationship crisis. After a string of mistakes in which the thieves outsmart the police time and time again, Daniel and his super-taxi pitch in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Yk3O5mNIYpIKIKaB2l4TJBDdlS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2334'),
  ('198749897555782514', 'Taxi 4', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Gérard Krawczyk, Pierre Morel, Guillaume Morand', 'Luc Besson', 'Samy Naceri, Frédéric Diefenthal, Bernard Farcy, Emma Wiklund, Édouard Montoute, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Jean-Luc Couchard, François Damiens', null, 'Before being extradited to Africa to stand trial, a notorious Belgian criminal is entrusted to the Marseilles police department for less than 24 hours. But the wily crook convinces bumbling policeman Emilien he''s a lowly Belgian embassy employee who got railroaded by the brilliant master criminal.', 'Before being extradited to Africa to stand trial, a notorious Belgian criminal is entrusted to the Marseilles police department for less than 24 hours. But the wily crook convinces bumbling policeman Emilien he''s a lowly Belgian embassy employee who got railroaded by the brilliant master criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqjMGQzdMohCL66uCqbyvWBP896.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2335'),
  ('867138042986131522', 'Taxi 5', 2018, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Vincent Richard-Marquis, Franck Gastambide, Luc Besson', 'Franck Gastambide, Stéphane Kazandjian, Luc Besson', 'Franck Gastambide, Malik Bentalha, Bernard Farcy, Salvatore Esposito, Édouard Montoute, Sabrina Ouazani, Sand Van Roy, Anouar Toubali', null, 'A police officer who''s transfered in the police of Marseille gets assigned to take down a group of Italian robbers who drive the powerfull Ferrari''s with the older niece of Daniel, a terrible driver who gets the legendary white taxi.', 'A police officer who''s transfered in the police of Marseille gets assigned to take down a group of Italian robbers who drive the powerfull Ferrari''s with the older niece of Daniel, a terrible driver who gets the legendary white taxi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9xqSAKN0gAa8GIoHwAC7IsmCw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434355'),
  ('228180083937771161', 'Taxi Blues', 1990, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pavel Lungin, Yuri Kryuchkov, Eduard Gimpel', 'Pavel Lungin', 'Pyotr Mamonov, Pyotr Zaychenko, Natalya Kolyakanova, Elena Safonova, Vladimir Kashpur, Sergey Gazarov, Igor Zolotovitsky, Vladimir Sterzhakov', null, 'Ivan is old Russia: thick, dour, hard-working, often brutish; he misses Communism. He drives a taxi and one night meets Alexi, a new Russian, a musician, an alcoholic, irresponsible. Alexi stiffs Ivan for the fare, so Ivan tracks him down and a love-hate relationship ensues. When Alexi lets the bath water run over in Ivan''s flat and Ivan must pay 500 rubles for repairs, he tries to force Alexi into day labor to repay him. It''s hopeless. Then, suddenly, Alexi is discovered, goes on a jazz tour of America, becomes a celebrity, and returns in triumph. Ivan longs to renew the friendship, and it looks as if he may get what he wants.', 'Ivan is old Russia: thick, dour, hard-working, often brutish; he misses Communism. He drives a taxi and one night meets Alexi, a new Russian, a musician, an alcoholic, irresponsible. Alexi stiffs Ivan for the fare, so Ivan tracks him down and a love-hate relationship ensues. When Alexi lets the bath water run over in Ivan''s flat and Ivan must pay 500 rubles for repairs, he tries to force Alexi into day labor to repay him. It''s hopeless. Then, suddenly, Alexi is discovered, goes on a jazz tour of America, becomes a celebrity, and returns in triumph. Ivan longs to renew the friendship, and it looks as if he may get what he wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOWdSyompSqcyynAPP7LQSjkHwM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41842'),
  ('622937816662720665', 'Taxi Driver', 1976, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michael Chapman, Ralph S. Singleton, William Eustace', 'Paul Schrader', 'Robert De Niro, Jodie Foster, Cybill Shepherd, Harvey Keitel, Peter Boyle, Leonard Harris, Albert Brooks, Diahnne Abbott', 'R', 'Suffering from insomnia, disturbed loner Travis Bickle takes a job as a New York City cabbie, haunting the streets nightly, growing increasingly detached from reality as he dreams of cleaning up the filthy city.', 'Suffering from insomnia, disturbed loner Travis Bickle takes a job as a New York City cabbie, haunting the streets nightly, growing increasingly detached from reality as he dreams of cleaning up the filthy city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekstpH614fwDX8DUln1a2Opz0N8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103'),
  ('1151836851289922772', 'Taxi Drivers', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Bogdan Theodor Olteanu, Theodor Boia', 'Adrian Nicolae, Bogdan Theodor Olteanu', 'Alexandru Ion, Rolando Matsangos, Victoria Raileanu, Maria Popistașu, Madalina Stoica, Andi Vasluianu, Cosmin Nedelcu, Monica Bîrlădeanu', null, 'A night. Dozens of stories. A city. Lică, a taxi driver, is an all knowing guy, while Liviu, his friend, also a taxi driver keeps a lot to himself. They are completely different and their ideas about life and people only meet when they are eating and drinking at the bar. They are frustrated with their jobs. For Lică money is the most important thing, while Liviu thinks that a happy and fulfilling life represents more. They are trying to rediscover who they are and what they can do with their life, all while being on an on going adventure on the streets of Bucharest where they cross paths with all kinds of clients who end up having an impact on their lives, for better and also for worse.', 'A night. Dozens of stories. A city. Lică, a taxi driver, is an all knowing guy, while Liviu, his friend, also a taxi driver keeps a lot to himself. They are completely different and their ideas about life and people only meet when they are eating and drinking at the bar. They are frustrated with their jobs. For Lică money is the most important thing, while Liviu thinks that a happy and fulfilling life represents more. They are trying to rediscover who they are and what they can do with their life, all while being on an on going adventure on the streets of Bucharest where they cross paths with all kinds of clients who end up having an impact on their lives, for better and also for worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trsPAVN87IeVBaYVJ0AATichw1w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072586'),
  ('410619767468263816', 'Taxi for Tobruk', 1961, 'History, Drama, War', 'Denys de La Patellière, Marcel Grignon, Salvador Torres Garriga', 'Michel Audiard', 'Hardy Krüger, Lino Ventura, Charles Aznavour, Maurice Biraud, Germán Cobos', null, 'During World War II, French Commandos join forces with a German officer in order to survive the African desert.', 'During World War II, French Commandos join forces with a German officer in order to survive the African desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2J7eq4oqKt9YrSTQW2SJXkeHcAm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33336'),
  ('412310260984497337', 'Taxi Girl', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Michele Massimo Tarantini, Giancarlo Ferrando, Alessandro Metz', 'Francesco Milizia, Michele Massimo Tarantini', 'Edwige Fenech, Aldo Maccione, Michele Gammino, Gianfranco D''Angelo, Alvaro Vitali, Giacomo Rizzo, Gastone Pescucci, Rossana Di Lorenzo', null, 'Marcella inherits a taxi business from her father and now sets out on the job of her life. With each new fare she becomes involved with sex and crime, all done up 70''s Italian comedy style.', 'Marcella inherits a taxi business from her father and now sets out on the job of her life. With each new fare she becomes involved with sex and crime, all done up 70''s Italian comedy style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yEtiK4H1hqRyJtmQGMjfakP4iE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114738'),
  ('125630227795588593', 'Taxi Hunter', 1993, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Herman Yau, Puccini Yu Kwok-Ping', 'Ray Mak, Lau Yin, Herman Yau', 'Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Yu Rongguang, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Athena Chu Yan, Perrie Lai Hoi-San, Chan Fai-Hung, Joey Fan Oi-Kit, Lung Tin-Sang', null, 'Kin is a hard-working insurance salesman with a very pregnant wife. When his wife starts haemorrhaging, he calls a taxi, but it leaves when someone else offers more money. After his wife dies, Kin vows to get revenge on all taxi drivers by taking them out one at a time.', 'Kin is a hard-working insurance salesman with a very pregnant wife. When his wife starts haemorrhaging, he calls a taxi, but it leaves when someone else offers more money. After his wife dies, Kin vows to get revenge on all taxi drivers by taking them out one at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twx2xEOQzbfbK4Y08MmvILw5RwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154115'),
