  ('321581668718618822', 'Taxidermia', 2006, 'Drama, Horror, Comedy', 'Gergely Pohárnok, György Pálfi', 'György Pálfi, Zsófia Ruttkay', 'Csaba Czene, Gergely Trócsányi, Marc Bischoff, István Gyuricza, Piroska Molnár, Gábor Máté, Géza D. Hegedűs, István Hunyadkürthy', null, 'Set over three generations and beginning with a sexually frustrated orderly during WWII who relieves his tensions in the most outlandish, gross ways. The result of his liaison is a glutton who grows up to be a champion speed eater. He produces a child who becomes obsessed with taxidermy.', 'Set over three generations and beginning with a sexually frustrated orderly during WWII who relieves his tensions in the most outlandish, gross ways. The result of his liaison is a glutton who grows up to be a champion speed eater. He produces a child who becomes obsessed with taxidermy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRqxKim0Vr1JZPLYcR1rjFtu74p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15742'),
