  ('639712575447878994', 'Taylor Swift City of Lover Concert', 2020, 'Music', 'Dan Massie, Ben Coughlan, David Cook', 'Taylor Swift', 'Taylor Swift, David Cook, Amos Heller, Matt Billingslea, Max Bernstein, Mike Meadows, Paul Sidoti, Kamilah Marshall', 'PG', 'In a once-in-a-lifetime musical event, Taylor Swift performs songs from her award-winning album, “Lover.” Filmed in Paris, the City of Love, in September 2019, this show gives fans unprecedented access to behind-the-scenes moments with the artist and marks her only concert performance in 2020.', 'In a once-in-a-lifetime musical event, Taylor Swift performs songs from her award-winning album, “Lover.” Filmed in Paris, the City of Love, in September 2019, this show gives fans unprecedented access to behind-the-scenes moments with the artist and marks her only concert performance in 2020.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJYwjrLKDI7QqTQ0kn6H3ZICuop.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:701684'),
  ('632156457856938886', 'Taylor Swift: The 1989 World Tour - Live', 2015, 'Music', 'Pär M. Ekberg, Andrew Coffing, Jonas Åkerlund', null, 'Taylor Swift, Mick Jagger, Wiz Khalifa, Ally Brooke, Camila Cabello, Dinah Jane, Lauren Jauregui, Normani', 'NR', 'Filmed in front of 76,000 fans at the ANZ Stadium in Sydney, Australia, "The 1989 World Tour Live" captures Taylor Swift''s entire performance while also mixing in behind-the-scene, rehearsal, and special guest footage from her 1989 Tour.', 'Filmed in front of 76,000 fans at the ANZ Stadium in Sydney, Australia, "The 1989 World Tour Live" captures Taylor Swift''s entire performance while also mixing in behind-the-scene, rehearsal, and special guest footage from her 1989 Tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwRGig0N8l6v5WxdrmwSBEBToAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373558'),
  ('808366082817503495', 'Taylor Tomlinson: Have It All', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Kristian Mercado Figueroa, Jay Lafayette, David Butzler', 'Taylor Tomlinson', 'Taylor Tomlinson', 'R', 'Can Taylor Tomlinson have it all? From dating woes to dream jobs to inventive dirty talk, she shares life''s ups and downs in this stand-up comedy special.', 'Can Taylor Tomlinson have it all? From dating woes to dream jobs to inventive dirty talk, she shares life''s ups and downs in this stand-up comedy special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHsbWXfhVk53azsXICJGzn2imMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1227770'),
  ('953279133564427823', 'Taylor Tomlinson: Look at You', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Kristian Mercado Figueroa, Jay Lafayette', 'Taylor Tomlinson', 'Taylor Tomlinson', null, 'Breakups. Therapy. Bangs. Taylor''s gone through some stuff since her quarter-life crisis, and she spins her mental health journey into insightful comedy.', 'Breakups. Therapy. Bangs. Taylor''s gone through some stuff since her quarter-life crisis, and she spins her mental health journey into insightful comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/de8ZRKr0TEFTuvdvlolIt6bLJUk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937348'),
  ('345672313158421568', 'Taylor Tomlinson: Quarter-Life Crisis', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Dylan Sanford, Marcus Raboy', 'Taylor Tomlinson', 'Taylor Tomlinson', 'PG-13', 'Comedian Taylor Tomlinson is halfway through her 20s — and she''s over it. From dating losers to a failed engagement, she takes aim at her life choices.', 'Comedian Taylor Tomlinson is halfway through her 20s — and she''s over it. From dating losers to a failed engagement, she takes aim at her life choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3dWZYGa0Tq1mdOUrUXTF7i2n3z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671652'),
  ('285076096495355482', 'Tayna admirala Ushakova', 2026, 'Adventure, History', 'Dmitry Korobkin', 'Yusup Razykov, Svetlana Koroleva', 'Yuri Belyayev, Mikhail Boyarskiy, Stanislav Duzhnikov', null, 'Russian Empire, 1812. While Napoleon gathers his troops, a French spy infiltrates Admiral Fyodor Ushakov''s estate. The great naval commander is ready to rejoin the fray, and his weapons will be his faith and love for his homeland.', 'Russian Empire, 1812. While Napoleon gathers his troops, a French spy infiltrates Admiral Fyodor Ushakov''s estate. The great naval commander is ready to rejoin the fray, and his weapons will be his faith and love for his homeland.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F3O8kCyldHQf78LmOCAl7PFI9LNM.jpg', 'plex:movie:tayna-admirala-ushakova'),
  ('695418027408345800', 'Tayuan', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Topel Lee', 'Michelle Ngu', 'Angeli Khang, Stephanie Raz, Chester Grecia, Francine Garcia, Rash Flores, PJ Rosario, Anthony Dabao, Dianne Moldez', null, 'Ella, an events project manager, usually takes a private transportation service. However, she is forced to take a bus, where bus conductor Rico becomes aroused when her body gets pressed into him due to the thick crowd. This encounter deeply affects Ella, and from that night on, she starts pursuing Rico. Even after discovering that Rico already has a live-in partner and a daughter, Ella doesn’t care at all and she’ll do anything to make him want her just as much.', 'Ella, an events project manager, usually takes a private transportation service. However, she is forced to take a bus, where bus conductor Rico becomes aroused when her body gets pressed into him due to the thick crowd. This encounter deeply affects Ella, and from that night on, she starts pursuing Rico. Even after discovering that Rico already has a live-in partner and a daughter, Ella doesn’t care at all and she’ll do anything to make him want her just as much.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eX2JxR8djmoPBQhU0327uehqBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127227'),
  ('108205306474919921', 'Taz: Quest for Burger', 2023, 'Comedy, Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Ryan Kramer, Sean Covernton', 'Bryan Condon', 'Steve Blum, Hadley Gannaway, Eric Bauza, Ian James Corlett, Ely Henry, Piotr Michael, Kevin Michael Richardson, Jon Luke Thomas', null, 'After an outlaw abducts her father and steals her town’s food supply, a feisty adolescent bandicoot named Quinn recruits the Tasmanian Devil to help her find the thief. Taz may be an ill-tempered rogue with a fearsome reputation, but he and Quinn will have to work together to track the criminal through the wilds of Tasmania and save her community.', 'After an outlaw abducts her father and steals her town’s food supply, a feisty adolescent bandicoot named Quinn recruits the Tasmanian Devil to help her find the thief. Taz may be an ill-tempered rogue with a fearsome reputation, but he and Quinn will have to work together to track the criminal through the wilds of Tasmania and save her community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL4GDXHnwknt5oyD9eyyi693gbB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1109207'),
  ('1145279988987341787', 'Taza, Son of Cochise', 1954, 'Western', 'Douglas Sirk, Tom Shaw, Russell Metty', 'George Zuckerman', 'Rock Hudson, Barbara Rush, Gregg Palmer, Rex Reason, Morris Ankrum, Eugene Iglesias, Richard H. Cutting, Ian MacDonald', 'NR', 'Three years after the end of the Apache wars, peacemaking chief Cochise dies. His elder son Taza shares his ideas, but brother Naiche yearns for war...and for Taza''s betrothed, Oona. Naiche loses no time in starting trouble which, thanks to a bigoted cavalry officer, ends with the proud Chiricahua Apaches on a reservation, where they are soon joined by the captured renegade Geronimo, who is all it takes to light the firecracker''s fuse...', 'Three years after the end of the Apache wars, peacemaking chief Cochise dies. His elder son Taza shares his ideas, but brother Naiche yearns for war...and for Taza''s betrothed, Oona. Naiche loses no time in starting trouble which, thanks to a bigoted cavalry officer, ends with the proud Chiricahua Apaches on a reservation, where they are soon joined by the captured renegade Geronimo, who is all it takes to light the firecracker''s fuse...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSJmpVgm28EUOtVDj16q5YmFwqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81417'),
  ('682454897196537268', 'Tazza: One Eyed Jack', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kwon O-kwang, Byun Bong-sun, Song Hyun-suk', 'Kwon O-kwang, Jeong Cheol', 'Park Jeong-min, Ryoo Seung-bum, Choi Yu-hwa, Woo Hyeon, Yoon Je-moon, Lee Kwang-soo, Kwon Hae-hyo, Lim Ji-yeon', null, 'A young poker player at the top of his game joins a team led by the legendary poker player One-Eyed Jack. While successfully working on a plan to win a huge jackpot, a single mistake puts the entire team in a life-or-death situation.', 'A young poker player at the top of his game joins a team led by the legendary poker player One-Eyed Jack. While successfully working on a plan to win a huge jackpot, a single mistake puts the entire team in a life-or-death situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hj0z3JltvNtEz9p5WS2YRgtjTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574302'),
  ('149121073520762932', 'Tazza: The Hidden Card', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kim Jang-mi, Hong Seung-chul, Kang Hyoung-chul', 'Cho Sang-bum, Kang Hyoung-chul', 'T.O.P, Shin Sae-kyeong, Kwak Do-won, Lee Hanee, Yoo Hai-jin, Kim Yun-seok, Lee Kyung-young, Kim In-kwon', null, 'Dae-gil has been skilled with his hands and has shown a strong desire for winning ever since he was a child. He will succeed his uncle and jump into the world of Tazza, risking his life in competition.', 'Dae-gil has been skilled with his hands and has shown a strong desire for winning ever since he was a child. He will succeed his uncle and jump into the world of Tazza, risking his life in competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWiOBlD8NSuOJRQAZHOzPRFrwa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290865'),
  ('407184935027777693', 'Tazza: The High Rollers', 2006, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Choi Dong-hoon, Choi Young-hwan, Kim Sung-kwan', 'Choi Dong-hoon', 'Cho Seung-woo, Kim Hye-soo, Baek Yoon-sik, Yoo Hai-jin, Kim Eung-soo, Kim Sang-ho, Kim Yun-seok, Ju Jin-mo', null, 'Go-ni tries his best to worship Pyung Gyung-jang as his teacher, and promises to stop gambling after winning his money back. But people''s desires are endless.', 'Go-ni tries his best to worship Pyung Gyung-jang as his teacher, and promises to stop gambling after winning his money back. But people''s desires are endless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIIGKcD9CmCYPYaCOZg3rTw0bRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38015'),
  ('399546251770142506', 'TC 2000', 1993, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'T.J. Scott, Curtis Petersen', 'T.J. Scott', 'Bolo Yeung, Billy Blanks, Jalal Merhi, Bobbie Phillips, Matthias Hues, Kelly Gallant, Alex Appel, Harry Mok', null, 'Somewhere in the future the environmental overkill had come. Many people had died. The rich were able to build the underworld, the poor had to stay on the surface building gangs to survive. Jason Storm, an underworld guard gets knowledge of a conspiracy to kill all people on the surface. He needs to flee to the surface, and wins Sumai, a respected martial arts master, as his ally to stop the dirty plot.', 'Somewhere in the future the environmental overkill had come. Many people had died. The rich were able to build the underworld, the poor had to stay on the surface building gangs to survive. Jason Storm, an underworld guard gets knowledge of a conspiracy to kill all people on the surface. He needs to flee to the surface, and wins Sumai, a respected martial arts master, as his ally to stop the dirty plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVULeqvSEykblA3lBBHNbDBDVrq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56172'),
  ('1127419051941219139', 'Tchaikovsky''s Wife', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Vladislav Opelyants, Kirill Serebrennikov, Anna Shalashina', 'Kirill Serebrennikov', 'Alyona Mikhaylova, Odin Lund Biron, Nikita Elenev, Ekaterina Ermishina, Philipp Avdeev, Miron Fedorov, Andrey Burkovskiy, Aleksandr Gorchilin', null, 'Antonina Milyukova is a beautiful and bright young woman, born in the aristocracy of 19th century Russia. She could have anything she''d want, and yet her only obsession is to marry Pyotr Tchaikovsky, with whom she falls in love from the very moment she hears his music. The composer finally accepts this union, but after blaming her for his misfortunes and breakdowns, his attempts to get rid of his wife are brutal. Consumed by her feelings for him, Antonina decides to endure and do whatever it takes to stay with him. Humiliated, disgraced and discarded, she is slowly driven to madness.', 'Antonina Milyukova is a beautiful and bright young woman, born in the aristocracy of 19th century Russia. She could have anything she''d want, and yet her only obsession is to marry Pyotr Tchaikovsky, with whom she falls in love from the very moment she hears his music. The composer finally accepts this union, but after blaming her for his misfortunes and breakdowns, his attempts to get rid of his wife are brutal. Consumed by her feelings for him, Antonina decides to endure and do whatever it takes to stay with him. Humiliated, disgraced and discarded, she is slowly driven to madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SHL9l0gCACJExESoYUP4Rlr7tL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:901358'),
  ('1006401110485239481', 'Tchin-Chao, the Chinese Conjurer', 1904, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A Chinese conjurer stands next to a table, it becomes two tables. A fan becomes a parasol, lanterns appear and disappear. The conjurer spins the open parasol in front of himself, and a dog leaps out from behind it. The dog becomes a woman, then a masked man appears. The conjurer sits them each on a box a few feet apart: suddenly the woman and man have changed places. The disappearing and the transfers continue in front of a simple backdrop.', 'A Chinese conjurer stands next to a table, it becomes two tables. A fan becomes a parasol, lanterns appear and disappear. The conjurer spins the open parasol in front of himself, and a dog leaps out from behind it. The dog becomes a woman, then a masked man appears. The conjurer sits them each on a box a few feet apart: suddenly the woman and man have changed places. The disappearing and the transfers continue in front of a simple backdrop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJ3ZrZ51GV0cOFelrrjjkuSBDn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185494'),
  ('460298810282572379', 'Te juro que yo no fui', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Joaquín Bissner', null, 'Mauricio Ochmann, Marta Hazas, Ariadne Díaz, Mónica Dionne, Santiago Salcido, María Prado, María Aura, Rodrigo Murray', null, 'Running away from some evil arabs, a woman hides in a counterbass case, causing problems to his owner, a musician with a jelous wife who is trying to win her back.', 'Running away from some evil arabs, a woman hides in a counterbass case, causing problems to his owner, a musician with a jelous wife who is trying to win her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnUzAymfRq5yriq8mVzXuQtkpuu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375795'),
  ('1069005961125039429', 'Te marre pas... c''est pour rire !', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Besnard', null, 'Aldo Maccione, Michel Galabru, Marthe Mercadier, Jacques Marin, Jacques Legras, Chantal Nobel, Corinne Lahaye, Brigitte Lahaie', null, 'A young astrology enthusiast inherits an industrial business. Before any decision, he carefully studies the sign of his interlocutors.', 'A young astrology enthusiast inherits an industrial business. Before any decision, he carefully studies the sign of his interlocutors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48kuf6fDhhOvaMZqa7yF4yjXtL4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114736'),
  ('545075153649574238', 'Te Prego Lá Fora', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Rodrigo Van Der Put', 'Fábio Porchat', 'Rafael Portugal, João Vicente de Castro, Thati Lopes, Fábio de Luca, Nathalia Cruz, Estevam Nabote, Antonio Tabet, Gregório Duvivier', null, 'Everyone knows that being a teenager is not easy, especially when you are a demigod with unlimited powers and risking being crucified at any moment, this is the life of Jesus Christ in his new school.', 'Everyone knows that being a teenager is not easy, especially when you are a demigod with unlimited powers and risking being crucified at any moment, this is the life of Jesus Christ in his new school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k06TIjqtbwplF2Q0EIHT229qUvC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912828'),
  ('575526181337046086', 'Te Presento a Laura', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Fez Ortega', 'Martha Higareda', 'Martha Higareda, Kuno Becker, Adriana Barraza, Joaquín Cosío, Silvia Navarro, Mónica Huarte, Adan Canto, Eugenio Derbez', null, 'This is the story of 23-year-old Laura who lives in the largest city in the world and yet feels alone. She also knows the exact date in which she''ll die: April 30. What Laura doesn''t know is what she''ll do from now till then, and thus she enrolls in a group of optimists, which she finds pathetic but fun. In that group she writes a list of 10 things she wants to do before she dies, some that mean a lot and some that are a lot of fun. The first thing on her list is to save a life.', 'This is the story of 23-year-old Laura who lives in the largest city in the world and yet feels alone. She also knows the exact date in which she''ll die: April 30. What Laura doesn''t know is what she''ll do from now till then, and thus she enrolls in a group of optimists, which she finds pathetic but fun. In that group she writes a list of 10 things she wants to do before she dies, some that mean a lot and some that are a lot of fun. The first thing on her list is to save a life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boacL0GNxCCJPgmQq4JSPmOQltk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70712'),
  ('851067586620997766', 'Te rompo el rating', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Horacio Guisado, Víctor Hugo Caula, Mario Faroni', 'Hugo Sofovich', 'Jorge Porcel, Moria Casán, Javier Portales, Fernando Siro, Camila Perissé, César Bertrand, Luisa Albinoni, Gino Renni', null, 'A television network infiltrates an inept employee (Porcel) in the competition and he begins to ruin all the programs but, instead of subtracting audience, he only managed to improve it.', 'A television network infiltrates an inept employee (Porcel) in the competition and he begins to ruin all the programs but, instead of subtracting audience, he only managed to improve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyGJUDVisvYDXfJuGzrDKBPsGiT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369384'),
  ('561987938653358116', 'Te3n', 2016, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Ribhu Dasgupta, Tushar Kanti Ray', 'Bijesh Jayarajan, Suresh Nair', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Vidya Balan, Padmavati Rao, Mukesh Chhabra, Prakash Belawadi, Masood Akhtar, Tota Roy Chowdhury', null, 'A grandfather, police officer and a priest join hands to investigate and find a missing child.', 'A grandfather, police officer and a priest join hands to investigate and find a missing child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSkghZtZygWBTmv6DQVKcn69mUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377213'),
  ('655901301462598809', 'Tea and Sympathy', 1956, 'Drama', 'Vincente Minnelli, John Alton, Joel Freeman', 'Robert Anderson', 'Deborah Kerr, John Kerr, Leif Erickson, Edward Andrews, Darryl Hickman, Norma Crane, Dean Jones, Jacqueline deWit', null, 'A sensitive young man recalls his time in boarding school when the only person who seemed compassionate towards him was his housemaster''s wife.', 'A sensitive young man recalls his time in boarding school when the only person who seemed compassionate towards him was his housemaster''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkaMwVQKStFH5a311wCRF3io67B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63096'),
  ('1134400789356999973', 'Tea for Two', 1950, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'David Butler, Wilfrid M. Cline, Howard Jackson', 'Frank Mandel', 'Doris Day, Gordon MacRae, Gene Nelson, Eve Arden, Billy De Wolfe, S.Z. Sakall, Bill Goodwin, Patrice Wymore', 'NR', 'In this reworking of "No, No, Nanette," wealthy heiress Nanette Carter bets her uncle $25,000 that she can say "no" to everything for 48 hours. If she wins, she can invest the money in a Broadway show featuring songs written by her beau, and of course, in which she will star. Trouble is, she doesn''t realize her uncle''s been wiped out by the Stock Market crash.', 'In this reworking of "No, No, Nanette," wealthy heiress Nanette Carter bets her uncle $25,000 that she can say "no" to everything for 48 hours. If she wins, she can invest the money in a Broadway show featuring songs written by her beau, and of course, in which she will star. Trouble is, she doesn''t realize her uncle''s been wiped out by the Stock Market crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qeQo1oSoA2C2uBq1av910MHHjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33117'),
  ('74694286070277161', 'Tea for Two Hundred', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Donald is preparing a little picnic when he sees some ants passing by. He decides to tease one, ultimately by piling lots of food onto it. The ant eventually stumbles, but realizes Donald is sitting on a veritable gold mine. He rallies his fellow ants, and while Donald is napping, they cart him to a cliff and drop him into the river. When he returns to the raid in progress, he finds himself powerless to stop it. He dynamites the ant hill, but that only separates the ledge he''s standing on, and he finds himself in the river again as the ants finish off a cupcake.', 'Donald is preparing a little picnic when he sees some ants passing by. He decides to tease one, ultimately by piling lots of food onto it. The ant eventually stumbles, but realizes Donald is sitting on a veritable gold mine. He rallies his fellow ants, and while Donald is napping, they cart him to a cliff and drop him into the river. When he returns to the raid in progress, he finds himself powerless to stop it. He dynamites the ant hill, but that only separates the ledge he''s standing on, and he finds himself in the river again as the ants finish off a cupcake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duxJFPu0hqJEIWf6zSA98RNySBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90497'),
  ('561595684351513519', 'Tea in the Harem', 1985, 'Drama', 'Mehdi Charef, Dominique Chapuis', 'Mehdi Charef', 'Kader Boukhanef, Rémi Martin, Laure Duthilleul, Saïda Bekkouche, Nicole Hiss, Sandrine Dumas, Albert Delpy, Mazouz Ould-Abderrahmane', null, 'The story of two youths – one Algerian, one French – who become juvenile delinquents in a Paris suburb.', 'The story of two youths – one Algerian, one French – who become juvenile delinquents in a Paris suburb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipXQTFF7tZsHntvwvEiK6X6571J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76388'),
  ('1068065788648697265', 'Tea Pets', 2017, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Gary Wang', 'Gary Wang', 'Ji Guanlin, Shi Lei', 'G', 'A group of tea pets—cute clay figurines that are good-luck charms for tea drinkers—embark on a magical animated adventure to find a fabled mystic.', 'A group of tea pets—cute clay figurines that are good-luck charms for tea drinkers—embark on a magical animated adventure to find a fabled mystic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8ku8TwbZaiXGbxeE8is8jHeadw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458186'),
  ('797710246613377782', 'Tea Time', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Pablo Valdés, Maite Alberdi', 'Sebastián Brahm, Maite Alberdi, Juan Eduardo Murillo', 'Maria Teresa Muñoz, Alicia Pérez', null, 'More than sixty years after leaving high school, former classmates Alicia, Gema, Angelica, Ximena and Maria Teresa are still devoted to their regular catch-ups in which they exchange gossip and reminiscences over elaborately presented afternoon teas. Impeccably turned out, the ladies’ free-wheeling tea-time chats run the gamut from mortality and marital infidelity to soccer and twerking.', 'More than sixty years after leaving high school, former classmates Alicia, Gema, Angelica, Ximena and Maria Teresa are still devoted to their regular catch-ups in which they exchange gossip and reminiscences over elaborately presented afternoon teas. Impeccably turned out, the ladies’ free-wheeling tea-time chats run the gamut from mortality and marital infidelity to soccer and twerking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5HjYuw09Ffqs9xD2LnudvKNrca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204506'),
  ('116705736815356401', 'Tea Time Transit', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Andrew Bagwell', 'Carter Graves, Andrew Bagwell', 'Agustin Moro, Sean Mcfarland, Christian Cardona, Andrew Bagwell, Kevan Thieriot', 'NR', 'A mysterious English man runs into two people, requesting a ride to an address', 'A mysterious English man runs into two people, requesting a ride to an address', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CYFqq36kSlyamDRdvuGWZZWr8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1623585'),
  ('531817294564240953', 'Tea with Mussolini', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Franco Zeffirelli, David Watkin', 'John Mortimer', 'Maggie Smith, Judi Dench, Joan Plowright, Cher, Lily Tomlin, Baird Wallace, Charlie Lucas, Michael Williams', 'PG', 'In 1930s fascist Italy, adolescent Luca just lost his mother. His father, a callous businessman, sends him to be taken care of by British expatriate Mary Wallace. Mary and her cultured friends - including artist Arabella, young widow Elsa, and archaeologist Georgie - keep a watchful eye over the boy. But the women''s cultivated lives take a dramatic turn when Allied forces declare war on Mussolini.', 'In 1930s fascist Italy, adolescent Luca just lost his mother. His father, a callous businessman, sends him to be taken care of by British expatriate Mary Wallace. Mary and her cultured friends - including artist Arabella, young widow Elsa, and archaeologist Georgie - keep a watchful eye over the boy. But the women''s cultivated lives take a dramatic turn when Allied forces declare war on Mussolini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3rAPxhhDjqsL1rZJM57pyR7xFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10368'),
  ('1085866969825191615', 'Teacher of the Year', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Jason Strouse', 'Jason Strouse', 'Matt Letscher, Keegan-Michael Key, Sunny Mabrey, Larry Joe Campbell, Jamie Kaler, Jason Sklar, Randy Sklar, Brenda Strong', null, 'Surrounded by the eccentric faculty of Truman High School, Mitch Carter wins the California Teacher of the Year award and immediately receives a tempting offer that may force him to leave his job.', 'Surrounded by the eccentric faculty of Truman High School, Mitch Carter wins the California Teacher of the Year award and immediately receives a tempting offer that may force him to leave his job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kf9hZ3Ol6GpFH0vE0yf1tLzXJMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297362'),
