  ('259342329642867440', 'Teacher''s Pet', 1958, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Seaton, Haskell B. Boggs, Francisco Day', 'Fay Kanin, Michael Kanin', 'Clark Gable, Doris Day, Gig Young, Mamie Van Doren, Nick Adams, Peter Baldwin, Marion Ross, Charles Lane', 'NR', 'A rugged city editor poses as a journalism student and flirts with the professor.', 'A rugged city editor poses as a journalism student and flirts with the professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nScpsAfMBj0ehlisTOuwivnulH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43137'),
  ('1135583558803234288', 'Teacher''s Pet', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Marcus Spiegel, M. David Mullen', 'Richard Brandes', 'Jodi Lyn O''Keefe, Jsu Garcia, Katherine Kendall, Jeanette Brox, Christiana Frank, Todd Robert Anderson, Bill Gratton, Sarah Lancaster', 'R', 'Psychopath Debbie Strand escapes from a mental institution for the criminally insane and takes the identity of a co-ed she meets and sets herself up on a college campus where she once again begins killing students who get in the way of her obsession with her former high school teacher Sam Deckner now teaching at the college.', 'Psychopath Debbie Strand escapes from a mental institution for the criminally insane and takes the identity of a co-ed she meets and sets herself up on a college campus where she once again begins killing students who get in the way of her obsession with her former high school teacher Sam Deckner now teaching at the college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tP0SNBPUWEFd4dz77p4JH2S574.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45511'),
  ('266313217330107332', 'Teacher''s Pet', 2004, 'Animation, Family, Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Timothy Bjorklund, Christina Long', 'Bill Steinkellner, Cherie Steinkellner', 'Nathan Lane, Kelsey Grammer, Shaun Fleming, Debra Jo Rupp, David Ogden Stiers, Jerry Stiller, Paul Reubens, Megan Mullally', 'PG', 'Meet Spot, a clever little dog with big dreams of becoming a real boy. When Spot finds out that a crazy scientist can make his wish come true, he takes a cross-country trek with Leonard, his best friend and master, and their mom. However, Dr. Krank''s experiments are a little less than perfect, and it will take Leonard and his pet pals to right this genetic wrong.', 'Meet Spot, a clever little dog with big dreams of becoming a real boy. When Spot finds out that a crazy scientist can make his wish come true, he takes a cross-country trek with Leonard, his best friend and master, and their mom. However, Dr. Krank''s experiments are a little less than perfect, and it will take Leonard and his pet pals to right this genetic wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IiwOT4QF4beOOdCLbJxdw7xzH1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24034'),
  ('828434325780048349', 'Teachers', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Arthur Hiller, David M. Walsh, L. Andrew Stone', 'W.R. McKinney', 'Nick Nolte, JoBeth Williams, Judd Hirsch, Ralph Macchio, Allen Garfield, Lee Grant, Richard Mulligan, Royal Dano', 'R', 'A teacher reconnects with an old student who is now an attorney representing a family who is suing the school for graduating their son who still cannot read or write. Amid the daily chaos of teaching in an inner city school, Alex Jurel tries to decide if he will lie at his deposition to protect the school or tell the truth and risk throwing away his career.', 'A teacher reconnects with an old student who is now an attorney representing a family who is suing the school for graduating their son who still cannot read or write. Amid the daily chaos of teaching in an inner city school, Alex Jurel tries to decide if he will lie at his deposition to protect the school or tell the truth and risk throwing away his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foWZXdAeNtMubNrjYqSni6iDuVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31601'),
  ('1014111596891609431', 'Teachers Are People', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Alan Reed', null, 'As the narrator explains, educating children is one of the most important things today and the heroic man who takes on this role is "the school teacher" (Goofy, naturally). After taking role call, Goofy tries to teach the class but keeps having to deal with a mischievous trouble-maker named George who enjoys sneaking out of class to go fishing, eating the teacher''s apple, squeaking chalk, making faces while teacher gives a geography lesson, and terrorizing the other students with his water pistol. In the end, George''s mischief goes too far when he destroys the school with an exploding bomb and is forced to write "I will not bomb the school again" 100 times!', 'As the narrator explains, educating children is one of the most important things today and the heroic man who takes on this role is "the school teacher" (Goofy, naturally). After taking role call, Goofy tries to teach the class but keeps having to deal with a mischievous trouble-maker named George who enjoys sneaking out of class to go fishing, eating the teacher''s apple, squeaking chalk, making faces while teacher gives a geography lesson, and terrorizing the other students with his water pistol. In the end, George''s mischief goes too far when he destroys the school with an exploding bomb and is forced to write "I will not bomb the school again" 100 times!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ttBuBpkPWvgyTWhNfNTwjbXnTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67503'),
  ('1011982716789346592', 'Teachers of Sexual Play: Modelling Vessels with the Female Body', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Sion Sono, Kazuhiro Suzuki, Yutaka Nishikawa', 'Sion Sono', 'Kana Sakurai, Yuya Ishikawa, Yû Kanzaki, Sion Sono, Atsuko Suzuki, Ageha Kiryû, Rumi Sasada, Thunder Sugiyama', null, 'About a pottery workshop run by Ms. Namie. Her students want to become as skilled as her, and she teach them that the key to good pottery is love.', 'About a pottery workshop run by Ms. Namie. Her students want to become as skilled as her, and she teach them that the key to good pottery is love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usjHwAed0q0iUpvb7TPS0qtTgAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258919'),
  ('270781531678183558', 'Teaching Mrs. Tingle', 1999, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Jerzy Zieliński, Kevin Williamson, Steve M. Davison', 'Kevin Williamson', 'Helen Mirren, Katie Holmes, Barry Watson, Marisa Coughlan, Michael McKean, Jeffrey Tambor, Liz Stauber, Molly Ringwald', 'PG-13', 'A bright high-school senior has her impending status as valedictorian jeopardized when her bitter history teacher, Mrs. Tingle, gives her a poor grade on a project. When an attempt to get ahead in Mrs. Tingle''s class goes awry, mayhem ensues and friendships, loyalties and trust are tested by the teacher''s intricate mind-games.', 'A bright high-school senior has her impending status as valedictorian jeopardized when her bitter history teacher, Mrs. Tingle, gives her a poor grade on a project. When an attempt to get ahead in Mrs. Tingle''s class goes awry, mayhem ensues and friendships, loyalties and trust are tested by the teacher''s intricate mind-games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGv0tkWZZSmoaPYiOsDcGmMhKq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10342'),
  ('185010897392083925', 'Teahouse', 1982, 'Drama, History', 'Tian Xie, Yuyuan Zheng, Jiao Juyin', 'Tian Xie, Lao-She', 'Yu Shizhi, Lan Tianye, Ruocheng Ying, Zheng Rong, Huang Zongluo, Tong Chao, Zhu Xu, Niu Xingli', null, 'An old teahouse in Beijing serves as the stage for a drama that unfolds over several tumultuous decades of modern Chinese history, from the waning days of the Qing dynasty to the eve of the People''s Republic.', 'An old teahouse in Beijing serves as the stage for a drama that unfolds over several tumultuous decades of modern Chinese history, from the waning days of the Qing dynasty to the eve of the People''s Republic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itIChnfvQCtLVz9t55RaELPE9MQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526431'),
  ('1095259835034240897', 'Team America: World Police', 2004, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Trey Parker, Ramsey Avery, Bill Pope', 'Trey Parker, Pam Brady, Matt Stone', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, Kristen Miller, Chelsea Marguerite, Masasa Moyo, Daran Norris, Fred Tatasciore, Phil Hendrie', 'R', 'When North Korean ruler Kim Jong-il orchestrates a global terrorist plot, it''s up to the heavily armed, highly specialized Team America unit to stop his dastardly scheme. The group, which has recruited troubled Broadway actor Gary Johnston, not only has to face off against Jong-il, but they must also contend with the Film Actors Guild, a cadre of Hollywood liberals at odds with Team America''s ''policing the world'' tactics.', 'When North Korean ruler Kim Jong-il orchestrates a global terrorist plot, it''s up to the heavily armed, highly specialized Team America unit to stop his dastardly scheme. The group, which has recruited troubled Broadway actor Gary Johnston, not only has to face off against Jong-il, but they must also contend with the Film Actors Guild, a cadre of Hollywood liberals at odds with Team America''s ''policing the world'' tactics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1Q2VFe1DVVbjfu1LDZe7tlp9yb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3989'),
  ('1102966161359216158', 'Team Bride', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Dylan Pearce, Chase Gardiner, J.D. Schroder', 'Katy Breier, Erica Deutschman', 'Rhiannon Fish, Marcus Rosner, Anna Primiani, Nikki Rae Hallow, Reamonn Joshee, Larry Reese, Dianne Wulf, Michael Lazarovitch', null, 'Hardworking and dedicated seamstress, Hannah McKenzie, runs a side business making bespoke wedding dresses when she’s not busy with her day job at renowned bridal salon, Millington’s. Her operation is soon threatened, however, when Will Millington, heir to the bridal empire, comes in looking to revamp the brand. Along the way, the two manage to sort out their differences, work together and perhaps even fall in love…', 'Hardworking and dedicated seamstress, Hannah McKenzie, runs a side business making bespoke wedding dresses when she’s not busy with her day job at renowned bridal salon, Millington’s. Her operation is soon threatened, however, when Will Millington, heir to the bridal empire, comes in looking to revamp the brand. Along the way, the two manage to sort out their differences, work together and perhaps even fall in love…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upNBhf9pO8Hxd0UKJ5SATUGL1VT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039066'),
  ('924003449948334013', 'Team Darryl', 2018, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Taika Waititi', 'Taika Waititi', 'Jeff Goldblum, Daley Pearson, Zach Campa, Chris Hemsworth, Rachel House', 'PG', 'Fresh off being unseated as the ruler of Sakaar, the Grandmaster makes his way to Earth to start a new life. It''s been over a year since Thor left Australia and Darryl has been struggling to pay his rent. Now Darryl needs a new roommate to help make the monthly payments. Unfortunately for Darryl, the Grandmaster was the only one who answered Darryl''s "Roommate Needed" ad and with no viable options, the Grandmaster moves in.', 'Fresh off being unseated as the ruler of Sakaar, the Grandmaster makes his way to Earth to start a new life. It''s been over a year since Thor left Australia and Darryl has been struggling to pay his rent. Now Darryl needs a new roommate to help make the monthly payments. Unfortunately for Darryl, the Grandmaster was the only one who answered Darryl''s "Roommate Needed" ad and with no viable options, the Grandmaster moves in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edroTAeTEM9ILyAnumA0ALxRSne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505945'),
  ('283799537135942362', 'Team Foxcatcher', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Jon Greenhalgh', null, 'Dave Schultz, Nancy Schultz, John E. du Pont, Dan Chaid, Mark Schultz, Valentin Yordanov', null, 'With never-before seen home video, this film recounts the paranoid downward spiral of John E. du Pont and the murder of Olympic wrestler Dave Schultz.', 'With never-before seen home video, this film recounts the paranoid downward spiral of John E. du Pont and the murder of Olympic wrestler Dave Schultz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeHMJUVHo0EgfiFaM7pyxK5k8qu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390520'),
  ('450235531515331505', 'Team Thor', 2016, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Taika Waititi, Vincent Lascoumes, James McGrady', 'Taika Waititi', 'Chris Hemsworth, Mark Ruffalo, Daley Pearson', 'PG', 'Discover what Thor was up to during the events of Captain America: Civil War.', 'Discover what Thor was up to during the events of Captain America: Civil War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVSmX89BvsQV2z3wh2IVYVNVw1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413279'),
  ('161938730947395708', 'Team Thor: Part 2', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Taika Waititi, Vincent Lascoumes', 'Taika Waititi', 'Chris Hemsworth, Daley Pearson', 'PG', 'A continuation of the documentary spoof of what Thor and his roommate Darryl were up to during the events of "Captain America: Civil War". While Cap and Iron Man duke it out, Thor tries to pay Darryl his rent in Asgardian coins.', 'A continuation of the documentary spoof of what Thor and his roommate Darryl were up to during the events of "Captain America: Civil War". While Cap and Iron Man duke it out, Thor tries to pay Darryl his rent in Asgardian coins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jmP71A5Un0jDNqBesDPQSN8hjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441829'),
  ('520863818073344313', 'Teambuilding', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Alex Coteț, Matei Dima, Cosmin Nedelcu', 'Cosmin Nedelcu, Matei Dima, Alex Coteț', 'Șerban Pavlu, Matei Dima, Anca Dinicu, Cosmin Nedelcu, Nicu Banea, Vlad Ianus, Anca Munteanu, Roxana Condurache', null, 'A frothy comedy about life in the corporation, about the challenges of building a career and those of consolidating and motivating a team. The film, a satire of corporate life, reveals the events of a team building in which the robotic corporativism unleash themselves and unleash themselves by showing their human side.', 'A frothy comedy about life in the corporation, about the challenges of building a career and those of consolidating and motivating a team. The film, a satire of corporate life, reveals the events of a team building in which the robotic corporativism unleash themselves and unleash themselves by showing their human side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kCztLCB5pFUp2pjeTmAGU02G6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1021331'),
  ('643550280562856282', 'Tear This Heart Out', 2008, 'Romance, Drama', 'Roberto Sneider', 'Roberto Sneider', 'Ana Claudia Talancón, Daniel Giménez Cacho, José María de Tavira, Joaquín Cosío, Isela Vega, Delia Casanova, Ana Ofelia Murguía, Álex Perea', 'R', 'A young girl recounts her girlhood and eventual marriage to a general of the Mexican revolution. by one of the most outstanding writers of the new feminist Mexican literature, it is at once a haunting novel of one woman''s life and a powerful account of post-revolutionary Mexico from a female perspective.', 'A young girl recounts her girlhood and eventual marriage to a general of the Mexican revolution. by one of the most outstanding writers of the new feminist Mexican literature, it is at once a haunting novel of one woman''s life and a powerful account of post-revolutionary Mexico from a female perspective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYklD0eR48grqzxal49I8XjEo8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16382'),
  ('682451767306957534', 'Tears', 2001, 'Drama', 'Im Sang-soo', 'Im Sang-soo', 'Han Jun, Park Geun-yeong, Bong Tae-gyu, Cho Eun-ji, Sung Ji-ru', null, 'Han, a young runaway, and Chang, an over-the-top teen, are close friends. Chang is a foulmouthed, womanizer while Han is a quiet and humble virgin. As they venture into the streets of Garibong-dong and jump from apartment to apartment, they encounter a young hooker, Lan, and Seri, a paint-sniffing young woman who finds comfort in the hands of Han. And this forms the unlikely group of teenagers facing the hardships of street life.', 'Han, a young runaway, and Chang, an over-the-top teen, are close friends. Chang is a foulmouthed, womanizer while Han is a quiet and humble virgin. As they venture into the streets of Garibong-dong and jump from apartment to apartment, they encounter a young hooker, Lan, and Seri, a paint-sniffing young woman who finds comfort in the hands of Han. And this forms the unlikely group of teenagers facing the hardships of street life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0RP8JGqtbHeM2kA8k2nrykM88b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161481'),
  ('84135962102263808', 'Tears for You', 2006, 'Drama', 'Nobuhiro Doi', 'Noriko Yoshida', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Masami Nagasawa, Kumiko Aso, Takashi Tsukamoto, Eiichiro Funakoshi, Isao Hashizume, Ryohei Hirota, Kyoko Koizumi', null, 'A love story about two step-siblings, Yota and Kaoru. Long ago, Yota''s mother married Kaoru''s jazz-playing father, effectively merging the two families. Unfortunately, Kaoru''s father skipped town, and Yota''s mother passed away, but not before imparting a dying wish to her young son to take care of Kaoru.', 'A love story about two step-siblings, Yota and Kaoru. Long ago, Yota''s mother married Kaoru''s jazz-playing father, effectively merging the two families. Unfortunately, Kaoru''s father skipped town, and Yota''s mother passed away, but not before imparting a dying wish to her young son to take care of Kaoru.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTOjOB7zOdxaikxCPbZ2DhRQgCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75679'),
  ('795437770661652326', 'Tears in the Rain', 1988, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Don Sharp, Barry Langley', 'Freda Kelsall', 'Sharon Stone, Christopher Cazenove, Leigh Lawson, Paul Daneman, Maurice Denham, Anna Massey, Rachael Dowling, Harry Burton', null, 'When Casey Cantrell''s mother died, her last wish was that her daughter would give a letter to Lord Richard Bredon, living in the UK. When Casey arrives in London, Lord Bredon denies ever having known her mother.', 'When Casey Cantrell''s mother died, her last wish was that her daughter would give a letter to Lord Richard Bredon, living in the UK. When Casey arrives in London, Lord Bredon denies ever having known her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEAsKBif5VwGOPcxjcHWmgunfiC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77631'),
  ('662524417716754025', 'Tears of April', 2008, 'Romance, Drama, War', 'Aku Louhimies, Rauno Ronkainen, Jouni Mutanen', 'Jari Rantala', 'Samuli Vauramo, Pihla Viitala, Eero Aho, Eemeli Louhimies, Miina Maasola, Riina Maidre, Sulevi Peltola, Oskar Pöysti', null, 'There is civil war in Finland between "Whites" and "Reds". A woman soldier of the Reds is captured by the Whites. She is ordered to be executed. A lieutenant is enforced into a homosexual relationship with his commanding officer to save the Red female with whom he is infatuated.', 'There is civil war in Finland between "Whites" and "Reds". A woman soldier of the Reds is captured by the Whites. She is ordered to be executed. A lieutenant is enforced into a homosexual relationship with his commanding officer to save the Red female with whom he is infatuated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tXAvn1fZmyTYQzt1BgMpgyJyZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54669'),
  ('176893176602509673', 'Tears of Cem Karaca', 2024, 'Drama, Music', 'Yüksel Aksu, Ersan Çapan', 'Onur Böber, Özden Uçar, Emrah Saltik', 'İsmail Hacıoğlu, Fikret Kuşkan, Yasemin Yalçın, Melisa Aslı Pamuk, Kubilay Tunçer, Buçe Buse Kahraman, Meral Çetinkaya, Melisa Döngel', null, 'Against a backdrop of political unrest in Turkey, this biopic charts the life of Anatolian rock singer Cem Karaca, focusing on his revolutionary ideals. Heightened emotions and moments of threat reflect the country''s rising tensions.', 'Against a backdrop of political unrest in Turkey, this biopic charts the life of Anatolian rock singer Cem Karaca, focusing on his revolutionary ideals. Heightened emotions and moments of threat reflect the country''s rising tensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOdlIrWIeRX0eLQTxVGSGYyyhMn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1230527'),
  ('265817597885099968', 'Tears of Faith', 2025, 'Drama', 'Indra Gunawan, Umar Setyadi, Fajar Irawan', 'Oka Aurora', 'Acha Septriasa, Achmad Megantara, Dewi Irawan, Rizky Hanggono, Budi Ros, Dewi Amanda, Yama Carlos, Syamim Farid', null, 'Anggie, a woman who is a victim of her boyfriend''s violence and finds guidance after being saved by a girl who runs a mosque.', 'Anggie, a woman who is a victim of her boyfriend''s violence and finds guidance after being saved by a girl who runs a mosque.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejkXEpahvqFDdpdlUfRITLQkEk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1509633'),
  ('854511309199040553', 'Tears of Kali', 2004, 'Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Michael Schuff, Heiko Merten, Andreas Marschall', 'Andreas Marschall', 'Pietro Martellanza, Anja Gebel, Magdalena Ritter, Ludwig Nicole, Maunsell Gabriel, Chole Micky, Vroni Kiefer, Anja Gebel', null, 'Composed of three episodes—titled Kali, Shakti, and Devi—and linked within a narrative framework, it tells the story of the Taylor-Eriksson group, its members, and their extreme practices in search of awareness and liberation from karma. These practices, spiraling into violence and sex, ultimately turn into real nightmares.', 'Composed of three episodes—titled Kali, Shakti, and Devi—and linked within a narrative framework, it tells the story of the Taylor-Eriksson group, its members, and their extreme practices in search of awareness and liberation from karma. These practices, spiraling into violence and sex, ultimately turn into real nightmares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVARY9zCCXw4kETRDlwdj26jo7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10175'),
  ('965844347718335547', 'Tears of Steel', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Ian Hubert, Joris Kerbosch', 'Ian Hubert', 'Derek de Lint, Sergio Hasselbaink, Vanja Rukavina, Denise Rebergen, Rogier Schippers, Chris Haley, Jody Bhe', null, 'The film’s premise is about a group of warriors and scientists, who gathered at the “Oude Kerk” in Amsterdam to stage a crucial event from the past, in a desperate attempt to rescue the world from destructive robots.', 'The film’s premise is about a group of warriors and scientists, who gathered at the “Oude Kerk” in Amsterdam to stage a crucial event from the past, in a desperate attempt to rescue the world from destructive robots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qy3jRmaHR7f8VZh3iXCqCWfFsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133701'),
  ('912217116473583659', 'Tears of the Black Tiger', 2000, 'Romance, Comedy, Action, Western', 'Wisit Sasanatieng, Phasiri Panya, Nattawut Kittikhun', 'Wisit Sasanatieng', 'Chartchai Ngamsan, Stella Malucchi, Suppakorn Kitsuwan, Passin Reungwoot, Sombat Metanee, Phairoj Jaising, Naiyana Shewanan, Kanchit Kwanpracha', 'NR', 'Dum, the son of a peasant falls in love with Rumpoey, the daughter of a wealthy and respected family. The star-crossed lovers are torn apart for years, but their forbidden love survives. When tragedy strikes, Dum unleashes his rage and becomes the gun-slinging outlaw the "Black Tiger" who will stop at nothing to seek his revenge.', 'Dum, the son of a peasant falls in love with Rumpoey, the daughter of a wealthy and respected family. The star-crossed lovers are torn apart for years, but their forbidden love survives. When tragedy strikes, Dum unleashes his rage and becomes the gun-slinging outlaw the "Black Tiger" who will stop at nothing to seek his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxoefU7hlNkhdVZe1DxOiYLCCjj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2805'),
  ('926621971087241352', 'Tears of the Sun', 2003, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Mauro Fiore, Antoine Fuqua, Robert Fechtman', 'Patrick Cirillo, Alex Lasker', 'Bruce Willis, Monica Bellucci, Cole Hauser, Eamonn Walker, Johnny Messner, Nick Chinlund, Tom Skerritt, Akosua Busia', 'R', 'Navy SEAL Lieutenant A.K. Waters and his elite squadron of tactical specialists are forced to choose between their duty and their humanity, between following orders by ignoring the conflict that surrounds them, or finding the courage to follow their conscience and protect a group of innocent refugees. When the democratic government of Nigeria collapses and the country is taken over by a ruthless military dictator, Waters, a fiercely loyal and hardened veteran is dispatched on a routine mission to retrieve a Doctors Without Borders physician.', 'Navy SEAL Lieutenant A.K. Waters and his elite squadron of tactical specialists are forced to choose between their duty and their humanity, between following orders by ignoring the conflict that surrounds them, or finding the courage to follow their conscience and protect a group of innocent refugees. When the democratic government of Nigeria collapses and the country is taken over by a ruthless military dictator, Waters, a fiercely loyal and hardened veteran is dispatched on a routine mission to retrieve a Doctors Without Borders physician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psP90zHD3ZYGLCLpt4B3MbtrlWr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9567'),
  ('60636487324210184', 'Tears Were Falling', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Yury Klimenko', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Aleksandr Volodin, Kir Bulychyov', 'Evgeni Leonov, Iya Savvina, Nina Grebeshkova, Olga Mashnaya, Aleksandra Yakovleva-Aasmyae, Boris Andreyev, Lev Perfilov, Boryslav Brondukov', null, 'A beautiful man, husband, father and worker Pavel Ivanovich Vasin got into the eye with a shard of the mirror of an evil wizard. And the world for him appeared in a gloomy light. He began to insult and offend everyone at home and at work. Anger and suspicion overwhelmed Vasin''s heart. Enemies, schemers and thieves are seen everywhere. Everywhere he sees intrigues and intrigues. In complete despair from the ineradicability of evil, Vasin cries bitterly... along with tears, the unfortunate splinter disappears...', 'A beautiful man, husband, father and worker Pavel Ivanovich Vasin got into the eye with a shard of the mirror of an evil wizard. And the world for him appeared in a gloomy light. He began to insult and offend everyone at home and at work. Anger and suspicion overwhelmed Vasin''s heart. Enemies, schemers and thieves are seen everywhere. Everywhere he sees intrigues and intrigues. In complete despair from the ineradicability of evil, Vasin cries bitterly... along with tears, the unfortunate splinter disappears...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cNpl1sNt3jK1xUYZPKO3MmY3ha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27925'),
  ('101619483353555263', 'Teaserama', 1955, 'Documentary', 'Michael Slifka, Irving Klaw', null, 'Bettie Page, Tempest Storm, Cherrie Knight, Trudy Wayne, Chris LaChris, Twinnie Wallen, Dave Starr, Honey Baer', 'R', 'A collection of numerous burlesque acts from the 1950s, including strippers, and cult character Betty Page introducing the acts.', 'A collection of numerous burlesque acts from the 1950s, including strippers, and cult character Betty Page introducing the acts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRyEb8m8LYkTaUEW7FsQLHqT7l2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70233'),
  ('228216662192236907', 'Teasing Master Takagi-san', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rikiya Imaizumi, Hiroshi Iwanaga', 'Jun Hagimori, Rikiya Imaizumi, Tomoki Kanazawa', 'Mei Nagano, Fumiya Takahashi, Jin Suzuki, Yuna Taira, Oshirō Maeda, Sara Shida, Tamaki Shiratori, Jun Saito', null, 'Takagi, now grown up, revisits her middle school as a trainer. She encounters Nishikata, her former classmate she used to tease, now a PE teacher there. Their playful dynamic resumes, leading to more interactions between the two.', 'Takagi, now grown up, revisits her middle school as a trainer. She encounters Nishikata, her former classmate she used to tease, now a PE teacher there. Their playful dynamic resumes, leading to more interactions between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBzPJ4z1CSjGxK0wM1n5MUQjDdd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1210989'),
  ('587088658465906525', 'Teasing Master Takagi-san: The Movie', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Hiroaki Akagi, Kim Min-ja, Woo Keum-young', 'Kanichi Kato, Aki Itami, Hiroko Fukuda', 'Yuki Kaji, Rie Takahashi, Inori Minase, Konomi Kohara, Mao Ichimichi, Yui Ogura, Haruka Tomatsu, Jun Fukushima', null, 'Takagi and Nishikata’s final summer in junior high is about to begin, and it’s already off to a heartwarming start! When the pair find an abandoned kitten, they decide to work together and take care of Hana, their adorable new companion until they can locate its missing mother.', 'Takagi and Nishikata’s final summer in junior high is about to begin, and it’s already off to a heartwarming start! When the pair find an abandoned kitten, they decide to work together and take care of Hana, their adorable new companion until they can locate its missing mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/di0QJLTVfroK7W1D5V8i9QkFkMk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938567'),
  ('287518233871971950', 'Technoboss', 2019, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'João Nicolau, Mário Castanheira', 'Mariana Ricardo, João Nicolau', 'Luísa Cruz, Miguel Lobo Antunes, Américo Silva, Sandra Faleiro, Tiago Garrinhas, José Raposo, João Nunes Monteiro, Crista Alfaiate', null, 'The start of Luís Rovisco’s old age isn’t exactly cheerful. Already in his sixties, he’s still roaming the country by himself, carrying out his tasks — increasingly less real — as sales director for the company SegurVale. Sadness, resignation? Not with the songs Luís makes up behind the wheel, and that take over this film from start to finish.', 'The start of Luís Rovisco’s old age isn’t exactly cheerful. Already in his sixties, he’s still roaming the country by himself, carrying out his tasks — increasingly less real — as sales director for the company SegurVale. Sadness, resignation? Not with the songs Luís makes up behind the wheel, and that take over this film from start to finish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiLrxaxV9ENNMGIqrneyujAv86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582880'),
  ('828323888875284725', 'Technoboys', 2024, 'Comedy, Music', 'Luis Gerardo Méndez, Gerardo Gatica, Emiliano Villanueva', 'Alexandro Aldrete', 'Luis Gerardo Méndez, Karla Souza, Gabriel Nuncio, Luis Rodriguez "El Guana", Fernando Bonilla, Daniela Vega, Mónica del Carmen, Joaquín Ferreira', null, 'They''re fierce, they''re iconic, they''re back — and they''re totally lost. A boyband seeking a renaissance must navigate a world they barely understand.', 'They''re fierce, they''re iconic, they''re back — and they''re totally lost. A boyband seeking a renaissance must navigate a world they barely understand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWyjJnGHMb4ov5TZZ4rMnBL5fmH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1250786'),
  ('428657837169709538', 'Technological Threat', 1988, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Bill Kroyer', 'Brian Jennings, Bill Kroyer, Rich Moore', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Human fear of technology is portrayed in this very amusing futuristic parody. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2013.', 'Human fear of technology is portrayed in this very amusing futuristic parody. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iq4u9ZCSv6LzCfTaQ3XyxJFIq33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210964'),
  ('593747561665541178', 'Technotise: Edit and I', 2009, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Aleksa Gajić, Stevan Đorđević, Nebojša Andrić', 'Aleksa Gajić', 'Sanda Knežević, Nikola Đuričko, Nebojša Glogovac, Marija Karan, Igor Bugarski, Tatjana Đorđević, Petar Kralj, Srđan Miletić', 'PG-13', 'Belgrade, 2074. Edit Stefanović, a psychology student, after failing the same university exam for the sixth time, decides to visit a dealer on the black market who installs a stolen military chip in her body that will record everything she sees to help her pass the exam. Edit also has a job at a scientific and social research company, in taking care of Abel Mustafov, an autistic math genius who discovered a formula that connects all forces in the world, but no computer was able to calculate it fully without becoming self-aware and shutting down immediately after that. After Edit sees the formula graph, the chip calculates the formula, and becomes able to "survive" thanks to its connection to Edit. It develops a parallel personality and affords her abilities greater than she ever imagined.', 'Belgrade, 2074. Edit Stefanović, a psychology student, after failing the same university exam for the sixth time, decides to visit a dealer on the black market who installs a stolen military chip in her body that will record everything she sees to help her pass the exam. Edit also has a job at a scientific and social research company, in taking care of Abel Mustafov, an autistic math genius who discovered a formula that connects all forces in the world, but no computer was able to calculate it fully without becoming self-aware and shutting down immediately after that. After Edit sees the formula graph, the chip calculates the formula, and becomes able to "survive" thanks to its connection to Edit. It develops a parallel personality and affords her abilities greater than she ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSGbVkWZEl3556M1bia8rk5jWnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38248'),
  ('534733467059503762', 'Tecumseh', 1972, 'Western, Drama, Adventure', 'Hans Kratzert, Wolfgang Braumann', 'Rolf Römer, Wolfgang Ebeling, Hans Kratzert', 'Gojko Mitić, Annekathrin Bürger, Rolf Römer, Leon Niemczyk, Milan Beli, Wolfgang Greese, Gerry Wolff, Herbert Köfer', null, 'At the beginning of the 19th century, white settlers regularly make and break treaties with the Native American inhabitants to gain possession of vast hunting grounds at ludicrously low prices without any bloodshed. Harrison, Governor of Indiana, has made and broke no less than fifteen such treaties, driving increasing numbers of Indians out to the infertile West. To put a stop to this criminal practice, the Shawnee Chief Tecumseh tries to unite the Native Americans.', 'At the beginning of the 19th century, white settlers regularly make and break treaties with the Native American inhabitants to gain possession of vast hunting grounds at ludicrously low prices without any bloodshed. Harrison, Governor of Indiana, has made and broke no less than fifteen such treaties, driving increasing numbers of Indians out to the infertile West. To put a stop to this criminal practice, the Shawnee Chief Tecumseh tries to unite the Native Americans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7n2Pv9kVsoERTWAvxanBuRcfMKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122440'),
  ('1077907759208094218', 'Ted', 2012, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Seth MacFarlane, Michael Barrett, Eric Heffron', 'Seth MacFarlane, Alec Sulkin, Wellesley Wild', 'Mark Wahlberg, Mila Kunis, Seth MacFarlane, Joel McHale, Giovanni Ribisi, Patrick Warburton, Matt Walsh, Jessica Barth', 'R', 'John Bennett, a man whose childhood wish of bringing his teddy bear to life came true, now must decide between keeping the relationship with the bear or his girlfriend, Lori.', 'John Bennett, a man whose childhood wish of bringing his teddy bear to life came true, now must decide between keeping the relationship with the bear or his girlfriend, Lori.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QVZXQQHCEIj8lyUhdBYd2qOYtq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72105'),
  ('589899107453703130', 'Ted & Venus', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Bud Cort, Dietrich Lohmann', 'William Martens, Paul Ciotti, Bud Cort', 'Bud Cort, James Brolin, Kim Adams, Carol Kane, Pamella D''Pella, Brian Thompson, Rhea Perlman, Woody Harrelson', null, 'Ted is a 1970s Venice Beach poet who spends his days drifting along the boardwalk, reciting his poetry to anyone who will listen. His life changes when a bikini-clad beauty named Linda strolls by him. Instantly, Ted believes he''s found his "Venus" and becomes obsessed with Linda. He tries to woo her with poetry, obscene phone calls and romantic overtures, all to disastrous effect.', 'Ted is a 1970s Venice Beach poet who spends his days drifting along the boardwalk, reciting his poetry to anyone who will listen. His life changes when a bikini-clad beauty named Linda strolls by him. Instantly, Ted believes he''s found his "Venus" and becomes obsessed with Linda. He tries to woo her with poetry, obscene phone calls and romantic overtures, all to disastrous effect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SUYd9cVYm6w51E3ZZRSxAiPOe1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86773'),
  ('150330805603623903', 'Ted 2', 2015, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Seth MacFarlane, Michael Barrett, Laura Anderson', 'Seth MacFarlane, Alec Sulkin, Wellesley Wild', 'Mark Wahlberg, Seth MacFarlane, Amanda Seyfried, Jessica Barth, Giovanni Ribisi, Morgan Freeman, Sam J. Jones, Patrick Warburton', 'R', 'Newlywed couple Ted and Tami-Lynn want to have a baby, but in order to qualify to be a parent, Ted will have to prove he''s a person in a court of law.', 'Newlywed couple Ted and Tami-Lynn want to have a baby, but in order to qualify to be a parent, Ted will have to prove he''s a person in a court of law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38C91I7Xft0gyY7BITm8i4yvuRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214756'),
  ('252644217106684885', 'Ted Bundy', 2002, 'Crime, Horror', 'Matthew Bright, Alexa Sheehan, Sonja Rom', 'Matthew Bright, Stephen Johnston', 'Michael Reilly Burke, Boti Bliss, Tracey Walter, Deborah Offner, Tom Savini, Tiffany Shepis, Julianna McCarthy, Steffani Brass', null, 'Seattle, 1974. Ted Bundy gives into his violent passions and embarks on a cross country killing spree, leaving a trail of raped, tortured, murdered, dismembered, and defiled corpses in his wake…', 'Seattle, 1974. Ted Bundy gives into his violent passions and embarks on a cross country killing spree, leaving a trail of raped, tortured, murdered, dismembered, and defiled corpses in his wake…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bh6wHjHxmuSyYL8jSFqtLlzMSGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34081'),
  ('679606797192769625', 'Ted Bundy: American Boogeyman', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Daniel Farrands', 'Daniel Farrands', 'Chad Michael Murray, Holland Roden, Lin Shaye, Greer Grammer, Jake Hays, Marietta Melrose, Leslie Stratton, Dashiell Connery', null, 'Set in a gritty and decadent 1970s America, American Boogeyman follows the elusive and charming killer and the manhunt that brought him to justice involving the detective and the FBI rookie who coined the phrase ‘serial killer’.', 'Set in a gritty and decadent 1970s America, American Boogeyman follows the elusive and charming killer and the manhunt that brought him to justice involving the detective and the FBI rookie who coined the phrase ‘serial killer’.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MGcMWgxYPFrBMjIAHcQqmsOIGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835112'),
  ('1049392458747310066', 'Ted Bunny', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Fredianelli', 'Michael Fredianelli, Maralynn Adams', 'Diana Roman, Dee Wallace, Brad Satterwhite, Rosanna Wyant, Bryan Palacios', 'Not Rated', 'Filmmaker Sasha finds Catherine, who claims to be a Ted Bundy victim. At Catherine''s remote farmhouse, Sasha''s crew uncovers horrific secrets. After her crew is killed with no evidence left, Sasha and a rogue cop hunt the unleashed terror.', 'Filmmaker Sasha finds Catherine, who claims to be a Ted Bundy victim. At Catherine''s remote farmhouse, Sasha''s crew uncovers horrific secrets. After her crew is killed with no evidence left, Sasha and a rogue cop hunt the unleashed terror.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F42AaFCFj9O8cTybOegrCBWH1bvA.jpg', 'plex:movie:ted-bunny'),
  ('756926250696288985', 'Ted K', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Robin Takao D''Oench, Nathan Corbin, Brooke Swaney', 'John Rosenthal, Gaddy Davis, Tony Stone', 'Sharlto Copley, Drew Powell, Christian Calloway, Amber Rose Mason, Bob Jennings, Tahmus Rounds, Sal Rendino, Wayne Pyle', 'R', 'An exploration of Ted Kaczynski''s life in Lincoln, Montana in the years leading up to his arrest as The Unabomber.', 'An exploration of Ted Kaczynski''s life in Lincoln, Montana in the years leading up to his arrest as The Unabomber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wv9VeqVU4FXnG02mHXT2Vz43bQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660353'),
  ('310838569241413578', 'Teddy', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Horror', 'Zoran Boukherma, Ludovic Boukherma, Augustin Barbaroux', 'Zoran Boukherma, Ludovic Boukherma', 'Anthony Bajon, Ludovic Torrent, Christine Gautier, Noémie Lvovsky, Guillaume Mattera, Jean-Paul Fabre, Alexis Orlandini, Gérard Pau', 'PG-13', 'In a rural French town, twenty-something Teddy is scratched by an unknown beast and slowly undergoes frightening changes.', 'In a rural French town, twenty-something Teddy is scratched by an unknown beast and slowly undergoes frightening changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVm8RMd5rAU7z2t5n0FVpCcSVOL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712123'),
  ('410069560879846366', 'Teddy Bear', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Stanisław Bareja, Zdzislaw Kaczmarek', 'Stanisław Tym, Stanisław Bareja', 'Stanisław Tym, Barbara Burska, Christine Paul-Podlasky, Krzysztof Kowalewski, Bronisław Pawlik, Ewa Bem, Zofia Czerwińska, Cezary Julski', null, 'En route to London, Bear discovers at the border checkpoint that his passport is missing a few pages, which may prevent him from traveling to the city with the sports team he manages.', 'En route to London, Bear discovers at the border checkpoint that his passport is missing a few pages, which may prevent him from traveling to the city with the sports team he manages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvPR52hepNXBNBezFeLtEorbruo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31407'),
  ('1121720341977967683', 'Teddy Bear', 2012, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Mads Matthiesen, Laust Trier-Mørk', 'Mads Matthiesen, Martin Zandvliet', 'Kim Kold, Elsebeth Steentoft, Lamaiporn Hougaard, David Winters, Allan Mogensen, Patrick Johnson, Barbara Zatler, Paweena Im-Erb', null, 'After failing to find love in Denmark, a painfully shy bodybuilder sets off for Thailand to escape from his overbearing mother and search for a bride.', 'After failing to find love in Denmark, a painfully shy bodybuilder sets off for Thailand to escape from his overbearing mother and search for a bride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSAxLj2kQot4g4MmklCg1vIbZxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84344'),
  ('560547655617460801', 'Teddy Pendergrass: If You Don''t Know Me', 2018, 'Documentary, Music', 'Olivia Lichtenstein', null, 'Teddy Pendergrass', null, 'The untold and ultimately inspiring story of legendary singer, Teddy Pendergrass, the man poised to be the biggest R&B artist of all time until the tragic accident that changed his life forever at the age of only 31.', 'The untold and ultimately inspiring story of legendary singer, Teddy Pendergrass, the man poised to be the biggest R&B artist of all time until the tragic accident that changed his life forever at the age of only 31.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccSFRV59TSqowjm4Y6Es5WXJDOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551752'),
  ('845254350213622048', 'Teddy the Rough Rider', 1940, 'Drama, History, Documentary', 'Ray Enright', 'Charles L. Tedford', 'Sidney Blackmer, Douglas Wood, Selmer Jackson, Theodore von Eltz, Arthur Loft, John Ridgely, Glenn Strange, Robert Warwick', null, 'This short follows the political career of Theodore Roosevelt, beginning in 1895, when he was appointed police commissioner of New York City. In 1897 he was appointed Assistant Secretary of the Navy. His charge up San Juan Hill during the Spanish-American War in 1898 is re-created. He becomes vice president in March 1901 and assumes the presidency when William McKinley is assassinated six months later. According to the narrator, Roosevelt refused to be beholden to political bosses, doing what he believed to be right for the American people.', 'This short follows the political career of Theodore Roosevelt, beginning in 1895, when he was appointed police commissioner of New York City. In 1897 he was appointed Assistant Secretary of the Navy. His charge up San Juan Hill during the Spanish-American War in 1898 is re-created. He becomes vice president in March 1901 and assumes the presidency when William McKinley is assassinated six months later. According to the narrator, Roosevelt refused to be beholden to political bosses, doing what he believed to be right for the American people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2m7Ip6YziLfHQTY9A05QH5m6aH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236795'),
  ('285951236253331903', 'Teddy''s Christmas', 2022, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Andrea Eckerbom, Kjell Vassdal', 'Lars Gudmestad, Harald Rosenløw-Eeg', 'Marte Klerck-Nilssen, John Brungot, Vegard Strand Eide, Mariann Hole, Jan Gunnar Røise, Lene Kongsvik Johansen, Nader Khademi, Marianne Krogness', 'G', 'While visiting a Christmas market in her Norwegian town, eight year old Mariann spots a talking teddy bear at a carnival game booth. However, when someone else wins it, she embarks on a quest to find the adorable bear that captured her heart.', 'While visiting a Christmas market in her Norwegian town, eight year old Mariann spots a talking teddy bear at a carnival game booth. However, when someone else wins it, she embarks on a quest to find the adorable bear that captured her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEf96axaZhZQEu9ORVtEujBTG9p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020969'),
