  ('304018193685774429', 'Tee Yai: Born to Be Bad', 2025, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Nonzee Nimibutr, Teerawat Rujintham, Unkana Ngamlertsirichai', 'Chanchana Homsap', 'Nattawin Wattanagitiphat, Witsarut Himmarat, Supassara Thanachart, Sadanont Durongkhaweroj, Ongart Cheamcharoenpornkul, Patara Eksangkul, Akarin Akaranitimaytharatt, Sirin Horwang', 'R', 'In 1980s Bangkok, a wily thief stages a series of daring heists, baffling the authorities and the public — until one cop sets out to take him down.', 'In 1980s Bangkok, a wily thief stages a series of daring heists, baffling the authorities and the public — until one cop sets out to take him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ig00LBM2rv4fmCJOPATyRWOJnlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1429738'),
  ('498697968728405266', 'Teen Beach 2', 2015, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jeffrey Hornaday, Mark Irwin', 'Robert Horn, Mark Landry, Vince Marcello', 'Ross Lynch, Maia Mitchell, Gracie Gillam, Garrett Clayton, John DeLuca, Chrissie Fit, Jordan Fisher, Jessica Lee Keller', 'G', 'When characters from the movie musical “Wet Side Story” get stuck in the real world, teens Brady and Mack must find a way to return them home.', 'When characters from the movie musical “Wet Side Story” get stuck in the real world, teens Brady and Mack must find a way to return them home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hm2P8pMoeJlETIaSP6OWR0Lu7c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325189'),
  ('128877731493655608', 'Teen Beach Movie', 2013, 'Family, Music, TV Movie, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jeffrey Hornaday, Mark Irwin, Jesús A. Romero', 'Vince Marcello, Mark Landry, Robert Horn', 'Ross Lynch, Maia Mitchell, Gracie Gillam, Garrett Clayton, John DeLuca, Chrissie Fit, Suzanne Cryer, Barry Bostwick', 'PG', 'Life''s a beach for surfers Brady and McKenzie – until a rogue wave magically transports them inside the classic ''60s beach party flick, "Wet Side Story," where a full-blown rivalry between bikers and surfers threatens to erupt. There, amidst a sea of surfing, singing and dancing, Brady and Mack accidentally change the storyline, and the film’s dreamy hero and heroine fall for them instead of for each other!', 'Life''s a beach for surfers Brady and McKenzie – until a rogue wave magically transports them inside the classic ''60s beach party flick, "Wet Side Story," where a full-blown rivalry between bikers and surfers threatens to erupt. There, amidst a sea of surfing, singing and dancing, Brady and Mack accidentally change the storyline, and the film’s dreamy hero and heroine fall for them instead of for each other!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKrGe5EmDSyVaWM0uj7rJDQHRjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177888'),
  ('410041589012869502', 'Teen Bride', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Norichika Oba', 'Keiko Hokimoto', 'Kento Nakajima, Yuna Taira, Yuri Chinen, Maika Yamamoto, Shingo Murakami, Sylvia Grab, Tomoko Ikuta, Masahiro Takashima', null, 'Karin Oriyama, 16 years old. She is in high school and... she''s about to get married!', 'Karin Oriyama, 16 years old. She is in high school and... she''s about to get married!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVASaDBkewZHTAtFspSPLbdkTrL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530284'),
