  ('1060916889666909080', 'Teen Patti', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Leena Yadav, Chetana Kowshik, Richard Graysmark', 'Leena Yadav, Shivkumar Subramaniam', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Ben Kingsley, R. Madhavan, Shraddha Kapoor, Dhruv Ganesh, Raima Sen, Mahesh Manjrekar, Saira Mohan', 'PG-13', 'A professor uses the three-card game to prove his probability thesis. He involves some of his students on his research and later realizes it was a big mistake', 'A professor uses the three-card game to prove his probability thesis. He involves some of his students on his research and later realizes it was a big mistake', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3k7qtufRawz2i8RUIMffUdV5bp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34418'),
