  ('534110578257909921', 'Teen Spirit', 2011, 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Gil Junger, Dave Perkal', 'Bob Young, Kathryn McCullough', 'Cassie Scerbo, Lindsey Shaw, Chris Zylka, Rhoda Griffis, Katie Sarife, Paras Patel, Andrea Powell, Travis Quentin Young', 'PG-13', 'Amber, a mean popular girl who gets electrocuted and dies, is not allowed to enter into heaven unless she helps the least popular girl in school become Prom Queen within a week, but things do not go as planned.', 'Amber, a mean popular girl who gets electrocuted and dies, is not allowed to enter into heaven unless she helps the least popular girl in school become Prom Queen within a week, but things do not go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mmxoEBzTMX4ziYgveeEx35ltNY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73108'),
  ('758687764568631832', 'Teen Spirit', 2019, 'Music, Drama', 'Steve Robinson, Matt Jennings, Tilly Scandrett', 'Max Minghella', 'Elle Fanning, Zlatko Burić, Rebecca Hall, Agnieszka Grochowska, Millie Brady, Ruairí O''Connor, Archie Madekwe, Clara Rugaard', 'PG-13', 'A shy teenager living on the Isle of Wight dreams of pop stardom. With the help of an unlikely mentor, she enters a singing competition that will test her integrity, talent, and ambition.', 'A shy teenager living on the Isle of Wight dreams of pop stardom. With the help of an unlikely mentor, she enters a singing competition that will test her integrity, talent, and ambition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFPqJZ9vOcH7QroNxXV5wefX2qe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440918'),
  ('1129175592199744773', 'Teen Titans Go! & DC Super Hero Girls: Mayhem in the Multiverse', 2022, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Matt Peters, Katie Rice', 'Jase Ricci', 'Tara Strong, Greg Cipes, Scott Menville, Khary Payton, Hynden Walch, Kari Wahlgren, Kimberly Brooks, Grey DeLisle', 'NR', 'With the help of an ancient Kryptonian power, Lex Luthor unites the world’s Super-Villains to capture all of Earth''s Super Heroes, until…only the DC Super Hero Girls are left to stop the Legion of Doom. Our heroes must cross dimensions to rescue their fellow Super Heroes from the Phantom Zone, but a fortuitous wrong turn leads them to Titans Tower – where they find much-needed allies in the Teen Titans!', 'With the help of an ancient Kryptonian power, Lex Luthor unites the world’s Super-Villains to capture all of Earth''s Super Heroes, until…only the DC Super Hero Girls are left to stop the Legion of Doom. Our heroes must cross dimensions to rescue their fellow Super Heroes from the Phantom Zone, but a fortuitous wrong turn leads them to Titans Tower – where they find much-needed allies in the Teen Titans!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCOt6rm6bcppXeYIHalAXJGIZZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913205'),
  ('65167317030163265', 'Teen Titans Go! See Space Jam', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Peter Rida Michail', 'Brady Klosterman', 'Greg Cipes, Scott Menville, Khary Payton, Tara Strong, Hynden Walch, John DiMaggio, Fred Tatasciore', 'NR', 'The Teen Titans are visited by the Nerdlucks, the Space Jam villains who tried to capture Michael Jordan and the Looney Tunes. Astonished to discover his fellow Titans have never seen Space Jam, Cyborg organizes an exclusive watch party.', 'The Teen Titans are visited by the Nerdlucks, the Space Jam villains who tried to capture Michael Jordan and the Looney Tunes. Astonished to discover his fellow Titans have never seen Space Jam, Cyborg organizes an exclusive watch party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBOipwFIZS2uLk0FwmKpysCx4HD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834404'),
  ('855422754302710977', 'Teen Titans Go! To the Movies', 2018, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Aaron Horvath, Peter Rida Michail', 'Michael Jelenic, Aaron Horvath', 'Greg Cipes, Scott Menville, Khary Payton, Tara Strong, Hynden Walch, Will Arnett, Kristen Bell, Eric Bauza', 'PG', 'All the major DC superheroes are starring in their own films, all but the Teen Titans, so Robin is determined to remedy this situation by getting over his role as a sidekick and becoming a movie star. Thus, with a few madcap ideas and an inspirational song in their hearts, the Teen Titans head to Hollywood to fulfill their dreams.', 'All the major DC superheroes are starring in their own films, all but the Teen Titans, so Robin is determined to remedy this situation by getting over his role as a sidekick and becoming a movie star. Thus, with a few madcap ideas and an inspirational song in their hearts, the Teen Titans head to Hollywood to fulfill their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFHihhE9hlvJEk2f1AqdLRaYHd6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474395'),
  ('838108222818287139', 'Teen Titans Go! vs. Teen Titans', 2019, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Jeff Mednikow', 'Marly Halpern-Graser, Jeremy Adams', 'Greg Cipes, Scott Menville, Khary Payton, Tara Strong, Hynden Walch, Rhys Darby, Grey DeLisle, Sean Maher', 'PG', 'The comedic modern-day quintet takes on their 2003 counterparts when villains from each of their worlds join forces to pit the two Titan teams against each other. They''ll need to set aside their differences and work together to combat Trigon, Hexagon, Santa Claus (that''s right, Santa!) and time itself in order to save the multiverse.', 'The comedic modern-day quintet takes on their 2003 counterparts when villains from each of their worlds join forces to pit the two Titan teams against each other. They''ll need to set aside their differences and work together to combat Trigon, Hexagon, Santa Claus (that''s right, Santa!) and time itself in order to save the multiverse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GWJEdzVC9aOBSOMF9NHodYxSsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:556901'),
  ('430952925368746119', 'Teen Titans: The Judas Contract', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action', 'Sam Liu', 'Ernie Altbacker', 'Stuart Allan, Jake T. Austin, Taissa Farmiga, Christina Ricci, Brandon Soo Hoo, Kari Wahlgren, Miguel Ferrer, Sean Maher', 'PG-13', 'Tara Markov is a girl who has power over earth and stone; she is also more than she seems. Is the newest Teen Titan an ally or a threat? And what are the mercenary Deathstroke''s plans for the Titans?', 'Tara Markov is a girl who has power over earth and stone; she is also more than she seems. Is the newest Teen Titan an ally or a threat? And what are the mercenary Deathstroke''s plans for the Titans?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuGIlNAJUati4qEAH1nrYKUA3xa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408647'),
  ('1002412624303954976', 'Teen Vamp', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Samuel Bradford, Richard Man', 'Samuel Bradford', 'Karen Carlson, Clu Gulager, Angie Brown, Beau Bishop, Evans Dietz, Edd Anderson, Jude Gerard Prest', 'NR', 'An unimpressive, boring high-school geek is bitten and contracts vampirical symptoms, transforming him into a confident coolio.', 'An unimpressive, boring high-school geek is bitten and contracts vampirical symptoms, transforming him into a confident coolio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEp7N8xbcj3ZsQcDgXM51vXqz0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98308'),
  ('427126610168372357', 'Teen Witch', 1989, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Dorian Walker, Marc Reshovsky', 'Robin Menken, Vernon Zimmerman', 'Robyn Lively, Dan Gauthier, Joshua John Miller, Caren Kaye, Dick Sargent, Lisa Fuller, Amanda Ingber, Zelda Rubinstein', 'PG-13', 'Louise is not very popular at her highschool. Then she learns that she''s descended from the witches of Salem and has inherited their powers. At first she uses them to get back at the girls and teachers who teased her and to win the heart of the handsome footballer''s captain. But soon she has doubts if it''s right to ''cheat'' her way to popularity.', 'Louise is not very popular at her highschool. Then she learns that she''s descended from the witches of Salem and has inherited their powers. At first she uses them to get back at the girls and teachers who teased her and to win the heart of the handsome footballer''s captain. But soon she has doubts if it''s right to ''cheat'' her way to popularity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UNA7PZ9gpoIgELB13bKCwOuICp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25199'),
  ('1089743886981573525', 'Teen Wolf', 1985, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Rod Daniel, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Jeph Loeb, Matthew Weisman', 'Michael J. Fox, James Hampton, Susan Ursitti, Jerry Levine, Matt Adler, Lorie Griffin, Jim McKrell, Mark Arnold', 'PG', 'When a shy teenager''s new-found powers help him score at basketball - and with the popular girls - he has some pretty hairy decisions to make.', 'When a shy teenager''s new-found powers help him score at basketball - and with the popular girls - he has some pretty hairy decisions to make.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bv9rY9eoue2Hat6tcvrKVQ0ow8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11824'),
  ('696790153302171143', 'Teen Wolf Too', 1987, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Christopher Leitch, Jules Brenner, Tana M. Manners', 'Tim Kring', 'Jason Bateman, Kim Darby, John Astin, Paul Sand, Mark Holton, James Hampton, Estee Chandler, Robert Neary', 'PG', 'Although awkward college student Todd Howard is particularly adept at science, he''s paying for school with an athletic scholarship that he will lose should he not fare well in an upcoming boxing tournament. Luckily for Todd, he has inherited the same family curse that once turned his cousin into a werewolf. As he transforms into the hairy, fanged, howling monster, he finds both his physical agility and his popularity skyrocketing -- but at what cost?', 'Although awkward college student Todd Howard is particularly adept at science, he''s paying for school with an athletic scholarship that he will lose should he not fare well in an upcoming boxing tournament. Luckily for Todd, he has inherited the same family curse that once turned his cousin into a werewolf. As he transforms into the hairy, fanged, howling monster, he finds both his physical agility and his popularity skyrocketing -- but at what cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unfbmoUTIsQzQF09RJZVN1GKr6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15582'),
  ('348102470020891506', 'Teen Wolf: The Movie', 2023, 'Action, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'David Daniel, Russell Mulcahy, James J.D. Taylor', 'Jeph Loeb, Matthew Weisman', 'Tyler Posey, Crystal Reed, Holland Roden, Tyler Hoechlin, Shelley Hennig, JR Bourne, Ian Bohen, Colton Haynes', 'R', 'The wolves are howling once again, as a terrifying ancient evil emerges in Beacon Hills. Scott McCall, no longer a teenager yet still an Alpha, must gather new allies and reunite trusted friends to fight back against this powerful and deadly enemy.', 'The wolves are howling once again, as a terrifying ancient evil emerges in Beacon Hills. Scott McCall, no longer a teenager yet still an Alpha, must gather new allies and reunite trusted friends to fight back against this powerful and deadly enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAkpPm3wcHRqZl8XjUI3Y2chYq2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877703'),
  ('769722544620251432', 'Teen-Age Crime Wave', 1955, 'Crime, Drama', 'Fred F. Sears, Henry Freulich, Eddie Saeta', 'Harry Essex, Ray Buffum', 'Tommy Cook, Molly McCart, Sue England, James Bell, Kay Riehl, Frank Griffin, Guy Kingsford, Helen Brown', 'NR', 'A delinquent girl involves an innocent friend in an armed robbery followed by a jail-break and hostage-taking with her equally delinquent boyfriend.', 'A delinquent girl involves an innocent friend in an armed robbery followed by a jail-break and hostage-taking with her equally delinquent boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnHyVqI079Kqjm7dbaCDgjp3iXE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92728'),
