  ('807452001694165784', 'Teen''s Confessions', 2014, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Daniel Filho, Cris D''amato, Felipe Reinheimer', 'Sylvio Gonçalves', 'Sophia Abrahão, Bella Camero, Malu Rodrigues, Clara Tiezzi, Cássio Gabus Mendes, Olívia Torres, Tammy Di Calafiori, Christian Monassa', null, 'Four sisters work together to raise rent money after learning they have to move to another neighborhood in this coming-of-age drama based on the series.', 'Four sisters work together to raise rent money after learning they have to move to another neighborhood in this coming-of-age drama based on the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w21eOmw5KwEyaPIsD8JmVtVXGrz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228208'),
  ('365401500746704276', 'Teenage Angst', 2008, 'Drama', 'Thomas Stuber', 'Holger Jäckle', 'Franz Dinda, Niklas Kohrt, Janusz Kocaj, Michael Ginsburg, Stephanie Schönfeld, Michael Schweighöfer, Kerstin De Ahna', 'NR', 'At an elite private Border School four students form a clique to sneak out of school after hours to meet, drink and play. By trying to escape the golden cage which their wealthy parents have stuck them in, they search for the Extreme. In the course of time their excessive games grow more and more violent and soon they turn against the weakest of the group.', 'At an elite private Border School four students form a clique to sneak out of school after hours to meet, drink and play. By trying to escape the golden cage which their wealthy parents have stuck them in, they search for the Extreme. In the course of time their excessive games grow more and more violent and soon they turn against the weakest of the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80CBzApU7gUmPpaV3Q1OSPGFWuj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36292'),
  ('24119314967660054', 'Teenage Bonnie and Klepto Clyde', 1993, 'Drama, Action', 'John Shepphird, Neal Brown', 'John Shepphird, Steve Jankowski', 'Maureen Flannigan, Scott Wolf, Bentley Mitchum, Tom Bower, Don Novello, Jeff Olson, David Jensen, Curley Green', 'R', 'The Bonnie &amp; Clyde story is re-told from a contemporary viewpoint. Clyde in this movie is a high school nerd working in the local burger joint. Urges to steal things are inflamed when he runs into Bonnie, the bored daughter of the local police commissioner, who is running with a street gang led by Kirk. Clyde immediately senses a kindred spirit in Bonnie. Initially she ignores him, but he rescues her from a shop-lifting charge and offers her a ride in a stolen van. Soon the two have taken guns from her father''s home and go off on a bloody crime spree...', 'The Bonnie &amp; Clyde story is re-told from a contemporary viewpoint. Clyde in this movie is a high school nerd working in the local burger joint. Urges to steal things are inflamed when he runs into Bonnie, the bored daughter of the local police commissioner, who is running with a street gang led by Kirk. Clyde immediately senses a kindred spirit in Bonnie. Initially she ignores him, but he rescues her from a shop-lifting charge and offers her a ride in a stolen van. Soon the two have taken guns from her father''s home and go off on a bloody crime spree...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57WEYORdKsg7gd04QLrvLvIv2sV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44482'),
  ('634261258902219365', 'Teenage Catgirls In Heat', 1994, 'Horror, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Scott Perry, Thad Halcli', 'Scott Perry, Grace Smith', 'Gary Graves, Carrie Vanston, Dave Cox, Esmeralda Huffhines, Helen Griffiths, Dorothy Layne, George Franklin, Chad Strader', 'R', 'The film is set in a small Texas town, where an ancient Egyptian cat god, in the form of a cheap statue, commands all the local felines to surrender their nine lives; a mass cat suicide ensues, as cat after cat throw themselves off roofs, bridges and telephone poles. However, the dead felines are revived, becoming beautiful women in the process, given one goal: mate with and exterminate the population of human males in order to make room for "The Great Litter".', 'The film is set in a small Texas town, where an ancient Egyptian cat god, in the form of a cheap statue, commands all the local felines to surrender their nine lives; a mass cat suicide ensues, as cat after cat throw themselves off roofs, bridges and telephone poles. However, the dead felines are revived, becoming beautiful women in the process, given one goal: mate with and exterminate the population of human males in order to make room for "The Great Litter".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKtjrsWnEDGZ5LbtUw4koyxBFt9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67955'),
  ('1039537056707334424', 'Teenage Cave Man', 1958, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Roger Corman, Floyd Crosby, Jack Bohrer', 'R. Wright Campbell', 'Robert Vaughn, Darah Marshall, Leslie Bradley, Frank De Kova, Charles Thompson, June Jocelyn, Jonathan Haze, Beach Dickerson', 'NR', 'Roger Corman''s post-holocaust quickie about an adolescent tribesman who dares to explore the feared "forbidden zone."', 'Roger Corman''s post-holocaust quickie about an adolescent tribesman who dares to explore the feared "forbidden zone."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38kDZhW3885yZBDZjiwMBY1KeBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97784'),
  ('216345824276104831', 'Teenage Caveman', 2002, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Larry Clark, Steve Gainer, Jessica W. Leung', 'Christos N. Gage', 'Andrew Keegan, Tara Subkoff, Tiffany Limos, Crystal Celeste Grant, Richard Hillman, Stephen Jasso, Shan Elliot, Hayley Keenan', null, 'In a post-apocalyptic future mankind is lives in a prehistoric manner. After killing his father for sexually assaulting his girlfriend, the son of a tribal leader runs away with a group of his teenage friends. They are taken in by Neil and Judith who introduce them to the vices outlawed by their tribes namely sex and drugs.Neil and Judith, however, are genetically altered indestructible mutants who have their own plans for the future of the human race.', 'In a post-apocalyptic future mankind is lives in a prehistoric manner. After killing his father for sexually assaulting his girlfriend, the son of a tribal leader runs away with a group of his teenage friends. They are taken in by Neil and Judith who introduce them to the vices outlawed by their tribes namely sex and drugs.Neil and Judith, however, are genetically altered indestructible mutants who have their own plans for the future of the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edAu8TypWbX1XQ39bMUjCnT2jzV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12718'),
  ('527387707973136903', 'Teenage Cocktail', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'John Carchietta, Justin Kane', 'John Carchietta, Chris Sivertson, Sage Bannick', 'Nichole Sakura, Fabianne Therese, Pat Healy, Michelle Borth, Joshua Leonard, AJ Bowen, Zak Henri, Lou Wegner', null, 'Feeling confined by their small town and overbearing parents, Annie and Jules hatch a scheme of running away. The only issue is, they need the money to get there. Jules suggests the couple try webcam modeling. Although she’s nervous at first, Annie can’t argue when the money starts rolling in. But as the girls soon find out, consequences can blindside you. Sometimes violently.', 'Feeling confined by their small town and overbearing parents, Annie and Jules hatch a scheme of running away. The only issue is, they need the money to get there. Jules suggests the couple try webcam modeling. Although she’s nervous at first, Annie can’t argue when the money starts rolling in. But as the girls soon find out, consequences can blindside you. Sometimes violently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24Hbcq4KnvvWPPz8WYZuAIG5S6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381075'),
  ('741785860621671988', 'Teenage Dirtbag', 2009, 'Drama', 'Regina Crosby', 'Regina Crosby', 'Scott Michael Foster, Noa Hegesh, Chris Ellis, Bethany D. Hart, Regina Crosby, Kyle Lupo', 'PG-13', 'A popular high school girl is harassed by a delinquent boy until they are placed in creative writing class together. Through written words, they create a bond, but tragically a bond that cannot withstand her social pressures or his brutal home life.', 'A popular high school girl is harassed by a delinquent boy until they are placed in creative writing class together. Through written words, they create a bond, but tragically a bond that cannot withstand her social pressures or his brutal home life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52E75FIew5tmVI4QSpFODDuZzTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33582'),
  ('1047566740973510229', 'Teenage Doll', 1957, 'Crime, Drama', 'Roger Corman, Floyd Crosby, C.M. Florance', 'Charles B. Griffith', 'June Kenney, Fay Spain, John Brinkley, Colette Jackson, Barbara Wilson, Barboura Morris, Sandra Smith, Ziva Rodann', 'NR', 'The Black Widows, a teenage girl gang, find one of their number killed. They blame her murder on Barbara, the on-again-off-again girlfriend of the leader of rival gang The Vandals. As the gangs prepare for a fight, we take a glimpse into their tumultuous home lives.', 'The Black Widows, a teenage girl gang, find one of their number killed. They blame her murder on Barbara, the on-again-off-again girlfriend of the leader of rival gang The Vandals. As the gangs prepare for a fight, we take a glimpse into their tumultuous home lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngifB8bYB63iHhFnIfJ1PWeGYrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60613'),
  ('39107034503534131', 'Teenage Exorcist', 1991, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Grant Austin Waldman, William H. Molina', 'Ted Newsom', 'Brinke Stevens, Eddie Deezen, Oliver Darrow, John Henry Richardson, Tom Shell, Elena Sahagun, Robert Quarry, Michael Berryman', null, 'Diane is a repressed, neurotic grad student, who moves into a cursed mansion only to be possessed by the house''s demonic master. She is then transformed into a raven-haired, leather and lingerie-clad seductress, who seeks a virgin sacrifice for her master. Meanwhile her sister, brother-in-law, a priest, and a pizza boy try to rescue her while avoiding the demon''s wrath.', 'Diane is a repressed, neurotic grad student, who moves into a cursed mansion only to be possessed by the house''s demonic master. She is then transformed into a raven-haired, leather and lingerie-clad seductress, who seeks a virgin sacrifice for her master. Meanwhile her sister, brother-in-law, a priest, and a pizza boy try to rescue her while avoiding the demon''s wrath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UcdRu3z2zs1dweTsbZgNcl9kjl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29506'),
